  ('308867337652689271', 'Drafty, Isn''t It?', 1957, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', 'Chuck Jones', 'Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Ralph Phillips dreams about his future, only to have his dreams interrupted by Willie N. List, using an ACME Anti-Nightmare Machine, to compare military and civilian life.', 'Ralph Phillips dreams about his future, only to have his dreams interrupted by Willie N. List, using an ACME Anti-Nightmare Machine, to compare military and civilian life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9jyOIeGGfS9tWDiw4bFhnyjSmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83751'),
  ('1138689394415744714', 'Drag Me to Hell', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sam Raimi, Peter Deming, Jim Aupperle', 'Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi', 'Alison Lohman, Justin Long, Lorna Raver, Dileep Rao, David Paymer, Adriana Barraza, Chelcie Ross, Reggie Lee', 'PG-13', 'After denying a woman the extension she needs to keep her home, loan officer Christine Brown sees her once-promising life take a startling turn for the worse. Christine is convinced she''s been cursed by a Gypsy, but her boyfriend is skeptical. Her only hope seems to lie in a psychic who claims he can help her lift the curse and keep her soul from being dragged straight to hell.', 'After denying a woman the extension she needs to keep her home, loan officer Christine Brown sees her once-promising life take a startling turn for the worse. Christine is convinced she''s been cursed by a Gypsy, but her boyfriend is skeptical. Her only hope seems to lie in a psychic who claims he can help her lift the curse and keep her soul from being dragged straight to hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdyejM5Zd6dsa0YyWa02ZAKwQzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16871'),
  ('370135110213492819', 'Drag-A-Long Droopy', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Western', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Bill Thompson, Daws Butler', null, 'An "absolutely authentic account of the grazing land battles of the sheep and cattle wars of the early west," pitting sheep rancher Droopy against a cattle ranching wolf.', 'An "absolutely authentic account of the grazing land battles of the sheep and cattle wars of the early west," pitting sheep rancher Droopy against a cattle ranching wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgEd9ovoVfnLIOeEMcPYXJd39kO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84755'),
  ('398162752554011786', 'Dragged Across Concrete', 2019, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'S. Craig Zahler, Jackson Ezard, Chad Belair', 'S. Craig Zahler', 'Mel Gibson, Vince Vaughn, Tory Kittles, Michael Jai White, Jennifer Carpenter, Don Johnson, Laurie Holden, Jordyn Ashley Olson', 'R', 'Two policemen, one an old-timer, the other his volatile younger partner, find themselves suspended when a video of their strong-arm tactics becomes the media''s cause du jour. Low on cash and with no other options, these two embittered soldiers descend into the criminal underworld to gain their just due, but instead find far more than they wanted awaiting them in the shadows.', 'Two policemen, one an old-timer, the other his volatile younger partner, find themselves suspended when a video of their strong-arm tactics becomes the media''s cause du jour. Low on cash and with no other options, these two embittered soldiers descend into the criminal underworld to gain their just due, but instead find far more than they wanted awaiting them in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11wQX0gv1kW1cjXsMTnoKXxhaqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438674'),
  ('876259816595271277', 'Dragnet', 1954, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edward Colman, Jack Webb, Oren Haglund', 'Richard L. Breen', 'Jack Webb, Ben Alexander, Richard Boone, Ann Robinson, Stacy Harris, Virginia Gregg, Vic Perrin, Georgia Ellis', 'NR', 'Two homicide detectives try to find just the facts behind a mobster''s brutal murder.', 'Two homicide detectives try to find just the facts behind a mobster''s brutal murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvzFBDVtthFaZVoB23dSgWf3sZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43334'),
  ('147141802589289498', 'Dragnet Girl', 1933, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Akira Kiyosuke, Toyotomi Sano', 'Tadao Ikeda', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Joji Oka, Sumiko Mizukubo, Kōji Mitsui, Yumeko Aizome, Chishū Ryū, Yoshiro Takayama, Yoshio Takayama', null, 'A gangster tries to find redemption with the inadvertent help of an innocent shop girl and his jealous girlfriend will do anything to keep him.', 'A gangster tries to find redemption with the inadvertent help of an innocent shop girl and his jealous girlfriend will do anything to keep him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHkdSXumZHqUILAy8zsiYLlfGmH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117472'),
  ('48410205507425181', 'Dragon', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Donnie Yen, Yang Zhenyu', 'Joyce Chan Ka-Yi, Aubrey Lam Oi-Wah', 'Donnie Yen, Takeshi Kaneshiro, Tang Wei, Jimmy Wang Yu, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Yin Zhusheng, Zheng Wei, Li Jia-Min', 'R', 'A sinful martial arts expert wants to start a new tranquil life, only to be hunted by a determined detective and his former master.', 'A sinful martial arts expert wants to start a new tranquil life, only to be hunted by a determined detective and his former master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnzIYs7NNJGC7AuQKfecEVStYAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70057'),
  ('644182749149257049', 'Dragon', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Ashwath Marimuthu, Prabhu Devan, Ramesh Narayanan', 'Ashwath Marimuthu', 'Pradeep Ranganathan, Anupama Parameswaran, Kayadu Lohar, Mysskin, Gautham Vasudev Menon, K. S. Ravikumar, George Mariyan, Indumathi Manigandan', null, 'Raghavan transforms from a school topper into a “bad boy” to score girls in college, but ends up a heartbroken dropout. He then cons his way into a successful finance career, but the lies keep building and maintaining the facade proves tricky.', 'Raghavan transforms from a school topper into a “bad boy” to score girls in college, but ends up a heartbroken dropout. He then cons his way into a successful finance career, but the lies keep building and maintaining the facade proves tricky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKNJPuejtE6Xrp6RK6LKsQcbL8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273049'),
  ('223058997994195226', 'Dragon Age: Dawn of the Seeker', 2012, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Fumihiko Sori, Bernard Edlington', 'John Burgmeier, Sean Whitley', 'John Swasey, Mike McFarland, Pam Dougherty, R. Bruce Elliott, Luci Christian, Colleen Clinkenbeard', 'NR', 'In the land of Orlais, a brash young Seeker—Cassandra—fights to stop a blood-soaked conspiracy. Hidden hands seek to tear apart the realm''s most powerful religious order, and as the sinister plot unfolds, Cassandra is accused of treason and murder. Hunted by friend and foe alike, the impulsive beauty must clear her name while clashing with corrupt templars and rogue blood mages. Should she fail, the executioner’s blade awaits. Should she overcome her rage and expose the unseen forces threatening the rule of the Divine, Cassandra will take her place in legend.', 'In the land of Orlais, a brash young Seeker—Cassandra—fights to stop a blood-soaked conspiracy. Hidden hands seek to tear apart the realm''s most powerful religious order, and as the sinister plot unfolds, Cassandra is accused of treason and murder. Hunted by friend and foe alike, the impulsive beauty must clear her name while clashing with corrupt templars and rogue blood mages. Should she fail, the executioner’s blade awaits. Should she overcome her rage and expose the unseen forces threatening the rule of the Divine, Cassandra will take her place in legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6R4gnQZp8MSaljsR8dl9R4ARByo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103173'),
  ('203160480192772870', 'Dragon Around', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Dessie Flynn, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Lost in a book of fairy tales, Dale imagines what it might be like to do battle with a vicious dragon---and thanks to Donald he''ll soon get to find out. As Donald moves his hulking steam shovel into position, intent on clearing a path right through their tree for a new freeway, Chip and Dale ready themselves for battle just like the knights of old. With a tuna can for armor and a hat pin for a lance, Chip charges into battle atop his trusty steed, Dale. But with some quick thinking, Donald makes his phony dragon a fire breather. Who will prevail in the medieval battle for the junkyard?', 'Lost in a book of fairy tales, Dale imagines what it might be like to do battle with a vicious dragon---and thanks to Donald he''ll soon get to find out. As Donald moves his hulking steam shovel into position, intent on clearing a path right through their tree for a new freeway, Chip and Dale ready themselves for battle just like the knights of old. With a tuna can for armor and a hat pin for a lance, Chip charges into battle atop his trusty steed, Dale. But with some quick thinking, Donald makes his phony dragon a fire breather. Who will prevail in the medieval battle for the junkyard?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uOZGkJrMIOoCsD2Fh7j1lmbHAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55510'),
  ('229836535534386579', 'Dragon Ball GT: A Hero''s Legacy', 1997, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Kasai', 'Neil Bligh', 'Masako Nozawa, Yuko Minaguchi, Shin Aomori, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Miki Ito, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Toru Furuya, Yasuhiko Kawazu', 'PG', 'Son Goku Jr. is the great-great-grandson of the legendary martial artist Son Goku. However, unlike his predecessor he''s not a brave fighter. He''s constantly picked on by school bullies, his grandmother Pan sees this and she''s worried, but even though Goku Jr. is not a strong and powerful Saiyan, he has a kind heart, and Pan loves him. When Pan gets sick Goku Jr. realizes he must do something if he doesn''t want to lose Pan. Then he will remember about the legends of the Dragon Balls. It was told they granted a wish to the bearer, Goku Jr. needs a magical wish more than ever.', 'Son Goku Jr. is the great-great-grandson of the legendary martial artist Son Goku. However, unlike his predecessor he''s not a brave fighter. He''s constantly picked on by school bullies, his grandmother Pan sees this and she''s worried, but even though Goku Jr. is not a strong and powerful Saiyan, he has a kind heart, and Pan loves him. When Pan gets sick Goku Jr. realizes he must do something if he doesn''t want to lose Pan. Then he will remember about the legends of the Dragon Balls. It was told they granted a wish to the bearer, Goku Jr. needs a magical wish more than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reNPMjkPg9f6wgf6kHSSkKjBarL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18095'),
  ('217696999260516175', 'Dragon Ball Super: Super Hero', 2022, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Tetsuro Kodama, Hisashi Eguchi, Hiroshi Shirai', 'Akira Toriyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Toshio Furukawa, Yuko Minaguchi, Hiroshi Kamiya, Mamoru Miyano, Miyu Irino, Ryota Takeuchi, Aya Hisakawa', 'PG-13', 'The Red Ribbon Army, an evil organization that was once destroyed by Goku in the past, has been reformed by a group of people who have created new and mightier Androids, Gamma 1 and Gamma 2, and seek vengeance against Goku and his family.', 'The Red Ribbon Army, an evil organization that was once destroyed by Goku in the past, has been reformed by a group of people who have created new and mightier Androids, Gamma 1 and Gamma 2, and seek vengeance against Goku and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pi0iZOEHeA3ih4p1IwAG4x2DZNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610150'),
  ('891020813175403043', 'Dragon Ball Z Side Story: Plan to Eradicate the Saiyans', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Animation', 'Shigeyasu Yamauchi', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Takeshi Kusao, Toshio Furukawa, Shinji Ogawa, Yusaku Yara, Ryusei Nakao, Hiromi Tsuru', null, 'Dr. Raichi is one of the only survivors of the Tuffles, a race that once lived on Planet Plant before the coming of the Saiyans. The Saiyans not only massacred the entire Tuffle race, but also stole their technology and conquered the planet, renaming it Planet Vegeta in honor of their king. Raichi managed to escape with a capsule and found refuge on the Dark Planet, a world at the end of the universe. His only wish is to eradicate the last remaining Saiyans.', 'Dr. Raichi is one of the only survivors of the Tuffles, a race that once lived on Planet Plant before the coming of the Saiyans. The Saiyans not only massacred the entire Tuffle race, but also stole their technology and conquered the planet, renaming it Planet Vegeta in honor of their king. Raichi managed to escape with a capsule and found refuge on the Dark Planet, a world at the end of the universe. His only wish is to eradicate the last remaining Saiyans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sb7LPrIrNMp8ZlsUSEhNwhUpU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652754'),
  ('419781235992854835', 'Dragon Ball Z: Bardock - The Father of Goku', 1990, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Mitsuo Hashimoto, Katsuyoshi Nakatsuru, Yuichi Suenaga', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa, Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Yuko Mita, Takeshi Watabe, Kozo Shioya, Ryusei Nakao, Show Hayami, Yukitoshi Hori', 'NR', 'Bardock, Son Goku''s father, is a low-ranking Saiyan soldier who was given the power to see into the future by the last remaining alien on a planet he just destroyed. He witnesses the destruction of his race and must now do his best to stop Frieza''s impending massacre.', 'Bardock, Son Goku''s father, is a low-ranking Saiyan soldier who was given the power to see into the future by the last remaining alien on a planet he just destroyed. He witnesses the destruction of his race and must now do his best to stop Frieza''s impending massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/docwOsWZuwJKQdwcYJtQPBcg6bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39323'),
  ('54476624498814549', 'Dragon Ball Z: Battle of Gods', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Yasunori Goto, Tadayoshi Yamamuro, Masahiro Hosoda', 'Yusuke Watanabe', 'Masako Nozawa, Koichi Yamadera, Masakazu Morita, Ryo Horikawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Joji Yanami, Toshio Furukawa, Shoko Nakagawa', 'PG-13', 'After the defeat of Majin Buu, a powerful God of Destruction known as Beerus searches for the Saiyan warrior who defeated Frieza. Realizing the threat Beerus poses to Earth, the Z-fighters must stop him. Only Goku, humanity’s last hope, can ascend to the level of a legendary Super Saiyan God and save the planet, and possibly the entire universe!', 'After the defeat of Majin Buu, a powerful God of Destruction known as Beerus searches for the Saiyan warrior who defeated Frieza. Realizing the threat Beerus poses to Earth, the Z-fighters must stop him. Only Goku, humanity’s last hope, can ascend to the level of a legendary Super Saiyan God and save the planet, and possibly the entire universe!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxZEdYcHMuD8SSuwusDnK9CD2H1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126963'),
  ('959270090229875493', 'Dragon Ball Z: Bio-Broly', 1994, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiro Ueda', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Takeshi Kusao, Daisuke Gori, Mayumi Tanaka, Miki Ito, Naoki Tatsuta, Keiji Fujiwara, Masaharu Sato', 'PG', 'Jaga Bada, Mr. Satan''s old sparring partner, has invited Satan to his personal island to hold a grudge match. Trunks and Goten decide to come for the adventure and Android #18 is following Satan for the money he owes her. Little do they know that Jaga Bada''s scientist have found a way to resurrect Broly, the legendary Super Saiyan.', 'Jaga Bada, Mr. Satan''s old sparring partner, has invited Satan to his personal island to hold a grudge match. Trunks and Goten decide to come for the adventure and Android #18 is following Satan for the money he owes her. Little do they know that Jaga Bada''s scientist have found a way to resurrect Broly, the legendary Super Saiyan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0VKJ6eRIubW6wH4eAwcpQfjoRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39106'),
  ('439241412056158917', 'Dragon Ball Z: Bojack Unbound', 1993, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiro Ueda', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Daisuke Gori, Tessyo Genda, Toshio Furukawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Takeshi Kusao, Tomoko Maruo, Ryo Horikawa', 'PG', 'Mr. Money is holding another World Martial Arts Tournament and Mr. Satan invites everyone in the world to join in. Little does he know that Bojack, an ancient villain who has escaped his prison, is competing. Since Goku is currently dead, it is up to Gohan, Vegeta, and Trunks to defeat Bojack and his henchman.', 'Mr. Money is holding another World Martial Arts Tournament and Mr. Satan invites everyone in the world to join in. Little does he know that Bojack, an ancient villain who has escaped his prison, is competing. Since Goku is currently dead, it is up to Gohan, Vegeta, and Trunks to defeat Bojack and his henchman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iihTK9Af8G1ZzBjkIIAV4qQMkzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39105'),
  ('60902098512847965', 'Dragon Ball Z: Broly - Second Coming', 1994, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shigeyasu Yamauchi, Tadayoshi Yamamuro', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Takeshi Kusao, Yuko Minaguchi, Junko Shimakata, Chafurin, Hisao Egawa, Yoshiyuki Kono', 'NR', 'A Saiyan Space pod crash-lands on Earth out of which a wounded Saiyan crawls: Broly, the Legendary Super Saiyan. The wounded Broly shouts out in frustration and turns into normal form. The place soon freezes, trapping him in it and he falls into a coma.', 'A Saiyan Space pod crash-lands on Earth out of which a wounded Saiyan crawls: Broly, the Legendary Super Saiyan. The wounded Broly shouts out in frustration and turns into normal form. The place soon freezes, trapping him in it and he falls into a coma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Apnw8FWoPOIsu14d5dvaNZzFSJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44251'),
  ('898164014523515606', 'Dragon Ball Z: Broly - The Legendary Super Saiyan', 1993, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Shigeyasu Yamauchi', 'Takao Koyama', 'Bin Shimada, Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Iemasa Kayumi, Takeshi Kusao, Mayumi Tanaka, Toshio Furukawa, Kohei Miyauchi', null, 'While the Saiyan Paragus persuades Vegeta to rule a new planet, King Kai alerts Goku of the South Galaxy''s destruction by an unknown Super Saiyan.', 'While the Saiyan Paragus persuades Vegeta to rule a new planet, King Kai alerts Goku of the South Galaxy''s destruction by an unknown Super Saiyan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iO8TJCyLI4BiPYOvdwzPV2bhoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34433'),
  ('963502620287188768', 'Dragon Ball Z: Cooler''s Revenge', 1991, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Minoru Maeda, Mitsuo Hashimoto, Junichi Fujise', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Toshio Furukawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Naoki Tatsuta, Naoko Watanabe, Kohei Miyauchi, Ichiro Nagai, Ryusei Nakao', 'PG', 'After defeating Frieza, Goku returns to Earth and goes on a camping trip with Gohan and Krillin. Everything is normal until Cooler - Frieza''s brother - sends three henchmen after Goku. A long fight ensues between our heroes and Cooler, in which he transforms into the fourth stage of his evolution and has the edge in the fight... until Goku transforms into a Super Saiyan.', 'After defeating Frieza, Goku returns to Earth and goes on a camping trip with Gohan and Krillin. Everything is normal until Cooler - Frieza''s brother - sends three henchmen after Goku. A long fight ensues between our heroes and Cooler, in which he transforms into the fourth stage of his evolution and has the edge in the fight... until Goku transforms into a Super Saiyan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqTSXqjaSgSAT2lCv3GyZeodQPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24752'),
  ('724382803778606390', 'Dragon Ball Z: Dead Zone', 1989, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Daisuke Nishio, Motoaki Ikegami', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Toshio Furukawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Mayumi Tanaka, Daisuke Gori, Mayumi Shou, Kohei Miyauchi, Takeshi Aono', 'PG', 'In order to wish for immortality and avenge his father, Garlic Jr. collects the dragon balls, kidnapping Goku''s son Gohan in the process. Goku, Kami, Piccolo, and Krillin unite to rescue Gohan and save the world from being sucked into a dead zone.', 'In order to wish for immortality and avenge his father, Garlic Jr. collects the dragon balls, kidnapping Goku''s son Gohan in the process. Goku, Kami, Piccolo, and Krillin unite to rescue Gohan and save the world from being sucked into a dead zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywtyEDTM2YO7qod7USNNwhrAfvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28609'),
  ('143214340078724149', 'Dragon Ball Z: Fusion Reborn', 1995, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Tadayoshi Yamamuro, Shigeyasu Yamauchi, Toshiharu Takei', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Takeshi Kusao, Daisuke Gori, Hiromi Tsuru, Naoko Watanabe, Yuko Minaguchi, Hikaru Midorikawa', 'PG', 'Not paying attention to his job, a young demon allows the evil cleansing machine to overflow and explode, turning the young demon into the infamous monster Janemba. Goku and Vegeta make solo attempts to defeat the monster, but realize their only option is fusion.', 'Not paying attention to his job, a young demon allows the evil cleansing machine to overflow and explode, turning the young demon into the infamous monster Janemba. Goku and Vegeta make solo attempts to defeat the monster, but realize their only option is fusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AHvaEAeQfkfJ4OqcBePxa2ao09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39107'),
  ('9977121916322339', 'Dragon Ball Z: Gather Together! Goku''s World', 1992, 'Action, Animation, Adventure', null, null, 'Masako Nozawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Hiromi Tsuru, Takeshi Kusao, Takeshi Aono, Toshio Furukawa, Norio Wakamoto, Ryusei Nakao', null, 'In this OVA, Goku and his friends pose questions for the viewers about the Dragon Ball series.', 'In this OVA, Goku and his friends pose questions for the viewers about the Dragon Ball series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKr5GFLLAGy4ndo1NKkIngx1teJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299963'),
  ('806266008635332329', 'Dragon Ball Z: Lord Slug', 1991, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Mitsuo Hashimoto, Katsuyoshi Nakatsuru', null, 'Toshio Furukawa, Kenji Utsumi, Masako Nozawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Joji Yanami, Naoko Watanabe, Hiromi Tsuru, Kohei Miyauchi', null, 'A Super Namekian named Slug comes to invade Earth. But the Z Warriors do their best to stop Slug and his gang.', 'A Super Namekian named Slug comes to invade Earth. But the Z Warriors do their best to stop Slug and his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lmwZTsqwTtvd3m60pyQfhGM2Ut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39102'),
  ('646004746731185733', 'Dragon Ball Z: Plan to Eradicate the Super Saiyans', 2010, 'Action, Animation, Adventure', 'Tadayoshi Yamamuro, Yoshihiro Ueda', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Takeshi Kusao, Toshio Furukawa, Ryusei Nakao, Hiromi Tsuru, Naoko Watanabe, Joji Yanami', 'PG', 'Dr. Raichi is one of the only survivors of the Tuffles, a race that once lived on Planet Plant before the coming of the Saiyans. The Saiyans not only massacred the entire Tuffle race, but also stole their technology and conquered the planet, renaming it Planet Vegeta in honor of their king. Raichi managed to escape with a capsule and found refuge on the Dark Planet, a world at the end of the universe. His only wish is to eradicate the last remaining Saiyans.', 'Dr. Raichi is one of the only survivors of the Tuffles, a race that once lived on Planet Plant before the coming of the Saiyans. The Saiyans not only massacred the entire Tuffle race, but also stole their technology and conquered the planet, renaming it Planet Vegeta in honor of their king. Raichi managed to escape with a capsule and found refuge on the Dark Planet, a world at the end of the universe. His only wish is to eradicate the last remaining Saiyans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPv8avE1joxywziPMd49k6yINJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89636'),
  ('971272506059505910', 'Dragon Ball Z: Resurrection ''F''', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yasunori Goto, Tadayoshi Yamamuro, Tadayoshi Yamamuro', 'Akira Toriyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Ryusei Nakao, Koichi Yamadera, Masakazu Morita, Hiromi Tsuru, Mayumi Tanaka, Masaharu Sato', 'NR', 'One peaceful day on Earth, two remnants of Frieza''s army named Sorbet and Tagoma arrive searching for the Dragon Balls with the aim of reviving Frieza. They succeed, and Frieza subsequently seeks revenge on the Saiyans.', 'One peaceful day on Earth, two remnants of Frieza''s army named Sorbet and Tagoma arrive searching for the Dragon Balls with the aim of reviving Frieza. They succeed, and Frieza subsequently seeks revenge on the Saiyans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soq3AxjALdBfdPAm8H7yuMmNL5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303857'),
  ('409210811381240681', 'Dragon Ball Z: Summer Vacation Special', 1992, 'Animation', 'Kouzou Morishita', null, 'Masako Nozawa, Joji Yanami', null, 'This is a TV special that takes place directly after Dragon Ball Z movie 7. In it, Goku and Gohan discuss Dragon Ball movies 1-3 and Dragon Ball Z movies 1-7.', 'This is a TV special that takes place directly after Dragon Ball Z movie 7. In it, Goku and Gohan discuss Dragon Ball movies 1-3 and Dragon Ball Z movies 1-7.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2msuvPPFxcnWt4OVQ35EvVbnQuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675304'),
  ('386313689478708820', 'Dragon Ball Z: Super Android 13!', 1992, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Daisuke Nishio', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Takeshi Kusao, Toshio Furukawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Kohei Miyauchi, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Hisao Egawa', 'PG', 'Dr. Gero''s Androids #13, #14, and #15 are awakened by the laboratory computers and immediately head to the mall where Goku is shopping. After Goku, Trunks, and Vegeta defeat #14 and #15, #13 absorbs their inner computers and becomes a super being greater than the original three separately were. Now it is up to Goku to stop him.', 'Dr. Gero''s Androids #13, #14, and #15 are awakened by the laboratory computers and immediately head to the mall where Goku is shopping. After Goku, Trunks, and Vegeta defeat #14 and #15, #13 absorbs their inner computers and becomes a super being greater than the original three separately were. Now it is up to Goku to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIwjWaEuCcT3QVBd9Ng9wG3kbpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39104'),
  ('1100243000229708093', 'Dragon Ball Z: The History of Trunks', 1993, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Daisuke Nishio, Nobuhiro Komatsu, Minoru Maeda', 'Hiroshi Toda', 'Masako Nozawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Hiromi Tsuru, Ryo Horikawa, Takeshi Kusao, Naoko Watanabe, Daisuke Gori, Naoki Tatsuta', 'NR', 'It has been thirteen years since the Androids began their killing rampage and Son Gohan is the only person fighting back. He takes Bulma''s son Trunks as a student and even gives his own life to save Trunks''s. Now Trunks must figure out a way to change this apocalyptic future', 'It has been thirteen years since the Androids began their killing rampage and Son Gohan is the only person fighting back. He takes Bulma''s son Trunks as a student and even gives his own life to save Trunks''s. Now Trunks must figure out a way to change this apocalyptic future', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0FCkSSdOGTA3gC99QayGJH0Dqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39324'),
  ('190720471881439828', 'Dragon Ball Z: The Real 4-D at Super Tenkaichi Budokai', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Adventure', null, null, 'Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Bin Shimada, Toshio Furukawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Miki Ito, Unsho Ishizuka', null, 'Dragon Ball Z: The Real 4-D at Super Tenkaichi Budoka is a cinematic attraction at Universal Studios Japan and the successor to Dragon Ball Z: The Real 4-D. Like its predecessor, it is a new installment in the Dragon Ball series, this time primarily featuring the face off between Super Saiyan Blue Goku and Broly God.', 'Dragon Ball Z: The Real 4-D at Super Tenkaichi Budoka is a cinematic attraction at Universal Studios Japan and the successor to Dragon Ball Z: The Real 4-D. Like its predecessor, it is a new installment in the Dragon Ball series, this time primarily featuring the face off between Super Saiyan Blue Goku and Broly God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsML7r1iijCiGjowbcUfsgtrUWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575249'),
  ('574356726536271417', 'Dragon Ball Z: The Return of Cooler', 1992, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Daisuke Nishio', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Toshio Furukawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Ryo Horikawa, Kohei Miyauchi, Naoki Tatsuta, Tomiko Suzuki, Toku Nishio', 'NR', 'Cooler has resurrected himself as a robot and is enslaving the people of New Namek. Goku and the gang must help.', 'Cooler has resurrected himself as a robot and is enslaving the people of New Namek. Goku and the gang must help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k23L4i0JjwU8D5flnR5damgXFcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39103'),
  ('527554223675070414', 'Dragon Ball Z: The Tree of Might', 1990, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Daisuke Nishio, Motoaki Ikegami, Katsuyoshi Nakatsuru', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Toru Furuya, Toshio Furukawa, Hiroko Emori, Naoko Watanabe, Joji Yanami', null, 'Goku and friends must stop a band of space pirates from consuming fruit from the Tree of Might before it''s destructive powers drain Earth''s energy.', 'Goku and friends must stop a band of space pirates from consuming fruit from the Tree of Might before it''s destructive powers drain Earth''s energy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDX4Dp8IKvjBAaEb5MOJrGkxWX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39101'),
  ('890934659052573450', 'Dragon Ball Z: The World''s Strongest', 1990, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Daisuke Nishio, Minoru Maeda, Motoaki Ikegami', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Toshio Furukawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Hiromi Tsuru, Kohei Miyauchi, Mayumi Shou, Naoki Tatsuta, Kenji Utsumi', 'PG', 'The evil Dr. Kochin uses the dragon balls to resurrect his mentor, Dr. Wheelo, in an effort to take over the world. Dr. Wheelo, his body having been destroyed by the avalanche that killed him fifty years before, desires the body of the strongest fighter in the world as his new vessel. Believing Roshi to be the world''s strongest warrior, Dr. Kochin abducts Bulma and forces Roshi to surrender himself to save her. When Goku hears of their abduction, he goes to their rescue.', 'The evil Dr. Kochin uses the dragon balls to resurrect his mentor, Dr. Wheelo, in an effort to take over the world. Dr. Wheelo, his body having been destroyed by the avalanche that killed him fifty years before, desires the body of the strongest fighter in the world as his new vessel. Believing Roshi to be the world''s strongest warrior, Dr. Kochin abducts Bulma and forces Roshi to surrender himself to save her. When Goku hears of their abduction, he goes to their rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5elbm3iLgGQ6nA5vqUmi9vIojbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39100'),
  ('867005457641069344', 'Dragon Ball Z: Wrath of the Dragon', 1995, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Tadayoshi Yamamuro, Mitsuo Hashimoto', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Takeshi Kusao, Mayumi Tanaka, Hiromi Tsuru, Masaharu Sato, Yuko Minaguchi, Ryo Horikawa, Hiro Yuuki', 'PG', 'The Z Warriors discover an unopenable music box and are told to open it with the Dragon Balls. The contents turn out to be a warrior named Tapion who had sealed himself inside along with a monster called Hildegarn. Goku must now perfect a new technique to defeat the evil monster.', 'The Z Warriors discover an unopenable music box and are told to open it with the Dragon Balls. The contents turn out to be a warrior named Tapion who had sealed himself inside along with a monster called Hildegarn. Goku must now perfect a new technique to defeat the evil monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uRu9EA3nie0n2mlVDDLlTI3IzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39108'),
  ('219604936443179210', 'Dragon Ball: Curse of the Blood Rubies', 1986, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Daisuke Nishio, Motoaki Ikegami', 'Toshiki Inoue, Yoshifumi Yûki', 'Masako Nozawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Naoki Tatsuta, Naoko Watanabe, Toru Furuya, Kohei Miyauchi, Mami Koyama, Tomiko Suzuki', null, 'The great King Gurumes is searching for the Dragon Balls in order to put a stop to his endless hunger. A young girl named Pansy who lives in the nearby village has had enough of the treachery and decides to seek Muten Rōshi for assistance. Can our heroes save the village and put a stop to the Gurumes Army?', 'The great King Gurumes is searching for the Dragon Balls in order to put a stop to his endless hunger. A young girl named Pansy who lives in the nearby village has had enough of the treachery and decides to seek Muten Rōshi for assistance. Can our heroes save the village and put a stop to the Gurumes Army?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZCWRFJnwyxYOhzAhf7Xyru4moB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39144'),
  ('59805821908609420', 'Dragon Ball: Episode of Bardock', 2011, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiro Ueda, Tadayoshi Yamamuro', 'Makoto Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Ryusei Nakao, Houko Kuwashima, Masashi Ebara, Keiji Hirai, Kazuyuki Ishikawa, Hiroaki Miura, Takashi Nagasako', 'PG', 'A spin-off scenario taking place after the events of the TV special Dragon Ball Z: Bardock - The Father of Goku, in which Bardock survives the destruction of Planet Vegeta and is sent into the past, combating Frieza''s ancestor Chilled and turning into a Super Saiyan.', 'A spin-off scenario taking place after the events of the TV special Dragon Ball Z: Bardock - The Father of Goku, in which Bardock survives the destruction of Planet Vegeta and is sent into the past, combating Frieza''s ancestor Chilled and turning into a Super Saiyan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5uAIJH94OnPhilGCdWbAiSGewa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120475'),
  ('963796265985378168', 'Dragon Ball: Fight Son Goku, Win Son Goku', 1990, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Ryong Wang', 'Youn Suk-hoon', 'Heo Seong-tae, Lee Joo-Hee, Jang Min-seok, Lee Kye-Yeong, Shim Hyung-rae', null, 'The young warrior Son Ogong (Son Goku) goes on a outrageous quest to acquire seven magical orbs, along the way beating up evil persons who want to steal the orbs for their own ends.', 'The young warrior Son Ogong (Son Goku) goes on a outrageous quest to acquire seven magical orbs, along the way beating up evil persons who want to steal the orbs for their own ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y40nrj3yg6DJctv14X5E1ngGjcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106958'),
  ('882068530513929231', 'Dragon Ball: Mystical Adventure', 1988, 'Action, Animation', 'Motoaki Ikegami, Kazuhisa Takenouchi', 'Yoshifumi Yûki', 'Masako Nozawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Mayumi Tanaka, Kohei Miyauchi, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Hiroko Emori, Toru Furuya, Mitsuko Horie', 'PG', 'Master Roshi has succeeded at the one mission he valued most: to train Goku and Krillin to become ultimate fighters. So, he arranges for them to test their mettle at a competition hosted by Emperor Chiaotzu. Not everyone''s playing by the rules, however, as a member of the ruler''s household schemes to use the Dragonballs to extort money and power from the royal.', 'Master Roshi has succeeded at the one mission he valued most: to train Goku and Krillin to become ultimate fighters. So, he arranges for them to test their mettle at a competition hosted by Emperor Chiaotzu. Not everyone''s playing by the rules, however, as a member of the ruler''s household schemes to use the Dragonballs to extort money and power from the royal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uPs9rjKkGWOmc5QO4VV08YdLpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116776'),
  ('41217936390911509', 'Dragon Ball: Sleeping Princess in Devil''s Castle', 1987, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Daisuke Nishio, Hiromitsu Shiozaki, Motoaki Ikegami', 'Keiji Terui', 'Masako Nozawa, Mayumi Tanaka, Nachi Nozawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Toru Furuya, Naoko Watanabe, Naoki Tatsuta, Shozo Iizuka', null, 'Goku and Kuririn are given an assignment by Kame-Sen''nin: "Retrieve the sleeping princess from Lucifer and I will take you as my students." But the mission proves to be more perilous than originally thought.', 'Goku and Kuririn are given an assignment by Kame-Sen''nin: "Retrieve the sleeping princess from Lucifer and I will take you as my students." But the mission proves to be more perilous than originally thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BMFoAqU4DadJajmL3BX0CgJXfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39145'),
  ('216131674670142449', 'Dragon Ball: The Magic Begins', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Liao Ching-Sung, Chen Chun-Liang', 'Yao Ching Kang', 'Chen Chi-Chiang, Jeannie Hsieh, Cheng Tung-Chuen, Pang San, Wong Chung-Yue, Philip So Yuen-Fung, Chin Tu, Lee Yee-Kuen', null, 'An unauthorized live-action adaptation of the Dragon Ball manga, it follows a band of misfit adventurers trying to stop King Horn and his goal to collect all seven Dragon Balls, and his wish of ultimate power.', 'An unauthorized live-action adaptation of the Dragon Ball manga, it follows a band of misfit adventurers trying to stop King Horn and his goal to collect all seven Dragon Balls, and his wish of ultimate power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OfxuVeFsClcEMt71MDw8BhbaZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68810'),
  ('722854963576473550', 'Dragon Ball: The Path to Power', 1996, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Munehisa Sakai, Tadayoshi Yamamuro, Shigeyasu Yamauchi', 'Aya Matsui', 'Masako Nozawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Toru Furuya, Naoki Tatsuta, Naoko Watanabe, Kin''ya Aikawa, Daisuke Gori, Kenji Utsumi', null, 'A retelling of Dragon Ball''s origin with a different take on the meeting of Goku, Bulma, and Kame-Sen''nin. It also retells the Red Ribbon Army story; but this time they find Goku rather than Goku finding them.', 'A retelling of Dragon Ball''s origin with a different take on the meeting of Goku, Bulma, and Kame-Sen''nin. It also retells the Red Ribbon Army story; but this time they find Goku rather than Goku finding them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPkoqtFhDoIbzt61oOYwmLOZdAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39148'),
  ('73906466562824372', 'Dragon Ball: Yo! Son Goku and His Friends Return!!', 2008, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Yoshihiro Ueda, Tadayoshi Yamamuro', 'Takao Koyama', 'Masako Nozawa, Takeshi Kusao, Ryo Horikawa, Yusuke Numata, Kazunari Tanaka, Yasunori Masutani, Toru Furuya, Mayumi Tanaka', null, 'Following the defeat of Majin Buu, Son Goku and friends travel to Mr. Satan''s newly-opened hotel for an all-you-can-eat banquet, when they are paid a visit by Vegeta''s younger brother Tarble. They are informed by Tarble that the terrible brother duo of Abo and Cado have terrorized his planet and are on their way to Earth.', 'Following the defeat of Majin Buu, Son Goku and friends travel to Mr. Satan''s newly-opened hotel for an all-you-can-eat banquet, when they are paid a visit by Vegeta''s younger brother Tarble. They are informed by Tarble that the terrible brother duo of Abo and Cado have terrorized his planet and are on their way to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0tBLECAYhOmzJmQmpfoFH8Syyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38594'),
  ('298183146794035669', 'Dragon Blade', 2015, 'Adventure, History, Action, Fantasy', 'Daniel Lee, Tony Cheng', 'Daniel Lee', 'Jackie Chan, John Cusack, Adrien Brody, Sharni Vinson, Kevin Lee, Robert Peoples, Tomer Oz, Alfred Hsing', 'R', 'Huo An, the commander of the Protection Squad of the Western Regions, was framed by evil forces and becomes enslaved. On the other hand, a Roman general escapes to China after rescuing the Prince. The heroic duo meet in the Western Desert and a thrilling story unfolds.', 'Huo An, the commander of the Protection Squad of the Western Regions, was framed by evil forces and becomes enslaved. On the other hand, a Roman general escapes to China after rescuing the Prince. The heroic duo meet in the Western Desert and a thrilling story unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5yyMErIDbdzVLIDXVBG6EzM1oF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300168'),
  ('405598041040953809', 'Dragon Eyes', 2012, 'Action', 'John Hyams', 'Tim Tori', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Peter Weller, Cung Le, Luis Da Silva, Jr., Crystal Mantecon, Rich Clementi, Dan Henderson, Trevor Prangley', 'R', 'In St. Jude, drug dealers and corrupt cops have destroyed an urban neighborhood. But newcomer, Hong, has the fighting skills and moral vision to save this town from itself.', 'In St. Jude, drug dealers and corrupt cops have destroyed an urban neighborhood. But newcomer, Hong, has the fighting skills and moral vision to save this town from itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TY2u8VTjtMzzXNiDra9FXDGrn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100683'),
  ('945181016332983689', 'Dragon Fight', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Billy Tang', 'James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Jet Li, Stephen Chow, Dick Wei, Nina Li Chi, Mark Williams, Michael McFall, Henry Fong Ping, Go Wang', null, 'Jimmy and Tiger are members of the Chinese national wushu team. The two are in Los Angeles to perform exhibitions. However, for Tiger, he plans to defect to L.A. to make a name for himself. When Jimmy learns of Tigers plan to defect, an attempt to stop him fails and Jimmy ends up missing his flight to China. Now a fish out of water, Jimmy''s only hope is Andy, a wisecracking youngster in L.A. Meanwhile, Tiger works for a mafia boss. When Tiger loses a fortune in cocaine in a detergent box that Andy accidentally took, Andy and Jimmy soon have no choice but to face the wrath of Tiger and his men. Their only ally is Penny, the girlfriend of Tiger''s boss. Two men who were once best friends have now become bitter enemies.', 'Jimmy and Tiger are members of the Chinese national wushu team. The two are in Los Angeles to perform exhibitions. However, for Tiger, he plans to defect to L.A. to make a name for himself. When Jimmy learns of Tigers plan to defect, an attempt to stop him fails and Jimmy ends up missing his flight to China. Now a fish out of water, Jimmy''s only hope is Andy, a wisecracking youngster in L.A. Meanwhile, Tiger works for a mafia boss. When Tiger loses a fortune in cocaine in a detergent box that Andy accidentally took, Andy and Jimmy soon have no choice but to face the wrath of Tiger and his men. Their only ally is Penny, the girlfriend of Tiger''s boss. Two men who were once best friends have now become bitter enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5fEeD0O0rKFNGKvNqj4B11PpwN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35038'),
  ('355947556168210389', 'Dragon Fist', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'Lo Wei, Chu Hsueh-Liang, Chen Jung-Shu', 'Wang Chung-Pin', 'Jackie Chan, Nora Miao, James Tien Chun, Im Eun-Joo, Yen Shi-Kwan, Mu Szu-Cheng, Hsu Hsia, Kim Yeong-Il', null, 'After the death of his master, martial arts student Tong Huo-wan travels with his adoptive family to seek redress from the man responsible but finds himself torn between righteousness and filial piety after becoming entangled in a feud between a local clan and gangsters.', 'After the death of his master, martial arts student Tong Huo-wan travels with his adoptive family to seek redress from the man responsible but finds himself torn between righteousness and filial piety after becoming entangled in a feud between a local clan and gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bTvTDjcbxdf8NvGTRacr9wM2jh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46124'),
  ('409652646209392982', 'Dragon from Shaolin', 1996, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kenny Ha Sau-Hin, Ming-Chuen Lo, Venus Keung', 'Kai-Chung Mak, Biu Cheung Lee', 'Ashton Chen, Steven Hao, Yuen Biao, Vivian Hsu, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Law Kar-Ying, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Lau Shun', null, 'A youthful Shaolin initiate inadvertenly separated from the rest of gang joins forces with dashing adventurer (Biao) on a request to protect a priceless artifact from his greedy brother.', 'A youthful Shaolin initiate inadvertenly separated from the rest of gang joins forces with dashing adventurer (Biao) on a request to protect a priceless artifact from his greedy brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KZnt2zXOTedax8kVWhKmWrb9Ld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75704'),
  ('126124926006616604', 'Dragon Fury', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'David Heavener, John P. Tarver', 'David Heavener', 'Robert Chapin, Richard Lynch, Chona Jason, Deborah Stambler, T.J. Storm, David Heavener, Judy Landers, Sean P. Donahue', null, 'Mason, a dragon warrior from the future, returns to the year 1999 in search of a serum that can combat a disease simply known as "The Plague." In the post-apocalyptic world of 2099 -- after an earthquake has destroyed all of civilization has been -- "The Plague" is the deadliest menace of them all. And the cure for it lies in the past!', 'Mason, a dragon warrior from the future, returns to the year 1999 in search of a serum that can combat a disease simply known as "The Plague." In the post-apocalyptic world of 2099 -- after an earthquake has destroyed all of civilization has been -- "The Plague" is the deadliest menace of them all. And the cure for it lies in the past!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0eJdnqQuKUdHrQ6QoqWeMxCm8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167635'),
  ('1086187571630630582', 'Dragon Fury', 2021, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Scott Chambers', 'Scott Chambers, Rhys Frake-Waterfield', 'Nicola Wright, Chelsea Greenwood, Chrissie Wunna, Sofia Lacey, Rachel Rye, Richard Lovell, Andrew Rolfe', null, 'A group of soldiers are taken to the mountains of Wales to investigate a strange looking monster.', 'A group of soldiers are taken to the mountains of Wales to investigate a strange looking monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WcJ4cV2Y3gnTYp5zHu968TYmTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839436'),
  ('216624664973833033', 'Dragon Girls', 2012, 'Documentary, Action, Drama', 'Inigo Westmeier', 'Inigo Westmeier, Benjamin Quabeck', 'Huang Luolan, Chen Xi, Xin Chenxi, Yang Ziyu, Quan Ling, Xu Manyu, Liu Heike', null, 'The documentary film Dragon Girls tells the story of three young Chinese girls training to become Kung Fu fighters, far away from their families, at the largest Kung Fu school in China. These girls, in a crowd of 26,000 children, are under constant pressure to conform to the norms and structures. They are turned into fighting robots and yet, if you look behind the curtain, you see children with dreams and aspirations. It show the controversial world of selection of the fittest in a totalitarian system.', 'The documentary film Dragon Girls tells the story of three young Chinese girls training to become Kung Fu fighters, far away from their families, at the largest Kung Fu school in China. These girls, in a crowd of 26,000 children, are under constant pressure to conform to the norms and structures. They are turned into fighting robots and yet, if you look behind the curtain, you see children with dreams and aspirations. It show the controversial world of selection of the fittest in a totalitarian system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0RXkqLUG7wscIhUQmVYu1NYBmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189817'),
  ('833616681885822672', 'Dragon Head', 2003, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'George Iida, Junichiro Hayashi, Masaru Tateishi', 'George Iida, Masaru Nakamura, Hiroshi Saito', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Sayaka Kanda, Takayuki Yamada, Naohito Fujiki, Yoshimasa Kondo, Kyūsaku Shimada, Minori Terada, Jinpachi Nezu', null, 'Teru Aoki (青木 輝) is on a train to Tokyo after a school trip. A disaster occurs which partially destroys the train and blocks a tunnel. When Teru awakes, he finds all his classmates and teachers are dead.', 'Teru Aoki (青木 輝) is on a train to Tokyo after a school trip. A disaster occurs which partially destroys the train and blocks a tunnel. When Teru awakes, he finds all his classmates and teachers are dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ajs7QqYMfXIoQHsgWAtvZfkAo21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36167'),
  ('21514373905256785', 'Dragon Hill', 2002, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Ángel Izquierdo', 'Antonio Zurera', null, null, 'There are four entrances to the dragons'' beautiful world: fire, water, earth and air. Only Ethelbert, the guardian, has the key and the secret to get out. Kevin, a boy form Mediaeval Age, falls into the water and goes to Dragon Hill. He and the youngest dragon become friends. But everything is not perfect in Dragon Hill. A mean wizard and his assistant are captured and try to make the boy let them free.', 'There are four entrances to the dragons'' beautiful world: fire, water, earth and air. Only Ethelbert, the guardian, has the key and the secret to get out. Kevin, a boy form Mediaeval Age, falls into the water and goes to Dragon Hill. He and the youngest dragon become friends. But everything is not perfect in Dragon Hill. A mean wizard and his assistant are captured and try to make the boy let them free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49vGNSydXjgOV4LXXEYcxMR7EZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26807'),
  ('655959756715477046', 'Dragon Hunter', 2008, 'Fantasy', 'Stephen Shimek', 'Stephen Shimek', 'Kelly Stables, Maclain Nelson, Adam Johnson, Isaac C. Singleton, Jr., Newell Alexander, Slate Holmgren, Brian King, Orlando Seale', null, 'Orphaned as a baby when his parents were killed in a vicious orc attack, Kendrick of Elwood was raised by his elder brother, Darius. Now, after years of absence, a new danger emerges, more lethal than the threat of orcs or men. Reports of dragon attacks spread like wildfire through the panicked land.', 'Orphaned as a baby when his parents were killed in a vicious orc attack, Kendrick of Elwood was raised by his elder brother, Darius. Now, after years of absence, a new danger emerges, more lethal than the threat of orcs or men. Reports of dragon attacks spread like wildfire through the panicked land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6GOmXzfVEL7bIurNPL7z84BThO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31221'),
  ('372504814154486013', 'Dragon Hunters', 2008, 'Animation, Family', 'Guillaume Ivernel, Arthur Qwak, Kyle Balda', 'Frédéric Lenoir, Arthur Qwak', 'Vincent Lindon, Patrick Timsit, Philippe Nahon, Amanda Lear, Marie Drion, Jérémy Prévost, Jean-Marc Lentretien, Elias Eliot', 'PG', 'Dragon Hunters is a fantastic tale telling the adventures of two dragon hunters: the world has become a vast conglomerate of islands of varying size and shape. This babbling universe is mainly peopled with ruthless rogues, surly peasants and illiterate, petty lords Their main concerns revolve around two fundamental rules : Eat and don''t get eaten.', 'Dragon Hunters is a fantastic tale telling the adventures of two dragon hunters: the world has become a vast conglomerate of islands of varying size and shape. This babbling universe is mainly peopled with ruthless rogues, surly peasants and illiterate, petty lords Their main concerns revolve around two fundamental rules : Eat and don''t get eaten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhHhTCh43aT3kAeknSd5T5BcZcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10800'),
  ('554187984124552326', 'Dragon in Jail', 1990, 'Action, Crime', 'Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Abdul M. Rumjahn', 'Nam Yin', 'Andy Lau, Kenny Ho Ka-King, Gigi Lai Chi, Lung Fong, John Ching Tung, Shing Fui-On, Melvin Wong, Wong Hoi-Yan', null, 'Andy Lau stars as a juvenile delinquent trying to escape life in the ghetto. After releasing from jail, he is bullied by a local tyrant, Ma Chao-wei, at last his jail mates help him to settle the problem. However, Ma takes revenge on him. His friendship with a rich jail mate (Ho Kar King) is his only way out!', 'Andy Lau stars as a juvenile delinquent trying to escape life in the ghetto. After releasing from jail, he is bullied by a local tyrant, Ma Chao-wei, at last his jail mates help him to settle the problem. However, Ma takes revenge on him. His friendship with a rich jail mate (Ho Kar King) is his only way out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huVe027Ujly2HaJ4GA8f6meUxwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153990'),
  ('807843236716100466', 'Dragon Inn', 1967, 'Action, Adventure', 'King Hu, Hua Hui-Ying, Han Ying-Chieh', 'King Hu', 'Shih Chun, Pai Ying, Polly Shang-Kuan Ling-Feng, Miao Tian, Han Ying-Chieh, Tsao Chien, Hsueh Han, Go Ming', null, 'China, year 1457. The Minister of Defense is executed, and his children are sentenced to exile by order of the tyrannical Tsao. Fearful of future revenge from the young people, Tsao sends cruel soldiers to murder them, but a brave group of swordsmen can change the course of the battle at the Dragon Inn.', 'China, year 1457. The Minister of Defense is executed, and his children are sentenced to exile by order of the tyrannical Tsao. Fearful of future revenge from the young people, Tsao sends cruel soldiers to murder them, but a brave group of swordsmen can change the course of the battle at the Dragon Inn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1EVgOjZ4gfnRTFSZIsr1UoAx0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104237'),
  ('874596223009988480', 'Dragon Knight', 2022, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Lawrie Brewster', 'Sarah Daly', 'Ryan Livingstone, Megan Tremethick, Regan Walker, Michael Daviot, Erich Redman, Lawrie Brewster, Briony Monroe, Stephen Kerr', null, 'Many years after the war has been lost, and all the dragons slain, a lone knight travels the lands of Agonos seeking to raise an army against the demon lord Abaddon. When a healer''s vision reveals that one dragon still lives, and together with an eager young squire, the knight sets off in search of the fabled creature. As the armies of Abaddon descend on the human kingdoms, the dragon is their last hope of fending off the horde, before it lays waste to the lands of men. But does the creature even exist? And if it does, will it fight for them once more?', 'Many years after the war has been lost, and all the dragons slain, a lone knight travels the lands of Agonos seeking to raise an army against the demon lord Abaddon. When a healer''s vision reveals that one dragon still lives, and together with an eager young squire, the knight sets off in search of the fabled creature. As the armies of Abaddon descend on the human kingdoms, the dragon is their last hope of fending off the horde, before it lays waste to the lands of men. But does the creature even exist? And if it does, will it fight for them once more?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkGFADykBtfPfTv7YJooxTH52ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919355'),
  ('1002354215020069965', 'Dragon Lord', 1982, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jackie Chan, Edward Tang, Angie Chen', 'Jackie Chan, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu, Edward Tang', 'Jackie Chan, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Sidney Yim, Mars, Tien Feng, Paul Chang Chung, Hwang In-shik, Kwon Yeong-Moon', null, 'Dragon and his madcap pal Cowboy spend their days getting into mischief, frustrating the elders, chasing girls, and competing in the village sport. When Dragon overhears a fiendish plot by smugglers to sell China''s national treasures overseas, the pair leap into action. Also, Cowboy''s wealthy father is kidnapped by the villainous and lethal Big Boss, and the scene is set for a furious martial arts showdown.', 'Dragon and his madcap pal Cowboy spend their days getting into mischief, frustrating the elders, chasing girls, and competing in the village sport. When Dragon overhears a fiendish plot by smugglers to sell China''s national treasures overseas, the pair leap into action. Also, Cowboy''s wealthy father is kidnapped by the villainous and lethal Big Boss, and the scene is set for a furious martial arts showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjQhm2jwV4DSTauOydFJVhVyMS3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16407'),
  ('954092563353279288', 'Dragon Nest: Warriors'' Dawn', 2014, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Yuefeng Song', 'Bill Borden', 'Shen Dawei, Josie Xu Jiao, Sun Ye, Hu Ge, Jing Tian, Meng Xianglong, Ji Guanlin, Xia Zitong', 'G', 'For years, the land of Altera has observed an uneasy peace between the humans, the elves, and the beasts who are loyal to the legendary Black Dragon. But when the dragon wakes from its hibernation, mobilizing a force of beasts to make war, a small band of humans and elves unite in a search for the secret road to the dragon’s lair.', 'For years, the land of Altera has observed an uneasy peace between the humans, the elves, and the beasts who are loyal to the legendary Black Dragon. But when the dragon wakes from its hibernation, mobilizing a force of beasts to make war, a small band of humans and elves unite in a search for the secret road to the dragon’s lair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fklM49dK7AZ3j8jgycxbRwECGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257932'),
  ('45906262074175715', 'Dragon Princess', 1976, 'Action', 'Yutaka Kohira, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Hirō Matsuda', 'Etsuko Shihomi, Yasuaki Kurata, Jirô Chiba, Go Otsuka, Yoshi Katō, Toyoko Takechi, Gajirō Satō, Kyōichi Satō', null, 'A karate master played by Sonny Chiba is attacked and left crippled and blinded in one eye. He trains his daughter with the intention of her avenging not only himself but a murdered friend.', 'A karate master played by Sonny Chiba is attacked and left crippled and blinded in one eye. He trains his daughter with the intention of her avenging not only himself but a murdered friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWoZyNBdOrbY1dOzSxkhIC4ghkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86539'),
  ('630469037432476684', 'Dragon Princess', 2021, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Anthony Roux, Jean-Jacques Denis', 'Jean-Jacques Denis, Anthony Roux', 'Lila Lacombe, Kaycie Chase, Jérémie Covillault, Colette Venhard, Michel Bompoil, Florence Viala, Jean-Christophe Dollé, Lionel Tua', null, 'Bristle is a little girl raised by dragons, but when her father, Dragon, has to pay the Sorcerog using his second most valuable asset, he offers her Bristle – throwing her into an infinite sadness and forcing her to flee the family cave. Bristle then embarks on a journey to discover the world of men.', 'Bristle is a little girl raised by dragons, but when her father, Dragon, has to pay the Sorcerog using his second most valuable asset, he offers her Bristle – throwing her into an infinite sadness and forcing her to flee the family cave. Bristle then embarks on a journey to discover the world of men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRGLydGfSr4koHiYbU0dnbNJNRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588917'),
  ('592610630195159611', 'Dragon Quest: Your Story', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Family', 'Ryuichi Yagi, Takashi Yamazaki, Keiichi Momose', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Takeru Satoh, Kasumi Arimura, Haru, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Takayuki Yamada, Kendo Kobayashi, Ken Yasuda, Suzuki Matsuo', 'PG', 'Luca follows in his father''s footsteps to rescue his mother from evil Ladja. Finding the heavenly hero who wields the Zenithian sword is his only hope.', 'Luca follows in his father''s footsteps to rescue his mother from evil Ladja. Finding the heavenly hero who wields the Zenithian sword is his only hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5R70ehKGh5V0ZYOdikxwSfoLGMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592867'),
  ('585492304552624325', 'Dragon Rider', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Olaf Aue, Tomer Eshed', 'Johnny Smith', 'Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Freddie Highmore, Felicity Jones, Patrick Stewart, Sanjeev Bhaskar, Nonso Anozie, Meera Syal, Alex Norton', null, 'An unlikely trio of heroes – a dragon, a boy and a forest brownie – embark on an epic adventure to find the “Rim of Heaven” - the mythological safe haven for all dragons.', 'An unlikely trio of heroes – a dragon, a boy and a forest brownie – embark on an epic adventure to find the “Rim of Heaven” - the mythological safe haven for all dragons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucDrOXUrVnr9X3ZmXP2Q68HDIHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523366'),
  ('606265414600225984', 'Dragon Seed', 1944, 'Drama', 'Harold S. Bucquet, Jack Conway, Sidney Wagner', 'Jane Murfin, Marguerite Roberts', 'Katharine Hepburn, Walter Huston, Aline MacMahon, Akim Tamiroff, Turhan Bey, Hurd Hatfield, J. Carrol Naish, Agnes Moorehead', 'NR', 'Life in a small Chinese village is turned upside down when the Japanese invade it. A heroic young Chinese woman leads her fellow villagers in an uprising against the Japanese invaders.', 'Life in a small Chinese village is turned upside down when the Japanese invade it. A heroic young Chinese woman leads her fellow villagers in an uprising against the Japanese invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94sBtA9bBLGQLCXfwFmK4F0c1DY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123665'),
  ('590066844652887062', 'Dragon Squad', 2005, 'Action, Crime', 'Daniel Lee, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Lau Ho-Leung, Daniel Lee, Kwok Man-Ki', 'Vanness Wu, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Xia Yu, Eva Huang Shengyi, Lawrence Chou Chun-Wai, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Michael Biehn, Huh Joon-ho', null, 'A team of Interpol agents arrive in the city to testify against a local crime lord. However on the way to court the vehicle carrying the Triad boss is attacked and the crime lord snatched, not by his own people but by another foe.', 'A team of Interpol agents arrive in the city to testify against a local crime lord. However on the way to court the vehicle carrying the Triad boss is attacked and the crime lord snatched, not by his own people but by another foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG5psOQnLBiNR6HpGjSTEglWn6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18816'),
  ('639996059912681804', 'Dragon Tiger Gate', 2006, 'Action, Thriller', 'Wilson Yip, Donnie Yen, Ko Chiu-Lam', 'Edmond Wong Chi-Mun', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Donnie Yen, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Dong Jie, Chen Kuan-Tai, Yu Kang, Li Xiaoran, Yuen Wah', null, 'Three young martial arts masters emerge from the back streets of Hong Kong to help the powerless fight injustice.', 'Three young martial arts masters emerge from the back streets of Hong Kong to help the powerless fight injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qamxFxSDtxFk4WPOp5bOYroLqFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15860'),
  ('990858944604532796', 'Dragon Trap', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Uğur Yücel', null, 'Uğur Yücel, Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Nejat İşler, Berrak Tüzünataç, Ceyda Düvenci, Sırrı Süreyya Önder, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Ozan Güven', null, 'When a serial killer goes after former convicted pedophiles, it is up to Police Commissioner Abbas and his Chief Celal to stop the killings.', 'When a serial killer goes after former convicted pedophiles, it is up to Police Commissioner Abbas and his Chief Celal to stop the killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Vc2NOLXo08T3VvrafLP4QLu28d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35963'),
  ('1094979270210794130', 'Dragon Wars: D-War', 2007, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Hubert Taczanowski, Shim Hyung-rae, Alexa Sheehan', 'Shim Hyung-rae', 'Jason Behr, Amanda Brooks, Robert Forster, Craig Robinson, Aimee Garcia, Chris Mulkey, John Ales, Elizabeth Peña', 'PG-13', 'Ethan learns he carries the spirit of a warrior who battled dragons in 16th-century Korea -- and one day he''ll find a tattooed girl carrying the spirit of that warrior''s beloved. Years later, he meets Sarah and dragons soon descend on Los Angeles seeking out the two souls of the ancient lovers.', 'Ethan learns he carries the spirit of a warrior who battled dragons in 16th-century Korea -- and one day he''ll find a tattooed girl carrying the spirit of that warrior''s beloved. Years later, he meets Sarah and dragons soon descend on Los Angeles seeking out the two souls of the ancient lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEpvqWGu08coDLUpcpiz4sMoDYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10253'),
  ('804288953481580282', 'Dragon Wasps', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Joe Knee, Mikey Jechort', 'Rafael Jordan, Mark Atkins', 'Corin Nemec, Dominika Juillet, Nikolette Noel, Benjamin Easterday, David Staszko, Gildon Roland, Cosondra Sjostrom', null, 'A scientist enlists the help of the US army to investigate the mysterious disappearance of her father, deep in the Belizean jungle. Caught in the crossfire between a brutal guerrilla army controlled by a mystical warlord, they are also confronted by an even bigger terror giant mutated wasps that are, for some reason, thirsty for blood.', 'A scientist enlists the help of the US army to investigate the mysterious disappearance of her father, deep in the Belizean jungle. Caught in the crossfire between a brutal guerrilla army controlled by a mystical warlord, they are also confronted by an even bigger terror giant mutated wasps that are, for some reason, thirsty for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYW9kuRPpkumbyOK3znajiKNEQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136568'),
  ('1136318210396966639', 'Dragon: The Bruce Lee Story', 1993, 'Drama, History, Action', 'David Eggby, Rob Cohen, John Cheung Ng-Long', 'John Raffo, Edward Khmara, Rob Cohen', 'Jason Scott Lee, Lauren Holly, Robert Wagner, Michael Learned, Nancy Kwan, Lim Kay Tong, Ric Young, Wang Luoyong', 'PG-13', 'This film is a glimpse into the life, love and the unconquerable spirit of the legendary Bruce Lee. From a childhood of rigorous martial arts training, Lee realizes his dream of opening his own kung-fu school in America. Before long, he is discovered by a Hollywood producer and begins a meteoric rise to fame and an all too short reign as one the most charismatic action heroes in cinema history.', 'This film is a glimpse into the life, love and the unconquerable spirit of the legendary Bruce Lee. From a childhood of rigorous martial arts training, Lee realizes his dream of opening his own kung-fu school in America. Before long, he is discovered by a Hollywood producer and begins a meteoric rise to fame and an all too short reign as one the most charismatic action heroes in cinema history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxhsdC8wuGgQf0gKCt8wyHHxGcQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10423'),
  ('661396650599973181', 'Dragon''s Claws', 1979, 'Action', 'Joseph Kuo, Ma Koon-Wah', 'Joseph Kuo', 'Lau Kar-Yung, Hwang Jang-Lee, Pak Sha-Lik, Hon Kwok-Choi, Chu Tit-Wo, Chan Lau, Yuen Qiu, Lau Hok-Nin', null, 'A "Dragon Claw" master returns from Manchuria where he became a traitor to China. He''s after the coveted Dragon Claw Golden Tablet that will force people to bow down to him. He challenges the Grand-master who has a checkered past of his own. The Grand-master happens to suffers from a terminal chronic injury related to his evil past. The traitor kills the grand-master, causing his wife and son the go into hiding. The wife seems to really be the Dragon Claw master in the family and she vows to train her son the kung fu secrets. The son finds that one of his friends has learned a strange style of kung fu from a filthy medicine man. The son seeks him out to improve his kung fu and defeat the traitor.', 'A "Dragon Claw" master returns from Manchuria where he became a traitor to China. He''s after the coveted Dragon Claw Golden Tablet that will force people to bow down to him. He challenges the Grand-master who has a checkered past of his own. The Grand-master happens to suffers from a terminal chronic injury related to his evil past. The traitor kills the grand-master, causing his wife and son the go into hiding. The wife seems to really be the Dragon Claw master in the family and she vows to train her son the kung fu secrets. The son finds that one of his friends has learned a strange style of kung fu from a filthy medicine man. The son seeks him out to improve his kung fu and defeat the traitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o19M4jI90JXptRa2wA247WLSbN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40067'),
  ('159700469301330474', 'Dragon''s Heaven', 1988, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Makoto Kobayashi, Tsuguo Kozawa', 'Makoto Kobayashi', 'Kei Tomiyama, Yuko Minaguchi, Iemasa Kayumi, Daisuke Gori', null, 'A thousand years after the war that stopped the robot uprising, a human-allied mech awakens to find the battle rages on in Brazil. In the new world, he and his fresh-faced human operator launch a plan to confront his old archnemesis and bring the age-old conflict to an end.', 'A thousand years after the war that stopped the robot uprising, a human-allied mech awakens to find the battle rages on in Brazil. In the new world, he and his fresh-faced human operator launch a plan to confront his old archnemesis and bring the age-old conflict to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ppfFmQfr6gkudlx31VRM8pKmui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166795'),
  ('922203808327141582', 'Dragon''s Return', 1968, 'Drama', 'Martin Slivka, Pavol Benca, Eduard Grečner', 'Eduard Grečner', 'Radovan Lukavský, Gustáv Valach, Emília Vášáryová, Viliam Polónyi, Jozef Čierny, Pavol Chrobák, Mikuláš Ladižinský, Ivan Macho', null, 'This is a ballad about love, hate, and a search for a way out of loneliness. It is a dramatic story about the strange potter, Martin Leaps, nicknamed Dragon, who is suspected by the villagers as the cause of natural disasters. He lost his wife, his home, and his freedom due to false accusations. After years he returns to his native village. Putting his own life to risk, he saves a herd of cows from a forest fire in the hills. But not even this heroic deed helps him to win back the friendship of the locals.', 'This is a ballad about love, hate, and a search for a way out of loneliness. It is a dramatic story about the strange potter, Martin Leaps, nicknamed Dragon, who is suspected by the villagers as the cause of natural disasters. He lost his wife, his home, and his freedom due to false accusations. After years he returns to his native village. Putting his own life to risk, he saves a herd of cows from a forest fire in the hills. But not even this heroic deed helps him to win back the friendship of the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DBYGjn7tHSUDnSyD0V2duzS9AE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46212'),
  ('493336714126669876', 'Dragon''s World: A Fantasy Made Real', 2004, 'Fantasy, Documentary', 'Mike Eley, John Howarth, Justin Hardy', null, 'Tom Chadbon, Catherine Bach, Paul Hilton, Bradley Lavelle, Niccolo Cioni, Hamish MacLeod, Aidan Woodward, Ian Holm', 'PG', '"The Last Dragon" is a nature mockumentary about a British scientific team that attempts to understand the unique incredible beasts that have fascinated people for ages. CGI is used to create the dragons.', '"The Last Dragon" is a nature mockumentary about a British scientific team that attempts to understand the unique incredible beasts that have fascinated people for ages. CGI is used to create the dragons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqlRs93DhEB2JZLydCI21X9qBmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27243'),
  ('1078485820263010121', 'Dragonball Evolution', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'James Wong, Robert McLachlan', 'Ben Ramsey', 'Justin Chatwin, Chow Yun-Fat, Joon Park, Jamie Chung, Emmy Rossum, James Marsters, Randall Duk Kim, Ernie Hudson', 'PG', 'On his 18th birthday, Goku receives a mystical Dragonball as a gift from his grandfather. There are only six others like it in the whole world, and legend has it that whoever possesses all seven will be granted one perfect wish. When the arrival of a dark force triggers a tragedy, Goku and his companions are propelled into an epic quest to collect the seven Dragonballs and save the Earth from destruction.', 'On his 18th birthday, Goku receives a mystical Dragonball as a gift from his grandfather. There are only six others like it in the whole world, and legend has it that whoever possesses all seven will be granted one perfect wish. When the arrival of a dark force triggers a tragedy, Goku and his companions are propelled into an epic quest to collect the seven Dragonballs and save the Earth from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sunS9xhPnFNP5wlOWrvbpBteAB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14164'),
  ('490509525394213874', 'Dragonflies', 2022, 'Drama', 'Luc Knowles', 'Luc Knowles', 'Milena Smit, Olivia Baglivi, Pol Hermoso, Marina Esteve, Javier Collado, Berta Sánchez, Gonzalo Herrero, Aramis Baglivi', null, 'Álex and Cata, two young women who live on the outskirts of the city, a desolate place full of empty stores and ramshackle bars where dreams end up fading, have been preparing their escape all their lives.', 'Álex and Cata, two young women who live on the outskirts of the city, a desolate place full of empty stores and ramshackle bars where dreams end up fading, have been preparing their escape all their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdh500AAzDwbJtR82UOkdgJekGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943934'),
  ('33661954485468001', 'Dragonfly', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Tom Shadyac, Dean Semler, Dawn Swiderski', 'Brandon Camp, Mike Thompson, David Seltzer', 'Kevin Costner, Joe Morton, Ron Rifkin, Susanna Thompson, Kathy Bates, Jacob Smith, Robert Bailey Jr., Jay Thomas', 'PG-13', 'A grieving doctor is being contacted by his late wife through his patient''s near death experiences.', 'A grieving doctor is being contacted by his late wife through his patient''s near death experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tafDYI10ZhorJ6nmsPqUfzQpRLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10052'),
  ('1013825823850893353', 'DragonHeart', 1996, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Rob Cohen, David Eggby, Maria Teresa Barbasso', 'Charles Edward Pogue, Patrick Read Johnson', 'Dennis Quaid, Sean Connery, David Thewlis, Dina Meyer, Pete Postlethwaite, Jason Isaacs, Brian Thompson, Julie Christie', 'PG-13', 'In an ancient time when majestic fire-breathers soared through the skies, a knight named Bowen comes face to face and heart to heart with the last dragon on Earth, Draco. Taking up arms to suppress a tyrant king, Bowen soon realizes his task will be harder than he''d imagined: If he kills the king, Draco will die as well.', 'In an ancient time when majestic fire-breathers soared through the skies, a knight named Bowen comes face to face and heart to heart with the last dragon on Earth, Draco. Taking up arms to suppress a tyrant king, Bowen soon realizes his task will be harder than he''d imagined: If he kills the king, Draco will die as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1J2FvxEoEKMFT9TjUdfhm0MJhZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8840'),
  ('17616955272458822', 'Dragonheart 3: The Sorcerer''s Curse', 2015, 'Fantasy', 'Colin Teague, David Luther, Andrei-Florian Popa', 'Colin Teague', 'Julian Morris, Tamzin Merchant, Ben Kingsley, Jassa Ahluwalia, Jonjo O''Neill, Christopher Fairbank, Dominic Mafham, Ozama Oancea', 'PG-13', 'When aspiring knight Gareth goes in search of a fallen comet rumored to contain gold, he is shocked to instead find the dragon Drago. After Drago saves Gareth''s life the two become intricately bonded, and must work together to defeat an evil sorcerer and stop his reign of terror. Along the way, Gareth learns the true meaning of being a knight in this fantasy action-adventure for the ages.', 'When aspiring knight Gareth goes in search of a fallen comet rumored to contain gold, he is shocked to instead find the dragon Drago. After Drago saves Gareth''s life the two become intricately bonded, and must work together to defeat an evil sorcerer and stop his reign of terror. Along the way, Gareth learns the true meaning of being a knight in this fantasy action-adventure for the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPiyMWZHlRGgQ54roaraS3iJR12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300803'),
  ('296731684558787253', 'DragonHeart: A New Beginning', 2000, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Doug Lefler, Buzz Feitshans IV', null, 'Christopher Masterson, Harry Van Gorkum, Rona Figueroa, Matt Hickey, Henry O, Tom Burke, Robby Benson, Ken Shorter', 'PG', 'When Geoff, an orphaned stable boy (Chris Masterson), discovers Drake (voice of Robby Benson), the world''s last living dragon, he realizes that his dream of becoming a knight in shining armor can now come true. Together, they soon face challenges that turn them into heroes. But caught up in the excitement of their new lives, Geoff and Drake fail to see the hidden dangers that surround them.', 'When Geoff, an orphaned stable boy (Chris Masterson), discovers Drake (voice of Robby Benson), the world''s last living dragon, he realizes that his dream of becoming a knight in shining armor can now come true. Together, they soon face challenges that turn them into heroes. But caught up in the excitement of their new lives, Geoff and Drake fail to see the hidden dangers that surround them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plFfQfmr4J4ghg3v2p7oWtFKvNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10473'),
  ('762551835975735864', 'Dragonheart: Battle for the Heartfire', 2017, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Patrik Syversen', 'Matthew Feitshans', 'Marte Germaine Christensen, Patrick Stewart, Tom Rhys Harries, Jessamine-Bliss Bell, Tamzin Merchant, André Eriksen, Richard Cordery, Martin Hutson', 'PG-13', 'When the King Gareth dies, his potential heirs, twin grandchildren who possess the dragon’s unique strengths, use their inherited powers against each other to vie for the throne. When Drago’s source of power – known as the Heartfire – is stolen, more than the throne is at stake; the siblings must end their rivalry with swords and sorcery or the kingdom may fall.', 'When the King Gareth dies, his potential heirs, twin grandchildren who possess the dragon’s unique strengths, use their inherited powers against each other to vie for the throne. When Drago’s source of power – known as the Heartfire – is stolen, more than the throne is at stake; the siblings must end their rivalry with swords and sorcery or the kingdom may fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21awrY48uEiDOyLYALcuMgE5G7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451644'),
  ('10639403735305004', 'Dragonheart: Vengeance', 2021, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Ivan Silvestrini, Matthew Weston', 'Matthew Feitshans', 'Joseph Millson, Jack Kane, Arturo Muselli, Helena Bonham Carter, Carolina Carlsson, Tam Williams, Richard Ashton, Ross O''Hennessy', 'PG-13', 'Lukas, a young farmer whose family is killed by savage raiders in the countryside, sets out on an epic quest for revenge, forming an unlikely trio with a majestic dragon and a swashbuckling, sword-fighting mercenary, Darius.', 'Lukas, a young farmer whose family is killed by savage raiders in the countryside, sets out on an epic quest for revenge, forming an unlikely trio with a majestic dragon and a swashbuckling, sword-fighting mercenary, Darius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qs6gz6atyQcAvqC6qZaslOjliUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666750'),
  ('17557998009816359', 'Dragonkeeper', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jian-Ping Li, Salvador Simó, Abraham López Guerrero', 'Ignacio Ferreras, Xianping Wang, Pablo Castrillo', 'Mario Gas, Lucía Pérez, Fernando Castro, Carlos de Luna, José Gómez Adán, César Díaz Capilla, Isabel Gaudí, Miquel Rodríguez Ros', 'PG', 'Set in Han Imperial China, the plot follows the adventures of enslaved girl Ping with ancient dragon Long Danzi. Dragons had been banished from the kingdom. Ping, an orphan, finds one of the last remaining dragon eggs. Palace guards force Ping to run away in order to return the dragon egg to the ocean and save all dragons from extinction. Ping discovers that she is a true Dragonkeeper.', 'Set in Han Imperial China, the plot follows the adventures of enslaved girl Ping with ancient dragon Long Danzi. Dragons had been banished from the kingdom. Ping, an orphan, finds one of the last remaining dragon eggs. Palace guards force Ping to run away in order to return the dragon egg to the ocean and save all dragons from extinction. Ping discovers that she is a true Dragonkeeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggZGnJLzO3BTu7ysuuIzou3Oex5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588648'),
  ('1115368952782268682', 'Dragonlance: Dragons of Autumn Twilight', 2008, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Will Meugniot', 'George Strayton', 'Michael Rosenbaum, Kiefer Sutherland, Lucy Lawless, Fred Tatasciore, Michelle Trachtenberg, Rino Romano, Jason Marsden, Neil Ross', 'PG-13', 'A barbarian woman with a miraculous blue crystal staff gains the help of a group of adventurers as an army of dragons invades the land of Krynn.', 'A barbarian woman with a miraculous blue crystal staff gains the help of a group of adventurers as an army of dragons invades the land of Krynn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cssz1AP3foW0FfeKqiPd1Ix868u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17031'),
  ('245531104259709057', 'Dragonquest', 2009, 'Fantasy', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins, Stephen Fiske', 'Brian Brinkman, Micho Rutare', 'Marc Singer, Brian Thompson, Jason Connery, Daniel Bonjour, Jennifer Dorogi, Russell Reynolds, Jack Goldenberg, Jonathan Nation', null, 'When an ancient warlord summons a mythological beast, a young hero must complete a series of quests to awaken the dragon that will defeat the monster.', 'When an ancient warlord summons a mythological beast, a young hero must complete a series of quests to awaken the dragon that will defeat the monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uvWhwQili4U1Zl6iFxWNoWX3U8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16398'),
  ('834826875400800817', 'Dragons Forever', 1988, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Fruit Chan, Ng Min-Kan', 'Sze-To Cheuk-Hon', 'Jackie Chan, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Yuen Biao, Deanie Ip, Pauline Yeung Bo-Ling, Yuen Wah, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Steve Lee Ka-Ting', null, 'A hot-shot lawyer is hired by a Hong Kong chemical plant to dispose of opposition to their polluting ways. But when he falls for a beautiful woman out to stop the plant, he is torn in a conflict of interest and asks his trusty friends Samo and Biao to help out at least until they discover the true purpose of the plant.', 'A hot-shot lawyer is hired by a Hong Kong chemical plant to dispose of opposition to their polluting ways. But when he falls for a beautiful woman out to stop the plant, he is torn in a conflict of interest and asks his trusty friends Samo and Biao to help out at least until they discover the true purpose of the plant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lt94C482UqyVlq1UdK5nvXukaw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21733'),
  ('748602713798792971', 'Dragons: Dawn of the Dragon Racers', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'John Sanford, Elaine Bogan, Christi Soper Hilt', 'Art Brown, Douglas Sloan', 'Jay Baruchel, America Ferrera, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, T.J. Miller, Tim Conway, Chris Edgerly, Tom Kenny, Nolan North', 'G', 'A hunt for a lost sheep turns into a competition between Hiccup and friends as they compete to become the first Dragon Racing champion of Berk.', 'A hunt for a lost sheep turns into a competition between Hiccup and friends as they compete to become the first Dragon Racing champion of Berk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgOXOQyPIjeMi1bnWu1r0CzLsZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298115'),
  ('318810440699317762', 'Dragons: Destiny of Fire', 2006, 'Animation', 'Eduardo Schuldt', 'Enrique Moncloa, Giovanna Pollarolo, Hernán Garrido-Lecca', 'Gian Marco Zignago, Gianella Neyra, Silvia Navarro, Jesús Ochoa, Roberto Moll, Ricardo Velásquez, Paul Martin, Katia Condos', null, 'Raised by a loving family of condors, little John John grows up thinking that he, too, is a condor, despite the fact that he looks nothing like his parents. Turns out, John John is no ordinary bird. In fact, he''s really an honest-to-goodness dragon! After developing his fire-breathing powers, John John flies off on an adventure to find the dragon kingdom and his real family in this charming animated fantasy.', 'Raised by a loving family of condors, little John John grows up thinking that he, too, is a condor, despite the fact that he looks nothing like his parents. Turns out, John John is no ordinary bird. In fact, he''s really an honest-to-goodness dragon! After developing his fire-breathing powers, John John flies off on an adventure to find the dragon kingdom and his real family in this charming animated fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aG8jYCr8Sy6CaDvSKgP3fEHRnOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319549'),
