  ('826217734374218450', 'Dragonslayer', 1981, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Derek Vanlint, Matthew Robbins', 'Hal Barwood, Matthew Robbins', 'Peter MacNicol, Caitlin Clarke, Ralph Richardson, John Hallam, Peter Eyre, Albert Salmi, Sydney Bromley, Chloe Salaman', 'PG', 'A sorcerer and his apprentice are on a mission to kill an evil dragon to save the King’s daughter from being sacrificed according to a pact that the King himself made with the dragon to protect his kingdom.', 'A sorcerer and his apprentice are on a mission to kill an evil dragon to save the King’s daughter from being sacrificed according to a pact that the King himself made with the dragon to protect his kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92VXAEwbjebYqTeUa7uX5bBtDuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848'),
