  ('751577087238136743', 'Drakula Tok', 1979, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Sawong Supsamruay', null, 'Sawong Supsamruay, Naiyana Shewanan, Nirut Sirijanya, Suwin Sawangrat, Viyada Umarin, Jaran Petcharoen, Kokheng, Setha Sirachaya', null, 'Things seem to be normal in an area of Thailand. But then Dracula is summoned to that region from Europe. He goes after a young woman. He has a bunch of dancing female vampire servants. Devils, zombies and some other weird creatures also show up.', 'Things seem to be normal in an area of Thailand. But then Dracula is summoned to that region from Europe. He goes after a young woman. He has a bunch of dancing female vampire servants. Devils, zombies and some other weird creatures also show up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqHdvozruane8EtElbnWlDROZog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447849'),
  ('581042603582540561', 'Drama', 2010, 'Drama', 'Matias Lira, M.I. Littin-Menz, Waldo Salgado', 'Eliseo Altunaga, Matias Lira, Sebastian Arrau', 'Eusebio Arenas, Diego Ruiz, Isidora Urrejola, Jaime McManus, Eduardo Paxeco, Alejandro Goic, Fernanda Urrejola, Benjamín Vicuña', null, 'Three theater students, influenced by a professor and French theorist Antonin Artaud''s acting technique, begin to experiment with their own lives, searching for real emotions and situations to bring onto the stage. Their obsession with becoming better actors leads them to their darkest sides, surpassing boundaries that neither they nor their teachers could ever imagine.', 'Three theater students, influenced by a professor and French theorist Antonin Artaud''s acting technique, begin to experiment with their own lives, searching for real emotions and situations to bring onto the stage. Their obsession with becoming better actors leads them to their darkest sides, surpassing boundaries that neither they nor their teachers could ever imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7zZ9zQjJ7kuoKvqrIjrBWhTkn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79168'),
  ('1059072900075883615', 'Drama at the Puppets'' House', 1908, 'Comedy, Animation, Crime', 'Émile Cohl', null, null, null, 'For a short comedy of rare merit this subject is unexcelled. A chalk line series of grotesque caricatures enacted in the land of puppets. A fickle maiden gets herself into numerous embarrassing complications with her host of admirers, but the artist with lightning rapidity overcomes all obstacles and brings the maiden out victorious.', 'For a short comedy of rare merit this subject is unexcelled. A chalk line series of grotesque caricatures enacted in the land of puppets. A fickle maiden gets herself into numerous embarrassing complications with her host of admirers, but the artist with lightning rapidity overcomes all obstacles and brings the maiden out victorious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhOTpXOT4WUBnUXtYR1DuNkgQbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196598'),
  ('756823841451421258', 'Drama/Mex', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gerardo Naranjo, Tobias Datum', 'Gerardo Naranjo', 'Fernando Becerril, Juan Pablo Castañeda, Diana García, Martha Claudia Moreno, Miriana Moro, Emilio Valdés, Gloria Stalina', null, 'Two stories unfold over the same long, hot day in Acapulco. The first involves Fernanda, who is forced to deal with the emergence of her ex-lover. Her boyfriend must compete with the sexual tension they share. The second concerns Jamie, a worker attempting suicide, until a girl disrupts his plan.', 'Two stories unfold over the same long, hot day in Acapulco. The first involves Fernanda, who is forced to deal with the emergence of her ex-lover. Her boyfriend must compete with the sexual tension they share. The second concerns Jamie, a worker attempting suicide, until a girl disrupts his plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIH6SOsb5iKkJO79LHT8e4AIMqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63883'),
  ('646661555424634019', 'Dranem Performs "Five O''Clock Tea"', 1906, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Dranem', null, 'Dranem performs "Five O''Clock Tea" for Alice Guy.', 'Dranem performs "Five O''Clock Tea" for Alice Guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr9v3wK2kS4IIX7dfkAiJ3PgUP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120010'),
  ('1049529839999534216', 'Dranem Performs The True Jiu-Jitsu', 1905, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Dranem', null, 'Armand Dranem performs The True Jiu-Jitsu ("Le Vrai Jiu-Jitsu", by P. Briollet & G. Fabri / C. D''Orviet) in this phonoscene by Alice Guy. This early form of music video was created using a chronophone recording of Dranem, who was then filmed "lip singing". Guy would film phonoscenes of all three major Belle Époque celebrities in France: Polin, Félix Mayol, and Dranem.', 'Armand Dranem performs The True Jiu-Jitsu ("Le Vrai Jiu-Jitsu", by P. Briollet & G. Fabri / C. D''Orviet) in this phonoscene by Alice Guy. This early form of music video was created using a chronophone recording of Dranem, who was then filmed "lip singing". Guy would film phonoscenes of all three major Belle Époque celebrities in France: Polin, Félix Mayol, and Dranem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uStZFI2I03xgjW9x88lSjVap1SQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120009'),
  ('942328460137704692', 'Draniki', 2026, 'Comedy, Family', 'Maxim Maksimov, Pavel Skakun, Egor Sokolov', 'Aleksandr Berezhnoy, Andrey Lipov', 'Andrey Chernikevich, Miron Lebedev, Eva Smirnova, Andrey Pynzaru', null, 'Maks is forced to spend his winter holidays in the village. Together with his cousin Yura, he decides to turn an old UAZ into a food truck and start a business selling potato pancakes. But will the children be able to cope with the difficulties of adult life, resist skeptics and realize their dreams?', 'Maks is forced to spend his winter holidays in the village. Together with his cousin Yura, he decides to turn an old UAZ into a food truck and start a business selling potato pancakes. But will the children be able to cope with the difficulties of adult life, resist skeptics and realize their dreams?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FYqbsdceVI8pR5swOQiWw1y29nY.jpg', 'plex:movie:draniki'),
