  ('354220165209689879', 'Drawing Restraint 9', 2006, 'Fantasy', 'Matthew Barney, Peter Strietmann', 'Matthew Barney', 'Shigeru Akahori, Matthew Barney, Björk, Naomi Araki, Mayumi Miyata, Yoshio Harada, Shinya Kimura, Jun Naito', null, 'The film concerns the theme of self-imposed limitation and continues Matthew Barney''s interest in religious rite, this time focusing on Shinto.', 'The film concerns the theme of self-imposed limitation and continues Matthew Barney''s interest in religious rite, this time focusing on Shinto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/453zKeXErfTZoRDK8AldLBoJsM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34787'),
