  ('799934411080150923', 'Dream City', 1973, 'Adventure', 'Johannes Schaaf, Gérard Vandenberg, Klaus König', 'Russell Parker, Rosemarie Fendel, Johannes Schaaf', 'Per Oscarsson, Rosemarie Fendel, Eva Maria Meineke, Helen Vita, Herbert Bötticher, Alexander May, Olimpia, Heinrich Schweiger', null, 'A married couple of artists move to a utopian town known for its absolute freedom, but behind the surface perversion and violence are spreading.', 'A married couple of artists move to a utopian town known for its absolute freedom, but behind the surface perversion and violence are spreading.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6H9g2U71dPVnRxBcrXwIoGPAcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257831'),
  ('338261260071887942', 'Dream Cruise', 2007, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Norio Tsuruta, Tetsuro Sano', 'Naoya Takayama, Norio Tsuruta', 'Daniel Gillies, Ryo Ishibashi, Yoshino Kimura, Thom Irvine, Ethan Amis, Maky Soler, Tiffany Martin, Ian Moore', null, 'Absolutely terrified of the sea, an American lawyer reluctantly goes on an ocean cruise to be near the wife of a client, with no idea of the grim situation that awaits them all.', 'Absolutely terrified of the sea, an American lawyer reluctantly goes on an ocean cruise to be near the wife of a client, with no idea of the grim situation that awaits them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdNPspTH55BBWx43m7KnccZ6Wsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319203'),
  ('1132746928997350158', 'Dream Demon', 1988, 'Horror', 'Harley Cokeliss, Ian Wilson, John Dodds', 'Harley Cokeliss, Christopher Wicking', 'Jemma Redgrave, Kathleen Wilhoite, Timothy Spall, Jimmy Nail, Mark Greenstreet, Susan Fleetwood, Annabelle Lanyon, Nickolas Grace', null, 'As her marriage to decorated war hero Oliver draws near, well-heeled Diana moves into an apartment within an otherwise unoccupied, sprawling London house where she starts to experience strange and terrifying nightmares. But are these troubling night terrors merely the symptom of an unsettled mind, or the sign of something far more sinister at work? Hounded by a pair of sleazy journalists, Diana soon crosses paths with American tourist Jenny, who appears to have a strange connection to the foreboding house and its dark past.', 'As her marriage to decorated war hero Oliver draws near, well-heeled Diana moves into an apartment within an otherwise unoccupied, sprawling London house where she starts to experience strange and terrifying nightmares. But are these troubling night terrors merely the symptom of an unsettled mind, or the sign of something far more sinister at work? Hounded by a pair of sleazy journalists, Diana soon crosses paths with American tourist Jenny, who appears to have a strange connection to the foreboding house and its dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYq8GNsI5nUdLEYBh7rqgA8SpYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49343'),
  ('415008993286658961', 'Dream Doll', 1979, 'Animation', 'Zlatko Grgić, Bob Godfrey', 'Stephen Penn', null, null, 'A lonely man living in a large city buys a life-size sex doll. His relationship with his dream doll causes a certain reaction in the community. A bizarre adaption of Le Ballon Rouge.', 'A lonely man living in a large city buys a life-size sex doll. His relationship with his dream doll causes a certain reaction in the community. A bizarre adaption of Le Ballon Rouge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64mF94whXuNm5vPtq3aMf1hWNML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220987'),
  ('33086909927786287', 'Dream Eater', 2025, 'Horror', 'Alex Lee Williams, Mallory Drumm, Jay Drakulic', 'Mallory Drumm, Alex Lee Williams, Jay Drakulic', 'Alex Lee Williams, Mallory Drumm, David Richard, Dainty Smith, Kelly Williams, Jay Drakulic, Sade Green, Brittany Drumm', 'NR', 'A filmmaker documents her boyfriend''s violent parasomnia during their holiday at a remote cabin in the woods.', 'A filmmaker documents her boyfriend''s violent parasomnia during their holiday at a remote cabin in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PRT9vkRxSAogsce4v4svKNQkqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317877'),
  ('220228663233989936', 'Dream Factory', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Martin Schreier, Martin Schlecht', 'Arend Remmers', 'Dennis Mojen, Emilia Schüle, Heiner Lauterbach, Ken Duken, Nikolai Kinski, Ellenie Salvo González, Michael Gwisdek, Thomas Heinze', null, 'A romantic drama set in 1961 that follows a young studio extra''s ambitious efforts to reunite with the French girl he loves after being separated by the construction of the Berlin Wall.', 'A romantic drama set in 1961 that follows a young studio extra''s ambitious efforts to reunite with the French girl he loves after being separated by the construction of the Berlin Wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ue4VNnCtOLw4PY235pvuC72yQ82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570292'),
  ('327571522420048524', 'Dream for an Insomniac', 1996, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Tiffanie DeBartolo, Guillermo Navarro', 'Tiffanie DeBartolo', 'Ione Skye, Jennifer Aniston, Mackenzie Astin, Michael Landes, Seymour Cassel, Sean San Jose, Michael Sterk, Leslie Stevens', 'R', 'A girl with insomnia who works in a coffee house has impossibly high standards for her love and fears she will never meet a worthy man. Then in walks a new employee and they click - until she discovers he has a girlfriend. Undaunted, she moves to L.A. with a friend sure that he will dump the girlfriend and follow her. She puts all her faith in fate and hopes for the best.', 'A girl with insomnia who works in a coffee house has impossibly high standards for her love and fears she will never meet a worthy man. Then in walks a new employee and they click - until she discovers he has a girlfriend. Undaunted, she moves to L.A. with a friend sure that he will dump the girlfriend and follow her. She puts all her faith in fate and hopes for the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hGRcEPnpmgAmfLObym3olCk6tM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32284'),
  ('1009599724508981258', 'Dream Girl', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sunder Konar, Manoj Kirdat, Rohit Gupta', 'Pawan Sony, Raaj Shaandilyaa', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Annu Kapoor, Manjot Singh, Vijay Raaz, Rajesh Sharma, Nidhi Bisht, Abhishek Banerjee', null, 'Desperate to find employment, Karam picks up a job as ‘Pooja’ at a call center for sex chats, keeping most people in his life in the dark about the nature of his work. How long can he keep it up before everyone including his girlfriend and father find out?', 'Desperate to find employment, Karam picks up a job as ‘Pooja’ at a call center for sex chats, keeping most people in his life in the dark about the nature of his work. How long can he keep it up before everyone including his girlfriend and father find out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr3za9i5SpqTVA2W2uyx0DekgID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579224'),
  ('303939603788380741', 'Dream Girl', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'M.R. Bharathi, N Solomon Boaz D., M R Bharathi', 'M.R. Bharathi, M R Bharathi', 'Jeeva Rajendran, Harisha Jestin, Prabhu Sastha', null, 'He Falls in Love With an Angel Who Appears in His Dreams. That Love Ends in Heartbreak. Yet The Same Emotions Continue in Real Life Without Changing a Single Frame. The Story Follows How the Hero, Carrying the Same Love in His Heart, Finds a Way to Reclaim the Angel He Lost in His Dream, This Time in Reality', 'He Falls in Love With an Angel Who Appears in His Dreams. That Love Ends in Heartbreak. Yet The Same Emotions Continue in Real Life Without Changing a Single Frame. The Story Follows How the Hero, Carrying the Same Love in His Heart, Finds a Way to Reclaim the Angel He Lost in His Dream, This Time in Reality', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlFGujFFdclNXyqr9Yq2bpUxnLVP.jpg', 'plex:movie:dream-girl-2026'),
  ('897680989597278368', 'Dream Girl 2', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Raaj Shaandilyaa, C.K. Muraleedharan, Jitan Harmeet Singh', 'Raaj Shaandilyaa, Naresh Kathooria', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Ananya Panday, Annu Kapoor, Paresh Rawal, Vijay Raaz, Rajpal Yadav, Asrani, Manoj Joshi', null, 'Karam, a small-town boy from Mathura, is struggling every day to pay his father''s debt, who has borrowed money from nearly everyone on the planet. On the other hand, he is deeply in love with Pari, whose father has kept the conditions to marry her. To make ends meet, Karam dons as Pooja, which creates wild chaos and a comedy of errors.', 'Karam, a small-town boy from Mathura, is struggling every day to pay his father''s debt, who has borrowed money from nearly everyone on the planet. On the other hand, he is deeply in love with Pari, whose father has kept the conditions to marry her. To make ends meet, Karam dons as Pooja, which creates wild chaos and a comedy of errors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvNeqDNwZ8isym8CeHZsZk1QiSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025067'),
  ('355089136326999199', 'Dream Home', 2010, 'Horror', 'Edmond Pang, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Derek Tsang Kwok-Cheung, Wan Chi-Man, Edmond Pang', 'Josie Ho, Eason Chan Yik-Shun, Lawrence Chou Chun-Wai, Derek Tsang Kwok-Cheung, Juno Mak, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Nina Paw Hei-Ching', null, 'A woman will go to whatever lengths necessary to obtain her dream home with a view of the sea. This includes driving down the property value and decreasing the occupancy rate by killing her potential neighbors.', 'A woman will go to whatever lengths necessary to obtain her dream home with a view of the sea. This includes driving down the property value and decreasing the occupancy rate by killing her potential neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edY2IRaCGEKuJstuLLJ9MQNAYKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49706'),
  ('509795127328897644', 'Dream Horse', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erik Wilson, Peter Bennett, Hannah Lewis', 'Neil McKay', 'Toni Collette, Owen Teale, Damian Lewis, Karl Johnson, Siân Phillips, Joanna Page, Alan David, Lynda Baron', 'PG', 'The inspiring true story of Dream Alliance, an unlikely race horse bred by small town bartender, Jan Vokes. With very little money and no experience, Jan convinces her neighbors to chip in their meager earnings to help raise Dream and compete with the racing elites. Their investment pays off as Dream rises through the ranks and becomes a beacon of hope in their struggling community.', 'The inspiring true story of Dream Alliance, an unlikely race horse bred by small town bartender, Jan Vokes. With very little money and no experience, Jan convinces her neighbors to chip in their meager earnings to help raise Dream and compete with the racing elites. Their investment pays off as Dream rises through the ranks and becomes a beacon of hope in their struggling community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF1mnSdf9EqDIm5XfODAHU6AcWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603206'),
  ('73644585325110246', 'Dream House', 2011, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Jim Sheridan, Caleb Deschanel, Walter Gasparovic', 'David Loucka', 'Daniel Craig, Naomi Watts, Rachel Weisz, Marton Csokas, Elias Koteas, Taylor Geare, Claire Geare, Rachel Fox', 'PG-13', 'Publisher Will Atenton quits a lucrative job in New York to relocate his wife, Libby, and their daughters to a quaint town in New England. However, as they settle into their home the Atentons discover that a woman and her children were murdered there, and the surviving husband is the town''s prime suspect. With help from a neighbor who was close to the murdered family, Will pieces together a horrifying chain of events.', 'Publisher Will Atenton quits a lucrative job in New York to relocate his wife, Libby, and their daughters to a quaint town in New England. However, as they settle into their home the Atentons discover that a woman and her children were murdered there, and the surviving husband is the town''s prime suspect. With help from a neighbor who was close to the murdered family, Will pieces together a horrifying chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQFbnBEYguc6EWYKG0Hgq4LVdc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69668'),
  ('372585485646106943', 'Dream Lover', 1986, 'Horror, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Alan J. Pakula, David Tringham, Michael Stevenson', 'Jon Boorstin', 'Kristy McNichol, Ben Masters, Paul Shenar, Justin Deas, John McMartin, Gayle Hunnicutt, Joseph Culp, Matthew Penn', 'R', 'After she''s been attacked in her apartment, Cathy starts reliving the event in her dreams. She seeks help at a sleep disorder research center, but in doing so she encounters some unexpected results.', 'After she''s been attacked in her apartment, Cathy starts reliving the event in her dreams. She seeks help at a sleep disorder research center, but in doing so she encounters some unexpected results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71LKYA4IBYmGcMzQMxkhmJNI5nd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103600'),
  ('735228532761399761', 'Dream Lover', 1994, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nicholas Kazan, Jean-Yves Escoffier', 'Nicholas Kazan', 'James Spader, Mädchen Amick, Fredric Lehne, Bess Armstrong, Larry Miller, Kathleen York, Kate Williamson, Tom Lillard', null, 'Not long after they cross paths at an art gallery, architect Ray Reardon and hypnotically sensual Lena are married with children. But as strange incidents occur, Ray begins to realize he may not really know the woman he married.', 'Not long after they cross paths at an art gallery, architect Ray Reardon and hypnotically sensual Lena are married with children. But as strange incidents occur, Ray begins to realize he may not really know the woman he married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epl5pprGt04gAJI8lzbKy83XkbE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18190'),
  ('613972844288670775', 'Dream Machine', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Lyman Dayton, T.C. Christensen, Doug Coleman', 'Eric Hendershot', 'Corey Haim, Brittney Lewis, Jeremy Slate, Jim McKrell, Tracy Fraim, Suzanne Kent, Susan Seaforth Hayes, Don Shanks', 'PG', 'As a reward from a jilted millionairess, Davis is given the $100,000 Porsche of the unfaithful husband. Unknown to Davis and the wife, the body of the husband is in the Porsche. The killer tries in vain to recover the body before it is discovered.', 'As a reward from a jilted millionairess, Davis is given the $100,000 Porsche of the unfaithful husband. Unknown to Davis and the wife, the body of the husband is in the Porsche. The killer tries in vain to recover the body before it is discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lj5Z5Y0LiJ2ULJRYc7Rw6nFBxqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66469'),
  ('43366918903779176', 'Dream No Evil', 1970, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'John Hayes, Jerome Guardino, Paul Hipp', 'John Hayes', 'Edmond O''Brien, Michael Pataki, Marc Lawrence, Brooke Mills, Paul Prokop, Arthur Franz, Donna Anderson, Nadyne Turney', 'R', 'Grace is a troubled young lady with some serious daddy issues. She was adopted as a young girl and raised up in a family of traveling faith healers. After the patriarch of that little group passes away Grace''s world is thrown into turmoil. The eldest brother turns his back on the family business in favor of medical school despite being engaged to Grace and she is left alone with the shady younger son who puts Grace in a skimpy leotard and incorporates some circus style showmanship to draw in the rubes.', 'Grace is a troubled young lady with some serious daddy issues. She was adopted as a young girl and raised up in a family of traveling faith healers. After the patriarch of that little group passes away Grace''s world is thrown into turmoil. The eldest brother turns his back on the family business in favor of medical school despite being engaged to Grace and she is left alone with the shady younger son who puts Grace in a skimpy leotard and incorporates some circus style showmanship to draw in the rubes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNsfJGn88N2eWi1K3qvbNkKJhLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92319'),
  ('457034428963276310', 'Dream of a Rarebit Fiend', 1906, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Edwin S. Porter', null, 'John P. Brawn', null, 'A live-action film adaptation of the comic strip Dream of the Rarebit Fiend by American cartoonist Winsor McCay. This silent short film follows the established theme: the “Rarebit Fiend” gorges himself on rarebit and thus suffers spectacular hallucinatory dreams.', 'A live-action film adaptation of the comic strip Dream of the Rarebit Fiend by American cartoonist Winsor McCay. This silent short film follows the established theme: the “Rarebit Fiend” gorges himself on rarebit and thus suffers spectacular hallucinatory dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zP4drr7ZgAq4OXBg75SJleJWk8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94702'),
  ('314359408317714735', 'Dream of Light', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Víctor Erice, Ángel Luis Fernández, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Antonio López García, Víctor Erice', 'Antonio López García, Maria Moreno, Enrique Gran, María López, Carmen López, Elisa Ruiz, José María Carretero, Amalia Avia', null, 'Filmmaker Victor Erice follows Spanish artist Antonio Lopez in his painstaking attempt to paint the image of a tree.', 'Filmmaker Victor Erice follows Spanish artist Antonio Lopez in his painstaking attempt to paint the image of a tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH3VuGHcf0jTzeRGLZlPfqTIHS1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94706'),
  ('342137162593539493', 'Dream Scenario', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Kristoffer Borgli, Benjamin Loeb, Trevor Smale', 'Kristoffer Borgli', 'Nicolas Cage, Julianne Nicholson, Michael Cera, Tim Meadows, Dylan Gelula, Lily Bird, Jessica Clement, Dylan Baker', 'R', 'Hapless family man Paul Matthews finds his life turned upside down when millions of strangers suddenly start seeing him in their dreams. But when his nighttime appearances take a nightmarish turn, Paul is forced to navigate his newfound stardom.', 'Hapless family man Paul Matthews finds his life turned upside down when millions of strangers suddenly start seeing him in their dreams. But when his nighttime appearances take a nightmarish turn, Paul is forced to navigate his newfound stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RSMu2iMDCdMKmvBWWvcmE8vjMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823482'),
  ('1056944164865547374', 'Dream Theater: Metropolis 2000 - Scenes From New York', 2001, 'Music', 'Mike Portnoy', null, 'James LaBrie, John Petrucci, Mike Portnoy, John Myung, Jordan Rudess', null, 'The video contains "Scenes From A Memory" in its entirety from its final performance in New York City on August 30th, 2000. The contents of the Special Edition DVD is: 1. SFAM in its entirety from its final performance in New York City 2. Audio Commentary throughout SFAM by all five members of Dream Theater 3. Over one hour of bonus live material 4. Behind The Scenes Documentary 5. Metropolis 2000 World Tour Photo Gallery', 'The video contains "Scenes From A Memory" in its entirety from its final performance in New York City on August 30th, 2000. The contents of the Special Edition DVD is: 1. SFAM in its entirety from its final performance in New York City 2. Audio Commentary throughout SFAM by all five members of Dream Theater 3. Over one hour of bonus live material 4. Behind The Scenes Documentary 5. Metropolis 2000 World Tour Photo Gallery', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/212mvEVnrarJeARmc5HqEAxzya9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45393'),
  ('667442998185717302', 'Dream Wife', 1953, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sidney Sheldon, Milton Krasner', 'Sidney Sheldon, Herbert Baker', 'Cary Grant, Deborah Kerr, Walter Pidgeon, Betta St. John, Eduard Franz, Buddy Baer, Les Tremayne, Donald Randolph', 'NR', 'Clemson Reade, a business tycoon with marriage on his mind, and Effie, a U.S. diplomat, are a modern couple. Unfortunately there seems to be too much business and not enough pleasure on the part of Effie. When Clemson meets Tarji, a princess trained in all the arts of pleasing men, he decides he wants an old fashioned girl. Princess Tarji''s father is king of oil-rich Bukistan. Because of the oil situation and to maintain good political relations during the courtship between Clemson & Tarji, the State Department assigns a diplomat to maintain protocol until the wedding - Effie!', 'Clemson Reade, a business tycoon with marriage on his mind, and Effie, a U.S. diplomat, are a modern couple. Unfortunately there seems to be too much business and not enough pleasure on the part of Effie. When Clemson meets Tarji, a princess trained in all the arts of pleasing men, he decides he wants an old fashioned girl. Princess Tarji''s father is king of oil-rich Bukistan. Because of the oil situation and to maintain good political relations during the courtship between Clemson & Tarji, the State Department assigns a diplomat to maintain protocol until the wedding - Effie!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqKiB8csGBsA3b5dbXlJSNBQYez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52365'),
  ('300652550581213551', 'Dream with the Fishes', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Finn Taylor, Barry Stone', 'Finn Taylor, Jeffrey D. Brown', 'David Arquette, Brad Hunt, Kathryn Erbe, Patrick McGaw, Cathy Moriarty, J.E. Freeman, Richmond Arquette, Katherine Copenhaver', 'R', 'Terry is a suicidal voyeur who treats a dying addict to a final binge, but Terry will only do this if he promises to kill him.', 'Terry is a suicidal voyeur who treats a dying addict to a final binge, but Terry will only do this if he promises to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEYVS0WSCC7ZtT9D1ZnpGA3RvDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47686'),
  ('1123464507138776984', 'Dream Work', 2001, 'Mystery', 'Peter Tscherkassky', null, null, null, 'A woman goes to bed, falls asleep, and begins to dream. This dream takes her to a landscape of light and shadow, evoked in a form only possible through classic cinematography. An homage to Man Ray, dedicated to the beginning of the European avant-garde film within the surrealist movement.', 'A woman goes to bed, falls asleep, and begins to dream. This dream takes her to a landscape of light and shadow, evoked in a form only possible through classic cinematography. An homage to Man Ray, dedicated to the beginning of the European avant-garde film within the surrealist movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49dCtaDNZTku1D2QaNOoYVSJ1HL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144156'),
  ('823764541847225639', 'Dream.net', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Gábor Forgács', 'Gábor Forgács', 'Lilla Labancz, Kinga Czifra, Ádám Csernóczki, Attila Jankóczky, István Széni, János Szücs, Arnold Tarsoly, Dorottya Farsang', null, 'Regina, the once popular girl has to make new friends at her new, conservative school. Problems arrive when she becomes enemies with Lívia, the school''s queen bee, and falls in love with Márk, a musician. If these wouldn''t be enough, she decides to organize a cheerleader team.', 'Regina, the once popular girl has to make new friends at her new, conservative school. Problems arrive when she becomes enemies with Lívia, the school''s queen bee, and falls in love with Márk, a musician. If these wouldn''t be enough, she decides to organize a cheerleader team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zp9jVNAgidshnvv7Zco2BEyW19R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60242'),
  ('287706079834833242', 'Dreamaniac', 1986, 'Horror', 'David DeCoteau, Howard Wexler', 'Helen Robinson', 'Thomas Bern, Ashlyn Gere, Sylvia Summers, Lauren Peterson, Bob Pelham, Cynthia Crass, Brad Laughlin, Linda Denise Martin', null, 'A heavy-metal musician makes a deal with a satanic succubus to make him successful with women, in return for the succubus being able to feed on the girls.', 'A heavy-metal musician makes a deal with a satanic succubus to make him successful with women, in return for the succubus being able to feed on the girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1vtoZ0Bdy02mnEf0pMomMHw7SH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85136'),
  ('217207600298740105', 'Dreamboat', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Claude Binyon, Milton Krasner, Lionel Newman', 'Claude Binyon', 'Clifton Webb, Ginger Rogers, Anne Francis, Jeffrey Hunter, Elsa Lanchester, Fred Clark, Paul Harvey, Ray Collins', 'NR', 'Thornton Sayre, a respected college professor - secretly formerly a silent films romantic action hero - is disturbed, feeling his privacy has been violated, and his professional credibility as a scholar jeopardized, when he learns his old movies have been resurrected and are being aired on TV. He sets out to demand this cease. However, his former co-star is the hostess of the TV show playing the films, and she has other plans.', 'Thornton Sayre, a respected college professor - secretly formerly a silent films romantic action hero - is disturbed, feeling his privacy has been violated, and his professional credibility as a scholar jeopardized, when he learns his old movies have been resurrected and are being aired on TV. He sets out to demand this cease. However, his former co-star is the hostess of the TV show playing the films, and she has other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyL6IXcePuDo7jCbb2Ts85tilUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94618'),
  ('165065527988288044', 'Dreambuilders', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Kim Hagen Jensen, Tonni Zinck', 'Søren Grinderslev Hansen, Kim Hagen Jensen', 'Emilie Kroyer Koppel, Caroline Vedel Larsen, Rasmus Botoft, Martin Buch, Ditte Hansen, Stig Hoffmeyer, Mia Lerdam, Alberte Winding', null, 'Minna, a young girl, misuses her newfound ability to create and control other people’s dreams to teach her bothersome stepsister a lesson. When her stepsister can no longer wake up, Minna has to enter the dream world to save her.', 'Minna, a young girl, misuses her newfound ability to create and control other people’s dreams to teach her bothersome stepsister a lesson. When her stepsister can no longer wake up, Minna has to enter the dream world to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcf3YSluCt9bulXegWqqcyWqlHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586742'),
  ('884243009575129755', 'Dreamcatcher', 2003, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lawrence Kasdan, John Seale, Marion Kolsby', 'William Goldman, Lawrence Kasdan', 'Thomas Jane, Damian Lewis, Morgan Freeman, Jason Lee, Timothy Olyphant, Tom Sizemore, Donnie Wahlberg, Michael O''Neill', 'R', 'Four childhood friends reunite for a hunting trip in the Maine woods, bound by a psychic force born from a childhood friend''s dreamcatcher. They find themselves caught in a grotesque alien invasion that twists memory, sanity and reality into something far more sinister.', 'Four childhood friends reunite for a hunting trip in the Maine woods, bound by a psychic force born from a childhood friend''s dreamcatcher. They find themselves caught in a grotesque alien invasion that twists memory, sanity and reality into something far more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLhvwLNU4pLgvaNREVFaQ4n3lCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6171'),
  ('299068947239039979', 'Dreamcatcher', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jacob Johnston', 'Jacob Johnston', 'Niki Koss, Zachary Gordon, Travis Burns, Blaine Kern III, Adrienne Wilkinson, Lou Ferrigno Jr., Ryan Powers, Al Calderon', null, 'The film centers on two estranged sisters who, along with their friends, become entrenched in a 48 hour whirlwind of violence after a traumatic experience at an underground music festival.', 'The film centers on two estranged sisters who, along with their friends, become entrenched in a 48 hour whirlwind of violence after a traumatic experience at an underground music festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CF743g2BpC8r3mCVV9gSX2yQBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793002'),
  ('547518037251904241', 'Dreamchild', 1985, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Gavin Millar, Billy Williams', 'Dennis Potter', 'Coral Browne, Ian Holm, Peter Gallagher, Caris Corfman, Nicola Cowper, Jane Asher, Amelia Shankley, Imogen Boorman', 'PG', '80-year-old Alice Hargreaves is about to visit Columbia University to attend a reception in honour of author Lewis Carroll. As a child, Alice''s close friendship with the writer was the creative catalyst for Carroll''s most beloved work. However, as Alice reflects on her experiences with the author, she slowly realises the complexity of their bond has had lasting, deeply felt ramifications.', '80-year-old Alice Hargreaves is about to visit Columbia University to attend a reception in honour of author Lewis Carroll. As a child, Alice''s close friendship with the writer was the creative catalyst for Carroll''s most beloved work. However, as Alice reflects on her experiences with the author, she slowly realises the complexity of their bond has had lasting, deeply felt ramifications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgmONyJ6Io0sPibW9SRiZFHVOO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42034'),
  ('536446951986732679', 'Dreamchild', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Raphaël Jacoulot', 'Raphaël Jacoulot', 'Jalil Lespert, Louise Bourgoin, Mélanie Doutey, Jean-Marie Winling, Nathan Willcocks, Rio Vega, Garance Clavel, Jean-Michel Fête', null, 'François and Noémie run a sawmill in the mountains not far from the Swiss border. François has taken over his family''s business, making him the fourth generation. He dreams of having a child. After years of failed fertility assistance, they give up on having a baby of their own and turn to adoption. But then François meets Patricia, new to the neighborhood. They begin a passionate affair. Soon after, Patricia gets pregnant.', 'François and Noémie run a sawmill in the mountains not far from the Swiss border. François has taken over his family''s business, making him the fourth generation. He dreams of having a child. After years of failed fertility assistance, they give up on having a baby of their own and turn to adoption. But then François meets Patricia, new to the neighborhood. They begin a passionate affair. Soon after, Patricia gets pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdLNmqIehGximKCHZre65hCcYxb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741110'),
  ('528319492442002415', 'Dreamer: Inspired By a True Story', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'John Gatins, Fred Murphy', 'John Gatins', 'Kurt Russell, Dakota Fanning, Kris Kristofferson, Elisabeth Shue, David Morse, Freddy Rodríguez, Luis Guzmán, Oded Fehr', 'PG', 'Ben Crane believes that a severely injured racehorse deserves another chance. He and his daughter Cale adopt the mare and save it from being sacrificed by the owner.', 'Ben Crane believes that a severely injured racehorse deserves another chance. He and his daughter Cale adopt the mare and save it from being sacrificed by the owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Z5FuLTrP5myJ2Dl9VzDRa6q0CG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12920'),
  ('225995055596142886', 'Dreamfools', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Marcello de Archangelis, Uriel de Nola, Fabio Simonelli', 'Francesco Miccichè, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Sergio Castellitto, Sabrina Ferilli, Valeria Fabrizi, Matilde Gioli, Antonio Catania, Antonella Attili, Gianfranco Gallo, Paolo Calabresi', null, 'Two lovers are stuck in stale relationships due to lean finances. But when one is duped into thinking he''s suddenly rich, he takes very drastic action.', 'Two lovers are stuck in stale relationships due to lean finances. But when one is duped into thinking he''s suddenly rich, he takes very drastic action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWmBU9b7CZGiZLOZqG2tf8aTYE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539926'),
  ('417145216582880617', 'Dreamgirls', 2006, 'Drama, Music', 'Bill Condon, Tobias A. Schliessler, Jann K. Engel', 'Bill Condon', 'Jamie Foxx, Beyoncé, Eddie Murphy, Danny Glover, Jennifer Hudson, Anika Noni Rose, Keith D. Robinson, Sharon Leal', 'PG-13', 'A trio of female soul singers cross over to the pop charts in the early 1960s, facing their own personal struggles along the way.', 'A trio of female soul singers cross over to the pop charts in the early 1960s, facing their own personal struggles along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sG5JyOj8Spe13QkNJMH8b5kzQUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125'),
  ('123625240611930057', 'Dreamgirls', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Anika Decker, Andreas Berger', 'Anika Decker', 'Hannah Herzsprung, Karoline Herfurth, Palina Rojinski, Iris Berben, Elyas M''Barek, Frederick Lau, Doron Amit, Friedrich von Thun', null, 'Parallel love stories of three young women in Berlin: Hannah - an unhappy attorney who sexually demeans herself in order to get at least some love and romance, Leni who runs a coffee shop and has just been ditched by her long term boyfriend, and Vivienne who ends up falling in love with a puppy-eyed pasta designer with 21 dogs.', 'Parallel love stories of three young women in Berlin: Hannah - an unhappy attorney who sexually demeans herself in order to get at least some love and romance, Leni who runs a coffee shop and has just been ditched by her long term boyfriend, and Vivienne who ends up falling in love with a puppy-eyed pasta designer with 21 dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jji0voa3xDORDgWXezKC5jdx3Q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315588'),
  ('416769593799732302', 'Dreamin'' Wild', 2023, 'Music, Drama', 'Bill Pohlad, Arnaud Potier, Marc Dahlstrom', 'Bill Pohlad', 'Casey Affleck, Walton Goggins, Zooey Deschanel, Beau Bridges, Chris Messina, Noah Jupe, Jack Dylan Grazer, Katy Cavanagh', 'PG', 'The true story of the Emerson family and the tumult that followed the success of their self-recorded pop-funk album of the same name, which went largely unnoticed until critics rediscovered and reappraised it decades later. Now, as an adult, Donnie is forced to confront the ghosts from the past and grapple with the emotional toll his dreams have taken on the family who supported him.', 'The true story of the Emerson family and the tumult that followed the success of their self-recorded pop-funk album of the same name, which went largely unnoticed until critics rediscovered and reappraised it decades later. Now, as an adult, Donnie is forced to confront the ghosts from the past and grapple with the emotional toll his dreams have taken on the family who supported him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58eMSDfgXAUO2wK1y26uN2zcNro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887321'),
  ('1038635441718016577', 'Dreaming the Reality', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Wong Chit, Ally Wong', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Lee Ho-Kwan', 'Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung, Yukari Ôshima, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Eddy Ko Hung, Lee Ho-Kwan, Anthony Cho Cheuk-Nin, Hsu Hsia', null, 'An expert assassin - trained since childhood to be the perfect killer - loses her memory during a mission in Thailand, and ends up in the care of a wry ex-policewoman and her boxing cohort. The equally lethal sister of the assassin pursues her, uncertain of her intentions and whether to kill her.', 'An expert assassin - trained since childhood to be the perfect killer - loses her memory during a mission in Thailand, and ends up in the care of a wry ex-policewoman and her boxing cohort. The equally lethal sister of the assassin pursues her, uncertain of her intentions and whether to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eracuaZ0Rbb8kPN0OyqHnpsPd3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172940'),
  ('785013136628582937', 'Dreamkatcher', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lina Lansky, Tonie Chisholm, Kerry Harris', 'Dan V. Shea', 'Radha Mitchell, Henry Thomas, Lin Shaye, Finlay Wojtak-Hissong, Jules Willcox, Joseph Bishara, Bella Marie Fucile, J. Christian Ingvordsen', 'R', 'Gail is forced to come to terms with Josh, her new stepson, at a remote country home. After stealing an evil talisman from a mysterious neighbor, Josh has sinister dreams of his dead mother, who commands Josh to murder Gail. When Josh''s dad returns, he and Gail suspect that their son has been possessed by an ancient, bloodthirsty spirit. Is it too late to save Josh''s life — or their own?', 'Gail is forced to come to terms with Josh, her new stepson, at a remote country home. After stealing an evil talisman from a mysterious neighbor, Josh has sinister dreams of his dead mother, who commands Josh to murder Gail. When Josh''s dad returns, he and Gail suspect that their son has been possessed by an ancient, bloodthirsty spirit. Is it too late to save Josh''s life — or their own?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wSaO6aY9vpwK7z67vq3HpGCrnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639247'),
  ('827003687319842489', 'Dreamland', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jason Matzner, Jonathan Sela', 'Tom Willett', 'Agnes Bruckner, Kelli Garner, Justin Long, John Corbett, Gina Gershon, Brian Klugman, Chris Mulkey, Luce Rains', 'PG-13', 'A young woman who lives in a desert trailer park must choose between caring for her hapless father and sick friend or fulfilling her own destiny.', 'A young woman who lives in a desert trailer park must choose between caring for her hapless father and sick friend or fulfilling her own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wp2t4oE6oqPbGC40dq7OMKTFRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8199'),
  ('684772886819363923', 'Dreamland', 2013, 'Drama', 'Petra Biondina Volpe, Judith Kaufmann', 'Petra Biondina Volpe', 'Luna Mijović, André Jung, Bettina Stucky, Marisa Paredes, Ursina Lardi, Devid Striesow, Stefan Kurt, Kire Gorevski', null, 'An affluent city is covered in snow, all seems perfect – on the surface. Divorcé Rolf is doing his best to rebuild his relationship with his daughter. Pregnant Lena appears to be living a faultless family life with her husband and son. Social worker Judith has a tough job and escapes it through her fantasies, whilst widowed Maria has finally built up the courage to invite her male acquaintance to a romantic dinner. In the course of one day, all of them will cross paths with the Bulgarian Mia, who works in the red-light trade and their seemingly perfect lives will never be the same…', 'An affluent city is covered in snow, all seems perfect – on the surface. Divorcé Rolf is doing his best to rebuild his relationship with his daughter. Pregnant Lena appears to be living a faultless family life with her husband and son. Social worker Judith has a tough job and escapes it through her fantasies, whilst widowed Maria has finally built up the courage to invite her male acquaintance to a romantic dinner. In the course of one day, all of them will cross paths with the Bulgarian Mia, who works in the red-light trade and their seemingly perfect lives will never be the same…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTyCj7b61UNQ0fd8bPb3hu4cjmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224237'),
  ('630943529019135183', 'Dreamland', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Miles Joris-Peyrafitte, Hailey Oltman, Aaron Moskal', 'Nicolaas Zwart', 'Finn Cole, Margot Robbie, Travis Fimmel, Kerry Condon, Darby Camp, Lola Kirke, Pab Schwendimann, Grayson Berry', 'R', 'Amid the dust storms and economic depression of Dust Bowl Era Oklahoma, Eugene Evans finds his family farm on the brink of foreclosure. Discovering fugitive bank robber Allison Wells hiding in his small town, he is torn between claiming the bounty on her head and his growing attraction to the seductive criminal.', 'Amid the dust storms and economic depression of Dust Bowl Era Oklahoma, Eugene Evans finds his family farm on the brink of foreclosure. Discovering fugitive bank robber Allison Wells hiding in his small town, he is torn between claiming the bounty on her head and his growing attraction to the seductive criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8ax79K6TZEnMqSS5ePrNCnrK8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480434'),
  ('603065333924213073', 'Dreams', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Hilding Bladh', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Eva Dahlbeck, Harriet Andersson, Gunnar Björnstrand, Ulf Palme, Inga Landgré, Benkt-Åke Benktsson, Sven Lindberg, Kerstin Hedeby', null, 'Two women—a fashion executive and her young model—experience parallel romantic disappointments during a trip to Gothenburg, exposing generational differences in desire, illusion, and emotional endurance. A transitional work in Ingmar Bergman’s mid-1950s cinema.', 'Two women—a fashion executive and her young model—experience parallel romantic disappointments during a trip to Gothenburg, exposing generational differences in desire, illusion, and emotional endurance. A transitional work in Ingmar Bergman’s mid-1950s cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whdg2Oxdp8mJdiO7sIUQtwtMlnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97211'),
  ('829352226287643841', 'Dreams', 1993, 'Fantasy, History, Drama', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Karen Shakhnazarov, Anatoliy Dzhirkvelov', 'Karen Shakhnazarov, Aleksandr Borodyanskiy', 'Amaliya Mordvinova, Oleg Basilashvili, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Pyotr Merkuryev, Valeriy Nosik, Aleksei Zharkov, Svetlana Andropova, Gosha Kutsenko', null, 'Russian countess in 1893 has strange dreams about herself living a life as a dishwasher in 1993'' Moscow after dissolution of the USSR.', 'Russian countess in 1893 has strange dreams about herself living a life as a dishwasher in 1993'' Moscow after dissolution of the USSR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knoLDpBJ5RF6dw769SPl4TzqzHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222468'),
  ('481989417469073477', 'Dreams', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Dag Johan Haugerud, Cecilie Semec, Paul Tunge', 'Dag Johan Haugerud', 'Ella Øverbye, Selome Emnetu, Anne Marit Jacobsen, Ane Dahl Torp, Andrine Sæther, Silje Breivik, Lars Jacob Holm, Valdemar Dørmænen Irgens', 'NR', 'Johanne falls in love with her teacher and records her fantasies and feelings in writing. Together with her mother and grandmother, they debate the literary potential and whether to publish it.', 'Johanne falls in love with her teacher and records her fantasies and feelings in writing. Together with her mother and grandmother, they debate the literary potential and whether to publish it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctBhKsd2AGlubApDf7VogbFKRlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1228682'),
  ('63699663652038110', 'Dreams', 2025, 'Romance, Thriller, Drama', 'Michel Franco, Yves Cape, Jeremiah Kelleher', 'Michel Franco', 'Jessica Chastain, Isaac Hernández, Rupert Friend, Marshall Bell, Eligio Meléndez, Mercedes Hernández, Tatiana Ronderos, Bobby August Jr.', 'NR', 'A powerful socialite and a promising ballet dancer begin a dangerous affair. When he secretly crosses the US-Mexico border, she takes desperate measures to protect their future together.', 'A powerful socialite and a promising ballet dancer begin a dangerous affair. When he secretly crosses the US-Mexico border, she takes desperate measures to protect their future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHglxM0wjfuc5hmVrz7sVykBLrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1134463'),
  ('708468350151976320', 'Dreams Come True', 1984, 'Romance, Fantasy, Horror', 'John Drake, Max Kalmanowicz', 'Steve Kinjerski', 'Michael Sanville, Stephanie Shuford, Ken Charlton, Steve Charlton, Bert Kinyon, Richard France', null, 'Boy discovers how to dream travel. Only in this senerio he appears in real life at the location of his dreams while his "other" body lies in bed. He then teaches his girlfriend how to dream travel and together they share the adventures of their dreams.', 'Boy discovers how to dream travel. Only in this senerio he appears in real life at the location of his dreams while his "other" body lies in bed. He then teaches his girlfriend how to dream travel and together they share the adventures of their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9n5sV4pRjMaSaUItWZROtlKFLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232194'),
  ('49550961863773716', 'Dreams for Sale', 2012, 'Drama, Crime', 'Miwa Nishikawa, Katsumi Yanagijima, Shinji Kuma', 'Miwa Nishikawa', 'Takako Matsu, Sadao Abe, Rena Tanaka, Sawa Suzuki, Tamae Ando, Yūsuke Iseya, Yuka Ebara, Tae Kimura', null, 'After losing their restaurant in a fire, a husband and wife come up with a strange plan to rebuild their shattered finances: marrying the husband off to a series of lonely women and defrauding them.', 'After losing their restaurant in a fire, a husband and wife come up with a strange plan to rebuild their shattered finances: marrying the husband off to a series of lonely women and defrauding them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2lCZuNesOTEdcXp6vGKJ5O1wrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121796'),
  ('526289489273893588', 'Dreams from Strangers', 2015, 'Romance', 'Roberto Cuzzillo', 'Roberto Cuzzillo', 'Giuseppe Claudio Insalaco, Daniel De Rossi, Walter Lo Piccolo, Enrico Nasi', null, 'New anti-gay laws have just been approved in Russia. After a competition in St. Petersburg, Italian swimmer Massimo meets a Russian of his own age, Vladimir, working as an interpreter for the delegation of which Massimo is a member. The two men fall in love, but they will have to face the cultural barriers between them, as well as old and new macho stereotypes.', 'New anti-gay laws have just been approved in Russia. After a competition in St. Petersburg, Italian swimmer Massimo meets a Russian of his own age, Vladimir, working as an interpreter for the delegation of which Massimo is a member. The two men fall in love, but they will have to face the cultural barriers between them, as well as old and new macho stereotypes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1R8cDPP4r8WalDw9NCLbI3LMGdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378317'),
  ('921766050649382931', 'Dreams in the Witch House', 2005, 'Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Stuart Gordon', null, 'Ezra Godden, Campbell Lane, Jay Brazeau, Chelah Horsdal, David Racz, Nicholas Racz, Yevgen Voronin, Susanna Uchatius', null, 'A college student renting an old room in a boarding house discovers a plot by sinister, otherworldly forces to sacrifice his neighbor''s infant.', 'A college student renting an old room in a boarding house discovers a plot by sinister, otherworldly forces to sacrifice his neighbor''s infant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ymDDhDNGHXdU7bnXbMaFvVn5gG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319326'),
  ('858428194865263232', 'Dreams of a Life', 2011, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Carol Morley, Lynda Hall, Mary Farbrother', 'Carol Morley', 'Zawe Ashton, Alix Luka-Cain, Cornell John, Neelam Bakshi, Frances Cooper, Kelly Agbowu, Sophia Leonie, Nadia Di Mambro', null, 'A filmmaker sets out to discover the life of Joyce Vincent, who died in her bedsit in North London in 2003. Her body wasn''t discovered for three years, and newspaper reports offered few details of her life - not even a photograph.', 'A filmmaker sets out to discover the life of Joyce Vincent, who died in her bedsit in North London in 2003. Her body wasn''t discovered for three years, and newspaper reports offered few details of her life - not even a photograph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5vQtRWFjpBLRPXgpGzoggCMEjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83540'),
  ('629024706298572682', 'Dreams of Getting Rich', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zhao Xiaoding, Song Xiaobao', 'Sharon Wu, Rui Hao, Jiang Jiachen', 'Song Xiaobao, Ma Li, Sha Yi, Zhang Yishan, Xiao Yang, Allen, Wong Cho-Lam, Wei Xiang', null, 'The plot spans nearly 30 years and tells the story of a poor boy from the northeast, "Xiao Bao", who follows his village''s hairdresser, "Er Ge" (Sha Yi), to Shenzhen, a special zone. The two are forced to take care of the baby, and then they meet up with a cold-hearted young woman named Ma Lu (Ma Li).', 'The plot spans nearly 30 years and tells the story of a poor boy from the northeast, "Xiao Bao", who follows his village''s hairdresser, "Er Ge" (Sha Yi), to Shenzhen, a special zone. The two are forced to take care of the baby, and then they meet up with a cold-hearted young woman named Ma Lu (Ma Li).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUCftqXbWDE0CCXX5d4u0ADryTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796120'),
  ('94315549664888684', 'Dreams of Hind and Camilia', 1988, 'Drama', 'Mohamed Khan, Saeed Hamed, Fathy Youssry', 'Mohamed Khan, Mostafa Gomaa', 'Naglaa Fathy, Aaidah Riyadh, Ahmed Zaki, Hassan El-Adl, Othman Abdel Monem, Zeinab Abdo, Khairy Beshara, Mohga Abdel Rahman', null, 'Hend is a young widow who works as a maid, she meets Eid the conman who goes to prison and leaves her pregnant. While Camellia is a divorced maid who supports her unemployed brother and his family in exchange for letting her sleep over in his apartment.', 'Hend is a young widow who works as a maid, she meets Eid the conman who goes to prison and leaves her pregnant. While Camellia is a divorced maid who supports her unemployed brother and his family in exchange for letting her sleep over in his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmhddaUW0UKcjwcIM9TqnDxYHyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193415'),
  ('1016719986927607215', 'Dreams of the Rarebit Fiend: Bug Vaudeville', 1921, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay', null, null, 'After eating a cheesecake given to him by a kind-hearted lady, a hobo goes to sleep and has a bizarre dream in which insects are putting on a vaudeville show for him, with a grasshopper juggling an ant, a dancing daddy long-legs, etc.', 'After eating a cheesecake given to him by a kind-hearted lady, a hobo goes to sleep and has a bizarre dream in which insects are putting on a vaudeville show for him, with a grasshopper juggling an ant, a dancing daddy long-legs, etc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pnhqdsXWOJR9J0pZcBylRdeeZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175411'),
  ('80906862791838621', 'Dreams of the Rarebit Fiend: The Flying House', 1921, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay', null, null, 'After eating a rarebit at a party, a woman has a strange dream in which her husband converts their home into a flying machine to escape having to pay the exorbitant interest on the mortgage, on a flight that takes them around the world and to the moon.', 'After eating a rarebit at a party, a woman has a strange dream in which her husband converts their home into a flying machine to escape having to pay the exorbitant interest on the mortgage, on a flight that takes them around the world and to the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/446vRheWYQCAtOMjv1kgso0KYTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175403'),
  ('628718126962602830', 'Dreams of the Rarebit Fiend: The Pet', 1921, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay', null, null, 'After eating a rarebit, a man falls asleep and dreams his wife adopts a mysterious animal with an insatiable appetite. The pet eats its milk, the house cat, the house''s furnishings, rat poison, and passing vehicles, including airplanes and a blimp, while growing larger and larger. This cartoon is part of a Dream trilogy animated by Winsor McCay in 1921. (CBGP)', 'After eating a rarebit, a man falls asleep and dreams his wife adopts a mysterious animal with an insatiable appetite. The pet eats its milk, the house cat, the house''s furnishings, rat poison, and passing vehicles, including airplanes and a blimp, while growing larger and larger. This cartoon is part of a Dream trilogy animated by Winsor McCay in 1921. (CBGP)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7neh61SZUJfDb1b488vRFoFLZwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175362'),
  ('489107949945781879', 'Dreams That Money Can Buy', 1947, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Hans Richter, Miriam Raeburn, Louis Applebaum', null, 'Jack Bittner, Dorothy Griffith, Libby Holman, Josh White, Stanley Kubrick, Max Ernst, Norma Cazanjian, Doris Okerson', null, 'An attempt to bring the work of surrealist artists to a wider public. The plot is that of an average Joe who can conjure up dreams that will improve his customer''s lives. This frame story serves as a link between several avant-garde sequences created by leading visual artists of their day, most of whom were emigres to the US during WWII.', 'An attempt to bring the work of surrealist artists to a wider public. The plot is that of an average Joe who can conjure up dreams that will improve his customer''s lives. This frame story serves as a link between several avant-garde sequences created by leading visual artists of their day, most of whom were emigres to the US during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gujtXApdB2bNT3mu3xMJR6A90U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32327'),
  ('151917251721470492', 'Dreamscape', 1984, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Joseph Ruben, Brian Tufano, Michael Daves', 'Chuck Russell, Joseph Ruben, David Loughery', 'Dennis Quaid, Max von Sydow, Christopher Plummer, Eddie Albert, Kate Capshaw, David Patrick Kelly, George Wendt, Larry Gelman', 'PG-13', 'In order to diagnose the psychic traumas suffered by his patients, Dr. Paul Novotny gets young Alex Gardner to enter their dreams.', 'In order to diagnose the psychic traumas suffered by his patients, Dr. Paul Novotny gets young Alex Gardner to enter their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRLhwWhXS9asnE4c1mt84t1iEER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24099'),
  ('251814060367641841', 'Dreamwood', 1972, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'James Broughton', 'James Broughton', 'Henry Taylor, Margo St. James, Diane Nelson, Roger Somers, Monica Taylor, Claxton Taylor', null, 'The oneiric quest of a modern argonaut on a mysterious island located somewhere on the borders of the unconscious.', 'The oneiric quest of a modern argonaut on a mysterious island located somewhere on the borders of the unconscious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygXxqJmqvsmdwKLPXghPWPsj2rz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293753'),
  ('459404155749303376', 'Dredd', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Anthony Dod Mantle, Mark Walker, Alan Munro', 'Alex Garland', 'Karl Urban, Olivia Thirlby, Lena Headey, Wood Harris, Langley Kirkwood, Tamer Burjaq, Joe Vaz, Rakie Ayola', 'R', 'In the future, America is a dystopian wasteland. The latest scourge is Ma-Ma, a prostitute-turned-drug pusher with a dangerous new drug and aims to take over the city. The only possibility of stopping her is an elite group of urban police called Judges, who combine the duties of judge, jury and executioner to deliver a brutal brand of swift justice. But even the top-ranking Judge, Dredd, discovers that taking down Ma-Ma isn’t as easy as it seems in this explosive adaptation of the hugely popular comic series.', 'In the future, America is a dystopian wasteland. The latest scourge is Ma-Ma, a prostitute-turned-drug pusher with a dangerous new drug and aims to take over the city. The only possibility of stopping her is an elite group of urban police called Judges, who combine the duties of judge, jury and executioner to deliver a brutal brand of swift justice. But even the top-ranking Judge, Dredd, discovers that taking down Ma-Ma isn’t as easy as it seems in this explosive adaptation of the hugely popular comic series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLx65gtGVnUFCxceHWGszcruCZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49049'),
  ('823435133595568583', 'Drei Mann in einem Boot', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Helmut Weiss, Sepp Ketterer', 'Wolf Neumeister', 'Walter Giller, Heinz Erhardt, Hans-Joachim Kulenkampff, Susanne Cramer, Loni Heuser, Bum Krüger, Willy Reichert, Rolf Wanka', null, 'Three men want to escape their troubles with women by taking a boat tour on the Rhine river.', 'Three men want to escape their troubles with women by taking a boat tour on the Rhine river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qChtlvC6yjiVplQQnE3XZXPMtt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12631'),
  ('1053227944294701677', 'Dreileben: Beats Being Dead', 2011, 'Drama', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm', 'Christian Petzold, Christoph Hochhäusler', 'Jacob Matschenz, Luna Mijović, Vijessna Ferkic, Rainer Bock, Konstantin Frolov, Florian Bartholomäi, Stefan Kurt, Kirsten Block', null, 'Johannes is a loner who wants a better job. And then he meets Ana. Ana is attractive and even though her job is even less prestigious than Johannes''s, he falls for her. And then she quits her job to be with him (and be dependent on him) and suddenly things become much more serious. She has fallen for him. But does he still love her? Did he ever? Enter Sarah. Sarah is the daughter of Johannes''s boss. He and she have a past. Will Sarah and what she represents be his future, and Ana just a memory, something he''d like to erase?', 'Johannes is a loner who wants a better job. And then he meets Ana. Ana is attractive and even though her job is even less prestigious than Johannes''s, he falls for her. And then she quits her job to be with him (and be dependent on him) and suddenly things become much more serious. She has fallen for him. But does he still love her? Did he ever? Enter Sarah. Sarah is the daughter of Johannes''s boss. He and she have a past. Will Sarah and what she represents be his future, and Ana just a memory, something he''d like to erase?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYMeFNGnY9LhK95n9ldDLy097P5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94336'),
  ('39993382761167323', 'Dreileben: Don’t Follow Me Around', 2011, 'Drama', 'Dominik Graf, Michael Wiesweg', 'Markus Busch, Dominik Graf', 'Jeanette Hain, Mišel Matičević, Malou Hain, Lisa Kreuzer, Rüdiger Vogler, Stefan Kurt, Jacob Matschenz, Anja Schiffel', null, 'The police psychologist Jo is supposed to help catch the sex offender Molesch. Since the hotel is fully booked, she stays with her old college friend Vera and her husband Bruno. It turns out that Vera and Jo used to be in love with the same man. The two women''s musings are interrupted when Molesch suddenly appears in the garden.', 'The police psychologist Jo is supposed to help catch the sex offender Molesch. Since the hotel is fully booked, she stays with her old college friend Vera and her husband Bruno. It turns out that Vera and Jo used to be in love with the same man. The two women''s musings are interrupted when Molesch suddenly appears in the garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH09ZYKvZixGo0UTTssBDRPrzsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81255'),
  ('573315567870774602', 'Dreileben: One Minute of Darkness', 2011, 'Drama', 'Christoph Hochhäusler, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Christoph Hochhäusler, Peer Klehmet', 'Stefan Kurt, Eberhard Kirchberg, Imogen Kogge, Timo Jacobs, Ioan Gyuri Pascu, Holger Doellmann, Paraschiva Dragus, Jacob Matschenz', null, 'An ailing police inspector (Stefan Kurt) hunts a dangerous criminal who escaped from custody.', 'An ailing police inspector (Stefan Kurt) hunts a dangerous criminal who escaped from custody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGFGHjT3Vq1OKd2qAHUPRPWPTLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94334'),
  ('935732252866852716', 'Drenched in Blood', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Aly Muritiba, Inti Briones', 'Aly Muritiba, Jessica Sato', 'Charlie Pergentini, Daniel Galera, Ana Paula Cardoso, Gabriel Leone, Thainá Duarte', null, 'A man decides to end his own life and asks one of his children to take care of his dog after his death. In this dramatic conversation, the father reveals to his son the mysterious disappearance of his grandfather in a small fishing town. Then begins the saga of the guy and his dog in search of answers that involve his life and that of his family. A film that involves mystery and action in a passionate setting of the southern coast of Brazil.', 'A man decides to end his own life and asks one of his children to take care of his dog after his death. In this dramatic conversation, the father reveals to his son the mysterious disappearance of his grandfather in a small fishing town. Then begins the saga of the guy and his dog in search of answers that involve his life and that of his family. A film that involves mystery and action in a passionate setting of the southern coast of Brazil.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7bfhnpThjeVVMfMJdxAvC2Vtm2m.jpg', 'plex:movie:drenched-in-blood'),
  ('684498935451695522', 'Dresden Dynamo', 1971, 'Animation', 'Lis Rhodes', null, null, null, '‘At the work''s core is an experimental approach to the stuff of film and a fiercely political outlook. Dresden Dynamo is an abstract assault on the senses. Eschewing a camera, Rhodes affixed patterned Letratone stickers to the film itself and used filters to create red and blue colours. Stripes, dots and wavy lines surge across the screen, and their forms dictate the accompanying barrage of white noise and atonal bleeps.’ --Ben Luke London Evening Standard 26 January 2012', '‘At the work''s core is an experimental approach to the stuff of film and a fiercely political outlook. Dresden Dynamo is an abstract assault on the senses. Eschewing a camera, Rhodes affixed patterned Letratone stickers to the film itself and used filters to create red and blue colours. Stripes, dots and wavy lines surge across the screen, and their forms dictate the accompanying barrage of white noise and atonal bleeps.’ --Ben Luke London Evening Standard 26 January 2012', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45vq3rEpRRlTNA2Zn02NvsATjzZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357341'),
  ('378614944625115711', 'Dresden, August-Brücke', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière, Auguste Lumière', null, null, null, 'A short film from the Lumière brothers, filmed in a Dresden street.', 'A short film from the Lumière brothers, filmed in a Dresden street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAuXqBZxar6rzf8cJAWGrORESzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193625'),
  ('189336667768139347', 'Dress to Wed', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Gerson Sanginitto, Carina Sanginitto, Paulo Aragão', 'Audemir Leuzinger', 'Leandro Hassum, Fernanda Rodrigues, André Mattos, Marcos Veras, Renata Dominguez, Tonico Pereira, Catarina Abdala, Érico Brás', null, 'When Fernando accidentally rips the designer dress of a reality show star, he races to replace it, putting his own wedding at risk.', 'When Fernando accidentally rips the designer dress of a reality show star, he races to replace it, putting his own wedding at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drLwYgHobi90mI1IqmXNPHIHXqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270525'),
  ('736261303767496629', 'Dressage', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre B. Reinhard', 'Jean-Claude Roy, Jean-Philippe Berger', 'Véronique Catanzaro, Patrick Guillemin, Marc Henry, Henri-Jacques Huet, André Nader, Sylvie Novak, Katya Strambi, Cornélia Wilms', null, 'At a gathering of would-be society debauchees, the Baron Plessis de Regard and the attractive young Nathalie hatch their individual plans to use sex to respectively ruin and punish their selected enemies. The Baron''s plan is to scupper the political ambitions of right-wing parliamentary candidate Colonel Montvilliers by setting him up with a female companion and publicly exposing his new-found vices. Nathalie''s quest is of a more personal nature, to destroy her estranged father Charles Leroy-Merville by corrupting his innocent 17-year-old daughter Sophie, a task she intends to achieve by securing employ as the girl''s summer tutor.', 'At a gathering of would-be society debauchees, the Baron Plessis de Regard and the attractive young Nathalie hatch their individual plans to use sex to respectively ruin and punish their selected enemies. The Baron''s plan is to scupper the political ambitions of right-wing parliamentary candidate Colonel Montvilliers by setting him up with a female companion and publicly exposing his new-found vices. Nathalie''s quest is of a more personal nature, to destroy her estranged father Charles Leroy-Merville by corrupting his innocent 17-year-old daughter Sophie, a task she intends to achieve by securing employ as the girl''s summer tutor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3IWumAPrEWNROUWZsrznubVCov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101875'),
  ('95553599618337155', 'Dressed in Blue', 1983, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Antonio Giménez-Rico, Alfredo Mayo', 'Antonio Giménez-Rico', 'Loren Arana Arellano, Reneé Amor Fernández, Nacha María Sánchez Sánchez, Eva Pérez de los Cobos Ávila, Josette Ruiz-Orejón Casado, Tamara Muñoz Santiago, Javier Burgos', null, 'A documentary about the lives of six transgender women in post-Franco Spain.', 'A documentary about the lives of six transgender women in post-Franco Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzi122kG6xYCXHhggACrsxuxusg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259235'),
  ('151762440921907794', 'Dressed to Kill', 1941, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Eugene Forde', 'Manning O''Connor, Stanley Rauh', 'Lloyd Nolan, Mary Beth Hughes, Sheila Ryan, William Demarest, Ben Carter, Virginia Brissac, Erwin Kalser, Henry Daniell', null, 'A detective''s wedding is postponed when gunshots are heard nearby.', 'A detective''s wedding is postponed when gunshots are heard nearby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvI632ALoH7ukWLNzy9fEyJAva8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42298'),
  ('620421858036944680', 'Dressed to Kill', 1946, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Roy William Neill, Maury Gertsman, Milton Rosen', 'Leonard Lee', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Patricia Morison, Frederick Worlock, Harry Cording, Carl Harbord, Holmes Herbert, Edmund Breon', 'NR', 'A convicted thief in Dartmoor prison hides the location of the stolen Bank of England printing plates inside three music boxes. When the innocent purchasers of the boxes start to be murdered, Holmes and Watson investigate.', 'A convicted thief in Dartmoor prison hides the location of the stolen Bank of England printing plates inside three music boxes. When the innocent purchasers of the boxes start to be murdered, Holmes and Watson investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD4z3ON2ciLMv6obEH2K8tGThWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20417'),
  ('66671841019906863', 'Dressed to Kill', 1980, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Brian De Palma, Ralf D. Bode, William Eustace', 'Brian De Palma', 'Michael Caine, Nancy Allen, Angie Dickinson, Keith Gordon, Dennis Franz, David Margulies, Ken Baker, Susanna Clemm', 'R', 'After witnessing a mysterious woman brutally slay a homemaker, prostitute Liz Blake finds herself trapped in a dangerous situation. While the police thinks she is the murderer, the real killer is intent on silencing her only witness.', 'After witnessing a mysterious woman brutally slay a homemaker, prostitute Liz Blake finds herself trapped in a dangerous situation. While the police thinks she is the murderer, the real killer is intent on silencing her only witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oy1m5dd44foNrxV8U9l6Walx82V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11033'),
  ('620263571297169702', 'Dreyfus Court Martial - Arrest Of Dreyfus', 1899, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Du Paty de Clam requests Captain Dreyfus to write as he dictates for the purpose of ascertaining whether his handwriting conforms to that of the Bordereau. He notices the nervousness of Dreyfus, and accuses him of being the author of the Bordereau. Paty de Clam offers Dreyfus a revolver, with advice to commit suicide. The revolver is scornfully rejected, Dreyfus stating that he had no need for such cowardly methods, proclaiming his innocence. His arrest is immediately ordered by M. Cochefort.', 'Du Paty de Clam requests Captain Dreyfus to write as he dictates for the purpose of ascertaining whether his handwriting conforms to that of the Bordereau. He notices the nervousness of Dreyfus, and accuses him of being the author of the Bordereau. Paty de Clam offers Dreyfus a revolver, with advice to commit suicide. The revolver is scornfully rejected, Dreyfus stating that he had no need for such cowardly methods, proclaiming his innocence. His arrest is immediately ordered by M. Cochefort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ18wTvu2OXTqTDxwHXclFIyAuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105327'),
  ('775227052595108100', 'Dreyfus Meets His Wife at Rennes', 1899, 'Drama', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Showing room at the military prison at Rennes in which Dreyfus the accused is confined. He is visited by his counsel, Maître Labori and Demange, with whom he is seen in animated conversation. A visit from his wife is announced, who enters. The meeting of the husband and wife is most pathetic and emotional.', 'Showing room at the military prison at Rennes in which Dreyfus the accused is confined. He is visited by his counsel, Maître Labori and Demange, with whom he is seen in animated conversation. A visit from his wife is announced, who enters. The meeting of the husband and wife is most pathetic and emotional.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68pYBriySVModkDKDlJhaqspf3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105332'),
  ('521854565649866450', 'Dreyfus Put in Irons', 1899, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Showing the interior view of the hut in which Dreyfus is confined. The scene takes place at night, showing the moon through the window of the cell. Two guards stealthily approach the cot upon which Dreyfus is sleeping. They awake him and read to him the order from the French minister–M. Lebon–to put him into irons, which they proceed at once to accomplish. Dreyfus vigorously protests against this treatment, which protests, however, fall on deaf ears. The chief sergeant and guards before leaving the hut, inspect the four corners of same by means of a lantern.', 'Showing the interior view of the hut in which Dreyfus is confined. The scene takes place at night, showing the moon through the window of the cell. Two guards stealthily approach the cot upon which Dreyfus is sleeping. They awake him and read to him the order from the French minister–M. Lebon–to put him into irons, which they proceed at once to accomplish. Dreyfus vigorously protests against this treatment, which protests, however, fall on deaf ears. The chief sergeant and guards before leaving the hut, inspect the four corners of same by means of a lantern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42dU5hTPv2EerKsZYtYXp1EU5he.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105329'),
  ('47253732947714965', 'Dries', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Reiner Holzemer, Reiner Holzemer', 'Reiner Holzemer', 'Dries Van Noten, Iris Apfel, Pamela Golbin, Geert Brulot', null, 'For the first time fashion designer Dries Van Noten allows a filmmaker to accompany him in his creative process and rich home life. For an entire year Reiner Holzemer documents the precise steps that Dries takes to conceive of four collections, the rich fabrics, embroidery and prints exclusive to his designs. As well as the emblematic fashion shows that bring his collections to the world and have become cult “must sees” at Paris Fashion Week. This film offers an insight into the life, mind and creative heart of a master fashion designer who, for more than 25 years, has remained independent in a landscape of fashion consolidation and globalization.', 'For the first time fashion designer Dries Van Noten allows a filmmaker to accompany him in his creative process and rich home life. For an entire year Reiner Holzemer documents the precise steps that Dries takes to conceive of four collections, the rich fabrics, embroidery and prints exclusive to his designs. As well as the emblematic fashion shows that bring his collections to the world and have become cult “must sees” at Paris Fashion Week. This film offers an insight into the life, mind and creative heart of a master fashion designer who, for more than 25 years, has remained independent in a landscape of fashion consolidation and globalization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vACmIYy2MICN5fTeX2OZkuGaVeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450941'),
  ('996977464498589610', 'Drift', 2013, 'Drama', 'Geoffrey Hall, Morgan O''Neill, Ben Nott', 'Morgan O''Neill', 'Sam Worthington, Myles Pollard, Xavier Samuel, Lesley-Ann Brandt, Sean Keenan, Robyn Malcolm, Aaron Glenane, John Fairhead', 'R', 'In the 70s two brothers battle killer waves, conservative society and ruthless bikers to kick-start the modern surf industry.', 'In the 70s two brothers battle killer waves, conservative society and ruthless bikers to kick-start the modern surf industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAQsxWn82CXsFxrItzzSfYJdSd3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137968'),
  ('95533819110095356', 'Drift', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anthony Chen, Dominique Delany, Crystel Fournier', 'Susanne Farrell, Alexander Maksik', 'Cynthia Erivo, Alia Shawkat, Ibrahima Ba, Honor Swinton Byrne, Zainab Jah, Suzy Bemba, Vincent Vermignon, Abigail Boyd', 'NR', 'After fleeing civil war in Liberia, a formerly-privileged refugee is barely scraping by in her new life in Greece when she strikes up an unexpected friendship with a rootless tour guide.', 'After fleeing civil war in Liberia, a formerly-privileged refugee is barely scraping by in her new life in Greece when she strikes up an unexpected friendship with a rootless tour guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OMssa91kM2GUNrDUfcqDqxajnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977966'),
  ('216843850712719134', 'Drift Away', 2021, 'Drama', 'Xavier Beauvois, Julien Hirsch, Nina Boussad', 'Xavier Beauvois, Frédérique Moreau, Marie-Julie Maille', 'Jérémie Renier, Marie-Julie Maille, Iris Bry, Victor Belmondo, Olivier Pequery, Madeleine Beauvois, Geoffroy Sery, Suzanne Lipinska', null, 'Laurent, a young brigade commander in a gendarmerie in a small town in Normandy is planning his wedding with Marie, his partner and mother of his daughter. He loves his job despite facing social misery on a daily basis. One day, a farmer who might try to kill himself runs away.', 'Laurent, a young brigade commander in a gendarmerie in a small town in Normandy is planning his wedding with Marie, his partner and mother of his daughter. He loves his job despite facing social misery on a daily basis. One day, a farmer who might try to kill himself runs away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfRksbnMcBEgILGP9ST998nwwkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661591'),
  ('190070166166807059', 'Drift GTR', 2008, 'Action, Romance, Drama', 'Takaaki Hashiguchi, Naoto Ishioka', 'Yuji Takagi', 'Taiyo Sugiura, Atsumi Kanno, Kazuya Kimura, Mizuho Hata', null, 'A young street racer Renn has just defented a red 180SX on the mountain pass. A moment later, he found that the tires of his GTR were stolen by a famous tire stealing gang! Renn challenged the daughter of the gang’s boss. However, the daughter asked him to do a favor after she lost the race!!… With the turned up GTR, 180 SX and others race cars, this is exciting car battle action for all car lovers.', 'A young street racer Renn has just defented a red 180SX on the mountain pass. A moment later, he found that the tires of his GTR were stolen by a famous tire stealing gang! Renn challenged the daughter of the gang’s boss. However, the daughter asked him to do a favor after she lost the race!!… With the turned up GTR, 180 SX and others race cars, this is exciting car battle action for all car lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xO0p0odWr18opWNeE72UZb7owL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56029'),
  ('124864134749939270', 'Drifter', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hannes Hirsch, Eli Börnicke', 'Hannes Hirsch', 'Lorenz Hochhuth, Cino Djavid, Gustav Schmidt, Oscar Hoppe, Aviran Edri, Cat Jugravu, Alexandre Karim Howard, Rabea Egg', null, 'Moritz follows a boyfriend to Berlin and is soon abandoned by him. Alone in the big city, he embarks on a journey through a wide range of queer experience. Only through a new circle of queer friends does he develop his own ideas of sexuality and masculinity, leading him to a clearer self-identity.', 'Moritz follows a boyfriend to Berlin and is soon abandoned by him. Alone in the big city, he embarks on a journey through a wide range of queer experience. Only through a new circle of queer friends does he develop his own ideas of sexuality and masculinity, leading him to a clearer self-identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BYYRIeaCxPIYuBIhSz9Zc5H1u8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025802'),
  ('735665245283584157', 'Drifters', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Basil Emmott, John Grierson', null, null, null, 'A silent film by John Grierson. It tells the story of Britain''s North Sea herring fishery.', 'A silent film by John Grierson. It tells the story of Britain''s North Sea herring fishery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjElGoDSItuGuYcRKTyMfu4v5u6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174892'),
  ('112019760537477972', 'Drifters', 2003, 'Drama', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Juyong Liu, Jianlun Zheng, Yioun Huang, Don Fernando, Peizhu Jin, Tang Yang, Shu Yang, Duan Yihong', null, 'The young adult life of Hong Yunsheng, nicknamed Little Brother, is seen as somewhat of a failure by those that know him. A Chinese national, he stowed away on a boat to the United States, where he worked as a dishwasher in the restaurant of a family from his hometown back in Fujian province. After two years in the States and after fathering an illegitimate child there named Fusheng, the child''s mother Xuhui who is the restaurateur''s daughter, he was deported back to China. Since, he has been floundering in life, which has caused a rift between himself and his older brother, who, with his wife, operate a street front diner and can''t have children of their own. Little Brother relies on his new girlfriend, a woman he barely knows named Wu Ruifang who is a performer in a touring opera troupe, for emotional support. Despite Little Brother being the local poster boy for not stowing away, his friend named Monkey tried to do the same, but died on the voyage over due to exposure to toxic ..', 'The young adult life of Hong Yunsheng, nicknamed Little Brother, is seen as somewhat of a failure by those that know him. A Chinese national, he stowed away on a boat to the United States, where he worked as a dishwasher in the restaurant of a family from his hometown back in Fujian province. After two years in the States and after fathering an illegitimate child there named Fusheng, the child''s mother Xuhui who is the restaurateur''s daughter, he was deported back to China. Since, he has been floundering in life, which has caused a rift between himself and his older brother, who, with his wife, operate a street front diner and can''t have children of their own. Little Brother relies on his new girlfriend, a woman he barely knows named Wu Ruifang who is a performer in a touring opera troupe, for emotional support. Despite Little Brother being the local poster boy for not stowing away, his friend named Monkey tried to do the same, but died on the voyage over due to exposure to toxic ..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwnC0UdvkHXy3zBkbbVvisGPrFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255962'),
  ('112499056217242163', 'Drifters', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matteo Rovere, Vladan Radović', 'Francesco Piccolo, Laura Paolucci', 'Andrea Bosca, Miriam Giovanelli, Claudio Santamaria, Michele Riondino, Asia Argento, Sara Centola, Massimo Popolizio, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón', null, 'A man develops an attraction to the daughter of his father''s fiancee.', 'A man develops an attraction to the daughter of his father''s fiancee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrtoUT23wAQUvng3JkNf8HYNOlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120457'),
  ('288976686270078089', 'Drifting', 2021, 'Drama', 'Leung Ming-kai, Jun Li, Chung Hing Lam', 'Jun Li', 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Tommy Chu Pak-Hong, Cecilia Choi, Will Or Wai-Lam, Cecilia Yip Tung, Shaun Chen', null, 'Just out of jail, Fai finds a spot on a street corner where other homeless people welcome him. But he doesn’t get much time to settle in. The police soon chase them away, and their possessions disappear into a garbage truck. Young social worker Ms. Ho thinks it’s time to fight this in court. In the meantime, Fai and his friends have other concerns.', 'Just out of jail, Fai finds a spot on a street corner where other homeless people welcome him. But he doesn’t get much time to settle in. The police soon chase them away, and their possessions disappear into a garbage truck. Young social worker Ms. Ho thinks it’s time to fight this in court. In the meantime, Fai and his friends have other concerns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m61BsYlxAZYzn4ueCCGPLAz1Ue2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740467'),
  ('428051277369354511', 'Drifting Clouds', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Erja Dammert', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Kati Outinen, Kari Väänänen, Elina Salo, Sakari Kuosmanen, Markku Peltola, Matti Onnismaa, Shelley Fisher, Markus Allan', 'NR', 'The ever-poker-faced Ilona loses her job as a restaurant hostess, as her tram driver husband, Lauri, also finds himself out of work. Together they must hit the streets of Helsinki, facing up to hardship and humiliation in their quest for survival, guided through the gloom by a ray of hope.', 'The ever-poker-faced Ilona loses her job as a restaurant hostess, as her tram driver husband, Lauri, also finds himself out of work. Together they must hit the streets of Helsinki, facing up to hardship and humiliation in their quest for survival, guided through the gloom by a ray of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxzuKTo3RNyyUGXghfVkeiSbVDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8214'),
  ('502433918913239204', 'Drifting Flowers', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zero Chou, Hoho Liu Yun-Ho', 'Zero Chou', 'Serena Fang, Pai Chih-Ying, Lu Yi-ching, Chao Yi-lan, Sam Wang, Hsu Li-wen, Ma Yi-hang, Yu An-shun', null, 'Three poetic tales of seeking the true identity. In the first story, Jing, a blind singer, falls in love with her band''s tomboy accordionist Diego. In another time and place, Lily, an elderly lesbian and Yen, her gay friend, create an unexpected bond and support each other in a time of crisis. Finally, we see Diego before she joined the band, when as a teenager she came to grips with her gender identity.', 'Three poetic tales of seeking the true identity. In the first story, Jing, a blind singer, falls in love with her band''s tomboy accordionist Diego. In another time and place, Lily, an elderly lesbian and Yen, her gay friend, create an unexpected bond and support each other in a time of crisis. Finally, we see Diego before she joined the band, when as a teenager she came to grips with her gender identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lg1RkYHnLE2IqeW6B5IxkYvw1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72489'),
  ('858450118538164987', 'Drifting Home', 2022, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Eriko Kimura, Yo Watanabe, Huang Chieh', 'Hiroyasu Ishida, Hayashi Mori', 'Mutsumi Tamura, Asami Seto, Ayumu Murase, Daiki Yamashita, Yumiko Kobayashi, Inori Minase, Kana Hanazawa, Bin Shimada', 'PG', 'One fateful summer, a group of elementary school kids set adrift on an abandoned apartment building must look within themselves to find a way back home.', 'One fateful summer, a group of elementary school kids set adrift on an abandoned apartment building must look within themselves to find a way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNf1wC8cK6e8zgNyuMUqWFT7Din.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877957'),
  ('207633273806555069', 'Driftwood', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Ronan O''Leary, Billy Williams, Tim Lewis', null, 'James Spader, Anne Brochet, Barry McGovern, Anna Massey, Aiden Grennell, Kevin McHugh', 'R', 'When Sarah walks alone along the desolate beach one day she find an unconscious man, who has been brought to land by the waves. When he awakens he doesn''t remember anything. He has no name and no past. His dependence lies on Sarah. A role that makes her forget her loneliness and she decides to therefore lie about their situation... She says that they are situated on an island, where no one can reach them. From now, his life lies in her hands.', 'When Sarah walks alone along the desolate beach one day she find an unconscious man, who has been brought to land by the waves. When he awakens he doesn''t remember anything. He has no name and no past. His dependence lies on Sarah. A role that makes her forget her loneliness and she decides to therefore lie about their situation... She says that they are situated on an island, where no one can reach them. From now, his life lies in her hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAIWexiiyGyJLjjpmyblC723ysJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144816'),
  ('1117487664677520003', 'Driftwood', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Tim Sullivan', 'Tim Sullivan, Chris Kobin', 'Raviv Ullman, Page Falkinburg Jr., Talan Torriero, David Eigenberg, Jer Adrianne Lelliott, Baelyn Neff, Lin Shaye, Marc McClure', 'R', 'Riddled with guilt over the loss of his rock star older brother, 16 year old David Forrester becomes obsessed with death, leading his misguided parents to send him to Driftwood, an "Attitude Adjustment Camp for Troubled Youths" run by the sadistic Captain Doug Kennedy and his brutal young henchman, Yates.', 'Riddled with guilt over the loss of his rock star older brother, 16 year old David Forrester becomes obsessed with death, leading his misguided parents to send him to Driftwood, an "Attitude Adjustment Camp for Troubled Youths" run by the sadistic Captain Doug Kennedy and his brutal young henchman, Yates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCrnhTGaAuUlqizp6zMODUWhcNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14417'),
