  ('796828319822662055', 'Drive', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Newton Thomas Sigel, Dieter Busch', 'Hossein Amini', 'Ryan Gosling, Carey Mulligan, Bryan Cranston, Albert Brooks, Oscar Isaac, Christina Hendricks, Ron Perlman, Kaden Leos', 'R', 'Driver is a skilled Hollywood stuntman who moonlights as a getaway driver for criminals. Though he projects an icy exterior, lately he''s been warming up to a pretty neighbor named Irene and her young son, Benicio. When Irene''s husband gets out of jail, he enlists Driver''s help in a million-dollar heist. The job goes horribly wrong, and Driver must risk his life to protect Irene and Benicio from the vengeful masterminds behind the robbery.', 'Driver is a skilled Hollywood stuntman who moonlights as a getaway driver for criminals. Though he projects an icy exterior, lately he''s been warming up to a pretty neighbor named Irene and her young son, Benicio. When Irene''s husband gets out of jail, he enlists Driver''s help in a million-dollar heist. The job goes horribly wrong, and Driver must risk his life to protect Irene and Benicio from the vengeful masterminds behind the robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/602vevIURmpDfzbnv5Ubi6wIkQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64690'),
