  ('879716480546619743', 'Drive, He Said', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jack Nicholson, Skip Cosper, Sheldon Schrager', 'Jack Nicholson, Jeremy Larner', 'William Tepper, Karen Black, Michael Margotta, Bruce Dern, Robert Towne, Henry Jaglom, Michael Warren, June Fairchild', 'R', 'Hector is a star basketball player for the College basketball team he plays for, the Leopards. His girlfriend, Olive, doesn''t know whether to stay with him or leave him. And his friend, Gabriel, who may have dropped out from school and become a protestor, wants desperately not to get drafted for Vietnam.', 'Hector is a star basketball player for the College basketball team he plays for, the Leopards. His girlfriend, Olive, doesn''t know whether to stay with him or leave him. And his friend, Gabriel, who may have dropped out from school and become a protestor, wants desperately not to get drafted for Vietnam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eltTSrLJEWGDSHHzCzYQ0wiWZ7D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57215'),
  ('554395715790035541', 'Driven', 2001, 'Action, Drama', 'Mauro Fiore, Renny Harlin, David Arnold', 'Jan Skrentny, Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Burt Reynolds, Kip Pardue, Stacy Edwards, Til Schweiger, Gina Gershon, Estella Warren, Cristián de la Fuente', 'PG-13', 'Talented rookie race-car driver Jimmy Bly has started losing his focus and begins to slip in the race rankings. It''s no wonder, with the immense pressure being shoveled on him by his overly ambitious promoter brother as well as Bly''s romance with his arch rival''s girlfriend Sophia. With much riding on Bly, car owner Carl Henry brings former racing star Joe Tanto on board to help Bly. To drive Bly back to the top of the rankings, Tanto must first deal with the emotional scars left over from a tragic racing accident which nearly took his life.', 'Talented rookie race-car driver Jimmy Bly has started losing his focus and begins to slip in the race rankings. It''s no wonder, with the immense pressure being shoveled on him by his overly ambitious promoter brother as well as Bly''s romance with his arch rival''s girlfriend Sophia. With much riding on Bly, car owner Carl Henry brings former racing star Joe Tanto on board to help Bly. To drive Bly back to the top of the rankings, Tanto must first deal with the emotional scars left over from a tragic racing accident which nearly took his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tJ4Ya8yEyxCMihDumEyvwvUuLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10477'),
  ('303730193585207346', 'Driven', 2019, 'Thriller, History, Crime', 'William Paul Clark, René Besson, Colleen Comer', 'Alejandro Carpio', 'Jason Sudeikis, Lee Pace, Judy Greer, Corey Stoll, Isabel Arraiza, Michael Cudlitz, Erin Moriarty, Jamey Sheridan', 'R', 'FBI informant Jim Hoffman lures troubled automobile magnate John DeLorean to an undercover sting for cocaine trafficking.', 'FBI informant Jim Hoffman lures troubled automobile magnate John DeLorean to an undercover sting for cocaine trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5szS3NXiycrTL67AunS7TLG0EE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520016'),
  ('144622784629307035', 'Driven round the bend', 2021, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Arnaud Bedouët, Marc Romani', 'Arnaud Bedouët', 'Alban Lenoir, Olivier Saladin, André Wilms, Aïmen Derriachi, Nailia Harzoune, Jisca Kalvanda, Riadh Belaïche, Milouda Chaqiq', null, 'Pierre, a serviceman with a strong character, goes back to his childhood housing estate to take over his dying father’s driving school. But things have changed a bit while he’s been away, and the teaching methods are very different. After a rough first encounter, Pierre has to adapt, ditch his prejudices and turn his life around', 'Pierre, a serviceman with a strong character, goes back to his childhood housing estate to take over his dying father’s driving school. But things have changed a bit while he’s been away, and the teaching methods are very different. After a rough first encounter, Pierre has to adapt, ditch his prejudices and turn his life around', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orOv94c6CAJQuKegcXkVbsyus6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899306'),
  ('279231627864665235', 'Driven to Kill', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Jeff F. King, Thomas M. Harting', 'Mark James', 'Steven Seagal, Dmitry Chepovetsky, Igor Jijikine, Robert Wisden, Inna Korobkina, Laura Mennell, Andrew Rasputin, Zak Santiago', 'R', 'A former Russian mobster named Ruslan, who is now a crime novelist, returns home and discovers his daughter is marrying his arch nemesis. His past also comes back to haunt him when his family is threatened. Hungry for justice, Ruslan returns to the life he once knew...with a vengeance.', 'A former Russian mobster named Ruslan, who is now a crime novelist, returns home and discovers his daughter is marrying his arch nemesis. His past also comes back to haunt him when his family is threatened. Hungry for justice, Ruslan returns to the life he once knew...with a vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dprXvycJtj8OGxPWDXDTIl0y5LK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18472'),
  ('64814958915741585', 'Driveways', 2020, 'Drama', 'Andrew Ahn, Ki Jin Kim, Siena Brown', 'Paul Thureen, Hannah Bos', 'Hong Chau, Lucas Jaye, Brian Dennehy, Christine Ebersole, Jerry Adler, Robyn Payne, Jeter Rivera, Sophia DiStefano', 'NR', 'Eight-year-old Cody is spending the summer in an unfamiliar setting with his mom Kathy. Though he can''t relate to the neighbourhood kids, things take an unexpected turn when he develops an unusual friendship with the widowed old man from next door.', 'Eight-year-old Cody is spending the summer in an unfamiliar setting with his mom Kathy. Though he can''t relate to the neighbourhood kids, things take an unexpected turn when he develops an unusual friendship with the widowed old man from next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kxgyi84VkgRyyPl6hQih0uCMCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568994'),
