  ('33045399085486639', 'Driving Lessons', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jeremy Brock, David Katznelson', 'Jeremy Brock', 'Laura Linney, Rupert Grint, Julie Walters, Michelle Duncan, Oliver Milburn, Tamsin Egerton, Nicholas Farrell, Jim Norton', 'PG-13', 'A shy teenage boy trying to escape the influence of his domineering mother, has his world changed when he begins to work for a retired actress.', 'A shy teenage boy trying to escape the influence of his domineering mother, has his world changed when he begins to work for a retired actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPRFM5co4v12ksWaZKr8niIHBrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11404'),
  ('222786366311049955', 'Driving Madeleine', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pierre Cottereau, Christian Carion', 'Cyril Gely', 'Line Renaud, Dany Boon, Alice Isaaz, Gwendoline Hamon, Hadriel Roure, Elie Kaempfen, Christophe Rossignon, Jérémie Laheurte', 'NR', 'A seemingly simple taxi ride across Paris evolves into a profound meditation on the realities of the driver, whose personal life is in shambles, and his fare, an elderly woman whose warmth belies her shocking past.', 'A seemingly simple taxi ride across Paris evolves into a profound meditation on the realities of the driver, whose personal life is in shambles, and his fare, an elderly woman whose warmth belies her shocking past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTxRdKxxvigwaDruD9X2BEwsFYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893372'),
  ('73217350258881847', 'Driving Me Crazy', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Jon Turteltaub, Phedon Papamichael', 'Jon Turteltaub, David Tausik', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Billy Dee Williams, Dom DeLuise, Milton Berle, Steve Kanaly, Michelle Johnson, Richard Moll, Morton Downey, Jr.', 'PG', 'An eccentric East German inventor and defector travels to Los Angeles, California to sell a prototype revolutionary new car that runs on vegetables and produces no pollution, but he runs into one madcap situation after another to find a buyer and financier for mass production.', 'An eccentric East German inventor and defector travels to Los Angeles, California to sell a prototype revolutionary new car that runs on vegetables and produces no pollution, but he runs into one madcap situation after another to find a buyer and financier for mass production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmPgjdGVAO8mrE7AEbAxx9PxfsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12447'),
  ('45839825265603503', 'Driving Miss Daisy', 1989, 'Drama', 'Bruce Beresford, Peter James, Katterli Frauenfelder', 'Alfred Uhry', 'Morgan Freeman, Jessica Tandy, Dan Aykroyd, Patti LuPone, Esther Rolle, Joann Havrilla, Ray McKinnon, Crystal R. Fox', 'PG', 'The story of an old Jewish widow named Daisy Werthan and her relationship with her black chauffeur, Hoke. From an initial mere work relationship grew in 25 years a strong friendship between the two very different characters, in a time when those types of relationships were shunned.', 'The story of an old Jewish widow named Daisy Werthan and her relationship with her black chauffeur, Hoke. From an initial mere work relationship grew in 25 years a strong friendship between the two very different characters, in a time when those types of relationships were shunned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaCzvcY42HihFxQBTZCTKMpsI0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403'),
  ('81180404050517198', 'Drizzle', 1978, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Sergio Olhovich, Felipe Palomino, Rosalío Solano', 'Juan de la Cabada, Sergio Olhovich', 'Aarón Hernán, Salvador Sánchez, Delia Casanova, Amado Zumaya, Silvia Mariscal, Luis Couturier, Carlos Chávez, Martín Palomares', null, 'Returning from a business trip, a man meets some peasants who arouse fears in him.', 'Returning from a business trip, a man meets some peasants who arouse fears in him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTYNR9vR3kTj8y8NaRUcSSVLhM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254031'),
  ('124859727063802751', 'Drogam: Nadanthathu Enna?', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mohammed Sameer', null, 'Kishore, Leena Chowdary, Swathi Varma, Saso, Ramya Sen, Delhi Ganesh', null, 'Drogam Nadanthathu Enna film is based on a real incident which happened in Mumbai. The electric power goes at the time when a young police officer makes love to his wife. So the inspector goes to light a candle. At that time a stranger embraces the inspector''s wife who is not able to recognize the person. She thinks that it is her husband. The stranger records this incident in his cell phone. The stranger blackmails the lady showing this clipping and asks her to make love with him. Whether she agrees or not is the rest of the story.', 'Drogam Nadanthathu Enna film is based on a real incident which happened in Mumbai. The electric power goes at the time when a young police officer makes love to his wife. So the inspector goes to light a candle. At that time a stranger embraces the inspector''s wife who is not able to recognize the person. She thinks that it is her husband. The stranger records this incident in his cell phone. The stranger blackmails the lady showing this clipping and asks her to make love with him. Whether she agrees or not is the rest of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4p11mJuBtZApzlPnJxQMchn7Lh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833324'),
  ('545353792473927171', 'Drona', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Goldie Behl', null, 'Abhishek Bachchan, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Jaya Bachchan, Ali Haji, Kay Kay Menon, Conan Stevens', null, 'Aditya is an orphaned and lonely young man. He soon learns that he belongs to a family of ancestral warriors who guard a mystic source of cosmic energy, and he must now take up his responsibilities.', 'Aditya is an orphaned and lonely young man. He soon learns that he belongs to a family of ancestral warriors who guard a mystic source of cosmic energy, and he must now take up his responsibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7l5lejRwvkEnQ3s1dOLQ1qUXGRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19623'),
  ('928926695106370758', 'Drone', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Jason Bourque, Graham Talbot, Nelson Talbot', 'Paul A. Birkett, Jason Bourque', 'Sean Bean, Mary McCormack, Joel David Moore, Patrick Sabongui, Sharon Taylor, Kirby Morrow, Bradley Stryker, Kevin O''Grady', 'NR', 'Ideologies collide with fatal results when a military drone contractor meets an enigmatic Pakistani businessman.', 'Ideologies collide with fatal results when a military drone contractor meets an enigmatic Pakistani businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1Zp7DBOkxDhGCg6fXhuaFaFwsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452068'),
  ('257753898174465383', 'Drone', 2024, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Romaric Thomas, Alma Galy-Nadal, Mona Vigué', 'Gilles Marchand', 'Marion Barbeau, Eugénie Derouand, Cédric Kahn, Stefan Crepon, Bilel Chegrani, Rio Vega, Clara Choï, Yamée Couture', null, 'Émilie lives in a world of surveillance: her camgirl work; the camera phone lingering on a crush from afar; the headset affording her a drone’s perspective. The same drone that stalks each move she makes, offering inspiration, noting rivals. An unsolicited companion is conspiring with or against her. A financially strapped transplant now living in the Paris suburbs, Émilie is thrust into a high-powered world when she is chosen for a renovation workshop with a prestigious architect. Her classmates come mostly from “filthy rich” backgrounds, like cocky Olivier, who wants Émilie as his conquest. But Émilie has shy eyes only for self-sufficient Mina, whose music builds like a “helicoid.” A drone—unlike any known model—is watching her all along waiting for her next move and paying handily for the privilege.', 'Émilie lives in a world of surveillance: her camgirl work; the camera phone lingering on a crush from afar; the headset affording her a drone’s perspective. The same drone that stalks each move she makes, offering inspiration, noting rivals. An unsolicited companion is conspiring with or against her. A financially strapped transplant now living in the Paris suburbs, Émilie is thrust into a high-powered world when she is chosen for a renovation workshop with a prestigious architect. Her classmates come mostly from “filthy rich” backgrounds, like cocky Olivier, who wants Émilie as his conquest. But Émilie has shy eyes only for self-sufficient Mina, whose music builds like a “helicoid.” A drone—unlike any known model—is watching her all along waiting for her next move and paying handily for the privilege.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flIYY0q6x5k6XpYSGtZz3hlOoBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001044'),
  ('317140924574149014', 'Drool', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nancy Kissam', 'Nancy Kissam', 'Laura Harring, Jill Marie Jones, Oded Fehr, Dalton Alfortish, Garrett A. Lain, Brett Lapeyrouse', null, 'An abused wife''s plan to escape her husband goes awry when she accidentally kills him, causing her to split on a cross-country drive with her best friend and his corpse in tow.', 'An abused wife''s plan to escape her husband goes awry when she accidentally kills him, causing her to split on a cross-country drive with her best friend and his corpse in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugGkaiYJZiWYEcIK55ZZ4qS8wyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35065'),
