  ('897793072796988940', 'Droopy''s Double Trouble', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', 'Rich Hogan', 'Daws Butler, Bill Thompson', null, 'Butler Droopy gets his twin brother Drippy a job as assistant butler, causing trouble for Butch, who is trying to mooch an easy meal but can''t tell the difference between the kind Droopy and the violence-prone Drippy.', 'Butler Droopy gets his twin brother Drippy a job as assistant butler, causing trouble for Butch, who is trying to mooch an easy meal but can''t tell the difference between the kind Droopy and the violence-prone Drippy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qazpMua8fFbTt54V4x2fwEqb1nB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84757'),
