  ('1022932569841982047', 'Drop', 2009, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hiroshi Shinagawa, Masayuki Fujii', 'Hiroshi Shinagawa', 'Hiroki Narimiya, Hiro Mizushima, Yuika Motokariya, Yusuke Kamiji, Noriko Nakagoshi, Show Aikawa, Yuji Ayabe, Kenichi Endo', null, '"Drop" tells the story of a boy named Hiroshi Shinanogawa, who grew up in the 1980s. He became inspired by the Be-Bop High School manga and decided to become a delinquent. Hiroshi dropped out of a private middle school and transferred to a public school There he joins up with a delinquent gang.', '"Drop" tells the story of a boy named Hiroshi Shinanogawa, who grew up in the 1980s. He became inspired by the Be-Bop High School manga and decided to become a delinquent. Hiroshi dropped out of a private middle school and transferred to a public school There he joins up with a delinquent gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuWCkQIm3dD7QGGWHeyjF8Bdjv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40119'),
  ('793924252693367598', 'Drop', 2025, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Christopher Landon, Alice Murphy, Jonathan Quinlan', 'Jillian Jacobs, Christopher Roach', 'Meghann Fahy, Brandon Sklenar, Reed Diamond, Violett Beane, Jeffery Self, Jacob Robinson, Gabrielle Ryan, Ed Weeks', 'PG-13', 'Violet, a widowed mother on her first date in years, arrives at an upscale restaurant where she is relieved that her date, Henry, is more charming and handsome than she expected. But their chemistry begins to curdle as Violet begins being irritated and then terrorized by a series of anonymous drops to her phone.', 'Violet, a widowed mother on her first date in years, arrives at an upscale restaurant where she is relieved that her date, Henry, is more charming and handsome than she expected. But their chemistry begins to curdle as Violet begins being irritated and then terrorized by a series of anonymous drops to her phone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSQPSW8aLjsMBfwqGjgJ6HozTkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249213'),
  ('670241594075018245', 'Drop Dead Fred', 1991, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Ate de Jong, Peter Deming, Michael Waxman', 'Carlos Davis, Anthony Fingleton', 'Phoebe Cates, Rik Mayall, Marsha Mason, Tim Matheson, Carrie Fisher, Keith Charles, Ashley Peldon, Daniel Gerroll', 'PG-13', 'An unhappy housewife gets a lift from the return of her imaginary childhood friend, Drop Dead Fred.', 'An unhappy housewife gets a lift from the return of her imaginary childhood friend, Drop Dead Fred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2kadCRcRdq8a0aRbQg4yVk3Xmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10379'),
  ('64046387857258036', 'Drop Dead Gorgeous', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Michael Spiller, Michael Patrick Jann, Linda Brachman', 'Lona Williams', 'Kirsten Dunst, Ellen Barkin, Denise Richards, Kirstie Alley, Allison Janney, Sam McMurray, Mindy Sterling, Brittany Murphy', 'PG-13', 'In a small Minnesota town, the annual beauty pageant is being covered by a TV crew. Former winner Gladys Leeman wants to make sure her daughter follows in her footsteps; explosions, falling lights, and trailer fires prove that. As the Leemans are the richest family in town, the police are pretty relaxed about it all. Despite everything, main rival (but sweet) Amber Atkins won''t give up without a fight.', 'In a small Minnesota town, the annual beauty pageant is being covered by a TV crew. Former winner Gladys Leeman wants to make sure her daughter follows in her footsteps; explosions, falling lights, and trailer fires prove that. As the Leemans are the richest family in town, the police are pretty relaxed about it all. Despite everything, main rival (but sweet) Amber Atkins won''t give up without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4nHRCB5GqWyWiqweVf6UUv8GWt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10490'),
  ('698486754956491904', 'Drop Dead Gorgeous', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Cris D''amato, Nonato Estrela, Paula Horta', 'Bruno Garotti, Regiana Antonini, Sylvio Gonçalves', 'Glória Pires, Emílio Dantas, Anttónia, Ângelo Paes Leme, Pablo Sanábio, Polly Marinho, Gláucia Rodrigues, Susana Vieira', null, 'Paula, a famous plastic surgeon, applies an experimental formula to herself that promises to completely eliminate cellulite. However, she ends up dying shortly after the test. Now, with the help of a medium, the doctor returns to Earth to try to stop her greedy ex-partner from putting the harmful product on the market.', 'Paula, a famous plastic surgeon, applies an experimental formula to herself that promises to completely eliminate cellulite. However, she ends up dying shortly after the test. Now, with the help of a medium, the doctor returns to Earth to try to stop her greedy ex-partner from putting the harmful product on the market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUGJUCQ8LINN6tKL9zpVtNPURo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342238'),
  ('198947681943951059', 'Drop Dead Sexy', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Michael Philip, Thomas L. Callaway, Richard Kooris', 'Michael Philip, John Benjamin Martin, Paul Doiron', 'Jason Lee, Crispin Glover, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Burton Gilliam, Xander Berkeley, Joseph D. Reitman, Amber Heard, Steven Chester Prince', 'R', 'When their money scam runs aground, a group of would-be thieves turn to kidnapping in an attempt to blackmail their target.', 'When their money scam runs aground, a group of would-be thieves turn to kidnapping in an attempt to blackmail their target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIsp5FUgPGJdQT6jVKtjQ94puz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21791'),
  ('333763925030805379', 'Drop Out Wife', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stephen C. Apostolof, R.C. Reuben', 'Edward D. Wood Jr., Stephen C. Apostolof', 'Angela Carnon, Terri Johnson, Harvey Shain, Lynn Harris, Douglas Frey, Jane Tsentas, Cory Brandon, Sandy Dempsey', null, 'A young housewife gets involved in the "swinging" scene and discovers that it isn''t all it''s cracked up to be.', 'A young housewife gets involved in the "swinging" scene and discovers that it isn''t all it''s cracked up to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fo8T6qxBhE9GT5UJBufzWdX4rFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29673'),
  ('555171856813228932', 'Drop Squad', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David C. Johnson, Ken Kelsch', 'David C. Johnson, Butch Robinson', 'Eriq La Salle, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Ving Rhames, Kasi Lemmons, Leonard L. Thomas, Nicole Powell, Eric Payne, Crystal R. Fox', 'R', 'Controversial film about an underground organization that kidnaps and ''deprograms'' African Americans who sell out or deny their cultural heritage. Spike Lee is the Executive Producer.', 'Controversial film about an underground organization that kidnaps and ''deprograms'' African Americans who sell out or deny their cultural heritage. Spike Lee is the Executive Producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zvaSqZ1ycRQusdRJGR96ilpE2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109461'),
  ('921884636880561445', 'Drop the Curtain', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Víctor Herrera', 'Jaime Salvador', 'Cantinflas, Beatriz Saavedra, Christiane Martel, Alberto Catalá, Víctor Alcocer, Tito Novaro, María Herrero, Alejandro Ciangherotti', null, 'Cantinflas, who owns a cleaning business, cleans the windows of the house of a famous French actress. While carrying out his work he observes how a man steals one of the famous actress necklaces, but he can only see his back.', 'Cantinflas, who owns a cleaning business, cleans the windows of the house of a famous French actress. While carrying out his work he observes how a man steals one of the famous actress necklaces, but he can only see his back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGxZyNZlM8nIXDuMCtNXW6i9A0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82768'),
  ('1124682669676618594', 'Drop Zone', 1994, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Badham, Roy H. Wagner, Joseph J. Kontra', 'Peter Barsocchini, John Bishop', 'Wesley Snipes, Gary Busey, Yancy Butler, Michael Jeter, Corin Nemec, Kyle Secor, Luca Bercovici, Malcolm-Jamal Warner', 'R', 'A daring prison break from an airliner at 30,000 feet leaves U.S. Marshal Pete Nessip mourning a brother and gunning for revenge. After being ordered to turn in his badge, he seeks out Jessie Crossman, a noted skydiver, and offers to sponsor her crew for the annual Independence Day parachuting show in Washington, D.C., if she trains him. Meanwhile, the mastermind behind the mid-air jailbreak is planning a daring computer theft on Independence Day.', 'A daring prison break from an airliner at 30,000 feet leaves U.S. Marshal Pete Nessip mourning a brother and gunning for revenge. After being ordered to turn in his badge, he seeks out Jessie Crossman, a noted skydiver, and offers to sponsor her crew for the annual Independence Day parachuting show in Washington, D.C., if she trains him. Meanwhile, the mastermind behind the mid-air jailbreak is planning a daring computer theft on Independence Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Psxz2Jx4UuXQSPaTSKjlhNGoAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4954'),
  ('1030240087568869303', 'Drowning by Numbers', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Peter Greenaway, Sacha Vierny', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Joan Plowright, Juliet Stevenson, Joely Richardson, Bernard Hill, Jason Edwards, Bryan Pringle, Trevor Cooper, David Morrissey', 'R', 'Cissie Colpitts drowns her cheating husband and, in the ensuing cover-up, enlists the help of lonely coroner Henry Madgett, an old friend with a longstanding weakness for her charms. But when Cissie''s daughter and granddaughter—both also named Cissie Colpitts—decide to resort to the same methods for solving conflicts with their own frustrating husbands, the women and their repeated appeals for help begin to wear on Madgett''s conscience.', 'Cissie Colpitts drowns her cheating husband and, in the ensuing cover-up, enlists the help of lonely coroner Henry Madgett, an old friend with a longstanding weakness for her charms. But when Cissie''s daughter and granddaughter—both also named Cissie Colpitts—decide to resort to the same methods for solving conflicts with their own frustrating husbands, the women and their repeated appeals for help begin to wear on Madgett''s conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTltoKsUD5ArBpRBP6PH4iCjX9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27362'),
  ('1118650809785154130', 'Drowning Ghost', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Mokrosinski, Mikael Håfström', 'Vasa, Mikael Håfström', 'Rebecka Hemse, Jesper Salén, Jenny Ulving, Peter Eggers, Rebecca Ferguson, Daniel Larsson, Frans Wiklund, Erik Hultqvist', null, 'Hundred years ago, three students at the Hellestads Boarding School were brutally slaughtered, the murderer drowned himself in a lake nearby and his body was never found. The story has become a legend for generations of students as well as a yearly festivity. Sara, a student, is writting an essay based on the legend and uncovers new facts from the event that will cast dark shadows on the family name of one of the school''s main benificiaries. On the night of the hundreth anniversary, the festivities go awry, students disappear and something dark and unknown is moving through the schools corridors...', 'Hundred years ago, three students at the Hellestads Boarding School were brutally slaughtered, the murderer drowned himself in a lake nearby and his body was never found. The story has become a legend for generations of students as well as a yearly festivity. Sara, a student, is writting an essay based on the legend and uncovers new facts from the event that will cast dark shadows on the family name of one of the school''s main benificiaries. On the night of the hundreth anniversary, the festivities go awry, students disappear and something dark and unknown is moving through the schools corridors...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Zq2QKVksRg1FGLvNJ1UulbRltD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58384'),
  ('8940731071041233', 'Drowning Love', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yuki Yamato, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Kishū Izuchi, Yuki Yamato', 'Masaki Suda, Nana Komatsu, Daiki Shigeoka, Mone Kamishiraishi, Ryohei Shima, Yoichiro Saito, Gôichi Mine, Ayumu Ito', null, 'Natsume Mochizuki works as a teen model in Tokyo, but she learns that she has to move to her father''s hometown of Ukigumo. She is in a desperate situation because she can''t do the things she wants to do in Ukigumo. One day, she meets Koichiro Hasegawa. He is the successor of the Hasegawa family. His family is wealthy and is respected in the area. Natsume Mochizuki and Koichiro Hasegawa become attracted to each other, but something changes their fate.', 'Natsume Mochizuki works as a teen model in Tokyo, but she learns that she has to move to her father''s hometown of Ukigumo. She is in a desperate situation because she can''t do the things she wants to do in Ukigumo. One day, she meets Koichiro Hasegawa. He is the successor of the Hasegawa family. His family is wealthy and is respected in the area. Natsume Mochizuki and Koichiro Hasegawa become attracted to each other, but something changes their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PYIgcBiMhGBq81MMPbhwIDdDUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410220'),
  ('108956691864154420', 'Drowning Mona', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Nick Gomez, Stacey Holmes, John M. Nelson', 'Peter Steinfeld', 'Danny DeVito, Bette Midler, Neve Campbell, Jamie Lee Curtis, Casey Affleck, William Fichtner, Marcus Thomas, Peter Dobson', 'PG-13', 'A Sheriff investigating the murder of an upstate New York woman learns that her extremely hateful ways gave the whole town a motive to be rid of her.', 'A Sheriff investigating the murder of an upstate New York woman learns that her extremely hateful ways gave the whole town a motive to be rid of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuN2SXCGPIlC7pAPCOzqAdeaDji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25166'),
  ('492168629340637255', 'Drowsiness', 2008, 'Drama', 'Magdalena Piekorz, Marcin Koszałka', 'Wojciech Kuczok', 'Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Michał Żebrowski, Krzysztof Zawadzki, Joanna Orleańska, Rafał Maćkowiak, Bartosz Obuchowicz, Dorota Pomykała, Anna Tomaszewska', null, 'The emotional inertia and chaos affecting a narcoleptic woman, a fatally ill writer and a gay doctor, and their attempts to escape from their dead-end situations.', 'The emotional inertia and chaos affecting a narcoleptic woman, a fatally ill writer and a gay doctor, and their attempts to escape from their dead-end situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNW0RStQA0ZJzS4OGiUj6MFOY2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38875'),
  ('265533155272007224', 'Drug War', 2012, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Johnnie To, Cheang Pou-Soi, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Ryker Chan, Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Louis Koo, Sun Honglei, Crystal Huang Yi, Michelle Ye Xuan, Lam Suet, Gao Yunxiang, Wang Ziyi, Wallace Chung', 'R', 'A drug cartel boss is arrested in a raid and coerced into betraying his former accomplices as part of an undercover operation.', 'A drug cartel boss is arrested in a raid and coerced into betraying his former accomplices as part of an undercover operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ndg350jismgWwag7RrDHb6zGo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110410'),
  ('635244578061855913', 'Drugs Are Like That', 1969, 'Documentary, Family', 'Paul Nagel Jr.', null, 'Anita Bryant', null, '[…] Though the highs and lows of human experience are all here, it''s often the gimcrack set design and fashion chops in these vintage clunkers that really wow – the pot-holder sweater vests, ponytails decorated with yarn, hippies with crumb-catching moustaches, banana-seat bikes and a hard rain of Quaaludes and amphetamines to illustrate the dangers of drug addiction. It is hard to believe anyone would buy the goofball cause-and-effect of that pill-popper''s weather pattern in "Drugs Are Like That". Co-produced by the Miami Junior League and narrated by Anita Bryant in this cheery little hand-slapper, a kid stealing cookies from a cookie jar is implied to be headed down a bad road to Bowery bum rolls and LSD parties. (from: http://clatl.com/atlanta/av-geeks-greatest-hits-lessons-learned/Content?oid=1268313)', '[…] Though the highs and lows of human experience are all here, it''s often the gimcrack set design and fashion chops in these vintage clunkers that really wow – the pot-holder sweater vests, ponytails decorated with yarn, hippies with crumb-catching moustaches, banana-seat bikes and a hard rain of Quaaludes and amphetamines to illustrate the dangers of drug addiction. It is hard to believe anyone would buy the goofball cause-and-effect of that pill-popper''s weather pattern in "Drugs Are Like That". Co-produced by the Miami Junior League and narrated by Anita Bryant in this cheery little hand-slapper, a kid stealing cookies from a cookie jar is implied to be headed down a bad road to Bowery bum rolls and LSD parties. (from: http://clatl.com/atlanta/av-geeks-greatest-hits-lessons-learned/Content?oid=1268313)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPMkyPzJdiFq0fshjDZa8Vb0R0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300502'),
  ('134302407443712567', 'Drugstore Cowboy', 1989, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gus Van Sant, Robert D. Yeoman, David B. Householter', 'Gus Van Sant, Daniel Yost', 'Matt Dillon, Kelly Lynch, James Remar, James Le Gros, Heather Graham, Beah Richards, Grace Zabriskie, Max Perlich', 'R', 'Portland, Oregon, 1971. Bob Hughes is the charismatic leader of a peculiar quartet, formed by his wife, Dianne, and another couple, Rick and Nadine, who skillfully steal from drugstores and hospital medicine cabinets in order to appease their insatiable need for drugs. But neither fun nor luck last forever.', 'Portland, Oregon, 1971. Bob Hughes is the charismatic leader of a peculiar quartet, formed by his wife, Dianne, and another couple, Rick and Nadine, who skillfully steal from drugstores and hospital medicine cabinets in order to appease their insatiable need for drugs. But neither fun nor luck last forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1URuvqnZcwL4wy8hIIwQ9p9AxVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476'),
  ('496416000724204670', 'Drugstore Girl', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Katsuhide Motoki', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Rena Tanaka, Akira Emoto, Yuji Miyake, Masatô Ibu, Yuu Tokui, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Naomasa Musaka, Yoshiko Mita', null, 'Pharmaceutical student, Keiko witnesses her boyfriend having an affair. Shocked and disappointed, she jumps on a train ("destination anywhere, east or west, she don''t care") and ends up in a town named Masao in Tokyo''s remote suburbs. There, she gets a part-time job at a newly opened drugstore. What do ya know.. The local shopping district''s middle-aged men all fall for the young girl''s charms, and they start practicing lacrosse once they have found out that that''s her favourite sport.', 'Pharmaceutical student, Keiko witnesses her boyfriend having an affair. Shocked and disappointed, she jumps on a train ("destination anywhere, east or west, she don''t care") and ends up in a town named Masao in Tokyo''s remote suburbs. There, she gets a part-time job at a newly opened drugstore. What do ya know.. The local shopping district''s middle-aged men all fall for the young girl''s charms, and they start practicing lacrosse once they have found out that that''s her favourite sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caXYk3Nrl46UE2JhB04IgZdaDtV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37096'),
  ('88121287129148314', 'Drugstore June', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Nicholaus Goossen, Sherri Kauk', 'Esther Povitsky, Nicholaus Goossen', 'Esther Povitsky, Beverly D''Angelo, James Remar, Brandon Wardell, Bobby Lee, Danny Griffin, Haley Joel Osment, Miranda Cosgrove', 'R', 'After the pharmacy in her small town is robbed, a girl who still lives at home with her parents takes matters into her own hands to solve the crime, while at the same time trying to get over her ex-boyfriend and become more of an adult.', 'After the pharmacy in her small town is robbed, a girl who still lives at home with her parents takes matters into her own hands to solve the crime, while at the same time trying to get over her ex-boyfriend and become more of an adult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbWcd3e5ooHEmiJnEmRE8sE3bOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058303'),
  ('583850261610767359', 'Drugstore Romance', 1979, 'Drama', 'Paul Vecchiali, Georges Strouvé', 'Paul Vecchiali, Martine Macqueron', 'Hélène Surgère, Nicolas Silberg, Myriam Mézières, Christine Murillo, Liza Braconnier, Louis Lyonnet, Sonia Saviange, Madeleine Robinson', null, 'Pierrot, mechanic in Paris, falls madly for a female chemist his senior—who at first refuses him, only accepting love after being diagnosed with a deadly illness.', 'Pierrot, mechanic in Paris, falls madly for a female chemist his senior—who at first refuses him, only accepting love after being diagnosed with a deadly illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJAGSB70fiBwXLdpvDjguGsIAHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131479'),
  ('921904738086224197', 'Druids', 2001, 'Action', 'Jacques Dorfmann, Stefan Ivanov, Plamen Somov', 'Rospo Pallenberg, Norman Spinrad, Jacques Dorfmann', 'Christopher Lambert, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Max von Sydow, Denis Charvet, Jean-Pierre Bergeron, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Maria Kavardjikova, Yannis Baraban', null, 'In the year 60 B.C. a group of Druids, including the arch-druid Guttuart (Max von Sydow), witness the passing of a comet and interpret it as the sign of the coming of a king for their country Gaul, which has not had a king for a long time. Guttuart goes to Gergovia, the capital of the Arvenes tribe, to attend a meeting of Gallic tribal chieftains. The young boy Vercingetorix, along with his friend the young girl Eponia, sneak into a large cavern where Celtill, Vercingetorix''s father and chieftain of the Arvenes, hosts the meeting of chieftains with the intention of proclaiming himself king of all Gauls. When Celtill shows off the crown once worn by the old kings of Gaul, an arrow from two Roman spies (dressed as Gauls) hits Celtill in the back.', 'In the year 60 B.C. a group of Druids, including the arch-druid Guttuart (Max von Sydow), witness the passing of a comet and interpret it as the sign of the coming of a king for their country Gaul, which has not had a king for a long time. Guttuart goes to Gergovia, the capital of the Arvenes tribe, to attend a meeting of Gallic tribal chieftains. The young boy Vercingetorix, along with his friend the young girl Eponia, sneak into a large cavern where Celtill, Vercingetorix''s father and chieftain of the Arvenes, hosts the meeting of chieftains with the intention of proclaiming himself king of all Gauls. When Celtill shows off the crown once worn by the old kings of Gaul, an arrow from two Roman spies (dressed as Gauls) hits Celtill in the back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKifUSwif4iUTZ66y45jgqpHQjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12911'),
  ('561563687310853579', 'Drum', 1976, 'History, Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Steve Carver, Lucien Ballard, Peter Bogart', 'Norman Wexler', 'Warren Oates, Pam Grier, Ken Norton, Isela Vega, Yaphet Kotto, John Colicos, Fiona Lewis, Paula Kelly', 'R', 'A mid-19th century mulatto slave is torn between his success as a pit-fighter and the injustices of white society.', 'A mid-19th century mulatto slave is torn between his success as a pit-fighter and the injustices of white society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKJUvemUAd0oXwyDuV4cpVzpkxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86194'),
  ('704217645733775935', 'Drum Beat', 1954, 'Western', 'Sidney Hickox, Delmer Daves, J. Peverell Marley', 'Delmer Daves', 'Alan Ladd, Audrey Dalton, Marisa Pavan, Robert Keith, Rodolfo Acosta, Charles Bronson, Warner Anderson, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'NR', 'President Grant orders Indian fighter MacKay to negotiate with the Modocs of northern California and southern Oregon. On the way he must escort Nancy Meek to the home of her aunt and uncle. After Modoc renegade Captain Jack engages in ambush and other atrocities, MacKay must fight him one-on-one with guns, knives and fists.', 'President Grant orders Indian fighter MacKay to negotiate with the Modocs of northern California and southern Oregon. On the way he must escort Nancy Meek to the home of her aunt and uncle. After Modoc renegade Captain Jack engages in ambush and other atrocities, MacKay must fight him one-on-one with guns, knives and fists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxxU1ZN7YZSRpo8hExDg0ceMQaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150875'),
  ('848415024234546440', 'Drumline', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Charles Stone III, Shane Hurlbut', 'Shawn Schepps, Tina Gordon', 'Nick Cannon, Zoe Saldaña, Orlando Jones, Leonard Roberts, GQ, Jason Weaver, Earl Poitier, Candace Carey', 'PG-13', 'A talented street drummer from Harlem enrolls in a Southern university, expecting to lead its marching band''s drumline to victory. He initially flounders in his new world, before realizing that it takes more than talent to reach the top.', 'A talented street drummer from Harlem enrolls in a Southern university, expecting to lead its marching band''s drumline to victory. He initially flounders in his new world, before realizing that it takes more than talent to reach the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zl7gdxYqKdFCioPT3DAkZR5DDUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13497'),
  ('236398394821471849', 'Drumline: A New Beat', 2014, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Bille Woodruff', 'Regina Y. Hicks, Karin Gist', 'Alexandra Shipp, Leonard Roberts, Jordan Calloway, LeToya Luckett, Jasmine Burke, Lisa Arrindell, Nick Cannon, Mario Van Peebles', 'PG', 'A girl from New York attends a college in Atlanta to join their once-famous marching band.', 'A girl from New York attends a college in Atlanta to join their once-famous marching band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bK4bMXT4xQoJRytBqSQS3FJmFBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299513'),
  ('1005808191382745270', 'Drummer-Crab', 1977, 'Drama, War', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer, Raoul Coutard', 'Jean-François Chauvel, Pierre Schoendoerffer', 'Jean Rochefort, Claude Rich, Jacques Perrin, Aurore Clément, Odile Versois, Pierre Rousseau, Jacques Dufilho, François Dyrek', null, '"Le Crabe Tambour" ("Drummer Crab") is the nickname for the mysterious central character, Willsdorff (Jacques Perrin), an Alsatian, whose doomed, out-of-date career is recalled through the tales of three naval officers currently serving aboard a French supply ship in the North Atlantic.', '"Le Crabe Tambour" ("Drummer Crab") is the nickname for the mysterious central character, Willsdorff (Jacques Perrin), an Alsatian, whose doomed, out-of-date career is recalled through the tales of three naval officers currently serving aboard a French supply ship in the North Atlantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZVXzC749OScK1pBtlhW0wcIN3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86727'),
  ('588950986380933704', 'Drums Across the River', 1954, 'Western', 'Nathan Juran, Tom Shaw, Joseph Gershenson', 'John K. Butler, Lawrence Roman', 'Audie Murphy, Walter Brennan, Lyle Bettger, Lisa Gaye, Hugh O''Brian, Mara Corday, Jay Silverheels, Emile Meyer', 'NR', 'When whites hunger after the gold on Ute Indian land, a bigoted young man finds himself forced into a peacekeeping role.', 'When whites hunger after the gold on Ute Indian land, a bigoted young man finds himself forced into a peacekeeping role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD1VTyENoknVvV02GqFnmfUilGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107427'),
  ('1101934505353214900', 'Drums Along the Mohawk', 1939, 'Drama, History, War', 'Ray Rennahan, Bert Glennon, John Ford', 'Sonya Levien, Lamar Trotti', 'Claudette Colbert, Henry Fonda, Edna May Oliver, Eddie Collins, John Carradine, Dorris Bowdon, Jessie Ralph, Arthur Shields', 'NR', 'Albany, New York, 1776. After marrying, Gil and Lana travel north to settle on a small farm in the Mohawk River Valley, but soon their growing prosperity and happiness are threatened by the sinister sound of drums that announce dark times of revolution and war.', 'Albany, New York, 1776. After marrying, Gil and Lana travel north to settle on a small farm in the Mohawk River Valley, but soon their growing prosperity and happiness are threatened by the sinister sound of drums that announce dark times of revolution and war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEBKiwxXByk5Co9ZwSwoQVLNT8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73194'),
  ('700360947946168980', 'Drums in the Deep South', 1951, 'Western', 'William Cameron Menzies, Lionel Lindon', 'Philip Yordan, Sidney Harmon', 'James Craig, Barbara Payton, Guy Madison, Barton MacLane, Robert Osterloh, Tom Fadden, Robert Easton, Louis Jean Heydt', 'NR', 'Two old friends find themselves on opposite sides during the Civil War in a desperate battle atop an impregnable mountain.', 'Two old friends find themselves on opposite sides during the Civil War in a desperate battle atop an impregnable mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bTVhe2XopRyzpaVoOwNdG8Kd8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110851'),
  ('204022089027497188', 'Drunk Angry Idiot', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Armando Casas', 'Eric Arcos Maldonado', 'Luis Arrieta, Luis Ernesto Franco, Danna García, Alfonso Arau, Tamara Mazarrasa', null, 'A comedy about alcoholism that follows the relationship between Mateo and his best friend, who always gets drunk.', 'A comedy about alcoholism that follows the relationship between Mateo and his best friend, who always gets drunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av2wwd4vZu3rrtr12F3CFUOYFSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387809'),
  ('1115468234958785027', 'Drunk Bus', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luke McCoubrey, Brandon LaGanke, John Carlucci', 'Chris Molinaro', 'Charlie Tahan, Kara Hayward, Tangaroa Pineapple, Tonatiuh, Will Forte, Sarah Mezzanotte, Frank Iero, Zach Cherry', null, 'A directionless, young campus bus driver and a punk rock Samoan security guard named Pineapple form an unlikely kinship as they navigate the unpredictable late shift shit show known as the "drunk bus." Together, they break out of their endless loop and into a world of uncertainty, excitement and incredibly poor decision-making.', 'A directionless, young campus bus driver and a punk rock Samoan security guard named Pineapple form an unlikely kinship as they navigate the unpredictable late shift shit show known as the "drunk bus." Together, they break out of their endless loop and into a world of uncertainty, excitement and incredibly poor decision-making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBkljyGgsLiYCwIveQaktbae9WV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659360'),
  ('181745104454937625', 'Drunk Parents', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Fred Wolf, Timothy A. Burton', 'Peter Gaulke, Fred Wolf', 'Alec Baldwin, Salma Hayek Pinault, Joe Manganiello, Treat Williams, Michelle Veintimilla, Natalia Cigliuti, Jim Gaffigan, Aimee Mullins', 'R', 'Two drunk parents attempt to hide their ever increasing financial difficulties from their daughter and social circle through elaborate neighborhood schemes.', 'Two drunk parents attempt to hide their ever increasing financial difficulties from their daughter and social circle through elaborate neighborhood schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbcqkOVT4KrWWhoT18FzZZ73Puk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369560'),
  ('979066694492856181', 'Drunk Stoned Brilliant Dead', 2015, 'History, Comedy, Documentary', 'Douglas Tirola, Sean Price Williams', 'Mark Monroe', 'John Belushi, John Candy, Kevin Bacon, Tim Matheson, John Goodman, Bill Murray, Harold Ramis, Chevy Chase', null, 'A look at the history of the American comedy publication and production company, National Lampoon, from its beginning in the 1970s to 2010, featuring rare and never before seen footage, this is the mind boggling story of The National Lampoon from its subversive and electrifying beginnings, to rebirth as an unlikely Hollywood heavyweight, and beyond. A humour empire like no other, the impact of the magazines irreverent, often shocking, sensibility was nothing short of seismic: this is an institution whose (drunk stoned brilliant) alumni left their fingerprints all over popular culture. Both insanely great and breathtakingly innovative, The National Lampoon created the foundation of modern comic sensibility by setting the bar in comedy impossibly high.', 'A look at the history of the American comedy publication and production company, National Lampoon, from its beginning in the 1970s to 2010, featuring rare and never before seen footage, this is the mind boggling story of The National Lampoon from its subversive and electrifying beginnings, to rebirth as an unlikely Hollywood heavyweight, and beyond. A humour empire like no other, the impact of the magazines irreverent, often shocking, sensibility was nothing short of seismic: this is an institution whose (drunk stoned brilliant) alumni left their fingerprints all over popular culture. Both insanely great and breathtakingly innovative, The National Lampoon created the foundation of modern comic sensibility by setting the bar in comedy impossibly high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKTLU5kIBiqvjbyIPbXFlXCTDwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319070'),
  ('880120007111377862', 'Drunken Angel', 1948, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Takeo Itō', 'Keinosuke Uekusa, Akira Kurosawa', 'Takashi Shimura, Toshirō Mifune, Reizaburo Yamamoto, Michiyo Kogure, Chieko Nakakita, Noriko Sengoku, Shizuko Kasagi, Eitarō Shindō', 'NR', 'In postwar Tokyo, a blunt, alcohol-soaked doctor diagnoses a swaggering young yakuza with tuberculosis, forging an uneasy bond that’s tested when the gangster’s ruthless former boss returns and drags him back toward the swampy underworld he can’t escape.', 'In postwar Tokyo, a blunt, alcohol-soaked doctor diagnoses a swaggering young yakuza with tuberculosis, forging an uneasy bond that’s tested when the gangster’s ruthless former boss returns and drags him back toward the swampy underworld he can’t escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kETXBSr6kawvtWJioacJjOofF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25858'),
  ('365469867272418473', 'Drunken Master', 1978, 'Action, Comedy', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Raymond Chang, Hsiao Lung', 'Hsiao Lung, Ng See-Yuen', 'Jackie Chan, Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Hwang Jang-Lee, Dean Shek Tin, Hsu Hsia, Linda Lin Ying, Lam Kau, Max Lee Chiu-Chun', 'PG-13', 'After getting into trouble, a mischievous young man is sent to train under a brutal, but slovenly old beggar, who teaches him the secret of the Drunken Fist.', 'After getting into trouble, a mischievous young man is sent to train under a brutal, but slovenly old beggar, who teaches him the secret of the Drunken Fist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf43J2SH8tECZVl9N5n0Q6Ckche.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11230'),
  ('315550502563836584', 'Drunken Master III', 1994, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan, Wan Cheun-Fat', 'Stanley Siu Wing', 'Andy Lau, Michele Reis, Willie Chi Tin-Sang, Simon Yam, Lau Kar-Leung, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, William Ho', null, 'Set around the turn of the century in China, the White Lotus Society plots to put the next Emperor on the throne. To do this they want their protege to marry the Princess Sun Yu who possesses an important jade ring. They dispatch Yueng Kwan to fetch her. However, Yueng Kwan is a patriot, working for the revolutionary forces of Sun Yat Sen. He abducts Sun Yu and finds refuge with the father of the future hero Wong Fei Hung.', 'Set around the turn of the century in China, the White Lotus Society plots to put the next Emperor on the throne. To do this they want their protege to marry the Princess Sun Yu who possesses an important jade ring. They dispatch Yueng Kwan to fetch her. However, Yueng Kwan is a patriot, working for the revolutionary forces of Sun Yat Sen. He abducts Sun Yu and finds refuge with the father of the future hero Wong Fei Hung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGJECMJTUBU9OWBFBdy9oUbL60Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66018'),
  ('1030939351014622754', 'Drunken Monkey', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Wong Po-Man, Benny Wong Chung-Yam', 'Keith Lee Pak-Ling', 'Wu Jing, Sammy Lau, Shannon Yao, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Li Haitao, Lau Kar-Leung, Chi Kuan-Chun, Chang Chen-Huan', null, 'China, the early 1930''s: martial arts master Wen Biao discovers that his brother has been using their security company for illegal activities. A confrontation between the brothers leaves Web Biao missing and presumed dead.', 'China, the early 1930''s: martial arts master Wen Biao discovers that his brother has been using their security company for illegal activities. A confrontation between the brothers leaves Web Biao missing and presumed dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOpCVCE016vcOre0muJzEbD12JB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39751'),
  ('261034589889199884', 'Drunken Tai Chi', 1984, 'Action, Comedy', 'Yuen Woo-Ping', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Brandy Yuen Jan-Yeung', 'Donnie Yen, Yuen Cheung-Yan, Lydia Shum Tin-Ha, Yuen Yat-Choh, Don Wong Tao, Li Kun, Yuen Shun-Yi, Mandy Chan Chi-Man', null, 'A spoiled young man - on the run from a ruthless killer - hooks up with a puppeteer and his wife who are masters of the art of tai chi; the only style that can defeat the killer.', 'A spoiled young man - on the run from a ruthless killer - hooks up with a puppeteer and his wife who are masters of the art of tai chi; the only style that can defeat the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7cVepUk1MOS6fj4eW6Pf2fj7vR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25425'),
  ('251379711325838392', 'Dry', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Elisabetta Boni, Anna Elisabetta Conti, Tom Karumathy', 'Francesca Archibugi, Paolo Giordano, Francesco Piccolo', 'Silvio Orlando, Monica Bellucci, Valerio Mastandrea, Claudia Pandolfi, Tommaso Ragno, Sara Serraiocco, Max Tortora, Emma Fasano', null, 'In Rome it hasn’t rained for three years and the lack of water is overturning rules and habits. Through the city dying of thirst and prohibitions moves a chorus of people, young and old, marginalised and successful, victims and profiteers. Their lives are linked in a single design, while each seeks his or her deliverance.', 'In Rome it hasn’t rained for three years and the lack of water is overturning rules and habits. Through the city dying of thirst and prohibitions moves a chorus of people, young and old, marginalised and successful, victims and profiteers. Their lives are linked in a single design, while each seeks his or her deliverance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pl2qRaUvJ9iKiNROyKi5a9l31E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797840'),
  ('640348913278525349', 'Dry Cleaning', 1997, 'Drama', 'Anne Fontaine, Caroline Champetier, Béatrice Humbert', 'Anne Fontaine, Gilles Taurand', 'Miou-Miou, Charles Berling, Stanislas Merhar, Mathilde Seigner, Nanou Meister, Noé Pflieger, Michel Bompoil, Christopher King', null, 'A bored couple takes in a young man who turns their lives inside out.', 'A bored couple takes in a young man who turns their lives inside out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2W2lPtTcjv5AAv2885T2JLMKlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6187'),
  ('468308420069045383', 'Dry Martina', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Che Sandoval, Bárbara Montaña, Pelayo Lira', 'Che Sandoval', 'Antonella Costa, Dindi Jane, Pedro Campos, Patricio Contreras, Álvaro Espinoza, Martín Garabal, Joaquin Fernández, Sergio Nicloux', null, 'Martina was a famous singer in Argentina during the late 90s, who''s become completely frigid and disenchanted with love. The arrival of a so-called sister, alongside her attractive boyfriend, compel Martina to go to Chile with one objective in mind: getting back her libido.', 'Martina was a famous singer in Argentina during the late 90s, who''s become completely frigid and disenchanted with love. The arrival of a so-called sister, alongside her attractive boyfriend, compel Martina to go to Chile with one objective in mind: getting back her libido.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gA6nTGlDtFdRtGEYHSEBzSJ1Xzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510338'),
  ('963496707928636207', 'Dry Movie', 2005, 'Drama', 'Lírio Ferreira, Murilo Salles, Francisco Accioly', 'Lírio Ferreira, Hilton Lacerda, Eduardo Nunes', 'Guilherme Weber, Giulia Gam, José Dumont, Luiz Carlos Vasconcelos, Mariana Lima, Selton Mello, Gustavo Falcão, Matheus Nachtergaele', null, 'Weatherman from a TV network goes back to his hometown, Vale da Rocha, a place in Northeast Brazil, devastated by the drought. He is forced to face the geographic elements and his own memories.', 'Weatherman from a TV network goes back to his hometown, Vale da Rocha, a place in Northeast Brazil, devastated by the drought. He is forced to face the geographic elements and his own memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM1YcgSPa7twIoUutn890uYgowv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40859'),
  ('715080488635312192', 'Dry Season', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun', 'Ali Barkai, Youssouf Djaoro, Aziza Hisseine, Aziza Hisseine, Khayar Oumar Defallah, Djibril Ibrahim, Hadje Fatime N''Goua, Garba Issa', null, 'Chad, 2006. After a forty-year civil war, the radio announces the government has just amnestied the war criminals. Outraged by the news, Gumar Abatcha orders his grandson Atim, a sixteen-year-old youth, to trace the man who killed his father and to execute him. Atim obeys him and, armed with his father''s own gun, he goes in search of Nassara, the man who made him an orphan. It does not take long before he finds him. Nassara, who now goes straight, is married, goes to the mosque and owns a small bakery. After some hesitation Atim offers him his services as an apprentice. He is hired then it will be easy for him to gun down the murderer of his father. At least, that is what he thinks...', 'Chad, 2006. After a forty-year civil war, the radio announces the government has just amnestied the war criminals. Outraged by the news, Gumar Abatcha orders his grandson Atim, a sixteen-year-old youth, to trace the man who killed his father and to execute him. Atim obeys him and, armed with his father''s own gun, he goes in search of Nassara, the man who made him an orphan. It does not take long before he finds him. Nassara, who now goes straight, is married, goes to the mosque and owns a small bakery. After some hesitation Atim offers him his services as an apprentice. He is hired then it will be easy for him to gun down the murderer of his father. At least, that is what he thinks...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IVVcLMQn9Ur3hjerOF5EfWoNMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24171'),
  ('377135222223734715', 'Dry Summer', 1963, 'Drama, Crime', 'Metin Erksan, Ali Uğur, Ahmet Yamaci', 'Metin Erksan, Kemal İnci, Ismet Soydan', 'Hülya Koçyiğit, Erol Taş, Ulvi Doğan, Hakkı Haktan, Yavuz Yalınkılıç, Zeki Tüney, Niyazi Er, Ercan Yazgan', null, 'A scheming tobacco farmer sets out to ruin his competition by diverting the local water to his own property.', 'A scheming tobacco farmer sets out to ruin his competition by diverting the local water to his own property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNwL6lvvDInVMteiUTKTf8a0jz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58897'),
  ('1063573124660810329', 'Dry Wind', 2020, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Daniel Nolasco, Larry Machado, Larissa Fernandes', 'Daniel Nolasco', 'Leandro Faria Lelo, Allan Jacinto Santana, Renata Carvalho, Rafael Teóphilo, Mel Gonçalves, Del Neto, Larissa Sisterolli, Guilhotina Guinle', 'NR', 'The area around Catalan in Brazil’s state of Goiás is dry, very dry. Sandro’s life here is somewhat monotonous. He works in a fertiliser factory, goes swimming and spends his evenings doing jigsaw puzzles of landscapes. When Maicon, a man straight out of a Tom of Finland illustration, shows up in their small town and flirts with Ricardo, Sandro’s burgeoning feelings of jealousy set a change in motion.', 'The area around Catalan in Brazil’s state of Goiás is dry, very dry. Sandro’s life here is somewhat monotonous. He works in a fertiliser factory, goes swimming and spends his evenings doing jigsaw puzzles of landscapes. When Maicon, a man straight out of a Tom of Finland illustration, shows up in their small town and flirts with Ricardo, Sandro’s burgeoning feelings of jealousy set a change in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVp8VwxXVlq2z62PR5sqv4YkGHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665783'),
  ('661123982946903642', 'DS-70 nevyjíždí', 1951, 'Drama', 'Martin Frič, Václav Hanuš, Vladimír Slavínský', 'Vladimír Borský, Otakar Kirchner', 'Rudolf Deyl, L. H. Struna, Robert Vrchota, Rudolf Široký, Vlasta Fabianová, Vlasta Fialová, Felix le Breux, J. O. Martin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 'tmdb:movie:788985'),
  ('1115779305512093494', 'Dschugaswili from Georgia', 1984, null, 'Terese Panoutsopoulos', null, null, null, 'Forced collectivism, famines, errors and mistakes mark Stalin´s ruthless rise to dictorial power and only increase his madness until he even declares a chicken to be an English spy that should be liquidated.', 'Forced collectivism, famines, errors and mistakes mark Stalin´s ruthless rise to dictorial power and only increase his madness until he even declares a chicken to be an English spy that should be liquidated.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1075378'),
  ('387889153749705459', 'DSP', 2022, 'Action, Drama', 'Ponram, Dinesh Krishnan B., Venkatesh S', 'Ponram', 'Vijay Sethupathi, Anukreethy Vas, Prabhakar, Pugazh, Ilavarasu, G. Gnanasambandam, Singampuli, Shivani Narayanan', null, 'A flower seller''s son ends up in a tussle with a ruthless rowdy in Dindigul, forcing him to become a policeman and fight the odds.', 'A flower seller''s son ends up in a tussle with a ruthless rowdy in Dindigul, forcing him to become a policeman and fight the odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9U4gIzmu60puzuk59C0viwsHhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806920'),
