  ('1053052487264638549', 'Du Barry Was a Lady', 1943, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Roy Del Ruth, Karl Freund', 'Irving Brecher', 'Red Skelton, Lucille Ball, Gene Kelly, Virginia O''Brien, Rags Ragland, Zero Mostel, Tommy Dorsey, Donald Meek', null, 'Hat check man Louis Blore is in love with nightclub star May Daly. May, however, is in love with a poor dancer but wants to marry for money. When Louis wins the Irish Sweepstakes, he asks May to marry him and she accepts even though she doesn''t love him. Soon after, Louis has an accident and gets knocked on the head, where he dreams that he''s King Louis XV pursuing the infamous Madame Du Barry.', 'Hat check man Louis Blore is in love with nightclub star May Daly. May, however, is in love with a poor dancer but wants to marry for money. When Louis wins the Irish Sweepstakes, he asks May to marry him and she accepts even though she doesn''t love him. Soon after, Louis has an accident and gets knocked on the head, where he dreams that he''s King Louis XV pursuing the infamous Madame Du Barry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYeTXHxdWw1UzR62zLE9n88N2dZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43508'),
  ('948594646576051743', 'Dual', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Riley Stearns, Michael Ragen, Johanna Ala-Karvia', 'Riley Stearns', 'Karen Gillan, Aaron Paul, Beulah Koale, Theo James, Elina Jackson, Maija Paunio, Rea Lest-Liik, Sanna-June Hyde', 'R', 'A terminally ill woman opts for a cloning procedure to ease her loss on her friends and family. When she makes a miraculous recovery, her attempts to have her clone decommissioned fail and lead to a court-mandated duel to the death.', 'A terminally ill woman opts for a cloning procedure to ease her loss on her friends and family. When she makes a miraculous recovery, her attempts to have her clone decommissioned fail and lead to a court-mandated duel to the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDEse2TQRiyfhdlusSXBdkDOQRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698128'),
  ('1112327332838059065', 'Dual Action', 2026, 'Short, Crime, Fantasy', 'Usher Morgan', 'Mark Flynn', 'Joel Bernard, Joe Trombino, Elyse Price, Skye Stracke', 'R', 'Dual Action is a short story about a dying gangster, confronted by two mysterious figures in his final moments. It''s sort of a Reservoir Dogs meets Christmas Carol type of story, where the main character is forced to face his own mortality and define the meaning of life. He''s tormented by guilt and repentance and must come to term with who he really is. It''s a fun twist on the gangster genre.', 'Dual Action is a short story about a dying gangster, confronted by two mysterious figures in his final moments. It''s sort of a Reservoir Dogs meets Christmas Carol type of story, where the main character is forced to face his own mortality and define the meaning of life. He''s tormented by guilt and repentance and must come to term with who he really is. It''s a fun twist on the gangster genre.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1uAVub7xGO5G4E87V11ygfH7f2e.jpg', 'plex:movie:dual-action'),
  ('539845288633329023', 'Dual Alibi', 1947, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alfred Travers, Hans May, Harold V. King', 'Alfred Travers, Stephen Clarkson, Vivienne Adès', 'Herbert Lom, Phyllis Dixey, Terence de Marney, Ronald Frankau, Abraham Sofaer, Eugene Deckers, Cromwell Brothers, Ernst Ulman', null, 'A French PR man and his girlfriend steal a lottery ticket from twin trapeze artists, prompting murder.', 'A French PR man and his girlfriend steal a lottery ticket from twin trapeze artists, prompting murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8ub7ESfDeCWfhyHvrBWUj2h1zv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86894'),
  ('243923452766490661', 'Duane Hopwood', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matt Mulhern, Mauricio Rubinstein', 'Matt Mulhern', 'David Schwimmer, Janeane Garofalo, Judah Friedlander, Chance Kelly, John Krasinski, Susan Lynch, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Vincent Riviezzo', 'R', 'A down-on-his-luck divorced father struggles to get his life and family back together before it''s too late.', 'A down-on-his-luck divorced father struggles to get his life and family back together before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmWM5EcFuLUOrklT0f0wKnNIHwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26907'),
  ('161587953440206235', 'Duas de Mim', 2017, 'Comedy', 'José Roberto Eliezer, Gabriela Carvalho, Zé Bob', 'L.G. Bayão, Carolina Castro', 'Thalita Carauta, Latino, Letícia Lima, Márcio Garcia, Alessandra Maestrini, Luma Costa, Polly Marinho, Maria Gladys', null, 'Suellen (Thalita Carauta) is a cook who works hard to keep her little son, her younger sister and her mother alone. One day, your dreams come true: she splits in two. Her copy, identical physically, has different personality, being much more extroverted and courageous. The idea would be to divide the tasks with the other one, but soon Suellen realizes that the look-alike has plans of its own, and decides to betray the original.', 'Suellen (Thalita Carauta) is a cook who works hard to keep her little son, her younger sister and her mother alone. One day, your dreams come true: she splits in two. Her copy, identical physically, has different personality, being much more extroverted and courageous. The idea would be to divide the tasks with the other one, but soon Suellen realizes that the look-alike has plans of its own, and decides to betray the original.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrs1YqNT9HeZfQaXENohXBvIPWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478397'),
  ('927680401984320679', 'Duchacek Will Fix It', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Karel Lamač, František Urbánek, Jindřich Adolf', 'Václav Wasserman', 'Vlasta Burian, Ladislav Hemmer, Milada Gampeová, Karel Máj, Adina Mandlová, Čeněk Šlégl, Jaroslav Marvan, Jiřina Sedláčková', null, 'Mr. Ducháček runs the law firm of JUDr. Faukner in a peculiar but completely devoted manner, which manages the financial affairs of the Rispaldic family. The family members treat their lawyer Faukner with condescension, except for their daughter Julia, who secretly loves him. However, no one except Ducháček knows that the squandering family no longer has any money and that JUDr. Faukner is subsidizing it, because he is also secretly in love with Julia.', 'Mr. Ducháček runs the law firm of JUDr. Faukner in a peculiar but completely devoted manner, which manages the financial affairs of the Rispaldic family. The family members treat their lawyer Faukner with condescension, except for their daughter Julia, who secretly loves him. However, no one except Ducháček knows that the squandering family no longer has any money and that JUDr. Faukner is subsidizing it, because he is also secretly in love with Julia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlIfk0MyLOgoy74Gs2uooxwUkzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159288'),
  ('222856445533245390', 'Duchess', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Neil Marshall, Simon Rowling', 'Charlotte Kirk, Neil Marshall', 'Charlotte Kirk, Philip Winchester, Colm Meaney, Hoji Fortuna, Stephanie Beacham, Sean Pertwee, Colin Egglesfield, Pau Poch', 'R', 'A tough, working-class petty criminal is drawn into the treacherous world of diamond smuggling and morphs into an anti-heroine to be reckoned with in the murky underworld.', 'A tough, working-class petty criminal is drawn into the treacherous world of diamond smuggling and morphs into an anti-heroine to be reckoned with in the murky underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TR7JlJbKucNSq84rkbnjLd1JB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005076'),
  ('179197722885396616', 'Duck Amuck', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'The short-tempered Daffy Duck must improvise madly as the backgrounds, his costumes, the soundtrack, even his physical form, shifts and changes at the whim of the animator.', 'The short-tempered Daffy Duck must improvise madly as the backgrounds, his costumes, the soundtrack, even his physical form, shifts and changes at the whim of the animator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRZYLCncLa2mzE59qY38McDlFdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53210'),
  ('690914588390509572', 'Duck and Cover', 1952, 'Animation, Family', 'Anthony Rizzo, Drummond Drury', 'Raymond J. Mauer', 'Robert Middleton', null, 'An instructional short aimed at school-aged children of the early 1950s that combines animation and live-action footage with voice-over narration to explain what to do to increase their chances of surviving the blast from an atomic bomb.', 'An instructional short aimed at school-aged children of the early 1950s that combines animation and live-action footage with voice-over narration to explain what to do to increase their chances of surviving the blast from an atomic bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOvHXalffspkXAPIOUiMcxfvomc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52230'),
  ('446322397985985642', 'Duck Butter', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Miguel Arteta, Hillary Spera, Michelle West', 'Miguel Arteta, Alia Shawkat', 'Alia Shawkat, Laia Costa, Mae Whitman, Hong Chau, Kate Berlant, Kumail Nanjiani, Lindsay Burdge, Mark Duplass', 'NR', 'Dissatisfied with the dishonesty they see in dating, strangers Naima and Sergio make a pact to spend 24 straight hours together in an attempt to fast forward their relationship.', 'Dissatisfied with the dishonesty they see in dating, strangers Naima and Sergio make a pact to spend 24 straight hours together in an attempt to fast forward their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhO5WFmf17ckCKwy6l3k9tt0z9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499319'),
