  ('96981824779772570', 'Duck Duck Goose', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Christopher Jenkins', 'Rob Muir, Christopher Jenkins, Tegan West', 'Jim Gaffigan, Zendaya, Lance Lim, Greg Proops, Natasha Leggero, Stephen Fry, Craig Ferguson, Carl Reiner', 'PG', 'After he’s grounded by an injury, a high-flying bachelor is saddled with two wide-eyed orphans as they come face-to-face with the dangers and beauty of the outside world.', 'After he’s grounded by an injury, a high-flying bachelor is saddled with two wide-eyed orphans as they come face-to-face with the dangers and beauty of the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XURM64DYa9DpS70I2rM4suvq1s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375107'),
  ('839486307052559573', 'Duck in Orange Sauce', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Luciano Salce, Franco Di Giacomo, Stefano Rolla', 'Bernardino Zapponi', 'Monica Vitti, Ugo Tognazzi, Barbara Bouchet, John Richardson, Sabina De Guida, Antonio Allocca, Angelo Boscariol, Tom Felleghy', null, 'When his wife wants a divorce -- in preference of a romantic Frenchman -- husband Livio seemingly accepts. But when he sets up a last weekend together with his secretary and his wife''s lover, the trip turns out to be part of an elaborate plan to win his wife back.', 'When his wife wants a divorce -- in preference of a romantic Frenchman -- husband Livio seemingly accepts. But when he sets up a last weekend together with his secretary and his wife''s lover, the trip turns out to be part of an elaborate plan to win his wife back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHUJmPPPrzmPjtM5cUYUXHyRwbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64034'),
  ('980673958273389407', 'Duck Pimples', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher, June Foray, Doodles Weaver', 'NR', 'Donald has an unpleasant evening when a mysterious book salesman comes to his door then disappears leaving Donald with a collection of whodunnit novels. He reads one and gets so fully involved in it that it appears that the characters are actually coming out of the book and into his living room getting him involved in the murder caper. Finally the author of the book, J. Harold King, steps forth and claims Donald innocent. The characters return to the novel from whence they came leaving Donald wondering if it was really just his "imagination"', 'Donald has an unpleasant evening when a mysterious book salesman comes to his door then disappears leaving Donald with a collection of whodunnit novels. He reads one and gets so fully involved in it that it appears that the characters are actually coming out of the book and into his living room getting him involved in the murder caper. Finally the author of the book, J. Harold King, steps forth and claims Donald innocent. The characters return to the novel from whence they came leaving Donald wondering if it was really just his "imagination"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mWurpmJyRHjihe9u0jVuvfH3HF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55541'),
  ('603560892637528369', 'Duck Season', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fernando Eimbcke, Alexis Zabé', 'Fernando Eimbcke, Paula Markovitch', 'Daniel Miranda, Diego Cataño, Danny Perea, Enrique Arreola, Carolina Politi', null, 'Flama and Moko are fourteen years old; they have been best friends since they were kids. They have everything they need to survive yet another boring Sunday: an apartment without parents, videogames, porn magazines, soft drinks and pizza delivery.', 'Flama and Moko are fourteen years old; they have been best friends since they were kids. They have everything they need to survive yet another boring Sunday: an apartment without parents, videogames, porn magazines, soft drinks and pizza delivery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9sDCVHOxetgCWnn85DwhPtPJQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34207'),
  ('1082246461031348000', 'Duck Soup', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Madeline Hurlock, Bob Kortman, William Courtright, Charlie Hall, James A. Marcus, William Austin', 'NR', 'Fleeing a group of forest rangers, who are rounding up tramps to serve as firefighters, they take refuge in a mansion. The owner has gone on vacation and the servants are away, so Hardy pretends to be the owner and offers to rent the house to an English couple. Hardy gets Laurel to pose as the maid. Unfortunately, the owner returns and tells the would-be renters that he owns the house; Laurel and Hardy then flee again and are caught by the rangers and forced to fight wildfires.', 'Fleeing a group of forest rangers, who are rounding up tramps to serve as firefighters, they take refuge in a mansion. The owner has gone on vacation and the servants are away, so Hardy pretends to be the owner and offers to rent the house to an English couple. Hardy gets Laurel to pose as the maid. Unfortunately, the owner returns and tells the would-be renters that he owns the house; Laurel and Hardy then flee again and are caught by the rangers and forced to fight wildfires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ln7zgsn2yOqlrOy1MbKVAYBWHbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50897'),
