  ('831630563974352856', 'DuckTales: The Movie - Treasure of the Lost Lamp', 1990, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Bob Hathcock', 'Alan Burnett', 'Alan Young, Terence McGovern, Russi Taylor, Richard Libertini, Christopher Lloyd, June Foray, Chuck McCann, Joan Gerber', 'G', 'With his nephews and niece, everyone''s favorite rich uncle, Scrooge McDuck, treks from his mansion home in Duckburg in search of the long-lost loot of the thief Collie Baba. But finding the goods isn''t quite what it''s "quacked" up to be! Their thrilling adventure leads to comical chaos, magical mayhem, and a lesson about what is far more valuable than money, gold and jewels.', 'With his nephews and niece, everyone''s favorite rich uncle, Scrooge McDuck, treks from his mansion home in Duckburg in search of the long-lost loot of the thief Collie Baba. But finding the goods isn''t quite what it''s "quacked" up to be! Their thrilling adventure leads to comical chaos, magical mayhem, and a lesson about what is far more valuable than money, gold and jewels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXya1Z9SC51kNOHsFxRqL1GIBua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10837'),
