  ('621450306558692352', 'Dudes', 1987, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Penelope Spheeris, Dan Bradley, Robert Richardson', 'Randall Jahnson', 'Jon Cryer, Daniel Roebuck, Catherine Mary Stewart, Flea, Lee Ving, Billy Ray Sharkey, Glenn Withrow, Michael Melvin', 'R', 'Two punks from the big city, traveling across the country in a Volkswagen bug, embrace the western ethos when they must take revenge against a group of rednecks for killing their friend in this lighthearted road movie. Along the way, they enlist the help of a young woman who runs a wrecking service.', 'Two punks from the big city, traveling across the country in a Volkswagen bug, embrace the western ethos when they must take revenge against a group of rednecks for killing their friend in this lighthearted road movie. Along the way, they enlist the help of a young woman who runs a wrecking service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NThzQWYfuVbhq6qq2TxWnbVOZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26574'),
  ('155973176308885903', 'Dudes!', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Radivoje ''Raša'' Andrić, Dušan Joksimović', 'Srđa Anđelić', 'Boris Milivojević, Sergej Trifunović, Maja Mandžuka, Milica Vujović, Zoran Cvijanović, Nebojša Glogovac, Nikola Đuričko, Dušan Milašinović', null, 'Urban comedy, happening during a night in Belgrade. Mare, Pop and Gojko are three friends who grew up together. Mare and Pop have always been musicians, while Gojko (who was harassed by them in school and nicknamed ''Sissy'') became a ''guy in suit'', boss of his own club and recording studio.', 'Urban comedy, happening during a night in Belgrade. Mare, Pop and Gojko are three friends who grew up together. Mare and Pop have always been musicians, while Gojko (who was harassed by them in school and nicknamed ''Sissy'') became a ''guy in suit'', boss of his own club and recording studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP8U8NTstM1qC94fDwPPjt9DRDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24457'),
  ('366877621611744772', 'Dudley Do-Right', 1999, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Hugh Wilson, Louis D''Esposito, Brentan Harron', 'Hugh Wilson', 'Brendan Fraser, Sarah Jessica Parker, Alfred Molina, Eric Idle, Robert Prosky, Alex Rocco, Jack Kehler, Louis Mustillo', 'PG', 'Royal Canadian Mountie Dudley Do-right is busy keeping the peace in his small mountain town when his old rival, Snidely Whiplash, comes up with a plot to buy all the property in town, then start a phony gold rush by seeding the river with gold nuggets.', 'Royal Canadian Mountie Dudley Do-right is busy keeping the peace in his small mountain town when his old rival, Snidely Whiplash, comes up with a plot to buy all the property in town, then start a phony gold rush by seeding the river with gold nuggets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LP5BieqdFNlCFjxsvaA3d6hGGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17709'),
  ('906924339560006442', 'Due Date', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Todd Phillips, Allan Graf, Lawrence Sher', 'Todd Phillips, Alan R. Cohen, Alan Freedland', 'Robert Downey Jr., Zach Galifianakis, Michelle Monaghan, Jamie Foxx, Juliette Lewis, Danny McBride, RZA, Matt Walsh', 'R', 'Peter Highman must scramble across the US in five days to be present for the birth of his first child. He gets off to a bad start when his wallet and luggage are stolen, and put on the ''no-fly'' list. Peter embarks on a terrifying journey when he accepts a ride from an actor.', 'Peter Highman must scramble across the US in five days to be present for the birth of his first child. He gets off to a bad start when his wallet and luggage are stolen, and put on the ''no-fly'' list. Peter embarks on a terrifying journey when he accepts a ride from an actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBxWS09pOOyXZ0dcnqfqqCAQGan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41733'),
