  ('294997169192910770', 'Duel for Gold', 1971, 'Action', 'Chor Yuen, Wu Cho-Hua', 'Ni Kuang', 'Ivy Ling Po, Wang Ping, Chin Han, Lo Lieh, Richard Chan Chun, Fan Mei-Sheng, Lee Pang-Fei, Tsung Hua', null, 'Soon-to-be legendary director Chu Yuan had just joined the Shaw Brothers when he helmed this thriller of bickering bandits. Audiences loved watching three pairs of cunning male and female crooks trying to steal a million gold taels from the Fu Lai Treasury House...not knowing that one of them is actually an undercover hero. Even without him, there''s no honor amongst thieves, so the double-crosses and deadly duels come fast and furious, all choreographed by Hsu Erh-niu.', 'Soon-to-be legendary director Chu Yuan had just joined the Shaw Brothers when he helmed this thriller of bickering bandits. Audiences loved watching three pairs of cunning male and female crooks trying to steal a million gold taels from the Fu Lai Treasury House...not knowing that one of them is actually an undercover hero. Even without him, there''s no honor amongst thieves, so the double-crosses and deadly duels come fast and furious, all choreographed by Hsu Erh-niu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tktHXzhJpolCOjn83AeG91sbhmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66019'),
  ('311322515813999666', 'Duel in the Sun', 1946, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Otto Brower, William Dieterle, Josef von Sternberg', 'Ben Hecht', 'Jennifer Jones, Joseph Cotten, Gregory Peck, Lionel Barrymore, Herbert Marshall, Lillian Gish, Walter Huston, Charles Bickford', null, 'Beautiful half-breed Pearl Chavez becomes the ward of her dead father''s first love and finds herself torn between her sons, one good and the other bad.', 'Beautiful half-breed Pearl Chavez becomes the ward of her dead father''s first love and finds herself torn between her sons, one good and the other bad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dW479xuDWrcuFuxr7yfoReztlzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32275'),
  ('678324246496622224', 'Duel of Fists', 1971, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To, Lee Kwok-Keung', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Ching Li, Wong Chung, Chan Sing, Canong Daech, Ku Feng, Pawana Chanajit', null, 'Two men, one a businessman skilled in Kung Fu, the other a kickboxer discover they are brothers, and together, both in and out of the ring, they must face a crime syndicate. One of the first films to use the martial art of Muay Thai.', 'Two men, one a businessman skilled in Kung Fu, the other a kickboxer discover they are brothers, and together, both in and out of the ring, they must face a crime syndicate. One of the first films to use the martial art of Muay Thai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nox5QR9vh1WYvBK2xMl89Tq6PCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185885'),
  ('862913231569854651', 'Duel on the Mississippi', 1955, 'Drama, Western', 'William Castle, Henry Freulich, Irving J. Moore', 'Gerald Drayson Adams', 'Lex Barker, Patricia Medina, Warren Stevens, Craig Stevens, John Dehner, Celia Lovsky, Ian Keith, Chris Alcaide', null, 'In bustling era of 19th-century Louisiana, sugar is as valuable as gold, and pirates like Lili Scarlet will do anything to get it. After robbing Jules Tulane’s estate of his crop, Scarlet takes over Tulane’s land debt and forces him to pay or go to prison. In exchange for postponing his debt, Scarlet allows Tulane’s son, André, to work as her servant. When André and Scarlet fall in love, it leads to jealous rage from Scarlet’s former paramour, expert swordsman Hugo — and when Hugo looks to raid the Tulane estate again, it is up to André and Scarlet to take him down and save the estate.', 'In bustling era of 19th-century Louisiana, sugar is as valuable as gold, and pirates like Lili Scarlet will do anything to get it. After robbing Jules Tulane’s estate of his crop, Scarlet takes over Tulane’s land debt and forces him to pay or go to prison. In exchange for postponing his debt, Scarlet allows Tulane’s son, André, to work as her servant. When André and Scarlet fall in love, it leads to jealous rage from Scarlet’s former paramour, expert swordsman Hugo — and when Hugo looks to raid the Tulane estate again, it is up to André and Scarlet to take him down and save the estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp1s7Ew0UJMH3myXX5tncclmmUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183996'),
  ('606444880047646106', 'Duel Personality', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'June Foray, Mel Blanc', null, 'Each having submitted his challenge card to the other, Tom and Jerry meet in a field to duel, using as weapons swords, pistols, bows and arrows, cannons and slingshots.', 'Each having submitted his challenge card to the other, Tom and Jerry meet in a field to duel, using as weapons swords, pistols, bows and arrows, cannons and slingshots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znO2QYaoruWSQpNanHD5lufi3FK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363193'),
  ('480126473811820005', 'Duel to the Death', 1983, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lee Hyeong-pyo, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Danny Lee Yau-Tong', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, David Lai Tai-Wai, Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Flora Cheong-Leen, Eddy Ko Hung, Paul Chang Chung, Kwon Yeong-Moon, Yeung Chak-Lam, Hon Kwok-Choi', null, 'In 16th century, during the Ming dynasty era, every ten years the greatest swordsman from Japan faces the greatest swordsman from China in a duel to the death for their nation''s honor. As a duel approaches, Chinese champion Bo Ching-Wan and Japanese champion Miyamoto uncover a plot to rig the fight.', 'In 16th century, during the Ming dynasty era, every ten years the greatest swordsman from Japan faces the greatest swordsman from China in a duel to the death for their nation''s honor. As a duel approaches, Chinese champion Bo Ching-Wan and Japanese champion Miyamoto uncover a plot to rig the fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6diqDVVpvagC3KPZctCipMcmgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50572'),
  ('1047186396029400347', 'Duelist', 2005, 'Action', 'Lee Myung-se, Hwang Ki-suk, Shin Kyung-man', 'Lee Hae-Jyung, Lee Myung-se', 'Ha Ji-won, Gang Dong-won, Ahn Sung-ki, Song Young-chang, Yun Ju-sang, Kim Bo-yeon, Lee Han-wi, Kim Jung-tae', null, 'Detective Nam-soon goes undercover with her partner Detective Ahn to investigate the counterfeit money. She discovers that one loyal henchman, Sad Eyes, a beautiful swordsman with a pale, blank face, is related to the truth. Nam-soon and Sad Eyes confront each other in a series of duels and become confused between love and obligation to duty.', 'Detective Nam-soon goes undercover with her partner Detective Ahn to investigate the counterfeit money. She discovers that one loyal henchman, Sad Eyes, a beautiful swordsman with a pale, blank face, is related to the truth. Nam-soon and Sad Eyes confront each other in a series of duels and become confused between love and obligation to duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AV1o7PKrzFkfYchXrpWUwdIoaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26138'),
  ('912117692282759483', 'Duelle (Une Quarantaine)', 1976, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Jacques Rivette, William Lubtchansky', 'Jacques Rivette, Eduardo de Gregorio, Marilù Parolini', 'Juliet Berto, Bulle Ogier, Hermine Karagheuz, Nicole Garcia, Claire Nadeau, Jean Babilée, Elisabeth Wiener, Jean Wiener', null, 'Two enigmatic women separately arrive in Paris, both with a hidden but shared motive. As they navigate the city and their search progresses, various characters become entangled in a conflict, which increasingly comes to take a fantastical turn. These characters too, driven by their own desires, strive for their own goals in the struggle. From a Paris, drenched in an otherworldly ambiance, a tale of desire and power emerges through mystery and secrets.', 'Two enigmatic women separately arrive in Paris, both with a hidden but shared motive. As they navigate the city and their search progresses, various characters become entangled in a conflict, which increasingly comes to take a fantastical turn. These characters too, driven by their own desires, strive for their own goals in the struggle. From a Paris, drenched in an otherworldly ambiance, a tale of desire and power emerges through mystery and secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYaFwG0MWtPqUO93eyrd3sdgiHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65707'),
  ('1002854882389692756', 'Duet for Cannibals', 1969, 'Drama', 'Susan Sontag', 'Susan Sontag', 'Lars Ekborg, Gösta Ekman, Adriana Asti, Agneta Ekmanner, Britta Brunius, Stig Engström, Gunnar ''Knas'' Lindkvist', null, 'Arthur, a university professor, and former political activist, lives in France with Francesca. They decide to hire a young man in order to help the teacher organize his notes. The employee leaves his girlfriend Ingrid and moves in with the couple.', 'Arthur, a university professor, and former political activist, lives in France with Francesca. They decide to hire a young man in order to help the teacher organize his notes. The employee leaves his girlfriend Ingrid and moves in with the couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQrLb8UqLnhkycYeMrBEP8cjZ3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148828'),
  ('332973546845263515', 'Duet for One', 1986, 'Drama', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Alex Thomson, Michael Stevenson', 'Tom Kempinski, Andrei Konchalovsky, Jeremy Lipp', 'Julie Andrews, Alan Bates, Max von Sydow, Rupert Everett, Margaret Courtenay, Cathryn Harrison, Sigfrit Steiner, Liam Neeson', 'R', 'When Stephanie, a famous violinist, contracts multiple sclerosis her life begins to fall apart. Her career ends, her husband leaves her for another woman and her favorite pupil leave the country. Unable to bear all this loss, Stephanie attempts suicide.', 'When Stephanie, a famous violinist, contracts multiple sclerosis her life begins to fall apart. Her career ends, her husband leaves her for another woman and her favorite pupil leave the country. Unable to bear all this loss, Stephanie attempts suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IaUnDjbaeTZQ3dYnTbc45CVWGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52964'),
  ('1060696797143656558', 'Duets', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Bruce Paltrow, Paul Sarossy, Jack Gill', 'John Byrum', 'Maria Bello, Andre Braugher, Paul Giamatti, Huey Lewis, Gwyneth Paltrow, Scott Speedman, Marian Seldes, Kiersten Warren', 'R', 'Duets is a road-trip comedy which revolves around the little known world of karaoke and the whimsical characters who inhabit it. All roads lead to Omaha, site of a national karaoke competition where this motley group of singers and stars come together for a blow-out sing-off.', 'Duets is a road-trip comedy which revolves around the little known world of karaoke and the whimsical characters who inhabit it. All roads lead to Omaha, site of a national karaoke competition where this motley group of singers and stars come together for a blow-out sing-off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isxHRG54S1bz1A1CAlPaAAoh65k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18074'),
  ('1078298638185133959', 'Duffer', 1972, 'Drama, Horror', 'Joseph Despins, William Dumaresq', 'William Dumaresq', 'William Dumaresq, Kit Gleave, Erna May, Lisa Doran, Marcelle MacHardie, Bogomir Rampre, Anthony Lambert, Traute Kraus', null, 'Duffer, an intense and bizarre study of obsession that is by turns beautiful and disturbing, tells the story of a teenage boy torn between the womanly charms of a kindly prostitute, and the sadistic attentions of an older man. Both whimsical and disturbing, with a quirky sense of the grotesque, Duffer is a film that defies easy comparison.', 'Duffer, an intense and bizarre study of obsession that is by turns beautiful and disturbing, tells the story of a teenage boy torn between the womanly charms of a kindly prostitute, and the sadistic attentions of an older man. Both whimsical and disturbing, with a quirky sense of the grotesque, Duffer is a film that defies easy comparison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePnatAOZs3AEfVLpQ6FW4faHEvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59039'),
  ('328856385119751639', 'Duffy', 1968, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Robert Parrish, Michael Frewin, Peter Price', 'Harry Joe Brown Jr., Donald Cammell', 'James Coburn, James Mason, James Fox, Susannah York, John Alderton, Guy Deghy, Carl Duering, Tutte Lemkow', null, 'Half-brothers Stefane and Antony despise their biological father, callous millionaire Charles Calvert. Because Charles refuses to share his wealth with his sons, Stefane and Antony ask hip American thrill-seeker Duffy to help steal the money they believe is their birthright. When Charles decides to move a large portion of his savings from Morocco to France, Duffy has an opportunity to stage a daring burglary attempt at sea.', 'Half-brothers Stefane and Antony despise their biological father, callous millionaire Charles Calvert. Because Charles refuses to share his wealth with his sons, Stefane and Antony ask hip American thrill-seeker Duffy to help steal the money they believe is their birthright. When Charles decides to move a large portion of his savings from Morocco to France, Duffy has an opportunity to stage a daring burglary attempt at sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOFD8jpYZjO0B75kucqJJiC20ze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92798'),
  ('21137569399962174', 'Dug''s Special Mission', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ronnie del Carmen', 'Ronnie del Carmen', 'Bob Peterson, Delroy Lindo, Jerome Ranft, Ed Asner, Jordan Nagai', 'G', 'Dug is sent on foolish missions by Alpha, Beta, and Gamma so they can hunt for the Bird of Paradise Falls by themselves. Dug may find that where he belongs is not where he''s been looking.', 'Dug is sent on foolish missions by Alpha, Beta, and Gamma so they can hunt for the Bird of Paradise Falls by themselves. Dug may find that where he belongs is not where he''s been looking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvK30UQ5cPxGH7ZBVpUhO6DPIM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24589'),
  ('67250440071062490', 'Duisburg - Linea di sangue', 2019, 'TV Movie, Drama, Crime', 'Enzo Monteleone, Stefano Falivene, Flavia Carimini', 'Claudio Fava, Francesco Ranieri Martinotti, Enzo Monteleone', 'Daniele Liotti, Benjamin Sadler, Vincenzo Ferrera, Marina Crialesi, Brenno Placido, Anna Ferzetti, Massimiliano Frateschi, Ester Pantano', null, 'After a brutal mafia-led massacre in the city of Duisburg, two detectives - one Italian, one Gernan - team up to investigate.Based on true events.', 'After a brutal mafia-led massacre in the city of Duisburg, two detectives - one Italian, one Gernan - team up to investigate.Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPlA81QP61aUBQHwLmei5X9EXub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604453'),
  ('156553182287470351', 'Duivinder', 2026, 'Family', 'Rik Sinkeldam, Xander van Doorn', 'Lisanne Hoefnagels, Rik Sinkeldam', 'Dave Frederking, raoul popma, Suzan van Eck, Bram van Kaauwen, Misja van Waterschoot', null, 'A determined 14-year-old girl teams up with her mischievous brother and a champion racing pigeon to reconnect their estranged grandfather with his past, uncovering a heartfelt story of love, loss, and the power of family bonds.', 'A determined 14-year-old girl teams up with her mischievous brother and a champion racing pigeon to reconnect their estranged grandfather with his past, uncovering a heartfelt story of love, loss, and the power of family bonds.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FgrJZ7nbjgzc8DhfnWvwjCvLKpIf.jpg', 'plex:movie:duivinder-2026'),
  ('717278027164395378', 'Dulcima', 1971, 'Drama', 'Frank Nesbitt, Ken Bridgeman, Dickie Bamber', 'Frank Nesbitt', 'Carol White, John Mills, Stuart Wilson, Bernard Lee, Sheila Raynor, Dudley Foster, Cyril Cross, Neil Wilson', 'PG', 'Dulcima, treated as a drudge by her family, becomes a housekeeper to Parker, a curmudgeonly widower living in drunken disarray on a neighbouring farm. When she sees the amount of money he has stashed around the place, Dulcima is happy enough to indulge his growing desire for her, and a strange, yet mutually beneficial, relationship develops. But a handsome young gamekeeper, newly arrived on a nearby estate, also catches Dulcima''s eye...', 'Dulcima, treated as a drudge by her family, becomes a housekeeper to Parker, a curmudgeonly widower living in drunken disarray on a neighbouring farm. When she sees the amount of money he has stashed around the place, Dulcima is happy enough to indulge his growing desire for her, and a strange, yet mutually beneficial, relationship develops. But a handsome young gamekeeper, newly arrived on a nearby estate, also catches Dulcima''s eye...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mYWOVNUSjY83byy3p7e9kmQl2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69973'),
  ('263215576270303055', 'Dulha Mil Gaya', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mudassar Aziz, Kriti Shetty, Dushyant Dabas', 'Neeraj Udhwani', 'Sushmita Sen, Fardeen Khan, Shah Rukh Khan, Ishita Sharma, Johny Lever, Tara Sharma, Suchitra Pillai, Howard Rosemeyer', 'PG', 'A man, the heir to an empire, believes that marriage will ruin a man''s life. Unfortunately, the only way for him to inherit his father''s wealth, is to get married.', 'A man, the heir to an empire, believes that marriage will ruin a man''s life. Unfortunately, the only way for him to inherit his father''s wealth, is to get married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gi6RJ0KEq8929qXHLE0OITyCCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29888'),
  ('277381921827714878', 'Dulhan Hum Le Jayenge', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Dhawan, Harmeet Singh, Manohar Patil', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Salman Khan, Karisma Kapoor, Om Puri, Paresh Rawal, Anupam Kher, Deepak Tijori, Kader Khan, Satish Kaushik', null, 'Sapna is raised by her three uncles, each one of them with a contrasting pursuit in life. She falls in love with Raja, who tries to impress each of her uncles in a different manner.', 'Sapna is raised by her three uncles, each one of them with a contrasting pursuit in life. She falls in love with Raja, who tries to impress each of her uncles in a different manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xC05yY7nXCOMh31NvBQhHO4Qg4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161223'),
  ('216955439134074885', 'Dulhe Raja', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Harmesh Malhotra', 'Rajeev Kaul', 'Govinda, Raveena Tandon, Kader Khan, Prem Chopra, Mohnish Behl', null, 'Poor Raja opens a fast foot restaurant right opposite a five star hotel run by its owner Singhania, earning his wrath. The wealthy hotel owner uses all his influence to remove Raja, but in vain. Things get worse for the wealthy man, when his daughter Kiran wants to marry the poor hotelier. The wealthy man refuses, leading to a confrontation and a condition - which Raja fulfills, he becomes rich virtually overnight, and proposes for the hand of Kiran. The wealthy hotelier reluctantly accepts him as his son-in-law, only to have Kiran elope with a man named Rahul.', 'Poor Raja opens a fast foot restaurant right opposite a five star hotel run by its owner Singhania, earning his wrath. The wealthy hotel owner uses all his influence to remove Raja, but in vain. Things get worse for the wealthy man, when his daughter Kiran wants to marry the poor hotelier. The wealthy man refuses, leading to a confrontation and a condition - which Raja fulfills, he becomes rich virtually overnight, and proposes for the hand of Kiran. The wealthy hotelier reluctantly accepts him as his son-in-law, only to have Kiran elope with a man named Rahul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sr6IDYP0ex53UEmLXA4garBt0o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54971'),
  ('1067683868195015894', 'Dum Laga Ke Haisha', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sharat Katariya, Manu Anand, Shanoo Sharma', null, 'Bhumi Pednekar, Ayushmann Khurrana, Sheeba Chaddha, Sanjay Mishra, Seema Pahwa, Shrikant Verma, Alka Amin, Kumar Sanu', null, 'A slim uneducated guy is pressured into an arranged marriage with an overweight college girl. The mismatched couple is challenged to compete in the annual wife-carrying race.', 'A slim uneducated guy is pressured into an arranged marriage with an overweight college girl. The mismatched couple is challenged to compete in the annual wife-carrying race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9TX2kH1rG7QYEl09flOVg82QdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325138'),
  ('254147477636611540', 'Dum Maaro Dum', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Rohan Sippy, Amit Roy, Varun Lalwani', null, 'Abhishek Bachchan, Bipasha Basu, Rana Daggubati, Prateik Smita Patil, Aditya Pancholi, Anaitha Nair, Govind Namdeo, Vidya Balan', null, 'ACP Vishnu is sent on a mission to investigate and clean the underbelly of Goa. During his investigation, he uncovers a huge racket and discovers the involvement of various politicians.', 'ACP Vishnu is sent on a mission to investigate and clean the underbelly of Goa. During his investigation, he uncovers a huge racket and discovers the involvement of various politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzqKhhSA6ypWwqsnZSwCs7C42sb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63006'),
  ('903299374771057396', 'Duma', 2005, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Carroll Ballard, Werner Maritz', 'Carol Cawthra, Xan Hopcraft, Carol Flint', 'Alex Michaeletos, Campbell Scott, Mary Makhatho, Nthabiseng Kenoshi, Hope Davis, Jennifer Steyn, Eamonn Walker, André Stolz', 'PG', 'An orphaned cheetah becomes the best friend and pet of a young boy living in South Africa.', 'An orphaned cheetah becomes the best friend and pet of a young boy living in South Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opoDxQW9S6SaiP8rY7urw16QVTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15907'),
  ('459480556754655762', 'Dumb and Dumber', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Peter Farrelly, Mark Irwin, J.B. Rogers', 'Bobby Farrelly, Bennett Yellin, Peter Farrelly', 'Jim Carrey, Jeff Daniels, Lauren Holly, Teri Garr, Charles Rocket, Karen Duffy, Mike Starr, Felton Perry', 'PG-13', 'Lloyd and Harry are two men whose stupidity is really indescribable. When Mary, a beautiful woman, loses an important suitcase with money before she leaves for Aspen, the two friends (who have found the suitcase) decide to return it to her. After some "adventures" they finally get to Aspen where, using the lost money they live it up and fight for Mary''s heart.', 'Lloyd and Harry are two men whose stupidity is really indescribable. When Mary, a beautiful woman, loses an important suitcase with money before she leaves for Aspen, the two friends (who have found the suitcase) decide to return it to her. After some "adventures" they finally get to Aspen where, using the lost money they live it up and fight for Mary''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LdpBXiCyGKkR8FGHgjKlphrfUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8467'),
  ('557936796144511325', 'Dumb and Dumber To', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly, J.B. Rogers', 'Bennett Yellin, Sean Anders, John Morris', 'Jim Carrey, Jeff Daniels, Laurie Holden, Rachel Melvin, Kathleen Turner, Rob Riggle, Tembi Locke, Paul Blackthorne', 'PG-13', '20 years since their first adventure, Lloyd and Harry go on a road trip to find Harry''s newly discovered daughter, who was given up for adoption.', '20 years since their first adventure, Lloyd and Harry go on a road trip to find Harry''s newly discovered daughter, who was given up for adoption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvEi0xV7TUkabJGuzulhvbMjrHi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100042'),
  ('88368286308875019', 'Dumb and Dumberer: When Harry Met Lloyd', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Troy Miller, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Robert Brener, Troy Miller', 'Derek Richardson, Eric Christian Olsen, Mimi Rogers, Luis Guzmán, Rachel Nichols, Eugene Levy, Teal Redmann, Shia LaBeouf', 'PG-13', 'This wacky prequel to the 1994 blockbuster goes back to the lame-brained Harry and Lloyd''s days as classmates at a Rhode Island high school, where the unprincipled principal puts the pair in remedial courses as part of a scheme to fleece the school.', 'This wacky prequel to the 1994 blockbuster goes back to the lame-brained Harry and Lloyd''s days as classmates at a Rhode Island high school, where the unprincipled principal puts the pair in remedial courses as part of a scheme to fleece the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxD6P3UXASFCdbrVavceZzgOfI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10152'),
  ('238438495373367602', 'Dumb Bell of the Yukon', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'A snowy scene; Daisy would like a fur coat, so Donald filches a baby bear from its sleeping mother. But the mother awakens and tracks Donald (and her baby) down. Donald uses his own fur coat to disguise himself as a bear cub. The real cub returns, and Donald looks like he might be in trouble, but a jar of honey turns him into the bear''s best friend instead.', 'A snowy scene; Daisy would like a fur coat, so Donald filches a baby bear from its sleeping mother. But the mother awakens and tracks Donald (and her baby) down. Donald uses his own fur coat to disguise himself as a bear cub. The real cub returns, and Donald looks like he might be in trouble, but a jar of honey turns him into the bear''s best friend instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EMTtSbeOa4d0IgOOneAZYxb2Bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55548'),
  ('656311949774407107', 'Dumb But Disciplined', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi', null, 'Jacques Villeret, Michel Aumont, Gérard Lanvin, Daniel Auteuil, Jean Rougerie, Michel Robbe, Hélène Zidi, Catherine Lachens', null, 'Jacques does his military service. Shy, round and clumsy, he is forced to agree to be the driver of a special ambulance.', 'Jacques does his military service. Shy, round and clumsy, he is forced to agree to be the driver of a special ambulance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vavdNDNO1QhkIucrvU3DlJUZ0f0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286658'),
  ('144031745410030138', 'Dumb Money', 2023, 'History, Comedy, Drama', 'Craig Gillespie, Jenn Doun, Zachary Citarella', 'Rebecca Angelo, Lauren Schuker Blum', 'Paul Dano, Shailene Woodley, America Ferrera, Pete Davidson, Seth Rogen, Myha''la, Talia Ryder, Anthony Ramos', 'R', 'Vlogger Keith Gill sinks his life savings into GameStop stock and posts about it. When social media starts blowing up, so do his life and the lives of everyone following him. As a stock tip becomes a movement, everyone gets rich—until the billionaires fight back, and both sides find their worlds turned upside down.', 'Vlogger Keith Gill sinks his life savings into GameStop stock and posts about it. When social media starts blowing up, so do his life and the lives of everyone following him. As a stock tip becomes a movement, everyone gets rich—until the billionaires fight back, and both sides find their worlds turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9u7luSxFKOZgPTB9XHFnPArGdP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792293'),
  ('208654518794885533', 'Dumb Patrol', 1964, 'Animation', 'Gerry Chiniquy', 'John W. Dunn', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Biplane battles over France in World War I between Bugs and Baron (Yosemite) Sam Von Shamm.', 'Biplane battles over France in World War I between Bugs and Baron (Yosemite) Sam Von Shamm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gffQqf6q2haMm0jiydsS9pbtlls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234428'),
  ('948473875160784450', 'Dumb-Hounded', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Tex Avery', 'Rich Hogan', 'Bill Thompson, Frank Graham', null, 'The wolf escapes from prison but can''t get away from police dog Droopy no matter how hard he tries. This is the first cartoon starring Droopy.', 'The wolf escapes from prison but can''t get away from police dog Droopy no matter how hard he tries. This is the first cartoon starring Droopy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0dZSdNTyxzgwK2w5wpNAbPfgxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84762'),
  ('921495715183251170', 'Dumbo', 1941, 'Animation, Family', 'Ben Sharpsteen, Jack Kinney, Bill Roberts', 'Joe Grant, Dick Huemer', 'Edward Brophy, Margaret Wright, Verna Felton, Sarah Selby, Noreen Gammill, Dorothy Scott, Herman Bing, Cliff Edwards', 'G', 'Dumbo is a baby elephant born with over-sized ears and a supreme lack of confidence. But thanks to his even more diminutive buddy Timothy the Mouse, the pint-sized pachyderm learns to surmount all obstacles.', 'Dumbo is a baby elephant born with over-sized ears and a supreme lack of confidence. But thanks to his even more diminutive buddy Timothy the Mouse, the pint-sized pachyderm learns to surmount all obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4x9FmvdJ464Fg7A9XcbYSmxfVw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11360'),
  ('302030840251234911', 'Dumbo', 2019, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Tim Burton, Ben Davis, Chris Lowe', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Colin Farrell, Michael Keaton, Danny DeVito, Eva Green, Nico Parker, Finley Hobbins, Alan Arkin, Roshan Seth', 'PG', 'A young elephant, whose oversized ears enable him to fly, helps save a struggling circus, but when the circus plans a new venture, Dumbo and his friends discover dark secrets beneath its shiny veneer.', 'A young elephant, whose oversized ears enable him to fly, helps save a struggling circus, but when the circus plans a new venture, Dumbo and his friends discover dark secrets beneath its shiny veneer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7XkpLfNH0El2yyDLc4b0KLAKvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329996'),
  ('8880666700839471', 'Dummy', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Greg Pritikin, Horacio Marquínez', 'Greg Pritikin', 'Adrien Brody, Milla Jovovich, Illeana Douglas, Vera Farmiga, Jessica Walter, Ron Leibman, Jared Harris, Helen Hanft', 'R', 'An ex-office worker becomes a ventriloquist, leading to a date with his unemployment counselor; but his quirky family and a gauche female friend may thwart his new career and love life.', 'An ex-office worker becomes a ventriloquist, leading to a date with his unemployment counselor; but his quirky family and a gauche female friend may thwart his new career and love life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ii8h0p26vhp4G6x5Hw86ka3ys45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17906'),
  ('666785240407576950', 'Dumped', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Eloïse Lang, Bastien Blum, Antoine Monod', 'Mette Heeno', 'Miou-Miou, Camille Cottin, Camille Chamoux, Johan Heldenbergh, Olivia Côte, Youssef Hajdi, Elliot Daurat, Thomas Scimeca', null, 'Françoise has just been dumped by her husband for a much younger woman. In order to cheer her up, and to celebrate her 60th birthday, sisters Rose and Alice decide to take their mother to a resort on the tropical island of Reunion so they can relax, work on their tans, and have too many margaritas. But when Rose pays a one-night stand, Thierry, to show her mother a good time, their holiday plans start to unravel.', 'Françoise has just been dumped by her husband for a much younger woman. In order to cheer her up, and to celebrate her 60th birthday, sisters Rose and Alice decide to take their mother to a resort on the tropical island of Reunion so they can relax, work on their tans, and have too many margaritas. But when Rose pays a one-night stand, Thierry, to show her mother a good time, their holiday plans start to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aN5kxWVoYsWemJLm7VroXsOFXQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490445'),
  ('1003541739778497024', 'Dumplin''', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anne Fletcher, Elliot Davis', 'Kristin Hahn', 'Danielle Macdonald, Jennifer Aniston, Odeya Rush, Bex Taylor-Klaus, Maddie Baillio, Harold Perrineau, Luke Benward, Georgie Flores', 'PG-13', 'To prove a point about measuring up and fitting in, Texas teen Willowdean “Dumplin’” Dickson enters a local pageant run by her ex-beauty queen mom.', 'To prove a point about measuring up and fitting in, Texas teen Willowdean “Dumplin’” Dickson enters a local pageant run by her ex-beauty queen mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJAB1HrFUuOf2VkWPaZ4N2DACCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472734'),
  ('506140085135145118', 'Dumplings', 2004, 'Horror', 'Fruit Chan, Christopher Doyle', 'Fruit Chan, Lilian Lee Bik-Wah', 'Miriam Yeung Chin-Wah, Bai Ling, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Pauline Lau, Meme Tian Pu-Jun, Miki Yeung Oi-Gan, Wong Siu-Foon, Wong Sum-Yuen', 'NR', 'Aunt Mei''s famous homemade dumplings provide amazing age-defying qualities popular with middle-aged women. But her latest customer, a fading actress, is determined to find out what the secret ingredient is.', 'Aunt Mei''s famous homemade dumplings provide amazing age-defying qualities popular with middle-aged women. But her latest customer, a fading actress, is determined to find out what the secret ingredient is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97Rb3JJl343B1AVdhQdHohsFBT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9060'),
  ('281884706376866413', 'Dunderklumpen!', 1974, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Music, Fantasy', 'Per Åhlin, Lennart Carlsson, Per Svensson', 'Beppe Wolgers', 'Beppe Wolgers, Jens Wolgers, Halvar Björk, Håkan Serner, Gösta Ekman, Toots Thielemans, Lotten Strömstedt, Sif Ruud', 'G', 'Dunderklumpen lives all alone in the mountains of Jämtland. One Midsummer''s Eve when he feels very lonely he sets off on a journey to find friends.', 'Dunderklumpen lives all alone in the mountains of Jämtland. One Midsummer''s Eve when he feels very lonely he sets off on a journey to find friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9nxy65nhTVAbx7GkK2K62M9bKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13798'),
  ('1008867447971178285', 'Dune', 1984, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'David Lynch, Freddie Francis, José María Alarcón', 'David Lynch', 'Kyle MacLachlan, Francesca Annis, Patrick Stewart, Linda Hunt, José Ferrer, Freddie Jones, Brad Dourif, Richard Jordan', 'PG-13', 'In the year 10,191, the most precious substance in the universe is the spice Melange. The spice extends life. The spice expands consciousness. The spice is vital to space travel. The spice exists on only one planet in the entire universe, the vast desert planet Arrakis, also known as Dune. Its native inhabitants, the Fremen, have long held a prophecy that a man would come, a messiah who would lead them to true freedom.', 'In the year 10,191, the most precious substance in the universe is the spice Melange. The spice extends life. The spice expands consciousness. The spice is vital to space travel. The spice exists on only one planet in the entire universe, the vast desert planet Arrakis, also known as Dune. Its native inhabitants, the Fremen, have long held a prophecy that a man would come, a messiah who would lead them to true freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kJmUCE7mkVJjXa7A0g2rY4IGTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841'),
  ('631299810666383953', 'Dune', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gábor Ulrich', 'Gábor Ulrich', null, null, 'Sounds as witnesses. They blurr into memories, half-dreams, it is undecided if they are real or not. A fluctuation between imagination and reality.', 'Sounds as witnesses. They blurr into memories, half-dreams, it is undecided if they are real or not. A fluctuation between imagination and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CecUPdnnP22wV1NoRFQaG231zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697620'),
  ('374627976990818342', 'Dune', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Borbála Debreczeni, Denis Villeneuve, Lee Tailor', 'Denis Villeneuve, Eric Roth, Jon Spaihts', 'Timothée Chalamet, Rebecca Ferguson, Oscar Isaac, Jason Momoa, Stellan Skarsgård, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Josh Brolin, Javier Bardem', 'PG-13', 'Paul Atreides, a brilliant and gifted young man born into a great destiny beyond his understanding, must travel to the most dangerous planet in the universe to ensure the future of his family and his people. As malevolent forces explode into conflict over the planet''s exclusive supply of the most precious resource in existence-a commodity capable of unlocking humanity''s greatest potential-only those who can conquer their fear will survive.', 'Paul Atreides, a brilliant and gifted young man born into a great destiny beyond his understanding, must travel to the most dangerous planet in the universe to ensure the future of his family and his people. As malevolent forces explode into conflict over the planet''s exclusive supply of the most precious resource in existence-a commodity capable of unlocking humanity''s greatest potential-only those who can conquer their fear will survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDzOcq0pfeCeqMBwKIJlSmQpjkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438631'),
  ('1384258881343376', 'Dune Drifter', 2020, 'Science Fiction', 'Marc Price, Noel Darcy', 'Marc Price', 'Phoebe Sparrow, Daisy Aitkens, Simon Dwyer-Thomas, Charlotte Mounter, Alastair Kirton, Michael Geary, Alexander Tol, Jen Nelson', null, 'When the trainee pilot and her mortally wounded gunner are shot down, they crash land on a nearby planet. An enemy craft offers the chance of spare parts to fix her ship, but then she spots another survivor - an enemy alien soldier with no intention of letting her escape.', 'When the trainee pilot and her mortally wounded gunner are shot down, they crash land on a nearby planet. An enemy craft offers the chance of spare parts to fix her ship, but then she spots another survivor - an enemy alien soldier with no intention of letting her escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBLJzYriF9zZAHc2Gjb3KTQGTGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744738'),
  ('137998255386743247', 'Dune Warriors', 1991, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Joe Batac, Cirio H. Santiago', 'Thomas McKelvey Cleaver', 'David Carradine, Rick Hill, Luke Askew, Jillian McWhirter, Blake Boyd, Joseph Zucchero, Henry Strzalkowski, Maria Isabel Lopez', 'R', 'After the end of the world, Earth is a thirsty planet ruled by vicious warlords. One woman is brave enough to fight back; she bands together five warriors to save her town and their precious water', 'After the end of the world, Earth is a thirsty planet ruled by vicious warlords. One woman is brave enough to fight back; she bands together five warriors to save her town and their precious water', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIdY8sYd3joPeHqnK5qUxABNieD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222339'),
  ('712517271611867567', 'Dune: Part Three', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Denis Villeneuve, Linus Sandgren, Tamara Marini', 'Denis Villeneuve, Brian K. Vaughan, Jon Spaihts', 'Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, Jason Momoa, Florence Pugh, Rebecca Ferguson, Isaach de Bankolé, Charlotte Rampling, Anya Taylor-Joy', 'PG-13', 'As Emperor, Paul Atreides grapples with the consequences of his rise to power as political conspiracies and a galaxy-spanning holy war threaten the future he alone can foresee.', 'As Emperor, Paul Atreides grapples with the consequences of his rise to power as political conspiracies and a galaxy-spanning holy war threaten the future he alone can foresee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4wekkUaxExzOeGe7hKXzhnyXHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1170608'),
  ('27033034676103476', 'Dune: Part Two', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Tom Brown, Greig Fraser, Stefanie Übelhör', 'Denis Villeneuve, Jon Spaihts', 'Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, Rebecca Ferguson, Javier Bardem, Josh Brolin, Austin Butler, Florence Pugh, Dave Bautista', 'PG-13', 'Follow the mythic journey of Paul Atreides as he unites with Chani and the Fremen while on a path of revenge against the conspirators who destroyed his family. Facing a choice between the love of his life and the fate of the known universe, Paul endeavors to prevent a terrible future only he can foresee.', 'Follow the mythic journey of Paul Atreides as he unites with Chani and the Fremen while on a path of revenge against the conspirators who destroyed his family. Facing a choice between the love of his life and the fate of the known universe, Paul endeavors to prevent a terrible future only he can foresee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pdfLvkbY9ohJlCjQH2CZjjYVvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693134'),
  ('907484175917723534', 'Dungeons & Dragons', 2000, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Courtney Solomon, Douglas Milsome, Jakub Dvorak', 'Topper Lilien, Carroll Cartwright', 'Justin Whalin, Jeremy Irons, Thora Birch, Bruce Payne, Zoe McLellan, Marlon Wayans, Robert Miano, Tomas Havrlik', 'PG-13', 'The Empire of Izmer is a divided land: elite magicians called “mages” rule while lowly commoners are powerless. When Empress Savina vows to bring equality and prosperity to her land, the evil mage Profion plots to depose her.', 'The Empire of Izmer is a divided land: elite magicians called “mages” rule while lowly commoners are powerless. When Empress Savina vows to bring equality and prosperity to her land, the evil mage Profion plots to depose her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLCsyHLHhTbzKzsL3IcBNyDKlZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11849'),
  ('717352490552078781', 'Dungeons & Dragons: Honor Among Thieves', 2023, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Barry Peterson, Sam Barry-Parker, Matthew Booth', 'Michael Gilio, John Francis Daley, Jonathan Goldstein', 'Chris Pine, Michelle Rodriguez, Justice Smith, Sophia Lillis, Hugh Grant, Regé-Jean Page, Chloe Coleman, Daisy Head', 'PG-13', 'A charming thief and a band of unlikely adventurers undertake an epic heist to retrieve a lost relic, but things go dangerously awry when they run afoul of the wrong people.', 'A charming thief and a band of unlikely adventurers undertake an epic heist to retrieve a lost relic, but things go dangerously awry when they run afoul of the wrong people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7UF7ypAqjsFZFdjksjQ7IUpXdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493529'),
  ('670017981587354852', 'Dungeons & Dragons: The Book of Vile Darkness', 2012, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gerry Lively, Emil Topuzov, Neil Tuohy', 'Brian Rudnick', 'Charlotte Hunter, Jack Derges, Anthony Howell, Eleanor Gecks, Habib Nasib Nader, Barry Aird, Meagan Good, Kaloian Vodenicharov', 'PG-13', 'A noble warrior must battle dragons and demons while upholding his moral code as he covertly joins a group of villains to rescue his kidnapped father from Shathrax, the Mind Flayer, who threatens to destroy the world.', 'A noble warrior must battle dragons and demons while upholding his moral code as he covertly joins a group of villains to rescue his kidnapped father from Shathrax, the Mind Flayer, who threatens to destroy the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3eezeLwKTQwgkqbySs0v74nXeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135858'),
  ('745524712629172163', 'Dungeons & Dragons: Wrath of the Dragon God', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Gerry Lively, Igor Meglic', 'Robert Kimmel, Gerry Lively, Brian Rudnick', 'Bruce Payne, Mark Dymond, Clemency Burton-Hill, Ellie Chidzey, Tim Stern, Steven Elder, Lucy Gaskell, Roy Marsden', 'PG-13', 'Due to a curse from his former master Profion, Damodar survived his death by Ridley Freeborn as an undead entity in pursuit of an evil artifact for some hundred years, so that he might be capable of unleashing unstoppable destruction on Izmir and the descendants of those who caused his demise.', 'Due to a curse from his former master Profion, Damodar survived his death by Ridley Freeborn as an undead entity in pursuit of an evil artifact for some hundred years, so that he might be capable of unleashing unstoppable destruction on Izmir and the descendants of those who caused his demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5PV0sV4Nd0eCZMcRfipeNhTpmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9288'),
  ('85148030284609776', 'Dungeons of Ecstasy', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Charles Band, Thomas L. Callaway, Nancy McManus', 'Cypress Bai', 'Nicole Mattox, Eric Guilmette, Francesco Meoni, Alexis Harris, Xander Bailey', null, 'After a devastating car crash, journalist Emily flees to rural Italy but becomes trapped in the Dungeons of Ecstasy. Her captor resembles her ex-husband and subjects her to dangerous, sensual trials that unlock taboo memories.', 'After a devastating car crash, journalist Emily flees to rural Italy but becomes trapped in the Dungeons of Ecstasy. Her captor resembles her ex-husband and subjects her to dangerous, sensual trials that unlock taboo memories.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fi4vfsYDy7pD3xqNsENfPvXi4nIU.jpg', 'plex:movie:dungeons-of-ecstasy-2026'),
  ('946969552541037901', 'Dunki', 2023, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Rajkumar Hirani, C.K. Muraleedharan, Manush Nandan', 'Abhijat Joshi, Kanika Dhillon, Rajkumar Hirani', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Taapsee Pannu, Vikram Kochhar, Anil Grover, Boman Irani, Vicky Kaushal, Deven Bhojani, Sapna Sand', null, 'Four friends from a sleepy little village in Punjab share a common dream: to go to England. Their problem is that they have neither the visa nor the ticket. A soldier alights from a train one day, and their lives change. He gives them a soldier''s promise: He will take them to the land of their dreams. What follows is a hilarious and heartwarming tale of a perilous journey through the desert and the sea, but most crucially through the hinterlands of their mind.', 'Four friends from a sleepy little village in Punjab share a common dream: to go to England. Their problem is that they have neither the visa nor the ticket. A soldier alights from a train one day, and their lives change. He gives them a soldier''s promise: He will take them to the land of their dreams. What follows is a hilarious and heartwarming tale of a perilous journey through the desert and the sea, but most crucially through the hinterlands of their mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPRb1mbVHGop0egQ7153y0lhzGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960876'),
  ('1138749843658741600', 'Dunkirk', 1958, 'Drama, War', 'Leslie Norman, Michael Birkett, Paul Beeson', 'David Divine, W.P. Lipscomb', 'John Mills, Richard Attenborough, Bernard Lee, Robert Urquhart, Ray Jackson, Ronald Hines, Sean Barrett, Roland Curram', null, 'A British Corporal in France finds himself responsible for the lives of his men when their officer is killed. He has to get them back to Britain somehow. Meanwhile, British civilians are being dragged into the war with Operation Dynamo, the scheme to get the French and British forces back from the Dunkirk beaches. Some come forward to help, others were less willing.', 'A British Corporal in France finds himself responsible for the lives of his men when their officer is killed. He has to get them back to Britain somehow. Meanwhile, British civilians are being dragged into the war with Operation Dynamo, the scheme to get the French and British forces back from the Dunkirk beaches. Some come forward to help, others were less willing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/357BscJA1gDEOzRuTeHnHmVBi7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17720'),
  ('519940295526688320', 'Dunkirk', 2017, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Hoyte van Hoytema, Eggert Ketilsson, Kevin Ishioka', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Fionn Whitehead, Tom Hardy, Mark Rylance, Kenneth Branagh, Cillian Murphy, Barry Keoghan, Harry Styles, Aneurin Barnard', 'PG-13', 'The story of the miraculous evacuation of Allied soldiers from Belgium, Britain, Canada and France, who were cut off and surrounded by the German army from the beaches and harbour of Dunkirk between May 26th and June 4th 1940 during World War II.', 'The story of the miraculous evacuation of Allied soldiers from Belgium, Britain, Canada and France, who were cut off and surrounded by the German army from the beaches and harbour of Dunkirk between May 26th and June 4th 1940 during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4Oe15CGLL61Ped0RAS9JpqdmCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374720'),
  ('538413483549576644', 'Dunston Checks In', 1996, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Ken Kwapis, John T. Kretchmer, Carole Keligian', 'John Hopkins', 'Sam the Orangutan, Jason Alexander, Faye Dunaway, Rupert Everett, Graham Sack, Paul Reubens, Glenn Shadix, Nathan Davis', 'PG', 'Hotel manager Robert Grant is forced by his boss to postpone his family vacation when a hotel critic checks in. Trouble is, the critic is really a villainous jewel thief with an orangutan assistant named Dunston. When Dunston gets loose and tries to escape a life of crime -- aided by Robert''s sons -- havoc, hijinks and lots of laughs abound!', 'Hotel manager Robert Grant is forced by his boss to postpone his family vacation when a hotel critic checks in. Trouble is, the critic is really a villainous jewel thief with an orangutan assistant named Dunston. When Dunston gets loose and tries to escape a life of crime -- aided by Robert''s sons -- havoc, hijinks and lots of laughs abound!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR2cWC04kWNr7TBeXNOf4uOqn00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17414'),
  ('651418123661927128', 'Dunya & Desie', 2008, 'Drama', 'Dana Nechushtan, Bert Pot, Richt Martens', 'Robert Alberdingk Thijm', 'Maryam Hassouni, Eva van de Wijdeven, Mahjoub Benmoussa, Rachida Iaallala, Christine van Stralen, Theo Maassen, Iliass Ojja, Ilias Addab', null, 'Dunya and Desie are two 18 year old best friends from Amsterdam North. Dunya is Moroccan and Desie is Dutch. On Dunya''s Birthday she is told that her marriage has been arranged with a distant cousin in Morocco. Dunya and her family will travel to Morocco to meet him. After Desie discovers that she is pregnant she joins Dunya in Morocco in a search for Desies father.', 'Dunya and Desie are two 18 year old best friends from Amsterdam North. Dunya is Moroccan and Desie is Dutch. On Dunya''s Birthday she is told that her marriage has been arranged with a distant cousin in Morocco. Dunya and her family will travel to Morocco to meet him. After Desie discovers that she is pregnant she joins Dunya in Morocco in a search for Desies father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li4qNgNeiuJMkzzaRpEH3JUyarm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38230'),
  ('227549798068099475', 'Dünyanın En Güzel Kokusu', 2016, 'Romance', 'Mustafa Uğur Yağcıoğlu, Metin Dağ', 'Mustafa Uğur Yağcıoğlu', 'Rıza Kocaoğlu, Tuba Ünsal, Burak Altay, Esra Ruşan, Nezih Tuncay, Feriha Eyüboğlu, Açelya Akkoyun, Semiha Bezek', null, 'Derya and Hakan are best friends. Derya is the one who makes soup when Hakan is ill and Hakan is there whenever Derya needs him. They are so deeply involved in eachother’s lives that they even have the keys to the other’s apartment. They don’t have any secrets between each other. They both think that in today’s world, people do not feel the love that our grandparents and even parents do. They think that couples consume each other. And therefore, everyone they meet seem shallow to them.', 'Derya and Hakan are best friends. Derya is the one who makes soup when Hakan is ill and Hakan is there whenever Derya needs him. They are so deeply involved in eachother’s lives that they even have the keys to the other’s apartment. They don’t have any secrets between each other. They both think that in today’s world, people do not feel the love that our grandparents and even parents do. They think that couples consume each other. And therefore, everyone they meet seem shallow to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUro5h9JPsAaTNf751gNq6mBlNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386373'),
  ('647908645453806359', 'Duo Concertantes', 1964, 'Animation', 'Lawrence Jordan', null, null, null, 'Jordan’s imagery is exquisite and eloquent, concentrating on simple, repeated use of particularly poetic symbols and figures, a conglomerative effect of old Gustave Dore drawings, 19th century whatnot memorabilia, all fused to a totally aware perception. —Lita Eliseu, East Village Other', 'Jordan’s imagery is exquisite and eloquent, concentrating on simple, repeated use of particularly poetic symbols and figures, a conglomerative effect of old Gustave Dore drawings, 19th century whatnot memorabilia, all fused to a totally aware perception. —Lita Eliseu, East Village Other', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJP2DCt2yYtyoReSE1mWXufBrTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170646'),
  ('128818882132434475', 'Duplex', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Danny DeVito, Anastas N. Michos', 'Larry Doyle', 'Ben Stiller, Drew Barrymore, Eileen Essell, Harvey Fierstein, Justin Theroux, James Remar, Robert Wisdom, Swoosie Kurtz', 'PG-13', 'When a young couple buys their dream home, they have no idea what the sweet little old lady upstairs is going to put them through!', 'When a young couple buys their dream home, they have no idea what the sweet little old lady upstairs is going to put them through!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCQ4oO9djqcthBRD3ftTnR8qSP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7288'),
  ('350813272300007863', 'Duplicate', 1998, 'Action, Comedy', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Sameer Arya, Vivek Sharma', null, 'Shah Rukh Khan, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Sonali Bendre, Mohnish Behl, Tiku Talsania, Sharat Saxena, Gulshan Grover, Kajol', null, 'Manu, a criminal, finds his doppelganger in a budding chef, Bablu, and uses this fact to his advantage. Later, Manu tries to kill the chef so that he can take over his life and escape the law.', 'Manu, a criminal, finds his doppelganger in a budding chef, Bablu, and uses this fact to his advantage. Later, Manu tries to kill the chef so that he can take over his life and escape the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylBsNn4xkMlZPk1beZuuwFqrWUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159090'),
  ('387461456729372656', 'Duplicity', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime', 'Tony Gilroy, Michael Pitt, Robert Elswit', 'Tony Gilroy', 'Julia Roberts, Clive Owen, Tom Wilkinson, Paul Giamatti, Tom McCarthy, Denis O''Hare, Kathleen Chalfant, Wayne Duvall', 'PG-13', 'Two romantically involved government operatives Claire Stenwick and Ray Koval team up to manipulate a race between opposing corporations to corner the market on a medical innovation that will reap huge profits and allow them to lead an extravagant lifestyle together. They find themselves on opposing sides as corporate spies; however, as they each try to outdo the other, neither one can decide how far to trust the other in this high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse.', 'Two romantically involved government operatives Claire Stenwick and Ray Koval team up to manipulate a race between opposing corporations to corner the market on a medical innovation that will reap huge profits and allow them to lead an extravagant lifestyle together. They find themselves on opposing sides as corporate spies; however, as they each try to outdo the other, neither one can decide how far to trust the other in this high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpWQs3CjwG6Er3DgZlv4L3NFjXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16558'),
  ('841620829138052592', 'Duplicity', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Julien Despaux', 'Soiliho Bodin, Nicolas Clément', 'Laura Smet, Alexia Barlier, Pierre Perrier, Adama Niane, Jacques Spiesser, Bastien Bouillon, Claude Lecat, Yves Collignon', null, 'Alice learns of her mother''s accidental death while travelling in Canada. The body has been repatriated to France at the request of her husband, Alice''s father. But he has supposedly been dead for 22 years. Is it really her father? Why would her mother have lied to her?', 'Alice learns of her mother''s accidental death while travelling in Canada. The body has been repatriated to France at the request of her husband, Alice''s father. But he has supposedly been dead for 22 years. Is it really her father? Why would her mother have lied to her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR0vmLkKjCgHyHcWMircgUSMUOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445113'),
  ('314118435481792175', 'Duplicity III', 1980, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'The final Duplicity film does seem at resolve with the term. All previous visual manifestations have been extended to their limits, through four-roll superimpositions. Obvious costumes and masks. Drama as an ultimate bid for truth, and totemic recognition of human and animal life-on-earth dominate all the evasions a duplicity otherwise affords.', 'The final Duplicity film does seem at resolve with the term. All previous visual manifestations have been extended to their limits, through four-roll superimpositions. Obvious costumes and masks. Drama as an ultimate bid for truth, and totemic recognition of human and animal life-on-earth dominate all the evasions a duplicity otherwise affords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J87l5OFT9cV4KVtYWwN18QXfpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164591'),
  ('7674390112138048', 'Durango Kids', 1999, 'Fantasy, Western, Science Fiction, Family', 'Ashton Root', 'William Martin Brennan, Ashton Root', 'Larry Drake, Brendon Ryan Barrett, Caitlin Barrett, Sara Paxton, Christina Milian, Curtis Williams, Taylor Root', 'PG', 'Four kids slip through a hole in time when they discover a hidden mine shaft that transports them to the old Wild West. Their magical journey takes them to a place where they encounter thieving bandits, pandemonium and adventure in their pursuit of lost treasure. The gang has to stick together to find the hidden gold before their evil school principal locates the loot for himself!', 'Four kids slip through a hole in time when they discover a hidden mine shaft that transports them to the old Wild West. Their magical journey takes them to a place where they encounter thieving bandits, pandemonium and adventure in their pursuit of lost treasure. The gang has to stick together to find the hidden gold before their evil school principal locates the loot for himself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lilPFj2ez7boU3PwPpGA1y8ZJbt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81379'),
  ('16720770715216915', 'Duress', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Jordan Barker, Adam Marsden', 'Jim Kehoe, Tope Oseni, Dipo Oseni', 'Martin Donovan, Ariel Winter, Cristina Dohmen, Sakis Rouvas, Joey Adams, Catherine Dent, Deon Derrico, Gina Gallego', null, 'Haunted with nightmares of his wife''s recent suicide and struggling to mend the relationship with his only daughter, Richard is caught as a witness to the violence of Abner Solvie. He finds himself at the mercy of a charismatic killer and plagued by his involvement in the city''s recent murders. As Abner''s new found protégé, Richard is forced to adopt the mind of his sociopathic mentor in order to protect the one he loves. Richard must decide if he''s willing to kill in order to keep his daughter alive.', 'Haunted with nightmares of his wife''s recent suicide and struggling to mend the relationship with his only daughter, Richard is caught as a witness to the violence of Abner Solvie. He finds himself at the mercy of a charismatic killer and plagued by his involvement in the city''s recent murders. As Abner''s new found protégé, Richard is forced to adopt the mind of his sociopathic mentor in order to protect the one he loves. Richard must decide if he''s willing to kill in order to keep his daughter alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0kxgftfB6Y43moFrM6Z2mT8aTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34108'),
  ('471563187957386152', 'Durgamati: The Myth', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kuldeep Mamania, Ashok G., Nishant Abdul Khan', 'Ashok G.', 'Bhumi Pednekar, Arshad Warsi, Mahie Gill, Karan Kapadia, Jisshu Sengupta, Ananth Narayan Mahadevan', null, 'In the skullduggery world of politics and crime, an innocent Chanchal has to pull all on the line to prove her innocence and bring justice to Shakti and the people that he loved so much. As she gets embroiled deep in a web of deceit, Chanchal must face powers both natural and supernatural to fulfill her destiny.', 'In the skullduggery world of politics and crime, an innocent Chanchal has to pull all on the line to prove her innocence and bring justice to Shakti and the people that he loved so much. As she gets embroiled deep in a web of deceit, Chanchal must face powers both natural and supernatural to fulfill her destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjKGGWBAbFApSIljxQNTlFKE5Pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702550'),
  ('1027270044674436698', 'Durian Durian', 2000, 'Drama', 'Fruit Chan, Lam Wah-Chuen, Peter Chan Wai-Keung', 'Fruit Chan, Sheng Zhimin', 'Qin Hailu, Wai-Fan Mak, Xiao Ming Biao, Fan Lei, Wai Yiu Yung, Qingyong Hu, Ping Lee, Zhihan Lu', null, 'The first half of this film portrays the experiences of a young northern mainland Chinese woman (Fan) temporarily working as a sex worker in Hong Kong. After her 3-month visa expires, the second half of the film focuses on Yan''s return to her family and her ex-fiancé in Northeast China and the ways that she invests the money that she has earned.', 'The first half of this film portrays the experiences of a young northern mainland Chinese woman (Fan) temporarily working as a sex worker in Hong Kong. After her 3-month visa expires, the second half of the film focuses on Yan''s return to her family and her ex-fiancé in Northeast China and the ways that she invests the money that she has earned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY6qtXbIMTNoo6fbdvoKmuuN4Kl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81593'),
  ('400620906625909547', 'Duro pero seguro', 1978, 'Family, Comedy', 'Fernando Cortés, Xavier Cruz, José Amezquita', 'Damián Acosta Esparza', 'María Elena Velasco, Jorge Lavat, Ángel Garasa, Alfredo Varela, Pancho Córdova, Miguel Suárez, Queta Lavat, Maribel Fernández', null, 'Nicolasa sells tacos near a movie studio and her popularity threatens the restaurant''s own studies. She drops the food when seeing actor Armando performing and the director expels her out.', 'Nicolasa sells tacos near a movie studio and her popularity threatens the restaurant''s own studies. She drops the food when seeing actor Armando performing and the director expels her out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsACEPgDlq7XlLbtjw6UZG4nMo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117894'),
  ('215517447952053722', 'Durval Discos', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Music, Thriller', 'Anna Muylaert, Jacob Solitrenick, Caio Gullane', 'Anna Muylaert', 'Ary França, Etty Fraser, Isabela Guasco, Marisa Orth, Letícia Sabatella, Tania Bondezan, Rita Lee, André Abujamra', null, 'Eccentric Durval is a bit like the record shop he operates with his mother: rundown and pathetic. When their home becomes too much for his mother to care for, Durval hires a maid who no sooner disappears, leaving a young girl and a note behind.', 'Eccentric Durval is a bit like the record shop he operates with his mother: rundown and pathetic. When their home becomes too much for his mother to care for, Durval hires a maid who no sooner disappears, leaving a young girl and a note behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MjSwjmAVUflv9WKx9PzWEAF1q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74901'),
  ('742127001996442821', 'Dus', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Anubhav Sinha, Vijay Kumar Arora', 'Yash Keswani', 'Sanjay Dutt, Abhishek Bachchan, Suniel Shetty, Zayed Khan, Esha Deol, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Dia Mirza, Raima Sen', null, 'Jamwaal, a terrorist, plans to wreak havoc in Canada when the Indian Prime Minister visits the nation. However, a team of special agents from India are sent to catch the terrorist.', 'Jamwaal, a terrorist, plans to wreak havoc in Canada when the Indian Prime Minister visits the nation. However, a team of special agents from India are sent to catch the terrorist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGxt6OwPvstGA5EQlMwQqtaD3Vv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58302'),
  ('502989328252118307', 'Dus Kahaniyaan', 2007, 'Drama', 'Apoorva Lakhia, Meghna Gulzar, Jasmeet Dhodhi', null, 'Arbaaz Khan, Mandira Bedi, Sudhanshu Pandey, Jimmy Shergill, Masumeh Makhija, Amrita Singh, Parmeet Sethi, Minissha Lamba', null, 'An anthology of ten short films dealing with diverse subjects such as infidelity, companionship, lust and a spectrum of human emotions.', 'An anthology of ten short films dealing with diverse subjects such as infidelity, companionship, lust and a spectrum of human emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqqdfQIq8yLeYyPijzYv5aU6CaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46383'),
  ('247465806447426881', 'Duse', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Pietro Marcello, Marco Graziaplena, Davide Zurolo', 'Letizia Russo, Guido Silei, Pietro Marcello', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Fanni Wrochna, Noémie Merlant, Fausto Russo Alesi, Edoardo Sorgente, Vincenzo Nemolato, Gaja Masciale, Vincenza Modica', null, 'In the years between WWI and the rise of Fascism, legendary thespian Eleonora Duse shocks everyone by getting back onstage at over 60 years of age. Struggling with the brutality of historical events unfolding and clinging to the possibility of utopia, she makes her art a revolutionary act, even at the cost of sacrificing health and affection—facing her final journey aware she could give up life itself, but not her own true nature.', 'In the years between WWI and the rise of Fascism, legendary thespian Eleonora Duse shocks everyone by getting back onstage at over 60 years of age. Struggling with the brutality of historical events unfolding and clinging to the possibility of utopia, she makes her art a revolutionary act, even at the cost of sacrificing health and affection—facing her final journey aware she could give up life itself, but not her own true nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PJ4DfW9T2uG9Bj6X20i2R3yW3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1291202'),
  ('752111732157155971', 'Dushman', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Tanuja Chandra', null, 'Sanjay Dutt, Kajol, Ashutosh Rana, Jas Arora, Tanvi Azmi, Kunal Khemu, Pratima Kazmi, Robin Bhatt', null, 'According to police records, a daredevil, Gokul Pandit is on the loose. He would attempts to rape and kill young and beautiful girls who are alone.', 'According to police records, a daredevil, Gokul Pandit is on the loose. He would attempts to rape and kill young and beautiful girls who are alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUgHLNNz5jz8M9otUA2msVVn10J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165068'),
  ('104013227543545902', 'Dusk for a Hitman', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Jean-François Lord, Marc Larose, Marc Larose', 'Raymond St-Jean, Martin Girard', 'Éric Bruneau, Benoît Gouin, Rose-Marie Perreault, Sylvain Marcel, Simon Landry-Désy, Joakim Robillard, Hugues Frenette, Alexandre Castonguay', 'R', '1979. Donald Lavoie is a fearsome hitman who works under the orders of Claude Dubois, head of the Montreal South-West mob. Donald is tasked to take under his wing new recruit Serge Rivard, a hotheaded small-time crook who soon compromises him in a botched double murder. Donald avoids justice thanks to the Dubois clan''s lawyers, but this is only a temporary setback for Detective Sergeant Roger Burns, who wants to convince Lavoie to become an informer.', '1979. Donald Lavoie is a fearsome hitman who works under the orders of Claude Dubois, head of the Montreal South-West mob. Donald is tasked to take under his wing new recruit Serge Rivard, a hotheaded small-time crook who soon compromises him in a botched double murder. Donald avoids justice thanks to the Dubois clan''s lawyers, but this is only a temporary setback for Detective Sergeant Roger Burns, who wants to convince Lavoie to become an informer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8POIwIWHfFigG8q0scggFJR3bGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750891'),
  ('1098655731317438519', 'Dust', 2001, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Western', 'Barry Ackroyd, Milcho Manchevski, Sarah Jane Cornish', 'Milcho Manchevski', 'Joseph Fiennes, David Wenham, Adrian Lester, Rosemary Murphy, Nikolina Kujača, Vlado Jovanovski, Vera Farmiga, Matt Ross', 'R', 'Two parallel tales of redemption, a century apart. In the New York storyline, Edge hunts for Angela''s gold to pay back a debt, and gradually grows closer to her. In the Macedonian story, the brothers end up fighting for opposite sides of a revolution, with the religious Elijah taking up sides with the Ottoman sultan and gunslinger Luke joining "the Teacher" , a Macedonian rebel.', 'Two parallel tales of redemption, a century apart. In the New York storyline, Edge hunts for Angela''s gold to pay back a debt, and gradually grows closer to her. In the Macedonian story, the brothers end up fighting for opposite sides of a revolution, with the religious Elijah taking up sides with the Ottoman sultan and gunslinger Luke joining "the Teacher" , a Macedonian rebel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhNlFTwlrte13wX3ntMQJSO7azG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16405'),
  ('211512890762781191', 'Dust', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Sergei Loban, Fedor Lyass', 'Marina Potapova', 'Aleksei Podolsky, Pyotr Mamonov, Gleb Mikhailov, Nina Yelisova, Mikhail Balinsky, Oleg Novikov, Larisa Pyatnitskaya, Alexey Ageev', null, 'The genre of the film DUST could be called fantastic realism or existential drama with elements of the fantastic. Dust means the haste in which people live. Dust is a common misconception, the natural clogging up of the brain. Specks of dust how scientists perceive people, scientists who think they know more than anyone else about the universe.', 'The genre of the film DUST could be called fantastic realism or existential drama with elements of the fantastic. Dust means the haste in which people live. Dust is a common misconception, the natural clogging up of the brain. Specks of dust how scientists perceive people, scientists who think they know more than anyone else about the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFb2ROLP54V3AKN7wcC75HYY2GB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65104'),
  ('995349458953639543', 'Dust', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Anke Blondé, Frank van den Eeden, Servaes Dewispelaere, Michał Staliński, Sofie Tusschans, Kajetan Zakowski', 'Angelo Tijssens', 'Arieh Worthalter, Jan Hammenecker, Thibaud Dooms, Anthony Welsh, Fania Sorel', null, '''Dust'' tracks the last fateful weekend before the, very public, financial collapse of two infamous entrepreneurs from West-Flanders, Belgium, in the late 1990s. The film follows their step by step implosion as they consciously head toward the inevitable ending.', '''Dust'' tracks the last fateful weekend before the, very public, financial collapse of two infamous entrepreneurs from West-Flanders, Belgium, in the late 1990s. The film follows their step by step implosion as they consciously head toward the inevitable ending.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fi2Eel3PVkjMOpSMPMhMpAa0N1xa.jpg', 'plex:movie:dust-2026'),
  ('124630551893811378', 'Dust Be My Destiny', 1939, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Lewis Seiler, James Wong Howe, William Kissell', 'Seton I. Miller', 'John Garfield, Priscilla Lane, Alan Hale, Frank McHugh, Billy Halop, Bobby Jordan, Charley Grapewin, Henry Armetta', 'NR', 'Embittered after serving time for a burglary he did not commit, Joe Bell is soon back in jail, on a prison farm. His love for the foreman''s daughter leads to a fight between them, leading to the older man''s death due to a weak heart. Joe and Mabel go on the run as he thinks no-one would believe a nobody like him.', 'Embittered after serving time for a burglary he did not commit, Joe Bell is soon back in jail, on a prison farm. His love for the foreman''s daughter leads to a fight between them, leading to the older man''s death due to a weak heart. Joe and Mabel go on the run as he thinks no-one would believe a nobody like him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twsX5wNnkWzyoZqrTR3iO7cgKPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26589'),
  ('1029334915282174590', 'Dust Bunny', 2025, 'Fantasy, Action, Horror', 'Bryan Fuller, Nicole Hirsch Whitaker, Margery Simkin', 'Bryan Fuller', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Sophie Sloan, Sigourney Weaver, David Dastmalchian, Sheila Atim, Caspar Phillipson, Line Kruse, Rebecca Henderson', 'R', 'Ten-year-old Aurora asks her hitman neighbor to kill the monster under her bed that she claims ate her family. To protect her, he must battle an onslaught of assassins while accepting that some monsters are real.', 'Ten-year-old Aurora asks her hitman neighbor to kill the monster under her bed that she claims ate her family. To protect her, he must battle an onslaught of assassins while accepting that some monsters are real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qa5aZpO8tQqhlDaE0flalS1TuIS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1043197'),
  ('493033534882948973', 'Dust Cloth', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ahu Öztürk, Hamit Annak, Merve Toz', 'Ahu Öztürk', 'Nazan Kesal, Asiye Dinçsoy, Serra Yılmaz, Didem İnselel, Mehmet Özgür, Asel Yalın, Yusuf Ancu, Gökçe Yanardağ', null, 'Nesrin and Hatun are two Kurdish cleaning women living in Istanbul. While Nesrin tries to survive with her little daughter, trying to understand why her husband left her, Hatun dreams of buying a house in the district where they clean.', 'Nesrin and Hatun are two Kurdish cleaning women living in Istanbul. While Nesrin tries to survive with her little daughter, trying to understand why her husband left her, Hatun dreams of buying a house in the district where they clean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mZInlGYrkKff9sIlhFxQWYEixb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382487'),
  ('831435189428659501', 'Dust Devil', 1992, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard Stanley, Steven Chivers, Gary Huckabay', 'Richard Stanley', 'Robert John Burke, Chelsea Field, Marianne Sägebrecht, William Hootkins, Zakes Mokae, John Matshikiza, Rufus Swart, Russell Copley', 'R', 'A woman on the run from her abusive husband encounters a mysterious hitch-hiker.', 'A woman on the run from her abusive husband encounters a mysterious hitch-hiker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59pEswv24gaJk1BZ6s7o7NnceVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5237'),
  ('6805396472122605', 'Dust for all the Money', 1963, 'Family, Comedy', 'Poul Bang, Hanne Mynster', 'Bent From, Ida From', 'Dirch Passer, Hanne Borchsenius, Ove Sprogøe, Bodil Udsen, Søren Elung Jensen, Helle Virkner, Jan Priiskorn Schmidt, Karl Stegger', null, 'A group of residents in the Copenhagen suburb of Solvænget decide to buy a farm in order to become self-sufficient in vegetables and other goodies. Unfortunately, farm life turns out to be much more strenuous and difficult than the small group of city dwellers had imagined.', 'A group of residents in the Copenhagen suburb of Solvænget decide to buy a farm in order to become self-sufficient in vegetables and other goodies. Unfortunately, farm life turns out to be much more strenuous and difficult than the small group of city dwellers had imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKyyrU4Lpo3bPe3LIn7zjzLwCmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41990'),
  ('94463737106911513', 'Dust in the Wind', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Wu Nien-jen, Chu Tien-Wen', 'Chien-wen Wang, Hsin Shu-Fen, Li Tian-Lu, Mei Fang, Grace Chen, Yang Li-yin, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen, Danny Deng', 'NR', 'A-yuan and A-yun are both from the small mining town of Jio-fen. They move to Taipei, where A-yuan is an apprentice by day and goes to night school, and A-yun works as a helper at a tailors. Everyone thinks they are meant for each other, and so do they. They fail to see time and fate are beyond their control.', 'A-yuan and A-yun are both from the small mining town of Jio-fen. They move to Taipei, where A-yuan is an apprentice by day and goes to night school, and A-yun works as a helper at a tailors. Everyone thinks they are meant for each other, and so do they. They fail to see time and fate are beyond their control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QbsT3gkG0WdchoDY8kqIwcVN0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45996'),
  ('90492534778238106', 'Dust of Angels', 1992, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Liao Ching-Sung, Hsu Hsiao-Ming, Chang Hui-kung', 'Hsu Hsiao-Ming', 'Yen Cheng-kuo, Tan Chih-Kang, Jack Kao, Vicky Wei, Chang Shih, Tsai Chen-nan, Cheung Yee-Haam, Chan Chung-Yung', null, 'A-Guo and A-Dou are two teenagers living in an industrial town in Taiwan, who fight, loaf, and cause trouble all day and hang out with Jie, a young gangster. When Jie''s gangland patron is gunned down, the trio set out to revenge the killing. As a result, the two teens are forced into hiding.', 'A-Guo and A-Dou are two teenagers living in an industrial town in Taiwan, who fight, loaf, and cause trouble all day and hang out with Jie, a young gangster. When Jie''s gangland patron is gunned down, the trio set out to revenge the killing. As a result, the two teens are forced into hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2KuecFvFAKdTDBDHkSefnRLBWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205464'),
  ('280748313566246070', 'Dust on the Brain', 1961, 'Family, Comedy', 'Poul Bang, Hanne Mynster', 'Arvid Müller, Eva Ramm, Aage Stentoft', 'Dirch Passer, Ove Sprogøe, Helle Virkner, Søren Elung Jensen, Bodil Udsen, Karl Stegger, Ingrid Langballe, Hanne Borchsenius', null, 'The story centers around the busybody housewives of a modern Danish working class neighborhood of the 1960''s. A remake of the Norwegian comedy film from 1959.', 'The story centers around the busybody housewives of a modern Danish working class neighborhood of the 1960''s. A remake of the Norwegian comedy film from 1959.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4M7kVH8pLRB6WhuBjfHXNvmrDBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41989'),
  ('332523825920219253', 'Dust on the Tongue', 2014, 'Drama', 'Rubén Mendoza, Juan Carlos Gil', 'Rubén Mendoza', 'Jairo Salcedo, Gabriel Mejía, Alma Rodríguez, Oliva Rondón, David Palacios, Mauricio Silva, Sonia Unda, Julio Mauricio Acevedo', null, 'A grandfather, in the final stage of his existence, asks two of his grandchildren to kill him because he wants to die by the hand of someone who bears his own blood. However, the young children discover a truth that will make them take the opposite decision.', 'A grandfather, in the final stage of his existence, asks two of his grandchildren to kill him because he wants to die by the hand of someone who bears his own blood. However, the young children discover a truth that will make them take the opposite decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erU2KT5MvBSprXwnurYT4qrwybg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260680'),
  ('306544266020426716', 'Dust To Dust', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Juan Carlos de Llaca', null, 'Osvaldo Benavides, Rodrigo Cachero, Ana de la Reguera, Xavier Massé, Gina Morett, Pilar Ixquic Mata, Héctor Ortega, Rosa María Bianchi', null, 'Rodrigo and Rocco join their families to hold a birthday party for their grandfather. Rodrigo is a regular middle-class teenager, while Rocco is rather more unconventional, indie magazine writer, and has deep conflicts with his father.', 'Rodrigo and Rocco join their families to hold a birthday party for their grandfather. Rodrigo is a regular middle-class teenager, while Rocco is rather more unconventional, indie magazine writer, and has deep conflicts with his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgMPD4SauvejCmLi8QhpDZz3sg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45123'),
  ('1134046293452793961', 'Dust To Dust', 2023, 'Drama', 'Terry Ng Ka-Wai, Tam Wai-Kai, Jonathan Li Tsz-Chun', 'Chou Man-Yu', 'Dong Chengpeng, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Zhang Songwen, Qi Xi, Sunny Sun, Ke Lan, Yi Yunhe, Shao Shengjie', null, '21 years after a major armed robbery where the masterminds escaped, a video of the crime resurfaces causing the police to reopen their investigation.', '21 years after a major armed robbery where the masterminds escaped, a video of the crime resurfaces causing the police to reopen their investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwXvw6sdlTE5K1w0NOJml4PXKoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1133013'),
  ('423647456293565871', 'Dustin', 2021, 'Drama', 'Samuel Berner, Claire Mathon, Naïla Guiguet', 'Naïla Guiguet', 'Dustin Muchuvitz, Félix Maritaud, Raya Martigny, Juan Corrales, Lucie Borleteau, Erwan Kepoa Falé, Nicolas Bachir, Sarah Belala', null, 'In an abandoned warehouse, a crowd is dancing as one on 145 BPM techno music. Among them is Dustin, a young transgender woman and crew: Felix, Raya and Juan. As the night draws on, collective hysteria morphs into sweet melancholy, and euphoria into yearning for tenderness.', 'In an abandoned warehouse, a crowd is dancing as one on 145 BPM techno music. Among them is Dustin, a young transgender woman and crew: Felix, Raya and Juan. As the night draws on, collective hysteria morphs into sweet melancholy, and euphoria into yearning for tenderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLs0pw2FnIVGBWNOjjWiZiCRWLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714028'),
  ('548805315283731653', 'Dusty and Sweets McGee', 1971, 'Drama, Crime', 'Floyd Mutrux, William A. Fraker', 'Floyd Mutrux', 'Clifton Tip Fredell, Kit Ryder, Billy Gray, Bob Graham, Nancy Wheeler, Russ Knight, William A. Fraker, Arnie Ginsberg', 'R', 'A "straight" couple dabbles in drugs and become heroin addicts.', 'A "straight" couple dabbles in drugs and become heroin addicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joZuLwzpJhkKdVQsucs1dUm5CAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86237'),
  ('180720007558944247', 'Dutch', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Charles Minsky, Peter Faiman, Christopher T. Gerrity', 'John Hughes', 'Ed O''Neill, Ethan Embry, JoBeth Williams, Christopher McDonald, Ari Meyers, E. G. Daily, L. Scott Caldwell, Kathleen Freeman', 'PG-13', 'To get to know his girlfriend''s son, a man volunteers to pick him up from a prep school... only to learn that her son''s not the nicest kid.', 'To get to know his girlfriend''s son, a man volunteers to pick him up from a prep school... only to learn that her son''s not the nicest kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diBUesRJ2w6ilSbAizpk062Sajh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25330'),
  ('1150152148315063055', 'Dutchman', 1966, 'Drama', 'Anthony Harvey, Gerry Turpin', 'Amiri Baraka', 'Shirley Knight, Al Freeman Jr., Frank Lieberman, Robert Calvert, Howard Bennett, Sandy McDonald, Dennis Alaba Peters, Keith James', null, 'A young conservative black man, minding his own business, rides a nearly empty subway car. The only other passenger, a blonde vixen looking for trouble, sizes him up. Sexual tension, racial bigotry and righteous fury collide in a razor''s edge confrontation between this unlikely pair.', 'A young conservative black man, minding his own business, rides a nearly empty subway car. The only other passenger, a blonde vixen looking for trouble, sizes him up. Sexual tension, racial bigotry and righteous fury collide in a razor''s edge confrontation between this unlikely pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQGSuTQO8TMSLLgqgAWaCTAuv6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66770'),
  ('969987773440888502', 'Dutiful But Dumb', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Eddie Acuff, Bruce Bennett, Vernon Dent, Bud Jamison, Chester Conklin', 'NR', 'The Stooges are photographers for Whack magazine who, after messing up an assignment, are sent to the country of Vulgaria to get a picture of a death ray gun. Features the famous scene where Curly pits his wits against a strong drink, and then a defiant oyster in his stew.', 'The Stooges are photographers for Whack magazine who, after messing up an assignment, are sent to the country of Vulgaria to get a picture of a death ray gun. Features the famous scene where Curly pits his wits against a strong drink, and then a defiant oyster in his stew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEukzbSQY7BL115KhEIpZeKn2Fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115990'),
  ('1024657540418664902', 'Duudsonit-elokuva: Kotiinpaluu', 2026, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jarno Laasala, Jussi Tapionlinna', 'Jukka Hildén, Jarppi Leppälä, Hannu-Pekka Parviainen, Jarno Laasala, Pekko Pesonen, Hannu Pekka Parviainen', 'Jukka Hildén, Jarppi Leppälä, Hannu-Pekka Parviainen', null, 'The Dudesons get together to film a new movie at their old ranch. They find themselves in the middle of a surprising and hilarious chain of events that harm the success of film. The pressures grow, and their friendship is put to the test.', 'The Dudesons get together to film a new movie at their old ranch. They find themselves in the middle of a surprising and hilarious chain of events that harm the success of film. The pressures grow, and their friendship is put to the test.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fqnu6MFVBEQcneRkteXHDanl9Xbn.jpg', 'plex:movie:duudsonit-elokuva-kotiinpaluu'),
  ('273092368232976762', 'Duvidha', 1973, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama', 'Mani Kaul, Navroze Contractor, Bhagvant Thakur', null, 'Raisa Padamsee, Ravi Menon, Hardan, Manohar Lalas, Bhola Ram, Kana Ram, Shambhudan', null, 'A newly-married merchant’s son is sent away for business. A ghost, who laid eyes on the bride, falls madly in love with her and takes the form of the husband and begins living with her.', 'A newly-married merchant’s son is sent away for business. A ghost, who laid eyes on the bride, falls madly in love with her and takes the form of the husband and begins living with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYxz3sthJKw8NOhJScICX9F4H5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103931'),
  ('44915475967351525', 'Dwelling in the Fuchun Mountains', 2020, 'Drama', 'Fang Zebra, Gu Xiaogang, Deng Xu', 'Gu Xiaogang', 'Qian Youfa, Du Hong Jun, Wang Fengjuan, Zhang Renliang, Zhang Guoying, Sun Zhangjian, Sun Zhangwei, Peng Luqi', null, 'In the Chinese town of Fuyang, four brothers go about their day-to-day lives, their destinies shaped by love and challenges.', 'In the Chinese town of Fuyang, four brothers go about their day-to-day lives, their destinies shaped by love and challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZMUOVHqIuXlHHnbQ0gg0jPLIi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596881'),
  ('113347760849067599', 'Dybbuk', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Jay K, Satya Ponmar, Vicky Sidana', 'Jay K', 'Emraan Hashmi, Nikita Dutta, Manav Kaul, Denzil Smith, Anil George, Resh Lamba, Bijay Anand, Yuri Suri', null, 'Mahi, a newly married woman, brings an antique Jewish box into her home. When Mahi and her husband Sam begin to have paranormal experiences, they soon learn that the box is a dybbuk containing an evil spirit. The couple then seeks the help of a rabbi to unravel its mystery. Will they survive this ordeal before their child is born?', 'Mahi, a newly married woman, brings an antique Jewish box into her home. When Mahi and her husband Sam begin to have paranormal experiences, they soon learn that the box is a dybbuk containing an evil spirit. The couple then seeks the help of a rabbi to unravel its mystery. Will they survive this ordeal before their child is born?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sy0u4UEzMxrj7G79LMQWcuO15kt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:886440'),
  ('740759035828372452', 'Dying', 2017, 'Drama', 'Fernando Franco, Santiago Racaj', 'Fernando Franco, Arthur Schnitzler', 'Marian Álvarez, Andrés Gertrúdix, Eduardo Rejón, Iñigo Aranburu', null, 'Morir revolves around the couple Luis and Marta, whose lives are paralyzed by the outbreak of a disease that is accompanied by guilt, lies and fear, testing the stability and love between them.', 'Morir revolves around the couple Luis and Marta, whose lives are paralyzed by the outbreak of a disease that is accompanied by guilt, lies and fear, testing the stability and love between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXz8wcwoFLmuhpX250RTOS3FX67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436835'),
  ('202561251185133383', 'Dying', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Matthias Glasner, Jakub Bejnarowicz', 'Matthias Glasner', 'Lars Eidinger, Corinna Harfouch, Lilith Stangenberg, Ronald Zehrfeld, Robert Gwisdek, Hans-Uwe Bauer, Anna Bederke, Saskia Rosendahl', null, 'Mother Lissy, father Gerd, son Tom and daughter Ellen: the members of the Lunies family are estranged. But confronted with death, they finally meet each other again.', 'Mother Lissy, father Gerd, son Tom and daughter Ellen: the members of the Lunies family are estranged. But confronted with death, they finally meet each other again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkPGlBrkmck3nlANsQwJKCKhRQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232781'),
  ('314951175180770274', 'Dying Beyond Their Means', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Isaki Lacuesta, Marc Gómez del Moral, Diego Dussuel', 'Isa Campo, Isaki Lacuesta', 'Raúl Arévalo, Imanol Arias, Iván Telefunken, Àlex Brendemühl, Josep Maria Pou, Albert Pla, Bárbara Lennie, Sergi López', null, 'Isaki Lacuesta presents a social satire in which five common or garden citizens, from a country pretty much identical to our own, see their lives ripped apart by the economic crisis. With nothing more to lose, they come up with a crazy plan to save the Spanish and world economy: kidnap the chairman of the Central Bank and demand that he return everything to the way it used to be.', 'Isaki Lacuesta presents a social satire in which five common or garden citizens, from a country pretty much identical to our own, see their lives ripped apart by the economic crisis. With nothing more to lose, they come up with a crazy plan to save the Spanish and world economy: kidnap the chairman of the Central Bank and demand that he return everything to the way it used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNHYWbb6EzzicxI5qgXFVm4mN1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288586'),
  ('508642926245862719', 'Dying Breed', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jody Dwyer, Geoffrey Hall', 'Michael Boughen, Jody Dwyer, Rod Morris', 'Nathan Phillips, Leigh Whannell, Bille Brown, Mirrah Foulkes, Melanie Vallejo, Elaine Hudson, Sheridan Harvey, Peter Docker', 'R', 'An extinct species, the Tasmanian tiger. A long-forgotten legend, “The Pieman” aka Alexander Pearce, who was hanged for cannibalism in 1824. Both had a desperate need to survive; both could have living descendants within the Tasmanian bush. Four hikers venture deep into isolated territory to find one of these legends, but which one will they come upon first?', 'An extinct species, the Tasmanian tiger. A long-forgotten legend, “The Pieman” aka Alexander Pearce, who was hanged for cannibalism in 1824. Both had a desperate need to survive; both could have living descendants within the Tasmanian bush. Four hikers venture deep into isolated territory to find one of these legends, but which one will they come upon first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8PQSt7nHAbMEbHX0nSLaUIPj4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18029'),
  ('1002889547761590412', 'Dying of Laughter', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Antonio ''Mármol'' Rodríguez, Flavio Martínez Labiano', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Santiago Segura, El Gran Wyoming, Álex Angulo, Carla Hidalgo, Eduardo Gómez, José María Íñigo, Uri Geller, Manuel Tallafé', null, 'Nino and Bruno are two comedians who reach the heights of success with their duo act, turning them into huge TV celebrities. However, the hate between them grows fast, as much as their fame.', 'Nino and Bruno are two comedians who reach the heights of success with their duo act, turning them into huge TV celebrities. However, the hate between them grows fast, as much as their fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pTnAwFOUt5NSOcKkeuNW46cwws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57544'),
  ('10355339860375824', 'Dying of the Light', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Paul Schrader, Gabriel Kosuth', 'Paul Schrader', 'Nicolas Cage, Anton Yelchin, Alexander Karim, Irène Jacob, Aymen Hamdouchi, Tomiwa Edun, Claudius Peters, Robert G. Slade', 'R', 'Evan Lake, a veteran CIA agent, has been ordered to retire. But when his protégé uncovers evidence that Lake''s nemesis, the terrorist Banir, has resurfaced, Lake goes rogue, embarking on a perilous, intercontinental mission to eliminate his sworn enemy.', 'Evan Lake, a veteran CIA agent, has been ordered to retire. But when his protégé uncovers evidence that Lake''s nemesis, the terrorist Banir, has resurfaced, Lake goes rogue, embarking on a perilous, intercontinental mission to eliminate his sworn enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gL6riNxQeyPXT5YsgqE2aWhl1zi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297596'),
  ('582435468849492848', 'Dying Room Only', 1973, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'John M. Stephens, Philip Leacock', null, 'Cloris Leachman, Ross Martin, Ned Beatty, Dana Elcar, Louise Latham, Dabney Coleman, Ron Feinberg', 'NR', 'A married couple are traveling on a deserted desert road at night. They stop at a diner and the husband goes to the men''s room. He never returns and the wife begins to suspect serious foul play.', 'A married couple are traveling on a deserted desert road at night. They stop at a diner and the husband goes to the men''s room. He never returns and the wife begins to suspect serious foul play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3owhlNYXMHYLEzNiI0W85s2p3lY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86236'),
  ('258508866596507498', 'Dying to be a Cheerleader', 2020, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Tom Shell, Ben Demaree', 'David Chester', 'Ashlynn Yennie, Dominique Booth, Kalen Bull, Nicolette Langley, Casey O''Keefe, Jon Briddell, Jake Meyerson, Christian Rivera', null, 'When the new girl in town tries out for her high school''s cheerleading team, she unwittingly humiliates the most popular girl in school, leading to deadly consequences.', 'When the new girl in town tries out for her high school''s cheerleading team, she unwittingly humiliates the most popular girl in school, leading to deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNEXAVYuoa2CSgKoFu1r2UGUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702699'),
  ('826069504153623519', 'Dying to Belong', 1997, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'William A. Graham, Robert Steadman, Charlie Picerni', 'Ron McGee', 'Hilary Swank, Sarah Chalke, Jenna Von Oÿ, Laurel Holloman, Jennifer Warren, Gregory Alan Williams, Tracy Middendorf, Isabella Hofmann', 'NR', 'When a girls friend is killed by a college hazing, she is the only one who can find out the truth.', 'When a girls friend is killed by a college hazing, she is the only one who can find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kO2W84HvRpSeoxDJSdyTMrHM9ev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69560'),
  ('656490176103053951', 'Dying to Survive', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wang Boxue, Wen Muye, Zhang Yan', 'Han Jianü, Wei Zhong, Wen Muye', 'Xu Zheng, Zhou Yiwei, Wang Chuanjun, Tan Zhuo, Zhang Yu, Yang Xinming, Wang Yanhui, Jia Hongxiao', null, 'A Chinese leukaemia patient smuggles cheap but untested pharmaceuticals from India to help hundreds of Chinese people suffering from cancer.', 'A Chinese leukaemia patient smuggles cheap but untested pharmaceuticals from India to help hundreds of Chinese people suffering from cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxtK8DWdIwdxF5X2TJcIRDSEtE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532753'),
  ('851943159949189505', 'Dying to Tell', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Hernán Zin', 'Hernán Zin', 'Hernán Zin', null, 'In 2012, awarded filmmaker Hernán Zin suffered an accident in Afghanistan that changed his life forever. The traumas he had been accumulating during 20 years of war reporting suddenly imploded. He began suffering depression, loneliness and self-destructive behaviors. Searching for answers of what happened to him, Hernán Zin decided to interview other journalists. He asked them about their traumas, their losses, their fears and their families. DYING TO TELL is the first documentary film ever made about trauma in war reporters. It is a brutal and torn portrait of war, and a tribute to those who risk their lives for the world to be informed. —Contramedia Films', 'In 2012, awarded filmmaker Hernán Zin suffered an accident in Afghanistan that changed his life forever. The traumas he had been accumulating during 20 years of war reporting suddenly imploded. He began suffering depression, loneliness and self-destructive behaviors. Searching for answers of what happened to him, Hernán Zin decided to interview other journalists. He asked them about their traumas, their losses, their fears and their families. DYING TO TELL is the first documentary film ever made about trauma in war reporters. It is a brutal and torn portrait of war, and a tribute to those who risk their lives for the world to be informed. —Contramedia Films', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UtXeya48TzXyjCd6VDTIAv7FQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548564'),
  ('914099400619593401', 'Dying Young', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joel Schumacher, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Stephen P. Dunn', 'Richard Friedenberg', 'Julia Roberts, Campbell Scott, Vincent D''Onofrio, Colleen Dewhurst, David Selby, Ellen Burstyn, Dion Anderson, George Martin', 'R', 'After she discovers that her boyfriend has betrayed her, Hilary O''Neil is looking for a new start and a new job. She begins to work as a private nurse for a young man suffering from blood cancer. Slowly, they fall in love, but they always know their love cannot last because he is destined to die.', 'After she discovers that her boyfriend has betrayed her, Hilary O''Neil is looking for a new start and a new job. She begins to work as a private nurse for a young man suffering from blood cancer. Slowly, they fall in love, but they always know their love cannot last because he is destined to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLVV8TETjCxWQmIip6t3HO1znVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9079'),
  ('134825691506611958', 'Dyketactics', 1974, 'Romance, Drama', 'Barbara Hammer', 'Barbara Hammer', 'Barbara Hammer', null, 'Born in Los Angeles but a New Yorker by choice, Barbara Hammer is a whole genre unto herself. Her pioneering 1974 short film Dyketactics, a four-minute, hippie wonder consisting of frolicking naked women in the countryside, broke new ground for its exploration of lesbian identity, desire and aesthetic.', 'Born in Los Angeles but a New Yorker by choice, Barbara Hammer is a whole genre unto herself. Her pioneering 1974 short film Dyketactics, a four-minute, hippie wonder consisting of frolicking naked women in the countryside, broke new ground for its exploration of lesbian identity, desire and aesthetic.', null, 'tmdb:movie:258907'),
  ('587008528986713800', 'Dylan Dog: Dead of Night', 2011, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kevin Munroe, Geoffrey Hall', 'Thomas Dean Donnelly, Joshua Oppenheimer', 'Brandon Routh, Peter Stormare, Sam Huntington, Taye Diggs, Anita Briem, Kurt Angle, Andrew Sensenig, Randal Reeder', 'PG-13', 'Supernatural private eye, Dylan Dog, seeks out the monsters of the Louisiana bayou in his signature red shirt, black jacket and blue jeans.', 'Supernatural private eye, Dylan Dog, seeks out the monsters of the Louisiana bayou in his signature red shirt, black jacket and blue jeans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZdYn5IktnGVg7pRA2JHD1rdZDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43935'),
  ('1137224696449244400', 'Dylan Dog: Victim Of Circumstances', 2014, 'Thriller, Adventure, Mystery', 'Claudio Di Biagio, Adriano Santucci', 'Luca Vecchi', 'Valerio Di Benedetto, Luca Vecchi, Milena Vukotić, Alessandro Haber, Massimo Bonetti, Ludovica Bargellini, Lucia Batassa, Alessandra Calamassi', null, 'Adele is suffering from a terrifying recurring dream; a dream that often borders on reality, and even enters it in the form of horrible visions which climax during an evening stroll in the center of Rome. The medical findings don''t reveal anything noteworthy and her brother, who was with her that evening, is diagnosed with a simple seizure. Faced with a general skepticism, Adele has no other choice but to turn to the unconventional, so she decides to seek out Dylan Dog - a paranormal investigator', 'Adele is suffering from a terrifying recurring dream; a dream that often borders on reality, and even enters it in the form of horrible visions which climax during an evening stroll in the center of Rome. The medical findings don''t reveal anything noteworthy and her brother, who was with her that evening, is diagnosed with a simple seizure. Faced with a general skepticism, Adele has no other choice but to turn to the unconventional, so she decides to seek out Dylan Dog - a paranormal investigator', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIV2u8Xswu1wbxJ5kA7DOlcr2aO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300838'),
  ('742235412616203696', 'Dyn Amo', 1972, 'Drama', 'Stephen Dwoskin, Stephen Dwoskin', 'Stephen Dwoskin, Chris Wilkerson', 'Jenny Runacre, Pat Ford, Catherine Kessler, Linda Marlowe, Malcolm Kaye, John Grillo, Andrew Carr, Derek Paget', null, '''Dyn Amo'' is a ''drama'' exploring the distinction between a person''s self and his projection of that self to others; and it''s a ''horror movie'' tragically suggesting how a projection can become more substantial than the self behind it. Its subjects are role-playing (especially sexual role-playing), and the masochism of playing a role that conforms to others'' exploitative interests.', '''Dyn Amo'' is a ''drama'' exploring the distinction between a person''s self and his projection of that self to others; and it''s a ''horror movie'' tragically suggesting how a projection can become more substantial than the self behind it. Its subjects are role-playing (especially sexual role-playing), and the masochism of playing a role that conforms to others'' exploitative interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifQgVHUWP4VHnxJfF9eZPo10o1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162419'),
  ('563752117748819089', 'Dynamite', 1929, 'Drama', 'Cecil B. DeMille, J. Peverell Marley', 'Jeanie Macpherson', 'Conrad Nagel, Kay Johnson, Charles Bickford, Julia Faye, Joel McCrea, Muriel McCormac, Robert Edeson, William Holden', null, 'Wealthy Cynthia is in love with not-so-wealthy Roger, who is married to Marcia. The threesome is terribly modern about the situation, and Marcia will gladly divorce Roger if Cynthia agrees to a financial settlement. But Cynthia''s wealth is in jeopardy because her trust fund will expire if she is not married by a certain date. To satisfy that condition, Cynthia arranges to marry Hagon Derk, who is condemned to die for a crime he didn''t commit. She pays him so he can provide for his little sister. But at the last minute, Derk is freed when the true criminal is discovered. Expecting to be a rich widow, Cynthia finds herself married to a man she doesn''t know and doesn''t want to.', 'Wealthy Cynthia is in love with not-so-wealthy Roger, who is married to Marcia. The threesome is terribly modern about the situation, and Marcia will gladly divorce Roger if Cynthia agrees to a financial settlement. But Cynthia''s wealth is in jeopardy because her trust fund will expire if she is not married by a certain date. To satisfy that condition, Cynthia arranges to marry Hagon Derk, who is condemned to die for a crime he didn''t commit. She pays him so he can provide for his little sister. But at the last minute, Derk is freed when the true criminal is discovered. Expecting to be a rich widow, Cynthia finds herself married to a man she doesn''t know and doesn''t want to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqoknfqWeGbGHzxswX0f3bA7TVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173580'),
  ('633701572952098033', 'Dynamite Warrior', 2006, 'Action', 'Chalerm Wongpim', 'Chalerm Wongpim', 'Dan Chupong, Putthipong Sriwat, Panna Rittikrai, Samart Payakaroon, Kanyapak Suworakood, Somdet Kaew-ler, Ampon Rattanawong, Wichai Prommajan', null, 'The story is set in 1890s Siam. Siang is a young Muay Thai warrior and rocketry expert who steals back water buffalo taken from poor Isan farmers by unscrupulous cattle raiders. He is searching for a man with a tattoo who killed his parents.', 'The story is set in 1890s Siam. Siang is a young Muay Thai warrior and rocketry expert who steals back water buffalo taken from poor Isan farmers by unscrupulous cattle raiders. He is searching for a man with a tattoo who killed his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yRZYBeYJgM49MGWEX1LQNgzqza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14818'),
  ('3737973410375541', 'Dynasty Warriors', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Roy Chow Hin-Yeung, Shadow Hung, Kenny Tse Chung-To', 'Christine To Chi-Long', 'Wang Kai, Han Geng, Louis Koo, Tony Yang, Ray Lui, Carina Lau, Gulnezer Bextiyar, Lam Suet', 'PG-13', 'In the turbulent late Eastern Han Dynasty, ambitious Dong Zhuo controls the court and the commonalty, and heroes from all over the country begin to rise.', 'In the turbulent late Eastern Han Dynasty, ambitious Dong Zhuo controls the court and the commonalty, and heroes from all over the country begin to rise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BCTdek5LFHglcgl7shsm7igJAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525660'),
  ('833924953441757432', 'Dystopia', 2018, 'Science Fiction', 'Paul Tanter', 'Paul Robert Lingas', 'Michael Copon, Sheena Colette, Simon Phillips, Eve Mauro, Rich Paul, Peter Woodward, Leo Goodman, Robert Shepherd', null, 'It is the year 2037. Our world is dying, slowly, from a virus that has rendered mankind infertile. Not a single child has been born in 25 years. Governments are now powerless puppets for the biggest corporations and Biocorp, the world''s biggest, keeps promising a cure that never comes', 'It is the year 2037. Our world is dying, slowly, from a virus that has rendered mankind infertile. Not a single child has been born in 25 years. Governments are now powerless puppets for the biggest corporations and Biocorp, the world''s biggest, keeps promising a cure that never comes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8luuxpom0e0u8q3x4MtvKR0tozA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520788'),
  ('919858778323894942', 'Dzhamilya', 1969, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Irina Poplavskaya, Kadyrzhan Kydyraliyev', 'Chinghiz Aitmatov', 'Natalya Arinbasarova, Suimenkul Chokmorov, Nasreddin Dubashev, Aliman Dzhangorozova, Altynbek Kenzhekov, Bolot Beyshenaliev, Nasyr Kitayev, Chinghiz Aitmatov', null, 'In a remote Kyrgyz village, Dzhamilya follows her parents'' orders when she marries a man without loving him. Then World War II breaks out and her new husband has to leave the village. While being alone, Dzhamiliya meets the returning soldier Daniyar and falls in love with him instead. Years later, their young friend Seid reminisces about the couple.', 'In a remote Kyrgyz village, Dzhamilya follows her parents'' orders when she marries a man without loving him. Then World War II breaks out and her new husband has to leave the village. While being alone, Dzhamiliya meets the returning soldier Daniyar and falls in love with him instead. Years later, their young friend Seid reminisces about the couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eW4BUuZGughuPU7te69Gzhh6QZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148430'),
  ('85183170664731768', 'E a Vida Continua...', 2012, 'Drama', 'Paulo Figueiredo', 'Paulo Figueiredo', 'Amanda Acosta, Luiz Baccelli, Lima Duarte, Ana Lúcia Torre, Pedro Costa', null, 'Ernesto is 50 years old and carries with him a tragedy from the past, which he hides behind a good-humored smile. He meets 25-year-old Evelina when helping her on the road after her car breaks down. Both are going to the same hotel and, little by little, build a solid friendship based also on the difficulties faced throughout life, since Evelina is emotionally hurt due to her husband''s infidelity.', 'Ernesto is 50 years old and carries with him a tragedy from the past, which he hides behind a good-humored smile. He meets 25-year-old Evelina when helping her on the road after her car breaks down. Both are going to the same hotel and, little by little, build a solid friendship based also on the difficulties faced throughout life, since Evelina is emotionally hurt due to her husband''s infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGsZd5MPX8LCqE9Pwi5VPL4G6n6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150181'),
  ('359639530936305156', 'E allora mambo!', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Fabio Cianchetti, Gianni Costantino', 'Fabio Bonifacci, Lucio Pellegrini', 'Luca Bizzarri, Paolo Kessisoglu, Luciana Littizzetto, Maddalena Maggi, Gigio Alberti, Cosima Coccheri, Gianni Fantoni, Valentina Carnelutti', null, 'After receiving a large sum of money on his bank account by mistake, a small-town thirtysomething dissatisfied with his life sees the opportunity of turning back the clock to when things were good, reliving the carefree life of an university student in a big city. Here, he falls in love with a girl and gets her pregnant. There''s just one problem: he already has a wife and a daughter back home!', 'After receiving a large sum of money on his bank account by mistake, a small-town thirtysomething dissatisfied with his life sees the opportunity of turning back the clock to when things were good, reliving the carefree life of an university student in a big city. Here, he falls in love with a girl and gets her pregnant. There''s just one problem: he already has a wife and a daughter back home!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZqw9vdFSbU3qgwxUnDgPvWWglh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70154'),
