  ('694697323297562673', 'E io non pago: L''Italia dei furbetti', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Capone, Dario Germani, Alessandro Sanacore', 'Marzio Rossi, Alessandro Tavanelli, Luca Biglione', 'Jerry Calà, Maurizio Mattioli, Valeria Marini, Enzo Salvi, Maurizio Casagrande, Benito Urgu, Adolfo Margiotta, Cosetta Turco', null, 'Two customs officers undercover, Marshal Remo Signorelli and Brigadier Riccardo Riva, try to stop Massimiliano Grilli, a master of evasion. On one occasion, Remo meets his old friend Fulvio who suspected he had an affair with his then girlfriend and now wife.', 'Two customs officers undercover, Marshal Remo Signorelli and Brigadier Riccardo Riva, try to stop Massimiliano Grilli, a master of evasion. On one occasion, Remo meets his old friend Fulvio who suspected he had an affair with his then girlfriend and now wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYZeUSUbchUs31GRGqEfmZdDXfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170110'),
  ('4353975509850268', 'È nata una star?', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Gian Enrico Bianchi', 'Michele Pellegrini, Lucio Pellegrini, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Luciana Littizzetto, Rocco Papaleo, Pietro Castellitto, Michela Cescon, Antonino Bruschetta, Gisella Burinato, Fausto Maria Sciarappa, Cristina Odasso', null, 'Marco, a shy teenager, learns that he has... what it takes to be a great porn star, but he doesn''t know how to tell his parents. Hell breaks loose when a neighbor finds a porn video of him and leaves it in his parents'' mailbox.', 'Marco, a shy teenager, learns that he has... what it takes to be a great porn star, but he doesn''t know how to tell his parents. Hell breaks loose when a neighbor finds a porn video of him and leaves it in his parents'' mailbox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjKRJYM0XcSw500cj41tgJU1K4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97836'),
  ('990498172518526197', 'E-love', 2011, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Anne Villacèque, Pierre Milon', 'Anne Villacèque, Sophie Fillières', 'Anne Consigny, Carlo Brandt, Antoine Chappey, Carole Franck, Rebecca Marder, Evelyne Didi, Claude Duneton, Laurent Manzoni', null, 'Paule is pushing 50, as she repeatedly observes in her voice-over commentary. When she – a philosophy lecturer with a 10-year marriage and a 15-year-old daughter – learns that her husband is having an affair with a 28-year-old, this number takes on a special weight. The Internet site “L’âme-sœur” is supposed to help Paule get through her burgeoning midlife crisis...', 'Paule is pushing 50, as she repeatedly observes in her voice-over commentary. When she – a philosophy lecturer with a 10-year marriage and a 15-year-old daughter – learns that her husband is having an affair with a 28-year-old, this number takes on a special weight. The Internet site “L’âme-sœur” is supposed to help Paule get through her burgeoning midlife crisis...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQ6hw8XF27kjgAmc8mcgx4cKqJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148851'),
  ('518760834872672798', 'E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Steven Spielberg, Allen Daviau, Katy Emde', 'Melissa Mathison', 'Henry Thomas, Drew Barrymore, Robert MacNaughton, Peter Coyote, Dee Wallace, Erika Eleniak, K.C. Martel, C. Thomas Howell', 'PG', 'An alien is left behind on Earth and saved by the 10-year-old Elliott who decides to keep him hidden in his home. While a task force hunts for the extra-terrestrial, Elliott, his brother, and his little sister Gertie form an emotional bond with their new friend, and try to help him find his way home.', 'An alien is left behind on Earth and saved by the 10-year-old Elliott who decides to keep him hidden in his home. While a task force hunts for the extra-terrestrial, Elliott, his brother, and his little sister Gertie form an emotional bond with their new friend, and try to help him find his way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an0nD6uq6byfxXCfk6lQBzdL2J1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601'),
  ('877249016609832964', 'E=mc²', 2002, 'Action, Comedy', 'Olaf Lubaszenko, Piotr Wojtowicz', 'Robert Mąka', 'Olaf Lubaszenko, Cezary Pazura, Agnieszka Włodarczyk, Renata Dancewicz, Edward Linde-Lubaszenko, Jan Nowicki, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Andrzej Grabowski', null, 'The film tells about mainly three people - Max, a bored, smart, poor University Professor of Philosophy; Ramzes, a mafia leader, cool, strong, merciless bully and Stella, Ramzes girlfriend.', 'The film tells about mainly three people - Max, a bored, smart, poor University Professor of Philosophy; Ramzes, a mafia leader, cool, strong, merciless bully and Stella, Ramzes girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cY3Jv6as4IQjdQdybvDz9YHw3BT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14224'),
  ('808358867051704983', 'Each and Every Moment', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Nicolas Philibert, Nicolas Philibert', 'Nicolas Philibert', null, null, 'Every year, thousands of students – mostly female – embark upon courses that will lead them to become nurses. This film follows the ups and downs of an apprenticeship that will confront them, often at a young age, with human fragility, suffering, illness, the flaws in souls and bodies.', 'Every year, thousands of students – mostly female – embark upon courses that will lead them to become nurses. This film follows the ups and downs of an apprenticeship that will confront them, often at a young age, with human fragility, suffering, illness, the flaws in souls and bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wY2G5qyew3VgeAiEivgOp2CxHZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536510'),
  ('201750605358432791', 'Each Dawn I Die', 1939, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'William Keighley, Arthur Edeson, Frank Heath', 'Warren Duff, Norman Reilly Raine, Charles Perry', 'James Cagney, George Raft, Jane Bryan, George Bancroft, Maxie Rosenbloom, Stanley Ridges, Alan Baxter, Victor Jory', 'NR', 'A corrupt D.A. with governatorial ambitions is annoyed by an investigative reporter''s criticism of his criminal activities and decides to frame the reporter for manslaughter in order to silence him.', 'A corrupt D.A. with governatorial ambitions is annoyed by an investigative reporter''s criticism of his criminal activities and decides to frame the reporter for manslaughter in order to silence him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgzSlasazy1rNH4myfAohLY6o9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36342'),
  ('638208306393536785', 'Eadweard Muybridge, Zoopraxographer', 1975, 'Documentary, History', 'Thom Andersen, Morgan Fisher, Fay Andersen', 'Morgan Fisher, Fay Andersen, Thom Andersen', 'Dean Stockwell, Eadweard Muybridge, Anje Bos, Sharon Hagen', null, 'Thom Andersen''s hour-long documentary adroitly combines biography, history, film theory, and philosophical reflection. Muybridge''s photographic studies of animal locomotion in the 1870s were a major forerunner of movies; even more interesting are his subsequent studies of diverse people, photographed against neutral backgrounds.', 'Thom Andersen''s hour-long documentary adroitly combines biography, history, film theory, and philosophical reflection. Muybridge''s photographic studies of animal locomotion in the 1870s were a major forerunner of movies; even more interesting are his subsequent studies of diverse people, photographed against neutral backgrounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZtOIpFKNrSn74wZhsnwcPSmBdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123092'),
  ('222577741066019256', 'Eager Bodies', 2003, 'Drama', 'Xavier Giannoli, Yorick Le Saux, Xavier Giannoli', 'Xavier Giannoli', 'Laura Smet, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Marie Denarnaud, Catherine Salviat, Maurice Antoni, Julien Bouvard, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Catherine Ducerf', null, 'Paul and Charlotte are in love. Charlotte discovers she has a grave malady and Paul supports her. But Paul is also attracted to Ninon, another girl. Charlotte accepts Paul to have an affair with her, and the three start a difficult and ambiguous relationship.', 'Paul and Charlotte are in love. Charlotte discovers she has a grave malady and Paul supports her. But Paul is also attracted to Ninon, another girl. Charlotte accepts Paul to have an affair with her, and the three start a difficult and ambiguous relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZ2cflbifYjS9Z1HQhs4NwD3HwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31356'),
  ('250998615235548865', 'Eagle and Jaguar, The Legendary Warriors', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Mike R. Ortiz', 'Mike R. Ortiz', 'José Eduardo Derbez, Romina Marroquín, Franco Escamilla, Roberto Palazuelos, Eduardo España, Edgar Vivar, Yurem Rojas, Daniela Basso', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic future in which water has almost disappeared, two young survivors travel back in time to find the mythical power of the prehispanic God of water, and so be able to create the vital resource. However, when they arrive at the present they discover that the power is in the hands of an unscrupulous businessman who had always wanted to monopolize water and who knows everything about prehispanic myths. The Aztaya brotherhood, a group of heroes, successors from the legendary Aztec and Mayan warriors, will begin the adventure to prevent the villain''s plan and help the travelers to change their sad future, teaming up to fight the powerful enemy and his dark allies. To win, the heroes will have to awake the greatest warriors of Aztec and Mayan mythology: The Eagle and the Jaguar.', 'In a post-apocalyptic future in which water has almost disappeared, two young survivors travel back in time to find the mythical power of the prehispanic God of water, and so be able to create the vital resource. However, when they arrive at the present they discover that the power is in the hands of an unscrupulous businessman who had always wanted to monopolize water and who knows everything about prehispanic myths. The Aztaya brotherhood, a group of heroes, successors from the legendary Aztec and Mayan warriors, will begin the adventure to prevent the villain''s plan and help the travelers to change their sad future, teaming up to fight the powerful enemy and his dark allies. To win, the heroes will have to awake the greatest warriors of Aztec and Mayan mythology: The Eagle and the Jaguar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qR9WbXYIddZcVk6nxFULfHcKmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029599'),
  ('880291191609590990', 'Eagle Eye', 2008, 'Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'D.J. Caruso, Martha Johnston, Dariusz Wolski', 'John Glenn, Travis Wright, Dan McDermott', 'Shia LaBeouf, Michelle Monaghan, Rosario Dawson, Michael Chiklis, Anthony Mackie, Ethan Embry, Billy Bob Thornton, Anthony Azizi', 'PG-13', 'Jerry Shaw and Rachel Holloman are two strangers whose lives are suddenly thrown into turmoil by a mysterious woman they have never met. Threatening their lives and family, the unseen caller uses everyday technology to control their actions and push them into increasing danger. As events escalate, Jerry and Rachel become the country''s most-wanted fugitives and must figure out what is happening to them.', 'Jerry Shaw and Rachel Holloman are two strangers whose lives are suddenly thrown into turmoil by a mysterious woman they have never met. Threatening their lives and family, the unseen caller uses everyday technology to control their actions and push them into increasing danger. As events escalate, Jerry and Rachel become the country''s most-wanted fugitives and must figure out what is happening to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KCOv0hL37IN3tWG3j86eZg3xDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13027'),
  ('965301456666762936', 'Eagle Shadow Fist', 1973, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Chu Mu, Ngai Hoi-Fung', 'So Lam', 'Wong Ching, Jackie Chan, Yuen Qiu, Alex Lung, Chiang Nan, Chu Mu, Ren Hao, Lee Man-Tai', null, 'Historical movie set during the Japanese occupation of China during WWII. Jackie Chan is one of the good guys but has nothing much more than a supporting role.', 'Historical movie set during the Japanese occupation of China during WWII. Jackie Chan is one of the good guys but has nothing much more than a supporting role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOxoM1mr6ePsOMXDdv5zBHkjZsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21537'),
  ('503925083566574881', 'Eagle Talon THE MOVIE 3', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Action', 'FROGMAN', null, 'FROGMAN, Yukie Kawamura, Mo Chugakusei, Mariko Dou', null, 'Returning from vacation, the members of Eagle Talon discover their secret lair destroyed. The only clue may lie with the missing Professor Leonardo.', 'Returning from vacation, the members of Eagle Talon discover their secret lair destroyed. The only clue may lie with the missing Professor Leonardo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OrdTIGCippdmaBA9T0kBAauYAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:863158'),
  ('925148373517258631', 'Eagle vs Shark', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Taika Waititi, Adam Clark, Axel Paton', 'Taika Waititi', 'Loren Taylor, Jemaine Clement, Joel Tobeck, Brian Sergent, Craig Hall, Rachel House, Morag Hills, Bernard Stewart', 'R', 'Love blossoms for Lily over double Meaty Boy burgers at mid-day when uber-computer nerd Jarrod comes in and leaves with free extra large fries. After gatecrashing Jarrod''s party and proving her skills on the game console, Lily goes down to Jarrod''s home town with him so he can settle an old score with a past school bully.', 'Love blossoms for Lily over double Meaty Boy burgers at mid-day when uber-computer nerd Jarrod comes in and leaves with free extra large fries. After gatecrashing Jarrod''s party and proving her skills on the game console, Lily goes down to Jarrod''s home town with him so he can settle an old score with a past school bully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHGHxXX8jOLV33r8rf1wjBkIdgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8748'),
  ('816453405591586798', 'Eagle''s Wing', 1979, 'Western, Drama', 'Anthony Harvey, Billy Williams, Jake Wright', 'John Briley', 'Martin Sheen, Sam Waterston, Harvey Keitel, Stéphane Audran, John Castle, Caroline Langrishe, Jorge Russek, Manuel Ojeda', null, 'Two men, an aging Native American and a ne''er-do-well trapper from North America, race to claim the stallion Eagle''s Wing in antebellum Mexico, meeting marauded stagecoach travelers and garrisoned Mexicans along the way.', 'Two men, an aging Native American and a ne''er-do-well trapper from North America, race to claim the stallion Eagle''s Wing in antebellum Mexico, meeting marauded stagecoach travelers and garrisoned Mexicans along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlK1K4h1Iroi9fvW8I71RjjMGHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131194'),
  ('584297675478854549', 'Eagles Over London', 1969, 'Drama, Action, History, War', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Alejandro Ulloa, Mariano Canales', 'Gilles Morris-Dumoulin, Vincenzo Mannino, José Luis Martínez Mollá', 'Frederick Stafford, Van Johnson, Francisco Rabal, Ida Galli, Luigi Pistilli, Renzo Palmer, Luis Dávila, Christian Hay', null, 'The British High Command finds itself in the thick of a huge dilemma when it is realized that they have long been infiltrated by spies from a German intelligence group. This all happens during the preliminary stages of the Battle of Britain.', 'The British High Command finds itself in the thick of a huge dilemma when it is realized that they have long been infiltrated by spies from a German intelligence group. This all happens during the preliminary stages of the Battle of Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBj4vrJKemNh9oBMPrMwOJDkwnm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24971'),
  ('269664318097386235', 'Early Abstractions', 1965, 'Animation', 'Harry Smith', null, null, null, 'Early Abstractions is a collection of seven short animated films created by Harry Everett Smith between 1939 and 1956. Each film is between two and six minutes long, and is named according to the chronological order in which it was made. The collection includes Numbers 1–5, 7, and 10.', 'Early Abstractions is a collection of seven short animated films created by Harry Everett Smith between 1939 and 1956. Each film is between two and six minutes long, and is named according to the chronological order in which it was made. The collection includes Numbers 1–5, 7, and 10.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyNH4DFeu4gr5kUteS3JqiI66ZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150931'),
