  ('318437339086922323', 'Early Birds', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Michael Steiner', 'Thomas Ritter', 'Nilam Farooq, Silvana Synovia, Anatole Taubman, Edon Rizvanolli, Dimitri Stapfer, Burak Yiğit', null, 'The neo-noir thriller EARLY BIRDS tells the story of the two wildly different women Annika and Caro, who become embroiled in a web of unpredictable events following a night out on the town. As the two flee together from the police, drug dealers and themselves, they''re confronted by the collision of two worlds: their personal freedom and unrelenting violence.', 'The neo-noir thriller EARLY BIRDS tells the story of the two wildly different women Annika and Caro, who become embroiled in a web of unpredictable events following a night out on the town. As the two flee together from the police, drug dealers and themselves, they''re confronted by the collision of two worlds: their personal freedom and unrelenting violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNcs0Pukc9RQ8KulkYuaDEKCXit.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1170260'),
  ('477726314835551254', 'Early Man', 2018, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Adventure', 'Charles Copping, Paul Smith, Nick Park', 'James Higginson, Mark Burton', 'Eddie Redmayne, Tom Hiddleston, Maisie Williams, Timothy Spall, Miriam Margolyes, Rob Brydon, Kayvan Novak, Richard Ayoade', 'PG', 'Dug, along with his sidekick Hognob, unite a cavemen tribe to save their hidden valley from being spoiled and, all together as a team, to face the menace of a mysterious and mighty enemy, on the turf of an ancient and sacred sport.', 'Dug, along with his sidekick Hognob, unite a cavemen tribe to save their hidden valley from being spoiled and, all together as a team, to face the menace of a mysterious and mighty enemy, on the turf of an ancient and sacred sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iW2rntwLZoGlFCYYy8TjHyblbw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387592'),
  ('457753600021911708', 'Early One Morning', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marc Moutout, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Jean-Marc Moutout', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Valérie Dréville, Xavier Beauvois, Yannick Renier, Laurent Delbecque, Ralph Amoussou, Aladin Reibel, Pierre Aussedat', null, 'Monday morning. Paul Wertret, 50, heads off to his job as a manager at the International Credit and Trade Bank. He arrives at 8 o''clock on the dot, as usual. He enters a meeting room, takes out a gun and kills two of his bosses. Then he locks himself in his office. As he waits for the inevitable police assault, this ordinary man looks back over his life and the events that led him to commit such an act.', 'Monday morning. Paul Wertret, 50, heads off to his job as a manager at the International Credit and Trade Bank. He arrives at 8 o''clock on the dot, as usual. He enters a meeting room, takes out a gun and kills two of his bosses. Then he locks himself in his office. As he waits for the inevitable police assault, this ordinary man looks back over his life and the events that led him to commit such an act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cv448bkJZmcMP07K9WcgX4Ujr9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89705'),
