  ('112907412869228304', 'Early to Bed', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald has to get up early, but everything seems to be working to keep him awake. His loudly ticking alarm clock resists several attempts to quiet it. Donald ultimately swallows it; the glow-in-the-dark dial can be seen through his feathers. Then his folding bed folds up on him. Springs start popping out of it; Donald builds an elaborate framework to hold it down. Finally, enough of the clock reassembles itself to sound the alarm and night is over.', 'Donald has to get up early, but everything seems to be working to keep him awake. His loudly ticking alarm clock resists several attempts to quiet it. Donald ultimately swallows it; the glow-in-the-dark dial can be seen through his feathers. Then his folding bed folds up on him. Springs start popping out of it; Donald builds an elaborate framework to hold it down. Finally, enough of the clock reassembles itself to sound the alarm and night is over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TGFVW7s2GUSZrLalSKecYod0YA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55557'),
  ('588090728251256855', 'Early to Bet', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', 'NR', 'The Gambling Bug causes gambling fever in anyone he bites.', 'The Gambling Bug causes gambling fever in anyone he bites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l2v4UTdjeZyAEihP3eJJzjpOR1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145941'),
  ('110208575938096536', 'Ears', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Aronadio, Francesco Di Giacomo', 'Alessandro Aronadio, Astutillo Smeriglia', 'Daniele Parisi, Silvia D''Amico, Pamela Villoresi, Ivan Franěk, Rocco Papaleo, Piera Degli Esposti, Milena Vukotić, Andrea Purgatori', null, 'A man wakes up one morning with an annoying ringing sound in his ears. A note on the fridge says: "Your friend Luigi has died. P.S. I took the car". The problem is that he does not even remember who this guy Luigi is. This is just the beginning of a tragicomic day during which he will be plunged into the folly of the world. One of those days that changes your life forever.', 'A man wakes up one morning with an annoying ringing sound in his ears. A note on the fridge says: "Your friend Luigi has died. P.S. I took the car". The problem is that he does not even remember who this guy Luigi is. This is just the beginning of a tragicomic day during which he will be plunged into the folly of the world. One of those days that changes your life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJgdra7UiRFYOOhHMaHToJzrGqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413923'),
  ('1137735429750028094', 'Earth', 1930, 'Drama', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko, Danylo Demutsky, Yuliya Solntseva', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko', 'Stepan Shkurat, Semen Svashenko, Yuliya Solntseva, Elena Maksimova, Vasyl Krasenko, Mykola Nademskyi, Ivan Franko, Petro Masokha', 'NR', 'The film tells about the creation of the first collective farm communes and class enmity. Vasyl, a member of the Komsomol, with the help of a local party organization, gets a tractor and plows private boundaries "on kulak fields." However, this enthusiasm will cost him dearly.', 'The film tells about the creation of the first collective farm communes and class enmity. Vasyl, a member of the Komsomol, with the help of a local party organization, gets a tractor and plows private boundaries "on kulak fields." However, this enthusiasm will cost him dearly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyWzVnZ3ot0nSPgG88B0Ni19k2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46594'),
  ('741053395768016758', 'Earth', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Javier Aguirresarobe, Julio Medem, Txarly Llorente', 'Julio Medem', 'Carmelo Gómez, Emma Suárez, Karra Elejalde, Silke, Nancho Novo, Txema Blasco, Ane Sánchez, Juan José Suárez', null, 'A mysterious exterminator falls in love with two women who live in a distinctive wine-producing region in Spain.', 'A mysterious exterminator falls in love with two women who live in a distinctive wine-producing region in Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGIoe43zo80lOs3HgN9mbHjb5jd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2460'),
  ('23801541084121084', 'Earth', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Deepa Mehta, Giles Nuttgens', 'Deepa Mehta', 'Aamir Khan, Nandita Das, Rahul Khanna, Maia Sethna, Kitu Gidwani, Arif Zakaria, Eric Peterson, Kulbhushan Kharbanda', null, 'It''s 1947 and the borderlines between India and Pakistan are being drawn. A young girl bears witnesses to tragedy as her ayah is caught between the love of two men and the rising tide of political and religious violence.', 'It''s 1947 and the borderlines between India and Pakistan are being drawn. A young girl bears witnesses to tragedy as her ayah is caught between the love of two men and the rising tide of political and religious violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQtvQYlxfEHl45TR41lNSywrq4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7504'),
  ('716063730918420255', 'Earth', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Richard Brooks Burton, Alastair Fothergill, Andrew Shillabeer', 'Alastair Fothergill, Mark Linfield, Leslie Megahey', 'Patrick Stewart, Constantino Romero, James Earl Jones, Ken Watanabe, Ulrich Tukur, Anggun', 'G', 'An epic story of adventure, starring some of the most magnificent and courageous creatures alive, awaits you in EARTH. Disneynature brings you a remarkable story of three animal families on a journey across our planet – polar bears, elephants and humpback whales.', 'An epic story of adventure, starring some of the most magnificent and courageous creatures alive, awaits you in EARTH. Disneynature brings you a remarkable story of three animal families on a journey across our planet – polar bears, elephants and humpback whales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xybnXW6E28W9agiwUeGLbTYS454.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10946'),
  ('754883652346841668', 'Earth 2100', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Rudy Bednar', null, null, null, 'Experts say over the next hundred years the "perfect storm" of population growth, resource depletion and climate change could converge with catastrophic results. The scenarios in Earth 2100 are not a prediction of what will happen but rather a warning about what might happen.', 'Experts say over the next hundred years the "perfect storm" of population growth, resource depletion and climate change could converge with catastrophic results. The scenarios in Earth 2100 are not a prediction of what will happen but rather a warning about what might happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1oAJxkSCu47D6kmdKkmja8pQJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21814'),
  ('819594925019789999', 'Earth and Blood', 2020, 'Action, Thriller', 'Julien Leclercq, Bob Vanwayenbergh, Brecht Goyvaerts', 'Jérémie Guez, Matthieu Serveau, Julien Leclercq', 'Sami Bouajila, Ériq Ebouaney, Samy Seghir, Sofia Lesaffre, Redouanne Harjane, Eric Kabongo, Oumar Diolo, Anis Benbatoul', null, 'A sawmill owner and his teenage daughter become tangled in a deadly feud when a drug dealer stashes stolen cocaine on their remote property.', 'A sawmill owner and his teenage daughter become tangled in a deadly feud when a drug dealer stashes stolen cocaine on their remote property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23S0NEXXOMhhXhF566Pw5sx7hnZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659067'),
  ('344353762389240408', 'Earth Angel', 1991, 'Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Stan Taylor, Bob Lewis, Tana M. Manners', 'Nina Shengold', 'Cathy Podewell, Rainbow Harvest, Roddy McDowall, Mark Hamill, Cindy Williams, Erik Estrada, Dustin Nguyễn, Garrett Morris', 'PG', 'When a prom queen dies in 1962, her only means of entering Heaven is by returning to 1990 earth, to assist friends from her youth.', 'When a prom queen dies in 1962, her only means of entering Heaven is by returning to 1990 earth, to assist friends from her youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pX5prwPekuZHcnAf8mBbURAGvDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246900'),
  ('83817201215384020', 'Earth Girls Are Easy', 1988, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Music, Romance', 'Julien Temple, Oliver Stapleton', 'Terrence E. McNally, Julie Brown, Charlie Coffey', 'Geena Davis, Jeff Goldblum, Jim Carrey, Damon Wayans, Julie Brown, Michael McKean, Charles Rocket, Larry Linville', 'PG', 'In this musical comedy, Valerie is dealing with her philandering fiancé, Ted, when she finds that a trio of aliens have crashed their spaceship into her swimming pool. Once the furry beings are shaved at her girlfriend''s salon, the women discover three handsome men underneath. After absorbing the native culture via television, the spacemen are ready to hit the dating scene in 1980s Los Angeles.', 'In this musical comedy, Valerie is dealing with her philandering fiancé, Ted, when she finds that a trio of aliens have crashed their spaceship into her swimming pool. Once the furry beings are shaved at her girlfriend''s salon, the women discover three handsome men underneath. After absorbing the native culture via television, the spacemen are ready to hit the dating scene in 1980s Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO9Edq8mgp9kD3N6EkCGYLnIVaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2210'),
  ('984074523291149346', 'Earth II', 1971, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Tom Gries, Michel Hugo', 'Allan Balter, William Read Woodfield', 'Gary Lockwood, Scott Hylands, Hari Rhodes, Anthony Franciosa, Mariette Hartley, Gary Merrill, Inga Swenson, Edward Bell', 'PG', 'In the near future, a space station dubbed Earth II is built for the purpose of scientific research and world peace. However, that peace is shattered when the Chinese send up a nuclear bomb that is orbiting just a few miles away from the station. Can the crew disarm the bomb before it detonates, not only destroying the station but setting off World War III?', 'In the near future, a space station dubbed Earth II is built for the purpose of scientific research and world peace. However, that peace is shattered when the Chinese send up a nuclear bomb that is orbiting just a few miles away from the station. Can the crew disarm the bomb before it detonates, not only destroying the station but setting off World War III?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvwZlb0WG3VJtJIkg7yQSygCJN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140354'),
  ('968992011230880907', 'Earth Light', 1970, 'Drama', 'Guy Gilles, Guy Gilles, Philippe Rousselot', 'Guy Gilles', 'Patrick Jouané, Edwige Feuillère, Annie Girardot, Micheline Presle, Élina Labourdette, Lucienne Boyer, Roger Hanin, Jacques Zanetti', null, 'The Tunisian born hero of the film decides to break with his disorganized yet habit-ridden life in Paris, and sets off to discover his homeland, which he left at 6 years old, and to rekindle the memory of his mother, who died when he was a child.', 'The Tunisian born hero of the film decides to break with his disorganized yet habit-ridden life in Paris, and sets off to discover his homeland, which he left at 6 years old, and to rekindle the memory of his mother, who died when he was a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miBnNFki29fr3nn2Bn4Yg9Gs7EV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84385'),
  ('1117091450913814703', 'Earth Mama', 2023, 'Drama', 'Savanah Leaf, Bryan Gildner, Nina Henninger', 'Savanah Leaf', 'Tia Nomore, Erika Alexander, Keta Price, Doechii, Sharon Duncan-Brewster, Bokeem Woodbine, Kami Jones, Slim Yani', 'R', 'A pregnant single mother, with two children in foster care, embraces her Bay Area community as she fights to reclaim her family.', 'A pregnant single mother, with two children in foster care, embraces her Bay Area community as she fights to reclaim her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA20kQaKxPvUbPeXyyc6ENJEEuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980537'),
  ('202503386789384821', 'Earth Rescue Day', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Hui Yu', 'Wang Zixin, Lu Zixuan', 'Jiang Chao, Ling Xiaosu, Yu Rongguang, Wang Zijia, Yu Entai, Liu Jianyu, Hu Zicheng, Wenjing Qin', null, 'Mankind is forced to live underground after a giant alien descends upon our planet. After spending years below, a team of braves a finally ready to head back to the top and fight for their planet, with a secret weapon that has been years in the making.', 'Mankind is forced to live underground after a giant alien descends upon our planet. After spending years below, a team of braves a finally ready to head back to the top and fight for their planet, with a secret weapon that has been years in the making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWY3GxtDMJyAIjjtDWwQEelmWT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910762'),
  ('794348674405771968', 'Earth to Echo', 2014, 'Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Dave Green, Maxime Alexandre, Zachary Fannin', 'Henry Gayden', 'Teo Halm, Stro, Reese Hartwig, Ella Wahlestedt, Jason Gray-Stanford, Algee Smith, Arthur Darbinyan, Cassius M. Willis', 'PG', 'After a construction project begins digging in their neighbourhood, best friends Tuck, Munch and Alex inexplicably begin to receive strange, encoded messages on their cell phones. Convinced something bigger is going on, they go to their parents and the authorities. The three embark on a secret adventure to crack the code and follow it to its source, and discover a mysterious being from another world who desperately needs their help. The journey that follows will change all their lives forever.', 'After a construction project begins digging in their neighbourhood, best friends Tuck, Munch and Alex inexplicably begin to receive strange, encoded messages on their cell phones. Convinced something bigger is going on, they go to their parents and the authorities. The three embark on a secret adventure to crack the code and follow it to its source, and discover a mysterious being from another world who desperately needs their help. The journey that follows will change all their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiNPza51nLvVTWTB9q4ifzfUlml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238603'),
  ('378873959529658640', 'Earth vs. the Flying Saucers', 1956, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Fred F. Sears, Gene Anderson Jr., Fred Jackman Jr.', 'George Worthing Yates, Bernard Gordon', 'Hugh Marlowe, Joan Taylor, Donald Curtis, Morris Ankrum, Thomas Browne Henry, Grandon Rhodes, John Zaremba, Paul Frees', 'NR', 'Test space rockets exploding at liftoff and increased reporting of UFO sightings culminate in a direct attempt by alien survivors of a dead, extra-galactic civilization to invade Earth from impervious flying saucers, using ray-weapons of mass destruction.', 'Test space rockets exploding at liftoff and increased reporting of UFO sightings culminate in a direct attempt by alien survivors of a dead, extra-galactic civilization to invade Earth from impervious flying saucers, using ray-weapons of mass destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCOLglZvQgQAyWMCZodBo3wmgqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18158'),
  ('327109579157669924', 'Earth vs. the Spider', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Jack A. Marta, Marty Moss', 'George Worthing Yates, László Görög', 'Ed Kemmer, June Kenney, Eugene Persson, Gene Roth, Hal Torey, June Jocelyn, Mickey Finn, Sally Fraser', 'NR', 'Teenagers from a small town and their high school science teacher join forces to battle a giant mutant spider, living in a cave nearby and getting hungry.', 'Teenagers from a small town and their high school science teacher join forces to battle a giant mutant spider, living in a cave nearby and getting hungry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uns8WSxu9LSFv0FkJP8uv6Q5kQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43115'),
  ('845166656790420191', 'Earth vs. the Spider', 2001, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Scott Ziehl, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Cary Solomon, Max Enscoe, Chuck Konzelman', 'Dan Aykroyd, Devon Gummersall, Amelia Heinle, Theresa Russell, Christopher Cousins, Mario Roccuzzo, John Cho, Randall Huber', null, 'A shy comic book fan is injected with an experimental serum and starts turning into a spider. When web covered bodies start appearing a policeman starts to investigate the strange case.', 'A shy comic book fan is injected with an experimental serum and starts turning into a spider. When web covered bodies start appearing a policeman starts to investigate the strange case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7i80BmhdqnvB5QhTt0oob7rKgnc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31013'),
  ('489438809239499824', 'Earth: One Amazing Day', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Peter Webber, Lixin Fan, Richard Dale', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce, Yan Geling', 'Robert Redford, Jackie Chan, Lee Je-hoon', 'G', 'An astonishing journey revealing the awesome power of the natural world. Over the course of one single day, we track the sun from the highest mountains to the remotest islands to exotic jungles.', 'An astonishing journey revealing the awesome power of the natural world. Over the course of one single day, we track the sun from the highest mountains to the remotest islands to exotic jungles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uZdJrpFDrsUddy5mG17lDBNxGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464593'),
  ('344196850632774705', 'Earth: The Power of the Planet', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Annabel Gillings, Ben Lawrie, Paul Olding', null, 'Iain Stewart', null, 'Dr Iain Stewart tells the story of how Earth works and how, over the course of 4.6 billion years, it came to be the remarkable place it is today.', 'Dr Iain Stewart tells the story of how Earth works and how, over the course of 4.6 billion years, it came to be the remarkable place it is today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f41ckyH0YeVXYXWA8wg7KXIZoa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25279'),
  ('202325094814477469', 'Earth''s Final Hours', 2011, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Anthony C. Metchie, W.D. Hogan', 'Rachelle S. Howie, David Ray', 'Hamza Adam, Julia Benson, Cameron Bright, Robert Knepper, Roark Critchlow, Bruce Davison, Andrew Chin, Ali Liebert', 'PG-13', 'After dense matter from an imploded white hole hits Earth, the planet''s rotation is devastated. A group of government agents must locate a lost satellite network that is the world''s only hope for survival.', 'After dense matter from an imploded white hole hits Earth, the planet''s rotation is devastated. A group of government agents must locate a lost satellite network that is the world''s only hope for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAQWdqXb6q83kbB9t1SkJTNkEdx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80034'),
  ('723153389019759675', 'Earthfall', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Steven Daniels, Stuart Brereton, Graham Geraghty', 'Neil Elman, Colin Reese', 'Joe Lando, Michelle Stafford, Diana Hopper, Denyse Tontz, Andrew Elvis Miller, Lou Ferrigno Jr., Jeff Doucette, Mark Rolston', null, 'As a rogue planet roars through our solar system, it acts as an intergalactic magnet that pulls Earth in its wake. Meteors destroy major cities. Fire and ice storms engulf the land. Casualties are in the millions. And as the situation grows even worse, Steve Lannon is determined to reunite with his wife and teenage daughter. But when they stumble into a secret government installation, they''ll uncover a nuclear mission that will either blast our planet back into orbit or guarantee front row seats to the end of the world.', 'As a rogue planet roars through our solar system, it acts as an intergalactic magnet that pulls Earth in its wake. Meteors destroy major cities. Fire and ice storms engulf the land. Casualties are in the millions. And as the situation grows even worse, Steve Lannon is determined to reunite with his wife and teenage daughter. But when they stumble into a secret government installation, they''ll uncover a nuclear mission that will either blast our planet back into orbit or guarantee front row seats to the end of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCaPFrbKnAjfcz9fUIoX0slelbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353257'),
  ('714034560926056974', 'Earthlings', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Shaun Monson', 'Shaun Monson', 'Joaquin Phoenix', null, 'Using hidden cameras and never-before-seen footage, Earthlings chronicles the day-to-day practices of the largest industries in the world, all of which rely entirely on animals for profit.', 'Using hidden cameras and never-before-seen footage, Earthlings chronicles the day-to-day practices of the largest industries in the world, all of which rely entirely on animals for profit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcRUYYyDWLJPlX7D6RPtQwdU7G2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30238'),
  ('1061046903443561275', 'Earthly Possessions', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'James Lapine, David Franco', null, 'Susan Sarandon, Stephen Dorff, Margo Martindale, Boyd Gaines, Deborah Rush, Jay O. Sanders, Alice Drummond, John Christopher Jones', 'R', 'A bored homemaker planning to run away from her minister husband is taken hostage in a bank robbery. However, she sees the thrill in being involved in the chase and becomes an accomplice to the young robber.', 'A bored homemaker planning to run away from her minister husband is taken hostage in a bank robbery. However, she sees the thrill in being involved in the chase and becomes an accomplice to the young robber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIDL4BmIgcukU7uVR34uQlUiMAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97964'),
  ('4930245624623418', 'Earthquake', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Philip H. Lathrop, Mark Robson, Murray Schwartz', 'George Fox, Mario Puzo', 'Charlton Heston, Ava Gardner, George Kennedy, Lorne Greene, Geneviève Bujold, Richard Roundtree, Marjoe Gortner, Barry Sullivan', 'PG', 'Various interconnected people struggle to survive when an earthquake of unimaginable magnitude hits Los Angeles, California.', 'Various interconnected people struggle to survive when an earthquake of unimaginable magnitude hits Los Angeles, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hJorsInxNpj1dIekh6dK6Kh9S6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11123'),
  ('88634175737075760', 'Earthquake Bird', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Wash Westmoreland, Chung Chung-hoon, Chris Carroll', 'Wash Westmoreland', 'Alicia Vikander, Riley Keough, Naoki Kobayashi, Kiki Sukezane, Yoshiko Sakuma, Ken Yamamura, Kazuhiro Muroyama, Crystal Kay', 'R', 'Tokyo, Japan, 1989. Lucy Fly, a foreigner who works as a translator, begins a passionate relationship with Teiji, a mysterious man obsessed with photography.', 'Tokyo, Japan, 1989. Lucy Fly, a foreigner who works as a translator, begins a passionate relationship with Teiji, a mysterious man obsessed with photography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyKnosHXQ7kkhlGwqsWOvn4RgKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513409'),
  ('496798409301281800', 'Earthquake in New York', 1998, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Terry Ingram, Barry Bergthorson, Mark Tataryn', 'Michael Sloan, D. Brent Mote', 'Greg Evigan, Melissa Sue Anderson, Cynthia Gibb, Michael Moriarty, Götz Otto, Michael Sarrazin, Dylan Provencher, Bryn McAuley', 'PG', 'A cop is after a nasty serial killer. Cop''s wife and kids are somewhere in the city too. Then a disastrous earthquake hits the city.', 'A cop is after a nasty serial killer. Cop''s wife and kids are somewhere in the city too. Then a disastrous earthquake hits the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffs6gBk1gd1UIzuAlYKVZ7MerAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430153'),
  ('264527302860469743', 'Earthstorm', 2006, 'TV Movie, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Terry Cunningham, John P. Tarver', 'Michael Konyves', 'Stephen Baldwin, Amy Price-Francis, John Ralston, Dirk Benedict, Matt Gordon, Anna Silk, Jessica Heafey, James Gallanders', null, 'A massive asteroid impact on the moon begins causing storms on earth due to the sudden changes in ocean tides. But when further examination is conducted it''s discovered that the moon''s structure is now entirely unstable -- threatening all life on earth. With time running out, a team of scientists turn to one man, demolitions expert John Redding, in effort to find a solution and secure the moon.', 'A massive asteroid impact on the moon begins causing storms on earth due to the sudden changes in ocean tides. But when further examination is conducted it''s discovered that the moon''s structure is now entirely unstable -- threatening all life on earth. With time running out, a team of scientists turn to one man, demolitions expert John Redding, in effort to find a solution and secure the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9X6UjDn8GLFBrmJl63vWyQkk4U3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15858'),
