  ('947426555521925477', 'Earwig and the Witch', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Goro Miyazaki, Koji Kasamatsu, Tan Seri', 'Keiko Niwa, Emi Gunji', 'Kokoro Hirasawa, Shinobu Terajima, Gaku Hamada, Sherina Munaf, Etsushi Toyokawa, Yuji Ueda', 'PG', 'A headstrong orphan discovers a world of spells and potions while living with a selfish witch.', 'A headstrong orphan discovers a world of spells and potions while living with a selfish witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oK820JieICOcfUhI6mkpFrcA9m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683127'),
  ('602928234872203890', 'East End Hustle', 1976, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Frank Vitale, Ivar Rushevic', 'Frank Vitale, Allan Moyle', 'Andrée Pelletier, Anne-Marie Provencher, Miguel Fernandes, Allan Moyle, Beverly Murray, Joe Mattia, George Verrecchia, Jean-Pierre Légaré', 'R', 'Group of prostitutes who rely on each other to revolt against their sinister pimps. Their bid for freedom turns much more dangerous than they ever imagined.', 'Group of prostitutes who rely on each other to revolt against their sinister pimps. Their bid for freedom turns much more dangerous than they ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWyiqUiCO1gJg8hNhKmRcgbx8oF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121721'),
  ('124265487573614014', 'East Is East', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Damien O''Donnell, Brian Tufano, Joan McCann', 'Ayub Khan-Din', 'Om Puri, Linda Bassett, Ian Aspinall, Jimi Mistry, Archie Panjabi, Jordan Routledge, Chris Bisson, Lesley Nicol', 'R', 'In 1971 Salford fish-and-chip shop owner George Khan expects his family to follow his strict Pakistani Muslim ways. But his children, with an English mother and having been born and brought up in Britain, increasingly see themselves as British and start to reject their father''s rules on dress, food, religion, and living in general.', 'In 1971 Salford fish-and-chip shop owner George Khan expects his family to follow his strict Pakistani Muslim ways. But his children, with an English mother and having been born and brought up in Britain, increasingly see themselves as British and start to reject their father''s rules on dress, food, religion, and living in general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDchJ4mB23vGgwdQCmq9FCQ4W23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10557'),
  ('116501572500700674', 'East L.A. Warriors', 1989, 'Action, Drama', 'Addison Randall, F. Smith Martin, Steve Rockmael', 'Addison Randall, Raymond Martino', 'Tony Bravo, Kamar de los Reyes, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Sabino Villa Lobos, Jastereo Coviare, Diane Heyden, Dan Moreau, Debra Lee Giometti', null, 'As host of gladiator-style duels in which gangbangers battle to the death, East Los Angeles drug kingpin Chesare (Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs) capitalizes on gang antagonisms. But Chesare hasn''t counted on the tactics of vengeance-minded Aurelio (Tony Bravo) and his sidekick Paulo (Kamar De Los Reyes). Vowing to fight without weapons, the determined duo stages a risky coup in the hopes of ending Chesare''s reign of terror.', 'As host of gladiator-style duels in which gangbangers battle to the death, East Los Angeles drug kingpin Chesare (Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs) capitalizes on gang antagonisms. But Chesare hasn''t counted on the tactics of vengeance-minded Aurelio (Tony Bravo) and his sidekick Paulo (Kamar De Los Reyes). Vowing to fight without weapons, the determined duo stages a risky coup in the hopes of ending Chesare''s reign of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1vmNj3jhd8sEQJlp4QfBpaY2kf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227407'),
  ('337989531871770997', 'East Lynne', 1931, 'Drama', 'Frank Lloyd, John F. Seitz', 'Bradley King, Tom Barry', 'Ann Harding, Clive Brook, Conrad Nagel, Cecilia Loftus, Beryl Mercer, O. P. Heggie, Flora Sheffield, David Torrence', null, 'The refined Lady Isabel Carlisle, after leaving her family and enduring nearly a decade of hardships, learns that her son has fallen ill. Despite being nearly blinded as the result of an explosion, she returns home to see her son again.', 'The refined Lady Isabel Carlisle, after leaving her family and enduring nearly a decade of hardships, learns that her son has fallen ill. Despite being nearly blinded as the result of an explosion, she returns home to see her son again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYsmWJ3Y9kwMFIYiSSGOlqTQ3Ah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84277'),
  ('497592137979307175', 'East of Eden', 1955, 'Drama', 'Elia Kazan, Ted D. McCord, Horace Hough', 'Paul Osborn', 'James Dean, Julie Harris, Raymond Massey, Richard Davalos, Jo Van Fleet, Burl Ives, Albert Dekker, Lois Smith', 'PG', 'In the Salinas Valley in and around World War I, Cal Trask feels he must compete against overwhelming odds with his brother for the love of their father. Cal is frustrated at every turn, from his reaction to the war, how to get ahead in business and in life, and how to relate to his estranged mother.', 'In the Salinas Valley in and around World War I, Cal Trask feels he must compete against overwhelming odds with his brother for the love of their father. Cal is frustrated at every turn, from his reaction to the war, how to get ahead in business and in life, and how to relate to his estranged mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xv1MZVIop0SQqwLUymgE5eb2LFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220'),
  ('264084552357148522', 'East of Main Street: Asians Aloud', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'NR', 'In celebration of Asian Heritage Month, HBO presents a collection of perspectives from a diverse group of Asian Americans.', 'In celebration of Asian Heritage Month, HBO presents a collection of perspectives from a diverse group of Asian Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhTTISGKoqmpLZf8RGKmSkE4kRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337514'),
  ('577533009717470998', 'East of Main Street: Milestones', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Jonathan Yi', null, null, 'G', 'The Venice Hongwanji Buddhist Temple had an opportunity to take part in an episode of East of Main Street, an HBO documentary series that has been produced for the past three years to celebrate Asian Pacific American Heritage Month. This year’s episode, Milestones, focuses on how different groups of Asian Americans mark the milestones throughout their lives.', 'The Venice Hongwanji Buddhist Temple had an opportunity to take part in an episode of East of Main Street, an HBO documentary series that has been produced for the past three years to celebrate Asian Pacific American Heritage Month. This year’s episode, Milestones, focuses on how different groups of Asian Americans mark the milestones throughout their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fd8FctfT5P04V2V5GqKPR8UCtgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288161'),
  ('328040152543052394', 'East of the Mountains', 2021, 'Drama, Action', 'S.J. Chiro, Sebastien Scandiuzzi', 'Thane Swigart', 'Tom Skerritt, Mira Sorvino, Annie Gonzalez, Wally Dalton, Diego Collie, Victoria Summer Felix, Jule Johnson, Lauren Du Pree', null, 'When retired heart surgeon Ben Givens learns that he has terminal cancer, he takes his beloved dog back to his boyhood home in Eastern Washington, determined to end his life on his own terms. Ben''s journey, though, takes an unexpected turn, and soon becomes an adventure against which he pits himself with characteristic stoicism, wit, and determination.', 'When retired heart surgeon Ben Givens learns that he has terminal cancer, he takes his beloved dog back to his boyhood home in Eastern Washington, determined to end his life on his own terms. Ben''s journey, though, takes an unexpected turn, and soon becomes an adventure against which he pits himself with characteristic stoicism, wit, and determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opW54LHRP551oPFoF1MCTKJTLsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810015'),
  ('1042672638163194053', 'East of Wall', 2025, 'Drama, Western', 'Kate Beecroft, Austin Shelton', 'Kate Beecroft', 'Tabatha Zimiga, Porshia Zimiga, Scoot McNairy, Jennifer Ehle, Jesse Thorson, Chancey Ryder Witt, Clay Pateneaude, Leanna Shumpert', 'R', 'After the death of her husband, Tabatha—a young, tattooed, rebellious horse trainer—wrestles with financial insecurity and unresolved grief while providing refuge for a group of wayward teenagers on her broken-down ranch in the Badlands.', 'After the death of her husband, Tabatha—a young, tattooed, rebellious horse trainer—wrestles with financial insecurity and unresolved grief while providing refuge for a group of wayward teenagers on her broken-down ranch in the Badlands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OsdhvbLNLUJEi9vqQCyhAXsaRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1398911'),
  ('724756252414068364', 'East of West', 1984, 'Comedy, Western', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Fernando Esteso, Antonio Ozores, Conrado San Martín, Adriana Vega, Fernando Sancho, África Pratt, José Manuel Martín, Luis Barbero', null, 'A village is under the yoke of two bands of thiefs assaulting them every week. The mayor, in search of a solution, has decided to write a letter to Bill ''Warlock'', the fastest man in the west.', 'A village is under the yoke of two bands of thiefs assaulting them every week. The mayor, in search of a solution, has decided to write a letter to Bill ''Warlock'', the fastest man in the west.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbWP9gbZUPcmuQWZbrUXvNmIsWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142968'),
  ('157635009895526665', 'East Palace, West Palace', 1996, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yuan', 'Wang Xiaobo, Zhang Yuan', 'Si Han, Hu Jun, Liu Yuxiao, Vicky Zhao, Wang Quan, Ye Jing, Zhao Xiaoyu', null, 'A heterosexual Beijing policeman and a young homosexual challenge each other''s sexuality.', 'A heterosexual Beijing policeman and a young homosexual challenge each other''s sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gS6YVtdBRxmGih0tJSjpKfbagHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44322'),
  ('675654197411073007', 'East Side Story', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Carlos Portugal, Neil De La Pena', 'Charo Toledo, Carlos Portugal', 'René Alvarado, David Berón, Gladise Jimenez, Steve Callahan, Cory Schneider, Luis Accinelli, Michael Cassady, Dominic Ceci', null, 'Diego is a gay but closeted Hispanic chef living in East Los Angeles who works in the restaurant operated by his grandmother. Frustrated by the secretive lifestyle he shares with his similarly closeted lover, Pablo, Diego finds himself attracted to Wesley, one of the openly gay Caucasian men he feels are gentrifying his neighborhood. Their relationship pushes Diego to consider the possibility of a life he had never imagined.', 'Diego is a gay but closeted Hispanic chef living in East Los Angeles who works in the restaurant operated by his grandmother. Frustrated by the secretive lifestyle he shares with his similarly closeted lover, Pablo, Diego finds himself attracted to Wesley, one of the openly gay Caucasian men he feels are gentrifying his neighborhood. Their relationship pushes Diego to consider the possibility of a life he had never imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGgd7k09LaaZBkJDW0C1zmPkwnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19151'),
  ('217318218750037707', 'East Side Sushi', 2014, 'Drama', 'Anthony Lucero', 'Anthony Lucero', 'Diana Elizabeth Torres, Jesus Fuentes, Yutaka Takeuchi, Alejandro Arzciat, Dixon Phillips, Melissa Locsin, Lane Nishikawa, James J. Der Jr.', 'PG', 'Years of working in the food industry have made Juana, a working-class Latina, a chef of speed and skill. Searching for financial stability, she stumbles into a high-energy, male-dominated Japanese cuisine kitchen. The new atmosphere re-ignites her passions for food and life and makes her hungry to get mixed up in the flavors of this new world.', 'Years of working in the food industry have made Juana, a working-class Latina, a chef of speed and skill. Searching for financial stability, she stumbles into a high-energy, male-dominated Japanese cuisine kitchen. The new atmosphere re-ignites her passions for food and life and makes her hungry to get mixed up in the flavors of this new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyDJxhPooTZQ3F889qxHyAUzBfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257245'),
  ('537306436850209139', 'East Side Waltz Garden of Earthly Delights', 1998, null, 'Kazunari Takeda', 'Haruhiko Arai', 'Hitoe Ootake, Renji Ishibashi, Yoshie Minami, Misayo Haruki, Junko Miyashita, Tamio Kawachi', null, 'Fukano, an elderly novelist who grew up in the mountains of Tokyo, met a young woman, Kana, for the first time in Fukagawa. Overcoming the age difference, they are strongly attracted to each other. However, in Fukano, in addition to the problem of downtown and uptown, there was a deep “river” that separated women and men. However, Kana, on the other hand, easily crossed that "river" due to her sexual love with Fukano. "I never thought I''d live west of the Sumida River," Kana said. However, behind this lies the conspiracy of Fukano''s old lover, Junko. The two get married, but Kana''s behavior is gradually haunted by a mystery, and the shadow of her detective and old man flickers. The core of the mystery involved a strange sex shop', 'Fukano, an elderly novelist who grew up in the mountains of Tokyo, met a young woman, Kana, for the first time in Fukagawa. Overcoming the age difference, they are strongly attracted to each other. However, in Fukano, in addition to the problem of downtown and uptown, there was a deep “river” that separated women and men. However, Kana, on the other hand, easily crossed that "river" due to her sexual love with Fukano. "I never thought I''d live west of the Sumida River," Kana said. However, behind this lies the conspiracy of Fukano''s old lover, Junko. The two get married, but Kana''s behavior is gradually haunted by a mystery, and the shadow of her detective and old man flickers. The core of the mystery involved a strange sex shop', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXZ84xbUsp1M5NpTFFad2e0M9qK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1069482'),
  ('1005795058920422077', 'East Side, West Side', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Charles Rosher', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Barbara Stanwyck, James Mason, Van Heflin, Ava Gardner, Cyd Charisse, Nancy Reagan, Gale Sondergaard, William Conrad', 'NR', 'A vain businessman puts strains on his happy marriage to a rich, beautiful socialite by allowing himself to be seduced by a former girlfriend.', 'A vain businessman puts strains on his happy marriage to a rich, beautiful socialite by allowing himself to be seduced by a former girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50DthmxOgQlLR48CFLSKeWwcOUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99627'),
  ('891375236147650578', 'East/West', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Régis Wargnier, Laurent Dailland', 'Louis Gardel, Régis Wargnier', 'Catherine Deneuve, Sandrine Bonnaire, Oleg Menshikov, Sergei Bodrov Jr., Tatyana Dogileva, Bohdan Stupka, Ruben Tapiero, Erwan Baynaud', null, 'June 1946: Stalin invites Russian emigres to return to the motherland. It''s a trap: when a ship-load from France arrives in Odessa, only a physician and his family are spared execution or prison. He and his French wife (her passport ripped up) are sent to Kiev. She wants to return to France immediately; he knows that they are captives and must watch every step.', 'June 1946: Stalin invites Russian emigres to return to the motherland. It''s a trap: when a ship-load from France arrives in Odessa, only a physician and his family are spared execution or prison. He and his French wife (her passport ripped up) are sent to Kiev. She wants to return to France immediately; he knows that they are captives and must watch every step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1Uf4HC5WEcssVoOm48Bfzn7Wmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28463'),
  ('790363113542033492', 'Easter in Sicily', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vittorio De Seta, Luigi Samonà', null, null, null, 'A short film which retells the story of Jesus Christ''s death and resurrection.', 'A short film which retells the story of Jesus Christ''s death and resurrection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6w2nVbdwTOqGZBkUrhGmqSq7cM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147159'),
  ('926646946144548713', 'Easter Monday', 1991, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Heiko Fipper, Heiko Fipper', 'Heiko Fipper', 'Heiko Fipper, Andreio Fiore, Stephan Fipper, Nicole Dietrich', null, 'A twisted tale of obsession and mistaken identity unravels with shocking consequences. Heiko, consumed by his unreciprocated love for one of his stepsisters, is unknowingly entangled with her twin, Nicole, in a deadly game of deception. His growing confusion and frustration lead to a catastrophic error: the accidental murder of the wrong sister. Years later, Heiko, haunted by his past, lures who believes to be Nicole under false pretences, igniting a chain of violent and grotesque events of staggering proportions.', 'A twisted tale of obsession and mistaken identity unravels with shocking consequences. Heiko, consumed by his unreciprocated love for one of his stepsisters, is unknowingly entangled with her twin, Nicole, in a deadly game of deception. His growing confusion and frustration lead to a catastrophic error: the accidental murder of the wrong sister. Years later, Heiko, haunted by his past, lures who believes to be Nicole under false pretences, igniting a chain of violent and grotesque events of staggering proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydJ66wqaLQpE0SkiDl3Ek6lMDOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132371'),
  ('596384690331880619', 'Easter Parade', 1948, 'Romance, Music', 'Charles Walters, Harry Stradling Sr., Johnny Green', 'Guy Bolton', 'Judy Garland, Fred Astaire, Peter Lawford, Ann Miller, Jules Munshin, Clinton Sundberg, Richard Beavers, Lola Albright', 'NR', 'On the day before Easter in 1911, Don Hewes is crushed when his dancing partner (and object of affection) Nadine Hale refuses to start a new contract with him. To prove Nadine''s not important to him, Don acquires innocent new protege Hannah Brown, vowing to make her a star in time for next year''s Easter parade.', 'On the day before Easter in 1911, Don Hewes is crushed when his dancing partner (and object of affection) Nadine Hale refuses to start a new contract with him. To prove Nadine''s not important to him, Don acquires innocent new protege Hannah Brown, vowing to make her a star in time for next year''s Easter parade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLgvafQvb6D6at4khC0b7kn0h8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29380'),
  ('663697451458647246', 'Easter Sunday', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jay Chandrasekhar, Joe Collins, Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle', 'Ken Cheng, Kate Angelo', 'Jo Koy, Brandon Wardell, Lydia Gaston, Eugene Cordero, Eva Noblezada, Asif Ali, Jay Chandrasekhar, Tia Carrere', 'PG-13', 'Comedian and actor Joe Valencia returns home for an Easter celebration with his riotous, bickering, eating, drinking, laughing, loving family, in this love letter to the Filipino-American community.', 'Comedian and actor Joe Valencia returns home for an Easter celebration with his riotous, bickering, eating, drinking, laughing, loving family, in this love letter to the Filipino-American community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7HNcXZDsf2fhWdgQhLZnSBnc1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824281'),
