  ('702512337688082977', 'Eastern Plays', 2009, 'Drama', 'Kamen Kalev, Julian Atanassov', 'Kamen Kalev', 'Christo Christov, Ovanes Torosian, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Nikolina Yancheva, Ivan Nalbantov, Krasimira Demirova, Hatice Aslan, Kerem Atabeyoğlu', null, 'Two estranged brothers are brought together when they have opposite roles in a racist beating: while Georgi who''s recently joined a neo-nazi group participates in the violence, Hristo witnesses and rescues a Turkish family. Only by reuniting will the two brothers be able to assess what they really want from life.', 'Two estranged brothers are brought together when they have opposite roles in a racist beating: while Georgi who''s recently joined a neo-nazi group participates in the violence, Hristo witnesses and rescues a Turkish family. Only by reuniting will the two brothers be able to assess what they really want from life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmGgetgogDi9RPtlApf2zNYYxB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43738'),
  ('955594881940137201', 'Eastern Promises', 2007, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'David Cronenberg, Peter Suschitzky, Catherine Palmer', 'Steven Knight', 'Viggo Mortensen, Naomi Watts, Vincent Cassel, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Sinéad Cusack, Donald Sumpter, Jerzy Skolimowski, Josef Altin', 'R', 'A Russian teenager living in London dies during childbirth but leaves clues in her diary that could tie her child to a rape involving a violent Russian mob family.', 'A Russian teenager living in London dies during childbirth but leaves clues in her diary that could tie her child to a rape involving a violent Russian mob family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpiJWb4NrWgcOg2rusuLhDM0hTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2252'),
