  ('538354401703866542', 'Easy', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jane Weinstock, Paul Ryan', 'Jane Weinstock', 'Marguerite Moreau, Brían F. O''Byrne, Naveen Andrews, Emily Deschanel, Caroline Goodall, D. B. Woodside, John Rothman, Lanette Ware', 'R', 'Quirky Jamie Harris is a magnet for less-than-kind men as she hops beds. But things start to look up when she becomes the object of affection of two seemingly normal men. Unfortunately, there''s the immense problem of her self-imposed 90-day moratorium on sex.', 'Quirky Jamie Harris is a magnet for less-than-kind men as she hops beds. But things start to look up when she becomes the object of affection of two seemingly normal men. Unfortunately, there''s the immense problem of her self-imposed 90-day moratorium on sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2p2pAHyuZCNR3rxJ7CPfuje6SOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45174'),
  ('1119274215424847501', 'Easy', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Andrea Magnani, Dmytro Nedria, Sergio Tisminetzky', 'Andrea Magnani, Chiara Barbo', 'Nicola Nocella, Libero De Rienzo, Barbara Bouchet, Ostap Stupka, Veronika Shostak, Lorenzo Acquaviva, Nadia Magnani Vivaldi, Orest Harda', null, 'A 40-year-old loser named Isidoro at the request of his brother drives from Italy to mountainous Carpathian village in Ukraine with a coffin of a diseased Ukrainian worker, who died at a construction site in Italy.', 'A 40-year-old loser named Isidoro at the request of his brother drives from Italy to mountainous Carpathian village in Ukraine with a coffin of a diseased Ukrainian worker, who died at a construction site in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDoEP0JWCdgPtVcwxe57IjtnzNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466997'),
  ('21436850238105223', 'Easy A', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Will Gluck, Michael Grady, Tony Nahar', 'Bert V. Royal', 'Emma Stone, Penn Badgley, Amanda Bynes, Dan Byrd, Thomas Haden Church, Patricia Clarkson, Cam Gigandet, Lisa Kudrow', 'PG-13', 'Olive, an average high school student, sees her below-the-radar existence turn around overnight once she decides to use the school''s gossip grapevine to advance her social standing. Now her classmates are turning against her and the school board is becoming concerned, including her favorite teacher and the distracted guidance counselor. With the support of her hilariously idiosyncratic parents and a little help from a long-time crush, Olive attempts to take on her notorious new identity and crush the rumor mill once and for all.', 'Olive, an average high school student, sees her below-the-radar existence turn around overnight once she decides to use the school''s gossip grapevine to advance her social standing. Now her classmates are turning against her and the school board is becoming concerned, including her favorite teacher and the distracted guidance counselor. With the support of her hilariously idiosyncratic parents and a little help from a long-time crush, Olive attempts to take on her notorious new identity and crush the rumor mill once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5f1qO6NJnxWgONgkYg21TW39DT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37735'),
  ('220416980020294021', 'Easy Come, Easy Go', 1967, 'Adventure, Comedy, Music', 'John Rich, William Margulies, Robert Goodstein', 'Allan Weiss, Anthony Lawrence', 'Elvis Presley, Dodie Marshall, Pat Priest, Pat Harrington Jr., Skip Ward, Sandy Kenyon, Frank McHugh, Ed Griffith', 'PG', 'Navy frogman Ted Jackson balances his time between twin careers as a deep-sea diver and nightclub singer. During a dive, Ted spots sunken treasure and returns with the hope to retrieve it.', 'Navy frogman Ted Jackson balances his time between twin careers as a deep-sea diver and nightclub singer. During a dive, Ted spots sunken treasure and returns with the hope to retrieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGh4D7pwfPPtQCgUxHrsEXl0Mqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47263'),
  ('136274131065072667', 'Easy Down There!', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Deray', 'Jacques Deray', 'Alain Delon, Paul Meurisse, Nathalie Delon, Julien Guiomar, Paul Préboist, André Bollet, Serge Davri, Carlo Nell', null, 'A priest gets a little hot under the collar when the wife he thought was dead unexpectedly returns.', 'A priest gets a little hot under the collar when the wife he thought was dead unexpectedly returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miU3twfmV00uptt5rFz9FD2lwFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289794'),
  ('93995665070375615', 'Easy Living', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mitchell Leisen, Ted Tetzlaff, Edgar Anderson', 'Preston Sturges', 'Jean Arthur, Edward Arnold, Ray Milland, Mary Nash, Franklin Pangborn, Luis Alberni, Barlowe Borland, William Demarest', 'NR', 'J.B. Ball, a rich financier, gets fed up with his free-spending family. He takes his wife''s just-bought (very expensive) sable coat and throws it out the window, it lands on poor hard-working girl Mary Smith. But it isn''t so easy to just give away something so valuable, as he soon learns.', 'J.B. Ball, a rich financier, gets fed up with his free-spending family. He takes his wife''s just-bought (very expensive) sable coat and throws it out the window, it lands on poor hard-working girl Mary Smith. But it isn''t so easy to just give away something so valuable, as he soon learns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAiagfGw23B79vmgHmNTKL7K7IT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80364'),
  ('54500339580998159', 'Easy Living', 1949, 'Drama', 'Jacques Tourneur, Harry J. Wild, James Lane', 'Charles Schnee', 'Victor Mature, Lucille Ball, Lizabeth Scott, Sonny Tufts, Lloyd Nolan, Paul Stewart, Jack Paar, Jeff Donnell', 'NR', 'A football halfback has a heart condition, a nagging wife and a team secretary who loves him.', 'A football halfback has a heart condition, a nagging wife and a team secretary who loves him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltNQFQnQU9DLQE8b7Vly26sA7CM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120785'),
  ('991785330386473291', 'Easy Love', 2019, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Tamer Jandali', 'Tamer Jandali', 'Sophia Seidenfaden, Lenika Lukas, Pina Felizitas, Sönke Andersen, Stella Vivien Dhingra, Niclas Jüngermann, Amelie Liebst, Sabine Seidenfaden', null, 'easy love is the experimental fiction debut of Tamer Jandali. His way of working shifted between documentary and fiction when he followed seven men and women from Cologne on their search for a balance between emotional security and sensual fulfillment. In four months of shooting those protagonists acted as braver versions of themselves. The camera opened the possibility to pursue their unlived dreams, fears and fantasies and ultimately experiencing them in reality. By shooting in a small team, always on the edge between documentary and fiction, Tamer Jandali created space for intimacy and a new form of cinematic authenticity.', 'easy love is the experimental fiction debut of Tamer Jandali. His way of working shifted between documentary and fiction when he followed seven men and women from Cologne on their search for a balance between emotional security and sensual fulfillment. In four months of shooting those protagonists acted as braver versions of themselves. The camera opened the possibility to pursue their unlived dreams, fears and fantasies and ultimately experiencing them in reality. By shooting in a small team, always on the edge between documentary and fiction, Tamer Jandali created space for intimacy and a new form of cinematic authenticity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mes9OnGhUwt12PeubzmGA1xC4BI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575823'),
  ('67248439204674136', 'Easy Money', 1983, 'Comedy', 'James Signorelli, Fred Schuler', 'Rodney Dangerfield, Dennis Blair, Michael Endler', 'Rodney Dangerfield, Joe Pesci, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Candice Azzara, Val Avery, Tom Noonan, Taylor Negron, Lili Haydn', 'R', 'To inherit his mother-in-law''s colossal fortune, a hard living gambling addict must change his unhealthy ways before it gets the best of him.', 'To inherit his mother-in-law''s colossal fortune, a hard living gambling addict must change his unhealthy ways before it gets the best of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nREZhCfkUgl6XqMZAvd6DCbVj2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18391'),
  ('781424325476643543', 'Easy Money', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Daniel Espinosa, Aril Wretblad', 'Hassan Loo Sattarvandi, Fredrik Wikström, Daniel Espinosa', 'Joel Kinnaman, Matias Varela, Dragomir Mrsic, Lisa Henni, Mahmut Suvakci, Dejan Čukić, Fares Fares, Joel Spira', 'R', 'When JW becomes a drug runner in order to maintain his double life, his fate becomes tied to two other men: Jorge, a fugitive on the run from both the Serbian mafia and the police, and mafia enforcer Mrado, who is on the hunt for Jorge.', 'When JW becomes a drug runner in order to maintain his double life, his fate becomes tied to two other men: Jorge, a fugitive on the run from both the Serbian mafia and the police, and mafia enforcer Mrado, who is on the hunt for Jorge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezx8LhhpZd6U4sd0lXyCEUhIBUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29920'),
  ('54534341110566443', 'Easy Money III: Life Deluxe', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jens Jonsson, James Velasquez, Denise Carlford', 'Jens Jonsson, Maria Karlsson', 'Matias Varela, Joel Kinnaman, Martin Wallström, Malin Buska, Dejan Čukić, Čedomir Đorđević, Madeleine Martin, Saša Petrović', null, 'JW now lives in exile and is more than ever determined to find out what happened to his missing sister Camilla. Every trace leads him to the world of organized crime in Stockholm. Jorge is about to do his last score – the largest robbery in Swedish history. But during the complicated preparations he meets a woman from his past – Nadja. Martin Hägerström is chosen to go undercover into the Serbian mafia, in order to get its notorious boss Radovan Krajnic behind bars. When an assassination attempt is made on Radovan, his daughter Natalie is pulled into the power struggle within the Serbian mafia.', 'JW now lives in exile and is more than ever determined to find out what happened to his missing sister Camilla. Every trace leads him to the world of organized crime in Stockholm. Jorge is about to do his last score – the largest robbery in Swedish history. But during the complicated preparations he meets a woman from his past – Nadja. Martin Hägerström is chosen to go undercover into the Serbian mafia, in order to get its notorious boss Radovan Krajnic behind bars. When an assassination attempt is made on Radovan, his daughter Natalie is pulled into the power struggle within the Serbian mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSTHRFOcC1l1qpW84n7RioCDRnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196032'),
  ('84786624800809572', 'Easy Money: Hard to Kill', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Babak Najafi, Aril Wretblad, Phillip Argeadson', 'Maria Karlsson, Peter Birro, Fredrik Wikström', 'Joel Kinnaman, Matias Varela, Dragomir Mrsic, Fares Fares, Madeleine Martin, Dejan Čukić, Lisa Henni, Joel Spira', null, 'JW is serving hard time in prison and struggling to get back on an honest path. There are glimmers of hope in his life – some venture capitalists are interested in a new piece of trading software he''s developed, and while behind bars he''s made peace with an old enemy. This all proves to be an illusion. On leave from prison, and back in contact with his former gang, JW learns that once you''ve walked in the shoes of a criminal there just may be no going back.', 'JW is serving hard time in prison and struggling to get back on an honest path. There are glimmers of hope in his life – some venture capitalists are interested in a new piece of trading software he''s developed, and while behind bars he''s made peace with an old enemy. This all proves to be an illusion. On leave from prison, and back in contact with his former gang, JW learns that once you''ve walked in the shoes of a criminal there just may be no going back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgSE9epmyShnfjAIWzIelW534cg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92647'),
  ('646061605084524704', 'Easy Rider', 1969, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Dennis Hopper, László Kovács', 'Peter Fonda, Dennis Hopper, Terry Southern', 'Peter Fonda, Dennis Hopper, Jack Nicholson, Antonio Mendoza, Phil Spector, Mac Mashourian, Warren Finnerty, Tita Colorado', 'R', 'Wyatt and Billy, two Harley-riding hippies, complete a drug deal in Southern California and decide to travel cross-country in search of spiritual truth.', 'Wyatt and Billy, two Harley-riding hippies, complete a drug deal in Southern California and decide to travel cross-country in search of spiritual truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmGEB6ly9OG8SYVfvAoa6QqHNvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624'),
  ('853175698347811921', 'Easy Rider: Shaking the Cage', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Charles Kiselyak, Robert Jaye', 'Charles Kiselyak', 'Dennis Hopper, Peter Fonda, William Hayward, Seymour Cassel, Karen Black, Paul Lewis, Luke Askew, László Kovács', null, 'Documentary about the making and history of the film "Easy Rider."', 'Documentary about the making and history of the film "Easy Rider."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EMqsH6ssDlpVGxdVO6rkcZPnp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343156'),
  ('205694786844208514', 'Easy Riders, Raging Bulls: How the Sex ''n'' Drugs ''n'' Rock ''n'' Roll Generation Saved Hollywood', 2003, 'Documentary, History', 'Kenneth Bowser, Paul Mailman', 'Kenneth Bowser', 'William H. Macy, Dede Allen, Peter Bart, Tony Bill, Karen Black, Peter Bogdanovich, Ellen Burstyn, Roger Corman', null, 'The chronicle of the mind-blowing journey that was Hollywood during the seventies; the true and gripping story of the last golden age of American cinema, an exalted celebration of creativity and experimentation; but also of sex, drugs and rock ''n'' roll: a turbulent and dark tale of ambition, envy, betrayal, hatred and self-destruction.', 'The chronicle of the mind-blowing journey that was Hollywood during the seventies; the true and gripping story of the last golden age of American cinema, an exalted celebration of creativity and experimentation; but also of sex, drugs and rock ''n'' roll: a turbulent and dark tale of ambition, envy, betrayal, hatred and self-destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKztDZqY6T5fhnpJKDqNsAaSLqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32276'),
  ('1045769394258536695', 'Easy Sex, Sad Movies', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Roberti, Bruno Roberti, Alejo Flah', 'Alejo Flah', 'Ernesto Alterio, Quim Gutiérrez, Marta Etura, Julieta Cardinali, Luis Luque, Carlos Areces, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, María Alché', null, 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. Pablo, a screenwriter, is hired to write a new romantic comedy.', 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. Pablo, a screenwriter, is hired to write a new romantic comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrpFgxL1OExF4I80EiAGdeZEadK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214758'),
  ('63051657268878615', 'Easy Street', 1917, 'Comedy, Action', 'William C. Forster, Charlie Chaplin, Roland Totheroh', 'Charlie Chaplin, Vincent Bryan, Maverick Terrell', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Eric Campbell, Lloyd Bacon, Henry Bergman, Erich von Stroheim Jr., Charlotte Mineau, Tom Wood', null, 'A derelict, huddled under the steps of a missionary church, feels enlightened by the sermon of a passionate preacher and infatuated by the beauty of the congregation''s pianist, in such a way that he tries to improve his life of poverty by becoming a policeman. His first assignment will be to patrol along Easy Street, the turf of a vicious bully and his criminal gang.', 'A derelict, huddled under the steps of a missionary church, feels enlightened by the sermon of a passionate preacher and infatuated by the beauty of the congregation''s pianist, in such a way that he tries to improve his life of poverty by becoming a policeman. His first assignment will be to patrol along Easy Street, the turf of a vicious bully and his criminal gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEPeUV0OCUMXAub5jm8Woqzg36p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47650'),
  ('1119470157952316357', 'Easy Virtue', 1928, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Frank Mills', 'Eliot Stannard, Noël Coward', 'Isabel Jeans, Franklin Dyall, Eric Bransby Williams, Ian Hunter, Robin Irvine, Violet Farebrother, Frank Elliott, Dacia Deane', null, 'Unjustly accused of adultery in a scandalous divorce, Larita Filton flees to the French Riviera. She soon falls in love with a young Englishman, John Whittaker, and begins anew under an assumed name. But when John brings her home to his disapproving family, Larita’s past begins to resurface.', 'Unjustly accused of adultery in a scandalous divorce, Larita Filton flees to the French Riviera. She soon falls in love with a young Englishman, John Whittaker, and begins anew under an assumed name. But when John brings her home to his disapproving family, Larita’s past begins to resurface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GVP7uJbBigNtlpnN6E6YwS75VB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36055'),
  ('675191886977223590', 'Easy Virtue', 1992, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Um Jong-sun', null, 'Yuk Cheol, Kang Ri-na, Jeon Moo-song, Bae Su-chun, Kwak Eun-Kyeong, Kim Ha-Rim, Kim Seok-ok, Yang Taek-jo', null, 'Jang is attacked in her home by a masked man two nights in a row. Her husband is reluctant to call the police, but they both begin to suspect the odd young man living next door', 'Jang is attacked in her home by a masked man two nights in a row. Her husband is reluctant to call the police, but they both begin to suspect the odd young man living next door', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMTVfbyiHwluS5N5P42nxumPGAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576174'),
  ('1089292977205920934', 'Easy Virtue', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stephan Elliott, Martin Kenzie, Christopher Newman', 'Stephan Elliott, Sheridan Jobbins', 'Jessica Biel, Ben Barnes, Kristin Scott Thomas, Colin Firth, Kimberley Nixon, Katherine Parkinson, Kris Marshall, Jim McManus', 'PG-13', 'A young Englishman marries a glamorous American. When he brings her home to meet the parents, she arrives like a blast from the future - blowing their entrenched British stuffiness out the window.', 'A young Englishman marries a glamorous American. When he brings her home to meet the parents, she arrives like a blast from the future - blowing their entrenched British stuffiness out the window.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9bGewoi6SWPTFQfUbn6ve06TY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16899'),
  ('776981837337805671', 'Easy!', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Bruni, Alessandro Casale, Fabio Mollo', 'Francesco Bruni', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Barbora Bobuľová, Vinicio Marchioni, Filippo Scicchitano, Raffaella Lebboroni, Arianna Scommegna, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Giacomo Ceccarelli', null, 'The life of a melancholy professor is turned upside down when he discovers that a rebellious teenager he is tutoring is actually his son.', 'The life of a melancholy professor is turned upside down when he discovers that a rebellious teenager he is tutoring is actually his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RwyeBE6i44VVmr3QXR9zwL1G9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78854'),
  ('325004768105639997', 'Easyout', 1972, null, 'Pat O''Neill', null, null, null, 'Has to do with a consideration of one possible conceptual model for human existence: that of a primitive form of yardchair, upon which sits The Creator, impassively observing the inexorable flow of His mountains.', 'Has to do with a consideration of one possible conceptual model for human existence: that of a primitive form of yardchair, upon which sits The Creator, impassively observing the inexorable flow of His mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SdEaGnGnL7eCWofha9XLaOAcZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130318'),
  ('896921781204167278', 'Eat', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Andy Warhol', null, 'Robert Indiana', null, 'This art experiment by Andy Warhol captures the simple act of a man eating mushrooms. This one-man show starring Robert Indiana presents the actor slowly eating some mushrooms, having an enjoyable time not only with the food but also with a friendly cat that from time to time comes to see what the man is doing.', 'This art experiment by Andy Warhol captures the simple act of a man eating mushrooms. This one-man show starring Robert Indiana presents the actor slowly eating some mushrooms, having an enjoyable time not only with the food but also with a friendly cat that from time to time comes to see what the man is doing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXhGyoDQzhZ9eR8fVmolfbVKxk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151730'),
  ('115650221560036149', 'Eat', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Tara Hunter, Jon Stevenson, Jimmy Weber', 'Jimmy Weber', 'Meggie Maddock, Ali Francis, Jeremy Make, Maru Garcia, Dakota Pike, Jeff Maez, Luke Sorge, Christine Olyer', null, 'Novella McClure is like most struggling actresses in Los Angeles: she''s in her early 30s, her fake name sounded cooler ten years ago, and she hasn''t landed a role in three years. To top it all off, she''s developed a disturbing habit of eating her own flesh. Novella desperately tries to hide her strange condition from her motherly landlord, Eesha, and somewhat psychopathic best friend, Candice, but her body and mind continue to deteriorate in the depressing world of failed auditions and sketchy night clubs. Can a romantic relationship with her psychiatrist prevent her from self destruction? Or will her fatal habit continue to eat away at her?', 'Novella McClure is like most struggling actresses in Los Angeles: she''s in her early 30s, her fake name sounded cooler ten years ago, and she hasn''t landed a role in three years. To top it all off, she''s developed a disturbing habit of eating her own flesh. Novella desperately tries to hide her strange condition from her motherly landlord, Eesha, and somewhat psychopathic best friend, Candice, but her body and mind continue to deteriorate in the depressing world of failed auditions and sketchy night clubs. Can a romantic relationship with her psychiatrist prevent her from self destruction? Or will her fatal habit continue to eat away at her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aTKmccL8bgKdpX6SacdeT8yLSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277610'),
  ('170865334676408760', 'Eat a Bowl of Tea', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Amir Mokri, Wayne Wang', 'Judith Rascoe', 'Cora Miao, Russell Wong, Victor Wong, Lau Siu-Ming, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Lee Sau-Kei, Yuen Fat Fai, Hui Fan', null, 'An American-Chinese man brings over his wife from China to America, but the challenges of making a living and adjusting to a new life, plus the attentions of a gambler threaten their marriage.', 'An American-Chinese man brings over his wife from China to America, but the challenges of making a living and adjusting to a new life, plus the attentions of a gambler threaten their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Dnr4mggLVUFqT4NGsqiIE0Ex7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98984'),
  ('1120521908902521271', 'Eat and Run', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Christopher Hart, Dyanna Taylor, Gary Marcus', 'Christopher Hart', 'Ron Silver, Sharon Sharth, Pat Ryan, John J. Fleming, Robert Silver, Mimi Cecchini, Tony Moundroukas, Frank Nastasi', 'R', 'A humanoid alien lands on earth, and soon discovers he likes to eat Italian. Italian people, that is. Incompetent detective McSorely is the only one with a clue about what''s going on, and even his grasp of the situation isn''t too firm. The rest of the police force thinks he''s crazy, while the alien continues sampling the Italian cuisine of New York City.', 'A humanoid alien lands on earth, and soon discovers he likes to eat Italian. Italian people, that is. Incompetent detective McSorely is the only one with a clue about what''s going on, and even his grasp of the situation isn''t too firm. The rest of the police force thinks he''s crazy, while the alien continues sampling the Italian cuisine of New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45rxNjunKR8zAcqpTJlcaEW4emt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101054'),
  ('45701134691537702', 'Eat Locals', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Jason Flemyng, Chas Bain', 'Danny King', 'Charlie Cox, Tony Curran, Mackenzie Crook, Freema Agyeman, Eve Myles, Vincent Regan, Billy Cook, Lukaz Leong', null, 'In a quiet countryside farmhouse, Britain''s vampires gather for their once-every-fifty-years meeting. Others will be joining them too; Sebastian Crockett, an unwitting Essex boy who thinks he''s on a promise with sexy cougar Vanessa; and a detachment of Special Forces vampire killers who have bitten off more than they can chew. This is certainly going to be a night to remember... and for some of them it will be their last.', 'In a quiet countryside farmhouse, Britain''s vampires gather for their once-every-fifty-years meeting. Others will be joining them too; Sebastian Crockett, an unwitting Essex boy who thinks he''s on a promise with sexy cougar Vanessa; and a detachment of Special Forces vampire killers who have bitten off more than they can chew. This is certainly going to be a night to remember... and for some of them it will be their last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYnvcrmNkkZXXmzzmUJ2ura95A9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412758'),
  ('411777145243442851', 'Eat My Dust', 1976, 'Action', 'Charles B. Griffith, Eric Saarinen, Barbara Peeters', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Ron Howard, Christopher Norris, Brad David, Kathy O''Dare, Clint Howard, Peter Isacksen, Jessica Potter, Warren J. Kemmerling', 'PG', 'Hoover Nielbold is a car-crazy teenager who, in order to impress the hottest girl in school, takes her for a ride in a souped-up race car owned by local racer Big Bubba Jones. Hoover''s father Harry, who''s also the local sheriff is furious at the situation and orders his bumbling deputies to go after him. With the Sheriff''s office overflowing with concerned parents and citizens and his deputies failing to catch him. He enlists the help of Jones and fellow racers to capture him. It culminates in a thrilling car chase finale through the rural countryside.', 'Hoover Nielbold is a car-crazy teenager who, in order to impress the hottest girl in school, takes her for a ride in a souped-up race car owned by local racer Big Bubba Jones. Hoover''s father Harry, who''s also the local sheriff is furious at the situation and orders his bumbling deputies to go after him. With the Sheriff''s office overflowing with concerned parents and citizens and his deputies failing to catch him. He enlists the help of Jones and fellow racers to capture him. It culminates in a thrilling car chase finale through the rural countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fR1fWwWPifbeShUDp6hjKg9IQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45232'),
  ('789346083348127597', 'Eat My Shit', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eduardo Casanova, César Maderal, Kiko Prada', 'Eduardo Casanova', 'Ana Polvorosa, Itziar Castro', null, 'Eat My Shit tells the tale of a woman with the unfortunate defect of having a butthole for a mouth.', 'Eat My Shit tells the tale of a woman with the unfortunate defect of having a butthole for a mouth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vVTSVOMV963Lnj7YaqYF2GNu2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325226'),
  ('392988608930981235', 'Eat Pray Bark', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Marco Petry, Marc Achenbach', 'Jane Ainscough, Marco Petry, Hortense Ullrich', 'Alexandra Maria Lara, Rúrik Gíslason, Devid Striesow, Anna Herrmann, Doğa Gürer, Kerim Waller, Bill Kaulitz, Brigitte Kren', 'PG-13', 'In this tumultuous comedy, five eccentric dog owners seek help in dealing with their four-legged friends. Their last hope: an intensive course with the charismatic and legendary dog trainer Nodon in the Tyrolean mountains.', 'In this tumultuous comedy, five eccentric dog owners seek help in dealing with their four-legged friends. Their last hope: an intensive course with the charismatic and legendary dog trainer Nodon in the Tyrolean mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZ0ntedjG2X6hZ7upzupeUe2g5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1635276'),
  ('475441917369606525', 'Eat Pray Love', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Richardson, Ryan Murphy, Mauro Fiori', 'Jennifer Salt, Ryan Murphy', 'Julia Roberts, Javier Bardem, James Franco, Billy Crudup, Richard Jenkins, Viola Davis, I. Gusti Ayu Puspawati, Hadi Subiyanto', 'PG-13', 'A married woman realizes how unhappy her marriage really is, and that her life needs to go in a different direction. After a painful divorce, she takes off on a round-the-world journey to "find herself".', 'A married woman realizes how unhappy her marriage really is, and that her life needs to go in a different direction. After a painful divorce, she takes off on a round-the-world journey to "find herself".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPLoZSLqUeQV37Brm71cRQTVUuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38167'),
  ('866901890394545559', 'Eat the Night', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Adventure', 'Raphaël Vandenbussche, Caroline Poggi, Jonathan Vinel', 'Guillaume Bréaud', 'Théo Cholbi, Erwan Kepoa Falé, Lila Gueneau, Mathieu Perotto, Eddy Suiveng, Kevin Bago, Xavier Maly, Thierry Hancisse', null, 'Young drug dealer Pablo and his sister Appoline bond over an online game called Darknoon. Pablo falls for Night, neglecting his sister. While Appoline finishes the game, Pablo and Night become embroiled in a dangerous gang conflict.', 'Young drug dealer Pablo and his sister Appoline bond over an online game called Darknoon. Pablo falls for Night, neglecting his sister. While Appoline finishes the game, Pablo and Night become embroiled in a dangerous gang conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqJ3k4CUsslrASmMG4Bq2nAMkZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250007'),
  ('815485680565594859', 'Eat the Rich', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Witold Stok, Peter Richardson', 'Peter Richardson, Pete Richens', 'Ronald Allen, Jimmy Fagg, Lanah P, Fiona Richmond, Sandra Dorne, Lemmy Kilmister, Nosher Powell, Dave Beard', 'R', 'Alex is a disgruntled waiter at a snobby exclusive restaurant who falls on hard times. Forced to deal with the contempt and disgust of the upper class, Alex & cohorts attempt to go on a rampage. Meanwhile, General Karprov and Spider plot to involve the inept anarchists into their plans to derail the prime-minister-to-be''s campaign.', 'Alex is a disgruntled waiter at a snobby exclusive restaurant who falls on hard times. Forced to deal with the contempt and disgust of the upper class, Alex & cohorts attempt to go on a rampage. Meanwhile, General Karprov and Spider plot to involve the inept anarchists into their plans to derail the prime-minister-to-be''s campaign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFGWfpzH1sR4sL1T7J0Kae59UE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4292'),
  ('439143901001587903', 'Eat the Schoolgirl: Osaka Telephone Club', 1997, 'Horror', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Kenji Yokoyama', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Chisato Ōgawara', 'Yuuki Fujita, Michiru Katô, Kozue Aoki, Shirô Misawa, Nobuyuki Hasegawa, Tadao Kawamoto, Tsuyoshi Ootsubo, Michael Segal', null, '"Eat the Schoolgirl" concerns two young adults who made a dirty work for a yakuza gang by making sadistic rape/snuff films. Both of them are sexually obsessed; one is addicted to telephone sex whilst the other can only function sexually, whilst seeing mutilated female corpses.', '"Eat the Schoolgirl" concerns two young adults who made a dirty work for a yakuza gang by making sadistic rape/snuff films. Both of them are sexually obsessed; one is addicted to telephone sex whilst the other can only function sexually, whilst seeing mutilated female corpses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9dFIlvOSBL1Ly346Z0wmFui0UQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39985'),
  ('665476561470732451', 'Eat Wheaties!', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phil Miller, Scott Abramovitch', 'Scott Abramovitch', 'Tony Hale, Elisha Cuthbert, Danielle Brooks, David Walton, Sarah Burns, Alan Tudyk, Sarah Chalke, Paul Walter Hauser', null, 'Sid Straw leads a dull life until he accidentally stalks famous college friend Elizabeth Banks on social media. With each failed attempt to prove he knows her, he rediscovers more of himself and the true meaning of friendship.', 'Sid Straw leads a dull life until he accidentally stalks famous college friend Elizabeth Banks on social media. With each failed attempt to prove he knows her, he rediscovers more of himself and the true meaning of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXjpkDrDE8ZfcMxFNVGL5QV2d1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659551'),
  ('528642503723369913', 'Eat Your Bones', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jean-Charles Hue', 'Jean-Charles Hue, Salvatore Lista', 'Frédéric Dorkel, Jason François, Mickaël Dauber, Moïse Dorkel, Joseph Dorkel', null, '18 year old Jason Dorkel belongs to a community of gypsies. He is about to celebrate his baptism when his half-brother Fred returns after fifteen years in prison. Together, with their last brother, the violent, hot-headed Michael and their Christian activist cousin, the four young people set off on a binge among the "gadjos" in search of a cargo of copper.', '18 year old Jason Dorkel belongs to a community of gypsies. He is about to celebrate his baptism when his half-brother Fred returns after fifteen years in prison. Together, with their last brother, the violent, hot-headed Michael and their Christian activist cousin, the four young people set off on a binge among the "gadjos" in search of a cargo of copper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95e0WhaYZrJQiWVIweBftW5bCpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270665'),
  ('634941691796842101', 'Eat, Play, Love', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Christie Will Wolf, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Joel Canfield, Lisa Canfield', 'Jason Cermak, Jen Lilley, Lucie Guest, Lindsay Wagner, Lee Majors, Emily Maddison, Eduard Witzke, Amélie Will Wolf', null, 'Veterinarian Dr. Carly Monroe makes it a habit to stop by the local dog shelter as often as possible because she loves dogs and secretly loves the shelter’s owner, Dan. Unfortunately, he has agreed to marry his glamorous TV personality girlfriend and move to the Big Apple. With Dan’s big move looming, his sister decides to take matters into her own hands.', 'Veterinarian Dr. Carly Monroe makes it a habit to stop by the local dog shelter as often as possible because she loves dogs and secretly loves the shelter’s owner, Dan. Unfortunately, he has agreed to marry his glamorous TV personality girlfriend and move to the Big Apple. With Dan’s big move looming, his sister decides to take matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdDlx7ACjdvjOgM5mDyy7C2yBEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471608'),
  ('1113213631251082521', 'Eaten Alive', 1976, 'Horror', 'Tobe Hooper, Robert Caramico', 'Kim Henkel', 'Neville Brand, Mel Ferrer, Carolyn Jones, Marilyn Burns, William Finley, Stuart Whitman, Robert Englund, Roberta Collins', null, 'A psychotic redneck owns a dilapidated hotel in rural East Texas, where he murders those who upset him or his business, and then feeds their remains to his pet crocodile in the swamp beside his hotel.', 'A psychotic redneck owns a dilapidated hotel in rural East Texas, where he murders those who upset him or his business, and then feeds their remains to his pet crocodile in the swamp beside his hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RVbWSY0Zo3ggQBVheEfqlpad8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30062'),
  ('518816574898975551', 'Eaten Alive!', 1980, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Federico Zanni, Umberto Lenzi, Franco Fantasia', 'Umberto Lenzi', 'Robert Kerman, Janet Ågren, Mel Ferrer, Ivan Rassimov, Paola Senatore, Me Me Lai, Fiamma Maglione, Franco Fantasia', null, 'A woman''s search for her missing sister leads her to the jungles of New Guinea, where she and an expatriate guide encounter a cult leader and flesh-hungry natives.', 'A woman''s search for her missing sister leads her to the jungles of New Guinea, where she and an expatriate guide encounter a cult leader and flesh-hungry natives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7h5LH5UNjYO4Hvv2myKqGeoaSo7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8690'),
  ('696784891389643624', 'Eaten Horizons', 1950, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Wilhelm Freddie, Jørgen Roos', null, 'Agnete Christensen, Wilhelm Freddie, Jørgen Roos', null, 'A short experimental film by (Carl Th. Dreyer''s cinematographer) Jørgen Roos and surrealist painter Wilhelm Freddie.', 'A short experimental film by (Carl Th. Dreyer''s cinematographer) Jørgen Roos and surrealist painter Wilhelm Freddie.', null, 'tmdb:movie:147598'),
  ('1119503346701889998', 'Eaters', 2011, 'Horror', 'Luca Boni, Marco Ristori, Paco Ferrari', 'Germano Tarricone, Marco Ristori', 'Rosella Elmi, Guglielmo Favilla, Elisa Ferretti, Riccardo Floris', 'R', 'Brutal, bloody terror. In a world where the living dead rule the planet, two human hunters seek dead specimens for their scientist cohort to experiment on to find answers among the madness.', 'Brutal, bloody terror. In a world where the living dead rule the planet, two human hunters seek dead specimens for their scientist cohort to experiment on to find answers among the madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBr8Y1L7Y0H3KBMI2woeWvQqdk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67673'),
  ('458241583840097137', 'Eatin'' on the Cuff or The Moth Who Came to Dinner', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Elvia Allman, Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Leo White', null, 'A live action piano player tells the story of a clothes-devouring moth who is on his way to marry a honey bee but gets caught by a black widow spider looking for a man of her own.', 'A live action piano player tells the story of a clothes-devouring moth who is on his way to marry a honey bee but gets caught by a black widow spider looking for a man of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oT6Blh3IW1surkWYN1EAURS9Lyo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185083'),
  ('698855924170073503', 'Eating Our Way to Extinction', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', 'Otto Brockway, Ludo Brockway', 'Otto Brockway', 'Kate Winslet, Richard Branson, Tony Robbins, Michael Greger, Sylvia Earle, Jeremy Rifkin, Peter Wadhams, Marco Springmann', 'NR', 'With searing insight that shines light in dark corners, EATING OUR WAY TO EXTINCTION is a compelling feature documentary that opens the lid on the elephant in the room no one wants to talk about. Confronting and entertaining, this documentary allows audiences to question their everyday choices, industry leaders and governments. Featuring a wealth of world-renowned contributors including Sir Richard Branson and Tony Robbins, it has a message of hope that will empower audiences.', 'With searing insight that shines light in dark corners, EATING OUR WAY TO EXTINCTION is a compelling feature documentary that opens the lid on the elephant in the room no one wants to talk about. Confronting and entertaining, this documentary allows audiences to question their everyday choices, industry leaders and governments. Featuring a wealth of world-renowned contributors including Sir Richard Branson and Tony Robbins, it has a message of hope that will empower audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aclMin8gNrGyMlnyqkafBGidyLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858381'),
  ('954116446242066040', 'Eating Out', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Q. Allan Brocka, Keith J. Duggan', 'Q. Allan Brocka', 'Scott Lunsford, Jim Verraros, Emily Brooke Hands, Ryan Carnes, Rebekah Kochan, Billy Shepard, Jillian Nusbaum, Kris Black', 'NR', 'After getting dumped by his slutty girlfriend, Caleb falls in love with Gwen. However, thanks to Caleb''s roommate, Gwen thinks he''s gay and sets him up with her roommate, Marc.', 'After getting dumped by his slutty girlfriend, Caleb falls in love with Gwen. However, thanks to Caleb''s roommate, Gwen thinks he''s gay and sets him up with her roommate, Marc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSbgNViEhXOFpaAZ1nB1AEC4pwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14681'),
  ('985479979685358689', 'Eating Out 2: Sloppy Seconds', 2006, 'Romance', 'Phillip J. Bartell, Lisa Wiegand', 'Phillip J. Bartell, Q. Allan Brocka', 'Jim Verraros, Emily Brooke Hands, Rebekah Kochan, Brett Chukerman, Scott Vickaryous, Marco Dapper, Mink Stole, Adrian Quiñonez', null, 'How far would you go to get the person of your dreams? With the help of Gwen and Tiffani, Kyle pretends to be heterosexual in order to land Troy, the new guy (and nude model) who''s turning the heads of both men and women. He soon finds himself joining the campus ex-gay support group and nabbing a girlfriend! Kyle''s ex-boyfriend Marc is horrified at the plan and decides to pursue the confused Troy with his own tactic -- being his "out" gay self. Who will win Troy first?', 'How far would you go to get the person of your dreams? With the help of Gwen and Tiffani, Kyle pretends to be heterosexual in order to land Troy, the new guy (and nude model) who''s turning the heads of both men and women. He soon finds himself joining the campus ex-gay support group and nabbing a girlfriend! Kyle''s ex-boyfriend Marc is horrified at the plan and decides to pursue the confused Troy with his own tactic -- being his "out" gay self. Who will win Troy first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcncbunLP4cz51SsPNjvKgEE8H0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17028'),
  ('191307234662818522', 'Eating Out: All You Can Eat', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Glenn Gaylord, Tom Camarda', 'Phillip J. Bartell, Q. Allan Brocka', 'Rebekah Kochan, Daniel Skelton, Chris Salvatore, Michael E.R. Walker, Julia Cho, Mink Stole, Leslie Jordan, Sumalee Montano', null, 'Tiffani attempts to help her geeky but very cute friend Casey find true love - or at least a sexy hunk. Taken under Tiffani’s wing, Casey pretends to be Ryan, Tiffani''s hot, straight, stripper ex-boyfriend, in order to seduce the smoldering Zack online, which works, until the real Ryan shows up!', 'Tiffani attempts to help her geeky but very cute friend Casey find true love - or at least a sexy hunk. Taken under Tiffani’s wing, Casey pretends to be Ryan, Tiffani''s hot, straight, stripper ex-boyfriend, in order to seduce the smoldering Zack online, which works, until the real Ryan shows up!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBCK26YxhePOiFjHpfFeycFIGzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25833'),
  ('116327536637235779', 'Eating Out: Drama Camp', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Q. Allan Brocka, Amanda Treyz', 'Phillip J. Bartell, Q. Allan Brocka', 'Chris Salvatore, Daniel Skelton, Aaron Milo, Ronnie Kroell, Harmony Santana, Lilach Mendelovich, Steven Daigle, Rob Westin', 'NR', 'Zack and Casey''s relationship is in a slump, but things are about to change at Dick Dickey''s Drama Camp. Zack meets gorgeous Benji, and when they get cast as lovers in a sexed-up version of The Taming of the Shrew, their self-restraint is put to the test. Will Zack and Casey''s relationship last with Benji in the picture?', 'Zack and Casey''s relationship is in a slump, but things are about to change at Dick Dickey''s Drama Camp. Zack meets gorgeous Benji, and when they get cast as lovers in a sexed-up version of The Taming of the Shrew, their self-restraint is put to the test. Will Zack and Casey''s relationship last with Benji in the picture?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a3qThJ0mRVaA5P3JqgOtO37I56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71744'),
  ('468101154507869488', 'Eating Out: The Open Weekend', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Q. Allan Brocka, Amanda Treyz', 'Phillip J. Bartell, Q. Allan Brocka', 'Chris Salvatore, Daniel Skelton, Aaron Milo, Lilach Mendelovich, Harmony Santana, Mink Stole, Joel Rush, Michael Vara', 'NR', 'Sexy couple Zack and Benji decide to have an “open” weekend to partake in the smorgasbord of available men on their vacation to a gay getaway in Palm Springs. When Zack runs into his ex-boyfriend Casey at the resort, they both do their best to look like they are having a good time. How could they not, when they are surrounded by cute, frisky guys with six-packs and very little clothing?', 'Sexy couple Zack and Benji decide to have an “open” weekend to partake in the smorgasbord of available men on their vacation to a gay getaway in Palm Springs. When Zack runs into his ex-boyfriend Casey at the resort, they both do their best to look like they are having a good time. How could they not, when they are surrounded by cute, frisky guys with six-packs and very little clothing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2wRS8XNU4fPfBfg5qQjZauK8FI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94354'),
  ('330396028080143074', 'Eating Raoul', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Paul Bartel, Gary Thieltges, Ira Halberstadt', 'Paul Bartel, Richard Blackburn', 'Paul Bartel, Mary Woronov, Robert Beltran, Susan Saiger, Richard Paul, John Shearin, Darcy Pulliam, Garry Goodrow', 'R', 'A prudish married couple feel put upon by the swingers living in their apartment building. One night, by accident, they discover a way to both rid themselves of the “perverts” down the hall and simultaneously realize their dream of opening a restaurant.', 'A prudish married couple feel put upon by the swingers living in their apartment building. One night, by accident, they discover a way to both rid themselves of the “perverts” down the hall and simultaneously realize their dream of opening a restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwbp2QoDH0MWxcoJCbErsfQpJmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28940'),
  ('347134553658366102', 'Eaux d''Artifice', 1953, 'Drama', 'Kenneth Anger, Kenneth Anger', null, 'Carmilla Salvatorelli', 'NR', 'A woman dressed elegantly walks purposely through the water gardens at the Villa d''Este in Tivoli, as the music of Vivaldi''s Winter movement of The Four Seasons plays. Heavy red filters give a blue cast to the light; water plays across stone, and fountains send it into the air. No words are spoken. Baroque statuary and the sensuous flow of water are back lit. Anger calls it water games.', 'A woman dressed elegantly walks purposely through the water gardens at the Villa d''Este in Tivoli, as the music of Vivaldi''s Winter movement of The Four Seasons plays. Heavy red filters give a blue cast to the light; water plays across stone, and fountains send it into the air. No words are spoken. Baroque statuary and the sensuous flow of water are back lit. Anger calls it water games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGz0MURNU3xMUYrf2tsqzvL9pTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65421'),
  ('486918683852758065', 'Ebbie', 1995, 'Fantasy, TV Movie', 'George Kaczender', 'Paul Redford, Ed Redlich', 'Susan Lucci, Wendy Crewson, Ron Lea, Molly Parker, Taran Noah Smith, Jeffrey DeMunn, Jennifer Clement, Lorena Gale', null, 'In this updated retelling of Dickens'' "A Christmas Carol," ruthless business-woman and shopping store owner Elizabeth "Ebbie" Scrooge is taught the true spirit of Christmas by three Spirits who visit her.', 'In this updated retelling of Dickens'' "A Christmas Carol," ruthless business-woman and shopping store owner Elizabeth "Ebbie" Scrooge is taught the true spirit of Christmas by three Spirits who visit her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LhUfnziJdpxLqkLIejfwKdKkZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125060'),
  ('851175993740720953', 'Ebirah, Horror of the Deep', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy', 'Jun Fukuda, Kazuo Yamada, Yasuyuki Inoue', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Akira Takarada, Kumi Mizuno, Akihiko Hirata, Jun Tazaki, Hideo Sunazuka, Chōtarō Tōgin, Tōru Ibuki, Toru Watanabe', null, 'Searching for his brother, Ryota stows away on a boat belonging to a criminal alongside two other teenagers. The group shipwrecks on Letchi island and discover the Infant Island natives have been enslaved by a terrorist organization controlling a crustacean monster. Finding a sleeping Godzilla, they decide to awaken him to defeat the terrorists and liberate the natives.', 'Searching for his brother, Ryota stows away on a boat belonging to a criminal alongside two other teenagers. The group shipwrecks on Letchi island and discover the Infant Island natives have been enslaved by a terrorist organization controlling a crustacean monster. Finding a sleeping Godzilla, they decide to awaken him to defeat the terrorists and liberate the natives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYGsvMKjIBU5CAQrfHOv9xIfYhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3115'),
  ('825679137703933350', 'Ebola Syndrome', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Herman Yau, Keith Lo Kam-Fu, Ho Lin', 'Chau Ting', 'Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Shing Fui-On, Lo Meng, Marianne Chan, Angel Wong Chui-Ling, Cheung Lau, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', null, 'A violent fugitive on the run from the law makes his way from Hong Kong to South Africa, where he discovers that he''s immune to the Ebola virus, and later returns home to spread the deadly disease.', 'A violent fugitive on the run from the law makes his way from Hong Kong to South Africa, where he discovers that he''s immune to the Ebola virus, and later returns home to spread the deadly disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3537kQNixMuzl9hS6WDY7J7v3nd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24922'),
  ('319646093619527520', 'Ecce Bombo', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nanni Moretti, Angelo Trombetta, Giuseppe Pinori', 'Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti, Luisa Rossi, Lina Sastri, Piero Galletti, Susanna Javicoli, Cristina Manni, Lorenza Ralli, Maurizio Romoli', null, 'Michele, Goffredo, Mirko and Vito are four friends who have participated in the battles of the student in Sixties. Now in the Seventies, the four friends don''t know what to do, though young and with so many possibilities to find a job in life. Intellectuals marginalized and misunderstood, the four friends find themselves when they can in a restaurant to discuss their outlandish theories. A girl named Olga disrupts their life, but Michele is her favorite, although he does not know what to do with the girl.', 'Michele, Goffredo, Mirko and Vito are four friends who have participated in the battles of the student in Sixties. Now in the Seventies, the four friends don''t know what to do, though young and with so many possibilities to find a job in life. Intellectuals marginalized and misunderstood, the four friends find themselves when they can in a restaurant to discuss their outlandish theories. A girl named Olga disrupts their life, but Michele is her favorite, although he does not know what to do with the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7t4aNyvRkLFVAE4XiPiY2U6RpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48282'),
  ('483875261913024310', 'Eccentric Dance', 1902, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Lina Esbrard', null, '"Danse excentrique" (Gaumont #587) is part of the "Miss Lina Esbrard. Danseuse cosmopolite et serpentine" series of 4 films, and should not be confused with "Danse serpentine" (Gaumont #588, the only extant film in the series), "Danse fantaisiste" (Gaumont #589) or "La Gigue" (Gaumont #590).', '"Danse excentrique" (Gaumont #587) is part of the "Miss Lina Esbrard. Danseuse cosmopolite et serpentine" series of 4 films, and should not be confused with "Danse serpentine" (Gaumont #588, the only extant film in the series), "Danse fantaisiste" (Gaumont #589) or "La Gigue" (Gaumont #590).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a47giSHYWayslQgbF16C10KKPqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119978'),
  ('535347158928676619', 'Eccentricities of a Blonde-Haired Girl', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Sabine Lancelin', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Ricardo Trêpa, Catarina Wallenstein, Júlia Buisel, Leonor Silveira, Filipe Vargas, Diogo Dória, Luis Miguel Cintra, Glória de Matos', null, 'On a train to Algarve, a young man recounts to a fellow passenger his past relationship with an eccentric young woman.', 'On a train to Algarve, a young man recounts to a fellow passenger his past relationship with an eccentric young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQfRqJH8OAR5WcFeBqkwnOkQIKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44411'),
