  ('731539315264421532', 'Edward, My Son', 1949, 'Drama', 'George Cukor, Freddie Young', 'Donald Ogden Stewart', 'Spencer Tracy, Deborah Kerr, Ian Hunter, James Donald, Mervyn Johns, Leueen MacGrath, Felix Aylmer, Walter Fitzgerald', 'NR', 'Following the death of his only son, a ruthless businessman reflects on his life, his unhappy marriage and his questionable parenting skills.', 'Following the death of his only son, a ruthless businessman reflects on his life, his unhappy marriage and his questionable parenting skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1udAkFcPMFRfxXWrZtQnSrRV2iG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94959'),
  ('156932270181811875', 'Edwin Boyd: Citizen Gangster', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Nathan Morlando, Andrew Shea, Sarah Campbell', 'Nathan Morlando', 'Scott Speedman, Kelly Reilly, Kevin Durand, Joseph Cross, Brendan Fletcher, Charlotte Sullivan, Melanie Scrofano, Brian Cox', 'NR', 'Based on a real WWII vet and family man turned bank robber. Disillusioned by his post war circumstances, Eddie Boyd is torn between the need to provide for his young family and an unfulfilled dream to head to Hollywood to become a star. He discovers a way to do both, robbing banks Hollywood style, but his dream leads him down a path of danger and tragedy.', 'Based on a real WWII vet and family man turned bank robber. Disillusioned by his post war circumstances, Eddie Boyd is torn between the need to provide for his young family and an unfulfilled dream to head to Hollywood to become a star. He discovers a way to do both, robbing banks Hollywood style, but his dream leads him down a path of danger and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTY0Wst8Gwm8tfVjw4J24i0L28q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92493'),
  ('1014756862946031715', 'Edy', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama, Comedy', 'Stéphan Guérin-Tillié, Céline Primard, Laurent Freyre', 'Stéphan Guérin-Tillié', 'François Berléand, Philippe Noiret, Marion Cotillard, Yves Verhoeven, Pascale Arbillot, Éric Savin, Laurent Bateau, Steve Suissa', null, 'Edy, an insurer with questionable morals, knows his business inside and out, so much so that he is not stingy with all kinds of schemes to help some of his privileged clients collect their spouse''s life insurance. However, Edy is tired of this life, which does not really bring him satisfaction anymore. So he decides to end his life. As he tries to do so, he finds himself involved in a dark story.', 'Edy, an insurer with questionable morals, knows his business inside and out, so much so that he is not stingy with all kinds of schemes to help some of his privileged clients collect their spouse''s life insurance. However, Edy is tired of this life, which does not really bring him satisfaction anymore. So he decides to end his life. As he tries to do so, he finds himself involved in a dark story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KZ6X7pAEo0Ds90yrvA9WJG9Pln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14734'),
  ('408960847787501111', 'Ee Parakkum Thalika', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Thaha, Saloo George', 'V. R. Gopalakrishnan', 'Dileep, Nithya Das, Harisree Ashokan, Salim Kumar, Cochin Haneefa, P. Vasu, Oduvil Unnikrishnan, Babu Namboothiri', null, 'Unnikrishnan owns an old bus, received as a compensation for his father''s road accident and he is facing lots of consequences due to the pathetic condition of the bus. The plot took a turn when a girl named Basanthi entered the bus as a nomad', 'Unnikrishnan owns an old bus, received as a compensation for his father''s road accident and he is facing lots of consequences due to the pathetic condition of the bus. The plot took a turn when a girl named Basanthi entered the bus as a nomad', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZzM4eaB60Ogz31NqomsHEdar45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194083'),
  ('862565537897218805', 'Ee Thani Niram', 2026, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Ratheesh Nedumangadu, Pradeep Nair', 'Ambika Kannan Bai', 'Anoop Menon, Rajeev Alunkal, Vishnu Bharath, Ramesh Pisharody, Noby Marcose', null, 'Young people gather at a resort camp where strangers meet. A tragic incident befalls a young woman during the program, triggering an investigation that unravels the events surrounding her fate.', 'Young people gather at a resort camp where strangers meet. A tragic incident befalls a young woman during the program, triggering an investigation that unravels the events surrounding her fate.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2mXBxdMiiiVkFCoPwxAgZz47ODG.jpg', 'plex:movie:ee-thani-niram'),
  ('677107822024562052', 'Eeb Allay Ooo!', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Prateek Vats, Saumyananda Sahi', 'Shubham Vardhan', 'Shardul Bhardwaj, Mahender Nath, Nutan Sinha, Shashi Bhushan, Naina Sareen, Nitin Goel', null, 'Hired as a monkey repeller upon moving to Delhi, a young man struggles to find his footing in his unenviable job and his place in the unforgiving world.', 'Hired as a monkey repeller upon moving to Delhi, a young man struggles to find his footing in his unenviable job and his place in the unforgiving world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpQk0DGreEmOhYNRrP7LRBPFbgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638665'),
  ('326545440875830160', 'Eeeny, Meeny, Miney, Moe', 1972, 'Drama', 'Rachel Weinberg, Jean-Jacques Renon', 'Rachel Weinberg', 'Monique Chaumette, Hans Meyer, Laurence Klejman, Ivan Erimitchoï, Gérard Bellocq, Jean-Paul Tribout, Henri Garcin, Francine Bergé', null, 'In the autumn of ''43, Mina, a little girl of Jewish origin, is entrusted to farmers in the Cévennes. Shocked by Jeroboam''s frustrated manners and Deborah''s cruel reflections - who is still suffering two centuries later from the struggle between Protestants and Catholics - Mina thinks she''ll find refuge with Jeannot. But the young boy doesn''t like girls and mistreats Mina. Fortunately, she has a friend: the village pastor. Thanks to him, she can go to school. Despite their constant bickering, Mina takes a liking to Jeannot. She convinces him to come to school with her. Together, they go for walks or take advantage of the passage of maquisards to force open the cellar door where hams hang! The arrival of an "informer" at the little school and encounters with the Germans disturb Jeannot.', 'In the autumn of ''43, Mina, a little girl of Jewish origin, is entrusted to farmers in the Cévennes. Shocked by Jeroboam''s frustrated manners and Deborah''s cruel reflections - who is still suffering two centuries later from the struggle between Protestants and Catholics - Mina thinks she''ll find refuge with Jeannot. But the young boy doesn''t like girls and mistreats Mina. Fortunately, she has a friend: the village pastor. Thanks to him, she can go to school. Despite their constant bickering, Mina takes a liking to Jeannot. She convinces him to come to school with her. Together, they go for walks or take advantage of the passage of maquisards to force open the cellar door where hams hang! The arrival of an "informer" at the little school and encounters with the Germans disturb Jeannot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2x4sCUlyxcXvWizCJ8jvrNKihZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564581'),
  ('167892439729998237', 'Eega', 2012, 'Fantasy, Action', 'S. S. Rajamouli, Jagadish Talasila, Suresh Ragutu', 'Ashwin Gangaraju', 'Sudeepa, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Nani, Adithya Menon, Thagubothu Ramesh, Devadarshini, Chatrapathi Sekhar, Srinivasa Reddy', null, 'Nani is a flower decorator, madly in love with his neighbor Bindhu. He gets killed by the baddie, Sudeep, a powerful businessman. Nani comes back as a housefly to get his revenge.', 'Nani is a flower decorator, madly in love with his neighbor Bindhu. He gets killed by the baddie, Sudeep, a powerful businessman. Nani comes back as a housefly to get his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pX7fn4EZrg2YFlV4GNMIfHDOQZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148265'),
  ('120953221825392194', 'Eegah', 1962, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Vilis Lapenieks, Arch Hall Sr.', 'Bob Wehling', 'Arch Hall Jr., Richard Kiel, Marilyn Manning, Arch Hall Sr., Lloyd Williams, Bob Davis, Addalyn Pollitt, Ray Dennis Steckler', null, 'Teenagers stumble across a prehistoric caveman, who goes on a rampage.', 'Teenagers stumble across a prehistoric caveman, who goes on a rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvLmdKwnzVjPNdRs5FYBgL3xQWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31287'),
  ('102675826275793583', 'Eenie Meanie', 2025, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy', 'Shawn Simmons, Tim Ives', 'Shawn Simmons', 'Samara Weaving, Karl Glusman, Andy Garcia, Steve Zahn, Jermaine Fowler, Marshawn Lynch, Randall Park, Mike O''Malley', 'R', 'A former teenage getaway driver gets dragged back into her unsavory past when a former employer offers her a chance to save the life of her chronically unreliable ex-boyfriend.', 'A former teenage getaway driver gets dragged back into her unsavory past when a former employer offers her a chance to save the life of her chronically unreliable ex-boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12Va3oO3oYUdOd75zM57Nx1976a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151334'),
  ('30093271119283791', 'Eephus', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Carson Lund, Greg Tango, Michael Basta', 'Michael Basta, Nate Fisher, Carson Lund', 'Keith William Richards, Stephen Radochia, Cliff Blake, Chris Goodwin, Theodore Bouloukos, John R. Smith Jnr., David Pridemore, Conner Marx', 'NR', 'As an imminent construction project looms over their beloved small-town baseball field, a pair of New England rec-league teams face off for the last time. Tensions flare up and ceremonial laughs are shared as an era of camaraderie and escapism fades into an uncertain future.', 'As an imminent construction project looms over their beloved small-town baseball field, a pair of New England rec-league teams face off for the last time. Tensions flare up and ceremonial laughs are shared as an era of camaraderie and escapism fades into an uncertain future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYlkEyYNku0RV4mZNhWBjIbNc4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226777'),
  ('390226461453936764', 'Eerie', 2019, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Sheryl Rose M. Andes, Mikhail Red, Mycko David', 'Rae Red, Mariah Reodica', 'Bea Alonzo, Charo Santos, Maxene Magalona, Jake Cuenca, Gabby Padilla, Gillian Vicencio, Mary Joy Apostol, Nafa Hilario Cruz', null, 'The unexpected and gruesome death of a student threatens the existence of an old Catholic school for girls. Pat Consolacion, the school guidance counselor, involves herself with the students in the hopes of helping them cope, and at the same time uncover the mysteries of the student’s death. Most students suspect of the strict and borderline abusive Mother Alice, who also threatened Pat’s tenure in the school because of her continuous meddling with the case. But Pat’s unusual talents lead her to knowing Eri, a former student who''s been watching the whole school for years. Piece by piece, Pat uncovers the secret of the school and the monster that it nurtured for the past century.', 'The unexpected and gruesome death of a student threatens the existence of an old Catholic school for girls. Pat Consolacion, the school guidance counselor, involves herself with the students in the hopes of helping them cope, and at the same time uncover the mysteries of the student’s death. Most students suspect of the strict and borderline abusive Mother Alice, who also threatened Pat’s tenure in the school because of her continuous meddling with the case. But Pat’s unusual talents lead her to knowing Eri, a former student who''s been watching the whole school for years. Piece by piece, Pat uncovers the secret of the school and the monster that it nurtured for the past century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duEI37Qjtt1WaiOzZzVlkI6JO2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522246'),
  ('476856999184992996', 'Eerie Tales', 1919, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Richard Oswald, Carl Hoffmann', null, 'Anita Berber, Conrad Veidt, Reinhold Schünzel, Hugo Döblin, Paul Morgan, Georg John, W. Arnoldi, Bernhard Goetzke', null, 'A demon, a reaper, and the ghost of a prostitute read gothic short stories and act them out.', 'A demon, a reaper, and the ghost of a prostitute read gothic short stories and act them out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53971ZEqRIk600jY8juaCBMaAT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28629'),
  ('26775527995680626', 'Efes''in Sirri', 2026, 'Comedy, Family', 'Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Zeynep Süner, Kamuran Süner', 'Ecem Erkek, Onur Buldu, Erdem Yener, Sarp Apak, Abdullah Şahin', null, 'A mysterious map discovered in Ephesus sends Tuna and Damla back in time, transforming them back into children.', 'A mysterious map discovered in Ephesus sends Tuna and Damla back in time, transforming them back into children.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbwzWzfAA5UcKQTsSGAxdIyo4sKh.jpg', 'plex:movie:efesin-sirri-2026'),
  ('813461923967344860', 'Effects', 1979, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Dusty Nelson', 'Dusty Nelson', 'Joseph Pilato, Susan Chapek, John Harrison, Bernard McKenna, Debra Gordon, Tom Savini, Charles Hoyes, Blay Bahnsen', 'R', 'Some crew members of a company shooting a horror film begin to suspect that the "killings" in the movie are real, and that they are actually making a "snuff" film.', 'Some crew members of a company shooting a horror film begin to suspect that the "killings" in the movie are real, and that they are actually making a "snuff" film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogW425ENOQFxNYv538E7wesPZWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86499'),
