  ('952776079560286766', 'Effetto domino', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alessandro Rossetto, Daniel Mazza', 'Caterina Serra, Alessandro Rossetto', 'Diego Ribon, Mirko Artuso, Nicoletta Maragno, Maria Roveran, Roberta da Soller, Olivier Rabourdin, Marco Paolini, Lucia Mascino', null, 'In a thermal bath town that withstands mass tourism, a builder and his surveyor partner start up an ambitious project: converting twenty abandoned hotels into luxury residences for wealthy retired people. The lack of financial support from the banks and investors triggers a domino effect in their destiny that forever subverts reality.', 'In a thermal bath town that withstands mass tourism, a builder and his surveyor partner start up an ambitious project: converting twenty abandoned hotels into luxury residences for wealthy retired people. The lack of financial support from the banks and investors triggers a domino effect in their destiny that forever subverts reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8F3eUzhiNQnw9p0NqJpdEHxkjM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614744'),
  ('1085172185460977019', 'Effi Briest', 1974, 'History, Drama', 'Jürgen Jürges, Dietrich Lohmann, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Hanna Schygulla, Wolfgang Schenck, Ulli Lommel, Lilo Pempeit, Herbert Steinmetz, Ursula Strätz, Irm Hermann, Karlheinz Böhm', null, 'When 17-year-old Effi Briest marries the elderly Baron von Instetten, she moves to a small, isolated Baltic town and a house that she fears is haunted. Starved for companionship, Effi begins a friendship with Major Crampas, a charismatic womanizer.', 'When 17-year-old Effi Briest marries the elderly Baron von Instetten, she moves to a small, isolated Baltic town and a house that she fears is haunted. Starved for companionship, Effi begins a friendship with Major Crampas, a charismatic womanizer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EJGIMa4S6cuyruDBt3Q9tMsibL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706'),
  ('854295634154901213', 'Effi Briest', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hermine Huntgeburth', 'Volker Einrauch', 'Julia Jentsch, Sebastian Koch, Juliane Köhler, Mišel Matičević, Barbara Auer, Margarita Broich, Rüdiger Vogler, Thomas Thieme', null, 'Following her parents'' wishes, spirited seventeen-year-old Effi Briest marries Baron von Innstetten – a former admirer of her mother – who is twenty years Effi''s senior. This marriage of prudence heralds the beginning of a humdrum life, far from home, for Effi. Innstetten devotes himself entirely to his political career, and the sleepy small town of Kessin has very little to offer in terms of variety. But then, one day, Innstetten''s old regimental comrade, Major Crampas – a charming womanizer – arrives on the scene.', 'Following her parents'' wishes, spirited seventeen-year-old Effi Briest marries Baron von Innstetten – a former admirer of her mother – who is twenty years Effi''s senior. This marriage of prudence heralds the beginning of a humdrum life, far from home, for Effi. Innstetten devotes himself entirely to his political career, and the sleepy small town of Kessin has very little to offer in terms of variety. But then, one day, Innstetten''s old regimental comrade, Major Crampas – a charming womanizer – arrives on the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88TlG6nRUA17Sz52AFpQyyVZkQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26496'),
  ('639895849376603934', 'Effie Gray', 2014, 'Drama', 'Richard Laxton, Andrew Dunn, Jack Ravenscroft', 'Emma Thompson', 'Dakota Fanning, Emma Thompson, Greg Wise, Tom Sturridge, Robbie Coltrane, Julie Walters, Derek Jacobi, Claudia Cardinale', 'PG-13', 'A look at the mysterious relationship between Victorian art critic John Ruskin and his teenage bride Effie Gray.', 'A look at the mysterious relationship between Victorian art critic John Ruskin and his teenage bride Effie Gray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEeuxFscc6NLdyhpvqBGsHgpqV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114155'),
  ('1151178529379631214', 'Efsunlu: Kabirden Gelen', 2019, 'Horror', 'Uğur Kaplan', 'Özgür Bakar, Koray Yeltekin, Alper Kıvılcım', 'Sedef Şahin, Elif Kartal, İlke Al, Dilara Çakır, İrem İpek, Reyhan İlhan', null, 'Kübra, who is enrolled in a historical girls'' dormitory, realizes Burcu, a sick girl who has been closed down in one of the rooms by the Manageress Zahide. As you explore the mystery of the dorm, the nightmares around Burcu begin to spread to Kübra.', 'Kübra, who is enrolled in a historical girls'' dormitory, realizes Burcu, a sick girl who has been closed down in one of the rooms by the Manageress Zahide. As you explore the mystery of the dorm, the nightmares around Burcu begin to spread to Kübra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zz3DasetwtIAoJpaLSoYlnbpMdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616204'),
  ('30150958895792655', 'Egg', 2005, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi', 'Jo Hye-yeong, Inuko Inuyama, Jiro Sato, Megumi Ujiie, Samy Pop, 小西康久', null, 'A bored office worker sees a giant egg when she closes her eyes, and when it hatches, each blink unleashes escalating real-world horrors.', 'A bored office worker sees a giant egg when she closes her eyes, and when it hatches, each blink unleashes escalating real-world horrors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFAN8LbaGDRR5tC059mlcFDdTpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188828'),
  ('805051015992721511', 'Egg', 2007, 'Drama', 'Semih Kaplanoğlu, Özgür Eken', 'Orçun Köksal, Semih Kaplanoğlu', 'Nejat İşler, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Ufuk Bayraktar, Kaan Karabacak, Tülin Özen, Cengiz Bozkurt, Gülçin Santırcıoğlu, Semra Kaplanoglu', null, 'Poet Yusuf (35-38) returns to his childhood hometown, which he hadn''t visited for years, upon his mother''s death. He is faced with a neglected, crumbling house. Ayla, a young girl (17-19) awaits him there. Yusuf has been unaware of the existence of this distant relation who had been living with his mother for five years; He stays by his dead mother''s bedside for a while on the morning of his return...', 'Poet Yusuf (35-38) returns to his childhood hometown, which he hadn''t visited for years, upon his mother''s death. He is faced with a neglected, crumbling house. Ayla, a young girl (17-19) awaits him there. Yusuf has been unaware of the existence of this distant relation who had been living with his mother for five years; He stays by his dead mother''s bedside for a while on the morning of his return...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcTlvAq4JPURVqmaVVWdIVSe33f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37586'),
  ('589450917764195476', 'Egg Nogg', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Roman Załuski, Jacek Mierosławski, Wiesław Pyda', 'Roman Załuski, Ilona Łepkowska', 'Grażyna Błęcka-Kolska, Ewa Kasprzyk, Zdzisław Wardejn, Katarzyna Łaniewska, Małgorzata Lorentowicz, Jerzy Turek, Dariusz Siatkowski, Jerzy Rogalski', null, 'Following the emotions associated with entrance examinations to the faculty of pedagogy, Catherine Solska returns to his native village. And here she will surprise - the family without their knowledge to begin preparations for engagement with a rich neighbor Kolasa. Girl falls into despair, tries to oppose the decision of the parents, but is closed in his room. On visits to her fiance and flees out the window calling mail to the university. Receives misleading information and is convinced that was not accepted to college. Resigned returns home and agrees to the wedding. Meanwhile, on the eve of the wedding the postman brings the notice of acceptance to the university.', 'Following the emotions associated with entrance examinations to the faculty of pedagogy, Catherine Solska returns to his native village. And here she will surprise - the family without their knowledge to begin preparations for engagement with a rich neighbor Kolasa. Girl falls into despair, tries to oppose the decision of the parents, but is closed in his room. On visits to her fiance and flees out the window calling mail to the university. Receives misleading information and is convinced that was not accepted to college. Resigned returns home and agrees to the wedding. Meanwhile, on the eve of the wedding the postman brings the notice of acceptance to the university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DNrgyNWBiGyr12Sab6LUUlhxFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36392'),
  ('3829338840759069', 'Egg! Egg! A Hardboiled Story', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Hans Alfredson, Lars Swanberg', 'Hans Alfredson', 'Gösta Ekman, Max von Sydow, Birgitta Andersson, Anna Godenius, Hans Alfredson, Ingvar Petrow, Jim Hughes, Stig Ossian Ericson', null, 'A fairy tale and satire about a wealthy industrialist, whose son has been subdued and oppressed and totally uninterested in his father''s business.', 'A fairy tale and satire about a wealthy industrialist, whose son has been subdued and oppressed and totally uninterested in his father''s business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnCVqnXZfoDclG7CtM9ULZa4OLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135390'),
  ('527986471187480042', 'Egged On', 1926, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Charles R. Bowers, Harold L. Muller, Ted Sears', null, 'Charles R. Bowers', null, 'Charley invents a machine that turns ordinary, breakable eggs into rubbery, unbreakable ones for transport. He builds a Rube Goldberg contraption of parts stolen from his neighbors. Rival egg companies want his invention, one of them stooping to sabotage to get it.', 'Charley invents a machine that turns ordinary, breakable eggs into rubbery, unbreakable ones for transport. He builds a Rube Goldberg contraption of parts stolen from his neighbors. Rival egg companies want his invention, one of them stooping to sabotage to get it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXt2biN2z6F7oUQLcdgBHThAhpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118509'),
  ('1141286027534904331', 'Eggs', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bent Hamer', 'Bent Hamer', 'Sverre Hansen, Kjell Stormoen, Juni Dahr, Ulf Wengård, Alf Conrad Olsen, Leif Malmberg, Leif Andrée, Trond Høvik', null, 'Two brothers in their seventies, Pa and Moe, have lived together all their lives in a little house in the country, the only interruption being when Pa made a weekend trip to Småland on his moped during the second World War. The past returns when his adult son dating from his Swedish visit, Konrad, comes to live with them after his mother has fallen ill. Soon Moe is about to discover that three is indeed a crowd...', 'Two brothers in their seventies, Pa and Moe, have lived together all their lives in a little house in the country, the only interruption being when Pa made a weekend trip to Småland on his moped during the second World War. The past returns when his adult son dating from his Swedish visit, Konrad, comes to live with them after his mother has fallen ill. Soon Moe is about to discover that three is indeed a crowd...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NJW0V8DgZArOya0j6fD7QsaflK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40378'),
  ('718206836165535368', 'Eggshells', 1971, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tobe Hooper, Lou Perryman, Tobe Hooper', 'Tobe Hooper', 'Mahlon Foreman, Ron Barnhart, Amy Lester, Pamela Craig, Jim Schulman, Allen Danziger, Sharon Danziger, David Noll', null, 'An experimental allegory about a group of hippie students in Austin, Texas, who move into a big old house in the woods. However, something else is there and it''s influencing them.', 'An experimental allegory about a group of hippie students in Austin, Texas, who move into a big old house in the woods. However, something else is there and it''s influencing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JtKSowpNuCakAZjOyorlHM60kG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89445'),
  ('914701756318189577', 'Egoist', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daishi Matsunaga, Naoya Ikeda, Yôhei Matsushita', 'Daishi Matsunaga, Kyoko Inukai', 'Ryohei Suzuki, Hio Miyazawa, Sawako Agawa, Yuko Nakamura, Iori Wada, Durian Lollobrigida, Akira Emoto', null, 'A lonely magazine editor finds romance with his personal trainer until a confession changes everything. Based on the novel by Makoto Takayama.', 'A lonely magazine editor finds romance with his personal trainer until a confession changes everything. Based on the novel by Makoto Takayama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNpzt36z9GsYnsgnGpZWqLL07oT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027273'),
  ('1024326787531740364', 'Egomania: Island Without Hope', 1987, 'Drama', 'Christoph Schlingensief, Beatrice Hasler, Dominikus Probst', 'Christoph Schlingensief', 'Udo Kier, Tilda Swinton, Uwe Fellensiek, Anna Fechter, Anastasia Kudelka, Sergej Gleithmann, Dietrich Kuhlbrodt, Wolfgang Schulte', null, 'Egomania is a visually stunning end-of-the-world melodrama about lust, jealousy and murder set amidst solar eclipses, orchestral chants and the distant thunder of the boiling sea. The film’s characters – riddled with unconscious desires – find themselves imprisoned on an island. Drawing parallels to the work of British filmmaker Derek Jarman and staring Jarman’s actress-muse Tilda Swinton, Schlingensief’s raw and almost mythological film stands in contrast to his more offensive efforts.', 'Egomania is a visually stunning end-of-the-world melodrama about lust, jealousy and murder set amidst solar eclipses, orchestral chants and the distant thunder of the boiling sea. The film’s characters – riddled with unconscious desires – find themselves imprisoned on an island. Drawing parallels to the work of British filmmaker Derek Jarman and staring Jarman’s actress-muse Tilda Swinton, Schlingensief’s raw and almost mythological film stands in contrast to his more offensive efforts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utZnK4KWPQN3zJq5ClUfiv5sO9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245324'),
  ('151440319002907777', 'Egon Schiele: Death and the Maiden', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Dieter Berner, Carsten Thiele, Alexandre Brown', 'Dieter Berner, Hilde Berger', 'Noah Saavedra, Maresi Riegner, Valerie Pachner, Larissa Breidbach, Marie Jung, Elisabeth Umlauft, Thomas Schubert, Daniel Sträßer', null, 'Vienna, Austria, 1910. The young painter Egon Schiele is a rising artist, provocative and free, whose work, characterized by eroticism, shocks as much as it fascinates art lovers.', 'Vienna, Austria, 1910. The young painter Egon Schiele is a rising artist, provocative and free, whose work, characterized by eroticism, shocks as much as it fascinates art lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRG0Y9im6hblgJrnwup6SY3r1Pr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416574'),
  ('727131607161074164', 'EgyBest', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marwan Abdelmoniem, Omar El Badrawy', 'Ahmed Hosny', 'Ahmed Malek, Salma Abu Deif, Marwan Pablo, Mohamed Abduo, Hanan Youssef', null, 'A journey of two friends from Cairo''s El-Marg district found a site that becomes the Arab world''s largest hub for pirated films. Explore the underworld of digital piracy and the ethical and legal challenges of the internet era.', 'A journey of two friends from Cairo''s El-Marg district found a site that becomes the Arab world''s largest hub for pirated films. Explore the underworld of digital piracy and the ethical and legal challenges of the internet era.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcwtLRUsaIWqQ3bFWmIso5qwnXzv.jpg', 'plex:movie:egybest'),
