  ('324561074171557819', 'Ehrengard: The Art of Seduction', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Pallesen, Bille August', 'Anders Frithiof August', 'Alice E. Bier Zandén, Emil Aron Dorph, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Jacob Lohmann, Sara-Marie Maltha, Emilie Kroyer Koppel, Christopher Læssø', 'R', 'When a self-appointed expert on love tries to teach a timid prince the art of seduction, the plan backfires, leading to scandal — and unexpected romance.', 'When a self-appointed expert on love tries to teach a timid prince the art of seduction, the plan backfires, leading to scandal — and unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gXPtMckzLAFOA8V2niy54HqQ4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113448'),
