  ('1145777617925202996', 'Eight Hours of Terror', 1957, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Seijun Suzuki, Kazunari Takeda, Kazue Nagatsuka', 'Rokuro Tsukiji, Gorō Tanada', 'Nobuo Kaneko, Harue Tone, Sumiko Minami, Kenjiro Uemura, Minako Katsuki, Kan Yanagiya, Hiroshi Kondō, Hideaki Nitani', null, 'A bus making its precarious way across a winding mountain road picks up some unwelcome passengers.', 'A bus making its precarious way across a winding mountain road picks up some unwelcome passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3GlcUJCVcddiiuI0MBLoSsZj2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352729'),
  ('409224756854995190', 'Eight Hundred Heroes', 1975, 'War, Drama, History', 'Lin Wen-Chin, Ting Shan-Hsi', null, 'Chen Hung-Lieh, Ko Chun-Hsiung, Brigitte Lin, Sylvia Chang, Ronald Chin Han, Chin Han, Hsu Feng, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan', null, 'As battle rages in Shanghai, a single battalion of soldiers led by Xie Jinyuan is ordered to hold back the Japanese forces at the Sihang warehouse. Girl scouts risk their lives to deliver food and medicine to the defenders.', 'As battle rages in Shanghai, a single battalion of soldiers led by Xie Jinyuan is ordered to hold back the Japanese forces at the Sihang warehouse. Girl scouts risk their lives to deliver food and medicine to the defenders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRAqeFx3stubC3s8j62NSMSaiQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235191'),
  ('1023680719803630521', 'Eight Legged Freaks', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Ellory Elkayem, John S. Bartley, Paul F. Bernard', 'Jesse Alexander, Ellory Elkayem', 'David Arquette, Kari Wührer, Doug E. Doug, Scarlett Johansson, Rick Overton, Matt Czuchry, Riley Smith, Leon Rippy', 'PG-13', 'The residents of a rural mining town discover that an unfortunate chemical spill has caused hundreds of little spiders to mutate overnight to the size of SUVs. It''s then up to mining engineer Chris McCormack and Sheriff Sam Parker to mobilize an eclectic group of townspeople, including the Sheriff''s young son, Mike, her daughter, Ashley, and paranoid radio announcer Harlan, into battle against the bloodthirsty eight-legged beasts.', 'The residents of a rural mining town discover that an unfortunate chemical spill has caused hundreds of little spiders to mutate overnight to the size of SUVs. It''s then up to mining engineer Chris McCormack and Sheriff Sam Parker to mobilize an eclectic group of townspeople, including the Sheriff''s young son, Mike, her daughter, Ashley, and paranoid radio announcer Harlan, into battle against the bloodthirsty eight-legged beasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5blAumPPS6vX6zcUlt9oIhOEheK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8869'),
  ('1105324085361450995', 'Eight Men Out', 1988, 'Drama, History', 'Gina Randazzo, Gary Marcus, Don Gibbin', 'John Sayles', 'John Cusack, Clifton James, Michael Lerner, Christopher Lloyd, John Mahoney, Charlie Sheen, David Strathairn, D. B. Sweeney', 'PG', 'Buck Weaver and Hap Felsch are young idealistic players on the Chicago White Sox, a pennant-winning team owned by Charles Comiskey - a penny-pinching, hands-on manager who underpays his players and treats them with disdain. And when gamblers and hustlers discover that Comiskey''s demoralized players are ripe for a money-making scheme, one by one the team members agree to throw the World Series. But when the White Sox are defeated, a couple of sports writers smell a fix and a national scandal explodes, ripping the cover off America''s favorite pastime.', 'Buck Weaver and Hap Felsch are young idealistic players on the Chicago White Sox, a pennant-winning team owned by Charles Comiskey - a penny-pinching, hands-on manager who underpays his players and treats them with disdain. And when gamblers and hustlers discover that Comiskey''s demoralized players are ripe for a money-making scheme, one by one the team members agree to throw the World Series. But when the White Sox are defeated, a couple of sports writers smell a fix and a national scandal explodes, ripping the cover off America''s favorite pastime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nh0w2C9h9KfJb0OsVg65O65b5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13554'),
  ('460606159416801404', 'Eight Miles High', 2007, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Achim Bornhak', 'Achim Bornhak, Claus Peter Hant, Olaf Kraemer', 'Natalia Avelon, Matthias Schweighöfer, David Scheller, Viktor Norén, Alexander Scheer, Petra Berndt, Inga Busch, Friederike Kempter', 'NR', 'Achim Bornhak''s movie focuses on the restless life of Uschi Obermaier, the icon of the 1968 movement in Germany and groupie. At the age of 16, Uschi is bored by her job in a photo lab, but soon becomes the "it girl" of Munich''s club scene. When she gets to know Rainer Langhans, they move to Berlin and live in "Kommune 1", the first politically-motivated commune in Germany. While the other occupants claim she isn''t political enough, Uschi just wants to have fun, works as fashion model and leads international music stars in temptation.', 'Achim Bornhak''s movie focuses on the restless life of Uschi Obermaier, the icon of the 1968 movement in Germany and groupie. At the age of 16, Uschi is bored by her job in a photo lab, but soon becomes the "it girl" of Munich''s club scene. When she gets to know Rainer Langhans, they move to Berlin and live in "Kommune 1", the first politically-motivated commune in Germany. While the other occupants claim she isn''t political enough, Uschi just wants to have fun, works as fashion model and leads international music stars in temptation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2GT0in1R0GU3a34CN4YFztJh4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244'),
  ('768601210120328168', 'Eight on the Lam', 1967, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, Alan Stensvold', 'Albert E. Lewin, Burt Styler', 'Bob Hope, Phyllis Diller, Jonathan Winters, Shirley Eaton, Jill St. John, Stacey Gregg, Kevin Brodie, Glenn Gilger', 'NR', 'Bank teller and widower with seven kids, Bob Hope finds $10,000 in a parking lot.', 'Bank teller and widower with seven kids, Bob Hope finds $10,000 in a parking lot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktB4lIka6P4R3SwYxxNYLTdUs7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94170'),
  ('243522484745118736', 'Eight Taels of Gold', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mabel Cheung Yuen-Ting, Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Stephen Wong Wai-Him', 'Alex Law Kai-Yui, Mabel Cheung Yuen-Ting', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Sylvia Chang, Xie Weixiong, Goo Fai, Chu Fei, Lau Kwok-Ping, Ho Tak-Hung, Chan Man-Kuen', null, 'An ex-pat travels from New York to his home village in rural China after a long absence. On his way, he meets a familiar girl.', 'An ex-pat travels from New York to his home village in rural China after a long absence. On his way, he meets a familiar girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4osG2wZ38J6T3ahtM3AZSYfs23h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213163'),
  ('255361089567900930', 'Eighteen in the Sun', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Pipolo, Castellano', 'Catherine Spaak, Lisa Gastoni, Gianni Garko, Spiros Focás, Luisa Mattioli, Fabrizio Capucci, Giampiero Littera, Eleonora Morana', null, 'An Italian variation on the Frankie & Annette-Gidget beach party movies that were all the rage in North America in the early 60s. Nicole Molino (Catherine Spaak) and Nicola Molino (Gianni Garko) are not related to one another. In fact, they don’t even know each other until both are inadvertently assigned the same hotel room on the island of Ischia. Nicole isn’t interested in any hanky-panky, so Nicola reluctantly promises to keep his hands to himself.', 'An Italian variation on the Frankie & Annette-Gidget beach party movies that were all the rage in North America in the early 60s. Nicole Molino (Catherine Spaak) and Nicola Molino (Gianni Garko) are not related to one another. In fact, they don’t even know each other until both are inadvertently assigned the same hotel room on the island of Ischia. Nicole isn’t interested in any hanky-panky, so Nicola reluctantly promises to keep his hands to himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLpZ9RKDe2CIFKXxsAAZ0ecMFwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196422'),
  ('1018410669679634897', 'Eighteen Springs', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ann Hui, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Cub Chin Kong-Hon', 'John Chan Kin-Chung', 'Leon Lai Ming, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Ge You, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Annie Wu, Huang Lei, Wang Zhiwen, Liu Changwei', null, 'In 1930s Shanghai, a young office girl falls in love with a factory worker in the same company.', 'In 1930s Shanghai, a young office girl falls in love with a factory worker in the same company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eFX91yAfhkiXRxWMBDXvnTcFC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40889'),
  ('651839000944556499', 'Eighth Grade', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bo Burnham, Vic Coram, Dan Taggatz', 'Bo Burnham', 'Elsie Fisher, Josh Hamilton, Emily Robinson, Jake Ryan, Daniel Zolghadri, Fred Hechinger, Imani Lewis, Luke Prael', 'R', 'Thirteen-year-old Kayla endures the tidal wave of contemporary suburban adolescence as she makes her way through the last week of middle school — the end of her thus far disastrous eighth grade year — before she begins high school.', 'Thirteen-year-old Kayla endures the tidal wave of contemporary suburban adolescence as she makes her way through the last week of middle school — the end of her thus far disastrous eighth grade year — before she begins high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTa9cLhGHfQ7084UvoPQ2bBXKqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489925'),
  ('724585350578999770', 'Eike: Tudo ou Nada', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dida Andrade, Andradina Azevedo, Andradina Azevedo', 'Dida Andrade, Andradina Azevedo, Sílvio Guindane', 'Nelson Freitas, Thelmo Fernandes, Xando Graça, Marcelo Valle, Juliana Alves, Bukassa Kabengele, Felipe Adler, André Mattos', null, 'In 2006, when the Brazilian economy was taking off due to the discovery of oil in the pre-salt layer, Eike Batista decided to create the oil company OGX and hired the best men from Petrobras to participate in the pre-salt auction. But megalomaniacal plans and a series of misguided decisions and alliances cause their empire to crumble as spectacularly as it had grown. And Brazil watches, perplexed, the fall of Eike, who loses all his fortune, power and prestige. Inspired by the book by journalist Malu Gaspar.', 'In 2006, when the Brazilian economy was taking off due to the discovery of oil in the pre-salt layer, Eike Batista decided to create the oil company OGX and hired the best men from Petrobras to participate in the pre-salt auction. But megalomaniacal plans and a series of misguided decisions and alliances cause their empire to crumble as spectacularly as it had grown. And Brazil watches, perplexed, the fall of Eike, who loses all his fortune, power and prestige. Inspired by the book by journalist Malu Gaspar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmE2NwVAt6AczscW0lapuuCTghg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875295'),
  ('801992818681611606', 'Eileen', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime', 'William Oldroyd, Ari Wegner, Josh Acosta', 'Ottessa Moshfegh, Luke Goebel', 'Thomasin McKenzie, Anne Hathaway, Shea Whigham, Sam Nivola, Marin Ireland, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Tonye Patano, William Hill', 'R', 'During a bitter 1964 Massachusetts winter, young secretary Eileen becomes enchanted by Rebecca, the glamorous new counselor at the prison where she works. Their budding friendship takes a twisted turn when Rebecca reveals a dark secret — throwing Eileen onto a sinister path.', 'During a bitter 1964 Massachusetts winter, young secretary Eileen becomes enchanted by Rebecca, the glamorous new counselor at the prison where she works. Their budding friendship takes a twisted turn when Rebecca reveals a dark secret — throwing Eileen onto a sinister path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6kedRqcj8jH0cik9p1jzkDwZvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664341'),
  ('175074883977020773', 'Ein Anfang von etwas', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hans Selikovsky, Nikolaus Leytner', 'Nikolaus Leytner', 'Christoph Waltz, Sandra Cervik, Georg Trenkwitz, Inge Rosenberg, Wolfgang Böck, Adi Hirschal, Karl Markovics, Sandra Kreisler', null, 'Herbert lives a rather simple life, left to his own devices. He works as a projectionist in a shabby Viennese movie theater and lives alone with his red nameless cat in the free caretaker''s apartment of a somewhat run-down apartment building. Now and then he visits his mother in a nursing home, meets with an old friend of his father, or comes to meetings of a savings club. Saving money is pretty much the center of his life because he has a dream. He wants to emigrate to the U.S. to buy his own movie theater and to reunite with his long-lost father. But when Rita, a young student, moves into the apartment building things in his life are changed completely.', 'Herbert lives a rather simple life, left to his own devices. He works as a projectionist in a shabby Viennese movie theater and lives alone with his red nameless cat in the free caretaker''s apartment of a somewhat run-down apartment building. Now and then he visits his mother in a nursing home, meets with an old friend of his father, or comes to meetings of a savings club. Saving money is pretty much the center of his life because he has a dream. He wants to emigrate to the U.S. to buy his own movie theater and to reunite with his long-lost father. But when Rita, a young student, moves into the apartment building things in his life are changed completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44gZk7WbOw7PSlFmInVSE8lw5DD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292563'),
  ('184283519592549651', 'Ein bisschen bleiben wir noch', 2020, 'Drama', 'Arash T. Riahi', 'Arash T. Riahi', 'Leopold Pallua, Rosa Zant, Anna Fenderl, Christine Ostermayer, Viktor Krüger, Rainer Wöss, Simone Fuith, Markus Zett', null, 'Chechen refugee children, Oskar (8) and Lilli (13), who have been living in Austria for six years, are about to be deported along with their mother. However, her sudden attempted suicide results not only in the short-term suspension of their deportation but also in the forced separation of the family. The children’s hope that they will be reunited with their mother is nourished by their love for each other and challenges all bureaucratic obstacles with passion and poetry. A bittersweet odyssey about the many ways of perceiving the world around you in order to survive.', 'Chechen refugee children, Oskar (8) and Lilli (13), who have been living in Austria for six years, are about to be deported along with their mother. However, her sudden attempted suicide results not only in the short-term suspension of their deportation but also in the forced separation of the family. The children’s hope that they will be reunited with their mother is nourished by their love for each other and challenges all bureaucratic obstacles with passion and poetry. A bittersweet odyssey about the many ways of perceiving the world around you in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkH8hCsrrMgV9WRsM3mxrSPYWFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655513'),
  ('381143748778696342', 'Ein Dorf wehrt sich', 2019, 'Drama', 'Gabriela Zerhau', 'Gabriela Zerhau', 'Fritz Karl, Brigitte Hobmeier, Harald Windisch, Francis Fulton-Smith, Philipp Hochmair, Oliver Masucci, Verena Altenberger, Johannes Silberschneider', null, 'In the last days of World War II, Gauleiter Eigruber ordered the blasting of the salt mine. Stolen art treasures are stored there. The villagers oppose it.', 'In the last days of World War II, Gauleiter Eigruber ordered the blasting of the salt mine. Stolen art treasures are stored there. The villagers oppose it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug1aG6BOc5NejxrTvR8aNsDiLcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530777'),
  ('326294325414149500', 'Ein fast perfekter Antrag', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Marc Rothemund, Ahmet Tan, Jacek Gluszko', 'Richard Kropf', 'Heiner Lauterbach, Iris Berben, Amira Demirkiran, Jonathan Perleth, Julius Forster', null, 'Grumpy widower Walter lives alone with his dog in Regensburg and spends his time writing restaurant reviews on the internet. But when he meets his old childhood sweetheart, art professor Alice, whom he had unsuccessfully proposed to 40 years earlier, his life changes radically once again.', 'Grumpy widower Walter lives alone with his dog in Regensburg and spends his time writing restaurant reviews on the internet. But when he meets his old childhood sweetheart, art professor Alice, whom he had unsuccessfully proposed to 40 years earlier, his life changes radically once again.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2QPOW7J0THyNVwta0GfBmc5v19Y.jpg', 'plex:movie:ein-fast-perfekter-antrag'),
  ('587397535712341366', 'Ein Fest Fürs Leben', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Richard Huber', 'Richard Huber', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Cynthia Micas, Marc Hosemann, Jörg Schüttauf, Johannes Allmayer, Ulrich Brandhoff, Banafshe Hourmazdi, Pit Bukowski', null, 'A fast-paced ensemble comedy about a wedding planner and his thrown-together crew whose meticulously planned celebration gets way out of hand.', 'A fast-paced ensemble comedy about a wedding planner and his thrown-together crew whose meticulously planned celebration gets way out of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKBUH1fY16FFQFqtVJwL9FbklF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159844'),
  ('111297298211474637', 'Ein Geschenk der Götter', 2014, 'Drama', 'Oliver Haffner, Kaspar Kaven', 'Oliver Haffner', 'Katharina M. Schubert, Adam Bousdoukos, Paul Faßnacht, Katharina Hauter, Rainer Furch, Marion Breckwoldt, Maik Solbach, Rick Okon', null, 'Out of the blue, actress Anna loses her job at a small municipal theater. Having just been on stage, she now finds herself in the dreariness of the local job center. At the insistence of her theater-enthusiastic caseworker, she takes over the management of an acting course for eight long-term unemployed people who are difficult to place. Despite enormous resistance to the compulsory training program, the frustrated lone fighters increasingly form a close-knit group with whom Anna stages Antigone. Surprisingly, the participants'' private dramas become more and more turbulent and Anna also experiences a new beginning that she hadn''t expected.', 'Out of the blue, actress Anna loses her job at a small municipal theater. Having just been on stage, she now finds herself in the dreariness of the local job center. At the insistence of her theater-enthusiastic caseworker, she takes over the management of an acting course for eight long-term unemployed people who are difficult to place. Despite enormous resistance to the compulsory training program, the frustrated lone fighters increasingly form a close-knit group with whom Anna stages Antigone. Surprisingly, the participants'' private dramas become more and more turbulent and Anna also experiences a new beginning that she hadn''t expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEzzTPcC8a7jM9T9GYPNLi40ydO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294484'),
  ('228301512689781920', 'Ein Mord mit Aussicht', 2015, 'Comedy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Jan Schomburg', 'Benjamin Hessler', 'Caroline Peters, Bjarne Mädel, Meike Droste, Petra Kleinert, Johann von Bülow, Nina Proll, Arnd Klawitter, Matthias Matschke', null, 'Sophie Haas and her team are forced to state everything they know about the committed crime in the nearby village.', 'Sophie Haas and her team are forced to state everything they know about the committed crime in the nearby village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CXnDtE97i1U4tS0UxoZBlfo2qM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374868'),
  ('429523191058565999', 'Ein Schnitzel für drei', 2009, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Manfred Stelzer, Tomas Erhart', 'Peter Freiberg, Thomas Koch, Stefan Barth', 'Armin Rohde, Ludger Pistor, Branko Samarovski, Caroline Peters, Therese Hämer, Cristina do Rego, Margit Bendokat, Peter Jordan', null, 'The unemployed salesman Wolfgang practices optimism, his friend Günther realism: The situation is shitty! But then zookeeper Günther finds a few hundred thousand Euros from his demented neighbor. The mates take the money but also the care for the old man.', 'The unemployed salesman Wolfgang practices optimism, his friend Günther realism: The situation is shitty! But then zookeeper Günther finds a few hundred thousand Euros from his demented neighbor. The mates take the money but also the care for the old man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3XugmQuItETkTzaaqVHGzMADAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202183'),
  ('566163978806573571', 'Ein Sommer in der Bretagne', 2022, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Florian Licht, Tina Böckenhauer, Britta Keils', null, 'Kristin Suckow, Karim Cherif, André Jung, Brigitte Zeh, Eric Klotzsch, Katharina Heyer, François Smesny, Nicolas Garin', null, 'Veterinarian Britta has recently separated from her boyfriend and is open to a new beginning, preferably in Brittany, where she spends the summer vacation with a befriend couple. After a rain shower, she unexpectedly stumbles upon her idyllic dream house, only to run over the fisherman Yves with her bike in her blissfulness. Unfortunately, Yves also wants to buy the house that is up for sale in an anonymous bidding process. He and his father can no longer make a living from fishing, and he wants to build up a second source of income in the form of holiday apartments. The empty neighboring house would be ideal for this. At first, Yves finds Britta more annoying than nice. But she gains ground with her fearless and positive nature. When Yves finds out who his opponent in the bidding process is, he tries to badmouth his beautiful home area in presence of the German doctor. Everything would be so much easier if it weren''t for those darn feelings. House or love, that is the question now.', 'Veterinarian Britta has recently separated from her boyfriend and is open to a new beginning, preferably in Brittany, where she spends the summer vacation with a befriend couple. After a rain shower, she unexpectedly stumbles upon her idyllic dream house, only to run over the fisherman Yves with her bike in her blissfulness. Unfortunately, Yves also wants to buy the house that is up for sale in an anonymous bidding process. He and his father can no longer make a living from fishing, and he wants to build up a second source of income in the form of holiday apartments. The empty neighboring house would be ideal for this. At first, Yves finds Britta more annoying than nice. But she gains ground with her fearless and positive nature. When Yves finds out who his opponent in the bidding process is, he tries to badmouth his beautiful home area in presence of the German doctor. Everything would be so much easier if it weren''t for those darn feelings. House or love, that is the question now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62Wr4W5wTe6fPwJJWYEPnCVV9Qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927920'),
  ('487049554090642583', 'Ein Sommer in Italien - WM 1990', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Nadja Kölling, Vanessa Nöcker', 'Nils Suling', 'Jürgen Klinsmann, Thomas Häßler, Guido Buchwald, Franz Beckenbauer, Pierre Littbarski', null, 'Documentary from Nadja Kölling and Vanessa Nöcker about the soccer world championship 1990 in Italy.', 'Documentary from Nadja Kölling and Vanessa Nöcker about the soccer world championship 1990 in Italy.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkJAxNDBp3SdHLtWUagQ5LOlyyWi.jpg', 'plex:movie:ein-sommer-in-italien-wm-1990'),
  ('205808727864938528', 'Ein Sommer in Paris', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jorgo Papavassiliou, Yvonne Tratz', 'Stefan Cantz, Jan Hinter', 'Anica Dobra, Pasquale Aleardi, Liane Forestieri, Peter Fitz, Peggy Lukac, Georg Tryphon, Kai Scheve', null, 'Clara and her boyfriend break up their relationship in Paris. She stays a few days in the city, where he meets a man who offers her work. But, unexpectedly, love again knocking on her door.', 'Clara and her boyfriend break up their relationship in Paris. She stays a few days in the city, where he meets a man who offers her work. But, unexpectedly, love again knocking on her door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NxVSsaKggez8CN0SOilAmCXaXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185065'),
  ('1030515857775682340', 'Eine ganz heiße Nummer', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Markus Goller', 'Andrea Sixt', 'Gisela Schneeberger, Bettina Mittendorfer, Rosalie Thomass, Monika Gruber, Sigi Zimmerschied, Johann Schuler, Cleo Kretschmer, Ferry Öllinger', null, 'When their little supermarket is threatened by bankruptcy, three shop assistants in rural Bavaria start their own phone sex line.', 'When their little supermarket is threatened by bankruptcy, three shop assistants in rural Bavaria start their own phone sex line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbj7W8aVmjX8oUpcEZbTDUfemhs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74894'),
