  ('1130972931109596267', 'Eine Insel namens Udo', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Markus Sehr, Manuel Siebert, Daniela Knapp', 'Clemente Fernandez-Gil, Markus Sehr', 'Kurt Krömer, Fritzi Haberlandt, Bernd Moss, Kari Ketonen, Jan-Gregor Kremp, Maja Beckmann, Hans Martin Stier, Carsten Strauch', null, 'Udo is invisible - no one ever seems to notice him. He makes the most of it, working as a department store detective and living off other people''s lives as they never notice him tagging along. Until he meets the one woman who sees him.', 'Udo is invisible - no one ever seems to notice him. He makes the most of it, working as a department store detective and living off other people''s lives as they never notice him tagging along. Until he meets the one woman who sees him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYpvLZjyr0iHmCkZU5Zprl3AxaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70807'),
  ('808895731544921871', 'Einfach mal was Schönes', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Karoline Herfurth, Daniel Gottschalk', 'Monika Fäßler, Karoline Herfurth, Tim Hebborn', 'Karoline Herfurth, Nora Tschirner, Milena Tscharntke, Ulrike Kriener, Jasmin Shakeri, Aaron Altaras, Herbert Knaup, Kathrin Angerer', null, 'Radio presenter Karla''s biological clock is ticking, and it''s now very loud and clear. But no matter what she does, she simply cannot find a suitable man with whom she could imagine a family.', 'Radio presenter Karla''s biological clock is ticking, and it''s now very loud and clear. But no matter what she does, she simply cannot find a suitable man with whom she could imagine a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ykSaUasOJkR0FUXLH3ksZijnnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982804'),
  ('1142099189504839983', 'Einmal Hallig und zurück', 2015, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Hermine Huntgeburth, Andreas Grimm, Martin Langer', 'Chris Geletneky, Sascha Albrecht', 'Anke Engelke, Charly Hübner, Robert Palfrader, Johanna Bantzer, Anne Müller, Ole Fischer, Dominik Maringer, Dagmar Leesch', null, 'She is always on the lookout for the latest gossip — with her tabloid methods, journalist Fanny accidentally uncovers an economic corruption scandal. To keep her safe, her boss and lover Bernd sends her to a small island in the Wadden Sea. There lives the quirky bird warden Hagen.', 'She is always on the lookout for the latest gossip — with her tabloid methods, journalist Fanny accidentally uncovers an economic corruption scandal. To keep her safe, her boss and lover Bernd sends her to a small island in the Wadden Sea. There lives the quirky bird warden Hagen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vD5cHJtCJzt3UNAEKjHuvyjpoYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369627'),
  ('189266527089202614', 'Einstein and Eddington', 2008, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Philip Martin, Hayden Matthews, Julian Court', 'Peter Moffat', 'Andy Serkis, David Tennant, Richard McCabe, Patrick Kennedy, Rebecca Hall, Jim Broadbent, Jacob Theato, Callum Williams', 'PG-13', 'Brilliant physicist Albert Einstein, and English scientist Arthur Eddington form an unlikely friendship during World War I, which leads to the creation of the relativity theory.', 'Brilliant physicist Albert Einstein, and English scientist Arthur Eddington form an unlikely friendship during World War I, which leads to the creation of the relativity theory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atbER263nDEMBQEb0dnfikN4mgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15044'),
  ('266809344884060666', 'Einstein and Einstein', 2018, 'Drama, Family', 'Cao Baoping, Luo Pan', 'Jiao Huajing', 'Sophie Zhang, Guo Jinglin, Zhi Yitong, Dai Xu, Cao Xiyue', null, 'A 13-year-old girl deals with the issues brought about by her family''s high-priced son.', 'A 13-year-old girl deals with the issues brought about by her family''s high-priced son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oT2Qc0re4F7cWhh5L9Z2ZDMII51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284593'),
  ('992317065768466606', 'Einstein and the Bomb', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Anthony Philipson, Irene Maffei, Andy Pearson', 'Philip Ralph', 'Aidan McArdle, Andrew Havill, Rachel Barry, Helena Westerman, Leo Ashizawa, Jay Lewis Mitchell, Simon Markey, James Musgrave', 'PG-13', 'What happened after Einstein fled Nazi Germany? Using archival footage and his own words, this docudrama dives into the mind of a tortured genius.', 'What happened after Einstein fled Nazi Germany? Using archival footage and his own words, this docudrama dives into the mind of a tortured genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWRKHXKfu2WJGICdVpKZ0jEKsbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168709'),
  ('408778027630709984', 'Eisenstein in Guanajuato', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Greenaway, Carlos Salom, Reinier van Brummelen', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Elmer Bäck, Luis Alberti, José Montini, Cristina Velasco Lozano, Rasmus Slätis, Jakob Öhrman, Sara Juárez, Alaín Vargas', null, 'In 1931, following the success of the film Battleship Potemkin, Soviet filmmaker Sergei Eisenstein travels to the city of Guanajuato, Mexico, to shoot a new film. Freshly rejected by Hollywood, Eisenstein soon falls under Mexico’s spell. Chaperoned by his guide Palomino Cañedo, the director opens up to his suppressed fears as he embraces a new world of sensual pleasures and possibilities that will shape the future of his art.', 'In 1931, following the success of the film Battleship Potemkin, Soviet filmmaker Sergei Eisenstein travels to the city of Guanajuato, Mexico, to shoot a new film. Freshly rejected by Hollywood, Eisenstein soon falls under Mexico’s spell. Chaperoned by his guide Palomino Cañedo, the director opens up to his suppressed fears as he embraces a new world of sensual pleasures and possibilities that will shape the future of his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUB98OAPQ3HVspcTVyQ9At1EuQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121869'),
  ('34539579820353767', 'Eismayer', 2022, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'David Wagner, Serafin Spitzer', 'David Wagner', 'Gerhard Liebmann, Luka Dimic, Julia Koschitz, Anton Noori, Christopher Schärf, Karl Fischer, Lion Tatzber, Joshua Jagersberger', null, 'Vice Lieutenant Eismayer is the most feared trainer and model macho in the Austrian Military and lives as a gay man in secret. When he falls in love with a young, openly gay soldier, his world gets turned upside down.', 'Vice Lieutenant Eismayer is the most feared trainer and model macho in the Austrian Military and lives as a gay man in secret. When he falls in love with a young, openly gay soldier, his world gets turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ev4BO0x9ZWredBp4xqPiKxkHmB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936362'),
