  ('384281324241543479', 'Ek Villain Returns', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Mukesh Chhabra, Sankalp Sadanah, Mohit Suri', 'Mohit Suri, Aseem Arora', 'John Abraham, Arjun Kapoor, Tara Sutaria, Disha Patani, J. D. Chakravarthi, Shaad Randhawa, Karishma Sharma, Ivan Rodrigues', null, 'When a singer goes missing amid a serial killing spree, a cabbie and a businessman''s son cross paths in a twisted tale where good and evil is blurred.', 'When a singer goes missing amid a serial killing spree, a cabbie and a businessman''s son cross paths in a twisted tale where good and evil is blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BqMeSSPaC7spmj4Zl7htiigCkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682401'),
