  ('336928467899717777', 'Ekis', 2025, 'Drama', 'Christian Paolo Lat, Dom Dycaico', 'Lester Caacbay, Christian Paolo Lat, Sigrid Polon', 'Angela Morena, Cheena Dizon, Aliya Raymundo, Astrid Lee, Arnold Reyes, Cess Garcia, Yda Manzano, Ralph Engle', null, 'Erik Matti’s classic Ekis gets a bold reboot with an all-girls ensemble led by Angela Morena, Cheena Dizon, and Aliya Raymundo. A crew of female thugs launches a kidnap-for-ransom plot, but when things go wrong, escaping the chaos becomes impossible.', 'Erik Matti’s classic Ekis gets a bold reboot with an all-girls ensemble led by Angela Morena, Cheena Dizon, and Aliya Raymundo. A crew of female thugs launches a kidnap-for-ransom plot, but when things go wrong, escaping the chaos becomes impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuUvGqqGabV422qzjGWPlhRuvN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1588846'),
  ('74428007503383736', 'Ekk Deewana Tha', 2012, 'Romance', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon, M. S. Prabhu', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon', 'Prateik Smita Patil, Amy Jackson, Tony Kattukaran, Manu Rishi Chadha, Sachin Khedekar, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Ashwin Kakumanu, Ramesh Sippy', null, 'Sachin is an engineering graduate from a middle class Mumbai family, but his passion is for the world of cinema. He is dreaming and planning for a future as a director, when he sees Jessie. It is love at first sight for Sachin. However, Jessie is from a strict Malayali Christian family, and her parents would never approve of their romance. The other problem is Jessie insists that she doesn''t want a romantic relationship, but wants only to be friends. Of all the girls in the world why did Sachin have to fall for Jessie?', 'Sachin is an engineering graduate from a middle class Mumbai family, but his passion is for the world of cinema. He is dreaming and planning for a future as a director, when he sees Jessie. It is love at first sight for Sachin. However, Jessie is from a strict Malayali Christian family, and her parents would never approve of their romance. The other problem is Jessie insists that she doesn''t want a romantic relationship, but wants only to be friends. Of all the girls in the world why did Sachin have to fall for Jessie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0qkcAF6SolWYmTWPzxLLIEeZKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91310'),
  ('1149560575703822775', 'Eklavya: The Royal Guard', 2007, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra, Natarajan Subramaniam', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra, Abhijat Joshi', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Saif Ali Khan, Vidya Balan, Sanjay Dutt, Boman Irani, Jackie Shroff, Jimmy Shergill, Raima Sen', null, 'As the kingdom of Devigarh comes apart at the seams, an aging bodyguard attempts to protect the Royal Family, as well as keep its darkest secrets from ever coming to light.', 'As the kingdom of Devigarh comes apart at the seams, an aging bodyguard attempts to protect the Royal Family, as well as keep its darkest secrets from ever coming to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IdT65RInyPf5Bo5wkqxKMituwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192675'),
  ('289047169946069760', 'Eklo I', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Pradeep Shahi', 'Pradeep Shahi', 'Pradeep Khadka, Kabita Nepali, Vijay Lama, Benisha Hamal, Deeya Pun', null, 'In 2090, the last human survivor lives in Nepal''s mountains. When two astronauts return to Earth, they meet this sole survivor and unravel the mystery of zombies roaming the land, after humanity fled a virus outbreak in 2030.', 'In 2090, the last human survivor lives in Nepal''s mountains. When two astronauts return to Earth, they meet this sole survivor and unravel the mystery of zombies roaming the land, after humanity fled a virus outbreak in 2030.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7ggoG6xBZd5NqAyMR5u1zKHvrPQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:eklo-i'),
  ('963614731470372737', 'Eko', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Dinjith Ayyathan, Bahul Ramesh', 'Bahul Ramesh', 'Sandeep Pradeep, Saurabh Sachdeva, Vineeth Radhakrishnan, Binu Pappu, Narain, Ashokan, Biana Momin, Sim Zhi Fei', 'PG-13', 'In the misty hills of Kaattukunnu, an aging woman and her servant boy struggle to survive the ghosts of the past, as the hunt for Kuriachan — a legendary dog breeder and outlaw — blurs the line between myth, memory, and vengeance, revealing that even in absence, he still rules the hills.', 'In the misty hills of Kaattukunnu, an aging woman and her servant boy struggle to survive the ghosts of the past, as the hunt for Kuriachan — a legendary dog breeder and outlaw — blurs the line between myth, memory, and vengeance, revealing that even in absence, he still rules the hills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXdFEmtqLm8tewIErDJgnbTS9qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070186'),
  ('1000944456733162507', 'Eko Eko Azarak II: Birth of the Wizard', 1996, 'Horror', 'Shimako Sato, Shoei Sudo', 'Shimako Sato', 'Kimika Yoshino, Wataru Shihôdô, Chieko Shiratori, Akira Otani, Hideyo Amamoto, Akira Saito, Takashi Mihashi, Makoto Fujieda', null, 'In Meiji-era Japan, a village of witches and wizards is slaughtered. Years later, an archaeologist discovers a mummy from the village, which reanimates, murders, then possesses his assistant. This evil spirit is now searching for Misa, who is protected by a survivor of the original massacre, known only as Saiga.', 'In Meiji-era Japan, a village of witches and wizards is slaughtered. Years later, an archaeologist discovers a mummy from the village, which reanimates, murders, then possesses his assistant. This evil spirit is now searching for Misa, who is protected by a survivor of the original massacre, known only as Saiga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1ku0CMOsFjduAb2Hpn3mbsgLsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71058'),
  ('1080953428647532875', 'Eko Eko Azarak: Wizard of Darkness', 1995, 'Horror', 'Shimako Sato, Shoei Sudo', 'Junki Takegami', 'Kimika Yoshino, Miho Kanno, Shu-Ma, Naozumi Takahashi, Ryoka Yuzuki, Mio Takaki, Miki Shibata, Juri Maezono', null, 'Misa Kuroi is an adorable high-school girl who arrives at her new school when it is falling under an evil supernatural force. Trying to figure out who''s behind the supernatural attack, Misa also has to deal with assumptions by her fellow classmates that believe she is the one behind it all. Misa and twelve other students are kept late after school hours one day to retake an exam. Then, after sunset, the entire school is deserted, and the students find themselves trapped inside and their teacher no where to be found. One by one, the thirteen students are picked up and disposed of in horrific and graphic fashion. It is up to Misa to try and gain the trust of her fellow students so that she can protect them and stop the evil before it''s too late.', 'Misa Kuroi is an adorable high-school girl who arrives at her new school when it is falling under an evil supernatural force. Trying to figure out who''s behind the supernatural attack, Misa also has to deal with assumptions by her fellow classmates that believe she is the one behind it all. Misa and twelve other students are kept late after school hours one day to retake an exam. Then, after sunset, the entire school is deserted, and the students find themselves trapped inside and their teacher no where to be found. One by one, the thirteen students are picked up and disposed of in horrific and graphic fashion. It is up to Misa to try and gain the trust of her fellow students so that she can protect them and stop the evil before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sES0WaAIocMDt9Wvced9YrZWfJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71057'),
