  ('881400435665741562', 'Él', 1953, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Luis Buñuel, Ignacio Villareal, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Luis Buñuel, Luis Alcoriza', 'Arturo de Córdova, Delia Garcés, Aurora Walker, Carlos Martínez Baena, Manuel Dondé, Rafael Banquells, Fernando Casanova, José Pidal', null, 'Gloria encounters Francisco, a man whose social veneer betrays a truer self burrowed underneath.', 'Gloria encounters Francisco, a man whose social veneer betrays a truer self burrowed underneath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5GjKN0aRxfw043NUsyMkqRNJvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43344'),
