  ('763576088854702872', 'El abuelo tiene un plan', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater, José Luis Pérez Tristán, Manuel Rojas', 'Alfonso Paso', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Isabel Garcés, José Sacristán, Maruja Bustos, Manuel Zarzo, Elvira Quintillá, Guadalupe Muñoz Sampedro, Belinda Corel', null, 'Leandro Cano, grandfather of many grandchildren, coincides in the clinic of Dr. Bolt with Elena, a lady already advanced in years. The doctor makes every effort to make them meet, and thus overcome their feelings of loneliness.', 'Leandro Cano, grandfather of many grandchildren, coincides in the clinic of Dr. Bolt with Elena, a lady already advanced in years. The doctor makes every effort to make them meet, and thus overcome their feelings of loneliness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Awf4JNkA30B5u4FDZmRPcUXnE6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85898'),
  ('381198341681550539', 'El Alamein', 2002, 'Action, Drama', 'Enzo Monteleone, Gianpaolo Rifino, Matteo Albano', 'Enzo Monteleone', 'Paolo Briguglia, Pierfrancesco Favino, Emilio Solfrizzi, Luciano Scarpa, Thomas Trabacchi, Sergio Albelli, Ivan Bacchi, Lorenzo Balducci', 'PG-13', 'War seen through the eyes of Serra, a university student from Palermo who volunteers in 1942 to fight in Africa. He is assigned to the Pavia Division on the southern line in Egypt. Rommel and the Axis forces are bogged down; it''s October, the British prepare an offensive. At first, boredom, heat, hunger, and thirst bedevil the Italians; then the Brits attack, and there''s no luck or heroism in death. Finally, it''s retreat in confusion. Serra, his sergeant Rizzo, and his lieutenant Fiori take a last walk toward home. It''s said that each soldier gets three miracles; when Serra''s are used up, what then?', 'War seen through the eyes of Serra, a university student from Palermo who volunteers in 1942 to fight in Africa. He is assigned to the Pavia Division on the southern line in Egypt. Rommel and the Axis forces are bogged down; it''s October, the British prepare an offensive. At first, boredom, heat, hunger, and thirst bedevil the Italians; then the Brits attack, and there''s no luck or heroism in death. Finally, it''s retreat in confusion. Serra, his sergeant Rizzo, and his lieutenant Fiori take a last walk toward home. It''s said that each soldier gets three miracles; when Serra''s are used up, what then?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yvhXV6RqgYXQYO1vtBTAyY3taZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26495'),
  ('969674357943275687', 'El Albañil', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'José Estrada, Fernando Colín, Rafael Villaseñor Kuri', 'José Estrada', 'Vicente Fernández, Manoella Torres, Dacia González, Alberto Rojas, Orvil Miller, Graciela Lara, Leandro Martínez, Agustín Silva', null, 'Construction worker falls in love with a handicapped woman who aspires to a career as a singer.', 'Construction worker falls in love with a handicapped woman who aspires to a career as a singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUhReYhSSmzCQVWobdXaTiSHrDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371953'),
  ('858612977480203248', 'El alegre divorciado', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater', 'Pedro Pérez Fernández', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Florinda Chico, Norma Lazareno, Fernando Luján, José Ángel Espinosa ''Ferrusquilla'', Pancho Córdova', null, 'Ramón y Socorro, a 50-year-old couple, owners of a tavern, embarks on a long trip to Mexico to attend the wedding of their son, Carlos, with Gloria, the daughter of an important Mexican businessman. Upon arriving in Mexico, Ramón discovers that in this country there is a divorce. Fed up with his wife, he decides to divorce without taking into account that he will soon pay the consequences of this act.', 'Ramón y Socorro, a 50-year-old couple, owners of a tavern, embarks on a long trip to Mexico to attend the wedding of their son, Carlos, with Gloria, the daughter of an important Mexican businessman. Upon arriving in Mexico, Ramón discovers that in this country there is a divorce. Fed up with his wife, he decides to divorce without taking into account that he will soon pay the consequences of this act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aImTFv81XCBfFgloB0vBWPKtIbt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85999'),
  ('688389848155899433', 'El Amarre', 2021, 'Horror', 'Tamae Garateguy', 'Carlos Quintanilla Sakar', 'Vadhir Derbez, Sofía Espinosa, Fabiola Guajardo, Danae Reynaud, Jorge Gallegos', null, 'A woman has a crush with a coworker and makes a ritual to make him fall in love with her, but things got a little out of hand when she messes with forces no one can control.', 'A woman has a crush with a coworker and makes a ritual to make him fall in love with her, but things got a little out of hand when she messes with forces no one can control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfRk3lcBmIicDobV0i5YXktqRgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676840'),
