  ('399695161030436841', 'El Bola', 2000, 'Drama', 'Achero Mañas, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'Achero Mañas, Verónica Fernández', 'Juan José Ballesta, Pablo Galán, Manuel Morón, Alberto Jiménez, Ana Wagener, Nieve de Medina, Gloria Muñoz, Javier Lago', null, 'El Bola is a 12-year-old boy raised in a violent and sordid environment. Embarrassed by his family life, he avoids becoming close to classmates. The arrival of a new boy at school changes his attitude towards his classmates and friendship.', 'El Bola is a 12-year-old boy raised in a violent and sordid environment. Embarrassed by his family life, he avoids becoming close to classmates. The arrival of a new boy at school changes his attitude towards his classmates and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i51PMyfiomYL9dw9zcHc3Z7BpjZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33504'),
  ('1084169799022113687', 'El bolero de Raquel', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Gabriel Figueroa, Mario Llorca', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Paquito Fernández, Manola Saavedra, Flor Silvestre, Daniel Herrera, Leonor Gómez, Mario Sevilla, Alberto Catalá', null, 'The film tells an episode of the life of a kindly hearted bootblack who becomes accidentally the tutor of an orphan but nevertheless spends all his time and effort for the sake of the boy.', 'The film tells an episode of the life of a kindly hearted bootblack who becomes accidentally the tutor of an orphan but nevertheless spends all his time and effort for the sake of the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fllXeoh4eNYQ9PGtpFX3mIuOaAy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40933'),
  ('32892439432626807', 'El bombero atómico', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Jack Draper, Manuel Ortega', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Roberto Soto, Gilberto González, Elisa Quintanilla, Miguel Manzano, Pascual García Peña, Ernesto Finance, Jorge Mondragón', null, 'Cantinflas is a clumsy fireman, who one day receives the visit of his little goddaughter, whose mother recently died in the jungle. After having work in a few fires, Cantinflas decided to quit and become a policeman, because is less dangerous. Everything goes well until a gang of gangsters kidnap the girl, because of a monetary inheritance.', 'Cantinflas is a clumsy fireman, who one day receives the visit of his little goddaughter, whose mother recently died in the jungle. After having work in a few fires, Cantinflas decided to quit and become a policeman, because is less dangerous. Everything goes well until a gang of gangsters kidnap the girl, because of a monetary inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liLlahWhkExi7V21agm2dSKB6aH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40996'),
  ('34863704407446610', 'El bonaerense', 2002, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pablo Trapero, Gabriel Medina, Guillermo Nieto', 'Pablo Trapero, Dodi Shoeuer, Nicolás Gueilburt', 'Jorge Román, Mimí Ardú, Darío Levy, Hugo Anganuzzi, Víctor Hugo Carrizo, Graciana Chironi, Roberto Posse, Luis Vicat', null, 'Zapa is a locksmith in a quiet and little town lost somewhere in the province of Buenos Aires. After getting involved in a crime, his uncle, a retired policeman, bails him out and sends him to Buenos Aires city so he can become an aspiring police officer. Soon he will get involved in a new type of corruption.', 'Zapa is a locksmith in a quiet and little town lost somewhere in the province of Buenos Aires. After getting involved in a crime, his uncle, a retired policeman, bails him out and sends him to Buenos Aires city so he can become an aspiring police officer. Soon he will get involved in a new type of corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeLZROGOpgJZS0HP6vuA9hj01Ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83505'),
  ('382037161463418188', 'El Bulli: Cooking in Progress', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Gereon Wetzel', 'Anna Gnesti Rosell, Gereon Wetzel', 'Ferran Adrià, Oriol Castro, Eduard Xatruch, Eugeni de Diego, Aitor Lozano', null, 'For six months of the year, renowned Spanish chef Ferran Adria closes his restaurant El Bulli -- repeatedly voted the world''s best -- and works with his culinary team to prepare the menu for the next season. An elegant, detailed study of food as avant-garde art, EL BULLI: COOKING IN PROGRESS is a rare inside look at some of the world''s most innovative and exciting cooking; as Adria himself puts it, "the more bewilderment, the better!"', 'For six months of the year, renowned Spanish chef Ferran Adria closes his restaurant El Bulli -- repeatedly voted the world''s best -- and works with his culinary team to prepare the menu for the next season. An elegant, detailed study of food as avant-garde art, EL BULLI: COOKING IN PROGRESS is a rare inside look at some of the world''s most innovative and exciting cooking; as Adria himself puts it, "the more bewilderment, the better!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNGSofFs66xnDyOwfN0WlB7zKUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82688'),
  ('363850093176693413', 'El bulto', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gabriel Retes', 'Gabriela Retes, Lourdes Elizarrarás, Gabriel Retes', 'José Alonso, Gabriel Retes, Héctor Bonilla, Lourdes Elizarrarás, Delia Casanova, Cecilia Camacho, Lucila Balzaretti, Juan Claudio Retes', null, 'After being in a comma for 20 year, Lauro wakes up in a very different Mexico than the one he lived on. Ideas, hopes, ways-of-life and customs have changed, and Mexicans of the nineties are strangers for a man sleeping since 1971. Lauro will have to deal with the changes brought by the History, and will have to accept that the future is never as we imagined it when we were young.', 'After being in a comma for 20 year, Lauro wakes up in a very different Mexico than the one he lived on. Ideas, hopes, ways-of-life and customs have changed, and Mexicans of the nineties are strangers for a man sleeping since 1971. Lauro will have to deal with the changes brought by the History, and will have to accept that the future is never as we imagined it when we were young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdTXniH753Hcq3Um4SkfRYKYuPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145492'),
  ('1017888888335918145', 'El Calentito', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Chus Gutiérrez, Kiko de la Rica', 'Juan Carlos Rubio, Chus Gutiérrez', 'Verónica Sánchez, Macarena Gómez, Juan Sanz, Ruth Díaz, Nuria González, Estíbaliz Gabilondo, Aitor Merino, Lluvia Rojo', null, 'Early 80''s, Sara is a good-family girl, she has never been with a man, does not drinks, does not take drugs. Following her love, she enters in "El Calentito" a bar where the group "las Siux" is singing.', 'Early 80''s, Sara is a good-family girl, she has never been with a man, does not drinks, does not take drugs. Following her love, she enters in "El Calentito" a bar where the group "las Siux" is singing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdYp5AvCfQALUDvJ7kJPyarpg8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24022'),
