  ('1039926133070015066', 'El Cid: The Legend', 2003, 'Adventure, Animation', 'Jose Pozo, Javier Martin Lapeyra, Jose Pozo', 'Jose Pozo', 'Manel Fuentes, Natalia Verbeke, Sancho Gracia, Loles León, Carlos Latre, Miguel Ángel Rodríguez ''El Sevilla'', Manolo García, Sergio Zamora', null, 'Rodrigo''s life as a child was a noble and happy one, he entered school at a young age. Often he went on adventures with his best friend Sancho and often visited his beloved one Jimena, the daughter of the count of Gormaz. His happiness did not last forever, after the death of the King Fernando, Rodrigo is seen wrapped in a world of plots and conspiracies that to will put an end to the life of Sancho and the consequent coronation of the infant Alfonso. All of a sudden, Rodrigo loses all that that he has acquired, his best friend and the love of its beloved one, and is unjustly exiled to Castile without honor!', 'Rodrigo''s life as a child was a noble and happy one, he entered school at a young age. Often he went on adventures with his best friend Sancho and often visited his beloved one Jimena, the daughter of the count of Gormaz. His happiness did not last forever, after the death of the King Fernando, Rodrigo is seen wrapped in a world of plots and conspiracies that to will put an end to the life of Sancho and the consequent coronation of the infant Alfonso. All of a sudden, Rodrigo loses all that that he has acquired, his best friend and the love of its beloved one, and is unjustly exiled to Castile without honor!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOrBX1jyVF1OjbWREGPMDr9KWlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44514'),
  ('657094611194474968', 'El Cinco', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Juan Salvador Ramos, Mariano Turek, Adrián Biniez', 'Adrián Biniez', 'Esteban Lamothe, Julieta Zylberberg, César Bordón, Néstor Guzzini, Luis Martínez, Alfonso Tort, Matias Castelli, Diego Mattioli', null, 'After being expelled for a flagrant foul during a match in Primera C (the fourth division in Argentinian football), Patón Bonasiolle, the captain and midfielder from Talleres de Escalada, realizes his career as a footballer has come to an end. At the age of 35, this means the end of a world he has known since he was a child. Together with Ale - his wife - he looks for a fresh new start.', 'After being expelled for a flagrant foul during a match in Primera C (the fourth division in Argentinian football), Patón Bonasiolle, the captain and midfielder from Talleres de Escalada, realizes his career as a footballer has come to an end. At the age of 35, this means the end of a world he has known since he was a child. Together with Ale - his wife - he looks for a fresh new start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTl2ETMrrycWFSovJG6MAdbl3Dn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285022'),
  ('895768677349283014', 'El circo', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Gloria Lynch, Estanislao Schillinsky, Eduardo Arozamena, Ángel T. Sala, Tito Novaro, Leonid Kinskey, Julio Ahuet', null, 'A cobbler gets a job in a Circus as a janitor, recommended by the beautiful girl rider of the show. But later, he gets in trouble when he involves in dangerous acts, such as the trapeze. Obviously, our friend will risk his life by the love of his new girlfriend.', 'A cobbler gets a job in a Circus as a janitor, recommended by the beautiful girl rider of the show. But later, he gets in trouble when he involves in dangerous acts, such as the trapeze. Obviously, our friend will risk his life by the love of his new girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gNkc5yHfwIqvM4a32YXnUT1aTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82775'),
  ('268281068418447846', 'El club de los buenos infieles', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Lluís Segura', 'Lluís Segura, Sara Alquézar, Ingride Santos Piñol', 'Fele Martínez, Jordi Vilches, Hovik Keuchkerian, Raúl Fernández de Pablo, Eszter Tompa, Juan Manuel Cifuentes, Albert Ribalta', null, 'Four childhood friends, all married with no passion left, get together in a high school reunion dinner. Between laughs and drinks, they all agree that they love their wives but no longer desire them. Together they hatch an illogical project: a secret club for men who want to cheat, so that they themselves can regain lust for their wives.', 'Four childhood friends, all married with no passion left, get together in a high school reunion dinner. Between laughs and drinks, they all agree that they love their wives but no longer desire them. Together they hatch an illogical project: a secret club for men who want to cheat, so that they themselves can regain lust for their wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoFgyW0fzFLb6gVbNyZjmncxFTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441592'),
  ('212118173750813556', 'El Coco 2', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Juan Camilo Pinzón, Sergio Iván Castaño', 'Dago García', 'Carlos "El Mono" Sanchez, Julian Madrid, Pedro González, María Auxilio Vélez, Alexandra Restrepo, Roberto Lozano, Gustavo Villanueva, Tahiana Bueno', null, 'With the arrival of a new and mysterious inmate, known as El Coco, fear grips the place: stormy nights, unexplained deaths, and an atmosphere charged with tension. Desperate authorities turn to a unique group of comical prisoners to uncover the truth. Can they save themselves from this sinister creature?', 'With the arrival of a new and mysterious inmate, known as El Coco, fear grips the place: stormy nights, unexplained deaths, and an atmosphere charged with tension. Desperate authorities turn to a unique group of comical prisoners to uncover the truth. Can they save themselves from this sinister creature?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQkKWGpTlNiHoW3HcrNwUiLnvIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657123'),
