  ('925132560323262252', 'El Diablo', 1990, 'Western, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Peter Markle, Ronald Víctor García', 'John Carpenter, Tommy Lee Wallace, Bill Phillips', 'Anthony Edwards, Louis Gossett Jr., John Glover, Joe Pantoliano, Robert Beltran, M.C. Gainey, Miguel Sandoval, Sarah Trigger', 'PG-13', 'When mild-mannered teacher Billy Ray Smith vows to bring a student''s kidnapper to justice, he needs a bit of help. Lacking any cowboy skills of his own, he signs on a speedy gunslinger and a no-nonsense cowboy to help. Now, Smith may just have a chance at capturing his man: the merciless bandit El Diablo.', 'When mild-mannered teacher Billy Ray Smith vows to bring a student''s kidnapper to justice, he needs a bit of help. Lacking any cowboy skills of his own, he signs on a speedy gunslinger and a no-nonsense cowboy to help. Now, Smith may just have a chance at capturing his man: the merciless bandit El Diablo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYMpGHtlAZPeiMMgtoKPhHESYrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71143'),
  ('755765123871974124', 'El Diablo El Santo Y El Tonto', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rafael Villaseñor Kuri, José Amezquita', 'Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'Vicente Fernández, Sasha Montenegro, Pedro Weber ''Chatanuga'', Martha Ortiz, Felipe Arriaga, Patsy Pepping, Carmelita González, Tito Guillén', null, 'When rancher, Don Trinidad is on his deathbed, he confesses to his fumbling son Rogelio, that he has two other illegitimate sons and that he wishes them to be included in his will. When Rogelio tracks them down, he discovers that each of them has a completely different life.', 'When rancher, Don Trinidad is on his deathbed, he confesses to his fumbling son Rogelio, that he has two other illegitimate sons and that he wishes them to be included in his will. When Rogelio tracks them down, he discovers that each of them has a completely different life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yM8i2Uiq4pxa2m7c0gxi5T2s3KG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423560'),
  ('538304285879025957', 'El diario de una prostituta', 2013, 'Drama', 'Christian González', 'Juan Manuel Soler, Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Alberto Estrella, Sergio Mayer, Armando Araiza, Salvador Pineda, Mariana Ávila, Hugo Stiglitz, Amara Villafuerte, Diana Ramírez', null, 'During a murder investigation, the police uncover a human trafficking network that involves a politician the media is protecting.', 'During a murder investigation, the police uncover a human trafficking network that involves a politician the media is protecting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1fHbiKtKfmcLz52KE7V5qfiqJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676989'),
  ('548860412884874422', 'El diario de una prostituta 2', 2017, 'Drama', 'Iván Cuevas', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Liliana Durazo, Paty Bermúdez, Amara Villafuerte, Jennifer Mosqueira, Ana La Salvia, Ethel Almada, Javier De la Vega, Luis Gatica', null, 'Two university students try to make a documentary about a prostitute and her origins, but they enter an unknown world where sex, drugs and death are the daily bread.', 'Two university students try to make a documentary about a prostitute and her origins, but they enter an unknown world where sex, drugs and death are the daily bread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isVUH35o5xl81YPC2bUdj5i8652.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:815767'),
  ('801493157629883089', 'El diario íntimo de una cabaretera', 1989, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Juan Manuel Soler Palavicini, Adolfo Martínez Solares, Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Angélica Chain, Hugo Stiglitz, Pedro Infante Jr., Lina Santos, Jeannette Mass, Jacaranda Alfaro, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Lorena Herrera', null, 'Martha is a single woman who becomes pregnant and commits suicide after giving birth to a pair of twins, Jessica and Angelica, who are adopted separately. Years later, Angelica becomes a lawyer working for the mafia. Jessica, who was adopted by a prostitute, has become a criminal and is now arrested for the murder of her husband. In prison she tries to be friends with the director without success and she has to pay her sentence.', 'Martha is a single woman who becomes pregnant and commits suicide after giving birth to a pair of twins, Jessica and Angelica, who are adopted separately. Years later, Angelica becomes a lawyer working for the mafia. Jessica, who was adopted by a prostitute, has become a criminal and is now arrested for the murder of her husband. In prison she tries to be friends with the director without success and she has to pay her sentence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mhZQ96JJ5vutgCpY0IDTIzyC8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673892'),
  ('913123693125011114', 'El dinero no cae del cielo - El aerolito', 2015, 'Drama', 'Iván Cuevas', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Alejandro Camacho, Roberto Ballesteros, Isabella Camil, Hugo Stiglitz, Mario Zaragoza, Alan Ciangherotti, Pascacio López, Mercedes Regina', null, 'Three ranchers discover the burial of some drug traffickers in the region. Without giving it much thought, they decide to dig it up and keep it, causing them unimaginable trouble.', 'Three ranchers discover the burial of some drug traffickers in the region. Without giving it much thought, they decide to dig it up and keep it, causing them unimaginable trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eRdHkpYZMgHc6Bo55TwVypnndU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841093'),
  ('610356722639600241', 'El disputado voto del señor Cayo', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Giménez-Rico, Kuki López Rodero', 'Manolo Matji, Antonio Giménez-Rico', 'Francisco Rabal, Iñaki Miramón, Juan Luis Galiardo, Lydia Bosch, Eusebio Lázaro', null, 'Based on Miguel Delibes novel. Rafael Corral, socialist member, decide to attend to the funeral of a friend although they had recomended him not to go for politic reasons. He finds there some friends and talking with them makes him to change his mind.', 'Based on Miguel Delibes novel. Rafael Corral, socialist member, decide to attend to the funeral of a friend although they had recomended him not to go for politic reasons. He finds there some friends and talking with them makes him to change his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gN5xkj8PSUJNiTf7mxksSzhr1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99766'),
  ('1104147072334547722', 'El dolor de pagar la renta', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Agustín P. Delgado', null, 'Gaspar Henaine, Marco Antonio Campos, Cesáreo Quezadas ''Pulgarcito'', Norma Lazareno', null, 'Viruta and Capulina are about to be evicted from the neighborhood where they live for not paying rent for eleven months. After several troubles with the police and the building owner, it is clarified that Capulina had saved the money to pay for the operation of a child that lives in the building. After all, the doctor operates the child for free, the neighbors celebrate with a big party and the building owner forgives them all the income.', 'Viruta and Capulina are about to be evicted from the neighborhood where they live for not paying rent for eleven months. After several troubles with the police and the building owner, it is clarified that Capulina had saved the money to pay for the operation of a child that lives in the building. After all, the doctor operates the child for free, the neighbors celebrate with a big party and the building owner forgives them all the income.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqUX3oUOYh3t6htS75poSnIu4I8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79099'),
  ('134237873136960619', 'El donante', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Ramón Fernández, José García Galisteo', 'Ramón Fernández', 'Andrés Pajares, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Silvia Marsó, Alfonso del Real, Luis Barbero, Josele Román, Emma Ozores, Gracita Morales', null, 'Tato Montini (Andrés Pajares), a popular radio show host and ladies man, agrees to donate his penis for a transplant after his death. He dies, goes to Heaven and discovers that even in afterlife he would have still needed his penis.', 'Tato Montini (Andrés Pajares), a popular radio show host and ladies man, agrees to donate his penis for a transplant after his death. He dies, goes to Heaven and discovers that even in afterlife he would have still needed his penis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXBX4gjSkQNfz1S3HOvlqSM6VcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134218'),
  ('1108154641408104426', 'El Dorado', 1921, 'Drama', 'Marcel L''Herbier, Georges Lucas, Georges Specht', 'Marcel L''Herbier', 'Ève Francis, Jaque Catelain, Marcelle Pradot, Philippe Hériat, Claire Prélia, Georges Paulais, Édith Réal, Max Dhartigny', null, 'In Granada in Spain, Sibilla works as a dancer in a squalid cabaret called El Dorado, struggling to earn enough to care for her sick child. The boy''s father Estiria, a prominent citizen, refuses them both help and recognition, fearful of jeopardising the engagement of his adult daughter Iliana to a wealthy nobleman. Iliana however slips away from her engagement party to meet her real lover Hedwick, a Swedish painter. Sibilla, in desperation after a further rejection by Estiria, sees an opportunity to blackmail him by locking the lovers overnight in their meeting-place in the Alhambra.', 'In Granada in Spain, Sibilla works as a dancer in a squalid cabaret called El Dorado, struggling to earn enough to care for her sick child. The boy''s father Estiria, a prominent citizen, refuses them both help and recognition, fearful of jeopardising the engagement of his adult daughter Iliana to a wealthy nobleman. Iliana however slips away from her engagement party to meet her real lover Hedwick, a Swedish painter. Sibilla, in desperation after a further rejection by Estiria, sees an opportunity to blackmail him by locking the lovers overnight in their meeting-place in the Alhambra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21UFgss2aXyejijtYhQQD948yF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94474'),
  ('1001737551297176327', 'El Dorado', 1966, 'Western', 'Howard Hawks, Harold Rosson, Andrew J. Durkus', 'Leigh Brackett', 'John Wayne, Robert Mitchum, James Caan, Charlene Holt, Paul Fix, Arthur Hunnicutt, Michele Carey, R.G. Armstrong', 'G', 'Cole Thornton, a gunfighter for hire, joins forces with an old friend, Sheriff J.P. Harrah. Together with a fighter and a gambler, they help a rancher and his family fight a rival rancher that is trying to steal their water.', 'Cole Thornton, a gunfighter for hire, joins forces with an old friend, Sheriff J.P. Harrah. Together with a fighter and a gambler, they help a rancher and his family fight a rival rancher that is trying to steal their water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poJxkMtTA3E95lJ6RnBgNxF0Vmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6644'),
  ('693164742056072868', 'El Dorado', 1988, 'Adventure, History, Drama', 'Teo Escamilla, Carlos Saura', 'Carlos Saura', 'Omero Antonutti, Lambert Wilson, Eusebio Poncela, Inés Sastre, Gabriela Roel, José Sancho, Féodor Atkine, Patxi Bisquert', null, 'The story of an expedition down the Orinoco and Amazon rivers in 1560 by Spanish soldiers searching for the fabled city of gold, El Dorado.', 'The story of an expedition down the Orinoco and Amazon rivers in 1560 by Spanish soldiers searching for the fabled city of gold, El Dorado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1Msl7LnDlKfoI7K3NcJlHchGGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52998'),
  ('138335839141465044', 'El Embustero', 1984, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Rafael Villaseñor Kuri', 'Rafael García Travesí', 'Vicente Fernández, Patricia Rivera, María Sorté, Miguel Ángel Rodríguez, Jorge Fegán, Rafael Fernández, Carlos Riquelme', null, 'In order to remain unnoticed in the eyes of justice, a clever rogue poses as a generous teacher at a small town school.', 'In order to remain unnoticed in the eyes of justice, a clever rogue poses as a generous teacher at a small town school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45SzUe1WLZ9hqYpGR6QlLUG271K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539067'),
  ('1140622078476094684', 'El enamorado', 1952, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Western', 'Miguel Zacarías, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Miguel Zacarías', 'Pedro Infante, Sara Montiel, Eulalio González, Armando Silvestre, Florencio Castelló, José Pulido, Ángel Infante, Irma Dorantes', null, 'Martin retired from his job as a hero because of his marriage to Rosario, a beautiful and ambitious girl who passed through the workshop where he works. However, Martin has to return in principle to help a friend from robbers.', 'Martin retired from his job as a hero because of his marriage to Rosario, a beautiful and ambitious girl who passed through the workshop where he works. However, Martin has to return in principle to help a friend from robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO1gfLyGakrjFSsGyUqTDqswQhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108275'),
  ('770075844686954140', 'El encanto', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ezequiel Tronconi, Juan Sasiaín, Eric Elizondo', 'Juan Sasiaín, Ezequiel Tronconi', 'Ezequiel Tronconi, Mónica Antonópulos, Yamila Saud, Michel Noher, Lucas Crespi, Andrea Frigerio, Boy Olmi, Juan Sasiaín', null, 'Bruno is thirty years old and has a girlfriend, Juliana, with whom he is about to celebrate a decade of love.He loves her, but feels that she no longer captivates him. She wants to be a mother. He doesn''t know if he wants to take that step. He fears it could be a mistake, perhaps Juliana is not the woman of his life or perhaps it is too soon. To make matters worse, he is attracted to Lara, his new sexy and young employee. Further confused, Bruno only finds comfort in the company of his father and his old bass. This confusion pushes Bruno to reunite with an old love: music.', 'Bruno is thirty years old and has a girlfriend, Juliana, with whom he is about to celebrate a decade of love.He loves her, but feels that she no longer captivates him. She wants to be a mother. He doesn''t know if he wants to take that step. He fears it could be a mistake, perhaps Juliana is not the woman of his life or perhaps it is too soon. To make matters worse, he is attracted to Lara, his new sexy and young employee. Further confused, Bruno only finds comfort in the company of his father and his old bass. This confusion pushes Bruno to reunite with an old love: music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZMFUQ3iw9ST9e1v0F8qxLwWg0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:703155'),
