  ('839412429628972279', 'El francotirador', 1977, 'Action', 'Carlos Puerto', null, 'Paul Naschy, Blanca Estrada, Pep Munné, Elisa Montés, Carmen de Lirio, José Nieto, Eva León', null, 'Lucas is a widower who works as a clockmaker. He has a daughter who lives in a village in northern Spain. One day his daughter go to school as each morning and he opens his shop. Aafter, a neighbor comes running to tell him that his daughter just died as an unfortunate victim of a terrorist attack that has been perpetrated against the car of a minister on official visit. Shattered, Lucas thinks that this is due to serious political tension that is living that part of the country, making a terrible emotionally unbalanced resolution: life threatening to the Head of State.', 'Lucas is a widower who works as a clockmaker. He has a daughter who lives in a village in northern Spain. One day his daughter go to school as each morning and he opens his shop. Aafter, a neighbor comes running to tell him that his daughter just died as an unfortunate victim of a terrorist attack that has been perpetrated against the car of a minister on official visit. Shattered, Lucas thinks that this is due to serious political tension that is living that part of the country, making a terrible emotionally unbalanced resolution: life threatening to the Head of State.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uklOOpBJzomVW0olKAC0Abk4lwl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104163'),
  ('352655168428056053', 'El Garabato', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares, Keith Holland', 'Victor Leñero', 'Juan Pablo Medina, Tania Robledo, Mariana Ávila, Margarita Sanz, María Rojo, José Alonso, María Aura, Alicia Camps', null, 'The story of a naive young man, provincial and not very experienced, to whom the circumstances of destiny, when crossing with the beautiful Frida, lead him to mature with a single blow. Rodolfo helps Frida in a car accident while she orders him to deliver an envelope. There begins the desperate flight of this innocent man fighting for his life, persecuted by thugs -who want to recover the contents of the envelope- and by the police -who seeks him for being a suspect in the death of an important diplomat.', 'The story of a naive young man, provincial and not very experienced, to whom the circumstances of destiny, when crossing with the beautiful Frida, lead him to mature with a single blow. Rodolfo helps Frida in a car accident while she orders him to deliver an envelope. There begins the desperate flight of this innocent man fighting for his life, persecuted by thugs -who want to recover the contents of the envelope- and by the police -who seeks him for being a suspect in the death of an important diplomat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epll4T5iTGUJS59LkCoXA5iSwp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168578'),
  ('551414227449734635', 'El gato sin botas', 1957, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Fernando Cortés, Enrique L. Morfín, Mario Cisneros', null, 'Germán Valdés, Martha Valdés, Nono Arsu, Wolf Ruvinskis, Marcelo Chávez, José Pidal, Pepe Ruiz Vélez, Julián de Meriche', null, 'Target of ridicule from fellow military academy, the cowardly Augustin did not want to return to their village for fear of confronting his grandfather, a revolutionary colonel. In love with the movie star Laura, Agustin flee to the capital but encounters the dangerous Humberto, another in love with the actress. Thanks to his "nine lives", he attains overcome perilous adventures and, incidentally, overcome their fears.', 'Target of ridicule from fellow military academy, the cowardly Augustin did not want to return to their village for fear of confronting his grandfather, a revolutionary colonel. In love with the movie star Laura, Agustin flee to the capital but encounters the dangerous Humberto, another in love with the actress. Thanks to his "nine lives", he attains overcome perilous adventures and, incidentally, overcome their fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJFmXQOgUzM2501zUHahF118akf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337567'),
