  ('271519175561052837', 'El Lute II: Tomorrow I''ll Be Free', 1988, 'Drama, Crime', 'Vicente Aranda, José Luis Alcaine', 'Eleuterio Sánchez', 'Imanol Arias, Jorge Sanz, Pastora Vega, Ángel Pardo, Silvia Rodríguez, Montserrat Tey, Margarita Calahorra, Terele Pávez', null, 'This is the story of a man fighting with all his might for his life and his freedom. Eleuterio (”El Lute”) embarks upon an action-packed future, fuelled by the notions of freedom and dreams of living just as his countrymen, ever-growing in his mind. Nothing and no-one can stop him. After escaping the Puerto de Santa María prison, the reunion with his family is just the beginning of what will become an endless escape.', 'This is the story of a man fighting with all his might for his life and his freedom. Eleuterio (”El Lute”) embarks upon an action-packed future, fuelled by the notions of freedom and dreams of living just as his countrymen, ever-growing in his mind. Nothing and no-one can stop him. After escaping the Puerto de Santa María prison, the reunion with his family is just the beginning of what will become an endless escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNLpsvvfrxQ924cpGFguN5ejTH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115695'),
