  ('100251250118908500', 'El Mal', 2026, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa', 'Natalia Tena, Belén Fabra, Tony Dalton', null, '“El mal is basically a suspense story, where the audience senses that something disturbing is going to happen, but doesn''t know how or when. But it also aims to get the viewer to question their own certainties, their capacity to love and to accept their own dark side.”', '“El mal is basically a suspense story, where the audience senses that something disturbing is going to happen, but doesn''t know how or when. But it also aims to get the viewer to question their own certainties, their capacity to love and to accept their own dark side.”', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfZWqXuy6UAgnc9ySFyZhXaB2DoR.jpg', 'plex:movie:el-mal-2026'),
