  ('93818804082423986', 'El Materdor', 2008, 'Animation', 'John Lasseter, Victor Navone, Rob Gibbs', null, 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, Lindsey Collins, Elissa Knight, Peter Sohn, Bob Peterson, Bob Scott, Bret Parker', null, 'Mater is a matador fighting a herd of bulldozers in Spain. When Lightning McQueen enters the story, the bulldozers begin to chase him due to his red paint.', 'Mater is a matador fighting a herd of bulldozers in Spain. When Lightning McQueen enters the story, the bulldozers begin to chase him due to his red paint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sW4IdZHsUOi6I4hAYtR92aeHUsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39030'),
  ('795462366415425111', 'El Miedo No Anda En Burro', 1973, 'Horror, Comedy, Family', 'Fernando Cortés, Fernando Colín', 'Fernando Galiana', 'María Elena Velasco, Fernando Luján, Óscar Ortiz de Pinedo, Eleazar García, Emma Roldán, Gloria Mayo, Alfredo Wally Barrón, Antonio Bravo', null, 'This funny Mexican film tell the tale of a family who will do anything to get rid of the rich old lady who sits at the head of the clan. All the hilarious members want a piece of the very lucrative inheritance money. What they don''t know, however, is that grandma has left all of the money to her trusty dog.', 'This funny Mexican film tell the tale of a family who will do anything to get rid of the rich old lady who sits at the head of the clan. All the hilarious members want a piece of the very lucrative inheritance money. What they don''t know, however, is that grandma has left all of the money to her trusty dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9b0UOkT54igBL8cOqFqNhblCaFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73696'),
  ('397751069256152010', 'El mil amores', 1954, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Rogelio A. González, Julio Cahero, Rosalío Solano', 'Ernesto Cortázar', 'Pedro Infante, Rosita Quintana, Joaquín Pardavé, Liliana Durán, Anita Blanch, Martha Alicia Rivas, Fernando Luján, Ethel Carrillo', null, 'Carmen has a daughter, Patricia, who attends a school for young ladies where they think Carmen is married to a sailor. Viviano is a friend of Carmen and when she needs it, he poses as the father of Patricia and she believes is her father. Actually, Viviano is engaged with Marilu', 'Carmen has a daughter, Patricia, who attends a school for young ladies where they think Carmen is married to a sailor. Viviano is a friend of Carmen and when she needs it, he poses as the father of Patricia and she believes is her father. Actually, Viviano is engaged with Marilu', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wz6WQ4QBsfvNAPhIZMNUJhyFs2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343288'),
  ('699890324092750634', 'El mil usos', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Javier Durán, Roberto G. Rivera', 'Ricardo Garibay', 'Héctor Suárez, Rafael Inclán, Roberto Cañedo, Isabela Corona, Miguel Manzano, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, José Carlos Ruiz, Alberto Rojas', null, 'The tragic adventures of a illiterate man named "Milusos" who leaves his family & hometown to go to the big city and try to better his luck. And finds he''s unprepared for what he encounters.', 'The tragic adventures of a illiterate man named "Milusos" who leaves his family & hometown to go to the big city and try to better his luck. And finds he''s unprepared for what he encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jICa2XNK79P0ylbsqe6jYju4br.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337667'),
