  ('556940661350315974', 'El moro de Cumpas', 1977, 'Comedy, Western', 'Mario Hernández, Agustín Lara Alvarado', 'Mario Hernández', 'Antonio Aguilar, Flor Silvestre, Jaime Fernández, Gerardo Reyes, Eleazar García, Alicia Encinas, Bruno Rey, Rubén Aguirre', null, 'In the city of Aguaprieta, two horses are part of the largest event in the region. The unbeatable horse Moro from the city of Cumpas faces the imposing Zaino de Aguaprieta. Two in a decided race in just 450 rods.', 'In the city of Aguaprieta, two horses are part of the largest event in the region. The unbeatable horse Moro from the city of Cumpas faces the imposing Zaino de Aguaprieta. Two in a decided race in just 450 rods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7g6Wi122KvtBSbhMDsNQvITUqu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108290'),
