  ('425380909177666762', 'El pacto', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Fernando Colomo', 'Santos Mercero', 'Diana Gómez, Marina Salas, Victoria Luengo, Macarena García, Denise Maestre, Georgina Latre, Sergio Mur', null, 'TV Miniseries of 2 episodes. "El pacto" tells the unusual and controversial story, inspired by a real case happened in the U.S., seven girls, Rebeca, Mará, Ana, Bea, Vivi, Merche and Carol seven teenage friends and students of 4th year of the same class one day decide to take a surprising decision: to become pregnant at the same time. After achieving his goal, it creates a stir in the school where they study and the girls become the focus of the small seaside town in which they reside. Soon after, the remarkable fact is investigated by their parents and teachers, as well as the media to discover the motivations behind this group of adolescents to carry out the unusual pact.', 'TV Miniseries of 2 episodes. "El pacto" tells the unusual and controversial story, inspired by a real case happened in the U.S., seven girls, Rebeca, Mará, Ana, Bea, Vivi, Merche and Carol seven teenage friends and students of 4th year of the same class one day decide to take a surprising decision: to become pregnant at the same time. After achieving his goal, it creates a stir in the school where they study and the girls become the focus of the small seaside town in which they reside. Soon after, the remarkable fact is investigated by their parents and teachers, as well as the media to discover the motivations behind this group of adolescents to carry out the unusual pact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3lvZNoWHHs99ehpxlGzw9exF4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223416'),
  ('1041268527153263696', 'El padre de la criatura', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater', 'Vicente Coello, Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Florinda Chico, José Sacristán, Rafaela Aparicio, Antonio Ferrandis, Mirta Miller, Mary Paz Pondal, Rafael López Somoza', null, 'Eduardo and Antonia are a mature couple excited about their daughter expecting their first grandchild. But life will change completely when some laboratory tests confirm that it is Antonia who is pregnant and not her daughter. This unexpected situation strongly influences the character of Eduardo, who begins to live what he calls a "second youth".', 'Eduardo and Antonia are a mature couple excited about their daughter expecting their first grandchild. But life will change completely when some laboratory tests confirm that it is Antonia who is pregnant and not her daughter. This unexpected situation strongly influences the character of Eduardo, who begins to live what he calls a "second youth".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diKTvaqrKwN8wUE5Sp98CAes0eI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80482'),
  ('60067285699764947', 'El padre Manolo', 1967, 'Comedy, Music', 'Ramón Torrado, Francisco Fraile', 'Manuel Tamayo Castro', 'Manolo Escobar, Ángel de Andrés, Francisco Piquer, Laly Soldevila, Eva Miller, Miguel Ligero, Mariano Vidal Molina, José Luis Lespe', null, 'Padre Manolo, priest, magician and singer, starts a private investigation on what seems to be a murder...', 'Padre Manolo, priest, magician and singer, starts a private investigation on what seems to be a murder...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptzs9sfG2HzWlpeGoaf3Fe9ZFhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374621'),
  ('581553637219230185', 'El padrecito', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Rosalío Solano, Moises M. Delgado', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Ángel Garasa, Angelines Fernández, José Elías Moreno, Rosa María Vázquez, Rogelio Guerra, Florencio Castelló, Jorge Russek', null, 'Young priest Father Sebastián is assigned to a parish in San Jeronimo el Alto, where he is not welcomed by the community, particularly the resident priest Father Damián. The newcomer gradually earns the trust of the people through humor, but firmly captures their hearts by saving the town fiesta by fighting a bull when the hired torero failed to show. Father Sebastián counsels the townspeople, lecturing them on their duties in a modern society. He used the collection plate to redistribute the town''s wealth more evenly.', 'Young priest Father Sebastián is assigned to a parish in San Jeronimo el Alto, where he is not welcomed by the community, particularly the resident priest Father Damián. The newcomer gradually earns the trust of the people through humor, but firmly captures their hearts by saving the town fiesta by fighting a bull when the hired torero failed to show. Father Sebastián counsels the townspeople, lecturing them on their duties in a modern society. He used the collection plate to redistribute the town''s wealth more evenly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCIuNHBYve2GHWYYI7d2DkhEntG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41308'),
  ('281154950430778783', 'El padrino: The Latin Godfather', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Damian Chapa', 'Aaron pugliese, Carlton Holder, Troy Barker', 'Damian Chapa, Sal Lopez, Emilio Rivera, Jennifer Tilly, Faye Dunaway, Joanna Pacula, Ismael ''East'' Carlo, Robert Wagner', 'R', 'In the streets of East Los Angeles, Manny is a formidable drug dealer. Impressed by his extravagant lifestyle and prowess, his young son, Kilo, yearns to follow in his footsteps. Kilo resolves to learn how to prosper in the drug world, and his new life as a dealer begins. In a world where a man wants everything, he may end up with nothing.', 'In the streets of East Los Angeles, Manny is a formidable drug dealer. Impressed by his extravagant lifestyle and prowess, his young son, Kilo, yearns to follow in his footsteps. Kilo resolves to learn how to prosper in the drug world, and his new life as a dealer begins. In a world where a man wants everything, he may end up with nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10J7EQ8WvMYku8lcZrLewV2Ko4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79026'),
  ('964333495983716813', 'El Paletero', 2016, 'Drama, Action', 'Michael Bendeck', 'Elizabeth Figueroa', 'Jorge Servellón, Paul Hughes Polache, Edgar Flores, Glenn Suárez, Katherine Cruz, Blanca Enamorado, Rafael David, Ana Posadas', null, 'After the tragic death of his mother, Carlos "El Paletero" won''t have a choice but to take justice into his own hands. His destination is a far away town. His mission is to recover his mother''s ashes. The means in which he will be fulfilling his goal don''t matter, what matters is that nothing is left in impunity. El Paletero is a Honduran western that promises justice.', 'After the tragic death of his mother, Carlos "El Paletero" won''t have a choice but to take justice into his own hands. His destination is a far away town. His mission is to recover his mother''s ashes. The means in which he will be fulfilling his goal don''t matter, what matters is that nothing is left in impunity. El Paletero is a Honduran western that promises justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLAS4FUfmskwJwIoFs23U3tEpnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415855'),
  ('1061476940679289383', 'El Papelerito', 1951, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Agustín P. Delgado, Moises M. Delgado', 'José G. Cruz', 'Sara García, Domingo Soler, Jaime Jiménez Pons, Jaime Calpe, Ismael Pérez ''Poncianito'', Amanda del Llano, Eduardo Noriega, Gloria Alonso', null, 'Three children forge a close friendship with the help of a gentle elderly woman, Doña Dominga. They survive poverty and social exclusion; however, fate has a cruel twist in store for little Toño.', 'Three children forge a close friendship with the help of a gentle elderly woman, Doña Dominga. They survive poverty and social exclusion; however, fate has a cruel twist in store for little Toño.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJg9eLcNFu3DDqD0xuPH1IjVsmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73466'),
  ('187534061721531082', 'El Paso', 1949, 'Western', 'Ellis W. Carter, Howard Pine, Lewis R. Foster', 'Lewis R. Foster', 'John Payne, Gail Russell, Sterling Hayden, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Dick Foran, Eduardo Noriega, Henry Hull, Mary Beth Hughes', 'NR', 'Ex-confederate officer Clay Fletcher jumps at the chance to reunite with his once lady-friend, Susan Jeffers, when his father, Judge Fletcher, sends him on an errand to El Paso, Texas to get the signature of Susan''s father, Judge Jeffers, on a legal document. Once there he finds the judge has become a drunk and a laughing stock, doing the bidding of local magnate Bert Donner and his running dog, Sheriff La Farge. Just as Clay starts straightening out the town''s problems, events occur which force him to abandon the legal system and instead adopt the murderous tactics of a vigilante.', 'Ex-confederate officer Clay Fletcher jumps at the chance to reunite with his once lady-friend, Susan Jeffers, when his father, Judge Fletcher, sends him on an errand to El Paso, Texas to get the signature of Susan''s father, Judge Jeffers, on a legal document. Once there he finds the judge has become a drunk and a laughing stock, doing the bidding of local magnate Bert Donner and his running dog, Sheriff La Farge. Just as Clay starts straightening out the town''s problems, events occur which force him to abandon the legal system and instead adopt the murderous tactics of a vigilante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhawsfZUMwLT1I2t4rRAs5pzO9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179272'),
  ('344324662132025251', 'El patrullero 777', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Rosalío Solano, Américo Fernández', 'Isaac Díaz Araiza', 'Cantinflas, Ana Bertha Lepe, Valeria Pani, Wolf Ruvinskis, Ramón Menéndez, Carlos Riquelme, Rosángela Balbó, María Montaño', null, 'Follows Diogenes as he goes about his day as a police officer. He''s prone to do things the right way, surrounded by a pretty much corrupt &amp; citizen distant police department, &amp; always resolves his duties with a personal method.', 'Follows Diogenes as he goes about his day as a police officer. He''s prone to do things the right way, surrounded by a pretty much corrupt &amp; citizen distant police department, &amp; always resolves his duties with a personal method.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jECUhQGo1OD4CMwN60oDiH7yzIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41298'),
