  ('662030747657257672', 'Eldorado', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bouli Lanners, Jean-Paul De Zaeytijd, Philippe Groff', 'Bouli Lanners', 'Bouli Lanners, Fabrice Adde, Philippe Nahon, Didier Toupy, Françoise Chichéry, Stefan Liberski, Jean-Jacques Rausin, Renaud Rutten', null, 'Yvan finds a burglar in his house. After some consideration, Yvan decides not to call the police and to drop the lad near the nearby city but he ends up giving him a lift home to his parents. Together, they travel through Belgium and meet some extraordinary people and find themselves in ditto situations.', 'Yvan finds a burglar in his house. After some consideration, Yvan decides not to call the police and to drop the lad near the nearby city but he ends up giving him a lift home to his parents. Together, they travel through Belgium and meet some extraordinary people and find themselves in ditto situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHRo3ODUGBEiUmQYWG3uRwFUXnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15126'),
  ('1136354213378666030', 'Eldorado: Everything the Nazis Hate', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Felix Leiberg, Christian Huck, Cezary Zacharewicz', 'Benjamin Cantu, Felix Kriegsheim', 'Walter Arlen, Howard Myers, Klaus Mueller, Morgan M. Page, Berno von Cramm, Zavier Nunn, Ben Miller, Katrin Himmler', 'R', 'A glittery nightclub in 1920s Berlin becomes a haven for the queer community in this documentary exploring the freedoms lost amid Hitler’s rise to power.', 'A glittery nightclub in 1920s Berlin becomes a haven for the queer community in this documentary exploring the freedoms lost amid Hitler’s rise to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRxLEqRj1qEqxvfpQLtZKANmqDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1133922'),
  ('794739614179878202', 'Eleanor the Great', 2025, 'Drama', 'Scarlett Johansson, Hélène Louvart, Atena Assiaee', 'Tory Kamen', 'June Squibb, Erin Kellyman, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Jessica Hecht, Rita Zohar, Will Price, Lia Lando, Greg Kaston', 'PG-13', '94-year-old Eleanor Morgenstein tries to rebuild her life after the death of her best friend. As a result, she moves back to New York City after living in Florida for decades.', '94-year-old Eleanor Morgenstein tries to rebuild her life after the death of her best friend. As a result, she moves back to New York City after living in Florida for decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XTM42IJST6lwPxtK2iUwNaFvCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212271'),
  ('189533066196837247', 'Eleanor''s Secret', 2009, 'Animation, Family', 'Dominique Monfery, Richard Mithouard, Quentin Boniface', 'Murielle Canta, Anik Leray, Alexandre Reverend', 'Denis Podalydès, Jeanne Moreau, Julie Gayet, Liliane Rovère, Lorànt Deutsch, Pierre Richard, Chilly Gonzales, Ruy Abitbol', null, 'Natanaël, seven, still doesn''t know how to read. His eccentric old aunt bequeaths her house to his parents and her book collection to the young boy. Nat discovers that the books serve as a shelter for all the heroes found in children''s literature. They are the original characters and are counting on him for protection. For if they leave the library, they will disappear along with their stories forever! When his parents start selling off the books, Nathanaël, who is shrunk by the evil witch Carabosse, braves everything to save his tiny friends', 'Natanaël, seven, still doesn''t know how to read. His eccentric old aunt bequeaths her house to his parents and her book collection to the young boy. Nat discovers that the books serve as a shelter for all the heroes found in children''s literature. They are the original characters and are counting on him for protection. For if they leave the library, they will disappear along with their stories forever! When his parents start selling off the books, Nathanaël, who is shrunk by the evil witch Carabosse, braves everything to save his tiny friends', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qk7goYlLVuioVcDf9lhasjItIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47353'),
  ('1068111417212739609', 'Election', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexander Payne, James Glennon, Randy N. Barbee', 'Alexander Payne, Jim Taylor', 'Matthew Broderick, Reese Witherspoon, Chris Klein, Jessica Campbell, Mark Harelik, Phil Reeves, Molly Hagan, Delaney Driscoll', 'R', 'Tracy Flick is running unopposed for this year’s high school student election. But Jim McAllister has a different plan. Partly to establish a more democratic election, and partly to satisfy some deep personal anger toward Tracy, Jim talks football player Paul Metzler to run for president as well.', 'Tracy Flick is running unopposed for this year’s high school student election. But Jim McAllister has a different plan. Partly to establish a more democratic election, and partly to satisfy some deep personal anger toward Tracy, Jim talks football player Paul Metzler to run for president as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbo0IYzBc32dD5SjFzKIgfp4O4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9451'),
  ('733601807336028019', 'Election', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung, Pad Chan Wai-Hung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Yip Tin-Shing', 'Simon Yam, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Louis Koo, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Lam Suet, Wong Tin-Lam', null, 'After losing an election to become chairman of the Wo Lin Shing triad, a gang leader lashes out and tries to seize the dragon-head baton, the official symbol of a chairman''s authority.', 'After losing an election to become chairman of the Wo Lin Shing triad, a gang leader lashes out and tries to seize the dragon-head baton, the official symbol of a chairman''s authority.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/js9w4pQNJq9si5AlwdvojBfC9Ml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18747'),
