  ('951140697739603438', 'Election Night', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Jens Schlosser', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Ulrich Thomsen, Jens Jørn Spottag, John Martinus, Ole Thestrup, Farshad Kholghi, Hella Joof, Mikkel Vadsholt, Nicolas Bro', null, 'On election night we meet Peter, an idealistic young man, who suddenly discovers he has forgotten to vote. On his way to the polls he encounters a variety of taxi drivers, all racist in their way and Peter has to decide whether to stand up for his convictions or getting to the polls on time. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'On election night we meet Peter, an idealistic young man, who suddenly discovers he has forgotten to vote. On his way to the polls he encounters a variety of taxi drivers, all racist in their way and Peter has to decide whether to stand up for his convictions or getting to the polls on time. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYe91VYoNxSEANwYntIwfl3oLdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93980'),
  ('1046174277794436296', 'Elections Day', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Oleg Fomin, Vasily Sikachinsky, Nikolai Puchkov', 'Leonid Barats, Rostislav Khait, Sergey Petreykov', 'Leonid Barats, Rostislav Khait, Aleksandr Demidov, Kamil Larin, Maksim Vitorgan, Nonna Grishaeva, Elena Knyazeva, Anna Azarova', null, 'The employees of a radio station in Moscow are forced to organize the elections campaign for a future governor in one of Russia districts.', 'The employees of a radio station in Moscow are forced to organize the elections campaign for a future governor in one of Russia districts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QtqntCWyOwUxPQCgEEyxlSV2fr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20963'),
