  ('120608785593810929', 'Electra', 1962, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, Walter Lassally', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Irene Papas, Notis Peryalis, Takis Emmanuel, Manos Katrakis, Giannis Fertis, Aleka Katselli, Theano Ioannidou, Fivos Razi', null, 'Living in exile after the death of their father, the grown children of a murdered and usurped king converge to exact eye-for-an-eye revenge.', 'Living in exile after the death of their father, the grown children of a murdered and usurped king converge to exact eye-for-an-eye revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9wrO7tJqr04YVbXuVeyclf38i9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47447'),
