  ('795762555923049917', 'Electra Glide in Blue', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'James William Guercio, Conrad Hall, Tom Shaw', 'Robert Boris', 'Robert Blake, Billy Green Bush, Jeannine Riley, Elisha Cook Jr., Royal Dano, Mitchell Ryan, Hawk Wolinski, Peter Cetera', 'PG', 'A short Arizona motorcycle cop gets his wish and is promoted to Homicide following the mysterious murder of a hermit. He is forced to confront his illusions about himself and those around him in order to solve the case, eventually returning to solitude in the desert.', 'A short Arizona motorcycle cop gets his wish and is promoted to Homicide following the mysterious murder of a hermit. He is forced to confront his illusions about himself and those around him in order to solve the case, eventually returning to solitude in the desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6813vVr0az8JHSebRULwg3ttX9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26332'),
  ('863360554242785298', 'Electra, My Love', 1974, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Miklós Jancsó, János Kende', 'Gyula Hernádi', 'Mari Törőcsik, György Cserhalmi, József Madaras, Mária Bajcsay, Lajos Balázsovits, Tamás Cseh, Gabi Jobba, Tamás Jordán', null, 'It has been fifteen years since the death of her father, Agamemnon, and Elektra still burns with hatred for Aegisztosz, who conspired with Elektra''s mother to kill him.', 'It has been fifteen years since the death of her father, Agamemnon, and Elektra still burns with hatred for Aegisztosz, who conspired with Elektra''s mother to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dvDFx9R6KWtWEPeTZCq0DfMWbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46772'),
  ('860237473795444882', 'Electric Boogaloo: The Wild, Untold Story of Cannon Films', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Mark Hartley, Garry Richards, Marcus Cobbledick', 'Mark Hartley', 'Molly Ringwald, Dolph Lundgren, Bo Derek, Alex Winter, Richard Chamberlain, Marina Sirtis, Tobe Hooper, Boaz Davidson', 'R', 'A documentary about the rise and fall of the Cannon Film Group, the legendary independent film company helmed by Israeli cousins Menahem Golan and Yoram Globus.', 'A documentary about the rise and fall of the Cannon Film Group, the legendary independent film company helmed by Israeli cousins Menahem Golan and Yoram Globus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MXCjEXZzLXQrgERXb8kRwiSsg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282041'),
  ('1082793263724366092', 'Electric Dragon 80000V', 2001, 'Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy, Music', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Yoshimasa Fujie, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Gakuryu Ishii', 'Tadanobu Asano, Masatoshi Nagase, Masakatsu Funaki, Yoshiki Arizono, Keiichi Ishiyama', null, 'A violent, guitar-playing, electrically charged boxer faces off against an electronic wizard half-merged with a metallic Buddha.', 'A violent, guitar-playing, electrically charged boxer faces off against an electronic wizard half-merged with a metallic Buddha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sD1wwY9CBGrFCQwZFkplHKN66yr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27245'),
  ('159773162250709470', 'Electric Dreams', 1984, 'Romance, Music, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Alex Thomson, Steve Barron, Roger Simons', 'Rusty Lemorande', 'Lenny Von Dohlen, Virginia Madsen, Maxwell Caulfield, Bud Cort, Don Fellows, Alan Polonsky, Wendy Miller, Harry Rabinowitz', 'PG', 'Miles Harding buys a state-of-the-art computer that starts expressing conscious thought and emotion after an interaction with spilled champagne. Things begin getting out of hand when both Miles and Edgar, the computer, fall in love with beautiful neighbor Madeline Robistat.', 'Miles Harding buys a state-of-the-art computer that starts expressing conscious thought and emotion after an interaction with spilled champagne. Things begin getting out of hand when both Miles and Edgar, the computer, fall in love with beautiful neighbor Madeline Robistat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wPmd5UothUkQQ8jqjgQOj1DTc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19596'),
  ('514918868096973338', 'Electric Earthquake', 1942, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Jackson Beck, Julian Noa', null, 'A scientist uses an earthquake machine to threaten the city, and only Superman can stop his extortion plan!', 'A scientist uses an earthquake machine to threaten the city, and only Superman can stop his extortion plan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnwMHCmIHSwnova7Knw7DVlqBQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145967'),
  ('861271400606701801', 'Electric July', 2014, 'Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Sean Singery, Sébastien Jousselin, Rémi Bigot', 'Rémi Bigot, François Peyroux', 'Nathan Bobet, Rémi Chaudière, Sophie Froissard, Florimont Constant', null, 'In the burning heat of July, Thomas and Victor, two 14 years old teenagers, are bored to death and want to escape. Victor decides to take Thomas to an abandoned bridge. He will have to confront his fears and desires.', 'In the burning heat of July, Thomas and Victor, two 14 years old teenagers, are bored to death and want to escape. Victor decides to take Thomas to an abandoned bridge. He will have to confront his fears and desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZsrWV43RpYIPSb7B1VnZd3GFT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429531'),
  ('942385989696142625', 'Electric Light Orchestra: Out of the Blue - Live at Wembley', 1978, 'Music', 'Mike Mansfield', null, 'Jeff Lynne, Bev Bevan, Kelly Groucutt, Mik Kaminski, Richard Tandy, Hugh McDowell, Melvyn Gale, Jake Commander', null, 'In the 1970s, England''s Electric Light Orchestra (aka ELO) was renowned for both its lushly textured prog rock and its ornately orchestrated arena concerts. This program captures the band performing live at London''s Wembley Stadium in support of their OUT OF THE BLUE album in 1978, combining a spectacular light show and special effects with classic tunes such as "Standing in the Rain," "Sweet Talking Woman," "Mr. Blue Sky," and many more.', 'In the 1970s, England''s Electric Light Orchestra (aka ELO) was renowned for both its lushly textured prog rock and its ornately orchestrated arena concerts. This program captures the band performing live at London''s Wembley Stadium in support of their OUT OF THE BLUE album in 1978, combining a spectacular light show and special effects with classic tunes such as "Standing in the Rain," "Sweet Talking Woman," "Mr. Blue Sky," and many more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/480HFHEotGjesCyNTjNe7Pwxh8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80504'),
  ('549697954910801106', 'Electric Shadows', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Jiang Xiao', 'Jiang Xiao, Cheng Qingsong', 'Xia Yu, Jiang Hongbo, Zhongyang Qi, Guan Xiaotong, Wang Zhengjia, Jiang Shan, Zhang Yijing, Li Haibin', null, 'For no apparent reason, a mute young woman assaults a youth who delivers water on his bicycle, injuring him and ruining his bike. Surprisingly, she asks him to feed her fish while she is in custody. Her tiny apartment, he discovers, is a shrine to his favorite escape, the movies.', 'For no apparent reason, a mute young woman assaults a youth who delivers water on his bicycle, injuring him and ruining his bike. Surprisingly, she asks him to feed her fish while she is in custody. Her tiny apartment, he discovers, is a shrine to his favorite escape, the movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chMeruqWmRZNfs3LTGCTHU2ZfqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26137'),
  ('220384367263490736', 'Electric Swan', 2019, 'Drama', 'Konstantina Kotzamani, Roman Kasseroller', 'Konstantina Kotzamani', 'Juan Carlos Aduviri, Nelly Prince, Elisa Massino, Nikita Zuckerberg, Susana Pampín', null, 'Buildings are not supposed to move. But on Avenida Libertador 2050, a building moves and the ceiling shivers, causing a strange nausea that devours its residents. Those who live on the top are afraid they’ll fall, the ones who live beneath are afraid they’ll drown.', 'Buildings are not supposed to move. But on Avenida Libertador 2050, a building moves and the ceiling shivers, causing a strange nausea that devours its residents. Those who live on the top are afraid they’ll fall, the ones who live beneath are afraid they’ll drown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VbVUJABVdhLpfNJZlOifOZEsoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618367'),
  ('423855663959699744', 'Electrick Children', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rebecca Thomas', 'Rebecca Thomas', 'Julia Garner, Rory Culkin, Liam Aiken, Bill Sage, Cynthia Watros, Billy Zane, John Patrick Amedori, Rachel Pirard', 'R', 'Rachel is a rambunctious girl from a polygamist colony in southern Utah. On Rachel’s 15th birthday, she finds a forbidden cassette tape. Having never seen anything like it before, Rachel plays the cassette tape, and finds glorious rock & roll thereupon. Weeks later, Rachel realizes a miracle has occurred - and the cassette tape must have something to do with it. She leaves her family and runs away to the closest city: Las Vegas. There she searches for the singer of the band on the cassette tape.', 'Rachel is a rambunctious girl from a polygamist colony in southern Utah. On Rachel’s 15th birthday, she finds a forbidden cassette tape. Having never seen anything like it before, Rachel plays the cassette tape, and finds glorious rock & roll thereupon. Weeks later, Rachel realizes a miracle has occurred - and the cassette tape must have something to do with it. She leaves her family and runs away to the closest city: Las Vegas. There she searches for the singer of the band on the cassette tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWszypKqAt91GFtRP2HyUP6UdOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89237'),
  ('858438937882810297', 'Electrocuting an Elephant', 1903, 'Documentary', 'Jacob Blair Smith, Edwin S. Porter, Edwin S. Porter', null, 'Carl Goliath, Topsy', null, 'This is a film taken of the execution of Topsy, an elephant employed to help build Luna Park on Coney Island.', 'This is a film taken of the execution of Topsy, an elephant employed to help build Luna Park on Coney Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHvPuoI3T0kTNBHUNLF5AUMLbzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144464'),
