  ('1003181884109992575', 'Electronic Labyrinth: THX 1138 4EB', 1967, 'Science Fiction', 'George Lucas, Nelson E. Harris', 'George Lucas', 'Dan Natchsheim, Joy Carmichael, David Munson, Marvin Bennett, Ralph Stell', null, 'In an underground city in a dystopian future, the protagonist, whose name is "THX 1138 4EB", is shown running through passageways and enclosed spaces. It is soon discovered that THX is escaping his community. The government uses computers and cameras to track down THX and attempt to stop him; however, they fail. He escapes by breaking through a door and runs off into the sunset. The government sends their condolences to YYO 7117, THX''s mate, claiming that THX has destroyed himself. Electronic Labyrinth: THX-1138 4EB is a 1967 science fiction short film written and directed by George Lucas while he attended the University of Southern California''s film school.', 'In an underground city in a dystopian future, the protagonist, whose name is "THX 1138 4EB", is shown running through passageways and enclosed spaces. It is soon discovered that THX is escaping his community. The government uses computers and cameras to track down THX and attempt to stop him; however, they fail. He escapes by breaking through a door and runs off into the sunset. The government sends their condolences to YYO 7117, THX''s mate, claiming that THX has destroyed himself. Electronic Labyrinth: THX-1138 4EB is a 1967 science fiction short film written and directed by George Lucas while he attended the University of Southern California''s film school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGa2sS34Qp2YZXCMg1Y1FzNnOX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140979'),
  ('243547103694579692', 'Elefante', 2011, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Pablo Larcuen', 'Pablo Larcuen', 'Marc Montserrat, Alexandre Novell, Xavier Ortiz, Ann M. Perelló, Constantino Romero, Cristina Rodríguez Torres', null, 'Manuel is stuck in a monotonous job, has only one friend that he cannot stand, and his family despises him. Everything will change when the doctor diagnoses him with a rare disease - Manuel is going to turn into an elephant.', 'Manuel is stuck in a monotonous job, has only one friend that he cannot stand, and his family despises him. Everything will change when the doctor diagnoses him with a rare disease - Manuel is going to turn into an elephant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFpJQHTdmiPuQiJnKZpJRGPgbeK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232759'),
  ('124772812483112722', 'Elegant Beast', 1962, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Noriaki Yuasa, Nobuo Munekawa', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Ayako Wakao, Eiji Funakoshi, Yūko Hamada, Hideo Takamatsu, Manamitsu Kawabata, Yūnosuke Itō, Hisano Yamaoka, Kyū Sazanka', null, 'A greedy, materialistic family attempts to cover-up the embezzlement committed by the son while keeping their other schemes active. They discover there are other, equally conniving players involved.', 'A greedy, materialistic family attempts to cover-up the embezzlement committed by the son while keeping their other schemes active. They discover there are other, equally conniving players involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nJUjLKbrx9OKigQbLe19BMcHEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125253'),
  ('954781991087748328', 'Elegy', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Zoltán Huszárik, János Tóth', 'Zoltán Huszárik', null, null, 'Often called a “film poem” or a “film symphonie” Huszárik’s masterpiece consists of montages of horses from the dawn of time to the modern times from cave paintings to horse races.', 'Often called a “film poem” or a “film symphonie” Huszárik’s masterpiece consists of montages of horses from the dawn of time to the modern times from cave paintings to horse races.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kM4V4NJVEEHSAHJ8aePaM42QDKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111152'),
  ('707451309781690240', 'Elegy', 1985, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yılmaz Güney, Gani Turanlı', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney, Hayati Hamzaoğlu, Bilâl İnci, Yusuf Koç, Sermin Hürmeriç, Nizam Ergüden, Şahin Dilbaz, Atilla Olgaç', null, 'Coban and his four comrades are smugglers who live in the bleak, inaccesable mountains. They are hard, pitiless men like the county they live in, whose daily commerce is in greed, danger, betrayal and murder.', 'Coban and his four comrades are smugglers who live in the bleak, inaccesable mountains. They are hard, pitiless men like the county they live in, whose daily commerce is in greed, danger, betrayal and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4aiWzUW7Ke0w5RkC16CYVMSnX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163855'),
