  ('323792691227540892', 'Elektra', 2005, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Rob Bowman, Bill Roe, Jeremy Stanbridge', 'M. Raven Metzner, Zak Penn, Stuart Zicherman', 'Jennifer Garner, Goran Višnjić, Will Yun Lee, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Terence Stamp, Natassia Malthe, Kirsten Zien, Colin Cunningham', 'PG-13', 'Elektra the warrior survives a near-death experience, becomes an assassin-for-hire, and tries to protect her two latest targets, a single father and his young daughter, from a group of supernatural assassins.', 'Elektra the warrior survives a near-death experience, becomes an assassin-for-hire, and tries to protect her two latest targets, a single father and his young daughter, from a group of supernatural assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC6s6NKHneSrOKyQZnUMb443RKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9947'),
