  ('931175295019258655', 'Elemental', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Romance, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Peter Sohn, Allison Rutland, David Juan Bianchi', 'John Hoberg, Brenda Hsueh, Kat Likkel', 'Leah Lewis, Mamoudou Athie, Ronnie del Carmen, Shila Ommi, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Catherine O''Hara, Mason Wertheimer, Ronobir Lahiri', 'PG', 'In a city where fire, water, land and air residents live together, a fiery young woman and a go-with-the-flow guy will discover something elemental: how much they have in common.', 'In a city where fire, water, land and air residents live together, a fiery young woman and a go-with-the-flow guy will discover something elemental: how much they have in common.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Y1WNkd88JXmGfhtWR7dmDAo1T2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976573'),
  ('1144124446748262737', 'Elementary', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Hélène Angel', 'Hélène Angel, Yann Coridian', 'Sara Forestier, Vincent Elbaz, Albert Cousi, Ghillas Bendjoudi, Guilaine Londez, Olivia Côte, Patrick d''Assumçao, Lucie Desclozeaux', null, 'Florence is a school teacher devoted to her students. When she encounters young Sacha, a child with problems, she will do everything she can to help him, even to the point of neglecting her own children, her own life, and of questioning her vocation. Little by little Florence realizes that learning has no age limit.', 'Florence is a school teacher devoted to her students. When she encounters young Sacha, a child with problems, she will do everything she can to help him, even to the point of neglecting her own children, her own life, and of questioning her vocation. Little by little Florence realizes that learning has no age limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2201MtfCf6DR3TyhF41DkTi4Dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395769'),
  ('1126572793535412023', 'Elena', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Andrey Zvyagintsev, Mikhail Krichman, Andrey Dergachev', 'Oleg Negin, Andrey Zvyagintsev', 'Nadezhda Markina, Aleksey Rozin, Andrey Smirnov, Elena Lyadova, Yaroslav Zhalnin, Aleksey Maslodudov, Yura Borisov, Ivan Mulin', null, 'After suffering from a heart attack, a wealthy elderly Russian man plans to will most of his estate to his estranged daughter, but his titular wife has other plans.', 'After suffering from a heart attack, a wealthy elderly Russian man plans to will most of his estate to his estranged daughter, but his titular wife has other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdSxysKTeE6oTYhtVBF08Nwj2Ir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78182'),
  ('835213412619860067', 'Elena', 2013, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Petra Costa, Janice D''Avila, Will Etchebehere', 'Petra Costa, Carolina Ziskind', 'Li An, Elena Andrade, Petra Costa', null, 'Petra heads to New York in search of her older sister after a long time of being separated. They are both movie actresses and heirs of the wounds of the Brazilian dictatorship. But Petra has only a few clues: home movies, newspaper clippings, a diary...', 'Petra heads to New York in search of her older sister after a long time of being separated. They are both movie actresses and heirs of the wounds of the Brazilian dictatorship. But Petra has only a few clues: home movies, newspaper clippings, a diary...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJ71RMba3A3zAUvxChgXhBOrLRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160859'),
  ('921727898402917333', 'Elena and Her Men', 1956, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jean Renoir, Claude Renoir', 'Jean Serge, Jean Renoir', 'Jean Marais, Ingrid Bergman, Mel Ferrer, Jean Richard, Juliette Gréco, Pierre Bertin, Dora Doll, Frédéric Duvallès', null, 'Set amid the military maneuvers and Quatorze Juillet carnivals of turn-of-the-century France, Jean Renoir’s delirious romantic comedy Elena and her Men stars a radiant Ingrid Bergman as a beautiful, but impoverished, Polish princess who drives men of all stations to fits of desperate love. When Elena elicits the fascination of a famous general, she finds herself at the center of romantic machinations and political scheming, with the hearts of several men—as well as the future of France—in her hands.', 'Set amid the military maneuvers and Quatorze Juillet carnivals of turn-of-the-century France, Jean Renoir’s delirious romantic comedy Elena and her Men stars a radiant Ingrid Bergman as a beautiful, but impoverished, Polish princess who drives men of all stations to fits of desperate love. When Elena elicits the fascination of a famous general, she finds herself at the center of romantic machinations and political scheming, with the hearts of several men—as well as the future of France—in her hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AcorR9braNGWHwXyYa4hI7ufVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53156'),
  ('727908150024419454', 'Elena and the Secret of Avalor', 2016, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Jamie Mitchell', 'Michael G. Stern, Craig Gerber', 'Aimee Carrero, Ariel Winter, Carlos Alazraqui, Yvette Nicole Brown, Darcy Rose Byrnes, Zach Callison, Laura Dickinson, Barbara Dirickson', 'G', 'In the Kingdom of Avalor, Elena takes Naomi up a mountain to show her favorite view of the kingdom. Elena laments to Naomi how she was trapped in the Amulet of Avalor for forty-one years, and then presents to her a broken wand. She tells her that it was Shuriki''s wand and how she would still be trapped in the Amulet if it was not for a brave young Princess: Sofia. Elena then proceeds to tell Naomi the whole story ...', 'In the Kingdom of Avalor, Elena takes Naomi up a mountain to show her favorite view of the kingdom. Elena laments to Naomi how she was trapped in the Amulet of Avalor for forty-one years, and then presents to her a broken wand. She tells her that it was Shuriki''s wand and how she would still be trapped in the Amulet if it was not for a brave young Princess: Sofia. Elena then proceeds to tell Naomi the whole story ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dknXo3Ny4J97eBRs9XKVwQc8fH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427143'),
  ('659590786432143802', 'Elena Knows', 2023, 'Drama', 'Anahí Berneri, Federico Lastra', 'Anahí Berneri, Gabriela Larralde', 'Mercedes Morán, Érica Rivas, Mercedes Scápola, Miranda de la Serna, Marcos Montes, Marcos Ferrante, Mónica Gonzaga, Agustina Muñoz', null, 'As her Parkinson''s disease progresses, a woman leads a relentless investigation into finding those responsible for the sudden death of her daughter.', 'As her Parkinson''s disease progresses, a woman leads a relentless investigation into finding those responsible for the sudden death of her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjAElsEROAhnRLFzob8eqTfvlN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948038'),
  ('382678577386323991', 'Elena Undone', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nicole Conn, Tal Lazar', 'Nicole Conn', 'Necar Zadegan, Thunderbird Dinwiddie, Gary Weeks, Sam Harris, Connor Kramme, Madlyn Hall, Mary Jane Wells, Erin Carufel', 'R', 'The wife of a pastor who preaches against homosexuality embarks on an affair with a female writer.', 'The wife of a pastor who preaches against homosexuality embarks on an affair with a female writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4SDHYqLbYHnq5Lb6XPZPHgBbID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56743'),
  ('576739837028253430', 'Eleni', 1985, 'Drama, History', 'Peter Yates, Billy Williams', 'Steve Tesich', 'Kate Nelligan, John Malkovich, Linda Hunt, Oliver Cotton, Ronald Pickup, Rosalie Crutchley, Glenne Headly, Dimitra Arliss', 'PG', 'Nick is a writer in New York when he gets posted to a bureau in Greece. He has waited 30 years for this. He wants to know why his mother was killed in the civil war years earlier. In a parallel plot line we see Nick as a young boy and his family as they struggle to survive in the occupied Greek hillside. The plot lines converge as Nick''s investigations bring him closer to the answers.', 'Nick is a writer in New York when he gets posted to a bureau in Greece. He has waited 30 years for this. He wants to know why his mother was killed in the civil war years earlier. In a parallel plot line we see Nick as a young boy and his family as they struggle to survive in the occupied Greek hillside. The plot lines converge as Nick''s investigations bring him closer to the answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bXy4qj9FIBAYg6JlNI0AeqOC8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42834'),
  ('1097240725407099944', 'Elephant', 1993, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Alan Clarke, John Ward, Philip Dawson', 'Bernard MacLaverty', 'Gary Walker, Bill Hamilton, Michael Foyle, Danny Small, Robert J. Taylor, Joe Cauley, Noel McGee, Patrick Condren', null, 'A chilling depiction of a series of violent killings during the Troubles in Northern Ireland.', 'A chilling depiction of a series of violent killings during the Troubles in Northern Ireland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEg0CvqHUnybH3CvbqmHhBTSFTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37055'),
  ('456191789371959978', 'Elephant', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harris Savides, Sally Sue Beisel, Kathy Krause', 'Gus Van Sant', 'Alex Frost, Eric Deulen, John Robinson, Elias McConnell, Jordan Taylor, Carrie Finklea, Nicole George, Brittany Mountain', 'R', 'Several ordinary high school students go through their daily routine as two others prepare for something more malevolent.', 'Several ordinary high school students go through their daily routine as two others prepare for something more malevolent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1a4VU9z2hxEvugHMK7VsobB9xTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1807'),
  ('696131700425618128', 'Elephant', 2020, 'Documentary, Family, Adventure', 'Mark Linfield, Vanessa Berlowitz, Alastair Fothergill', 'Mark Linfield, David H. Fowler', 'Meghan, Duchess of Sussex', 'G', 'Disneynature’s Elephant follows African elephant Shani and her spirited son Jomo as their herd make an epic journey hundreds of miles across the vast Kalahari Desert. Led by their great matriarch, Gaia, the family faces brutal heat, dwindling resources and persistent predators, as they follow in their ancestors’ footsteps on a quest to reach a lush, green paradise.', 'Disneynature’s Elephant follows African elephant Shani and her spirited son Jomo as their herd make an epic journey hundreds of miles across the vast Kalahari Desert. Led by their great matriarch, Gaia, the family faces brutal heat, dwindling resources and persistent predators, as they follow in their ancestors’ footsteps on a quest to reach a lush, green paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvRbUiOuqedyDmwToErkp7wuFCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665135'),
  ('206259282356568397', 'Elephant Boy', 1937, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Zoltan Korda, Robert Flaherty, David Flaherty', 'John Collier', 'Sabu, W.E. Holloway, Walter Hudd, Allan Jeayes, Bruce Gordon, D.J. Williams, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Iravatha', 'NR', 'In India, Toomai, a young mahout, helps lead the British on a large expedition to round up wild elephants.', 'In India, Toomai, a young mahout, helps lead the British on a large expedition to round up wild elephants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jacHhCmsnjl8eG5AGluDHE0mDzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43858'),
  ('929730563231977540', 'Elephant Juice', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Adrian Wild, Sam Miller, Sara Desmond', 'Amy Jenkins', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Sean Gallagher, Daniel Lapaine, Daniela Nardini, Mark Strong, Lennie James, Lee Williams, Kimberly Williams-Paisley', null, 'The story of Billy, Will, Jules, Daphne and Dodie, a group of people who prove that there are no secrets between friends. It all comes out in the end.', 'The story of Billy, Will, Jules, Daphne and Dodie, a group of people who prove that there are no secrets between friends. It all comes out in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wx3WxUk5KHwfqonEJkgYwMyXVJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35727'),
  ('688958094797304999', 'Elephant Mother', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Jez Lewis', null, null, null, 'A Thai conservationist takes on the powerful tourist industry to rescue abused elephants.', 'A Thai conservationist takes on the powerful tourist industry to rescue abused elephants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQlwHldPTTr65O5fjcegz3nAdxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1009457'),
  ('595905180433045310', 'Elephant Song', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Charles Binamé, Pierre Gill, Marc Larose', 'Nicolas Billon', 'Bruce Greenwood, Xavier Dolan, Carrie-Anne Moss, Guy Nadon, Colm Feore, Catherine Keener, Gianna Corbisiero, Cindy Sampson', null, 'A psychiatrist is drawn into a complex mind game when he questions a disturbed patient about the disappearance of a colleague.', 'A psychiatrist is drawn into a complex mind game when he questions a disturbed patient about the disappearance of a colleague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz5Lay32YWZ8Mof4dEGizMGhVYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285841'),
  ('830927523971604334', 'Elephant Walk', 1954, 'Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'William Dieterle, Irmin Roberts, Alvin Ganzer', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Peter Finch, Dana Andrews, Abraham Sofaer, Abner Biberman, Noel Drayton, Rosalind Ivan, Barry Bernard', 'NR', 'Colonial tea planter John Wiley (Peter Finch), visiting England at the end of World War II, wins and weds lovely English rose Ruth (Dame Elizabeth Taylor) and takes her home to Elephant Walk, Ceylon, where the local elephants have a grudge against the plantation. Ruth''s delight with the tropical wealth and luxury of her new home is tempered by isolation as the only white woman in the district; her husband''s occasional imperious arrogance; a mutual physical attraction with plantation manager Dick Carver (Dana Andrews), and the hovering, ominous menace of the hostile elephants.', 'Colonial tea planter John Wiley (Peter Finch), visiting England at the end of World War II, wins and weds lovely English rose Ruth (Dame Elizabeth Taylor) and takes her home to Elephant Walk, Ceylon, where the local elephants have a grudge against the plantation. Ruth''s delight with the tropical wealth and luxury of her new home is tempered by isolation as the only white woman in the district; her husband''s occasional imperious arrogance; a mutual physical attraction with plantation manager Dick Carver (Dana Andrews), and the hovering, ominous menace of the hostile elephants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82DMbgX6Mo9eT2oGpbZCHC3wDfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43335'),
  ('63795248841613383', 'Elephant White', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Fantasy, Crime', 'Prachya Pinkaew, Komkrit Chugnum, Simeon Asenov', 'Kevin Bernhardt', 'Kevin Bacon, Djimon Hounsou, Weeraprawat Wongpuapan, Suteerush Channukool, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Byron Gibson, Vithaya Pansringarm, Apichart Chusakul', 'R', 'An assassin is hired by a businessman to avenge the murder of his daughter by white slave traders in Thailand.', 'An assassin is hired by a businessman to avenge the murder of his daughter by white slave traders in Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqriJWWisRhm5XapyuB40D1jqqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57585'),
  ('4188728038221949', 'Elephants and Grass', 2000, 'Drama', 'Derviş Zaim', 'Derviş Zaim', 'Bülent Kayabaş, Ali Sürmeli, Sanem Çelik, Uğur Polat, Haluk Bilginer, Taner Barlas, Taner Birsel, Berke Üzrek', null, 'Elephants and Grass (Turkish: Filler ve Çimen) is a 2001 Turkish drama film, written and directed by Derviş Zaim, about six different stories that merge into a common theme. The film, which went on nationwide general release across Turkey on January 5, 2001, won awards at film festivals in Antalya and Istanbul, including the Golden Orange Behlül Dal Jury Special Award.', 'Elephants and Grass (Turkish: Filler ve Çimen) is a 2001 Turkish drama film, written and directed by Derviş Zaim, about six different stories that merge into a common theme. The film, which went on nationwide general release across Turkey on January 5, 2001, won awards at film festivals in Antalya and Istanbul, including the Golden Orange Behlül Dal Jury Special Award.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGA1sgokdShE2fx063RD3R35tvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232357'),
  ('405569521452753422', 'Elephants Dream', 2006, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Bassam Kurdali', 'Pepijn Zwanenberg', 'Tygo Gernandt, Cas Jansen', 'NR', 'Elephants Dream is the story of two strange characters exploring a capricious and seemingly infinite machine. The elder, Proog, acts as a tour-guide and protector, happily showing off the sights and dangers of the machine to his initially curious but increasingly skeptical protege Emo. As their journey unfolds we discover signs that the machine is not all Proog thinks it is, and his guiding takes on a more desperate aspect. Elephants Dream is a story about communication and fiction, made purposefully open-ended as the world’s first 3D animated “Open movie”. The film itself is released under the Creative Commons license, along with the entirety of the production files used to make it (roughly 7 Gigabytes of data). The software used to make the movie is the free/open source animation suite Blender along with other open source software, thus allowing the movie to be remade, remixed and re-purposed with only a computer and the data on the DVD or download.', 'Elephants Dream is the story of two strange characters exploring a capricious and seemingly infinite machine. The elder, Proog, acts as a tour-guide and protector, happily showing off the sights and dangers of the machine to his initially curious but increasingly skeptical protege Emo. As their journey unfolds we discover signs that the machine is not all Proog thinks it is, and his guiding takes on a more desperate aspect. Elephants Dream is a story about communication and fiction, made purposefully open-ended as the world’s first 3D animated “Open movie”. The film itself is released under the Creative Commons license, along with the entirety of the production files used to make it (roughly 7 Gigabytes of data). The software used to make the movie is the free/open source animation suite Blender along with other open source software, thus allowing the movie to be remade, remixed and re-purposed with only a computer and the data on the DVD or download.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zROtU9TkpZQrOuEaMAp68FOWLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9761'),
  ('448083734456105728', 'Elesin Oba: The King''s Horseman', 2022, 'Drama', 'Biyi Bandele, Lance Gewer', 'Wole Soyinka', 'Odunlade Adekola, Shaffy Bello, Olawale-Brymo Olofooro, Deyemi Okanlawon, Omowunmi Dada, Jide Kosoko, Mark Elderkin, Jenny Stead', null, 'Inspired by true life events, in the Oyo Empire in the 1940''s, Elesin Oba, the king''s chief horseman, succumbs to the lure of beauty and sexual desire on the very evening he is set to die in order to fulfil his lifelong debt of ritual suicide to accompany the dead Alaafin to the realm of the ancestors, he derails from a very important generational and spiritual transaction. This sets in motion a series of catastrophic consequences, in a spell-binding film of emotions, humour, and tragic role reversals that puts ancient beliefs and customs on trial in an ever increasingly post-modern and Western world.', 'Inspired by true life events, in the Oyo Empire in the 1940''s, Elesin Oba, the king''s chief horseman, succumbs to the lure of beauty and sexual desire on the very evening he is set to die in order to fulfil his lifelong debt of ritual suicide to accompany the dead Alaafin to the realm of the ancestors, he derails from a very important generational and spiritual transaction. This sets in motion a series of catastrophic consequences, in a spell-binding film of emotions, humour, and tragic role reversals that puts ancient beliefs and customs on trial in an ever increasingly post-modern and Western world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZvYgbDGIZq8mM4vCBiaVVAdmsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005774'),
  ('989507085342153910', 'Eletrodoméstica', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho, Roberto Santos Filho, Daniel Bandeira', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Magdale Alves, Gabriela Souza, Pedro Bandeira, Jonatas F. Lucena, Camila Van Der Linden, Luis Fonseca, Maria Mont''alverne, Dida Maia', null, 'A middle-class family living in a house filled with superfluous electronic appliances see the arrival of a new item, a 29" TV-set.', 'A middle-class family living in a house filled with superfluous electronic appliances see the arrival of a new item, a 29" TV-set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2ab9ZMz9WcPtUpFsrI6rB0OxFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236881'),
  ('383746415151554669', 'Elevated', 1996, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vincenzo Natali, Derek Rogers', 'Vincenzo Natali, Karen Walton', 'David Hewlett, Vickie Papavs, Bruce McFee', null, 'Ben and Ellen use the elevator in their building when all of a sudden, Hank, the blood covered security man of the building rushes into the elevator, claiming that there is a dangerous alien-like creature in the building.', 'Ben and Ellen use the elevator in their building when all of a sudden, Hank, the blood covered security man of the building rushes into the elevator, claiming that there is a dangerous alien-like creature in the building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHnDfRkgOJdesK0rha5dQcyavK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203618'),
  ('846282177901958774', 'Elevation', 2024, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'George Nolfi, Shelly Johnson, Kevin C. Lang', 'Kenny Ryan, Jacob Roman, John Glenn', 'Anthony Mackie, Morena Baccarin, Maddie Hasson, Danny Boyd Jr., Rachel Nicks, Shauna Earp, Tyler Grey, Drexel Malkoff', 'R', 'Post-apocalyptic survivors find refuge in the Rocky Mountains to hide from giant, insect-like creatures that can''t live above 8,000 feet. However, when one of them needs life-saving supplies, they risk it all to venture into the danger zone.', 'Post-apocalyptic survivors find refuge in the Rocky Mountains to hide from giant, insect-like creatures that can''t live above 8,000 feet. However, when one of them needs life-saving supplies, they risk it all to venture into the danger zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnfc0NJ3BzhJrGJhkkEd6MHBdq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035048'),
  ('810358352243557457', 'Elevator', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Stig Svendsen, Alain Betrancourt', 'Marc Rosenberg', 'Christopher Backus, Anita Briem, John Getz, Shirley Knight, Michael Mercurio, Amanda Pace, Rachel Pace, Devin Ratray', 'NR', 'Nine people are stuck in an elevator. One of them has a ticking bomb that can''t be defused. The other eight will do anything to survive. There is no escape and no promise of rescue. As the tension in the elevator mounts the unthinkable soon becomes the only reasonable solution.', 'Nine people are stuck in an elevator. One of them has a ticking bomb that can''t be defused. The other eight will do anything to survive. There is no escape and no promise of rescue. As the tension in the elevator mounts the unthinkable soon becomes the only reasonable solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1V8G6Lkxhv9ztJuBhXlGxyUp1MF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93394'),
  ('1084385406920623086', 'Elevator Game', 2023, 'Horror', 'Rebekah McKendry, Brad Crawford', 'Travis Seppala', 'Gino Anania, Verity Marks, Alec Carlos, Nazariy Demkowicz, Liam Stewart-Kanigan, Madison MacIsaac, Megan Best, Samantha Halas', 'R', 'Socially awkward teenager Ryan discovers that the night his sister disappeared, she had played ''The Elevator Game'' — a ritual conducted in an elevator in which players attempt to travel to another dimension using a set of rules found online. Ignoring warnings, he resolves to follow and find her.', 'Socially awkward teenager Ryan discovers that the night his sister disappeared, she had played ''The Elevator Game'' — a ritual conducted in an elevator in which players attempt to travel to another dimension using a set of rules found online. Ignoring warnings, he resolves to follow and find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4Zb13jow8RqJkYFgCUSdmzJCWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015303'),
  ('820578729926558616', 'Elevator Girl', 2010, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Bradford May, Maximo Munzi', 'Jennifer Notas Shapiro', 'Lacey Chabert, Ryan Merriman, Hedy Burress, Jonathan Bennett, Patty McCormack, Joey King, Allison McAtee, Sean McGowan', null, 'A smart, uptight attorney and a disorganized yet passionate and creative woman meet in a stuck elevator, and sparks ignite instantly. Will opposites attract, or are they simply passing time before getting off on different floors?', 'A smart, uptight attorney and a disorganized yet passionate and creative woman meet in a stuck elevator, and sparks ignite instantly. Will opposites attract, or are they simply passing time before getting off on different floors?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKFUtpqecNWmofIirG5UDCYaGdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40900'),
