  ('156060508491048722', 'Eleven Days, Eleven Nights', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joe D''Amato, Sean Rainey, Rubina Michettoni', 'Rossella Drudi, Claudio Fragasso', 'Jessica Moore, Joshua McDonald, Mary Sellers, Tom Mojack, David Brandon, Laura Gemser, Richard Barkeley, Barbara Cupisti', null, 'In eleven days time, Michael is due to wed his fiancée Helen. However, a chance meeting with Sarah, a total stranger, threatens to destroy all his plans as he is seduced on the spot and finds himself unable to resist her.', 'In eleven days time, Michael is due to wed his fiancée Helen. However, a chance meeting with Sarah, a total stranger, threatens to destroy all his plans as he is seduced on the spot and finds himself unable to resist her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXmH0Fk9VLx9gjGaRxAKsRnh1mr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125157'),
