  ('550705948320132020', 'Elf', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Jon Favreau, Barbara Wilson, Susie Farris', 'David Berenbaum', 'Will Ferrell, James Caan, Bob Newhart, Ed Asner, Mary Steenburgen, Zooey Deschanel, Daniel Tay, Faizon Love', 'PG', 'When young Buddy falls into Santa''s gift sack on Christmas Eve, he''s transported back to the North Pole and raised as a toy-making elf by Santa''s helpers. But as he grows into adulthood, he can''t shake the nagging feeling that he doesn''t belong. Buddy vows to visit Manhattan and find his real dad, a workaholic.', 'When young Buddy falls into Santa''s gift sack on Christmas Eve, he''s transported back to the North Pole and raised as a toy-making elf by Santa''s helpers. But as he grows into adulthood, he can''t shake the nagging feeling that he doesn''t belong. Buddy vows to visit Manhattan and find his real dad, a workaholic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOleziEempUPu96jkGs0Pj6tKxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10719'),
  ('81955470309321878', 'Elf Me', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Leonardo Mirabilia, Federico Cappabianca, Antonio Silvestre', 'Giovanni Gualdoni, Tommaso Renzoni, Marcello Cavalli', 'Lillo Petrolo, Anna Foglietta, Federico Ielapi, Giorgio Pasotti, Caterina Guzzanti, Claudio Santamaria, Fabio Rovazzi, Vincenzo Sebastiani', null, 'A bumbling Christmas elf whose Santa''s helper job is jeopardized by a complete inability in building toys teams up with a kid harassed by bullies.', 'A bumbling Christmas elf whose Santa''s helper job is jeopardized by a complete inability in building toys teams up with a kid harassed by bullies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43NaJeiXYgsEo7ysRDWUGliYSmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938030'),
  ('81357743066332809', 'Eli', 2019, 'Horror', 'Richard Graves, Michael Applebaum, Jeff Cutter', 'Ian B. Goldberg, Richard Naing, David Chirchirillo', 'Charlie Shotwell, Sadie Sink, Lili Taylor, Kelly Reilly, Max Martini, Deneen Tyler, Katia Gomez, Austin Foxx', 'R', 'A boy named Eli with a rare autoimmune disorder is confined to a special experimental clinic for his treatment. He soon begins experiencing supernatural forces, turning the supposedly safe facility into a haunted prison for him and his fellow patients.', 'A boy named Eli with a rare autoimmune disorder is confined to a special experimental clinic for his treatment. He soon begins experiencing supernatural forces, turning the supposedly safe facility into a haunted prison for him and his fellow patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLKypXb7St0UknM2JIKZB2RtHXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483202'),
  ('567023872088386820', 'Eliana and the Secret of the Dolphins', 2005, 'Action, Mystery, Family, Adventure', 'Eliana Fonseca, Luís Abramo, Antonio Luis Soares', 'Eliana Fonseca, Laura Malin, Reinaldo Moraes', 'Eliana, Daniel Del Sarto, João Paulo Bienermann, Fúlvio Stefanini, Ângela Dip, Jackson Antunes, Fernanda Souza, Eliana Fonseca', null, 'While filming a TV special about dolphins in Mexico, Eliana meets a biologist who warns her of an ecological danger, since the greedy Esquivel has stolen a crystal skull from the deep waters of the ocean. That''s the start of a great adventure and a romance with the dolphin trainer.', 'While filming a TV special about dolphins in Mexico, Eliana meets a biologist who warns her of an ecological danger, since the greedy Esquivel has stolen a crystal skull from the deep waters of the ocean. That''s the start of a great adventure and a romance with the dolphin trainer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjDbZ8WTwkPOv93yYIh27vhYViy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252543'),
  ('730901125566934566', 'Eliminators', 1986, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Peter Manoogian, Mac Ahlberg, Betsy Magruder', 'Paul De Meo, Danny Bilson', 'Andrew Prine, Denise Crosby, Patrick Reynolds, Conan Lee, Roy Dotrice, Pete Schrum, Peggy Mannix, Fausto Bara', 'PG', 'A former pilot rebels against his creator, teaming up with the scientist responsible for android technology, her pet robot Spot, a rough-and-tumble riverboat guide, and a martial arts warrior.', 'A former pilot rebels against his creator, teaming up with the scientist responsible for android technology, her pet robot Spot, a rough-and-tumble riverboat guide, and a martial arts warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RBzZcSKmBhVbJWtLwELyvU7V4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47822'),
  ('988026100012307436', 'Eliminators', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'James Nunn, Luke Bryant, Guy Murray-Brown', 'Bobby Lee Darby, Nathan Brookes', 'Scott Adkins, Stuart Bennett, Daniel Caltagirone, James Cosmo, Mem Ferda, Ty Glaser, Olivia Mace, Stephen Marcus', 'R', 'A former US Federal Agent must abandon the witness protection program and come out of hiding when his London home is invaded in error due to a wrong address. When the event ends with multiple homicides, the news triggers those hunting him to send Europe''s most dangerous assassin to kill him. Now on the run with his daughters life in jeopardy, a determined father must get her to safety before the people he''s been hiding from tracks him down.', 'A former US Federal Agent must abandon the witness protection program and come out of hiding when his London home is invaded in error due to a wrong address. When the event ends with multiple homicides, the news triggers those hunting him to send Europe''s most dangerous assassin to kill him. Now on the run with his daughters life in jeopardy, a determined father must get her to safety before the people he''s been hiding from tracks him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUB91wOMQrmkforP7ntIMy2zkdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421313'),
  ('488550768816535399', 'Elina: As If I Wasn''t There', 2003, 'Drama, Family', 'Klaus Härö, Jarkko T. Laine, Marie Lagerkvist', 'Kjell Sundstedt', 'Natalie Minnevik, Bibi Andersson, Marjaana Maijala, Henrik Rafaelsen, Tind Soneby, Björn Granath, Jarl Lindblad, Sara Arnia', null, 'In rural Sweden of the early 1950s, little Elina goes to school again after recovering from tuberculosis, the same illness that has killed her father a few years earlier. Elina''s family belongs to Finnish-speaking Finns frowned upon by a staunch schoolmistress who starts hounding Elina for questioning her authority. Elina''s mother, sister, and a liberal young male teacher all try to mediate the ensuing battle of wills between Elina and Miss Holm. Elina finds consolation in wandering out on the dangerous marshlands to have imaginary conversations with her dead father. Written by Markku Kuoppamäki', 'In rural Sweden of the early 1950s, little Elina goes to school again after recovering from tuberculosis, the same illness that has killed her father a few years earlier. Elina''s family belongs to Finnish-speaking Finns frowned upon by a staunch schoolmistress who starts hounding Elina for questioning her authority. Elina''s mother, sister, and a liberal young male teacher all try to mediate the ensuing battle of wills between Elina and Miss Holm. Elina finds consolation in wandering out on the dangerous marshlands to have imaginary conversations with her dead father. Written by Markku Kuoppamäki', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80mLBYT7pdtm4SPlrMkA1cDoSdT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46814'),
  ('607437031562327951', 'Elio', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Matt Aspbury, Danielle Feinberg, Catherine Hang-Hicks', 'Julia Cho, Mark Hammer, Mike Jones', 'Yonas Kibreab, Remy Edgerly, Zoe Saldaña, Brad Garrett, Brandon Moon, Jameela Jamil, Young Dylan, Jake T. Getman', 'PG', 'Elio, a space fanatic with an active imagination, finds himself on a cosmic misadventure where he must form new bonds with eccentric alien lifeforms, navigate a crisis of intergalactic proportions and somehow discover who he is truly meant to be.', 'Elio, a space fanatic with an active imagination, finds himself on a cosmic misadventure where he must form new bonds with eccentric alien lifeforms, navigate a crisis of intergalactic proportions and somehow discover who he is truly meant to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7z8jDiTZZco9moIKpTUImFtTy7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022787'),
  ('285820093524599307', 'Elippathayam', 1982, 'Drama', 'Adoor Gopalakrishnan, Mohan Kupleri, Shashi Vasu', 'Adoor Gopalakrishnan', 'Karamana Janardanan Nair, Sharada, Jalaja, Rajam K. Nair, Joycee, B K Nair, S. S. Nair, John Samuel', null, 'Unni is the last male heir of a decaying feudal family in rural Kerala. His inability to accept the socio-economic changes of a new society causes him to gradually withdraw into isolation and paranoia.', 'Unni is the last male heir of a decaying feudal family in rural Kerala. His inability to accept the socio-economic changes of a new society causes him to gradually withdraw into isolation and paranoia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2f5QZHESCo6JEQSAFIrzFrEKNKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88093'),
  ('730817177262338031', 'Elipsis', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Eduardo Arias-Nath', 'Eduardo Arias-Nath', 'Erich Wildpret, Angélica Aragón, Álvaro Bayona, Christina Dieckmann, Seu Jorge, Edgar Ramírez, Jean Paul Leroux, Gaby Espino', null, 'Parallel and fragmented stories are linked by the relationship between the famous actor and his friend Sebastian Castillo Galo Vidal, a frustrated fashion designer. The roles are reversed as a result of decisions made each of them. Sebastian''s life is now in chaos, while the Galo is a success. Their lives are again when Sebastian goes to Gaul for help and the two embark on a journey that will put their friendship and their lives at stake.', 'Parallel and fragmented stories are linked by the relationship between the famous actor and his friend Sebastian Castillo Galo Vidal, a frustrated fashion designer. The roles are reversed as a result of decisions made each of them. Sebastian''s life is now in chaos, while the Galo is a success. Their lives are again when Sebastian goes to Gaul for help and the two embark on a journey that will put their friendship and their lives at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gg2sYbXyq26DFEpV3DDPCywbTR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91836'),
  ('1085042965387558712', 'Elis', 2016, 'Drama', 'Hugo Prata, Adrian Teijido, Wellington Pingo', 'Vera Egito, Luiz Bolognesi, Hugo Prata', 'Andréia Horta, Gustavo Machado, Caco Ciocler, Zécarlos Machado, Lúcio Mauro Filho, Ícaro Silva, Júlio Andrade, Isabel Wilker', null, 'The film tells the story of the energetic and pulsating singer Elis Regina since her arrival in Rio de Janeiro at age 19 until her tragic and early death. Despite all the difficulties, success comes fulminant and the life of Elis Regina gained national and international recognition, becoming undoubtedly considered today the greatest Brazilian singer of all time.', 'The film tells the story of the energetic and pulsating singer Elis Regina since her arrival in Rio de Janeiro at age 19 until her tragic and early death. Despite all the difficulties, success comes fulminant and the life of Elis Regina gained national and international recognition, becoming undoubtedly considered today the greatest Brazilian singer of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf55SD27tKBrYMRqyfQ2LDeNyKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360139'),
  ('1055761567679163998', 'Elis & Tom: It Had to be You', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jom Tob Azulay, João Wainer, Fernando Duarte', 'Roberto de Oliveira, Nelson Motta', 'Elis Regina, Antônio Carlos Jobim, Jon Pareles, Aloysio de Oliveira, Hélio Delmiro, Roberto Menescal, César Camargo Mariano, João Marcello Bôscoli', null, 'Elis & Tom is considered one of the most important albums in the history of Brazilian music. Recorded in Los Angeles, in 1974, it was all captured by a team of filmmakers led by director Roberto de Oliveira, who arranged for the duo to meet. The original footage was kept for 45 years until restored and remastered in 2018. The film is also an exciting reunion of the director with the artists and the material he filmed nearly five decades ago.', 'Elis & Tom is considered one of the most important albums in the history of Brazilian music. Recorded in Los Angeles, in 1974, it was all captured by a team of filmmakers led by director Roberto de Oliveira, who arranged for the duo to meet. The original footage was kept for 45 years until restored and remastered in 2018. The film is also an exciting reunion of the director with the artists and the material he filmed nearly five decades ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhrT7TXMOERTP20o7j1LvVStN73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030653'),
  ('936000531157420211', 'Elisa', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Leonardo Di Costanzo, Luca Bigazzi, David Maria Putorti', 'Leonardo Di Costanzo, Bruno Oliviero, Valia Santella', 'Barbara Ronchi, Roschdy Zem, Diego Ribon, Valeria Golino, Giorgio Montanini, Hippolyte Girardot, Monica Codena, Roberta da Soller', null, 'Elisa, the daughter of an ordinary family, has been in prison for ten years for brutally murdering her sister. She believes she doesn’t remember what happened, but her fragmented memories begin to come into focus during meetings with the criminologist Alaoui, who is conducting a study on family homicides. The truth that emerges for Elisa is devastating—a pain that may mark the beginning of redemption.', 'Elisa, the daughter of an ordinary family, has been in prison for ten years for brutally murdering her sister. She believes she doesn’t remember what happened, but her fragmented memories begin to come into focus during meetings with the criminologist Alaoui, who is conducting a study on family homicides. The truth that emerges for Elisa is devastating—a pain that may mark the beginning of redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mhgTXDfVI2op4RfIp25ETE4UXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1438959'),
  ('16875487605227593', 'Élisa', 1995, 'Drama', 'Jean Becker, Étienne Becker', 'Fabrice Carazo, Jean Becker', 'Vanessa Paradis, Gérard Depardieu, Clotilde Courau, Sekkou Sall, Florence Thomassin, Werner Schreyer, Michel Bouquet, Philippe Léotard', null, 'Marie has had a tough childhood ever since her mother Elisa committed suicide. She has spent most of her life in an orphanage and now makes a living as a small time criminal in Paris. Now she wants to unravel her past and find her father whom she blames for her mother''s death.', 'Marie has had a tough childhood ever since her mother Elisa committed suicide. She has spent most of her life in an orphanage and now makes a living as a small time criminal in Paris. Now she wants to unravel her past and find her father whom she blames for her mother''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5LWron7LvX1XeKtTNEs47oY6Sf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58058'),
  ('1118946414597040161', 'Elisa & Marcela', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jennifer Cox, Isabel Coixet, Luca Vacchi', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Natalia de Molina, Greta Fernández, Sara Casasnovas, Tamar Novas, María Pujalte, Francesc Orella, Manolo Solo, Kelly Lua', 'R', 'The film tells the true story of Elisa Sánchez Loriga and Marcela Gracia Ibeas, two women in 1901 Spain who fell deeply in love. To overcome societal and legal barriers to their relationship, Elisa assumes a male identity, enabling the pair to marry in secret. Their daring act makes them the first recorded same-sex couple to marry in Spain, but their love is tested as they face relentless persecution and sacrifice.', 'The film tells the true story of Elisa Sánchez Loriga and Marcela Gracia Ibeas, two women in 1901 Spain who fell deeply in love. To overcome societal and legal barriers to their relationship, Elisa assumes a male identity, enabling the pair to marry in secret. Their daring act makes them the first recorded same-sex couple to marry in Spain, but their love is tested as they face relentless persecution and sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOd1CB3TgV1RLtnCHtDSPeC9tId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535356'),
  ('277262084840812325', 'Elisa Before the End of the World', 1997, 'Drama', 'Juan Antonio de la Riva, Arturo de la Rosa', 'Paula Markovitch', 'Sherlyn, Imanol, Rubén Rojo Aura, Susana Zabaleta, Claudia Goytia, Dino García', null, '10-year-old Elisa, whose parents are about to lose their new car due to financial problems, plans a bank robbery.', '10-year-old Elisa, whose parents are about to lose their new car due to financial problems, plans a bank robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g6CoKlV7S5R4NqsDX0TfjBFbdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128177'),
  ('441131756738589007', 'Elisa, My Life', 1977, 'Drama', 'Teo Escamilla, Carlos Saura, Francisco J. Querejeta', 'Carlos Saura', 'Fernando Rey, Geraldine Chaplin, Isabel Mestres, Joaquín Hinojosa, Norman Briski, Francisco Guijar, Arantxa Escamilla, Jacobo Escamilla', null, 'Elisa has not seen her father Luis for nine years, but she receives a telegram from her sister Isabel in a moment of crisis in her marriage with Antonio telling that her father is ill. Elisa decides to travel to the countryside of Madrid with Isabel and her brother-in-law Julián and their two children to visit Luis for his birthday. Elisa decides to stay with her father when her sister returns to Madrid with her family and she gets closer to Luis, understanding why he left her mother years ago. Later she tells him that Antonio cheated on her with her best friend Sophie and their relationship has ended. When Antonio unexpectedly arrives in the house, Elisa makes a decision about her life.', 'Elisa has not seen her father Luis for nine years, but she receives a telegram from her sister Isabel in a moment of crisis in her marriage with Antonio telling that her father is ill. Elisa decides to travel to the countryside of Madrid with Isabel and her brother-in-law Julián and their two children to visit Luis for his birthday. Elisa decides to stay with her father when her sister returns to Madrid with her family and she gets closer to Luis, understanding why he left her mother years ago. Later she tells him that Antonio cheated on her with her best friend Sophie and their relationship has ended. When Antonio unexpectedly arrives in the house, Elisa makes a decision about her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulwj7sunrRclU3WDnnelfYavNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114337'),
  ('1089176220961149289', 'Elise, or Real Life', 1970, 'Drama', 'Michel Drach, Claude Zidi', 'Michel Drach, Claire Etcherelli, Claude Lanzmann', 'Marie-José Nat, Mohamed Chouikh, Bernadette Lafont, Jean-Pierre Bisson, Catherine Allégret, Mustapha Chadli, Alice Reichen, Martine Chevallier', null, 'In the middle of the Algerian war, Elise, from Bordeaux, “goes” to Paris to join her brother to earn her living in an automobile factory. There she meets Arezki, an Algerian nationalist activist with whom she falls in love. A chronicle of working life at the time and which highlights the extent of police repression against Algerians.', 'In the middle of the Algerian war, Elise, from Bordeaux, “goes” to Paris to join her brother to earn her living in an automobile factory. There she meets Arezki, an Algerian nationalist activist with whom she falls in love. A chronicle of working life at the time and which highlights the extent of police repression against Algerians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcQq3Do8lalRbZDG1j2fTy3Iz0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66957'),
  ('757948098894060850', 'Eliso', 1929, 'Drama, History, Romance, War, Adventure', 'Nikoloz Shengelaia', 'Sergei Tretyakov', 'Aleksander Imedashvili, Kohkta Karalashvili, Kira Andronikashvili, Tsetsilia Tsutsunava, Marika Chimishkyan, Aleksandre Jorjoliani, Gogi Ratiani', null, 'Georgia, 1864. The Tsarist regime is using Cossacks to forcibly resettle Muslim Georgians to Turkey in order to steal their land. Meanwhile a Muslim girl falls in love with a Christian from the next village.', 'Georgia, 1864. The Tsarist regime is using Cossacks to forcibly resettle Muslim Georgians to Turkey in order to steal their land. Meanwhile a Muslim girl falls in love with a Christian from the next village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bixKuN8SWhjmYsirIbaShEY3p4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189965'),
  ('882201672267528115', 'Elite Cup', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Vitor Brandt, Tatiana Fragoso, Pablo Baião', 'Vitor Brandt, Pedro Aguilera', 'Marcos Veras, Júlia Rabello, Rafinha Bastos, Bento Ribeiro, Thammy Miranda, Babu Santana, Alexandre Frota, Victor Leal', null, 'Police officer Jorge Capitão is a competent BOP captain and a Brazilian idol. But after he saved Argentina''s greatest ace from a kidnapping, on the eve of the World Cup, he ended up becoming the nation''s number 1 public enemy. Expelled from the corporation and discredited by the people, Captain must relearn how to work as a team to avoid an attempt on the Pope in the final of the tournament. That''s when the sex shop manager Bia Alpinistinha, a medium and her very crazy mother, enters the scene.', 'Police officer Jorge Capitão is a competent BOP captain and a Brazilian idol. But after he saved Argentina''s greatest ace from a kidnapping, on the eve of the World Cup, he ended up becoming the nation''s number 1 public enemy. Expelled from the corporation and discredited by the people, Captain must relearn how to work as a team to avoid an attempt on the Pope in the final of the tournament. That''s when the sex shop manager Bia Alpinistinha, a medium and her very crazy mother, enters the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKpmi4dotMAENGVRB4yutItNKxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243451'),
  ('1045796373328236824', 'Elizabeth', 1998, 'Drama, History', 'Shekhar Kapur, Remi Adefarasin, Poppy Luard', 'Michael Hirst', 'Cate Blanchett, Joseph Fiennes, Geoffrey Rush, Christopher Eccleston, John Gielgud, Richard Attenborough, Fanny Ardant, Éric Cantona', 'R', 'The story of the ascension to the throne and the early reign of Queen Elizabeth the First, the endless attempts by her council to marry her off, the Catholic hatred of her and her romance with Lord Robert Dudley.', 'The story of the ascension to the throne and the early reign of Queen Elizabeth the First, the endless attempts by her council to marry her off, the Catholic hatred of her and her romance with Lord Robert Dudley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEk48VLOdibXFVIEzE9ETZUBcCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4518'),
  ('1017036098280476864', 'Elizabeth Harvest', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Sebastian Gutierrez, Cale Finot', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Abbey Lee, Ciarán Hinds, Carla Gugino, Matthew Beard, Dylan Baker', 'R', 'The newly married Elizabeth arrives with her new husband, the scientist Henry, at a magnificent house. He tells her that she can do there anything she pleases, except to enter a certain closed room.', 'The newly married Elizabeth arrives with her new husband, the scientist Henry, at a magnificent house. He tells her that she can do there anything she pleases, except to enter a certain closed room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiwY0z17ZqCPVSK1plvL11rSKuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457041'),
  ('718617209622983273', 'Elizabeth R: A Year in the Life of The Queen', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Edward Mirzoeff', 'Antony Jay, Edward Mirzoeff', 'Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom, Ian Holm', null, 'Join the BBC cameras as they go behind the glitter of Buckingham Palace and the pomp of Windsor Castle for a close-up look at the minutia of the monarchy. Culled from a year of unprecedented access to Queen Elizabeth II, the documentary trails the queen as she interacts one-on-one with her family, her staff, her public, and international heads of state. Go behind closed doors for Christmas with the royal family, eavesdrop on cocktail chatter with Ron and Nancy Reagan, and catch unguarded moments when the queen pilots her own jeep or romps with her dogs. Elizabeth R. is a once-in-a-lifetime glimpse into the everyday life of a queen.', 'Join the BBC cameras as they go behind the glitter of Buckingham Palace and the pomp of Windsor Castle for a close-up look at the minutia of the monarchy. Culled from a year of unprecedented access to Queen Elizabeth II, the documentary trails the queen as she interacts one-on-one with her family, her staff, her public, and international heads of state. Go behind closed doors for Christmas with the royal family, eavesdrop on cocktail chatter with Ron and Nancy Reagan, and catch unguarded moments when the queen pilots her own jeep or romps with her dogs. Elizabeth R. is a once-in-a-lifetime glimpse into the everyday life of a queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie9wogegwhBuoxnP19Gt3u3501c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791574'),
  ('757511843113149623', 'Elizabeth: The Golden Age', 2007, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Shekhar Kapur, Remi Adefarasin, Helen Xenopoulos', 'William Nicholson, Michael Hirst', 'Cate Blanchett, Laurence Fox, Clive Owen, Geoffrey Rush, Tom Hollander, Abbie Cornish, Rhys Ifans, Samantha Morton', 'PG-13', 'When Queen Elizabeth''s reign is threatened by ruthless familial betrayal and Spain''s invading army, she and her shrewd adviser must act to safeguard the lives of her people.', 'When Queen Elizabeth''s reign is threatened by ruthless familial betrayal and Spain''s invading army, she and her shrewd adviser must act to safeguard the lives of her people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBQ64TyPEINgVpwKWriv3QsIDJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4517'),
  ('80326455311299801', 'Elizabethtown', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John Toll, Cameron Crowe, Sunday Stevens', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Orlando Bloom, Kirsten Dunst, Susan Sarandon, Alec Baldwin, Bruce McGill, Judy Greer, Jessica Biel, Paul Schneider', 'PG-13', 'Drew Baylor is fired after causing his shoe company to lose hundreds of millions of dollars. To make matters worse, he''s also dumped by his girlfriend. On the verge of ending it all, Drew gets a new lease on life when he returns to his family''s small Kentucky hometown after his father dies. Along the way, he meets a flight attendant with whom he falls in love.', 'Drew Baylor is fired after causing his shoe company to lose hundreds of millions of dollars. To make matters worse, he''s also dumped by his girlfriend. On the verge of ending it all, Drew gets a new lease on life when he returns to his family''s small Kentucky hometown after his father dies. Along the way, he meets a flight attendant with whom he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOdlzAQxhMgiaazRzif1YtJzg9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9621'),
  ('903982256641582495', 'Ella Bella Bingo', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Atle Solberg Blakseth, Frank Mosvold', 'Rob Sprackling, Johnny Smith, Frank Mosvold', 'Ninni Spone, Bjarte Hjelmeland, Oskar Fjeldstad-Bergheim, Elias Søvold-Simonsen, Johannes Joner, Benjamin Plessala, Gard B. Eidsvold, Hege Schøyen', null, 'Ella Bella Bingo and Henry are best friends, but one day a new boy moves into the neighbourhood and everything changes.', 'Ella Bella Bingo and Henry are best friends, but one day a new boy moves into the neighbourhood and everything changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdK86hDn31gjtVJhMDB7ZMEAH8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619918'),
  ('719350043020977615', 'Ella Cinders', 1926, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alfred E. Green, Arthur Martinelli', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Frank Griffin', 'Colleen Moore, Lloyd Hughes, Vera Lewis, Doris Baker, Emily Gerdes, Mike Donlin, Jed Prouty, Jack Duffy', 'NR', 'Poor Ella Cinders is much abused by her evil step-mother and step-sisters. When she wins a local beauty contest she jumps at the chance to get out of her dead-end life and go to Hollywood, where she is promised a job in the movies. When she arrives in Hollywood, she discovers that the contest was a scam and the job non-existent. But through pluck, luck, and talent, she makes it in the movies anyway, and finds true love.', 'Poor Ella Cinders is much abused by her evil step-mother and step-sisters. When she wins a local beauty contest she jumps at the chance to get out of her dead-end life and go to Hollywood, where she is promised a job in the movies. When she arrives in Hollywood, she discovers that the contest was a scam and the job non-existent. But through pluck, luck, and talent, she makes it in the movies anyway, and finds true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heeZzfFoVRnmNyjnhF94gDvy2m6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111457'),
  ('731022902548682998', 'Ella Enchanted', 2004, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tommy O''Haver, John de Borman, David Daniels', 'Laurie Craig, Karen McCullah, Kirsten Smith', 'Anne Hathaway, Hugh Dancy, Cary Elwes, Aidan McArdle, Joanna Lumley, Lucy Punch, Jennifer Higham, Minnie Driver', 'PG', 'Ella lives in a magical world in which each child, at the moment of their birth, is given a virtuous "gift" from a fairy godmother. Ella''s so-called gift, however, is obedience. This birthright proves itself to be quite the curse once Ella finds herself in the hands of several unscrupulous characters whom she quite literally cannot disobey. Determined to gain control of her life and decisions, Ella sets off on a journey to find her fairy godmother who she hopes will lift the curse. The path, however, isn''t easy -- Ella must outwit a slew of unpleasant obstacles including ogres, giants, wicked stepsisters, elves and Prince Charmont''s evil uncle, who wants to take over the crown and rule the kingdom.', 'Ella lives in a magical world in which each child, at the moment of their birth, is given a virtuous "gift" from a fairy godmother. Ella''s so-called gift, however, is obedience. This birthright proves itself to be quite the curse once Ella finds herself in the hands of several unscrupulous characters whom she quite literally cannot disobey. Determined to gain control of her life and decisions, Ella sets off on a journey to find her fairy godmother who she hopes will lift the curse. The path, however, isn''t easy -- Ella must outwit a slew of unpleasant obstacles including ogres, giants, wicked stepsisters, elves and Prince Charmont''s evil uncle, who wants to take over the crown and rule the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AyNzwSEpJEG1gBdgwRfXi1cjs8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14442'),
  ('494262831718024587', 'Ella Fitzgerald: The Tale of a Vocal Virtuosa', 2003, 'Animation', 'Gary McGivney', null, 'Billy Dee Williams', null, 'Told in the voice of a cool cat named Scat, this dramatic story tells how Ella got her sound on the way to a most remarkable and inspiring career.', 'Told in the voice of a cool cat named Scat, this dramatic story tells how Ella got her sound on the way to a most remarkable and inspiring career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upY7MNE15z8DOGCDOpSTOTYHoii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561467'),
  ('900050347363656224', 'Ella McCay', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James L. Brooks, Robert Elswit, Aldric La''Auli Porter', 'James L. Brooks', 'Emma Mackey, Jamie Lee Curtis, Jack Lowden, Kumail Nanjiani, Ayo Edebiri, Spike Fearn, Julie Kavner, Rebecca Hall', 'PG-13', 'An idealistic young politician juggles familial issues and a challenging work life while preparing to take over the job of her mentor, the state’s longtime incumbent governor.', 'An idealistic young politician juggles familial issues and a challenging work life while preparing to take over the job of her mentor, the state’s longtime incumbent governor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQCtK477yqp6xnHHrQG2P0lXoow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1206008'),
  ('67805559709847258', 'Elle', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Verhoeven, Stéphane Fontaine, Sebastian Schelenz', 'David Birke', 'Isabelle Huppert, Laurent Lafitte, Anne Consigny, Charles Berling, Virginie Efira, Judith Magre, Christian Berkel, Jonas Bloquet', 'R', 'When Michèle, the CEO of a gaming software company, is attacked in her home by an unknown assailant, she refuses to let it alter her precisely ordered life. She manages crises involving family, all the while becoming engaged in a game of cat and mouse with her stalker.', 'When Michèle, the CEO of a gaming software company, is attacked in her home by an unknown assailant, she refuses to let it alter her precisely ordered life. She manages crises involving family, all the while becoming engaged in a game of cat and mouse with her stalker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z446adpGUVXXPxrLpKBGnYBcofk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337674'),
  ('710706794589425727', 'Elle voit des nains partout !', 1982, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jean-Claude Sussfeld', 'Philippe Bruneau, Jean-Claude Sussfeld', 'Zabou Breitman, Philippe Bruneau, Marilyne Canto, Christian Clavier, Agnès Daems, Roland Giraud, Martin Lamotte, Gaëlle Legrand', null, 'La reine de France meurt en couche. Elle met au monde un petite fille prénommée Blanche-neige. Le roi deçu de n''avoir pas un fils est résolu à faire disparaître sa progéniture mais c''est sans compter sur la protection de nombreux personnages de la littérature enfantine : les fées, Tarzan, Robin des Bois ou d''autres encore...', 'La reine de France meurt en couche. Elle met au monde un petite fille prénommée Blanche-neige. Le roi deçu de n''avoir pas un fils est résolu à faire disparaître sa progéniture mais c''est sans compter sur la protection de nombreux personnages de la littérature enfantine : les fées, Tarzan, Robin des Bois ou d''autres encore...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQJVLYDk4nXlFDHOAGmJw5bdy98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54147'),
  ('725457927672656055', 'Elle: A Modern Cinderella Tale', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction, Family', 'John Dunson, Sean Dunson, Hugo Pallete', 'Thomas R. Martin, Bo Ransdell, Ryan Dean', 'Ashlee Hewitt, Juliette Hing-Lee, Kiely Williams, Sterling Knight, Brandon Mychal Smith, Thomas Calabro, Katherine Bailess, Tyler Nicole', 'G', 'Elle wants to be a singer/songwriter, but her dreams are cut short by the sudden death of her parents. She moves in with her adoptive uncle, who runs a small independent record label whose biggest act, Sensation, is also Elle''s biggest pain.', 'Elle wants to be a singer/songwriter, but her dreams are cut short by the sudden death of her parents. She moves in with her adoptive uncle, who runs a small independent record label whose biggest act, Sensation, is also Elle''s biggest pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnExa5ZHZ8xSWR2J6E4muzqvMc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56929'),
  ('7068851854232619', 'Ellen DeGeneres: For Your Approval', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Joel Gallen', 'Ellen DeGeneres', 'Ellen DeGeneres, Portia De Rossi', 'R', 'In the final special of her historic career, Ellen gets candid about fame, parallel parking and her life since getting "kicked out of show business".', 'In the final special of her historic career, Ellen gets candid about fame, parallel parking and her life since getting "kicked out of show business".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFR1z640P1G3IYQ9FMtiLsFDYyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315601'),
  ('850443990988286579', 'Ellen DeGeneres: Here and Now', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Joel Gallen', 'Ellen DeGeneres, Karen Kilgariff, Karen Anderson', 'Ellen DeGeneres', null, 'Comedian and actress Ellen DeGeneres brings her honesty and off-the-wall wit to this stand-up special taped live at NYC''s Beacon Theater.', 'Comedian and actress Ellen DeGeneres brings her honesty and off-the-wall wit to this stand-up special taped live at NYC''s Beacon Theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSEX32XPjRyy3jrhrb1ZhMS1WSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19511'),
  ('742517436904314720', 'Ellen DeGeneres: Relatable', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Joel Gallen, Tig Notaro, Cameron Barnett', 'Ellen DeGeneres', 'Ellen DeGeneres, Portia De Rossi', null, 'In her first special since 2003, Ellen revisits her road to stardom and details the heartfelt -- and hilarious -- lessons she''s learned along the way.', 'In her first special since 2003, Ellen revisits her road to stardom and details the heartfelt -- and hilarious -- lessons she''s learned along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mWdVy4X113rcs5SHu1373YSO22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535358'),
  ('901998500756104556', 'Ellen Foster', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Erman, Brian West, Donald P.H. Eaton', null, 'Jena Malone, Julie Harris, Ted Levine, Glynnis O''Connor, Debra Monk, Barbara Garrick, Kate Burton, Željko Ivanek', 'PG-13', 'After her mother''s death, a young girl is separated from her abusive father and is sent between her various friends and relatives, always longing to find a place to call home.', 'After her mother''s death, a young girl is separated from her abusive father and is sent between her various friends and relatives, always longing to find a place to call home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iv4tahnFKwqXdWSll0ZbnyxPuWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113141'),
  ('974582922936427764', 'Elli and her Monster Team', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jesper Møller, Piet De Rycker, Jens Møller', 'Piet De Rycker', 'Dalia Mya Schmidt-Foß, Oliver Kalkofe, Santiago Ziesmer, Max Giermann, Svantje Wascher', 'PG', 'When a homeless little ghost knocks on the door to the eccentric residents of a Ghost Train on the lookout for a place to belong, she accidentally attracts the attention from the ''outsideworld'' and must team up with the motley crew of monsters on a crazy quest to save not only the future of the Ghost Train but also her only chance to finally have a family of her own.', 'When a homeless little ghost knocks on the door to the eccentric residents of a Ghost Train on the lookout for a place to belong, she accidentally attracts the attention from the ''outsideworld'' and must team up with the motley crew of monsters on a crazy quest to save not only the future of the Ghost Train but also her only chance to finally have a family of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyNtoI1r9ydJRKFGS1SCbT9ying.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217876'),
  ('426645308757529195', 'Ellie and Abbie (and Ellie''s Dead Aunt)', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Monica Zanetti, Calum Stewart, Nicola Macindoe', 'Monica Zanetti', 'Marta Dusseldorp, Zoe Terakes, Sophie Hawkshaw, Julia Billington, Rachel House, Bridie Connell, Chiara Gizzi, Madeleine Withington', null, 'School captain Ellie is seriously crushing on her rebellious classmate Abbie. Determined to ask her first love to the year 12 formal, Ellie devises a plan to go public with the invitation but before she can go through with it, her dead aunt Tara reappears from beyond the grave. Believing she''s been brought back from the dead to be Ellie''s fairy godmother, Tara dishes out unwanted dating advice based on her life as an out lesbian in the ''80s.', 'School captain Ellie is seriously crushing on her rebellious classmate Abbie. Determined to ask her first love to the year 12 formal, Ellie devises a plan to go public with the invitation but before she can go through with it, her dead aunt Tara reappears from beyond the grave. Believing she''s been brought back from the dead to be Ellie''s fairy godmother, Tara dishes out unwanted dating advice based on her life as an out lesbian in the ''80s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmNQCI7wZkQb1nY9ILvXM3n383X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662541'),
  ('695956363994517655', 'Ellie de Olifant, De grote reis', 2026, 'Animation, Family', 'Ellen Langendam', 'Luc Adriaens', 'Phaedra Kwant', null, 'Ellie and her friends go on fun adventures where teamwork and kindness help everyone take part, turning every challenge into a joyful celebration of friendship.', 'Ellie and her friends go on fun adventures where teamwork and kindness help everyone take part, turning every challenge into a joyful celebration of friendship.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnbIzHt2QGomiFmnMg1dMLTj5Qm.jpg', 'plex:movie:ellie-de-olifant-de-grote-reis'),
  ('1013207594295925271', 'Ellie Parker', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Scott Coffey, Blair Mastbaum, Scott Coffey', 'Scott Coffey', 'Naomi Watts, Scott Coffey, Jennifer Syme, Mark Pellegrino, Greg Freitas, Gaye Pope, Blair Mastbaum, Rebecca Rigg', 'R', 'Ellie Parker, an aspiring actress from Australia, lives a hectic Hollywood lifestyle, perpetually trying to land the role that will elevate her career. Living with her lothario musician boyfriend, Justin, Ellie is far from happy, finding support primarily from her friend Sam. But when Ellie meets Chris after a minor traffic accident, she sees new potential for both romance and her life in general.', 'Ellie Parker, an aspiring actress from Australia, lives a hectic Hollywood lifestyle, perpetually trying to land the role that will elevate her career. Living with her lothario musician boyfriend, Justin, Ellie is far from happy, finding support primarily from her friend Sam. But when Ellie meets Chris after a minor traffic accident, she sees new potential for both romance and her life in general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEmoWFzLb6YC90SpfOOCFypmc9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16548'),
  ('1081033153046942450', 'Elling', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Svein Krøvel, Petter Næss', 'Axel Hellstenius', 'Per Christian Ellefsen, Sven Nordin, Marit Pia Jacobsen, Jørgen Langhelle, Per Christensen, Hilde Olausson, Ola Otnes, Eli Anne Linnestad', 'R', '40-year-old Elling, sensitive, would-be poet, is sent to live in a state institution when his mother, who has sheltered him his entire life, dies. There he meets Kjell Bjarne, a gentle giant and female-obsessed virgin, also in his 40s.', '40-year-old Elling, sensitive, would-be poet, is sent to live in a state institution when his mother, who has sheltered him his entire life, dies. There he meets Kjell Bjarne, a gentle giant and female-obsessed virgin, also in his 40s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4o9u93vR7setcwVeL87jGwc8CS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6007'),
  ('691467295785339792', 'Elliot: The Littlest Reindeer', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Jennifer Westcott', 'Jennifer Westcott', 'Josh Hutcherson, Samantha Bee, Morena Baccarin, John Cleese, Martin Short, George Buza, Jeff Dunham, Christopher Jacot', 'PG', 'When Blitzen announces his retirement on December 21st, a miniature horse has 3 days to fulfill his lifelong dream of earning a spot on Santa''s team at the North Pole try-outs.', 'When Blitzen announces his retirement on December 21st, a miniature horse has 3 days to fulfill his lifelong dream of earning a spot on Santa''s team at the North Pole try-outs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYq809WTep01HO5oJR9o9VbEDJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455842'),
  ('40365902412663513', 'Ellipsis', 2024, 'Thriller', 'David Marqués, Santiago Racaj', 'Rafa Calatayud Cano, David Marqués', 'Diego Peretti, Jose Coronado, Cecilia Suárez, Georgina Amorós, Leticia Torres, Esteban G. Ballesteros, Domingo Cruz, Amparo Santolino', null, 'Leo is a successful author of mystery novels, who writes under the pseudonym Cameron Graves. While penning his next book in an isolated chalet, he receives a strange visit from Jota, a somewhat troubling character, who claims to be a journalist. No one is aware of Leo’s true identity and only Victoria, his agent, knows his whereabouts, so... How has Jota managed to track him down? What are his intentions? A dark secret linked to Adriana, his young lover, seems to be behind the mysterious visit. Lies, betrayal, threats and death will be the order of the day as the two characters go head to head in a merciless duel.', 'Leo is a successful author of mystery novels, who writes under the pseudonym Cameron Graves. While penning his next book in an isolated chalet, he receives a strange visit from Jota, a somewhat troubling character, who claims to be a journalist. No one is aware of Leo’s true identity and only Victoria, his agent, knows his whereabouts, so... How has Jota managed to track him down? What are his intentions? A dark secret linked to Adriana, his young lover, seems to be behind the mysterious visit. Lies, betrayal, threats and death will be the order of the day as the two characters go head to head in a merciless duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYXGFZjB5ynyXi81VUHV1JLrZwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067837'),
  ('787538940470341119', 'Ellis', 2015, 'Drama', 'JR, André Chemetoff', 'Eric Roth', 'Robert De Niro', null, 'Ellis, a fourteen-minute film directed by JR and written by Academy Award winner Eric Roth, tells the elusive story of countless immigrants whose pursuit of a new life led them to the now-shuttered Ellis Island Immigrant Hospital. Following its opening in 1902, approximately 1.2 million people passed through the facility, where the Statue of Liberty can be seen from the windows. Languishing in a sort of purgatory awaiting their fate, many were never discharged.', 'Ellis, a fourteen-minute film directed by JR and written by Academy Award winner Eric Roth, tells the elusive story of countless immigrants whose pursuit of a new life led them to the now-shuttered Ellis Island Immigrant Hospital. Following its opening in 1902, approximately 1.2 million people passed through the facility, where the Statue of Liberty can be seen from the windows. Languishing in a sort of purgatory awaiting their fate, many were never discharged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0lbu4CZ24ULisPoHpFXkN1qyAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361671'),
  ('623154744861167692', 'Elmer Elephant', 1936, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Wilfred Jackson, Graham Heid', 'Earl Hurd, Ted Sears, Bianca Majolie', 'Bernice Hansen, Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'G', 'Little Elmer Elephant has a crush on Tillie Tiger and his affection is reciprocated. Trouble is, the pint-sized pachyderm is beset by bullies who ridicule his trunk and make his life miserable. Then a conflagration breaks out at Tillie''s tree house.', 'Little Elmer Elephant has a crush on Tillie Tiger and his affection is reciprocated. Trouble is, the pint-sized pachyderm is beset by bullies who ridicule his trunk and make his life miserable. Then a conflagration breaks out at Tillie''s tree house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeROPnW0JWQOF380WGtGPlYNkzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52482'),
  ('808559306011541964', 'Elmer Gantry', 1960, 'Drama', 'Richard Brooks, John Alton, Tom Shaw', 'Richard Brooks', 'Burt Lancaster, Jean Simmons, Arthur Kennedy, Dean Jagger, Shirley Jones, Patti Page, Edward Andrews, John McIntire', 'NR', 'A charismatic charlatan begins a business — and eventually romantic — relationship with a roadside evangelist to sell religion to 1920s America. Based on Sinclair Lewis'' novel of the same name.', 'A charismatic charlatan begins a business — and eventually romantic — relationship with a roadside evangelist to sell religion to 1920s America. Based on Sinclair Lewis'' novel of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vd031r08rrfSMqtB9UarwqCUOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22013'),
