  ('226708365647978997', 'Eloá the Hostage: Live on TV', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Cris Ghattas, Henrique Vale, Fabi Vanelli', 'Ricky Hiraoka, Tainá Muhringer, Jordana Berg', 'Bianca Sousa, Everson Alexandre, Maria Jaqueline, Pery Maia, Caio del Rossi, Caio Cesar Laranjeira, Felipe Souza Ferreira, Amanda Celi', 'R', 'A tragic hostage case from 2008 Brazil unfolds through unseen diary entries, family interviews, and media coverage, as a 15-year-old girl is held captive by her ex-boyfriend for 100 hours while TV networks broadcast it live.', 'A tragic hostage case from 2008 Brazil unfolds through unseen diary entries, family interviews, and media coverage, as a 15-year-old girl is held captive by her ex-boyfriend for 100 hours while TV networks broadcast it live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhDxIfVMmcEE4g7sx5gCcuJYzad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1564346'),
  ('702798626781498391', 'Eloise', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jesús Garay', 'Cristina Moncunill', 'Diana Gómez, Ariadna Cabrol, Laura Conejero, Bernat Saumell, Carolina Montoya, Miranda Makaroff, Núria Hosta, Eduard Farelo', null, 'A sensuous and ethereal story of two young women falling in love for the first time. Young, beautiful Àsia lies in a coma, her mother and boyfriend keeping constant vigil by her side. In flashback we see what led up to her accident, her life studying architecture at university, the somewhat overbearing relationship she has with her mother and her passionless relationship with Nathaniel.', 'A sensuous and ethereal story of two young women falling in love for the first time. Young, beautiful Àsia lies in a coma, her mother and boyfriend keeping constant vigil by her side. In flashback we see what led up to her accident, her life studying architecture at university, the somewhat overbearing relationship she has with her mother and her passionless relationship with Nathaniel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSLg9z7eS4rTIiKXDNpgLzk7XJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44620'),
  ('505785487905998908', 'Eloise', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Legato, Antonio Riestra', 'Christopher Borrelli', 'Eliza Dushku, Robert Patrick, Chace Crawford, P.J. Byrne, Brandon T. Jackson, Nicole Forester, Milica Govich, Ricky Wayne', 'R', 'Four friends break into an abandoned insane asylum in search of a death certificate which will grant one of them a large inheritance. However, finding it soon becomes the least of their worries in a place haunted by dark memories.', 'Four friends break into an abandoned insane asylum in search of a death certificate which will grant one of them a large inheritance. However, finding it soon becomes the least of their worries in a place haunted by dark memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hXgwxOhaLwmyAE67Ky6ZOjyTdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331392'),
  ('622137063684510007', 'Eloise at Christmastime', 2003, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Kevin Lima', 'Elizabeth Chandler', 'Sofia Vassilieva, Gavin Creel, Sara Topham, Victor A. Young, Julie Andrews, Kenneth Welsh, Rick Roberts, Neil Crone', 'G', 'Eloise is a precocious but lovable six-year-old girl who lives in New York''s Plaza Hotel. The owner''s daughter is getting married, but Eloise discovers that the fiance has devious plans to defraud kind Rachel! When her true love is revealed to be none other than Eloise''s best friend Bill who works in the kitchen, Eloise goes on a mission to bring about a Christmas miracle and get the starcrossed lovers back together.. will things work out in time for a happy holiday ending?', 'Eloise is a precocious but lovable six-year-old girl who lives in New York''s Plaza Hotel. The owner''s daughter is getting married, but Eloise discovers that the fiance has devious plans to defraud kind Rachel! When her true love is revealed to be none other than Eloise''s best friend Bill who works in the kitchen, Eloise goes on a mission to bring about a Christmas miracle and get the starcrossed lovers back together.. will things work out in time for a happy holiday ending?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBm2QXjmBHN10n68MANWoRw8bMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59191'),
  ('565334315463443300', 'Eloise at the Plaza', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Kevin Lima, James Chressanthis', 'Janet Brownell', 'Sofia Vassilieva, Kintaro Akiyama, Julie Andrews, Kenneth Welsh, Jeffrey Tambor, Tannis Burnett, Gavin Creel, Debra Monk', 'G', 'Eloise is a precocious but lovable six-year-old girl who lives in New York''s Plaza Hotel. Her caretaker "Nanny" watches over her while her mom is away. Then one day, while trying to figure out how to get invited to a fancy ball as well as how to meet a visiting prince, Eloise makes a new friend around her age! So she decides to take him on a tour of the city - and all while plotting some matchmaking hijinks for her other friends too!', 'Eloise is a precocious but lovable six-year-old girl who lives in New York''s Plaza Hotel. Her caretaker "Nanny" watches over her while her mom is away. Then one day, while trying to figure out how to get invited to a fancy ball as well as how to meet a visiting prince, Eloise makes a new friend around her age! So she decides to take him on a tour of the city - and all while plotting some matchmaking hijinks for her other friends too!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdxBapcOvqfndDDrnrg8rv0STHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46806'),
  ('546114248055107788', 'Eloïse''s Journey', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Murielle Magellan, Michèle Hauteville, Alice Kern', 'Murielle Magellan', 'Sara Giraudeau, Pierre Deladonchamps, Grégoire Ludig, Sarah Suco, Jules Dhios Francisco, Thomas Chabrol, Pénélope Bagieu, Lola Dubini', null, 'Eloïse is sitting alone on a bench in Paris. She can''t remember who she is, where she comes from or how did she get here. So, she begins a funny investigation on her life. This amnesia might help her finding love and reinventing her life.', 'Eloïse is sitting alone on a bench in Paris. She can''t remember who she is, where she comes from or how did she get here. So, she begins a funny investigation on her life. This amnesia might help her finding love and reinventing her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dqL4mDuueNWg8pNFWE5MBxIX0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956877'),
  ('754059229256259465', 'Elon Doesn''t Believe in Death', 2017, 'Drama', 'Matheus da Rocha Pereira, Ricardo Alves Jr.', 'Diego Hoefel, Ricardo Alves Jr., João Salaviza', 'Rômulo Braga, Clara Choveaux, Lourenço Mutarelli, Germano Melo, Grace Passô, Silvana Stein, Maria José Novais Oliveira, Helvécio Alves Izabel', null, 'As he does every single day, Elon goes to meet his wife at her workplace, but she is not there. He doesn’t find her at home as well, so he starts to retrace the path Madalena makes daily. In the morning after, Elon goes to the police station and files a report, runs into hospitals, morgues. Alone, he wanders through a metropolis, searching for news about the sudden and mysterious disappearance of his wife.', 'As he does every single day, Elon goes to meet his wife at her workplace, but she is not there. He doesn’t find her at home as well, so he starts to retrace the path Madalena makes daily. In the morning after, Elon goes to the police station and files a report, runs into hospitals, morgues. Alone, he wanders through a metropolis, searching for news about the sudden and mysterious disappearance of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxtvQWW27MwEJPQZEr8f0EoxZEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409306'),
  ('176959333115394684', 'Elon Musk Unveiled – The Tesla Experiment', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Andreas Pichler, Jakob Stark, Tom Bergmann', 'Andreas Pichler, Anne von Petersdorff, Christian Beetz', 'Elon Musk, Donald Trump', null, 'Leaked Tesla data reveals Musk''s pattern: announcing grand plans, pushing execution regardless of accuracy or human impact. Based on 100GB of internal documents from whistleblower Lukasz Krupski.', 'Leaked Tesla data reveals Musk''s pattern: announcing grand plans, pushing execution regardless of accuracy or human impact. Based on 100GB of internal documents from whistleblower Lukasz Krupski.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fq8UezdbA8D6Xxy9RsDcwTd3nffO.jpg', 'plex:movie:elon-musk-unveiled-the-tesla-experiment-2026'),
  ('1088617725277280394', 'Elsa & Fred', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marcos Carnevale, Jorge Gundín, Guillermo Navajo', 'Lily Ann Martin, Marcos Carnevale, Marcela Guerty', 'China Zorrilla, Manuel Alexandre, Blanca Portillo, José Ángel Egido, Omar Muñoz, Roberto Carnaghi, Carlos Álvarez-Nóvoa, Gonzalo Urtizberea', null, 'When the retired seventy-seven years old hypochondriac widower Fred moves to an apartment in Madrid, his temperamental daughter Cuca has an incident with his next door neighbor, the elder Argentinean Elsa. Later, they meet each other and Elsa seduces Fred with her reckless behavior and view of life and they have a romance.', 'When the retired seventy-seven years old hypochondriac widower Fred moves to an apartment in Madrid, his temperamental daughter Cuca has an incident with his next door neighbor, the elder Argentinean Elsa. Later, they meet each other and Elsa seduces Fred with her reckless behavior and view of life and they have a romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xjfBIP8BCCkKDmSBlAfguUiW8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22916'),
  ('1100791533099031140', 'Elsa & Fred', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Steve Lonano, J.J. Dalton, Artist W. Robinson', 'Marcos Carnevale, Marcela Guerty, Lily Ann Martin', 'Shirley MacLaine, Christopher Plummer, Marcia Gay Harden, Wendell Pierce, Jared Gilman, Erika Alexander, Chris Noth, Scott Bakula', 'PG-13', 'After his daughter persuades him to move into a new apartment, aged widower Fred strikes up a friendship with his eccentric 74-year-old neighbour Elsa, who convinces him it''s never too late to keep enjoying life. Although he seemed resigned to a miserable bedridden existence, Fred embraces Elsa''s youthful enthusiasm as she introduces him to the path of life and entertains him with outlandish stories about her past life. But when he discovers Elsa''s terminally ill, Fred decides to accompany her on the trip of her dreams to the eternal city of Rome to help her fulfil a lifelong ambition.', 'After his daughter persuades him to move into a new apartment, aged widower Fred strikes up a friendship with his eccentric 74-year-old neighbour Elsa, who convinces him it''s never too late to keep enjoying life. Although he seemed resigned to a miserable bedridden existence, Fred embraces Elsa''s youthful enthusiasm as she introduces him to the path of life and entertains him with outlandish stories about her past life. But when he discovers Elsa''s terminally ill, Fred decides to accompany her on the trip of her dreams to the eternal city of Rome to help her fulfil a lifelong ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNzVwtlqOmPLVKD5zZIzAME9vYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268171'),
  ('612633021524513917', 'Elsa the Rose', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Willy Kurant, William Lubtchansky', 'Louis Aragon', 'Louis Aragon, Elsa Triolet, Michel Piccoli', 'NR', 'Images and poems of the celebrated couple Louis Aragon and Elsa Triolet. Elsa’s youth as recalled by Aragon, with commentary by Elsa.', 'Images and poems of the celebrated couple Louis Aragon and Elsa Triolet. Elsa’s youth as recalled by Aragon, with commentary by Elsa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwHCfHKKKjfrNnIzzINKaalHQtN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186361'),
  ('340656214964924502', 'Else', 2025, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Thibault Emin, Samuel Biboulian, Léo Lefèvre', 'Alice Butaud, Emma Sandona, Thibault Emin', 'Matthieu Sampeur, Dan Cohen, Lika Minamoto, Toni d''Antonio, Edith Proust, Camille Deveyrinas, Cyril Benoît, Lauriane Chesnel', null, 'Anx has just met Cass when a mysterious virus breaks out: everywhere, people’s bodies are merging with objects. Stuck in their apartment, the couple must face this dreadful threat.', 'Anx has just met Cass when a mysterious virus breaks out: everywhere, people’s bodies are merging with objects. Stuck in their apartment, the couple must face this dreadful threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg3mTKoKWFZ25z5luiHcy30GJBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136387'),
