  ('224884035341708663', 'Elsewhere - Alone in Africa', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Anselm Nathanael Pahnke, Janco Christiansen, Anselm Nathanael Pahnke', null, 'Anselm Nathanael Pahnke', null, '414 days, 15.000 km, 15 countries. On his 25th birthday, Anselm starts a journey across Africa on a bicycle with two friends. After they arrive in the scorching Kalahari Desert, the trio suddenly splits. His friends fly home while Anselm decides to continue the ride up north - alone.', '414 days, 15.000 km, 15 countries. On his 25th birthday, Anselm starts a journey across Africa on a bicycle with two friends. After they arrive in the scorching Kalahari Desert, the trio suddenly splits. His friends fly home while Anselm decides to continue the ride up north - alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQHgIALvjc5JHwCtUq4zxW1Yom7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559353'),
  ('1109103394161002082', 'Elstree Calling', 1930, 'Music, Comedy', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Jack Hulbert, Paul Murray', 'Adrian Brunel, Walter C. Mycroft, Val Valentine', 'Tommy Handley, Teddy Brown, Donald Calthrop, Jack Hulbert, Helen Burnell, The Three Eddies, Lily Morris, Will Fyffe', null, 'A series of 19 musical and comedy "vaudeville" sketches presented in the form of a live television broadcast hosted by Tommy Handley (as himself).', 'A series of 19 musical and comedy "vaudeville" sketches presented in the form of a live television broadcast hosted by Tommy Handley (as himself).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1fpRkO3YuNBrsBAsWIf3j3kC7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75793'),
  ('507197080231975636', 'Eltern', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Robert Thalheim', 'Jane Ainscough, Robert Thalheim', 'Christiane Paul, Charly Hübner, Maren Eggert, Paraschiva Dragus, Àlex Brendemühl, Clara Lago, Emilia Pieske, Daniela Holtz', null, 'Christine and Conrad are what we call modern parents nowadays: While he stays home to raise children, she makes a career as a doctor, earning big money. When Konrad with comes home with the offer to act as a theater director again, organizing the day-to-day family life becomes increasingly difficult. Who will take care of their daughters Emma and Kate? As it turns out, it is in fact not that easy to find a competent girl.', 'Christine and Conrad are what we call modern parents nowadays: While he stays home to raise children, she makes a career as a doctor, earning big money. When Konrad with comes home with the offer to act as a theater director again, organizing the day-to-day family life becomes increasingly difficult. Who will take care of their daughters Emma and Kate? As it turns out, it is in fact not that easy to find a competent girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ajhUxNhbOXS7UUsjkg55DnxDp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228384'),
  ('512974864641257883', 'Elton John Live: Farewell from Dodger Stadium', 2022, 'Music', 'Paul Dugdale', null, 'Elton John, Brandi Carlile, Kiki Dee, Dua Lipa, Davey Johnstone, Nigel Olsson, Ray Cooper, Kim Bullard', 'PG', 'A once-in-a-lifetime live, global original concert event offering fans from around the world a front-row seat to witness the groundbreaking magic of the Rocket Man back at Dodger Stadium and showcasing Elton John as audiences have never seen him before, paying tribute to the icon and the seminal moment in 1975 that cemented his global success.', 'A once-in-a-lifetime live, global original concert event offering fans from around the world a front-row seat to witness the groundbreaking magic of the Rocket Man back at Dodger Stadium and showcasing Elton John as audiences have never seen him before, paying tribute to the icon and the seminal moment in 1975 that cemented his global success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbV1dyczIIGHbQIb1IeGTzm5D6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1050281'),
  ('679209925154695871', 'Elton John: Never Too Late', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'R. J. Cutler, David Furnish', null, 'Elton John, Bernie Taupin, Dua Lipa, John Lennon, David Furnish, Alex Petridis, Yoko Ono', 'PG-13', 'Sir Elton John looks back on his life and the astonishing early days of his 50-year career in this emotionally charged, full-circle journey. As he prepares for his final concert in North America at Dodger Stadium, Elton takes us back in time and recounts his struggles with adversity, abuse, and addiction, and how he overcame them to become the icon he is today.', 'Sir Elton John looks back on his life and the astonishing early days of his 50-year career in this emotionally charged, full-circle journey. As he prepares for his final concert in North America at Dodger Stadium, Elton takes us back in time and recounts his struggles with adversity, abuse, and addiction, and how he overcame them to become the icon he is today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFvflqdWsrKLwh28VgOurgRlnPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977326'),
  ('926568762144508187', 'Elton John: Tantrums & Tiaras', 1997, 'Documentary, Music', 'David Furnish, David Furnish', 'David Furnish', 'Elton John, David Furnish, John Reid, Lulu, Bob Halley, Tony Parsons, Sheila Farebrother', 'PG', 'Unprecedented access into one of the world''s greatest musical talents and his larger than life lifestyle: Elton John. With frank, funny, and touching filmmaking, this documentary is a fascinating and honest look at the complex character of a modern day composer and performing artist.', 'Unprecedented access into one of the world''s greatest musical talents and his larger than life lifestyle: Elton John. With frank, funny, and touching filmmaking, this documentary is a fascinating and honest look at the complex character of a modern day composer and performing artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e377HQKpgrO42fbGloqkhDMyTk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17916'),
  ('49637793486895771', 'Elves', 1989, 'Horror', 'Jeffrey Mandel, Denise Strong, Ted Ferrari', 'Jeffrey Mandel, Mike Griffin, Bruce A. Taylor', 'Dan Haggerty, Julie Austin, Deanna Lund, Borah Silver, Mansell Rivers-Bland, Christopher Graham, Laura Lichstein, Stacey Dye', null, 'While conducting a pagan ritual in the woods with her friends, Kirsten inadvertently awakens the spirit of a demonic Christmas elf involved in a neo-Nazi plot to bring about the master race. After the rent-a-Santa in her department store is murdered, an unemployed, alcoholic ex-cop takes the job and the two set out to unravel the mystery.', 'While conducting a pagan ritual in the woods with her friends, Kirsten inadvertently awakens the spirit of a demonic Christmas elf involved in a neo-Nazi plot to bring about the master race. After the rent-a-Santa in her department store is murdered, an unemployed, alcoholic ex-cop takes the job and the two set out to unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh4T4xqhSTZ06TuHpJWc5H0DLyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30452'),
  ('284317644585682455', 'Elvira I Will Give You My Life But I''m Using It', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Manolo Caro, Mateo Londoño', 'Manolo Caro', 'Cecilia Suárez, Luis Gerardo Méndez, Vanessa Bauche, Angie Cepeda, Mariana Treviño, Carlos Bardem, Zuria Vega, Angélica Aragón', null, 'Elvira had a fight with her husband, he went to purchase some cigarettes but he never came back, now Elvira is searching for him.', 'Elvira had a fight with her husband, he went to purchase some cigarettes but he never came back, now Elvira is searching for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsN46YJ0OvzA0gPMQNNT10GUhye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267797'),
  ('145549325200012139', 'Elvira Madigan', 1967, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Jörgen Persson, Bo Widerberg, Kalle Boman', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Pia Degermark, Thommy Berggren, Lennart Malmer, Cleo Jensen, Nina Widerberg, Yvonne Ingdal', 'PG', 'Famous acrobat Elvira Madigan meets Sixten Sparre, a married Swedish officer with two children. They decide to elope, but since Sparre deserted the army, he''s unemployable and the couple encounter various hardships.', 'Famous acrobat Elvira Madigan meets Sixten Sparre, a married Swedish officer with two children. They decide to elope, but since Sparre deserted the army, he''s unemployable and the couple encounter various hardships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odjkOW8BYVTj1q73Ad5KIHFfAge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42692'),
  ('1097447453788916700', 'Elvira: Mistress of the Dark', 1988, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'James Signorelli, Hanania Baer', 'John Paragon, Sam Egan, Cassandra Peterson', 'Cassandra Peterson, William Morgan Sheppard, Daniel Greene, Edie McClurg, Susan Kellermann, Jeff Conaway, Ellen Dunning, Ira Heiden', 'PG-13', 'Arriving in the small town of Fallwell, Massachusetts to claim her inheritance, horror hostess Elvira receives a less than enthusiastic reception from the conservative locals, including her sinister uncle Vincent.', 'Arriving in the small town of Fallwell, Massachusetts to claim her inheritance, horror hostess Elvira receives a less than enthusiastic reception from the conservative locals, including her sinister uncle Vincent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tr9ajyzn0xRZhgp30SMdwhzFNJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5680'),
  ('664236257480323238', 'Elvira''s Haunted Hills', 2002, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Viorel Sergovici, Sam Irvin', 'John Paragon, Cassandra Peterson', 'Cassandra Peterson, Mary Jo Smith, Richard O''Brien, Mary Scheer, Scott Atkinson, Heather Hopper, Gabi Andronache, Jerry Jackson', 'PG-13', 'The setting is Carpathia. The year is 1851. When Elvira gets kicked out of an Inn for a slight monetary discrepancy, she is rescued by a local who takes her to stay at the castle in the hills high above the village. The fact that she happens to resemble the count''s former "missing" wife opens a can of worms or two.', 'The setting is Carpathia. The year is 1851. When Elvira gets kicked out of an Inn for a slight monetary discrepancy, she is rescued by a local who takes her to stay at the castle in the hills high above the village. The fact that she happens to resemble the count''s former "missing" wife opens a can of worms or two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woQR7BvgP8ZfuUrUg5bFQKNRRmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21597'),
  ('522597266318041250', 'Elvis', 1979, 'Drama, Music, TV Movie, History', 'John Carpenter, Donald M. Morgan', 'Anthony Lawrence', 'Kurt Russell, Shelley Winters, Bing Russell, Robert Gray, Pat Hingle, Season Hubley, Melody Anderson, Ed Begley Jr.', 'PG', 'This biopic traces Elvis Presley’s life from his impoverished childhood to his meteoric rise to stardom to his triumphant conquering of Las Vegas.', 'This biopic traces Elvis Presley’s life from his impoverished childhood to his meteoric rise to stardom to his triumphant conquering of Las Vegas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYsrWZrLZMH9duwXPtaoheunUz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40047'),
  ('732070428319055055', 'Elvis', 2022, 'Music, History, Drama', 'Mandy Walker, Ian Gracie, Tony Drew', 'Jeremy Doner, Sam Bromell, Baz Luhrmann', 'Austin Butler, Tom Hanks, Olivia DeJonge, Helen Thomson, Richard Roxburgh, Kelvin Harrison Jr., David Wenham, Kodi Smit-McPhee', 'PG-13', 'The life story of Elvis Presley as seen through the complicated relationship with his enigmatic manager, Colonel Tom Parker.', 'The life story of Elvis Presley as seen through the complicated relationship with his enigmatic manager, Colonel Tom Parker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rva3UhKaMeiB0Vej5A2pm1leX7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614934'),
  ('713768104476962087', 'Elvis - Aloha from Hawaii', 1973, 'Music, Documentary', 'John Freschi, Marty Pasetta', 'Elvis Presley', 'Elvis Presley, James Burton, Ronnie Tutt, Jerry Scheff, Glen D. Hardin, Charlie Hodge, J.D. Sumner, John Wilkinson', null, 'A 1973 concert by Elvis Presley that was broadcast live via satellite on January 14, 1973. The concert took place at the Honolulu International Center in Honolulu and aired in over 40 countries across Asia and Europe. Viewing figures have been estimated at over 1 billion viewers world wide, and the show was the most expensive entertainment special at the time, costing $2.5 million.', 'A 1973 concert by Elvis Presley that was broadcast live via satellite on January 14, 1973. The concert took place at the Honolulu International Center in Honolulu and aired in over 40 countries across Asia and Europe. Viewing figures have been estimated at over 1 billion viewers world wide, and the show was the most expensive entertainment special at the time, costing $2.5 million.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfvtF7Ojwb40Q9gWLOufuqdkT72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53024'),
  ('990369462367707301', 'Elvis & Anabelle', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Will Geiger, Conrad W. Hall', 'Will Geiger', 'Blake Lively, Max Minghella, Joe Mantegna, Mary Steenburgen, Keith Carradine, Eloise DeJoria, John Franklin, Everett Sifuentes', 'PG-13', 'A small-town beauty queen and an unlicensed mortician set out across the Texas plains on a journey of self-discovery.', 'A small-town beauty queen and an unlicensed mortician set out across the Texas plains on a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYucJWWJiTQVDwwbjhHIu1aDp5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19554'),
  ('788712957002521486', 'Elvis & Madonna', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tatiana Fragoso, Marcelo Laffitte, Leonardo Carvalho', 'José de Carvalho, Marcelo Laffitte', 'Simone Spoladore, Igor Cotrim, Sérgio Bezerra, Maitê Proença, Buza Ferraz, José Wilker, Romeu Evaristo, Duse Nacaratti', null, 'In Copacabana, lesbian photographer Elvis is hired to deliver pizzas in the night shift on her motorcycle. Her first assignment is a delivery to the transgender hairdresser Lady Madonna, whom she falls in love with.', 'In Copacabana, lesbian photographer Elvis is hired to deliver pizzas in the night shift on her motorcycle. Her first assignment is a delivery to the transgender hairdresser Lady Madonna, whom she falls in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojjtU1TpBAUu26NDnbM8AiFJa0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129400'),
  ('655448489614159513', 'Elvis & Nixon', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Liza Johnson, Aaron J. Stone, Terry Stacey', 'Cary Elwes, Joey Sagal, Hanala Sagal', 'Kevin Spacey, Michael Shannon, Alex Pettyfer, Johnny Knoxville, Colin Hanks, Evan Peters, Tate Donovan, Sky Ferreira', 'R', 'In 1970, a few days before Christmas, Elvis Presley showed up on the White House lawn seeking to be deputized into the Bureau of Narcotics and Dangerous Drugs by the President himself.', 'In 1970, a few days before Christmas, Elvis Presley showed up on the White House lawn seeking to be deputized into the Bureau of Narcotics and Dangerous Drugs by the President himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwUXhwUAOq3J7ixxwOIWpMAFbje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301348'),
  ('399534678100464936', 'Elvis and Me', 1988, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Larry Peerce', null, 'Susan Walters, Dale Midkiff, Jon Cypher, Billy Green Bush, Anne Haney, Marshall R. Teague, Elden Henson, Linda Miller', null, 'Priscilla remembers her life and her relationship with Elvis Presley since she was 14 years old. When she moves to Graceland, she feels like a princess. But her lover, the world-famous musician Elvis Presley, is rarely at home and increasingly resorts to drugs. Nevertheless, she decides to marry Elvis. After a while, the fairy tale slowly turns into a nightmare and the two seem to become estranged.', 'Priscilla remembers her life and her relationship with Elvis Presley since she was 14 years old. When she moves to Graceland, she feels like a princess. But her lover, the world-famous musician Elvis Presley, is rarely at home and increasingly resorts to drugs. Nevertheless, she decides to marry Elvis. After a while, the fairy tale slowly turns into a nightmare and the two seem to become estranged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8Z3KizVe5FVSlXdrGP0RLW5Hym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23178'),
  ('185521893775377539', 'Elvis Gratton 2: Miracle à Memphis', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Falardeau, Alain Dostie', 'Pierre Falardeau, Julien Poulin', 'Julien Poulin, Yves Trudel, Pierre Ébert, Khanh Hua, Barry Blake, Jacques Thériault, Gilles-Philippe Delorme, Michelle Sirois', null, 'Elvis Gratton, dead for three days, comes back to life.', 'Elvis Gratton, dead for three days, comes back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kakIUI140UwDwH2mDAnOHPDh7g9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60219'),
