  ('255168297405942434', 'Elvis Has Left the Building', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joel Zwick, Paul Elliott', 'Mitchell P Ganem, Adam-Michael Garber', 'Kim Basinger, Angie Dickinson, Denise Richards, John Corbett, Annie Potts, Jenny Gabrielle, Sean Astin, Tom Hanks', null, 'Harmony had an encounter early in life with the young Elvis, and can''t seem to shake his influence. Now a Pink Lady selling cosmetics, she seems to inadvertently bring harm to any Elvis impersonators she encounters. After a bizarre car accident leaves a slew of them dead, Harmony goes on the run from the authorities, hooking up with a downtrodden ad exec who has Elvis troubles of his own.', 'Harmony had an encounter early in life with the young Elvis, and can''t seem to shake his influence. Now a Pink Lady selling cosmetics, she seems to inadvertently bring harm to any Elvis impersonators she encounters. After a bizarre car accident leaves a slew of them dead, Harmony goes on the run from the authorities, hooking up with a downtrodden ad exec who has Elvis troubles of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfIRJpLwR0yGAj6PmWMHZVU8mB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37641'),
  ('618946251201231351', 'Elvis Meets Nixon', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Allan Arkush, Michael Storey', 'Allan Arkush', 'Rick Peters, Bob Gunton, Alyson Court, Denny Doherty, Jackie Burroughs, Curtis Armstrong, Gabriel Hogan, Robbi Jay Thuet', 'PG-13', 'A "mockumentary" about Elvis''s real-life trip to the White House to become a federal marshal under the DEA', 'A "mockumentary" about Elvis''s real-life trip to the White House to become a federal marshal under the DEA', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXiFfze9fHOuxgjf3OP7jbTXZ9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45120'),
  ('1048470131508330418', 'Elvis on Tour', 1972, 'Documentary, Music', 'Robert E. Thomas, Robert Abel, Pierre Adidge', 'Pierre Adidge, Robert Abel', 'Elvis Presley, James Burton, John Wilkinson, Jerry Scheff, Glen D. Hardin, Ronnie Tutt, Kathy Westmoreland, J.D. Sumner', 'G', 'This documentary captures Elvis Presley on his 1972 American tour and includes rehearsals, interviews, archival television appearances and backstage moments. With Elvis at his most flamboyant, the film features well-known hits and cover songs showcasing his country, gospel and rhythm-and-blues influences.', 'This documentary captures Elvis Presley on his 1972 American tour and includes rehearsals, interviews, archival television appearances and backstage moments. With Elvis at his most flamboyant, the film features well-known hits and cover songs showcasing his country, gospel and rhythm-and-blues influences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXxKJuQnkwFtWvOX161ppbaiaC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42482'),
  ('378026256126188958', 'Elvis: That''s the Way It Is', 1970, 'Documentary, Music', 'Denis Sanders, Lucien Ballard, John Wilson', null, 'Elvis Presley, James Burton, John Wilkinson, Charlie Hodge, Jerry Scheff, Glen D. Hardin, Ronnie Tutt, Cary Grant', 'PG', 'On July 31, 1970, in Las Vegas, Nevada, Elvis Presley staged a triumphant return to the concert stage from which he had been absent for almost a decade. His series of concerts broke all box office records and completely reenergized the career of the King of Rock ‘n’ Roll.', 'On July 31, 1970, in Las Vegas, Nevada, Elvis Presley staged a triumphant return to the concert stage from which he had been absent for almost a decade. His series of concerts broke all box office records and completely reenergized the career of the King of Rock ‘n’ Roll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snU2ElTb6OEQO6vrMx7KnhjTkAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31151'),
  ('920668746468975157', 'Elyas', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mobsitte Saad, Diane Capo, Valentin Rodriguez', 'Nicolas Laquerrière, Florent-Emilio Siri', 'Roschdy Zem, Laëtitia Eïdo, Nabil Elouahabi, Sherwan Haji, Dimitri Storoge, Jeanne Michel, Frédéric Maranber, Aguibou Ba', null, 'Elyas, a former Special Forces soldier who has become paranoid since a mission in Afghanistan, is recruited to ensure the safety of Amina and her daughter Nour, 13 years old, both of whom came from the Middle East for the holidays. As he takes office, Elyas senses something is up.', 'Elyas, a former Special Forces soldier who has become paranoid since a mission in Afghanistan, is recruited to ensure the safety of Amina and her daughter Nour, 13 years old, both of whom came from the Middle East for the holidays. As he takes office, Elyas senses something is up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXEv9qa9W03bWR8fqxrHwrqxRXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154215'),
  ('377801757842510081', 'Elysia, Valley of the Nude', 1933, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Carl Harbaugh, William Sullivan', null, 'Constance Allen, James Mack, Hobart Glassey, Bryan Foy', null, 'James Mack, a reporter for the International News Bureau, is assigned by his editor to do a story on the phenomenon of nudist camps.', 'James Mack, a reporter for the International News Bureau, is assigned by his editor to do a story on the phenomenon of nudist camps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ50PFryecT5YjnsocpS8Mr6BVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199071'),
  ('1048982322953119289', 'Elysium', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Neill Blomkamp, Trent Opaloch, Luis Antonio Ordoñez', 'Neill Blomkamp', 'Matt Damon, Jodie Foster, Sharlto Copley, Diego Luna, Wagner Moura, Alice Braga, William Fichtner, Jose Pablo Cantillo', 'R', 'In the year 2159, two classes of people exist: the very wealthy who live on a pristine man-made space station called Elysium, and the rest, who live on an overpopulated, ruined Earth. Secretary Rhodes, a hard line government official, will stop at nothing to enforce anti-immigration laws and preserve the luxurious lifestyle of the citizens of Elysium. That doesn’t stop the people of Earth from trying to get in, by any means they can. When unlucky Max is backed into a corner, he agrees to take on a daunting mission that, if successful, will not only save his life, but could bring equality to these polarized worlds.', 'In the year 2159, two classes of people exist: the very wealthy who live on a pristine man-made space station called Elysium, and the rest, who live on an overpopulated, ruined Earth. Secretary Rhodes, a hard line government official, will stop at nothing to enforce anti-immigration laws and preserve the luxurious lifestyle of the citizens of Elysium. That doesn’t stop the people of Earth from trying to get in, by any means they can. When unlucky Max is backed into a corner, he agrees to take on a daunting mission that, if successful, will not only save his life, but could bring equality to these polarized worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiiXHBd9oUrtUa4YqZiAoy05cRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68724'),
  ('949552902598872455', 'Em Nome da Lei', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Sérgio Rezende, Nonato Estrela, Pedro Bromfman', 'Rodrigo Lages', 'Mateus Solano, Paolla Oliveira, Chico Diaz, Eduardo Galvão, Emílio Dantas, Sílvio Guindane, Roberto Birindelli, Carolina Chalita', null, 'The journey of idealistic Vitor, a young federal judge who decides to dismantle the mafia that dominates the border between Brazil and Paraguay. Inspired by true events.', 'The journey of idealistic Vitor, a young federal judge who decides to dismantle the mafia that dominates the border between Brazil and Paraguay. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaPq2uwKxdHnInkGT9M1XA2Ytfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359806'),
  ('741285537319852917', 'Ema', 2019, 'Drama', 'Pablo Larraín, Sergio Armstrong, Oscar Godoy', 'Guillermo Calderón, Alejandro Moreno, Pablo Larraín', 'Mariana Di Girolamo, Gael García Bernal, Santiago Cabrera, Paola Giannini, Cristián Suárez, Mariana Loyola, Catalina Saavedra, Susana Hidalgo', 'R', 'Ema is a magnetic and impulsive dancer in a reggaeton troupe. Her toxic marriage to choreographer Gastón is beyond repair, following a decision to give up on their adopted child Polo. She sets out on a mission to get him back, not caring who she’ll need to fight, seduce or destroy to make it happen.', 'Ema is a magnetic and impulsive dancer in a reggaeton troupe. Her toxic marriage to choreographer Gastón is beyond repair, following a decision to give up on their adopted child Polo. She sets out on a mission to get him back, not caring who she’ll need to fight, seduce or destroy to make it happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9p78EwUeo7NkFFCIBzU8jwxC867.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540709'),
  ('165385706592111404', 'Emak-Bakia', 1926, 'Documentary', 'Man Ray', 'Man Ray', 'Kiki of Montparnasse, Jacques Rigaut', null, 'Emak-Bakia (Basque for Leave me alone) is a 1926 film directed by Man Ray. Subtitled as a cinépoéme, it features many techniques Man Ray used in his still photography (for which he is better known), including Rayographs, double exposure, soft focus and ambiguous features. The film features sculptures by Pablo Picasso, and some of Man Ray''s mathematical objects both still and animated using a stop motion technique.', 'Emak-Bakia (Basque for Leave me alone) is a 1926 film directed by Man Ray. Subtitled as a cinépoéme, it features many techniques Man Ray used in his still photography (for which he is better known), including Rayographs, double exposure, soft focus and ambiguous features. The film features sculptures by Pablo Picasso, and some of Man Ray''s mathematical objects both still and animated using a stop motion technique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCG53pUPRTlcex0CWYATpjho7hT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135318'),
  ('910611096179165149', 'Emanuelle and Françoise', 1975, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato, Alessandro Osetti', 'Joe D''Amato, Bruno Mattei', 'George Eastman, Rosemarie Lindt, Annie Carol Edel, Patrizia Gori, Maria Rosaria Riuzzi, Massimo Vanni, Eolo Capritti, Giorgio Fieri', null, 'Emanuelle is out to avenge her sister, who committed suicide after escaping from her sadistic lover Carlo. So she chains Carlo up in her basement, drugs him, and forces him to watch her having sex. As Carlo begins to hallucinate all kinds of bloody horrors and cannibalistic doings, he decides he has to break free and kill Emanuelle.', 'Emanuelle is out to avenge her sister, who committed suicide after escaping from her sadistic lover Carlo. So she chains Carlo up in her basement, drugs him, and forces him to watch her having sex. As Carlo begins to hallucinate all kinds of bloody horrors and cannibalistic doings, he decides he has to break free and kill Emanuelle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUoOevPp0bDjXjfXLU86G73lJZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50438'),
