  ('958587415065231756', 'Ember', 2016, 'Drama', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Aslihan Gurbuz, Taner Birsel, Caner Cindoruk, İştar Gökseven, Çağlar Çorumlu, Dolunay Soysert, Talha Yayıkçı, Berat Özdemir', null, 'When her husband Cemal is arrested in Romania, Emine is left alone with their child who needs immediate surgery.', 'When her husband Cemal is arrested in Romania, Emine is left alone with their child who needs immediate surgery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/varN1iNhY2IDjBOzX1czzNcDbGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394159'),
  ('128981493430921413', 'Embers', 2015, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Claire Carré, Todd Antonio Somodevilla', 'Claire Carré, Charles Spano', 'Jason Ritter, Iva Gocheva, Greta Fernández, Tucker Smallwood, Karl Glusman, Silvan Friedman, Roberto Cots, Dominique Swain', null, 'After a global neurological epidemic, those who remain search for meaning and connection in a world without memory. Five interwoven stories each explore a different facet of life without memory in a future that has no past.', 'After a global neurological epidemic, those who remain search for meaning and connection in a world without memory. Five interwoven stories each explore a different facet of life without memory in a future that has no past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pdOleZZ8jdXq7gPIdNvoRRcYrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358644'),
