  ('1020781194839032725', 'Embrace of the Vampire', 2013, 'Horror', 'Carl Bessai, Robert Aschmann, Collin Leadlay', 'Sheldon Roper, Andrew C. Erin', 'Sharon Hinnendael, Kaniehtiio Horn, C.C. Sheffield, Chelsey Reist, Victor Webster, Robert Moloney, Ryan Kennedy, Keegan Connor Tracy', 'NR', 'Sharon Hinnendael stars as Charlotte, a timid and sheltered teen who has just left an all-girls Catholic school for a new life at a co-ed university. But an ancient evil has followed her here, tormenting her with disturbing nightmares and tempting her with forbidden desires. It is a hunger that can only be satiated by sensual pleasures of the flesh...and a thirst for blood. It''s a battle for her soul... and one she''s losing. But Charlotte is a fighter. The chaos and torment threatens to unleash her own inner beast, and anyone even close to her may find themselves embracing their own horrific fate.', 'Sharon Hinnendael stars as Charlotte, a timid and sheltered teen who has just left an all-girls Catholic school for a new life at a co-ed university. But an ancient evil has followed her here, tormenting her with disturbing nightmares and tempting her with forbidden desires. It is a hunger that can only be satiated by sensual pleasures of the flesh...and a thirst for blood. It''s a battle for her soul... and one she''s losing. But Charlotte is a fighter. The chaos and torment threatens to unleash her own inner beast, and anyone even close to her may find themselves embracing their own horrific fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIJhLiYmqFd9SoKaFmO3gJFsWfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224908'),
  ('610614263878385672', 'Embrace the Darkness', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kelley Cauthen, Maximo Munzi, Roger Olkowski', 'Rick Bitzelberger', 'Madison Clark, Angelia High, Kevin Spirtas, Brad Bartram, Colleen McDermott, Jennifer Ludlow, Cliff Potts, Jason Schnuit', 'R', 'Vampires Galen and Miranda have just moved to a renovated warehouse in Los Angeles. Galen is tired of the vampiric life and becomes attracted to Jennifer, a dancer living in the building opposite who is trying to perfect a piece of erotic performance art.', 'Vampires Galen and Miranda have just moved to a renovated warehouse in Los Angeles. Galen is tired of the vampiric life and becomes attracted to Jennifer, a dancer living in the building opposite who is trying to perfect a piece of erotic performance art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2TmCzmEgW5bfsMyAeN5Itfu23h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28624'),
  ('309501574803425516', 'Embrace the Panda: Making Turning Red', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Erica Milsom', null, 'Domee Shi, Rona Liu, Lindsey Collins, Danielle Feinberg, Rosalie Chiang, Andrew Stanton, Sandra Oh', 'G', 'A feature length documentary about the all-women team at the helm of Pixar''s original feature, Turning Red. With unprecedented behind-the-scenes access to Director Domee Shi and her core leadership crew, this story shines a light on the powerful professional and personal journeys that brought this incredibly comical, utterly relatable, and deeply heartfelt story to the screen.', 'A feature length documentary about the all-women team at the helm of Pixar''s original feature, Turning Red. With unprecedented behind-the-scenes access to Director Domee Shi and her core leadership crew, this story shines a light on the powerful professional and personal journeys that brought this incredibly comical, utterly relatable, and deeply heartfelt story to the screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ociUlULY2vZkenQqwTnwK4aq2Y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940075'),
  ('169291537438765572', 'Embryo', 1976, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ralph Nelson, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Anita Doohan, Jack W. Thomas', 'Rock Hudson, Barbara Carrera, Diane Ladd, Roddy McDowall, Anne Schedeen, John Elerick, Vincent Baggetta, Jack Colvin', 'PG', 'A scientist doing experiments on a human fetus discovers a method to accelerate the fetus into a mature adult in just a few days.', 'A scientist doing experiments on a human fetus discovers a method to accelerate the fetus into a mature adult in just a few days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96NDgMsfzQl0AfcBOX8t0JaNtfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113525'),
  ('478274991969519317', 'Embryo', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Rebolledo, Francisco Inostroza, Juan Pablo Arriagada', 'Barry Keating', 'Romina Perazzo, Domingo Guzmán, Cristian Cuentrejo, Luis Vitalino Grandón, Carolina Escobar, Manuel Navarrete, Vittorio Farfán, Patricio Valladares', null, 'Kevin and his girlfriend Evelyn are camping in the woods when she is abducted and impregnated by otherworldly beings. As the entity within her begins to grow, Evelyn discovers that her cravings can only be satisfied by human flesh and blood.', 'Kevin and his girlfriend Evelyn are camping in the woods when she is abducted and impregnated by otherworldly beings. As the entity within her begins to grow, Evelyn discovers that her cravings can only be satisfied by human flesh and blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxbI3kT9mvlc6Yh14xCKFbd0RvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749051'),
  ('1013529972484328715', 'Emelie', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Thelin, Luca Del Puppo, Ryan Monolopolus', null, 'Sarah Bolger, Susan Pourfar, Chris Beetem, Joshua Rush, Thomas Bair, Carly Adams, Elizabeth Jayne Stillwell, Frank Rossi', 'NR', 'After their regular babysitter cancels, the Thompson family turns to her friend, Anna to supervise their children while the parents go out to celebrate their anniversary. At first Anna seems like a dream come true to the kids, allowing them to eat extra cookies and play with things that are usually off-limits, but as her behaviour becomes increasingly odd, the kids soon find out that her intentions are dark and twisted—and she is not who she seems to be.', 'After their regular babysitter cancels, the Thompson family turns to her friend, Anna to supervise their children while the parents go out to celebrate their anniversary. At first Anna seems like a dream come true to the kids, allowing them to eat extra cookies and play with things that are usually off-limits, but as her behaviour becomes increasingly odd, the kids soon find out that her intentions are dark and twisted—and she is not who she seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfb1kzY0V4j0KKPLYMfXEo3t3op.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329010'),
  ('87840069018663204', 'Emerald City', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Jenkins, Paul Murphy, Chris Webb', 'David Williamson', 'Nicole Kidman, John Hargreaves, Chris Haywood, Robyn Nevin, Ruth Cracknell, Dennis Miller, Nicholas Hammond, Ella Scott', null, 'A couple move to Sydney from Melbourne, and soon become lured by the bright lights of the big city. Colin, the scriptwriter husband, is corrupted by his editor and then falls for the girlfriend of his writing partner, while Colin''s wife Kate begins to lose sight of her ideals in a new world of hustlers and cynics.', 'A couple move to Sydney from Melbourne, and soon become lured by the bright lights of the big city. Colin, the scriptwriter husband, is corrupted by his editor and then falls for the girlfriend of his writing partner, while Colin''s wife Kate begins to lose sight of her ideals in a new world of hustlers and cynics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Cg7riuGHtke7Od8ywr7HJqSAG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66737'),
  ('266984518690341721', 'Emerald Green', 2016, 'Fantasy, Action, Mystery', 'Katharina Schöde, Felix Fuchssteiner', 'Katharina Schöde, Barry Thomson, Felix Fuchssteiner', 'Maria Ehrich, Jannis Niewöhner, Peter Simonischek, Josefine Preuß, Florian Bartholomäi, Laura Berlin, Johannes von Matuschka, Johannes Silberschneider', null, 'Emerald Green is the stunning conclusion to Kerstin Gier''s Ruby Red Trilogy, picking up where Sapphire Blue left off, reaching new heights of intrigue and romance as Gwen finally uncovers the secrets of the time-traveling society and learns her fate.', 'Emerald Green is the stunning conclusion to Kerstin Gier''s Ruby Red Trilogy, picking up where Sapphire Blue left off, reaching new heights of intrigue and romance as Gwen finally uncovers the secrets of the time-traveling society and learns her fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIBLt7TVRu22cWtQiMptNUoJ9Ho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337556'),
  ('956325775481644454', 'Emergency', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Carey Williams, Michael Dallatorre', 'K.D. Dávila', 'Donald Watkins, RJ Cyler, Sebastian Chacon, Sabrina Carpenter, Maddie Nichols, Madison Thompson, Diego Abraham, Summer Madison', 'R', 'Ready for a night of legendary partying, three college students must weigh the pros and cons of calling the police when faced with an unexpected situation.', 'Ready for a night of legendary partying, three college students must weigh the pros and cons of calling the police when faced with an unexpected situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVIa7Ynom2k96mNRXulOpTWP6SF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819309'),
  ('954459022291160051', 'Emergency Declaration', 2022, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Kim Jung-woo, Lee Mo-gae, Park Jong-cheol', 'Han Jae-rim', 'Song Kang-ho, Lee Byung-hun, Jeon Do-yeon, Kim Nam-gil, Yim Si-wan, Kim So-jin, Park Hae-joon, Do Yeong-seo', null, 'While investigating a terroristic threat that goes viral online, Korean authorities discover that a suspect has recently boarded an international flight bound for the United States. When a healthy passenger on the same flight suddenly dies a gruesome death of unknown cause, panic erupts both in-flight and on the ground. With steadily decreasing fuel and international refusals to offer aid, the captain and crew will be forced to take unprecedented emergency measures in an attempt to save the lives of their passengers.', 'While investigating a terroristic threat that goes viral online, Korean authorities discover that a suspect has recently boarded an international flight bound for the United States. When a healthy passenger on the same flight suddenly dies a gruesome death of unknown cause, panic erupts both in-flight and on the ground. With steadily decreasing fuel and international refusals to offer aid, the captain and crew will be forced to take unprecedented emergency measures in an attempt to save the lives of their passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7kaQG5MbraSLibOuTpo0gtMxRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626872'),
  ('1044888552260801', 'Emergency Kisses', 1989, 'Drama', 'Philippe Garrel, Jacques Loiseleux', 'Marc Cholodenko, Philippe Garrel', 'Brigitte Sy, Philippe Garrel, Louis Garrel, Anémone, Maurice Garrel, Yvette Etiévant, Jacques Kébadian, Valérie Dréville', null, 'When film director Mathieu casts a famous actress to portray a character based on his aspiring-actress wife, he creates a rift in his marriage. French filmmaker Philippe Garrel''s family members portray versions of themselves in this lyrical drama.', 'When film director Mathieu casts a famous actress to portray a character based on his aspiring-actress wife, he creates a rift in his marriage. French filmmaker Philippe Garrel''s family members portray versions of themselves in this lyrical drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWQG0J7GpG0JyHwDMrgwbI0TnFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65885'),
  ('703808123207061057', 'Emergency Squad', 1974, 'Action, Thriller', 'Stelvio Massi, Sergio Rubini, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Gianfranco Barberi, Adriano Bolzoni, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Tomas Milian, Gastone Moschin, Stefania Casini, Mario Carotenuto, Ray Lovelock, Ilaria Guerrini, Guido Leontini, Marcello Venditti', null, 'A ruthless Interpol agent goes after the man who killed his wife in Stelvio Massi''s crime thriller. A gutsy robber named Marseilles pulls off a tricky heist, but he''s no match for agent Ravelli, a maverick who can''t control his bloodlust. And this time, it''s personal: Years earlier, the daring thief murdered the operative''s wife in cold blood.', 'A ruthless Interpol agent goes after the man who killed his wife in Stelvio Massi''s crime thriller. A gutsy robber named Marseilles pulls off a tricky heist, but he''s no match for agent Ravelli, a maverick who can''t control his bloodlust. And this time, it''s personal: Years earlier, the daring thief murdered the operative''s wife in cold blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6iReP0yZzXCoQ1vKlrPCQhli8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90100'),
  ('355997500270441344', 'Emicida: AmarElo - It''s All for Yesterday', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Fred Ouro Preto', null, 'Emicida, Fernanda Montenegro, Zeca Pagodinho, Pabllo Vittar, Majur, MC Tha, Marcos Valle, Henrique Vieira', null, 'Between scenes from his concert in São Paulo''s oft-inaccessible Theatro Municipal, rapper and activist Emicida celebrates the rich legacy of Black Brazilian culture.', 'Between scenes from his concert in São Paulo''s oft-inaccessible Theatro Municipal, rapper and activist Emicida celebrates the rich legacy of Black Brazilian culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afVApltOyuDj5Dgq8OB99SqJ6v9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765613'),
  ('179250744744399237', 'Emil and the Detectives', 1931, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Gerhard Lamprecht, Werner Brandes', 'Erich Kästner, Billy Wilder, Emeric Pressburger', 'Rolf Wenkhaus, Käthe Haack, Fritz Rasp, Rudolf Biebrach, Olga Engl, Inge Landgut, Hans Joachim Schaufuß, Hans Richter', null, 'When a suspicious man bribes Emil with chocolate in return for a bundle of cash, the young lad thinks of a plan to catch him.', 'When a suspicious man bribes Emil with chocolate in return for a bundle of cash, the young lad thinks of a plan to catch him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPp6CLxZTWNfCGhoNXIoYsiFlkJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4540'),
  ('1097730284294183086', 'Emil and the Detectives', 1954, 'Family, Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Robert A. Stemmle, Kurt Schulz, Oscar Martay', 'Billy Wilder, Robert A. Stemmle', 'Peter Finkbeiner, Heli Finkenzeller, Wolfgang Lukschy, Kurt Meisel, Ruth Nimbach, Margarete Haagen, Camilla Spira, Hans Dieter Zeidler', null, 'Emil goes to Berlin to see his grandmother with a large amount of money and is offered sweets by a strange man that make him sleep. He wakes up at his stop with no money. It is up to him and a group of children to save the day.', 'Emil goes to Berlin to see his grandmother with a large amount of money and is offered sweets by a strange man that make him sleep. He wakes up at his stop with no money. It is up to him and a group of children to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a3UNrVwPkhAYxSl7hUJPqOLYOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4544'),
  ('1053854124726792601', 'Emil and the Detectives', 1964, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Tewksbury, Günther Senftleben', 'AJ Carothers', 'Walter Slezak, Bryan Russell, Roger Mobley, Heinz Schubert, Peter Ehrlich, Cindy Cassell, Elsa Wagner, Eva Ingeborg Scholz', 'PG', 'When Emil travels by bus to Berlin to visit his family, his money is stolen by a crook who specializes in digging tunnels. While following the thief, Emil runs into Gustav, a young boy who gathers up all his friends to help Emil find the money. However, they get into more trouble than they bargained for when Emil''s pickpocket turns out to be mixed up with a couple of notorious bank robbers.', 'When Emil travels by bus to Berlin to visit his family, his money is stolen by a crook who specializes in digging tunnels. While following the thief, Emil runs into Gustav, a young boy who gathers up all his friends to help Emil find the money. However, they get into more trouble than they bargained for when Emil''s pickpocket turns out to be mixed up with a couple of notorious bank robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yJCj1A8za6V2z6o5d8hn5XSCDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4542'),
  ('284232716457657708', 'Emil and the Detectives', 2001, 'Comedy, Family', 'Franziska Buch, Hannes Hubach', 'Franziska Buch', 'Tobias Retzlaff, Anja Sommavilla, Jürgen Vogel, Maria Schrader, Kai Wiesinger, Max Befort, Maurice Kumar, Sergej Moya', null, 'The twelve-year-old Emil and his father are haunted by bad luck. To take a break from a series of family disasters, Emil is allowed to spend a few days with a friend of the family, the female priest Hummel in Berlin. In the train he runs across the slick Max Grundeis who anaesthetizes Emil and steals his savings of 1500 DM. When he finally arrives in Berlin, Emil and a gang of street kids, led by the cheeky girl Pony Hütchen, try to find the gangster, who haunts the posh Hotel Adlon as a hotel thief. Meanwhile, to prevent anyone from finding out about Emil''s mishap, Gypsi, a member of the gang of kids, passes himself off as Emil, thus wreaking havoc on the home of the priest.', 'The twelve-year-old Emil and his father are haunted by bad luck. To take a break from a series of family disasters, Emil is allowed to spend a few days with a friend of the family, the female priest Hummel in Berlin. In the train he runs across the slick Max Grundeis who anaesthetizes Emil and steals his savings of 1500 DM. When he finally arrives in Berlin, Emil and a gang of street kids, led by the cheeky girl Pony Hütchen, try to find the gangster, who haunts the posh Hotel Adlon as a hotel thief. Meanwhile, to prevent anyone from finding out about Emil''s mishap, Gypsi, a member of the gang of kids, passes himself off as Emil, thus wreaking havoc on the home of the priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUZzX1DY849sWSTnncNQUhQuXSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10556'),
  ('611030302374362864', 'Emil and the Piglet', 1973, 'Comedy, Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm, Ingrid Dalunde', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Jan Ohlsson, Lena Wisborg, Allan Edwall, Emy Storm, Björn Gustafson, Maud Hansson, Carsta Löck, Isa Quensel', null, 'Nursing a piglet back to life because it''s the runt of the litter earns Emil a friend for life.', 'Nursing a piglet back to life because it''s the runt of the litter earns Emil a friend for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cMK2tiBrfV0TqCZPJA1O2t0Xko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11947'),
  ('819201324804771401', 'Emil i Lönneberga', 1971, 'Comedy, Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Jan Ohlsson, Lena Wisborg, Allan Edwall, Emy Storm, Björn Gustafson, Maud Hansson, Carsta Löck, Isa Quensel', null, 'Emil Svensson lives with his mother and father, little sister Ida, farmhand Alfred, and maid Lina on a picturesque farm in Småland. He is an unusually lively little boy, who just can''t resist trying out every whim that enters into his white-haired head. Always with the best intentions in mind, because he is a good-hearted child, but often with catastrophic results, especially for his short-tempered father. As a result, Emil spends a lot of quality time in the wood shed carving wood figurines and waiting for Anton''s temper to cool down. And the father''s patience is certainly tried, as Emil gets his head stuck in the family''s only soup bowl, hoists little Ida up the flag pole, and arranges a lavish Christmas party for the poor.', 'Emil Svensson lives with his mother and father, little sister Ida, farmhand Alfred, and maid Lina on a picturesque farm in Småland. He is an unusually lively little boy, who just can''t resist trying out every whim that enters into his white-haired head. Always with the best intentions in mind, because he is a good-hearted child, but often with catastrophic results, especially for his short-tempered father. As a result, Emil spends a lot of quality time in the wood shed carving wood figurines and waiting for Anton''s temper to cool down. And the father''s patience is certainly tried, as Emil gets his head stuck in the family''s only soup bowl, hoists little Ida up the flag pole, and arranges a lavish Christmas party for the poor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rhTvhB0oiUUrpL0J6hO3OVcjwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11945'),
  ('190048081462828773', 'Emilia Pérez', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jacques Audiard, Rodrigo Berlanga, Arturo García', 'Jacques Audiard, Léa Mysius, Nicolas Livecchi', 'Zoe Saldaña, Karla Sofía Gascón, Selena Gomez, Adriana Paz, Edgar Ramírez, Mark Ivanir, Eduardo Aladro, Emiliano Hasan', 'R', 'Rita, an underrated lawyer working for a large law firm more interested in getting criminals out of jail than bringing them to justice, is hired by the leader of a criminal organization.', 'Rita, an underrated lawyer working for a large law firm more interested in getting criminals out of jail than bringing them to justice, is hired by the leader of a criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7seqaCaaXDNUHOx4DqwpoOH8pPa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974950'),
  ('899723335120708', 'Emiliano Zapata', 1970, 'War, Action, Drama, History', 'Felipe Cazals, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Ricardo Garibay, Mario Hernández, Antonio Aguilar', 'Antonio Aguilar, Jaime Fernández, Mario Almada, Jorge Arvizu, David Alejandro, Enrique Lucero, David Reynoso, Armando Acosta', null, 'This is the story of a man, Emiliano Zapata, and of a revolution, the Mexican Revolution.', 'This is the story of a man, Emiliano Zapata, and of a revolution, the Mexican Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yitCtk6uOX0W33l7ef1MuFRqdQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301001'),
  ('664093640323658480', 'Emilie Jolie', 2011, 'Animation', 'Francis Nielsen', null, 'Camille Timmerman, Élie Semoun, François-Xavier Demaison', null, 'With the help of the Little Stone, the Hedgehog and the Great Bird, Emilie saves little blue rabbit Gilbert and the fantasy world. Throughout her adventure, she discovers the value of courage, friendship and generosity.', 'With the help of the Little Stone, the Hedgehog and the Great Bird, Emilie saves little blue rabbit Gilbert and the fantasy world. Throughout her adventure, she discovers the value of courage, friendship and generosity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JzI0XWWJiLvYNh403FdKcv00EP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93265'),
