  ('467425951800682912', 'Emily', 2022, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Nanu Segal, Jono Moles, Frances O''Connor', 'Frances O''Connor', 'Emma Mackey, Fionn Whitehead, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Alexandra Dowling, Gemma Jones, Adrian Dunbar, Amelia Gething, Veronica Roberts', 'R', 'The imagined life of one of the world’s most famous authors, Emily Brontë, as she finds her voice and writes the literary classic Wuthering Heights. Explore the relationships that inspired her – her raw, passionate sisterhood with Charlotte and Anne; her first aching, forbidden love for Weightman and her care for her maverick brother whom she idolises.', 'The imagined life of one of the world’s most famous authors, Emily Brontë, as she finds her voice and writes the literary classic Wuthering Heights. Explore the relationships that inspired her – her raw, passionate sisterhood with Charlotte and Anne; her first aching, forbidden love for Weightman and her care for her maverick brother whom she idolises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgVBMIiJczfBWINRRd9yxE8ESln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707103'),
  ('516373571430020925', 'Emily and the Magical Journey', 2020, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Sarah Leung, Nils Croné, Philip Ivarsson', 'Jenny Lampa, Marcus Ovnell', 'Tipper Seifert-Cleveland, Jenny Lampa, Robert Tygner, Chelsea Edge, Harriet Slater, Carl Ingemarsson Stjernlöf, Kristina Issa, Kristina Issa', 'PG', 'A young girl goes on a magical journey to find happiness for her mother.', 'A young girl goes on a magical journey to find happiness for her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jd4lG4gmgs0rKlg0EHptiHHdQF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734624'),
  ('1147409138279916949', 'Emily the Criminal', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Patton Ford, Jeff Bierman, Henry Brower', 'John Patton Ford', 'Aubrey Plaza, Theo Rossi, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Gina Gershon, Jonathan Avigdori, Bernardo Badillo, Craig Stark, John Billingsley', 'R', 'Desperate for income, Emily takes a shady gig buying goods with stolen credit cards supplied by a charismatic middleman named Youcef. Seduced by the quick cash and illicit thrills, they hatch a plan to take their business to the next level.', 'Desperate for income, Emily takes a shady gig buying goods with stolen credit cards supplied by a charismatic middleman named Youcef. Seduced by the quick cash and illicit thrills, they hatch a plan to take their business to the next level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZvzMpREGiqDQ5eYbx8z70qPgst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862965'),
  ('450422216678510613', 'Eminem: Live from New York City', 2005, 'Music', 'Hamish Hamilton', null, 'Eminem, The Alchemist, Bizarre, Kuniva, Mr. Porter, Proof, Obie Trice, Lil Jon', null, 'This concert was filmed at Madison Square Garden in New York in 2005 at the culmination of his farewell tour prior to his retirement. It’s a spectacular show with multi-level staging, amazing lighting and guest appearances from D12, Obie Trice and Stat Quo. Originally filmed for US TV station Showtime the show is now available on Blu-ray for the first time and gives us Eminem at his charismatic best.', 'This concert was filmed at Madison Square Garden in New York in 2005 at the culmination of his farewell tour prior to his retirement. It’s a spectacular show with multi-level staging, amazing lighting and guest appearances from D12, Obie Trice and Stat Quo. Originally filmed for US TV station Showtime the show is now available on Blu-ray for the first time and gives us Eminem at his charismatic best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2616zMUE6H7SgdGcQajvNF4v1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24988'),
  ('10350673678263025', 'Eminent Domain', 1991, 'Drama', 'John Irvin, Lucy Boulting, Ewa Skoczkowska', 'Andrzej Krakowski, Richard Gregson', 'Donald Sutherland, Anne Archer, Jodhi May, Paul Freeman, Françoise Michaud, Bernard Hepton, Anthony Bate, Pip Torrens', null, 'A high-ranking Polish politburo member is banished from the party, and must find out why. Set in 1979 Poland before the Solidarity events.', 'A high-ranking Polish politburo member is banished from the party, and must find out why. Set in 1979 Poland before the Solidarity events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dPIZYcwdK6tmVF0680L224SErt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299572'),
