  ('410799634501119317', 'Emma and Eddie: A Working Couple', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Gábor Hörcher, Kristóf Becsey, Ágnes Kovács', 'Gábor Hörcher', 'Emma Lovett, Eddie Lovett, Mirjana Garibovic, Alexandra Georgia, Lohinai György, Norbert Ion, Nata Ocean, Kira Queen', null, 'Emma and Eddie live two lives: one on social media and one in real life. The webcam couple is out to save their marriage by starting their own adult web-studio in Eastern Europe.', 'Emma and Eddie live two lives: one on social media and one in real life. The webcam couple is out to save their marriage by starting their own adult web-studio in Eastern Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feVCjER9R2bU8qflI3DEPH2oE80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1268818'),
  ('262183398345975348', 'Emma Bovary', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Didier Bivel, Marc Falchier', 'Natalie Carter, Ève de Castro', 'Camille Metayer, Thierry Godard, Laurent Stocker, Alexandre Brasseur, Dominique Pinon, Grégory Fitoussi, Laurent Bateau, Alexandre Blazy', null, '1857. A courtroom. The prosecutor and defense counsel prepare to face off. Between them: Gustave Flaubert, the man on trial. Madame Bovary is charged with obscenity and offending public morals. As the two sides lay out their cases, the novel springs to life. Emma''s story unfolds before our eyes. The trial is a reality check for us, rekindling the debate over the status of women at the time. What will the verdict be for Flaubert? What will the verdict be for women - for all the other Emmas?', '1857. A courtroom. The prosecutor and defense counsel prepare to face off. Between them: Gustave Flaubert, the man on trial. Madame Bovary is charged with obscenity and offending public morals. As the two sides lay out their cases, the novel springs to life. Emma''s story unfolds before our eyes. The trial is a reality check for us, rekindling the debate over the status of women at the time. What will the verdict be for Flaubert? What will the verdict be for women - for all the other Emmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hb9a1H3bbkVNsuOBHoI1Nxohd98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865553'),
  ('162037326389124203', 'Emma Mae', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jamaa Fanaka, Stephen L. Posey', 'Jamaa Fanaka', 'Jerri Hayes, Ernest Williams II, Charles D. Brooks III, Leopoldo Mandeville, Malik Carter, Eddie Allen, Gammy Burdett, Teri Taylor', 'R', 'A naive young woman moves from the South to stay with her aunt and uncle in Compton. As an outsider, she struggles at first to find her footing, but soon falls into the middle of a community of rebellious youth. She soon becomes more and more aware of the social injustices of the big city.', 'A naive young woman moves from the South to stay with her aunt and uncle in Compton. As an outsider, she struggles at first to find her footing, but soon falls into the middle of a community of rebellious youth. She soon becomes more and more aware of the social injustices of the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbS4EmmbCYozKIYPcb3mdPIJLJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90115'),
  ('556487508324346328', 'Emma Peeters', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Nicole Palo, Tobie Marier Robitaille', 'Nicole Palo', 'Monia Chokri, Fabrice Adde, Stéphanie Crayencour, Andréa Ferréol, Anne Sylvain, Jean-Henri Compère, Thomas Mustin, Jean-Noël Delfanne', null, 'After 10 years of struggle in Paris, Emma Peeters has to face the facts: she will never be an actress. She decides to commit suicide on her 35th birthday. That is when she meets Alex, a funeral home employee.', 'After 10 years of struggle in Paris, Emma Peeters has to face the facts: she will never be an actress. She decides to commit suicide on her 35th birthday. That is when she meets Alex, a funeral home employee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpcZhTFJTjS6dmaq6l0MKZnbeFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539456'),
