  ('999627530992558597', 'Emmanuelle 6', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Zincone, Serge Godet, Max Monteillet', 'Jean Rollin', 'Natalie Uher, Jean-René Gossart, Thomas Obermuller, Gustavo Rodríguez, François Guerrar, Luis Carlos Mendes, Tamira, Dagmar Berger', 'R', 'Journey with Emmanuelle and the world''s most excuisite models deep into the Venezuelan Amazon jungle to the heart of paradise. Beauty can be dangerous and the women soon find themselves captive to a powerful drug lord. Now they must escape from a land of darkness', 'Journey with Emmanuelle and the world''s most excuisite models deep into the Venezuelan Amazon jungle to the heart of paradise. Beauty can be dangerous and the women soon find themselves captive to a powerful drug lord. Now they must escape from a land of darkness', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akhaTeqlNEqkyAVdmRWEUDTMUgK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61108'),
