  ('895351107247360328', 'Emmanuelle in Venice', 1993, 'Romance, Drama', 'Francis Leroi, Denis Rouden', 'Jean-Marc Vasseur', 'Marcela Walerstein, George Lazenby, Sylvia Kristel, Joel Bui, Jay Hausman, Pham Duc-Tu, Daniel Hung Meas, Vibbe Haugaard', null, 'In the secrete mountains of Tibet, Emmanuelle was chosen to be the incarnation of all women. With one drop a secret perfume she could become young again or enter the soul of any woman. Emmanuelle decides to help the young and rich widow Anasis. With the help of the perfume, she enters her subconscious and steers her into new directions, towards passion and bodily pleasures.', 'In the secrete mountains of Tibet, Emmanuelle was chosen to be the incarnation of all women. With one drop a secret perfume she could become young again or enter the soul of any woman. Emmanuelle decides to help the young and rich widow Anasis. With the help of the perfume, she enters her subconscious and steers her into new directions, towards passion and bodily pleasures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tngaKz9F16Ssmv54HOnEEvLkRQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299108'),
