  ('970956625962650028', 'Emmanuelle''s Love', 1993, 'Romance, Drama', 'Francis Leroi, Denis Rouden', 'Timothy Fox, Jean-Marc Vasseur', 'Sylvia Kristel, Marcela Walerstein, George Lazenby, Joel Bui, Jay Hausman, Pham Duc-Tu, Daniel Hung Meas, Vibbe Haugaard', null, 'Emmanuelle withdraws into a temple in Tibet, where she wants to find to her true self. She''s given a mystic substance which will give her youth and allow her to enter the souls of other women. Now she sets out and searches her true love Mario from 20 years ago. When he sees young Emmanuelle, he doesn''t believe it''s really her, but she retells all the juicy details of her past to prove it to him.', 'Emmanuelle withdraws into a temple in Tibet, where she wants to find to her true self. She''s given a mystic substance which will give her youth and allow her to enter the souls of other women. Now she sets out and searches her true love Mario from 20 years ago. When he sees young Emmanuelle, he doesn''t believe it''s really her, but she retells all the juicy details of her past to prove it to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iURWiFsPVpKsK1ftNCrZtYuWiip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224397'),
  ('193278960082518708', 'Emmanuelle''s Magic', 1993, 'Drama', 'Francis Leroi, Denis Rouden', 'Jean-Marc Vasseur, Timothy Fox, Frank Bonti', 'Marcela Walerstein, George Lazenby, Sylvia Kristel, Joel Bui, Jay Hausman, Pham Duc-Tu, Daniel Hung Meas, Vibbe Haugaard', null, 'Young Emmanuelle and her friend Coco visit a friend whose sculptor husband is infatuated with one of his plaster creations. Emmanuelle uses her magic to get him interested again, jump starting their love life. Later, Emmanuelle, Coco and Coco''s sister, Paula, travel to a wedding in Africa. They miss their plane to Salima and have to travel by boat, where they all vie for the attention of a male passenger. After Paula misses her chance with him, she travels via rowboat to an African tribal village where her desires are fulfilled.', 'Young Emmanuelle and her friend Coco visit a friend whose sculptor husband is infatuated with one of his plaster creations. Emmanuelle uses her magic to get him interested again, jump starting their love life. Later, Emmanuelle, Coco and Coco''s sister, Paula, travel to a wedding in Africa. They miss their plane to Salima and have to travel by boat, where they all vie for the attention of a male passenger. After Paula misses her chance with him, she travels via rowboat to an African tribal village where her desires are fulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAb7JAOZVWmCqA4Dq1Sc3XW4tt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123111'),
