  ('545564143797151344', 'Emperor', 2012, 'Drama, History, War', 'Peter Webber, Stuart Dryburgh, Sam Storey', 'Vera Blasi, David Klass', 'Matthew Fox, Tommy Lee Jones, Eriko Hatsune, Masayoshi Haneda, Kaori Momoi, Toshiyuki Nishida, Colin Moy, Masatô Ibu', 'PG-13', 'As the Japanese surrender at the end of WWII, Gen. Fellers is tasked with deciding if Emperor Hirohito will be hanged as a war criminal. Influencing his ruling is his quest to find Aya, an exchange student he met years earlier in the U.S.', 'As the Japanese surrender at the end of WWII, Gen. Fellers is tasked with deciding if Emperor Hirohito will be hanged as a war criminal. Influencing his ruling is his quest to find Aya, an exchange student he met years earlier in the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKcRXcffQM2KxNruljrd7H3gUe5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127372'),
