  ('1126162408335468703', 'Empire', 1965, 'Documentary', 'Andy Warhol, John Palmer', null, 'Jonas Mekas, Andy Warhol', null, 'Filmed by Jonas Mekas from the 44th floor of the Time-Life Building, “Empire” explores the passage of time without the use of characters or a traditional narrative. The film, that consists of one stationary shot of the Empire State Building, was made from standard 1,200-foot rolls of 16mm film with a more than eight-hour runtime.', 'Filmed by Jonas Mekas from the 44th floor of the Time-Life Building, “Empire” explores the passage of time without the use of characters or a traditional narrative. The film, that consists of one stationary shot of the Empire State Building, was made from standard 1,200-foot rolls of 16mm film with a more than eight-hour runtime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70Hh09YIGa3M6WBwpXXd1wj6gTM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108419'),
  ('465107578924556663', 'Empire', 2002, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Franc. Reyes, Chip Signore, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Franc. Reyes', 'John Leguizamo, Peter Sarsgaard, Denise Richards, Vincent Laresca, Isabella Rossellini, Delilah Cotto, Nestor Serrano, Treach', 'R', 'Big time drug dealer Victor Rosa is looking to get out of the game and sees his chance with a big deal with a new friend who happens to be a Wall St. stockbroker. Thinking this will be his chance to go out on top, Victor soon finds out that he''s been double crossed and his last option is to get revenge.', 'Big time drug dealer Victor Rosa is looking to get out of the game and sees his chance with a big deal with a new friend who happens to be a Wall St. stockbroker. Thinking this will be his chance to go out on top, Victor soon finds out that he''s been double crossed and his last option is to get revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6XxaRLltWox4C9pykjUILrlGp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13369'),
