  ('550188378883301744', 'Empire of Silver', 2009, 'Drama, History, Family, Romance', 'Christina Yao, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Christina Yao', 'Aaron Kwok, Chang Lantian, Zhang Tielin, Jennifer Tilly, Hao Lei, Ding Zhicheng, King Shih-chieh, Jonathan Kos-Read', 'NR', 'In 1899, Lord Kang must decide which of his three sons will take over his family''s Chinese banking empire. When circumstances dictate that he appoint his unreliable youngest son, family bonds are pushed to the limit as father and son clash in a climate of political turmoil. Winner of the Special Jury Award at the 2009 Shanghai International Film Festival.', 'In 1899, Lord Kang must decide which of his three sons will take over his family''s Chinese banking empire. When circumstances dictate that he appoint his unreliable youngest son, family bonds are pushed to the limit as father and son clash in a climate of political turmoil. Winner of the Special Jury Award at the 2009 Shanghai International Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YkSbuU87UjcRpFncRJuqiYVCup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31185'),
  ('652888860082847110', 'Empire of the Ants', 1977, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Reginald H. Morris, James Quinn', 'Jack Turley', 'Joan Collins, Robert Lansing, John David Carson, Albert Salmi, Jacqueline Scott, Pamela Susan Shoop, Robert Pine, Edward Power', 'PG', 'A Florida real estate developer and her captain lure investors to a property in the Everglades called Dreamland Shores, under false pretenses that the swampland will soon be developed. After the group arrives on a small island, they find it has been overrun by giant mutated ants, brought on by the dumping of toxic waste in the area.', 'A Florida real estate developer and her captain lure investors to a property in the Everglades called Dreamland Shores, under false pretenses that the swampland will soon be developed. After the group arrives on a small island, they find it has been overrun by giant mutated ants, brought on by the dumping of toxic waste in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cmuKjH92h2wrBlbj0WPaTdnpnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42218'),
