  ('638656994373209328', 'Empire of the Rabbits', 2026, 'Drama', 'Seyfettin Tokmak, Claudia Becerril Bulos', 'Seyfettin Tokmak', 'Alpay Kaya, Sermet Yeşil, Kubilay Tunçer, Perla Palamutçuoğulları, Emrullah Çakay', null, 'A daring boy''s journey against the cruel entanglements of deception and disabilities of the adult world.', 'A daring boy''s journey against the cruel entanglements of deception and disabilities of the adult world.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1vVxmdlVLlvEuGe4gS3jX4AVLRq.jpg', 'plex:movie:empire-of-the-rabbits-2026'),
  ('306842877529454139', 'Empire of the Sun', 1987, 'Drama, History, War', 'Allen Daviau, Steven Spielberg, Steve Harding', 'Menno Meyjes, Tom Stoppard', 'Christian Bale, John Malkovich, Miranda Richardson, Nigel Havers, Joe Pantoliano, Leslie Phillips, Masatô Ibu, Emily Richard', 'PG', 'Jamie Graham, a privileged English boy, is living in Shanghai when the Japanese invade and force all foreigners into prison camps. Jamie is captured with an American sailor, who looks out for him while they are in the camp together. Even though he is separated from his parents and in a hostile environment, Jamie maintains his dignity and youthful spirit, providing a beacon of hope for the others held captive with him.', 'Jamie Graham, a privileged English boy, is living in Shanghai when the Japanese invade and force all foreigners into prison camps. Jamie is captured with an American sailor, who looks out for him while they are in the camp together. Even though he is separated from his parents and in a hostile environment, Jamie maintains his dignity and youthful spirit, providing a beacon of hope for the others held captive with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEaCzjwHoPgyQFcwHql7o5YLHAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10110'),
  ('147643681784367802', 'Empire of the Wolves', 2005, 'Action', 'Michel Abramowicz, Chris Nahon', 'Jean-Christophe Grangé, Chris Nahon, Christian Clavier', 'Jean Reno, Arly Jover, Jocelyn Quivrin, Laura Morante, Philippe du Janerand, Philippe Bas, Didier Sauvegrain, Patrick Floersheim', 'R', 'When the young detective Paul Nerteaux finds the third slashed female corpse of illegal Turkish immigrants, he decides to ask for support to the experienced dark retired detective Jean-Louis Schiffer to chase the serial killer. Together, they infiltrate in the Turkish mafia trying to find the answer to the crimes. Meanwhile, the worker Anna Heymes is being submitted to a brain treatment and has severe headaches and glimpses of memories and visions. When these two parallel events collide, disclose that the Turkish organization "The Wolves" is behind them.', 'When the young detective Paul Nerteaux finds the third slashed female corpse of illegal Turkish immigrants, he decides to ask for support to the experienced dark retired detective Jean-Louis Schiffer to chase the serial killer. Together, they infiltrate in the Turkish mafia trying to find the answer to the crimes. Meanwhile, the worker Anna Heymes is being submitted to a brain treatment and has severe headaches and glimpses of memories and visions. When these two parallel events collide, disclose that the Turkish organization "The Wolves" is behind them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkX5I7NF3OcFvxwWm2VzsRgZ1yb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10799'),
  ('746313951130240827', 'Empire Records', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Allan Moyle, Carolyn Chen, Philip A. Patterson', 'Carol Heikkinen', 'Liv Tyler, Johnny Whitworth, Renée Zellweger, Robin Tunney, Anthony LaPaglia, Rory Cochrane, Ethan Embry, Maxwell Caulfield', 'PG-13', 'The employees of an independent music store learn about each other as they try to stop the store from being absorbed by a large chain.', 'The employees of an independent music store learn about each other as they try to stop the store from being absorbed by a large chain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKP7hVdjAAvRvbF3GBCbzi5LzMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13531'),
  ('995397591331281322', 'Empire State', 1987, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ron Peck, Tony Imi, Sheila Trezise', 'Mark Ayres, Ron Peck', 'Cathryn Harrison, Jason Hoganson, Elizabeth Hickling, Jamie Foreman, Emily Bolton, Ian Sears, Martin Landau, Lorcan Cranitch', 'R', 'In the docklands of East London stands the Empire State, a nightclub full of magic and mystery. Designed like an ocean liner, it''s become a battle ground where anything can happen. In the midst of the action, a young boy stows aboard to search for his friend who has disappeared in the entrails of the club.', 'In the docklands of East London stands the Empire State, a nightclub full of magic and mystery. Designed like an ocean liner, it''s become a battle ground where anything can happen. In the midst of the action, a young boy stows aboard to search for his friend who has disappeared in the entrails of the club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMzRO2Q5FJFPRTJlWz2lAouObzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63406'),
  ('1023599964473302054', 'Empire State', 2013, 'Action, Drama', 'Dito Montiel, Dana Gonzales, Urs Hirschbiegel', 'Adam Mazer', 'Liam Hemsworth, Dwayne Johnson, Emma Roberts, Nikki Reed, Michael Angarano, Shenae Grimes-Beech, Lydia Hull, Jerry Ferrara', 'R', 'After failing to get into the police academy, Chris Potamitis settles for a security guard job with an armoured truck company. After he makes the mistake of mentioning the company''s lax security to his best friend, He''s unwittingly drawn into an elaborate scheme to rob the abundant amounts of cash being stored on their premises—resulting in the largest cash heist in U.S.history.', 'After failing to get into the police academy, Chris Potamitis settles for a security guard job with an armoured truck company. After he makes the mistake of mentioning the company''s lax security to his best friend, He''s unwittingly drawn into an elaborate scheme to rob the abundant amounts of cash being stored on their premises—resulting in the largest cash heist in U.S.history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uU4zhkZYVfo7MGKPVIYONseusoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169209'),
  ('1009979050321921450', 'Empire Waist', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claire Ayoub, Maria Rusche, Finley Fleck', 'Claire Ayoub', 'Mia Kaplan, Jemima Yevu, Jolene Purdy, Missi Pyle, Rainn Wilson, Kassandra Tellez, Daisy Washington, Holly McDowell', 'PG-13', 'Lenore Miller’s size has always earned her teases and jeers in her school’s hallways, but this clothes-loving teenager is about to set the world on fire with her own line of inclusive fashion designs.', 'Lenore Miller’s size has always earned her teases and jeers in her school’s hallways, but this clothes-loving teenager is about to set the world on fire with her own line of inclusive fashion designs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cha9illdJQ5CEIrVjsmi57xMFt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1048923'),
