  ('411240061505381583', 'Employee of the Month', 2004, 'Action, Comedy', 'Mitch Rouse, John Peters, Richard L. Fox', 'Jay Leggett, Mitch Rouse', 'Matt Dillon, Steve Zahn, Christina Applegate, Andrea Bendewald, Jay Leggett, David Pasquesi, Peter Jason, Paul Dooley', 'R', '"Employee of the Month" is about a guy whose day spirals from bad to worse when he gets fired from his dream job at the bank and is dumped by his fiancée Sara. David''s best friend Jack tries to convince him it''s for the best, but the opposite occurs when bank robberies and millions of dollars become part of his day from hell.', '"Employee of the Month" is about a guy whose day spirals from bad to worse when he gets fired from his dream job at the bank and is dumped by his fiancée Sara. David''s best friend Jack tries to convince him it''s for the best, but the opposite occurs when bank robberies and millions of dollars become part of his day from hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OJGGE1fdLxHGZTporORoxHpJoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11413'),
  ('1042803952298049947', 'Employee of the Month', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Greg Coolidge, Anthony B. Richmond, Maximillian D. Day', 'Greg Coolidge, Chris Conroy, Don Calame', 'Dane Cook, Jessica Simpson, Dax Shepard, Andy Dick, Tim Bagley, Brian George, Efren Ramirez, Marcello Thedford', 'PG-13', 'When he hears that the new female employee digs ambitious men who are the store employee of the month, a slacker gets his act together but finds himself in competition with his rival, an ambitious co-worker.', 'When he hears that the new female employee digs ambitious men who are the store employee of the month, a slacker gets his act together but finds himself in competition with his rival, an ambitious co-worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfALEF9wz4CEep071iOwM5Qqd17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9794'),
  ('1097843637465701007', 'Employee of the Month', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Massart, Jérôme Commandeur', 'Xavier Maingon, Jérôme Commandeur', 'Jérôme Commandeur, Laetitia Dosch, Pascale Arbillot, Nicole Calfan, Éva Darlan, Estéban, Jean-Marie Winling, Christian Clavier', null, 'Vincent, a civil servant, has always enjoyed the benefits of his family''s status. When the government votes on a massive savings plan, Vincent is pushed out. When he is transferred to the North Pole, he meets Eva and finds love. It''s time for him to choose.', 'Vincent, a civil servant, has always enjoyed the benefits of his family''s status. When the government votes on a massive savings plan, Vincent is pushed out. When he is transferred to the North Pole, he meets Eva and finds love. It''s time for him to choose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JuykPCoy4JJsmoGac7CB19xWow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745608'),
  ('928414090245113343', 'Employees'' Entrance', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roy Del Ruth, Barney McGill, Chuck Hansen', 'Robert Presnell Sr.', 'Warren William, Loretta Young, Wallace Ford, Alice White, Hale Hamilton, Albert Gran, Marjorie Gateson, Ruth Donnelly', 'NR', 'Kurt Anderson is the tyrannical manager of a New York department store in financial straits. He thinks nothing of firing an employee of more than 20 years or of toying with the affections of every woman he meets. One such victim is Madeline, a beautiful young woman in need of a job. Anderson hires her as a salesgirl, but not before the two spend the night together. Madeline is ashamed, especially after she falls for Martin West, a rising young star at the store. Her biggest fear is that Martin finds out the truth about her "career move."', 'Kurt Anderson is the tyrannical manager of a New York department store in financial straits. He thinks nothing of firing an employee of more than 20 years or of toying with the affections of every woman he meets. One such victim is Madeline, a beautiful young woman in need of a job. Anderson hires her as a salesgirl, but not before the two spend the night together. Madeline is ashamed, especially after she falls for Martin West, a rising young star at the store. Her biggest fear is that Martin finds out the truth about her "career move."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRBztofgI6c4v2ahiMNm0unGzls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43599'),
  ('168754372613053182', 'Empowered', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Santiago Segura, Kiko de la Rica, Eva Leira', 'Santiago Segura, Marta González de Vega, Nano López Moure', 'Maribel Verdú, Diego Martín, Toni Acosta, Rafael Spregelburd, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Cristina Castaño, Cristina Pedroche, Santiago Segura', null, 'Paz seems to have a perfect life. She has a job, a partner and friends but something''s missing. In reality, there are things she is unhappy about. She feels anxious and burdened but can''t bring herself to express these feelings. Until one day she turns to a strange therapy that will make her say absolutely everything she thinks. How would your life be if you only said what you think?', 'Paz seems to have a perfect life. She has a job, a partner and friends but something''s missing. In reality, there are things she is unhappy about. She feels anxious and burdened but can''t bring herself to express these feelings. Until one day she turns to a strange therapy that will make her say absolutely everything she thinks. How would your life be if you only said what you think?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LFikd2pUj8NO8pqnMTGxqQxaA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505015'),
  ('216903500172866837', 'Empties', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Vladimír Smutný, Jan Svěrák', 'Zdeněk Svěrák', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Daniela Kolářová, Tatiana Dyková, Jiří Macháček, Pavel Landovský, Jan Budař, Nela Boudová, Ondřej Vetchý', null, 'Czech literature teacher Josef Tkaloun, who is past retirement age, realises one day that he no longer understands his pupils, and so he quits… dramatically. What he does not predict is that in doing this he will lose his sense of place in society.', 'Czech literature teacher Josef Tkaloun, who is past retirement age, realises one day that he no longer understands his pupils, and so he quits… dramatically. What he does not predict is that in doing this he will lose his sense of place in society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2R5W3HyTg6mW33UPsisTqCRllir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6079'),
  ('801426612977793669', 'Empty Days', 2018, 'Drama', 'Robney Bruno Almeida, Maurício Baggio', 'Robney Bruno Almeida', 'Arthur Avila, Natália Dantas, Vinícius Queiroz, Carla Ribas, Nayara Tavares', null, '"Empty Days" tells the story of a day in the life of Jean and Fabiana, a couple of young boyfriends who try to reinvent their lives in a small town in the Brazilian interior. They are in their senior year of high school and live the old dilemma: either we leave this city or we stay here and continue the history of our parents. At the end of this day Jean commits suicide and Fabiana disappears. Two years later, Daniel and Alanis, another couple of young boyfriends, try to understand how everything happened.', '"Empty Days" tells the story of a day in the life of Jean and Fabiana, a couple of young boyfriends who try to reinvent their lives in a small town in the Brazilian interior. They are in their senior year of high school and live the old dilemma: either we leave this city or we stay here and continue the history of our parents. At the end of this day Jean commits suicide and Fabiana disappears. Two years later, Daniel and Alanis, another couple of young boyfriends, try to understand how everything happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUNpAJN6ApR7ERF5FCPqJ59LUoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471284'),
  ('291189430731312471', 'Empty Eyes', 1953, 'Drama', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Franco Zeffirelli, Domenico Scala', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Lucio Battistrada, Ugo Pirro', 'Gabriele Ferzetti, Irène Galter, Pina Bottin, Maria Pia Trepaoli, Scilla Vannucci, Anna Maria Dossena, Aristide Baghetti, Fara Libassi', null, 'A young and shy girl Celestina arrives from her small home village to Rome to become a housemaid. Her inexperience and naivety causes her to change her employers quite frequently. As she is moving from one family to another she makes friends with other Roman maids and falls desperately in love with a handsome plumber Fernando. But Fernando isn''t telling Celestina that he is already engaged to another woman.', 'A young and shy girl Celestina arrives from her small home village to Rome to become a housemaid. Her inexperience and naivety causes her to change her employers quite frequently. As she is moving from one family to another she makes friends with other Roman maids and falls desperately in love with a handsome plumber Fernando. But Fernando isn''t telling Celestina that he is already engaged to another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upHC61RnTuHpvpen0Le9KgLHWAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148217'),
  ('208944632054828540', 'Empty Nest', 2008, 'Drama', 'Daniel Burman, Hugo Colace, Magdalena Cernadas', 'Daniel Burman', 'Cecilia Roth, Carlos Bermejo, Inés Efrón, Arturo Goetz, Jean Pierre Noher, Oscar Martínez, Eugenia Capizzano, Osmar Núñez', null, 'Empty Nest tells the story of a couple who have to struggle to find themselves after their children grow up and move out. It starts out as a fairly simple story of a couple but becomes complicated by a series of events that may or may not be occurring only in Leonardo’s mind.', 'Empty Nest tells the story of a couple who have to struggle to find themselves after their children grow up and move out. It starts out as a fairly simple story of a couple but becomes complicated by a series of events that may or may not be occurring only in Leonardo’s mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAlyr7PQQS1kpLutQh1Qy8AqCfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73293'),
