  ('216470066748904947', 'En fuera de juego', 2012, 'Comedy', 'David Marqués, Federico Ribes', 'Rafa Calatayud Cano', 'Fernando Tejero, Diego Peretti, Hugo Silva, Chino Darín, Patricia Montero, Laura Pamplona, José Sancho, Carmen Ruiz', null, 'Diego, an Argentine doctor traumatized by the soccer since his childhood, is not satisfied with his life. Javi is a representative of kids who start playing soccer, a Spanish third division manager who dreams of an opportunity to change their fate. Suddenly, the discovery of a young Argentinian star, will join Diego and Javi in a common adventure, full of surprises and and picaresque.', 'Diego, an Argentine doctor traumatized by the soccer since his childhood, is not satisfied with his life. Javi is a representative of kids who start playing soccer, a Spanish third division manager who dreams of an opportunity to change their fate. Suddenly, the discovery of a young Argentinian star, will join Diego and Javi in a common adventure, full of surprises and and picaresque.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5smhyrxsIRdGcU6RMsBTv5PTWa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109690'),
  ('945390215608058392', 'En la Quietud de la Noche', 2026, 'Family, Drama, Fantasy', 'Aristides Mantilla, Alonso Quintero Fregoso, Jano Fernandez', 'Aristides Mantilla', 'Leonardo Nájar Márquez, Jesús Ochoa, Yalitza Aparicio, Memo Villegas', null, 'On the Day of the Dead, a 10-year-old kid anxiously awaits a visit from his grandfather from the afterlife to finally meet him', 'On the Day of the Dead, a 10-year-old kid anxiously awaits a visit from his grandfather from the afterlife to finally meet him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BTIYQnwYorPtUbKIZArxPB3bOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1510753'),
  ('206023963951338163', 'En même temps', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Hugues Poulain, Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Gustave Kervern, Benoît Delépine', 'Vincent Macaigne, Jonathan Cohen, India Hair, Jehnny Beth, Doully, Yolande Moreau, Isabelle Gaspar, Gustave Kervern', null, 'On the eve of a vote to greenlight the construction of a leisure centre where a primal forest currently stands, an unashamedly right-wing mayor sets out to trap his ecologist opponent. But both will end up being outwitted by a group of feminist activists who will confront the two men with their own contradictions, once and for all.', 'On the eve of a vote to greenlight the construction of a leisure centre where a primal forest currently stands, an unashamedly right-wing mayor sets out to trap his ecologist opponent. But both will end up being outwitted by a group of feminist activists who will confront the two men with their own contradictions, once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kYy6wxCJaiYmiNU2UZSIV8Zixp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920640'),
  ('311225277542028677', 'En rachâchant', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet, Louis Cochet', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub', 'Olivier Straub, Nadette Thinus, Bernard Thinus, Raymond Gérard', null, 'The child Ernesto doesn''t want to go to school any more because, as he says, all he is taught there is things he doesn''t know.', 'The child Ernesto doesn''t want to go to school any more because, as he says, all he is taught there is things he doesn''t know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pB69BCEbhy1KSvhoNhDa9fPSW62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129363'),
