  ('308419243959571189', 'Enaldinho and the Mystery of the Lagoon', 2023, 'Adventure, Family', 'Fábio Brasil', 'Fábio Brasil', 'Enaldinho, Brenner Mariano Ramos, Nícolas Gomes Costa, Juãozinho, João Marcos de Oliveira, Dayanna Maia Rocha, Fernanda do Monte Lima Lourival Guerreiro, Hélio Yochihiro Fuchigami', null, 'Enaldinho and his gang go out to have fun in a paradisiacal park. The class takes advantage of everything the place has to offer until strange things start to happen. Some people mysteriously disappear during the night and, when they reappear, they are different. They seem to be totally out of vital energy! Enaldinho leaves to try to find out who or what is doing this... He then discovers that the victims are being taken to a mysterious cave and there has their energy drained, turning everyone into Zombies... Who is behind all this is "Zap", a frightening alien who needs people''s energy to be the fuel of a destructive weapon that can enslave the entire planet. Enaldinho and his friends need to prevent "Zap" from realizing his plan and saving the world from this dark force.', 'Enaldinho and his gang go out to have fun in a paradisiacal park. The class takes advantage of everything the place has to offer until strange things start to happen. Some people mysteriously disappear during the night and, when they reappear, they are different. They seem to be totally out of vital energy! Enaldinho leaves to try to find out who or what is doing this... He then discovers that the victims are being taken to a mysterious cave and there has their energy drained, turning everyone into Zombies... Who is behind all this is "Zap", a frightening alien who needs people''s energy to be the fuel of a destructive weapon that can enslave the entire planet. Enaldinho and his friends need to prevent "Zap" from realizing his plan and saving the world from this dark force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRnthkrCp0hbsTY06Wa5u9LWyxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076868'),
  ('44363902064370844', 'Enamorada', 1946, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa, Zacarías Gómez Urquiza', 'Benito Alazraki', 'María Félix, Pedro Armendáriz, Fernando Fernández, José Morcillo, Eduardo Arozamena, Miguel Inclán, Manuel Dondé, Eugenio Rossi', 'PG', 'In Mexican Revolution times, a guerrilla general and his troops take the conservative town of Cholula, near by Mexico City. As the revolutionaries mistreat the town''s riches, General Reyes falls for beautiful and wild Beatriz Peñafiel, the daughter of one of the town''s richest men.', 'In Mexican Revolution times, a guerrilla general and his troops take the conservative town of Cholula, near by Mexico City. As the revolutionaries mistreat the town''s riches, General Reyes falls for beautiful and wild Beatriz Peñafiel, the daughter of one of the town''s richest men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHKRBzPNgu0XgGiBg2U5ltSE438.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115301'),
  ('1108316412933846722', 'Encanto', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Charise Castro Smith, Byron Howard, Jared Bush', 'Charise Castro Smith, Jared Bush', 'Stephanie Beatriz, María Cecilia Botero, John Leguizamo, Diane Guerrero, Jess Darrow, Carolina Gaitán, Angie Cepeda, Ravi Cabot-Conyers', 'PG', 'The tale of an extraordinary family, the Madrigals, who live hidden in the mountains of Colombia, in a magical house, in a vibrant town, in a wondrous, charmed place called an Encanto. The magic of the Encanto has blessed every child in the family—every child except one, Mirabel. But when she discovers that the magic surrounding the Encanto is in danger, Mirabel decides that she, the only ordinary Madrigal, might just be her exceptional family''s last hope.', 'The tale of an extraordinary family, the Madrigals, who live hidden in the mountains of Colombia, in a magical house, in a vibrant town, in a wondrous, charmed place called an Encanto. The magic of the Encanto has blessed every child in the family—every child except one, Mirabel. But when she discovers that the magic surrounding the Encanto is in danger, Mirabel decides that she, the only ordinary Madrigal, might just be her exceptional family''s last hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4j0PNHkMr5ax3IA8tjtxcmPU3QT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568124'),
  ('372904886268007756', 'Encanto at the Hollywood Bowl', 2022, 'Music, Documentary', 'Chris Howe, Cameron Barnett, Resa Jorgensen', null, 'Lin-Manuel Miranda, Stephanie Beatriz, Adassa, Carolina Gaitán, Jess Darrow, Diane Guerrero, Mauro Castillo, Angie Cepeda', 'G', 'Step into Casa Madrigal for a special concert spectacular as the original voice cast of Disney Animation''s Oscar®-winning "Encanto," Stephanie Beatriz, Adassa, Carolina Gaitán, Jessica Darrow, Diane Guerrero, Mauro Castillo, Angie Cepeda and Olga Merediz, along with special guests including Colombian superstar Carlos Vives, reunites for "Encanto at the Hollywood Bowl." This unprecedented concert experience gives you a front-row seat to the musical extravaganza celebrating the global phenomenon.', 'Step into Casa Madrigal for a special concert spectacular as the original voice cast of Disney Animation''s Oscar®-winning "Encanto," Stephanie Beatriz, Adassa, Carolina Gaitán, Jessica Darrow, Diane Guerrero, Mauro Castillo, Angie Cepeda and Olga Merediz, along with special guests including Colombian superstar Carlos Vives, reunites for "Encanto at the Hollywood Bowl." This unprecedented concert experience gives you a front-row seat to the musical extravaganza celebrating the global phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa3Ku5yNVjp8NloWxJoI9dQjvOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1041513'),
  ('68948980696460245', 'Enchanted', 2007, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Kevin Lima, Don Burgess, Kristin Bernstein', 'Bill Kelly', 'Amy Adams, Patrick Dempsey, James Marsden, Timothy Spall, Idina Menzel, Rachel Covey, Susan Sarandon, Julie Andrews', 'PG', 'The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn''t operate on a "happily ever after" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?', 'The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn''t operate on a "happily ever after" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4523'),
  ('838877657637880563', 'Enchanted April', 1991, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mike Newell, Jessica Nettleton, Rex Maidment', 'Peter Barnes', 'Josie Lawrence, Miranda Richardson, Polly Walker, Joan Plowright, Alfred Molina, Michael Kitchen, Jim Broadbent, Neville Phillips', 'PG', 'When married British women Rose Arbuthnot and Lottie Wilkins decide to take a break from their respective spouses, they stay at a castle in Italy for a quiet holiday. Joining the ladies is Caroline Dester, a young socialite, and Mrs. Fisher, an older aristocrat. Liberated from their daily routines, the four women ease into life in rural Italy, and each finds herself transformed by the experience.', 'When married British women Rose Arbuthnot and Lottie Wilkins decide to take a break from their respective spouses, they stay at a castle in Italy for a quiet holiday. Joining the ladies is Caroline Dester, a young socialite, and Mrs. Fisher, an older aristocrat. Liberated from their daily routines, the four women ease into life in rural Italy, and each finds herself transformed by the experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4Jrg23Q3y7p8GS7aMnPdFiEcnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26561'),
  ('720856421820108566', 'Enchanted Christmas', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Terry Cunningham', 'Catherine Fridey', 'Alexa PenaVega, Carlos PenaVega, Randy Wayne, Chelsie Hightower, Rene Rivera, Jaynee-Lynne Kinchen, Steve Bond, Melanie Nelson', null, 'Weeks before Christmas, interior designer Laura is sent to her hometown of Santa Fe, New Mexico to remodel a landmark hotel. As Laura is kept busy with the renovations, her 8-year-old daughter Nicole is introduced to the art of salsa dancing at a local dance studio. Laura is surprised to find that the studio’s owner is Ricardo, her old high school sweetheart and former salsa dance partner. When Laura and Ricardo reconnect, sparks fly on and off the dance floor. The beautiful Christmas traditions of New Mexico become the backdrop for spirited dancing and unexpected romance.', 'Weeks before Christmas, interior designer Laura is sent to her hometown of Santa Fe, New Mexico to remodel a landmark hotel. As Laura is kept busy with the renovations, her 8-year-old daughter Nicole is introduced to the art of salsa dancing at a local dance studio. Laura is surprised to find that the studio’s owner is Ricardo, her old high school sweetheart and former salsa dance partner. When Laura and Ricardo reconnect, sparks fly on and off the dance floor. The beautiful Christmas traditions of New Mexico become the backdrop for spirited dancing and unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWR2JcvR8uWNhzze03Q7ZXMwsgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474978'),
  ('290728067747465127', 'Enchanted Interlude', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michel Spinosa', 'Michel Spinosa', 'Vincent Elbaz, Karin Viard, Clotilde Courau, Roschdy Zem, Géraldine Pailhas, Éric Caravaca, Brigitte Catillon, Michel Spinosa', null, 'Summer 1969 on the Mediterranean coast. Paul and Vincent are childhood buddies. On a beach one day, they meet Alice and her friend Eve. After a series of memorable adventures, couples fall into place but not quite in the right order. Alice blossoms elsewhere, Paul marries Eve and Vincent weds Marie. The 70s are in full swing. Thanks to the pill, women''s lives change radically, sexology is in, feminists''s voices can be heard loud and clear but unrestricted and free access to abortion has yet to be attained. Against the backtop of a decade marked by sexual liberation, these three girls and two boys will cross each other''s paths, love one another, split up and reunite.', 'Summer 1969 on the Mediterranean coast. Paul and Vincent are childhood buddies. On a beach one day, they meet Alice and her friend Eve. After a series of memorable adventures, couples fall into place but not quite in the right order. Alice blossoms elsewhere, Paul marries Eve and Vincent weds Marie. The 70s are in full swing. Thanks to the pill, women''s lives change radically, sexology is in, feminists''s voices can be heard loud and clear but unrestricted and free access to abortion has yet to be attained. Against the backtop of a decade marked by sexual liberation, these three girls and two boys will cross each other''s paths, love one another, split up and reunite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTA0Aq4V1j4XvMNrhHiHGYTHm2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70990'),
  ('163208791147046434', 'Enchanted Island', 1958, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Allan Dwan, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'James Leicester', 'Dana Andrews, Jane Powell, Don Dubbins, Arthur Shields, Ted de Corsia, Friedrich von Ledebur, Agustín Fernández, Lasse Hellman', 'NR', 'Two 19th-century sailors jump ship only to discover their tropical paradise is a cannibal stronghold.', 'Two 19th-century sailors jump ship only to discover their tropical paradise is a cannibal stronghold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUqmPObRk9wnqkq3h6EObhpTBNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216707'),
  ('592292485431975439', 'Enchantment', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Irving Reis, Gregg Toland, Emil Newman', 'John Patrick', 'David Niven, Teresa Wright, Evelyn Keyes, Farley Granger, Jayne Meadows, Leo G. Carroll, Philip Friend, Shepperd Strudwick', null, 'Roland Dane finally retires to the house he was brought up in. Lost in thoughts of his lost love Lark, he does not want to be disturbed in his last days. However, the appearance of his niece and her subsequent romance with Lark''s nephew causes him to reevaluate his life and offer some advice so the young couple doesn''t make the same mistake he did, all those years ago.', 'Roland Dane finally retires to the house he was brought up in. Lost in thoughts of his lost love Lark, he does not want to be disturbed in his last days. However, the appearance of his niece and her subsequent romance with Lark''s nephew causes him to reevaluate his life and offer some advice so the young couple doesn''t make the same mistake he did, all those years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va1NmbFgojTohqjruhH3Lz0UnVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33111'),
  ('951502385344813242', 'Enchufe sin visa', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Christian Moya', 'Jorge Ulloa, Nataly Valencia, Julio Pañi', 'Raúl Santana, Orlando Herrera, Nataly Valencia, Jorge Ulloa, Gabriela Ruíz, Lider Medranda Hernández, Carla Yépez Caicedo, Carolina Pérez Flor', null, 'Six Latinos traveling to the United States for different reasons soon find themselves immersed in the most ridiculous and embarrassing situations. From an inexperienced boy traveling as an exchange student to a naive actress trying to make it in Hollywood, each of them will experience unexpected adventures that will make them question whether leaving their country was the best decision.', 'Six Latinos traveling to the United States for different reasons soon find themselves immersed in the most ridiculous and embarrassing situations. From an inexperienced boy traveling as an exchange student to a naive actress trying to make it in Hollywood, each of them will experience unexpected adventures that will make them question whether leaving their country was the best decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNmPPQqIqZ2h1wqpervJUfGKtzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403397'),
  ('989402459919808549', 'Encino Man', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Les Mayfield, Robert Brinkmann, Jerry Ketcham', 'Shawn Schepps', 'Sean Astin, Brendan Fraser, Pauly Shore, Megan Ward, Robin Tunney, Michael DeLuise, Patrick Van Horn, Dalton James', 'PG', 'High school misfits Stoney and Dave discover a long-frozen primeval man buried in their backyard. But the thawed-out Link—as the boys have named him—quickly becomes a wild card in the teens'' already zany Southern California lives. After a shave and some new clothes, Link''s presence at school makes the daily drudgery a lot more interesting.', 'High school misfits Stoney and Dave discover a long-frozen primeval man buried in their backyard. But the thawed-out Link—as the boys have named him—quickly becomes a wild card in the teens'' already zany Southern California lives. After a shave and some new clothes, Link''s presence at school makes the daily drudgery a lot more interesting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8HtL6pyjfODdHOFgciFVFmt8Eq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10406'),
  ('186002132378935353', 'Encirclement - Neo-Liberalism Ensnares Democracy', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Richard Brouillette', 'Richard Brouillette', 'Noam Chomsky, Ignacio Ramonet, Normand Baillargeon, Bernard Maris, Omar Aktouf, Susan George, Michel Chossudovsky, François Denord', null, 'Using the reflections and analysis of many renowned intellectuals, this documentary draws a portrait of neoliberal ideology and examines the various mechanisms used to impose its dictates throughout the world.', 'Using the reflections and analysis of many renowned intellectuals, this documentary draws a portrait of neoliberal ideology and examines the various mechanisms used to impose its dictates throughout the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7G6Ze59C4mDFzEr49zGKLsYmf0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104841'),
  ('889618994855196416', 'Enclosure', 1961, 'Drama', 'Armand Gatti, Robert Juillard', 'Pierre Lary, Pierre Joffroy, Armand Gatti', 'Jean Négroni, Hans Christian Blech, Herbert Wochinz, Maks Furijan, Tamara Miletič, Janez Vrhovec, Stevo Žigon, Pero Kvrgič', null, 'In a Nazi concentration camp, Karl, a German political prisoner, and David, a Jewish watchmaker, are confined in a small enclosure from which only one of them will be able to go out alive.', 'In a Nazi concentration camp, Karl, a German political prisoner, and David, a Jewish watchmaker, are confined in a small enclosure from which only one of them will be able to go out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RMlek9tqgUcd2h0612Sr5iEvIS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269966'),
  ('927313014806608328', 'Encore', 1951, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Harold French, Anthony Pelissier, Desmond Dickinson', 'Arthur Macrae, Eric Ambler, T. E. B. Clarke', 'Glynis Johns, Nigel Patrick, Roland Culver, Alison Leggatt, Charles Victor, Peter Graves, Margaret Withers, Margaret Vyner', null, 'Encore is a 1951 anthology film composed of adaptations of three short stories by W. Somerset Maugham: "The Ant and the Grasshopper", directed by Pat Jackson and adapted by T. E. B. Clarke; "Winter Cruise", helmed by Anthony Pelissier, screenplay by Arthur Macrae; "Gigolo and Gigolette", directed by Harold French, written by Eric Ambler. It is the last film in a Maugham trilogy, preceded by Quartet and Trio.', 'Encore is a 1951 anthology film composed of adaptations of three short stories by W. Somerset Maugham: "The Ant and the Grasshopper", directed by Pat Jackson and adapted by T. E. B. Clarke; "Winter Cruise", helmed by Anthony Pelissier, screenplay by Arthur Macrae; "Gigolo and Gigolette", directed by Harold French, written by Eric Ambler. It is the last film in a Maugham trilogy, preceded by Quartet and Trio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilDf6iBTsRpiBjFY8d7viCwcOx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197647'),
  ('592257593168798049', 'Encore heureux', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Benoît Graffin', 'Nicolas Bedos, Benoît Graffin', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Édouard Baer, Bulle Ogier, Carla Besnaïnou, Mathieu Torloting, Benjamin Biolay, Guilaine Londez, Anna Gaylor', null, 'Okay, Marie is a little tired of the insouciance of her husband Sam, framework sup unemployed for 2 years. Agree, it is very tempted to be seduced by this beautiful stranger who made him the Court. Okay, there is also the daughter piano competition... If this balance light and crazy about standing, an unexpected event throws the family on an even crazier way.', 'Okay, Marie is a little tired of the insouciance of her husband Sam, framework sup unemployed for 2 years. Agree, it is very tempted to be seduced by this beautiful stranger who made him the Court. Okay, there is also the daughter piano competition... If this balance light and crazy about standing, an unexpected event throws the family on an even crazier way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kk68eK0aIyP3m5e2g8PfV7PHCwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375897'),
  ('1033333061566692434', 'Encore, Once More Encore!', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Boris Velsher, Tatyana Pronina, Yuriy Rayskiy', 'Pyotr Todorovskiy', 'Valentin Gaft, Irina Rozanova, Evgeny Mironov, Elena Yakovleva, Larisa Malevannaya, Sergey Nikonenko, Vladimir Ilin, Andrey Ilin', null, 'A drama set at the end of the Forties and the beginning of the Fifties. In a distant garrison town, life proceeds at a measured past. The officers drink and debauch, while the soldiers serve. Meanwhile accidentally unleashed human emotions are suffocated by the atmosphere of cruelty and hypocrisy.', 'A drama set at the end of the Forties and the beginning of the Fifties. In a distant garrison town, life proceeds at a measured past. The officers drink and debauch, while the soldiers serve. Meanwhile accidentally unleashed human emotions are suffocated by the atmosphere of cruelty and hypocrisy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FlTWEV5BsLLOKqjnIvJ0qa6Tf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255494'),
  ('1043718383200133738', 'Encounter', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Paul Salamoff, Denton Adkinson, Joshua Lou Friedman', 'Paul Salamoff', 'Luke Hemsworth, Anna Hutchison, Glenn Keogh, Cheryl Texiera, Vincent M. Ward, Christopher Showerman, Wendy Davis, Peter Holden', 'NR', 'A group of friends uncover an otherworldly object in a rural field, which they soon discover holds greater secrets than they could imagine.', 'A group of friends uncover an otherworldly object in a rural field, which they soon discover holds greater secrets than they could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk49kIZWBqdunGvafZRmUudviNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529483'),
  ('744011822446754989', 'Encounter', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Benjamin Kračun, Michael Pearce', 'Joe Barton, Michael Pearce', 'Riz Ahmed, Octavia Spencer, Lucian-River Chauhan, Rory Cochrane, Aditya Geddada, Janina Gavankar, Misha Collins, Keith Szarabajka', 'R', 'A decorated Marine goes on a rescue mission to save his two young sons from an unhuman threat. As their journey takes them in increasingly dangerous directions, the boys will need to leave their childhoods behind.', 'A decorated Marine goes on a rescue mission to save his two young sons from an unhuman threat. As their journey takes them in increasingly dangerous directions, the boys will need to leave their childhoods behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjRUsn8m2znK4mQuYR5fUguBDQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728526'),
  ('717953102894035668', 'Encounter in Space', 1963, 'Science Fiction', 'Otar Koberidze, Mikhail Karyukov, Aleksei Gerasimov', 'Mikhail Karyukov, Oles Berdnyk, Ivan Bondin', 'Larisa Gordeichik, Boris Borisenok, Otar Koberidze, Peeter Kard, Aleksei Genesin, Nikolai Timofeyev, Nikolai Volkov St., Vitold Janpavlis', null, 'In the near future, a friendly exploratory mission to Earth from the planet Zenturia crashes on Mars''s moon Phobos, and cosmonauts from the USSR are sent to the difficult and dangerous rescue.', 'In the near future, a friendly exploratory mission to Earth from the planet Zenturia crashes on Mars''s moon Phobos, and cosmonauts from the USSR are sent to the difficult and dangerous rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGDZdPc9wifINGGn3uqF7pCN2ES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71018'),
  ('325422155633696592', 'Encounter with the Unknown', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Harry Thomason, James W. Roberson, Charles Thuston', 'Joe Glass, Harry Thomason, Jack Anderson', 'Rod Serling, Robert Ginnaven, Gary Brockette, John Leslie, Fran Franklin, Tom Haywood, James N. Harrell, John Cissne', 'PG', 'Three eerie tales based on actual events are enacted in this film. First, three college students play a prank on a geeky classmate, who is accidentally shot and killed. His vengeful mother forecasts the deaths of the three young men she holds responsible, on 7, 14, and 21 days hence. And, one by one, her grim predictions come true. Next, a ghoulish sound emanates from a mist-shrouded hole in the Earth near where a Missouri boy has lost his dog. The boy''s father is lowered into the hole and lets out an agonizing scream! Finally, a senator returning home from a party finds a lost girl on a bridge and learns from her father that she died years earlier', 'Three eerie tales based on actual events are enacted in this film. First, three college students play a prank on a geeky classmate, who is accidentally shot and killed. His vengeful mother forecasts the deaths of the three young men she holds responsible, on 7, 14, and 21 days hence. And, one by one, her grim predictions come true. Next, a ghoulish sound emanates from a mist-shrouded hole in the Earth near where a Missouri boy has lost his dog. The boy''s father is lowered into the hole and lets out an agonizing scream! Finally, a senator returning home from a party finds a lost girl on a bridge and learns from her father that she died years earlier', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyJzVpbgWJA93m796ktPOmo3P96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85681'),
  ('642415336681488703', 'Encounters at the End of the World', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Clive Oppenheimer, Scott Rowland, Stefan Pashov, Doug MacAyeal, Ryan Andrew Evans, Kevin Emery, Olav T. Oftedal', 'G', 'Herzog and cinematographer Peter Zeitlinger go to Antarctica to meet people who live and work there, and to capture footage of the continent''s unique locations. Herzog''s voiceover narration explains that his film will not be a typical Antarctica film about "fluffy penguins", but will explore the dreams of the people and the landscape.', 'Herzog and cinematographer Peter Zeitlinger go to Antarctica to meet people who live and work there, and to capture footage of the continent''s unique locations. Herzog''s voiceover narration explains that his film will not be a typical Antarctica film about "fluffy penguins", but will explore the dreams of the people and the landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAkl9GAUQoJaQQu2dtSQdQJ5yS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12172'),
  ('252735309367805924', 'Encounters of the Spooky Kind', 1980, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Wellson Chin Sing-Wai, Wu Cheuk-Wah', 'Wong Ying, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Paul Chung Fat, Wu Ma, Lam Ching-Ying, Peter Chan Lung, To Siu-Ming, Huang Ha, Leung Suet-Mei', 'NR', '"Big Guts" Cheung, a man well known in his local village for his lack of fear, is put to the test after being tricked into spending the night in a temple full of spirits, zombies, and vampires.', '"Big Guts" Cheung, a man well known in his local village for his lack of fear, is put to the test after being tricked into spending the night in a temple full of spirits, zombies, and vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pca4RsHaV1dzSR0Ex9zeE0ONrj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15724'),
  ('319662676632071787', 'Encounters of the Spooky Kind II', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Ricky Lau, Lam Hak-Ming, Lee Po-Cheung', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Lam Ching-Ying, Mimi Kung, Mang Hoi, Wong Man-Gwan, Tam Sin-Hung, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Andrew Lam', null, 'Impoverished teahouse worker (and martial-arts student) Abao is engaged to his boss'' daughter, Little Chu, and fights to protect her from the lecherous advances of the wealthy but repulsive Master Shi. The two men''s romantic rivalry escalates into full-scale supernatural warfare after Shi enlists the aid of a wicked sorcerer, and Abao encounters a benevolent female ghost.', 'Impoverished teahouse worker (and martial-arts student) Abao is engaged to his boss'' daughter, Little Chu, and fights to protect her from the lecherous advances of the wealthy but repulsive Master Shi. The two men''s romantic rivalry escalates into full-scale supernatural warfare after Shi enlists the aid of a wicked sorcerer, and Abao encounters a benevolent female ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9C7QSD8dTLcJ7nu1KFjpg0miEPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57104'),
  ('669024651565660458', 'Encuentros muy cercanos con señoras de cualquier tipo', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Hugo Moser', 'Hugo Moser', 'Alberto Olmedo, Jorge Porcel, Moria Casán, Adriana Aguirre, Adolfo García Grau, Patricia Dal, Stella Maris Lanzani, Nora Kaleka', null, 'Alberto and Jorge are two comedians, who before the possibility of making money with a business agent, agree to play the role of executives of a fictitious company, in order to appear prosperity before possible foreign buyers of players. As the business agent instructs them to present themselves as married, Alberto and Jorge propose two co-workers to represent the indicated role.', 'Alberto and Jorge are two comedians, who before the possibility of making money with a business agent, agree to play the role of executives of a fictitious company, in order to appear prosperity before possible foreign buyers of players. As the business agent instructs them to present themselves as married, Alberto and Jorge propose two co-workers to represent the indicated role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKEmHfdhAaeqkQSHUVdrYJywJXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366820'),
  ('716704063950644259', 'End', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Artavazd Peleshian, Vahagn Ter-Hakobyan', null, null, null, 'Peleshian transforms footage from a train ride into a metaphor for the shape of a life. Early images of faces on the train give way to landscape, a journey through a black tunnel, and a final emergence into pure white light.', 'Peleshian transforms footage from a train ride into a metaphor for the shape of a life. Early images of faces on the train give way to landscape, a journey through a black tunnel, and a final emergence into pure white light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yEJtv9MsHV0RfmBFJ08OAstjy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200148'),
  ('1064919944246493354', 'End Day', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Gareth Edwards', 'Gareth Edwards', 'Glenn Conroy, Robert Andrews, Craig Court, Allan Edwards, Yvonne Edwards, Bill McGuire, Jay Melosh, John Oxford', null, 'Made in the form of a faux documentary, these are four possibilities - set within the circumstances of a single day replayed over four separate times - that civilization could be brought to an abrupt end...', 'Made in the form of a faux documentary, these are four possibilities - set within the circumstances of a single day replayed over four separate times - that civilization could be brought to an abrupt end...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jzRAUPRnAGTnCqkXAbzrWbLGRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96641'),
  ('915779452944357698', 'End Game', 2006, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Andy Cheng, Chuck Cohen, Spiro Razatos', 'Andy Cheng, J.C. Pollock', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Angie Harmon, James Woods, Patrick Fabian, Peter Greene, Jack Scalia, Anne Archer, David Selby', 'R', 'Secret Service agent Alex Thomas is detailed with protecting the president of the United States but, at a public appearance, everything went wrong and the president is assassinated. Wracked with guilt, he blames himself for his team''s failure. Meanwhile, seasoned journalist Kate Crawford comes to believe there''s a massive conspiracy afoot and convinces Alex of it. Together they unravel a treacherous web of lies as they try to unlock the truth behind the conspiracy amid the deadly threat of shadowy assassins and ex-special ops enforcers.', 'Secret Service agent Alex Thomas is detailed with protecting the president of the United States but, at a public appearance, everything went wrong and the president is assassinated. Wracked with guilt, he blames himself for his team''s failure. Meanwhile, seasoned journalist Kate Crawford comes to believe there''s a massive conspiracy afoot and convinces Alex of it. Together they unravel a treacherous web of lies as they try to unlock the truth behind the conspiracy amid the deadly threat of shadowy assassins and ex-special ops enforcers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fqDXE7nxsqWCng3rwlWZwzBBBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9727'),
  ('26774516326428082', 'End Game', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Jeffrey Friedman, Rob Epstein, Rob Epstein', null, null, null, 'Filmed and edited in intimate vérité style, this movie follows visionary medical practitioners who are working on the cutting edge of life and death and are dedicated to changing our thinking about both.', 'Filmed and edited in intimate vérité style, this movie follows visionary medical practitioners who are working on the cutting edge of life and death and are dedicated to changing our thinking about both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6NoGTsmu0t7sTGqvfZ8oraRPwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510258'),
  ('330992301447352001', 'End of a Gun', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Keoni Waxman, Nathan Wilson, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Keoni Waxman, Chuck Hustmyre', 'Steven Seagal, Jonathan Rosenthal, Ovidiu Niculescu, Alexandre Nguyen, Florin Piersic Jr., Jade Ewen, Jacob Grodnik, Troy Miller', 'R', 'A mall security guard—and former federal agent—crosses paths with a drug kingpin''s enforcer after the guard saves a woman from danger.', 'A mall security guard—and former federal agent—crosses paths with a drug kingpin''s enforcer after the guard saves a woman from danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcwJ9Bs9io0Cg9fTElBxN756Nbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411632'),
  ('622903704402277196', 'End of Days', 1999, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Dawn Brown', 'Andrew W. Marlowe', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Gabriel Byrne, Robin Tunney, Kevin Pollak, CCH Pounder, Derrick O''Connor, David Weisenberg, Rainer Judd', 'R', 'Cynical bodyguard Jericho is hired by a man possessed by Satan, who is in search of his bride. When Jericho realizes what is happening, he must do everything he can to save the woman and the world.', 'Cynical bodyguard Jericho is hired by a man possessed by Satan, who is in search of his bride. When Jericho realizes what is happening, he must do everything he can to save the woman and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY8FbKKl3VD0jRI1iDFrwN6alLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9946'),
  ('1120040824131000786', 'End of Desire', 1958, 'Drama', 'Alexandre Astruc, Claude Renoir', 'Alexandre Astruc, Roland Laudenbach', 'Maria Schell, Christian Marquand, Pascale Petit, Louis Arbessier, Marie-Hélène Dasté, Antonella Lualdi, Ivan Desny, Gérard Darrieu', 'NR', 'Normandy, second half of the nineteenth century. Jeanne Dandieu lives in a manor house with her parents and their servant Rosalie. She gets to know Julien, a handsome man, whom she soon marries. Her happiness is short-lived as she finds out that not only has Julien married her for her money but he cheats on her as well, with Rosalie to crown it all.', 'Normandy, second half of the nineteenth century. Jeanne Dandieu lives in a manor house with her parents and their servant Rosalie. She gets to know Julien, a handsome man, whom she soon marries. Her happiness is short-lived as she finds out that not only has Julien married her for her money but he cheats on her as well, with Rosalie to crown it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQR1LXGOLgsIwlAWrNVSkxqIlAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169780'),
  ('803822188963274115', 'End of Sentence', 2019, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Elfar Adalsteins, Karl Oskarsson', 'Michael Armbruster', 'John Hawkes, Logan Lerman, Sarah Bolger, Andrea Irvine, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Denis Conway, Lalor Roddy, David Grant Wright', null, 'Newly widowed Frank Fogle embarks on a journey to Ireland to scatter his late wife’s ashes. His estranged son, Sean, recently released from prison, agrees to join only when his father promises that they’ll never see each other again following the trip. After revelations surface about an old flame of Frank’s wife and a charming hitchhiker with plans of her own intervenes, father and son find themselves drawn together in unexpected ways.', 'Newly widowed Frank Fogle embarks on a journey to Ireland to scatter his late wife’s ashes. His estranged son, Sean, recently released from prison, agrees to join only when his father promises that they’ll never see each other again following the trip. After revelations surface about an old flame of Frank’s wife and a charming hitchhiker with plans of her own intervenes, father and son find themselves drawn together in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46rCwwajqDkruT2cJyW1DWhyJrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472500'),
  ('732807711202032324', 'End of the Century', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lucio Castro, Bernat Mestres, Maria La Greca', 'Lucio Castro', 'Juan Barberini, Ramon Pujol, Mía Maestro, Mariano López Seoane, Helen Celia Castro-Wood', null, 'When Ocho, an Argentine poet on vacation in Barcelona, spots Javi from his balcony, the attraction is subtle but persistent. After a missed connection on the beach, a third chance encounter escalates to a seemingly random hookup. But are they part of each other’s histories, or maybe even destinies?', 'When Ocho, an Argentine poet on vacation in Barcelona, spots Javi from his balcony, the attraction is subtle but persistent. After a missed connection on the beach, a third chance encounter escalates to a seemingly random hookup. But are they part of each other’s histories, or maybe even destinies?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohKFWPragxPcF3WqhgsKkA0EWkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586961'),
  ('116430671613169512', 'End of the Century: The Story of the Ramones', 2003, 'Documentary, Music', 'Michael Gramaglia, Jim Fields', null, 'Marky Ramone, Johnny Ramone, Dee Dee Ramone, Tommy Ramone, Joey Ramone, Richie Ramone, Rick Rubin, Chris Stein', 'NR', 'A years-in-the-making documentary on the legendary punk band the Ramones. Through a mixture of archival footage, archival and new interviews with all members of the band''s various lineups, and new interviews with a number of their contemporaries, the film traces the peaks and valleys the band experienced over the course of its 20-plus year career before disbanding in 1995.', 'A years-in-the-making documentary on the legendary punk band the Ramones. Through a mixture of archival footage, archival and new interviews with all members of the band''s various lineups, and new interviews with a number of their contemporaries, the film traces the peaks and valleys the band experienced over the course of its 20-plus year career before disbanding in 1995.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqoZkkOVWE5f0H8jnrFRc7KAHs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16301'),
  ('837917478998750423', 'End of the Game', 1978, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Maximilian Schell, Ennio Guarnieri, Klaus König', 'Friedrich Dürrenmatt, Maximilian Schell, Roberto De Leonardis', 'Jon Voight, Jacqueline Bisset, Martin Ritt, Robert Shaw, Helmut Qualtinger, Gabriele Ferzetti, Rita Calderoni, Friedrich Dürrenmatt', 'PG', 'Hans Baerlach is a Swiss police detective who has dedicated much of his career to pursuing powerful and allegedly murderous businessman Richard Gastmann. Though Baerlach''s partner meets his demise while investigating Gastmann, his replacement, Walter Tschanz, is undaunted. Meanwhile, the lovely Anna Crawley becomes involved in the case, which proceeds to take many twists and turns.', 'Hans Baerlach is a Swiss police detective who has dedicated much of his career to pursuing powerful and allegedly murderous businessman Richard Gastmann. Though Baerlach''s partner meets his demise while investigating Gastmann, his replacement, Walter Tschanz, is undaunted. Meanwhile, the lovely Anna Crawley becomes involved in the case, which proceeds to take many twists and turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aq5SwVQ37piQwRYVLBr1lARa4cR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72494'),
  ('1055692101748608955', 'End of the Line', 1987, 'Action, Drama', 'Jay Russell, George Tirl', 'Jay Russell, John Wohlbruck', 'Kevin Bacon, Bob Balaban, Barbara Barrie, Michael Beach, Judy Benson, Wilford Brimley, Levon Helm, Clint Howard', 'PG', 'When the closure of a railway is announced, employees commandeer a locomotive to get to corporate headquarters and confront the president.', 'When the closure of a railway is announced, employees commandeer a locomotive to get to corporate headquarters and confront the president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6L4rvQ1KHVUiJb4URBzY1sjXk9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49855'),
  ('25917700620242578', 'End of the Line', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Maurice Devereaux, Denis-Noël Mostert, Shaun Malley', 'Maurice Devereaux', 'Ilona Elkin, Nicolas Wright, Neil Napier, Emily Shelton, Tim Rozon, Nina M. Fillis, Joan McBride, Danny Blanco Hall', 'R', 'Karen, a young psychiatric nurse, boards the last subway train of the night only to have it stop in the middle of the tunnel. Suddenly, her nightmare begins: a mysterious cult has decided that it''s the end of the world and the only way to save the souls of the living is to kill them in cold blood. As those around her are brutally murdered, Karen and a handful of survivors must face the homicidal cult, supernatural forces, and their own fears of Armageddon in order to survive.', 'Karen, a young psychiatric nurse, boards the last subway train of the night only to have it stop in the middle of the tunnel. Suddenly, her nightmare begins: a mysterious cult has decided that it''s the end of the world and the only way to save the souls of the living is to kill them in cold blood. As those around her are brutally murdered, Karen and a handful of survivors must face the homicidal cult, supernatural forces, and their own fears of Armageddon in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYzPhWgalmsICZw7ptaqNkGMnHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12791'),
  ('285956550258968803', 'End of the Road', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ben Burt, Susan E. Fiore, Ed Wu', 'Christopher J. Moore, David Loughery', 'Queen Latifah, Ludacris, Mychala Lee, Shaun Dixon, Beau Bridges, Frances Lee McCain, Keith Jardine, Jesse Luken', 'R', 'Recently widowed mom Brenda fights to protect her family during a harrowing road trip when a murder and a missing bag of cash plunge them into danger.', 'Recently widowed mom Brenda fights to protect her family during a harrowing road trip when a murder and a missing bag of cash plunge them into danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLFIMuPWJHlTJ6TN8HCOiSD6SdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773975'),
  ('881387233195032007', 'End of the Season', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lars Henning, Carol Burandt von Kameke', 'Lars Henning', 'Peter Kurth, Karl Markovics, Catrin Striebeck, Leonardo Nigro, Piet Fuchs, Jonathan Neo Völk, Marko Dyrlich, Paul Faßnacht', null, 'Becker is a German ex-con trying to hold down a job as a night watchman, but a chance encounter with the man whose family Becker killed 18 years earlier sends his new life spiraling out of control.', 'Becker is a German ex-con trying to hold down a job as a night watchman, but a chance encounter with the man whose family Becker killed 18 years earlier sends his new life spiraling out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKjaqymFn22I2r9PT7IMUXA1kBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404806'),
  ('371948320514103245', 'End of the Spear', 2005, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Jim Hanon, Eugene Mazzola, Robert Driskell', 'Bill Ewing, Bart Gavigan, Jim Hanon', 'Louie Leonardo, Chad Allen, Jack Guzman, Chase Ellison, Sylvia Jefferies, Christina Souza, Chemo Mepaquito, Ninabet Bedoya', 'PG-13', '"End of the Spear" is the story of Mincayani, a Waodani tribesman from the jungles of Ecuador. When five young missionaries, among them Jim Elliot and Nate Saint, are speared to death by the Waodani in 1956, a series of events unfold to change the lives of not only the slain missionaries'' families, but also Mincayani and his people.', '"End of the Spear" is the story of Mincayani, a Waodani tribesman from the jungles of Ecuador. When five young missionaries, among them Jim Elliot and Nate Saint, are speared to death by the Waodani in 1956, a series of events unfold to change the lives of not only the slain missionaries'' families, but also Mincayani and his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jMM1cuF1FcxdPPdEJy8gquDmES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14120'),
  ('160984960278923399', 'End of the World', 1977, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'John Hayes, John Huneck', 'Frank Ray Perilli', 'Christopher Lee, Sue Lyon, Kirk Scott, Dean Jagger, Lew Ayres, Macdonald Carey, Liz Ross, Jon Van Ness', 'PG', 'After witnessing a man''s death in a bizarre accident, Father Pergado goes on a spiritual retreat, where he encounters his alien double bent on world conquest.', 'After witnessing a man''s death in a bizarre accident, Father Pergado goes on a spiritual retreat, where he encounters his alien double bent on world conquest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixPm2F6ddHpVrQvCkNZeKT2sXP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3030'),
  ('806781999405698426', 'End of the World', 2002, 'Animation', 'Osamu Kobayashi', null, null, null, 'Kazumi is at a punk concert and bumps into Yuko. Yuko is a girl from another dimension. Kazumi invites Yuko over to her apartment. There Yuko''s robotic sidekick and stead Face comes from out of the t.v. The wall opens up and Yuko and Face enter into different dimension. Yuko seeks to kill the creator of the dimension to end the suffering of it''s people. Yuko meets Kazumi, who claims not to be from Earth, at a rock concert, and they become instant friends. Yuko invites her new friend to come live with her. However, onces Kazumi gets to Yuko''s apartment, she leaves through the wall with her trusty cybernetic steed and into another dimension to face evil.', 'Kazumi is at a punk concert and bumps into Yuko. Yuko is a girl from another dimension. Kazumi invites Yuko over to her apartment. There Yuko''s robotic sidekick and stead Face comes from out of the t.v. The wall opens up and Yuko and Face enter into different dimension. Yuko seeks to kill the creator of the dimension to end the suffering of it''s people. Yuko meets Kazumi, who claims not to be from Earth, at a rock concert, and they become instant friends. Yuko invites her new friend to come live with her. However, onces Kazumi gets to Yuko''s apartment, she leaves through the wall with her trusty cybernetic steed and into another dimension to face evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43vWhNkq5a9W6EmODgisLEWw0Qy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365290'),
  ('706122924886635014', 'End of the World', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Steven R. Monroe, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Jason Bourque, David Ray', 'Caroline Cave, Brad Dourif, Greg Grunberg, Neil Grayston, Mark Hildreth, Amitai Marmorstein, Serge Houde, Merrilyn Gann', 'PG-13', 'In End of the World, the fate of humanity lies in the hands of two guys who run a video rental store and are “sci-fi obsessed” movie fans. And who better to save the world, than guys who have seen all the movies and all the “out there” ways to save it!?', 'In End of the World, the fate of humanity lies in the hands of two guys who run a video rental store and are “sci-fi obsessed” movie fans. And who better to save the world, than guys who have seen all the movies and all the “out there” ways to save it!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZsk45d9zARmvyW4pXvIhx7izRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172721'),
  ('1095778966084876787', 'End of Watch', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Roman Vasyanov, David Ayer', 'David Ayer', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Michael Peña, Natalie Martinez, Anna Kendrick, David Harbour, Frank Grillo, America Ferrera, Cody H. Carolin', 'R', 'Two young officers are marked for death after confiscating a small cache of money and firearms from the members of a notorious cartel during a routine traffic stop.', 'Two young officers are marked for death after confiscating a small cache of money and firearms from the members of a notorious cartel during a routine traffic stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDeVKQICkcdwwjHxGj0MeS14YJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77016'),
  ('970420924661712540', 'End Zone', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Terica Kindred', 'Jerry Robbins', 'Johnell Young, Jizzixious Bishop, Matthew Gilmore, Yhover Perez, Drew Sidora', null, 'Recovering from severe leg injuries, a college football star is terrorized by hallucinations of his deceased friends and a mysterious figure who breaks into his home.', 'Recovering from severe leg injuries, a college football star is terrorized by hallucinations of his deceased friends and a mysterious figure who breaks into his home.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYmI4YWY0MDQtYTA0Zi00ODA3LWJmNmEtNjQzMjczYjBlOWFkXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:end-zone-2026'),
  ('867188988006849526', 'Endangered Species', 1982, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Alan Rudolph, Paul Lohmann', 'Alan Rudolph, John Binder', 'Robert Urich, JoBeth Williams, Paul Dooley, Hoyt Axton, Peter Coyote, Marin Kanter, Gailard Sartain, Dan Hedaya', 'R', 'A retired New York cop on vacation in America''s West is drawn into a sheriff''s investigation of a mysterious series of cattle killings.', 'A retired New York cop on vacation in America''s West is drawn into a sheriff''s investigation of a mysterious series of cattle killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBmVdwGCTn9xrXwDKRkLN07nT7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65300'),
  ('286486448783301057', 'Endangered Species', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Kevin Tenney, Christopher Manley', 'Kevin Tenney', 'Arnold Vosloo, Eric Roberts, John Rhys-Davies, Tony Lo Bianco, Al Sapienza, Saulius Siparis, James W. Quinn, Sarah Kaite Coughlan', null, 'When police are puzzled by several horrific murders, they assume they have a serial killer on their hands. But soon they realise that the unimaginable has happened. A killing machine from another world has arrived on Earth determined to brutally execute human beings. Finding themselves out of their depth they are forced to rely on a mysterious alien hunter that has volunteered his help.', 'When police are puzzled by several horrific murders, they assume they have a serial killer on their hands. But soon they realise that the unimaginable has happened. A killing machine from another world has arrived on Earth determined to brutally execute human beings. Finding themselves out of their depth they are forced to rely on a mysterious alien hunter that has volunteered his help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAz5hduQNMgUhVKgBBZPjrVWB4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133831'),
  ('960553806608670032', 'Endangered Species', 2017, 'Drama', 'Gilles Bourdos, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Michel Spinosa, Gilles Bourdos', 'Alice Isaaz, Éric Elmosnino, Grégory Gadebois, Vincent Rottiers, Suzanne Clément, Damien Chapelle, Brigitte Catillon, Alice de Lencquesaing', null, 'The fates of three entwined families. Joséphine and Tomas have just got married. It was a joyful celebration. But soon, Joséphine’s parents will discover a darker side lurking behind the couple’s sunny happiness. Meanwhile, Mélanie tells her parents that she is pregnant but the father is not ideal.', 'The fates of three entwined families. Joséphine and Tomas have just got married. It was a joyful celebration. But soon, Joséphine’s parents will discover a darker side lurking behind the couple’s sunny happiness. Meanwhile, Mélanie tells her parents that she is pregnant but the father is not ideal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQGhLaAS9dy88Gl3LuqEnIw46EJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421452'),
  ('357409945936572085', 'Endangered Species', 2021, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'MJ Bassett, Brendan Barnes, Julia Seth Smith', 'MJ Bassett, Isabel Bassett', 'Rebecca Romijn, Philip Winchester, Isabel Bassett, Michael Johnston, Chris Fisher, Jerry O''Connell, Brenda Ngeso, George Glenn Ouma', 'R', 'Jack Halsey takes his wife, their adult kids, and a friend for a dream vacation in Kenya. But as they venture off alone into a wilderness park, their safari van is flipped over by an angry rhino, leaving them injured and desperate. Then, as two of them go in search of rescue, a bloody, vicious encounter with a leopard and a clan of hyenas incites a desperate fight for survival.', 'Jack Halsey takes his wife, their adult kids, and a friend for a dream vacation in Kenya. But as they venture off alone into a wilderness park, their safari van is flipped over by an angry rhino, leaving them injured and desperate. Then, as two of them go in search of rescue, a bloody, vicious encounter with a leopard and a clan of hyenas incites a desperate fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccsSqbpEqr2KK9eMvoeF8ERFCd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:817451'),
  ('175873806972601538', 'Ender''s Game', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Gavin Hood, Donald McAlpine, Garrett Warren', 'Gavin Hood', 'Asa Butterfield, Hailee Steinfeld, Harrison Ford, Viola Davis, Ben Kingsley, Abigail Breslin, Aramis Knight, Moisés Arias', 'PG-13', 'Based on the classic novel by Orson Scott Card, Ender''s Game is the story of the Earth''s most gifted children training to defend their homeplanet in the space wars of the future.', 'Based on the classic novel by Orson Scott Card, Ender''s Game is the story of the Earth''s most gifted children training to defend their homeplanet in the space wars of the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVcRI5YKnkkgaAD876jBeKb189d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80274'),
  ('680118018720498446', 'Endgame', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', 'Aldo Florio, Joe D''Amato', 'Al Cliver, Laura Gemser, George Eastman, Gabriele Tinti, Gordon Mitchell, Dino Conti, Bobby Rhodes, Nello Pazzafini', 'R', 'A telepathic mutant recruits a post World War III TV game show warrior to lead her band of mutants to safety.', 'A telepathic mutant recruits a post World War III TV game show warrior to lead her band of mutants to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vr1ru5obpajhCnSTyiYXEQp2ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28850'),
  ('263614662085872324', 'Endgame', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pete Travis, Mark Goddard, Daryn Goldsbrough', 'Paula Milne', 'William Hurt, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Jonny Lee Miller, Mark Strong, Clarke Peters, John Kani, Derek Jacobi, Timothy West', 'PG-13', 'The time is the late ''80s, a crucial period in the history of South Africa. President P.W. Botha is hanging on to power by a thread as the African National Congress (ANC) takes up arms against apartheid and the country tumbles toward insurrection. A British mining concern is convinced that their interests would be better served in a stable South Africa and they quietly dispatch Michael Young, their head of public affairs, to open an unofficial dialogue between the bitter rivals. Assembling a reluctant yet brilliant team to pave the way to reconciliation by confronting obstacles that initially seem insurmountable, Young places his trust in ANC leader Thabo Mbeki and Afrikaner philosophy professor Willie Esterhuyse. It is their empathy that will ultimately serve as the catalyst for change by proving more powerful than the terrorist bombs that threaten to disrupt the peaceful dialogue.', 'The time is the late ''80s, a crucial period in the history of South Africa. President P.W. Botha is hanging on to power by a thread as the African National Congress (ANC) takes up arms against apartheid and the country tumbles toward insurrection. A British mining concern is convinced that their interests would be better served in a stable South Africa and they quietly dispatch Michael Young, their head of public affairs, to open an unofficial dialogue between the bitter rivals. Assembling a reluctant yet brilliant team to pave the way to reconciliation by confronting obstacles that initially seem insurmountable, Young places his trust in ANC leader Thabo Mbeki and Afrikaner philosophy professor Willie Esterhuyse. It is their empathy that will ultimately serve as the catalyst for change by proving more powerful than the terrorist bombs that threaten to disrupt the peaceful dialogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8WzwCABwVRVdw14OcE6pmezJjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15102'),
  ('880322551366286080', 'Endgame', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Wang Gang, Liao Ni, Rao Xiaozhi', 'Fan Xiang, Rao Xiaozhi, Li Xiang', 'Andy Lau, Xiao Yang, Wan Qian, Cheng Yi, Huang Xiaolei, Ti Chih-Chieh, Guo Yiqian, Wang Xuebing', null, 'A world-class hitman ends up swapping identities with a down-to-luck extra actor during an accident.', 'A world-class hitman ends up swapping identities with a down-to-luck extra actor during an accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3chxejrvpOU5sAc0vU1xjiyoc7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752803'),
  ('1069571262876864436', 'Endings, Beginnings', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sarah Balboa, Sean Vawter, Colin Flaherty', 'Jardine Libaire, Drake Doremus', 'Shailene Woodley, Jamie Dornan, Sebastian Stan, Matthew Gray Gubler, Lindsay Sloane, Noureen DeWulf, Shamier Anderson, Penny O''Brien', null, 'An artist dumps her longtime boyfriend, but her attempt to take a break from dating ends when she quickly finds herself in two passionate romances.', 'An artist dumps her longtime boyfriend, but her attempt to take a break from dating ends when she quickly finds herself in two passionate romances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yfJDjTp6n8QXN0M9aGCYpqahXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554908'),
  ('26957250560975298', 'Endless', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Scott Speer, Frank Borin, Mark Dobrescu', 'Andre Case, Oneil Sharma', 'Alexandra Shipp, Nicholas Hamilton, DeRon Horton, Famke Janssen, Ian Tracey, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Zoë Belkin, Eddie Ramos', null, 'When madly in love high school graduates Riley and Chris are separated by a tragic car accident, Riley blames herself for her boyfriend''s death while Chris is stranded in limbo. Miraculously, the two find a way to connect. In a love story that transcends life and death, both Riley and Chris are forced to learn the hardest lesson of all: letting go.', 'When madly in love high school graduates Riley and Chris are separated by a tragic car accident, Riley blames herself for her boyfriend''s death while Chris is stranded in limbo. Miraculously, the two find a way to connect. In a love story that transcends life and death, both Riley and Chris are forced to learn the hardest lesson of all: letting go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZViaX2oRnI0uM3Gf87Z7eCZ3hE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470610'),
  ('1111492661605802940', 'Endless Desire', 1958, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shōhei Imamura, Shinsaku Himeda, Kirio Urayama', 'Shōhei Imamura, Hisashi Yamanouchi', 'Hiroyuki Nagato, Misako Watanabe, Kō Nishimura, Sanae Nakahara, Taiji Tonoyama, Takeshi Katō, Shoichi Ozawa, Reiji Akitsu', null, 'Set in post-war Japan, a group of five, four men and one woman, gathers in the basement of a butcher shop to dig up a cache of morphine buried during the war. A grimly humorous tale of twisted relationships as one by one each of the group is eliminated.', 'Set in post-war Japan, a group of five, four men and one woman, gathers in the basement of a butcher shop to dig up a cache of morphine buried during the war. A grimly humorous tale of twisted relationships as one by one each of the group is eliminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYZdDrFkIIclaw6zWwKq8CedXFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37330'),
  ('288544015682241586', 'Endless Journey', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dai Mo, Dong Jinsong', 'Zhang Ji', 'Zhang Yi, Vision Wei, Cao Bingkun, Wang Xiao, Zhang Zixian, Yang Xinming, Jerry Lee, Gao Ye', null, 'An accidental death of the suspect leads to the entire team of the Third Division being imprisoned. Six years later, team leader Cheng Bing is released but remains consumed by the case. Over the next eleven years, he lives a normal life while secretly tracking down the killer, determined to see justice served.', 'An accidental death of the suspect leads to the entire team of the Third Division being imprisoned. Six years later, team leader Cheng Bing is released but remains consumed by the case. Over the next eleven years, he lives a normal life while secretly tracking down the killer, determined to see justice served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIXESA5wfbfNtjfNAE1P2xi3Wn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109586'),
  ('104182472470828470', 'Endless Loop', 2018, 'Crime, Science Fiction', 'He Wen', null, 'Nie Yuan, Ge Tian, Yu Weiwei, Marco Chen, Shuang Chen, Lu Zhuo, Chu Junchen, Luan Yuanhui', null, 'The story starts because of one journey. Seven people who have never met before climb aboard the same ride that goes into a seemingly endless tunnel. Despite the countless trials, corpses that mysteriously appear, past acquaintances that returned from the dead and an unseen danger threatening to swallow them whole, it''s as if they are trapped in an enclosed space where there is no escape.', 'The story starts because of one journey. Seven people who have never met before climb aboard the same ride that goes into a seemingly endless tunnel. Despite the countless trials, corpses that mysteriously appear, past acquaintances that returned from the dead and an unseen danger threatening to swallow them whole, it''s as if they are trapped in an enclosed space where there is no escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilju5NjTb6l1IIpT2u2ST6TNg5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570587'),
  ('572273221154867103', 'Endless Love', 1981, 'Romance, Drama', 'Franco Zeffirelli, David Watkin', 'Judith Rascoe', 'Brooke Shields, Martin Hewitt, Shirley Knight, Don Murray, Richard Kiley, Beatrice Straight, James Spader, Ian Ziering', 'R', 'As their romance unfolds, Jade and David''s growing love for one another becomes the scorn of Jade''s father. However, when Jade''s grades begin to drop, her father forbids the young couple from seeing each other for 30 days. Driven insane with frustration and desire, David attempts to reverse the decision, with catastrophic results.', 'As their romance unfolds, Jade and David''s growing love for one another becomes the scorn of Jade''s father. However, when Jade''s grades begin to drop, her father forbids the young couple from seeing each other for 30 days. Driven insane with frustration and desire, David attempts to reverse the decision, with catastrophic results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAU5kEn3n2PROao46iqs0w57Tqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19114'),
  ('1053200993371493579', 'Endless Love', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shana Feste, Andrew Dunn, David Mendoza', 'Joshua Safran, Shana Feste', 'Alex Pettyfer, Gabriella Wilde, Bruce Greenwood, Rhys Wakefield, Joely Richardson, Robert Patrick, Emma Rigby, Anna Enger Ritch', 'PG-13', 'A privileged girl and a charismatic boy''s instant desire sparks a love affair made only more reckless by parents trying to keep them apart.', 'A privileged girl and a charismatic boy''s instant desire sparks a love affair made only more reckless by parents trying to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7FZP6uivgVc4t0mnmia0B8YygW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226857'),
  ('573641677654068433', 'Endless Love', 2017, 'Romance', 'Ahmet Katıksız', null, 'Murat Yildirim, Fahriye Evcen, Fatih Al, Filiz Ahmet, Zeynep Özder, Didem İnselel, Ege Aydan, Nazlı Pınar Kaya', null, 'Sparks fly when a humble housekeeper crosses paths with a wealthy surgeon, but a devastating truth puts their relationship to the test.', 'Sparks fly when a humble housekeeper crosses paths with a wealthy surgeon, but a devastating truth puts their relationship to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnVrVJT1Ek0jHyOjHtUnUW6SSrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468261'),
  ('883883728001509223', 'Endless Night', 1972, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Sidney Gilliat, Harry Waxman', 'Sidney Gilliat', 'Hayley Mills, Hywel Bennett, Britt Ekland, Per Oscarsson, George Sanders, Aubrey Richards, Ann Way, Patience Collier', null, 'Shiftless dreamer Michael Rogers fantasizes about a lifestyle above his means and marries a wealthy, young girl who just came of age. They hire a famous architect to build their dream home amidst a series of suspicious incidents. The spouse has dark intentions toward his naive, inexperienced bride. Secrets from his past and sinister ties to their house guest Greta lead to a terrible turn of unexpected events.', 'Shiftless dreamer Michael Rogers fantasizes about a lifestyle above his means and marries a wealthy, young girl who just came of age. They hire a famous architect to build their dream home amidst a series of suspicious incidents. The spouse has dark intentions toward his naive, inexperienced bride. Secrets from his past and sinister ties to their house guest Greta lead to a terrible turn of unexpected events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i90GwuPa58Ndz8CE71sZF6D2jQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40821'),
  ('736097278126099869', 'Endless Night', 2015, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Isabel Coixet, Jean-Claude Larrieu, Jairo Murray', 'Miguel Barros', 'Juliette Binoche, Rinko Kikuchi, Gabriel Byrne, Orto Ignatiussen, Matt Salinger, Ben Temple, Alberto Jo Lee, Clarence Smith', null, 'Ellesmere Island, northern Canada, 1908. Josephine, a brave but naive woman, embarks on a dangerous journey through inhospitable regions in search of her husband, the explorer Robert Peary, who tries to find a route to the North Pole.', 'Ellesmere Island, northern Canada, 1908. Josephine, a brave but naive woman, embarks on a dangerous journey through inhospitable regions in search of her husband, the explorer Robert Peary, who tries to find a route to the North Pole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62I43mWLre7zZNPit4zzr8Ia8Ry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320004'),
  ('417150963850479320', 'Endless Poetry', 2016, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Christopher Doyle', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky', 'Adan Jodorowsky, Brontis Jodorowsky, Pamela Flores, Leandro Taub, Alejandro Jodorowsky, Jeremias Herskovits, Julia Avendaño, Bastián Bodenhöfer', null, 'A portrait of the director’s young adulthood, set in the 1940s–1950s, in the electric capital city of Santiago. There, he decides to become a poet and is introduced, by destiny, into the foremost bohemian and artistic circle of the time.', 'A portrait of the director’s young adulthood, set in the 1940s–1950s, in the electric capital city of Santiago. There, he decides to become a poet and is introduced, by destiny, into the foremost bohemian and artistic circle of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJTWnSa3YOnD15zMME3ox9GP8XA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325385'),
  ('268066275685721423', 'Endless Rain', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yoo Il-seung, You Seok-moon, Cho Jin-mo', 'Yu Seong-hyeob', 'Kang Ha-neul, Chun Woo-hee, Kang So-ra, Lee Sul, Lim Ju-hwan, Lee Hang-na, Lee Yang-hee, Park Se-hyun', null, 'About a man and a woman who miss each other but cannot meet. Young-ho, a young man who took several tries to get into college, doesn''t have any special goals in life, and starts exchanging letters with someone.', 'About a man and a woman who miss each other but cannot meet. Young-ho, a young man who took several tries to get into college, doesn''t have any special goals in life, and starts exchanging letters with someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pn0NSlPTtUfKMP5xqZQCSsVNbsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656159'),
  ('390558690770431165', 'Endless Summer Syndrome', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Kaveh Daneshmand, Cedric Larvoire', 'Laurine Bauby, Kaveh Daneshmand', 'Sophie Colon, Matteo Capelli, Gem Deger, Frédérika Milano, Margaret Elizabeth Ousey, Roland Plantin, Patricia Piolet, Nikolina Menik Tute', null, 'When the mother of two adoptees is tipped off about the possible affair her husband may be having with one of their children, her sense of duty takes a macabre turn.', 'When the mother of two adoptees is tipped off about the possible affair her husband may be having with one of their children, her sense of duty takes a macabre turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qV40fy8UOUwoodvfJ3rd9PCMUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1188843'),
  ('137090510688543008', 'Endorphine', 2015, 'Drama', 'André Turpin, Josée Deshaies', 'André Turpin', 'Sophie Nélisse, Mylène Mackay, Lise Roy, Guy Thauvette, Monia Chokri, Stéphane Crête, Anne-Marie Cadieux, Théodore Pellerin', null, 'Twelve-year-old Simone feels painfully disconnected from the world after witnessing the brutal death of her mother. Simone, a solitary multimedia artist in her twenties, is struggling to control her crushing panic attacks and keep her day job in an underground parking lot. And Simone, a sixty-year-old physicist, is giving a conference on the nature of time. The three Simones'' lives are intertwined in a labyrinthine meta-world where timeframes overlap, characters multiply, and storylines repeat and expand. But, for all its shuttling forward and back through time, ENDORPHINE remains grounded in the Simones'' inner lives — it''s an artistic examination of scientific phenomena that also poignantly explores how people deal with trauma.', 'Twelve-year-old Simone feels painfully disconnected from the world after witnessing the brutal death of her mother. Simone, a solitary multimedia artist in her twenties, is struggling to control her crushing panic attacks and keep her day job in an underground parking lot. And Simone, a sixty-year-old physicist, is giving a conference on the nature of time. The three Simones'' lives are intertwined in a labyrinthine meta-world where timeframes overlap, characters multiply, and storylines repeat and expand. But, for all its shuttling forward and back through time, ENDORPHINE remains grounded in the Simones'' inner lives — it''s an artistic examination of scientific phenomena that also poignantly explores how people deal with trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1ZwGLPxzIgJaH3v8cNzu9Kh1eO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356733'),
  ('920433480443767681', 'Endurance', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Natalie Hewit, Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi, Jimmy Chin', null, 'Mensun Bound, John Shears, Nicolas Vincent, Dan Snow, Ernest Shackleton, Frank Worsley, Frank Hurley, Lasse Rabenstein', 'PG-13', 'A century after Shackleton''s Endurance sank beneath the ice, explorers uncover the legendary shipwreck and an amazing tale of survival.', 'A century after Shackleton''s Endurance sank beneath the ice, explorers uncover the legendary shipwreck and an amazing tale of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LPRuJ7pSxUB559ac8SS5mdElz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947763'),
  ('691947779691118620', 'Enduring Love', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Roger Michell, Jim Dowdall, Olivia Peniston-Bird', 'Joe Penhall', 'Daniel Craig, Rhys Ifans, Samantha Morton, Bill Nighy, Susan Lynch, Helen McCrory, Andrew Lincoln, Justin Salinger', 'R', 'Two strangers become dangerously close after witnessing a deadly accident. On a beautiful cloudless day a young couple celebrate their reunion with a picnic. Joe has planned a postcard-perfect afternoon in the English countryside with his partner, Claire. But as Joe and Claire prepare to open a bottle of champagne, their idyll comes to an abrupt end. A hot air balloon drifts into the field, obviously in trouble. The pilot catches his leg in the anchor rope, while the only passenger, a boy, is too scared to jump down. Joe and three other men rush to secure the basket. But fate has other ideas...', 'Two strangers become dangerously close after witnessing a deadly accident. On a beautiful cloudless day a young couple celebrate their reunion with a picnic. Joe has planned a postcard-perfect afternoon in the English countryside with his partner, Claire. But as Joe and Claire prepare to open a bottle of champagne, their idyll comes to an abrupt end. A hot air balloon drifts into the field, obviously in trouble. The pilot catches his leg in the anchor rope, while the only passenger, a boy, is too scared to jump down. Joe and three other men rush to secure the basket. But fate has other ideas...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogaUARGgXWmNSuh8qnFCcbqVvZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9391'),
  ('275947757539092371', 'Enea', 2024, 'Drama', 'Andrea Vellucci, Pietro Castellitto, Radek Ładczuk', 'Pietro Castellitto', 'Pietro Castellitto, Sergio Castellitto, Giorgio Quarzo Guarascio, Benedetta Porcaroli, Chiara Noschese, Giorgio Montanini, Adamo Dionisi, Matteo Branciamore', null, 'Enea chases after the myth he bears in his name; he does so to feel alive in a dead and decadent age. He does so together with Valentino, a newly baptized aviator. The two, in addition to dealing and partying, share youth. Lifelong friends, victims and perpetrators of a corrupt world, but moved by an incorruptible vitality. Beyond the boundaries of rules, on the other side of morality, there is a sea full of humanity and symbols to be discovered. Enea and Valentino will fly over it to the furthest extremes. However, drugs and the underworld are the invisible shadow of a story about something else: a melancholy father, a brother fighting at school, a mother defeated by love and a beautiful girl, a happy ending and a happy death, a palm tree falling on a glass world.', 'Enea chases after the myth he bears in his name; he does so to feel alive in a dead and decadent age. He does so together with Valentino, a newly baptized aviator. The two, in addition to dealing and partying, share youth. Lifelong friends, victims and perpetrators of a corrupt world, but moved by an incorruptible vitality. Beyond the boundaries of rules, on the other side of morality, there is a sea full of humanity and symbols to be discovered. Enea and Valentino will fly over it to the furthest extremes. However, drugs and the underworld are the invisible shadow of a story about something else: a melancholy father, a brother fighting at school, a mother defeated by love and a beautiful girl, a happy ending and a happy death, a palm tree falling on a glass world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fp9JSZDh0qCrud6YgoQYsDbgt3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1057999'),
  ('435779820477969276', 'Enemies Closer', 2013, 'Thriller, Action', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Franklin A. Vallette', 'James Bromberg, Eric Bromberg', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Tom Everett Scott, Orlando Jones, Linzey Cocker, Kris Van Damme, Zahari Baharov, Dimo Alexiev, Vlado Mihailov', 'R', 'After a major shipment of drugs goes missing on the US-Canadian border, forest ranger and former Navy SEAL Henry is plunged into survival mode when the drug cartel forces him to help retrieve the downed package. Trapped in the wilderness with no communication to the outside world, Henry finds himself face to face with Clay, a man with a personal vendetta against Henry who has returned for retribution. Now, the two mortal enemies must make a choice: put aside their past and work together, or die alone at the hands of the drug runners, a ruthless gang who will stop at nothing to retrieve their lost cargo.', 'After a major shipment of drugs goes missing on the US-Canadian border, forest ranger and former Navy SEAL Henry is plunged into survival mode when the drug cartel forces him to help retrieve the downed package. Trapped in the wilderness with no communication to the outside world, Henry finds himself face to face with Clay, a man with a personal vendetta against Henry who has returned for retribution. Now, the two mortal enemies must make a choice: put aside their past and work together, or die alone at the hands of the drug runners, a ruthless gang who will stop at nothing to retrieve their lost cargo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5njeDzYgcFV8wyVnytKPc3U62Cc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238589'),
  ('354220294735708318', 'Enemies In-Law', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Han Ki-eop, Kim Jin-young', 'Jo Joong-hoon', 'Jin Se-yeon, Hong Jong-hyun, Shin Jung-keun, Jeon Soo-kyeong, Kim Eung-soo, Park Eun-hye, Chung Sung-hwa, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'Chul-soo is the only son of a legendary thief family. He falls in love with Young-hee who is a police officer. Her family is also a police family. To get her parents’ permission to marry, Chul-soo undertakes an exam to become a police officer, but both families work to prevent their marriage.', 'Chul-soo is the only son of a legendary thief family. He falls in love with Young-hee who is a police officer. Her family is also a police family. To get her parents’ permission to marry, Chul-soo undertakes an exam to become a police officer, but both families work to prevent their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xe2q5puzmFogp2i3fVla9Xcloc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340912'),
  ('748576603433194686', 'Enemies Within', 2016, 'Drama', 'Selim Azzazi', 'Selim Azzazi', 'Stéphane Perrichon, Hassam Ghancy, Najib Oudghiri', null, 'During the 90s, Algerian terrorism reaches France. Two men. Two identities. One battle.', 'During the 90s, Algerian terrorism reaches France. Two men. Two identities. One battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOqdjZf5RYbRUXQQGPYCL58At4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427413'),
