  ('359138359139547088', 'Enemigos', 2025, 'Drama', 'David Valero, Alberto Pareja, Zara Cruz', 'Alfonso Amador, David Valero', 'Christian Checa, Hugo Welzel, Estefanía de los Santos, Luna Pamiés, José María Peinado, Sara Vidorreta, José Manuel Poga, Inma Sancho', 'R', 'Chimo turns 18 years and comes from a humble and supportive family. Since childhood he was bullied and even today, while working multiple jobs and dreaming of starting his own business, he continues to face his bully: El Rubio. When Chimo has the opportunity for revenge, he never imagines what begins as an act of retaliation could turn into an unexpected friendship that''ll change both their lives.', 'Chimo turns 18 years and comes from a humble and supportive family. Since childhood he was bullied and even today, while working multiple jobs and dreaming of starting his own business, he continues to face his bully: El Rubio. When Chimo has the opportunity for revenge, he never imagines what begins as an act of retaliation could turn into an unexpected friendship that''ll change both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/931RWObebU1Y4EUS2fpwmZQRGPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1285406'),
