  ('322076282468496925', 'Enemy Gold', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mark Morris, Christian Drew Sidaris, Cassidy Phillips', 'Wess Rahn, Christian Drew Sidaris', 'Bruce Penhall, Mark Barriere, Rodrigo Obregón, Suzi Simpson, Tanquil Lisa Collins, Julie Strain, Alan Abelew, Tom Abbott', 'R', 'Three Federal agents go in search of gold supposedly hidden by Quantrell during the Civil War after they are suspended by a corrupt official for excessive force during a drug raid. Meanwhile a drug lord hires a hit woman to kill the three for interfering with his operations.', 'Three Federal agents go in search of gold supposedly hidden by Quantrell during the Civil War after they are suspended by a corrupt official for excessive force during a drug raid. Meanwhile a drug lord hires a hit woman to kill the three for interfering with his operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bW3wf5KncLoMolW55k1Uvrrrs9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49983'),
  ('135819381494481386', 'Enemy Lines', 2020, 'War, Drama', 'Chris Maris, Anders Banke', 'Michael Wright', 'Ed Westwick, Tom Wisdom, Corey Johnson, Jean-Marc Birkholz, Paweł Deląg, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Gary Grant, Scott Haining', null, 'In the frozen, war torn landscape of occupied Poland during World War II, a crack team of allied commandos are sent on a deadly mission behind enemy lines to extract a rocket scientist from the hands of the Nazis.', 'In the frozen, war torn landscape of occupied Poland during World War II, a crack team of allied commandos are sent on a deadly mission behind enemy lines to extract a rocket scientist from the hands of the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG8qBkByy9naORB6zahcntIC2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679796'),
  ('1073322958403117282', 'Enemy Mine', 1985, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Tony Imi, Dave Carson', 'Edward Khmara', 'Dennis Quaid, Louis Gossett Jr., Brion James, Richard Marcus, Carolyn McCormick, Lance Kerwin, Bumper Robinson, Jim Mapp', 'PG-13', 'A soldier from Earth crashlands on an alien world after sustaining battle damage. Eventually he encounters another survivor, but from the enemy species he was fighting; they band together to survive on this hostile world. In the end the human finds himself caring for his enemy in a completely unexpected way.', 'A soldier from Earth crashlands on an alien world after sustaining battle damage. Eventually he encounters another survivor, but from the enemy species he was fighting; they band together to survive on this hostile world. In the end the human finds himself caring for his enemy in a completely unexpected way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3dr9L8VIjhEvivzQ2M12VQDere.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11864'),
  ('1079800412296845454', 'Enemy of the State', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tony Scott, Dan Mindel, Artist W. Robinson', 'David Marconi', 'Will Smith, Gene Hackman, Jon Voight, Regina King, Loren Dean, Jake Busey, Barry Pepper, Jason Lee', 'R', 'When the videotape of the murder of a congressman unknowingly ends up in the hands of labor lawyer and dedicated family man Robert Clayton Dean, he is framed for the murder. With the help of the mysterious Brill, Dean attempts to throw the NSA off his trail and prove his innocence.', 'When the videotape of the murder of a congressman unknowingly ends up in the hands of labor lawyer and dedicated family man Robert Clayton Dean, he is framed for the murder. With the help of the mysterious Brill, Dean attempts to throw the NSA off his trail and prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9pXrMKLsBGGOFyyZ0Gwt9YpVub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9798'),
  ('220571363762628564', 'Enemy Territory', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Manoogian, Ernest R. Dickerson, Michael Speero', 'Stuart Kaminsky, Bobby Liddell', 'Gary Frank, Ray Parker, Jr., Jan-Michael Vincent, Frances Foster, Tony Todd, Stacey Dash, Deon Richmond, Tiger Haynes', 'R', 'An insurance salesman inadvertently gets trapped after dark in an apartment building that is terrorized by a street gang called "The Vampires."', 'An insurance salesman inadvertently gets trapped after dark in an apartment building that is terrorized by a street gang called "The Vampires."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5jf8QtZHPcAZmk3qJHIHv8Bsfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100269'),
  ('854740728250435941', 'Enes Batur: Gerçek Kahraman', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Doğa Can Anafarta, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Busra Nur Karahan, Murat Özsoy', 'Enes Batur, Damla Aslanalp, Altan Erkekli, Ömer Başdoğan, Baturay Anar, Atilla Pekdemir, Mahsun Karaca, Mustafa Başaran', null, 'In the first film, Enes Batur was shy and unable to relate to those around him, showing the audience how his life changed through his social media posts. In this sequel, he becomes a part of "Justice Warriors" and embarks upon an adventure which will eventually make him a superhero.', 'In the first film, Enes Batur was shy and unable to relate to those around him, showing the audience how his life changed through his social media posts. In this sequel, he becomes a part of "Justice Warriors" and embarks upon an adventure which will eventually make him a superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64AkLwxDD9disfXNVwWSFYingQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607971'),
  ('253479495804526021', 'Enes Batur: Imagination or Reality?', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kamil Çetin, Bülent Özer', 'Busra Nur Karahan, Enver Sülük', 'Enes Batur, Ceyda Düvenci, Bilal Hancı, Atakan Özyurt, Fatih Yasin, Bekir Aksoy, Uras Benlioğlu, Yusuf Aktaş', null, 'Enes Batur has to decide between going to college or being a professional YouTuber.', 'Enes Batur has to decide between going to college or being a professional YouTuber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3qeDZLuAXAo62ZDMFOaCGXVaAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495339'),
  ('1108332361141056969', 'Enfant Terrible', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Oskar Roehler, Carl-Friedrich Koschnick', 'Klaus Richter', 'Oliver Masucci, Hary Prinz, Katja Riemann, Jochen Schropp, Erdal Yıldız, Markus Hering, Frida Lovisa Hamann, André Hennicke', null, 'When 22-year-old Rainer Werner Fassbinder storms the stage of a small, progressive theatre in Munich 1967, and seizes the production without further ado, nobody suspects this brazen young rebel to become one of the most important post-war German filmmakers. Despite early setbacks, many of his films breakout at the most renowned films festivals and polarise audience, critics and filmmakers alike. His radical views and self-exploitation, as well as his longing for love, have made him one of the most fascinating film directors of this time.', 'When 22-year-old Rainer Werner Fassbinder storms the stage of a small, progressive theatre in Munich 1967, and seizes the production without further ado, nobody suspects this brazen young rebel to become one of the most important post-war German filmmakers. Despite early setbacks, many of his films breakout at the most renowned films festivals and polarise audience, critics and filmmakers alike. His radical views and self-exploitation, as well as his longing for love, have made him one of the most fascinating film directors of this time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYT6aGySsVohb2PZVMZfS1l4eBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660717'),
  ('458811425350218201', 'Enfermo Amor', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Marco Polo Constandse, Rodrigo Nava', 'Ovidio De León, John Cariani', 'Eréndira Ibarra, Camila Sodi, Alberto Guerra, Juan Pablo Medina, Maya Zapata, Fernanda Castillo, Jesús Zavala, Cassandra Sánchez Navarro', null, 'The story of love struggles of 9 different couples, connected only by the complexity of human relationships.', 'The story of love struggles of 9 different couples, connected only by the complexity of human relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8CbqqTvxcq8jIHwwLxcQViHeM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003995'),
  ('488068068240756424', 'Enforcement', 2020, 'Action, Crime', 'Frederik Louis Hviid, Anders Ølholm, Jacob Møller', 'Frederik Louis Hviid, Anders Ølholm', 'Jacob Lohmann, Simon Sears, Tarek Zayat, Issa Khattab, Abdelmalik Dhaflaoui, Özlem Sağlanmak, Lara Aksoy, Arian Kashef', null, 'The exact details of what took place while Talib Ben Hassi was in police custody remain unclear. Police officers Jens and Mike are on routine patrol in Svalegården''s ghetto when news of Talib''s death comes in over the radio, igniting uncontrollable, pent-up rage in the ghetto''s youth, who lust for revenge. Suddenly, the two officers find themselves fair game and must fight tooth and claw to find a way out.', 'The exact details of what took place while Talib Ben Hassi was in police custody remain unclear. Police officers Jens and Mike are on routine patrol in Svalegården''s ghetto when news of Talib''s death comes in over the radio, igniting uncontrollable, pent-up rage in the ghetto''s youth, who lust for revenge. Suddenly, the two officers find themselves fair game and must fight tooth and claw to find a way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9At4gHXspTVG89nUZBJNM5zGmHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711017'),
  ('695291255044338182', 'Engaging Father Christmas', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'David Winning', 'David Golden', 'Erin Krakow, Niall Matter, Wendie Malick, Michael Kopsa, P. Lynn Johnson, Aliyah O''Brien, Bethany Brown, Crystal Balint', null, 'It''s Christmas and Miranda leaves Seattle with a suitcase full of presents to join her long- lost family in Carlton Heath, where she will experience the joyful traditions she missed as a child. Last Christmas, Miranda fell in love with Ian, a local man who helped her as she searched for her father, James Whitcomb, a famous theatre actor she believed had a connection to the town. At his widow Margaret’s request, Miranda agrees to keep it a secret to protect the family from scandal.', 'It''s Christmas and Miranda leaves Seattle with a suitcase full of presents to join her long- lost family in Carlton Heath, where she will experience the joyful traditions she missed as a child. Last Christmas, Miranda fell in love with Ian, a local man who helped her as she searched for her father, James Whitcomb, a famous theatre actor she believed had a connection to the town. At his widow Margaret’s request, Miranda agrees to keep it a secret to protect the family from scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiDQaS68IBFuMcFjstHF28ZOzxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479607'),
  ('123710656924816508', 'Engaño a primera vista', 2016, null, 'Yecid Benavides, Johanan Benavides, Eduardo Capriles', null, null, null, 'Two extremely nerdy brothers are hell-bent on winning the laptop of their dreams, but in order to do so they must, in only 48 hours, get a kiss from two gorgeous girls who are completely out of their league.', 'Two extremely nerdy brothers are hell-bent on winning the laptop of their dreams, but in order to do so they must, in only 48 hours, get a kiss from two gorgeous girls who are completely out of their league.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oLH0ctX0MZIzGY5fzOHdmiCEeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541503'),
