  ('571146166798683020', 'Engelmacher - Der Usedom-Krimi', 2016, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Jochen Alexander Freydank', null, 'Katrin Sass, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Rainer Sellien, Max Hopp, Rüdiger Klink, Franziska Wulf', null, 'High season on Usedom. Sophie Thiel has accepted a holiday job and waits tables in the café on the Heringsdorf pier. She becomes friends with her young Polish colleague Jadwiga Gryn. After work, they make their way home together on their bikes. Shortly after the girls have parted ways, Jadwiga is ambushed, drugged and kidnapped.The search for the missing person is the first job that inspector Julia Thiel takes on again after her serious accident. Jadwiga''s friend Christoph Dierwald fears the worst.', 'High season on Usedom. Sophie Thiel has accepted a holiday job and waits tables in the café on the Heringsdorf pier. She becomes friends with her young Polish colleague Jadwiga Gryn. After work, they make their way home together on their bikes. Shortly after the girls have parted ways, Jadwiga is ambushed, drugged and kidnapped.The search for the missing person is the first job that inspector Julia Thiel takes on again after her serious accident. Jadwiga''s friend Christoph Dierwald fears the worst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2B6Uf1ZfGrVpy0HWKnzWXBEhf0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385018'),
  ('371273849469758731', 'Engineering Red', 1993, 'Documentary, Science Fiction', 'Andrey I, Armen Petrosyan', null, 'Anna Syomkina', null, 'Set to readings of Thomas Mann''s ''The Magic Mountain'', a collage of medical, art and found footage, exploring various medical cases, including reconstructing the damaged human body, the separation of Siamese twins, and Cold War era attempts to create superhumans.', 'Set to readings of Thomas Mann''s ''The Magic Mountain'', a collage of medical, art and found footage, exploring various medical cases, including reconstructing the damaged human body, the separation of Siamese twins, and Cold War era attempts to create superhumans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYU78JQM66HlbQ7OX6moyvuJaXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438910'),
  ('267364778719406696', 'England Is Mine', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mark Gill, Nicholas D. Knowland', 'Mark Gill, William Thacker', 'Jack Lowden, Jessica Brown Findlay, Simone Kirby, Peter McDonald, Jodie Comer, Katherine Pearce, Vivienne Bell, Graeme Hawley', null, 'A portrait of Steven Patrick Morrissey and his early life in 1970s Manchester before he went on to become lead singer of seminal 1980s band The Smiths.', 'A portrait of Steven Patrick Morrissey and his early life in 1970s Manchester before he went on to become lead singer of seminal 1980s band The Smiths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ue3Zh4YRyJgQXj39tq8smr0iqOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428886'),
