  ('178389871281338044', 'Enola Holmes 2', 2022, 'Adventure, Mystery, Crime', 'Harry Bradbeer, Giles Nuttgens, James Lewis', 'Jack Thorne', 'Millie Bobby Brown, Henry Cavill, David Thewlis, Louis Partridge, Susan Wokoma, Adeel Akhtar, Sharon Duncan-Brewster, Helena Bonham Carter', 'PG-13', 'Now a detective-for-hire like her infamous brother, Enola Holmes takes on her first official case to find a missing girl, as the sparks of a dangerous conspiracy ignite a mystery that requires the help of friends — and Sherlock himself — to unravel.', 'Now a detective-for-hire like her infamous brother, Enola Holmes takes on her first official case to find a missing girl, as the sparks of a dangerous conspiracy ignite a mystery that requires the help of friends — and Sherlock himself — to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tegBpjM5ODoYoM1NjaiHVLEA0QM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829280'),
  ('1119348744080410281', 'Enormous', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Letourneur, Laurent Brunet, Guillemette Coutellier', 'Mathias Gavarry, Sophie Letourneur', 'Jonathan Cohen, Marina Foïs, Jacqueline Kakou, Ayala Cousteau, Victor Uzzan, Philippe Provensal, Emmanuel Hondré, Anne Jonquet', null, 'It takes him suddenly at 40 years: Frédéric wants a baby, Claire never wanted one and they agreed on that. He commits the unforgivable and makes a child behind her back. Claire turns into a whale and Frédéric becomes a doting father.', 'It takes him suddenly at 40 years: Frédéric wants a baby, Claire never wanted one and they agreed on that. He commits the unforgivable and makes a child behind her back. Claire turns into a whale and Frédéric becomes a doting father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nu5EjoHfk4oG8RclOqFvJ5TPH9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640561'),
  ('95762403420359616', 'Enough', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Apted, Rogier Stoffers, Robert Huberman', 'Nicholas Kazan', 'Jennifer Lopez, Billy Campbell, Tessa Allen, Juliette Lewis, Dan Futterman, Noah Wyle, Fred Ward, Christopher Maher', 'PG-13', 'Working-class waitress Slim thought she was entering a life of domestic bliss when she married Mitch, the man of her dreams. After the arrival of their first child, her picture perfect life is shattered when she discovers Mitch''s hidden possessive dark side, a controlling and abusive alter ego that can turn trust, love and tranquility into terror. Terrified for her child''s safety, Slim flees with her daughter. Relentless in his pursuit and enlisting the aid of lethal henchmen, Mitch continually stalks the prey that was once his family.', 'Working-class waitress Slim thought she was entering a life of domestic bliss when she married Mitch, the man of her dreams. After the arrival of their first child, her picture perfect life is shattered when she discovers Mitch''s hidden possessive dark side, a controlling and abusive alter ego that can turn trust, love and tranquility into terror. Terrified for her child''s safety, Slim flees with her daughter. Relentless in his pursuit and enlisting the aid of lethal henchmen, Mitch continually stalks the prey that was once his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAfXnB6B69iM8KiWwzGulCXF4Mo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1957'),
  ('258677924818309613', 'Enough is Enough!', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Gustave Kervern, Hugues Poulain', 'Gustave Kervern', 'Yolande Moreau, Laure Calamy, Anna Mouglalis, Raphaël Quenard, Marie Gillain, Aurélia Petit, Alison Wheeler, Frédéric Maranber', null, 'Anticipating eviction from her retirement home after the death of her son and sole provider, rebellious septuagenarian Émilie decides to take revenge on all those who have wronged her. During her journey of initiation, she cuts to the quick to right the wrongs and is joined by Linda, a cleaning lady with whom she has forged a close bond. She, too, has nothing left to lose and decides to wage war against those who have scorned her. Soon, these two companions are hunted down by a pair of policemen.', 'Anticipating eviction from her retirement home after the death of her son and sole provider, rebellious septuagenarian Émilie decides to take revenge on all those who have wronged her. During her journey of initiation, she cuts to the quick to right the wrongs and is joined by Linda, a cleaning lady with whom she has forged a close bond. She, too, has nothing left to lose and decides to wage war against those who have scorned her. Soon, these two companions are hunted down by a pair of policemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TwP8kSaP9Kar3Jma6w3cfm507x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145479'),
  ('794363941465211911', 'Enough Praying', 1972, 'Drama', 'Aldo Francia, Silvio Caiozzi, Jorge Durán', 'Aldo Francia, José Román, Jorge Durán', 'Marcelo Romo, Tennyson Ferrada, Leonardo Perucci, Roberto Navarrete, Claudia Paz, Rubén Sotoconil, Gonzalo Palta, Arnaldo Berríos', null, 'Many socially-concerned priests in Catholic Latin America have at some time left their parish churches to go and work in the fields and factories of the poor. Such priests, usually adherents of "liberation theology," are called "worker-priests." This Chilean film tells the story of how one man became a "worker-priest" and won the trust of the poor.', 'Many socially-concerned priests in Catholic Latin America have at some time left their parish churches to go and work in the fields and factories of the poor. Such priests, usually adherents of "liberation theology," are called "worker-priests." This Chilean film tells the story of how one man became a "worker-priest" and won the trust of the poor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CtBiHBxtxHzSzSKF9p05xaATLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392459'),
  ('820804293119877292', 'Enough Said', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jesse Nye, Kyle LeMire, Steve Lonano', 'Nicole Holofcener', 'Julia Louis-Dreyfus, James Gandolfini, Catherine Keener, Toni Collette, Tavi Gevinson, Ben Falcone, Tracey Fairaway, Eve Hewson', 'PG-13', 'Eva is a divorced soon-to-be empty-nester wondering about her next act. Then she meets Marianne, the embodiment of her perfect self. Armed with a restored outlook on being middle-aged and single, Eva decides to take a chance on her new love interest Albert — a sweet, funny and like-minded man. But things get complicated when Eva discovers that Albert is in fact the dreaded ex–husband of Marianne...', 'Eva is a divorced soon-to-be empty-nester wondering about her next act. Then she meets Marianne, the embodiment of her perfect self. Armed with a restored outlook on being middle-aged and single, Eva decides to take a chance on her new love interest Albert — a sweet, funny and like-minded man. But things get complicated when Eva discovers that Albert is in fact the dreaded ex–husband of Marianne...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5naJg0K8xF0h0HWEfiz6rc9lC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209263'),
  ('810347715018370541', 'EnPAREJAdos', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Adrián Uribe, Consuelo Duval', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPtwdH8yfnMyFCFIscaXgzsr5Qx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784581'),
  ('322281352832364682', 'Enrico Piaggio: Vespa', 2019, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Lorenzo Adorisio, Umberto Marino, Flavia Carimini', null, 'Alessio Boni, Enrica Pintore, Francesco Pannofino, Violante Placido, Beatrice Grannò, Moisé Curia, Roberto Ciufoli, Carmen Giardina', null, 'It is 1945. Enrico Piaggio’s Pontedera factory is in ruins and the 12,000 people who worked there are condemned to unemployment and misery. Piaggio feels the enormous responsibility resting on his shoulders: the lives of so many families depend on his ability to create new jobs. A project is born in the mind of the entrepreneur: a small, robust, agile and affordable means of transport, capable of relaunching mobility, giving impetus to the recovery of the country’s economic and civil life. To make this dream come true, Piaggio turns to engineer Corradino D’Ascanio, a brilliant designer who uses the experience gained in the field of aeronautics to create the scooter that remains today the symbol of Italian creativity and design: the Vespa!', 'It is 1945. Enrico Piaggio’s Pontedera factory is in ruins and the 12,000 people who worked there are condemned to unemployment and misery. Piaggio feels the enormous responsibility resting on his shoulders: the lives of so many families depend on his ability to create new jobs. A project is born in the mind of the entrepreneur: a small, robust, agile and affordable means of transport, capable of relaunching mobility, giving impetus to the recovery of the country’s economic and civil life. To make this dream come true, Piaggio turns to engineer Corradino D’Ascanio, a brilliant designer who uses the experience gained in the field of aeronautics to create the scooter that remains today the symbol of Italian creativity and design: the Vespa!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oWMBGhrU0x8W76PENyvbZ1d9h1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647579'),
  ('970647784593286396', 'Enron: The Smartest Guys in the Room', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Maryse Alberti', 'Alex Gibney', 'Peter Coyote, John Beard, Jim Chanos, Dick Cheney, Carol Coale, Gray Davis, Reggie Dees II, Joseph Dunn', 'R', 'A documentary about the Enron corporation, its faulty and corrupt business practices, and how they led to its fall.', 'A documentary about the Enron corporation, its faulty and corrupt business practices, and how they led to its fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zezeOElCxlPui9SFGj5ToZ4W1Nh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13020'),
  ('77679805575450589', 'Ensemble for Somnambulists', 1951, 'Music', 'Maya Deren', 'Maya Deren', 'Terry Chapman, Frank Ionson, Hanna Winer, Brian MacDonald', null, 'Ensemble for Somnambulists was a film Maya Deren made while teaching a workshop at the Toronto Film Society. It was never completed, and is officially "unpublished," but this title has been restored and it screens occasionally along with her other films. It is sort of a preliminary sketch for The Very Eye of Night. ~ David Lewis, Rovi', 'Ensemble for Somnambulists was a film Maya Deren made while teaching a workshop at the Toronto Film Society. It was never completed, and is officially "unpublished," but this title has been restored and it screens occasionally along with her other films. It is sort of a preliminary sketch for The Very Eye of Night. ~ David Lewis, Rovi', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UIEUWsG0ErZUW07jCj9MssON75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215056'),
  ('782792218922408269', 'Ensign Pulver', 1964, 'Comedy, War', 'Charles Lawton Jr., Joshua Logan', 'Peter S. Feibleman, Joshua Logan', 'Robert Walker Jr., Burl Ives, Walter Matthau, Tommy Sands, Millie Perkins, Kay Medford, Larry Hagman, Peter Marshall', null, '1945, on an old cargo ship somewhere deep in the Pacific ocean: Captain Morton strives to become commander, so he demands the maximum quality of work from his crew, without granting them any freedom or favors - ignoring that they''re thousand of miles away from the front. In one word: he drives his crew crazy. They are near mutiny, but no-one dares to do the first step. Until Ensign Pulver plays a prank on the captain that triggers fatal consequences...', '1945, on an old cargo ship somewhere deep in the Pacific ocean: Captain Morton strives to become commander, so he demands the maximum quality of work from his crew, without granting them any freedom or favors - ignoring that they''re thousand of miles away from the front. In one word: he drives his crew crazy. They are near mutiny, but no-one dares to do the first step. Until Ensign Pulver plays a prank on the captain that triggers fatal consequences...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbhbIPJMQ1zTXky1gY62BSbx2YJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42785'),
  ('942542676102938834', 'Enter Nowhere', 2015, 'Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jack Heller, Thomas M. Harting', 'Jason Dolan, Shawn Christensen', 'Katherine Waterston, Scott Eastwood, Sara Paxton, Shaun Sipos, Christopher Denham, Jesse Perez, Leigh Lezark', 'R', 'Three strangers arrive one by one to a mysterious cabin in the middle of nowhere after enduring separate life-altering predicaments. Searching for a way out of the woods, frustrated, hungry and battling to stay warm they discover their mysterious connection and realize what they have to do in order to get out of the woods alive.', 'Three strangers arrive one by one to a mysterious cabin in the middle of nowhere after enduring separate life-altering predicaments. Searching for a way out of the woods, frustrated, hungry and battling to stay warm they discover their mysterious connection and realize what they have to do in order to get out of the woods alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBWZmjzehYXmVTCsFan9RnzmZ7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98568'),
  ('166340167883815729', 'Enter the Anime', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alex Burunova', 'Julia Yorks', 'Kouzou Morishita, Kenji Kamiyama, Yoko Takahashi, Shinji Aramaki, Alex Burunova, Adi Shankar, LeSean Thomas', null, 'What is anime? Through deep-dives with notable masterminds of this electrifying genre, this fast-paced documentary seeks to find the answers.', 'What is anime? Through deep-dives with notable masterminds of this electrifying genre, this fast-paced documentary seeks to find the answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QUiKtq4qIXNFcMIiVWGWF4kWp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616904'),
  ('194109638638085237', 'Enter the Devil', 1972, 'Horror, Drama', 'Frank Q. Dobbs', 'David S. Cass Sr., Frank Q. Dobbs', 'Joshua Bryant, Irene Kelly, David S. Cass Sr., John Martin, Carle Bensen, Norris Domingue, Willie Gonzales, Ed Geldart', 'PG', 'People are disappearing in the wastelands. An occult researcher discovers that a devil-worshipping cult is responsible. Her inquiries lead her into great danger. Who can she trust?', 'People are disappearing in the wastelands. An occult researcher discovers that a devil-worshipping cult is responsible. Her inquiries lead her into great danger. Who can she trust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peGZiKvzZQS5Ic7HhBSJNJSVYnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235798'),
  ('292937305273969956', 'Enter the Devil', 1974, 'Horror', 'Mario Gariazzo, Carlo Carlini', 'Ambrogio Molteni', 'Stella Carnacina, Chris Avram, Lucretia Love, Ivan Rassimov, Gabriele Tinti, Luigi Pistilli, Gianrico Tondinelli, Umberto Raho', 'R', 'After a female art student purchases a life-size wooden sculpture of a crucifixion from an abandoned church, she has a vision of herself being nailed to a cross and soon becomes sexually tormented by the sculpture when it comes to life.', 'After a female art student purchases a life-size wooden sculpture of a crucifixion from an abandoned church, she has a vision of herself being nailed to a cross and soon becomes sexually tormented by the sculpture when it comes to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcuKtdGjcVDhYQMP0YiBHa02M8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145451'),
  ('522520664572163338', 'Enter the Dragon', 1973, 'Action', 'Robert Clouse, Gil Hubbs', 'Michael Allin', 'Bruce Lee, John Saxon, Jim Kelly, Sek Kin, Ahna Capri, Robert Wall, Angela Mao Ying, Betty Chung', 'R', 'A martial artist agrees to spy on a reclusive crime lord using his invitation to a tournament there as cover.', 'A martial artist agrees to spy on a reclusive crime lord using his invitation to a tournament there as cover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyrh2ULEcmLpGTVLPQqFW45hqr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9461'),
  ('995696888059923859', 'Enter the Fat Dragon', 1978, 'Action, Comedy', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Ricky Lau, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Ni Kuang', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Lee Hae-suk, Luk Chu-Sek, Roy Chiao, Peter Yang Kwan, Ankie Lau, Meg Lam Kin-Ming, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', null, 'Ah Lung is a pig farmer and a devoted Bruce Lee fan who is anxious to follow in Lee''s footsteps, but only ridiculed for his attempts. He is sent to the city to earn a living working at his uncle''s restaurant, but when he arrives, he finds a gang of thugs causing trouble in the restaurant. He takes the chance to prove himself and attacks the thugs, defeating them and saving the restaurant. Soon, he becomes a waiter, and discovers a plot by the same thugs to kidnap a woman he works with. Eventually, he defeats the thugs once again and saves the day.', 'Ah Lung is a pig farmer and a devoted Bruce Lee fan who is anxious to follow in Lee''s footsteps, but only ridiculed for his attempts. He is sent to the city to earn a living working at his uncle''s restaurant, but when he arrives, he finds a gang of thugs causing trouble in the restaurant. He takes the chance to prove himself and attacks the thugs, defeating them and saving the restaurant. Soon, he becomes a waiter, and discovers a plot by the same thugs to kidnap a woman he works with. Eventually, he defeats the thugs once again and saves the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymgK10c4uVLb8bOGDE1jWVHP0Sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78035'),
  ('178409610930550597', 'Enter the Fat Dragon', 2020, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Aman Chang Man, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Shadow Hung', 'Ronald Chan Kin-Hung, Lui Koon-Nam, Wong Jing', 'Donnie Yen, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Niki Chow Lai-Kei, Wong Jing, Louis Cheung, Jessica Jann, Naoto Takenaka, Tetsu Watanabe', null, 'After being dumped by his fiancé, heartbroken Hong Kong police officer Fallon Zhu gains 200+ pounds. His superiors demote him to the job of escorting convicts to Japan. When a convict in his custody mysteriously dies, he must team up with citizen Thor to solve the mystery.', 'After being dumped by his fiancé, heartbroken Hong Kong police officer Fallon Zhu gains 200+ pounds. His superiors demote him to the job of escorting convicts to Japan. When a convict in his custody mysteriously dies, he must team up with citizen Thor to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQqqsj0WhANqGqHQ8BhBE7iI4bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503917'),
  ('243312804501782880', 'Enter the Game of Death', 1978, 'Action', 'Ho Aug Wai, Choi Wu-hyeong, Lam Kwok-Cheung', 'Her Jin', 'Huang Kin-Lung, Bolo Yeung, Michael B. Christy, Chiu Chi-Ling, Lee Hoi-Sang, Steve James, Robert Kerver, Seok-hoon Nam', null, 'It''s approaching World War 2 and China is expecting to be invaded by Germany and Japan. Mr Ang is hired by a Chinese group who are after a "secret document." Many other groups want to get their hands on it as well. It''s on the top floor of a tower and Ang must fight his way to the top.', 'It''s approaching World War 2 and China is expecting to be invaded by Germany and Japan. Mr Ang is hired by a Chinese group who are after a "secret document." Many other groups want to get their hands on it as well. It''s on the top floor of a tower and Ang must fight his way to the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6k80xgt9ngyRpxAJlRhnkB6aRfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74522'),
  ('937379907399149263', 'Enter the Ninja', 1981, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Menahem Golan, David Gurfinkel, Emmett Alston', 'Dick Desmond', 'Franco Nero, Susan George, Christopher George, Sho Kosugi, Alex Courtney, Will Hare, Zachi Noy, Constantine Gregory', 'R', 'A newly trained ninja warrior journeys to the Philippines, where he must defend his former war comrade''s property against a determined adversary.', 'A newly trained ninja warrior journeys to the Philippines, where he must defend his former war comrade''s property against a determined adversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zYvNCPRX4W0s2gNxWqpsdk2OCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17205'),
  ('535140656503673957', 'Enter the Phoenix', 2004, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy', 'Stephen Fung, Ma Yuk-Sing, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Law Yiu-Fai', 'Daniel Wu, Eason Chan Yik-Shun, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Law Kar-Ying, Chapman To Man-Chat, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Stephen Fung, Yuen Biao', null, 'Georgie Hung is handsome, stylish and charming but he hides a secret that his old-fashion father, Hung who is a Triad leader, can never forgive. He has been sent to Thailand since he was a child and never returned. After Hung''s death, his right-hand Cheung intends to bring back Georgie to take over. However, Cheung finds Sam, Georgie''s flat-mate, whom he mistakes for Geogie...', 'Georgie Hung is handsome, stylish and charming but he hides a secret that his old-fashion father, Hung who is a Triad leader, can never forgive. He has been sent to Thailand since he was a child and never returned. After Hung''s death, his right-hand Cheung intends to bring back Georgie to take over. However, Cheung finds Sam, Georgie''s flat-mate, whom he mistakes for Geogie...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DJCnhLyqXUSdNNHPeiTBv80KKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21522'),
  ('719039247638771367', 'Enter the Void', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Gaspar Noé, Michael A. Williams, Toshio Hanaoka', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Paz de la Huerta, Nathaniel Brown, Cyril Roy, Olly Alexander, Masato Tanno, Ed Spear, Emily Alyn Lind, Jesse Kuhn', 'NR', 'This psychedelic tour of life after death is seen entirely from the point of view of Oscar, a young American drug dealer and addict living in Tokyo with his prostitute sister, Linda. When Oscar is killed by police during a bust gone bad, his spirit journeys from the past -- where he sees his parents before their deaths -- to the present -- where he witnesses his own autopsy -- and then to the future, where he looks out for his sister from beyond the grave.', 'This psychedelic tour of life after death is seen entirely from the point of view of Oscar, a young American drug dealer and addict living in Tokyo with his prostitute sister, Linda. When Oscar is killed by police during a bust gone bad, his spirit journeys from the past -- where he sees his parents before their deaths -- to the present -- where he witnesses his own autopsy -- and then to the future, where he looks out for his sister from beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krKnsfvSJM1PL40tLicRhVQ6kuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34647'),
  ('194986334227727039', 'Entertaining Mr. Sloane', 1970, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Douglas Hickox, Wolfgang Suschitzky, Ariel Levy', 'Clive Exton', 'Beryl Reid, Harry Andrews, Peter McEnery, Alan Webb, Charles Sinnickson', null, 'An aging nymphomaniac and her closeted gay brother are enamored with their father''s killer and blackmail him into satisfying their outlandish desires.', 'An aging nymphomaniac and her closeted gay brother are enamored with their father''s killer and blackmail him into satisfying their outlandish desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRKduOkq2u2LwYGXkpkdxbc2ng3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122268'),
  ('1122852362094595915', 'Entertainment', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rick Alverson, Lorenzo Hagerman', 'Rick Alverson, Tim Heidecker, Gregg Turkington', 'Gregg Turkington, Tye Sheridan, John C. Reilly, Lotte Verbeek, Dean Stockwell, Amy Seimetz, Tim Heidecker, Kalia Prescott', 'R', 'Set in the Mojave Desert, the film follows a broken-down comedian playing clubs across the Southwest, working his way to Los Angeles to meet his estranged daughter.', 'Set in the Mojave Desert, the film follows a broken-down comedian playing clubs across the Southwest, working his way to Los Angeles to meet his estranged daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Lngl5wLUnY9qvNdVLH7TPAAKOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246133'),
  ('256270598120556986', 'Enthiran', 2010, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Shankar, R. Ratnavelu, Atlee', 'Shankar', 'Rajinikanth, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Danny Denzongpa, Santhanam, Karunas, Devadarshini, Sabu Cyril, Kalabhavan Mani', null, 'Dr. Vaseegaran creates Chitti, a powerful robot in his own image, but it is rejected by the scientific body AIRD due to its lack of human behaviour and emotions. After a lightning strike triggers emotions in Chitti, he begins to develop human-like feelings. However, Chitti falls in love with Dr. Vaseegaran''s fiancée, Sana, and turns against his creator, leading to dangerous consequences.', 'Dr. Vaseegaran creates Chitti, a powerful robot in his own image, but it is rejected by the scientific body AIRD due to its lack of human behaviour and emotions. After a lightning strike triggers emotions in Chitti, he begins to develop human-like feelings. However, Chitti falls in love with Dr. Vaseegaran''s fiancée, Sana, and turns against his creator, leading to dangerous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3by3fYbGuJriAFsO6PxqRMFExSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148284'),
  ('233933221792164007', 'Enthralled', 2014, 'Drama', 'Chip Tsao, Lester Chow', 'Chip Tsao', 'Kelvin Kwan, Chui Tien-You, Christopher Goh, Mandy Lieu, Joy Sheng, Michael Chugani, Snow Suen, Mimi Kung', null, 'An enthralling directorial debut by the phenomenal, biting columnist and broadcaster Chip Tsao. Three elementary school pals, separated during the post-Tiananmen wave of emigration, reunite after 20 years, only to find themselves in totally different places. When each of them gets involved in an unlikely and at times illicit romance, their disparate lives intertwine and take a dire turn. The simmering ennui of post-handover Hong Kong is insightfully captured in this original and hardhitting drama about love, deceit and betrayal.', 'An enthralling directorial debut by the phenomenal, biting columnist and broadcaster Chip Tsao. Three elementary school pals, separated during the post-Tiananmen wave of emigration, reunite after 20 years, only to find themselves in totally different places. When each of them gets involved in an unlikely and at times illicit romance, their disparate lives intertwine and take a dire turn. The simmering ennui of post-handover Hong Kong is insightfully captured in this original and hardhitting drama about love, deceit and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKDuzLK6oK2VUuLpcXCMsBPJSN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257836'),
  ('444355686778469073', 'Enthusiasm. Symphony of Donbas', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov, Elizaveta Svilova, Borys Tseytlin', null, null, null, 'An audiovisual symphony that delves into the industrial, agrarian, and cultural fabric of the Donbas region during the inaugural Soviet Five Year Plan. It spotlights anti-religious campaigns, propagandistic marches, and the vibrant athletic culture of its time', 'An audiovisual symphony that delves into the industrial, agrarian, and cultural fabric of the Donbas region during the inaugural Soviet Five Year Plan. It spotlights anti-religious campaigns, propagandistic marches, and the vibrant athletic culture of its time', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWx63XY4g1Guh98QCj8W2xZ9Xiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45176'),
  ('810722163124567189', 'Entourage', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Doug Ellin, Steven Fierberg', 'Doug Ellin', 'Kevin Connolly, Adrian Grenier, Kevin Dillon, Jerry Ferrara, Jeremy Piven, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Perrey Reeves, Rex Lee', 'R', 'Movie star Vincent Chase, together with his boys, Eric, Turtle and Johnny, are back…and back in business with super agent-turned-studio head Ari Gold. Some of their ambitions have changed, but the bond between them remains strong as they navigate the capricious and often cutthroat world of Hollywood.', 'Movie star Vincent Chase, together with his boys, Eric, Turtle and Johnny, are back…and back in business with super agent-turned-studio head Ari Gold. Some of their ambitions have changed, but the bond between them remains strong as they navigate the capricious and often cutthroat world of Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28dqsx1jCxhR05DfH35ui13ywNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188222'),
  ('92120515537822011', 'Entr''acte', 1924, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'René Clair, Jimmy Berliet', 'Francis Picabia', 'Jean Börlin, Inge Frïss, Marcel Duchamp, Man Ray, Francis Picabia, Darius Milhaud, Marcel Achard, Georges Auric', null, 'Stop-motion photography blends with extreme slow-motion in Clair''s first and most ''dada'' film, composed of a series of zany, interconnected scenes. We witness a rooftop chess match between Marcel Duchamp and Man Ray, a hearse pulled by a camel (and chased by its pallbearers) and a dizzying roller coaster finale. A film of contradictions and agreements.', 'Stop-motion photography blends with extreme slow-motion in Clair''s first and most ''dada'' film, composed of a series of zany, interconnected scenes. We witness a rooftop chess match between Marcel Duchamp and Man Ray, a hearse pulled by a camel (and chased by its pallbearers) and a dizzying roller coaster finale. A film of contradictions and agreements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjgQQsO9e1R9fU0wepy6OASuaVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44473'),
  ('909019480745863862', 'Entrails of a Beautiful Woman', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kazuo Komizu, Shûichi Okada, Eiichi Ôsawa', 'Kazuo Komizu', 'Megumi Ozawa, Seira Kitagawa, Ken Yoshizawa, Ayako Ishii, Shinji Sekikawa, Kazuhiro Sano, Yoshinari Yoshie, Kimiya Kôdagawa', null, 'A nurse starts to investigate why a woman who came to her office committed suicide. She discovers that a Yakuza gang is using an unusual drug to sexually enslave women. But she gets caught and when she is injected with the drug rather gruesome side effects appear, much to the surprise of the gang.', 'A nurse starts to investigate why a woman who came to her office committed suicide. She discovers that a Yakuza gang is using an unusual drug to sexually enslave women. But she gets caught and when she is injected with the drug rather gruesome side effects appear, much to the surprise of the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Mn4oSxGDPvuAewoAsNNvhZhqqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39858'),
  ('1015428916826977393', 'Entranced Earth', 1967, 'Drama', 'Glauber Rocha, Luiz Carlos Barreto, Antônio Calmon', 'Glauber Rocha', 'Jardel Filho, Paulo Autran, José Lewgoy, Glauce Rocha, Paulo Gracindo, Hugo Carvana, Danuza Leão, Jofre Soares', null, 'Eldorado, a fictitious country in America, is sparkling with the internal struggle for political power. In the eye of this social convulsion, the jaded journalist Paulo Martins opposes two equally corrupt political candidates: a pseudopopulist and a conservative. In this context, Paulo is torn between the madness of the elite and the blind submission of the masses. But, in this complex tropical reality, nothing really is what it seems to be.', 'Eldorado, a fictitious country in America, is sparkling with the internal struggle for political power. In the eye of this social convulsion, the jaded journalist Paulo Martins opposes two equally corrupt political candidates: a pseudopopulist and a conservative. In this context, Paulo is torn between the madness of the elite and the blind submission of the masses. But, in this complex tropical reality, nothing really is what it seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuBU2eGzZyCBYxChYBUGbyTQ052.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67062'),
  ('70693496411006878', 'Entrapment', 1999, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Jon Amiel, Phil Meheux, Jim Morahan', 'Ronald Bass, William Broyles Jr.', 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Sean Connery, Will Patton, Maury Chaykin, Ving Rhames, Kevin McNally, Terry O''Neill, Madhav Sharma', 'PG-13', 'Two thieves, who travel in elegant circles, try to outsmart each other and, in the process, end up falling in love.', 'Two thieves, who travel in elegant circles, try to outsmart each other and, in the process, end up falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psrm7DToacaxQvgViBAcrYiLKzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1844'),
