  ('1127135191958478136', 'Entre Monjas Anda El Diablo', 1973, 'Comedy', 'René Cardona, Raúl Domínguez', 'Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'Vicente Fernández, Angélica María, Sara García, Alma Rosa Aguirre, Miguel Suárez, Armando Acosta, Regino Herrera, Rafael Valdés', null, 'A man called “The Devil” makes a living in cock-fights. He falls for a girl who''s about to enter the monastery.', 'A man called “The Devil” makes a living in cock-fights. He falls for a girl who''s about to enter the monastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSKwGbvpkIW3a0MTp6omZQ3bQ0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299131'),
  ('1031596347518003263', 'Entre Nous', 1983, 'Drama, War', 'Diane Kurys, Fabienne Bichet, Hubert Engammare', 'Diane Kurys, Alain Le Henry', 'Miou-Miou, Isabelle Huppert, Guy Marchand, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Robin Renucci, Patrick Bauchau, Jacques Alric, Jacqueline Doyen', null, 'In 1942 in occupied France, a Jewish refugee marries a soldier to escape deportation to Germany. Meanwhile a wealthy art student loses her first husband to a stray Resistance bullet; at the Liberation she meets an actor, gets pregnant, and marries him. Lena and Madeleine meet at their children''s school in Lyon in 1952 and the intensity of their relationship strains both their marriages to the breaking point.', 'In 1942 in occupied France, a Jewish refugee marries a soldier to escape deportation to Germany. Meanwhile a wealthy art student loses her first husband to a stray Resistance bullet; at the Liberation she meets an actor, gets pregnant, and marries him. Lena and Madeleine meet at their children''s school in Lyon in 1952 and the intensity of their relationship strains both their marriages to the breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUKJi4IwkMuD9mL7YxV6fSfHmLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42108'),
  ('780974484931348115', 'Entre sábanas', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gustavo Nieto Roa', 'Rene Belmonte', 'Karina Mora, Marlon Moreno', null, 'A woman takes a man she just met at a nightclub to a hotel, so they can have a one-night stand, but things start to get complicated when he asks her to spend the night with him so they can have a chance to know about each other between the sheets.', 'A woman takes a man she just met at a nightclub to a hotel, so they can have a one-night stand, but things start to get complicated when he asks her to spend the night with him so they can have a chance to know about each other between the sheets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opETUc1PXVAngiu8xCe3W2mvKwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80175'),
  ('64056598599257166', 'Entre ses mains', 2022, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Vincent Lannoo', 'Mary Milojevic, Marion Festraëts', 'Natacha Lindinger, Éric Caravaca, Yannick Choirat, Amelle Chahbi, Margaux Ribagnac-Vin, Fleur Geffrier', null, 'Clara, a lawyer in Annecy, leads a serene but monotonous life with her husband Damien and their two children. One night, she falls under the spell of a mysterious sculptor, Stéphane. This one torrid night will have dramatic repercussions for her and her family...', 'Clara, a lawyer in Annecy, leads a serene but monotonous life with her husband Damien and their two children. One night, she falls under the spell of a mysterious sculptor, Stéphane. This one torrid night will have dramatic repercussions for her and her family...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx9JG38A3VDhu6vIXbyAAHtbhbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959108'),
