  ('608840643802414450', 'Entrega Inmediata', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Gabriel Figueroa, Moises M. Delgado', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Gina Romand, Claudio Brook, Fanny Cano, Guillermo Zetina, Emma Roldán, Quintín Bulnes, Carlos León', null, 'Immediate delivery recounts the misadventures of Feliciano Callosum (Cantinflas), a postman who is recruited by the secret counterintelligence service (called XU-777 secret agency), and must uncover an international conspiracy.', 'Immediate delivery recounts the misadventures of Feliciano Callosum (Cantinflas), a postman who is recruited by the secret counterintelligence service (called XU-777 secret agency), and must uncover an international conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17EOPEXYgzmTcVQyYRH9xPq836w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82783'),
  ('978965526781719731', 'Entropy', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Phil Joanou, Carolyn Chen', 'Phil Joanou', 'Stephen Dorff, Judith Godrèche, Kelly Macdonald, Lauren Holly, Jon Tenney, Frank Vincent, Paul Guilfoyle, Héctor Elizondo', null, 'Entropy is a semi-autobiographical film which tells the story of a young director struggling to make a film for a despotic studio while his life falls apart around him. Along the way, he goes on tour with U2 to help them make a music video, gets married in Vegas, and has a conversation with his cat.', 'Entropy is a semi-autobiographical film which tells the story of a young director struggling to make a film for a despotic studio while his life falls apart around him. Along the way, he goes on tour with U2 to help them make a music video, gets married in Vegas, and has a conversation with his cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GcOcBCi96GMAptOtPsYU7rZ7t4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30382'),
  ('987803314996412133', 'Entrusted', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Engin Akyürek, Hilal Altınbilek, Şerif Sezer, Osman Alkaş, Ogün Kaptanoğlu, Birsen Dürülü, Eren Devrim, Parla Şenol', null, '''Çocuklar Sana Emanet'' meaning ''Children''s Safety to you" The story about an interior architect Kerem recovering from traumatic car accident then spends time with healer woman and people of a village. But It is full of mysteries, suspense & hope.', '''Çocuklar Sana Emanet'' meaning ''Children''s Safety to you" The story about an interior architect Kerem recovering from traumatic car accident then spends time with healer woman and people of a village. But It is full of mysteries, suspense & hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17PwD1eyCXppG4wRsNg8dFz8n8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507297'),
  ('309691909827442610', 'Envy', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Tim Maurice-Jones, Barry Levinson, Josh McLaglen', 'Steve Adams', 'Ben Stiller, Jack Black, Rachel Weisz, Christopher Walken, Amy Poehler, Ariel Gade, Sam Lerner, Lily Jackson', 'PG-13', 'A man becomes increasingly jealous of his friend''s newfound success.', 'A man becomes increasingly jealous of his friend''s newfound success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RMaKg5mVnGVI0z3SvIgS7hYPUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10710'),
  ('1135804982414993172', 'Envy', 2009, 'Drama', 'Zeki Demirkubuz, Emre Erkmen', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Nergis Öztürk, Berrak Tüzünataç, Serhat Tutumluer, Bora Cengiz, Hasibe Eren, Nihal Koldaş, Serdar Orçin, Ferda Işıl', null, 'Seniha lives with her brother Halit and his wife Mükerrem. When Nüzhet, the handsome son of the richest family in town, sets his eyes on the married Mükerrem, she is at first disgusted with Nüzhet’s overt sexual innuendo. However, it isn’t long before Mükerrem yields to her lust and thus they embark on an affair. When Seniha finally reveals her sister-in-law’s un-virtuousness to her brother, Seniha has no idea what the consequences will be and how cruelly her destiny will change.', 'Seniha lives with her brother Halit and his wife Mükerrem. When Nüzhet, the handsome son of the richest family in town, sets his eyes on the married Mükerrem, she is at first disgusted with Nüzhet’s overt sexual innuendo. However, it isn’t long before Mükerrem yields to her lust and thus they embark on an affair. When Seniha finally reveals her sister-in-law’s un-virtuousness to her brother, Seniha has no idea what the consequences will be and how cruelly her destiny will change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajOsceipC0Cw2Wwo3253wsNfSHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37523'),
  ('758454050567345574', 'Enys Men', 2023, 'Horror, Drama', 'Jonny Dry, Mark Jenkin, Callum Mitchell', 'Mark Jenkin', 'Mary Woodvine, Edward Rowe, Flo Crowe, John Woodvine, Joe Gray, Loveday Twomlow, Callum Mitchell, Morgan Val Baker', 'NR', 'A wildlife volunteer on an uninhabited island off the British coast descends into a terrifying madness that challenges her grip on reality and pushes her into a living nightmare.', 'A wildlife volunteer on an uninhabited island off the British coast descends into a terrifying madness that challenges her grip on reality and pushes her into a living nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCHn33ceY4W6GzZ543Q6a7VeioM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740049'),
  ('313291682408078085', 'Enzo', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jeanne Lapoirie, Robin Campillo, Augustine Girard', 'Laurent Cantet, Robin Campillo', 'Eloy Pohu, Maksym Slivinskyi, Pierfrancesco Favino, Élodie Bouchez, Nathan Japy, Vladislav Holyk, Malou Khebizi, Philippe Petit', null, 'Enzo, 16, defies his bourgeois family’s expectations by starting a masonry apprenticeship, a path far removed from the prestigious life they had envisioned for him. In their chic villa in the sun-drenched South of France, tensions simmer as relentless questions and pressures weigh on Enzo’s future and dreams. On the construction sites, however, Vlad, a charismatic Ukrainian colleague, shakes up Enzo’s world and opens the door to unexpected possibilities.', 'Enzo, 16, defies his bourgeois family’s expectations by starting a masonry apprenticeship, a path far removed from the prestigious life they had envisioned for him. In their chic villa in the sun-drenched South of France, tensions simmer as relentless questions and pressures weigh on Enzo’s future and dreams. On the construction sites, however, Vlad, a charismatic Ukrainian colleague, shakes up Enzo’s world and opens the door to unexpected possibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cghjz7l78J8S3rr5EkzCrpr3bMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277872'),
  ('902449825929285418', 'Enzo Jannacci - Vengo anch''io', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Giorgio Verdelli', null, 'Enzo Jannacci, Diego Abatantuono, Vasco Rossi, Dalia Gaberscik, Paolo Jannacci, Roberto Vecchioni, Giorgio Gaber', null, 'Enzo Jannacci navigated between several genres because he was a "genre" in his own.', 'Enzo Jannacci navigated between several genres because he was a "genre" in his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fgNzyEwAquopqDDtUL67Zskx1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156194'),
  ('429303560335107399', 'EO', 2022, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Michał Dymek, Maria Wider', 'Ewa Piaskowska, Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Sandra Drzymalska, Isabelle Huppert, Lorenzo Zurzolo, Mateusz Kościukiewicz, Tomasz Organek, Lolita Chammah, Agata Sasinowska, Anna Rokita', 'NR', 'The world is a mysterious place when seen through the eyes of an animal. EO, a grey donkey with melancholic eyes, meets good and bad people on his life’s path, experiences joy and pain, endures the wheel of fortune randomly turn his luck into disaster and his despair into unexpected bliss. But not even for a moment does he lose his innocence.', 'The world is a mysterious place when seen through the eyes of an animal. EO, a grey donkey with melancholic eyes, meets good and bad people on his life’s path, experiences joy and pain, endures the wheel of fortune randomly turn his luck into disaster and his despair into unexpected bliss. But not even for a moment does he lose his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MK86Vr2nf1GSYOtRd8pFvA5RM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785398'),
  ('270482186643590701', 'Eolomea', 1972, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Herrmann Zschoche, Günter Jaeuthe, Eleonore Dressel', 'Angel Vagenshtain, Herrmann Zschoche', 'Cox Habbema, Ivan Andonov, Rolf Hoppe, Holger Mahlich, Vsevolod Sanayev, Benjamin Besson, Evelyn Opoczynski, Wolfgang Greese', null, 'Eight space cargo-ships disappear without a trace within three days, and the orbit station "Margot" has suddenly fallen silent. It’s down to science officer Maria Scholl to find out what happened to them.', 'Eight space cargo-ships disappear without a trace within three days, and the orbit station "Margot" has suddenly fallen silent. It’s down to science officer Maria Scholl to find out what happened to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyci2OB8nhFYpDfaiGHVnwIXL7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2893'),
  ('1103441403439837357', 'Epic', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Chris Wedge, Renato Falcão, Daniel Sampaio Lima', 'Matt Ember, Daniel Shere, Tom J. Astle', 'Colin Farrell, Amanda Seyfried, Christoph Waltz, Josh Hutcherson, Jason Sudeikis, Aziz Ansari, Chris O''Dowd, Beyoncé', 'PG', 'A teenager finds herself transported to a deep forest setting where a battle between the forces of good and the forces of evil is taking place. She bands together with a rag-tag group characters in order to save their world—and ours.', 'A teenager finds herself transported to a deep forest setting where a battle between the forces of good and the forces of evil is taking place. She bands together with a rag-tag group characters in order to save their world—and ours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81cSsWzjTfR3cJSqnTiHwy1eyPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116711'),
  ('320543909189538016', 'Epic Movie', 2007, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Shawn Maurer, Aaron Seltzer, Jason Friedberg', 'Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer', 'Kal Penn, Adam Campbell, Jennifer Coolidge, Jayma Mays, Faune Chambers Watkins, Crispin Glover, Tony Cox, Héctor Jiménez', 'PG-13', 'When the Pevensie siblings each follow their own path, they find themselves at Willy''s Chocolate Factory. Walking through a wardrobe, they discover the world of Gnarnia, ruled by the White Bitch. Meeting up with characters such as Harry Potter and Captain Jack Swallows, the newly reunited family must team up with Aslo, a wise-but-horny lion to stop the White Bitch''s army.', 'When the Pevensie siblings each follow their own path, they find themselves at Willy''s Chocolate Factory. Walking through a wardrobe, they discover the world of Gnarnia, ruled by the White Bitch. Meeting up with characters such as Harry Potter and Captain Jack Swallows, the newly reunited family must team up with Aslo, a wise-but-horny lion to stop the White Bitch''s army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0lGJiTzU2Ce6T31DIRWv7I0kaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9760'),
  ('360628622308036518', 'Epic Tails', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'David Alaux', 'David Alaux, Eric Tosti, Jean-François Tosti', 'Kaycie Chase, Christophe Lemoine, Emmanuel Curtil, Michel Tureau, Pierre Richard, Frantz Confiac, Jérôme Pauwels, Barbara Tissier', 'PG', 'An adventurous mouse sets off to battle dangerous creatures in Ancient Greece, including Poseidon.', 'An adventurous mouse sets off to battle dangerous creatures in Ancient Greece, including Poseidon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVPw9gRPsZZhzY6cIXp6h6nep5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939338'),
  ('1042795338771075517', 'EPiC: Elvis Presley in Concert', 2026, 'Music, Documentary', 'Baz Luhrmann', null, 'Elvis Presley, James Burton, John Wilkinson, Charlie Hodge, Jerry Scheff, Glen D. Hardin, Ronnie Tutt, Bono', 'PG-13', 'Long-lost footage from Elvis Presley''s legendary Las Vegas residency in the 1970s woven together with rare 16mm footage from Elvis on Tour, and 8mm from the Graceland archive, plus recordings of Elvis telling "his side of the story" rediscovered during Baz Luhrmann''s research for his 2022 film, Elvis.', 'Long-lost footage from Elvis Presley''s legendary Las Vegas residency in the 1970s woven together with rare 16mm footage from Elvis on Tour, and 8mm from the Graceland archive, plus recordings of Elvis telling "his side of the story" rediscovered during Baz Luhrmann''s research for his 2022 film, Elvis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2K2NH5dforjT9kLcUC0eeBpdZkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1445363'),
  ('1118497839657048343', 'Epicenter', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Richard Pepin, Richard Leiterman, Ken Blakey', 'Greg McBride', 'Traci Lords, Gary Daniels, Jeff Fahey, Daniela Nane, Constantin Cotimanis, Katie Stuart, Andrew Francis, Trevor White', 'NR', 'Epicenter concerns brassy, beautiful Amanda Foster, a down-on-her-luck Los Angeles detective who''s been assigned to protect a mobster-turned-State''s-Witness, Nick Constantine, from the mob. On the night of the assignment, the city is rocked by a devastating earthquake, forcing Amanda and Nick to fight their way through the ravaged city streets while being pursued by ruthless assassins and corrupt cops.', 'Epicenter concerns brassy, beautiful Amanda Foster, a down-on-her-luck Los Angeles detective who''s been assigned to protect a mobster-turned-State''s-Witness, Nick Constantine, from the mob. On the night of the assignment, the city is rocked by a devastating earthquake, forcing Amanda and Nick to fight their way through the ravaged city streets while being pursued by ruthless assassins and corrupt cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f38T1yGR5G240THLbczpJd1ZEaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50477'),
  ('1115993115014979641', 'Epidemic', 1987, 'Drama, Horror', 'Lars von Trier, Henning Bendtsen', 'Niels Vørsel, Lars von Trier', 'Lars von Trier, Niels Vørsel, Claes Kastholm Hansen, Udo Kier, Svend Ali Hamann, Gitte Lind, Susanne Ottesen, Leif Sabro', null, 'A director and screenwriter pen a script and, in the process, blur the line between fiction and reality.', 'A director and screenwriter pen a script and, in the process, blur the line between fiction and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MvCaYCS3BLvSYdWpRDHahKbQZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29445'),
  ('708332901050209010', 'Epilog', 1992, 'Drama', 'Tom Tykwer, Frank Griebe', 'Tom Tykwer', 'Isis Krüger, Thomas Wolff', null, 'A love story has come to its end. When a man steps into the room where his beloved one lives, she tells him to go and that she doesn''t want to see him anymore. He realizes that this is going to be their last meeting - the epilogue. Afterwards he remembers the tragic ending of their relationship in a different way from what really happened.', 'A love story has come to its end. When a man steps into the room where his beloved one lives, she tells him to go and that she doesn''t want to see him anymore. He realizes that this is going to be their last meeting - the epilogue. Afterwards he remembers the tragic ending of their relationship in a different way from what really happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkCYrnjyYKCuD5yN8eLkFD2XEL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85923'),
  ('618451677697467365', 'Episode 50', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Joe Smalley, Tess Smalley, Oliver Cary', 'Ian Holt', 'Josh Folan, Natalie Wetta, Keithen Hergott, Eleanor Wilson, Justin Brutico, Robert Maisonett, Kieron Elliott, Anna Venizelos', null, 'Teaming up for the first time for a special episode of a supernatural reality TV show, two rival crews get more then they bargained for when they make physical contact with a ferocious spirit of terrifying power. They must band together before it destroys them all. After 49 killer episodes…this is the true story of what happened on episode 50.', 'Teaming up for the first time for a special episode of a supernatural reality TV show, two rival crews get more then they bargained for when they make physical contact with a ferocious spirit of terrifying power. They must band together before it destroys them all. After 49 killer episodes…this is the true story of what happened on episode 50.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CafSu1hxvxLRYTiFuhA3sH0xNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74915'),
