  ('513006194568683265', 'Equinox', 1970, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Jack Woods, Mike Hoover, Dennis Muren', 'Jack Woods', 'Edward Connell, Barbara Hewitt, Jack Woods, Frank Bonner, Robin Christopher, James Phillips, Fritz Leiber Jr., Patrick Burke', 'PG', 'Due to their possession of an ancient mystic book, four friends are attacked by a demon while on a picnic and find themselves pitched into a world of evil that overlaps their own. The film was originally made in 1967 by Dennis Muren as The Equinox: Journey into the Supernatural. Jack Woods was hired to shoot additional footage and expand on Muren''s work.', 'Due to their possession of an ancient mystic book, four friends are attacked by a demon while on a picnic and find themselves pitched into a world of evil that overlaps their own. The film was originally made in 1967 by Dennis Muren as The Equinox: Journey into the Supernatural. Jack Woods was hired to shoot additional footage and expand on Muren''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TbevVaTQ8Vyyez8eEXnoEyDvvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28681'),
  ('938053601968790637', 'Equinox', 1992, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alan Rudolph, Elliot Davis', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Matthew Modine, Lara Flynn Boyle, Fred Ward, Tyra Ferrell, Marisa Tomei, Kevin J. O''Connor, Tate Donovan, Lori Singer', 'R', 'Estranged twins Henry and Freddy navigate their drastically different lives— one a troubled bookworm, the other a hardened criminal. As a young writer uncovers their royal lineage and inheritance, the brothers’ fate intertwines in unexpected ways.', 'Estranged twins Henry and Freddy navigate their drastically different lives— one a troubled bookworm, the other a hardened criminal. As a young writer uncovers their royal lineage and inheritance, the brothers’ fate intertwines in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVmZkiDbTJ1GUYMxUDqdkrAQkFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115565'),
  ('652477368871960950', 'Equinox', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Katharina Bühler, Lena Knauss', 'Lena Knauss', 'Thomas Niehaus, Sarah Hostettler, Aenne Schwarz, Godehard Giese, Ines Marie Westernströer, Julia Richter, Mercedes Müller, Lina Wendel', null, 'Alexander is 30 years old and has never been in love - or has never been in love. He then sees in Paula, a theater actress, the possibility of sharing a future with someone.', 'Alexander is 30 years old and has never been in love - or has never been in love. He then sees in Paula, a theater actress, the possibility of sharing a future with someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJKaDuOuf1vlYF9a046UjZgzXOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567017'),
  ('865840373439555165', 'Equinox Flower', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta, Kôzô Yamamoto', 'Kōgo Noda, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Shin Saburi, Kinuyo Tanaka, Ineko Arima, Yoshiko Kuga, Keiji Sada, Teiji Takahashi, Miyuki Kuwano, Chishū Ryū', 'G', 'Wataru Hirayama''s outwardly liberal views on marriage are severely tested when his daughter declares that she is in love with a coworker and is adamant to live life her own way, instead of agreeing to an arranged marriage. Outwitted by his female relatives, Hirayama stubbornly refuses to admit defeat.', 'Wataru Hirayama''s outwardly liberal views on marriage are severely tested when his daughter declares that she is in love with a coworker and is adamant to live life her own way, instead of agreeing to an arranged marriage. Outwitted by his female relatives, Hirayama stubbornly refuses to admit defeat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osh4NByiG8wOAiQT2qiPGnNWQE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28272'),
  ('879096294605344061', 'Equity', 2016, 'Drama', 'Meera Menon, Eric Lin, Gordon Arkenberg', 'Amy Fox', 'Anna Gunn, James Purefoy, Sarah Megan Thomas, Alysia Reiner, Sophie von Haselberg, Craig Bierko, Lee Tergesen, Margaret Colin', 'R', 'Senior investment banker Naomi Bishop’s world of high-power big money is brutal and fierce, and one she thrives in. When a controversial IPO threatens the fragile balance of power and confidentiality, Naomi finds herself entangled in a web of politics and deception.', 'Senior investment banker Naomi Bishop’s world of high-power big money is brutal and fierce, and one she thrives in. When a controversial IPO threatens the fragile balance of power and confidentiality, Naomi finds herself entangled in a web of politics and deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCl96gJRjX4R1l1jArouQpPc5qw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347033'),
  ('880294724780386708', 'Equus', 1977, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sidney Lumet, David Tringham, Carol Spier', 'Peter Shaffer', 'Richard Burton, Peter Firth, Joan Plowright, Harry Andrews, Colin Blakely, Eileen Atkins, Jenny Agutter, Kate Reid', 'R', 'A psychiatrist, Martin Dysart, investigates the savage blinding of six horses with a metal spike in a stable in Hampshire, England. The atrocity was committed by an unassuming seventeen-year-old stable boy named Alan Strang, the only son of an opinionated but inwardly-timid father and a genteel, religious mother. As Dysart exposes the truths behind the boy''s demons, he finds himself face-to-face with his own.', 'A psychiatrist, Martin Dysart, investigates the savage blinding of six horses with a metal spike in a stable in Hampshire, England. The atrocity was committed by an unassuming seventeen-year-old stable boy named Alan Strang, the only son of an opinionated but inwardly-timid father and a genteel, religious mother. As Dysart exposes the truths behind the boy''s demons, he finds himself face-to-face with his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGjbZqTaq73jcOrcYD3j0trMRKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37258'),
