  ('990617431809264044', 'Er', 2020, null, 'Marco Martinelli', null, 'Ermanna Montanari', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1KVTD4jJQiwQLHrb4Wpo7tARhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975399'),
  ('674869528353606518', 'Er kann''s nicht lassen', 1962, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Axel von Ambesser, Erich Claunigk, Walter Boos', 'Carl Merz, Egon Eis', 'Heinz Rühmann, Rudolf Forster, Ruth-Maria Kubitschek, Grit Boettcher, Lina Carstens, Horst Tappert, Emmerich Schrenk, Siegfried Wischnewski', null, 'Father Brown is only too happy to interfere with the work of the police in solving tricky criminal cases, usually with resounding success. That''s why the clergyman is transferred to a sleepy island called Abbott''s Rock. At first, nothing happens there, but somehow Father Brown seems to be attracted to crime: Soon a gang of thieves is up to no good on the island. So Brown makes the headlines again, and is punitively transferred once more. This time he finds himself in a quiet Irish millionaire community.', 'Father Brown is only too happy to interfere with the work of the police in solving tricky criminal cases, usually with resounding success. That''s why the clergyman is transferred to a sleepy island called Abbott''s Rock. At first, nothing happens there, but somehow Father Brown seems to be attracted to crime: Soon a gang of thieves is up to no good on the island. So Brown makes the headlines again, and is punitively transferred once more. This time he finds himself in a quiet Irish millionaire community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNPnptPwmgrHPNfxPLH8gJO8QeI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11872'),
  ('450272408201308869', 'Era d''estate', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ciro Scognamiglio, Claudia De Falco, Benedetta Barroero', 'Fiorella Infascelli, Antonio Leotti, Silvia Napolitano', 'Giuseppe Fiorello, Massimo Popolizio, Valeria Solarino, Claudia Potenza, Francesco Acquaroli, Giovanni Anzaldo, Elisabetta Piccolomini, Lidia Vitale', null, 'Judges Giovanni Falcone and Paolo Borsellino would eventually fall at the hands of Italy’s Cosa Nostra in 1992. However, before that, in 1985, they were preparing for the ‘Mafia Maxi Trial’ when a tip-off of a planned attack against their families sees them taken to an island in Sardinia to wait out the threat. This situation, somewhere between a forced vacation and witness protection, sees the men delve further into their work, the retreat allowing them to hone their case. Fate, however, is not to be escaped, and all too soon danger returns.', 'Judges Giovanni Falcone and Paolo Borsellino would eventually fall at the hands of Italy’s Cosa Nostra in 1992. However, before that, in 1985, they were preparing for the ‘Mafia Maxi Trial’ when a tip-off of a planned attack against their families sees them taken to an island in Sardinia to wait out the threat. This situation, somewhere between a forced vacation and witness protection, sees the men delve further into their work, the retreat allowing them to hone their case. Fate, however, is not to be escaped, and all too soon danger returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOo9KiMaLnPrl0aVYMXfa3CnIlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395706'),
  ('624144036699749416', 'Eradication', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Byers', 'Harry Aspinwall, Daniel Byers', 'Awni Abdi-Bahri, Christian Masters, Harry Aspinwall, Ross Cowan, Claudia Minor Troyer, Stefan Sirucek', null, 'When an unknown disease wipes out most of the world’s population, a man with unique blood is isolated for study. Fearing for his wife’s safety, he breaks his quarantine – into a world overrun by monstrous Infected and a shadowy agency hunting them down.', 'When an unknown disease wipes out most of the world’s population, a man with unique blood is isolated for study. Fearing for his wife’s safety, he breaks his quarantine – into a world overrun by monstrous Infected and a shadowy agency hunting them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XZYA9VtCcidCU8Hus0J0V9wFhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993867'),
  ('580461490839000082', 'Eragon', 2006, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Hugh Johnson, Stefen Fangmeier', 'Peter Buchman', 'Ed Speleers, Jeremy Irons, Sienna Guillory, Robert Carlyle, John Malkovich, Garrett Hedlund, Alun Armstrong, Djimon Hounsou', 'PG', 'In his homeland of Alagaesia, a farm boy happens upon a dragon''s egg -- a discovery that leads him on a predestined journey where he realized he''s the one person who can defend his home against an evil king.', 'In his homeland of Alagaesia, a farm boy happens upon a dragon''s egg -- a discovery that leads him on a predestined journey where he realized he''s the one person who can defend his home against an evil king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNu6QLUnKqPIjRA3pgEb5dkJye6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2486'),
  ('845416166532961462', 'Erased', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Philipp Stölzl, Kolja Brandt', 'Arash Amel', 'Aaron Eckhart, Liana Liberato, Olga Kurylenko, Garrick Hagon, Éric Godon, Yassine Fadel, Neil Napier, David Bark-Jones', 'R', 'A former agent of the CIA and his estranged daughter go on the run after his employers target them for assassination.', 'A former agent of the CIA and his estranged daughter go on the run after his employers target them for assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42OvgvP795xTfVINk48PAYWEFt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106021'),
  ('422874430863069921', 'Erased', 2016, 'Thriller, Fantasy', 'Yuichiro Hirakawa, Shigeyu Madarame, Tomoyuki Iwasaki', 'Noriko Gotô', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Kasumi Arimura, Yuriko Ishida, Tetta Sugimoto, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Seiji Fukushi, Kanna Mori, Kento Hayashi', null, 'Struggling manga author Satoru Fujinuma is beset by his fear to express himself. However, he has a supernatural ability of being forced to prevent deaths and catastrophes by being sent back in time before the incident occurred, repeating time until the accident is prevented. One day, he gets involved in an accident that has him framed as a murderer. Desperate to save the victim, he sends himself back in time only to find himself as a grade-schooler one month before fellow classmate Kayo Hinazuki went missing. Satoru now embarks on a new quest: to save Kayo and solve the mystery behind her disappearance.', 'Struggling manga author Satoru Fujinuma is beset by his fear to express himself. However, he has a supernatural ability of being forced to prevent deaths and catastrophes by being sent back in time before the incident occurred, repeating time until the accident is prevented. One day, he gets involved in an accident that has him framed as a murderer. Desperate to save the victim, he sends himself back in time only to find himself as a grade-schooler one month before fellow classmate Kayo Hinazuki went missing. Satoru now embarks on a new quest: to save Kayo and solve the mystery behind her disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4LTbdVFKx5gUoUGSm2JQelMqce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379300'),
  ('1052081754044840092', 'Eraser', 1996, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Terry Leonard, Adam Greenberg, Chuck Russell', 'Michael S. Chernuchin, Tony Puryear, Walon Green', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Vanessa Williams, James Caan, James Coburn, Robert Pastorelli, James Cromwell, Danny Nucci, Andy Romano', 'R', 'A Witness Protection specialist becomes suspicious of his co-workers when dealing with a case involving high-tech weapons.', 'A Witness Protection specialist becomes suspicious of his co-workers when dealing with a case involving high-tech weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uu2gBpFElDfxTI6BI9bT4pZ4kvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9268'),
  ('1057449558466049227', 'Eraser: Reborn', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Swan, John Pogue, George Amos', 'Michael D. Weiss', 'Dominic Sherwood, Jacky Lai, McKinley Belcher III, Eddie Ramos, Nathan Castle, Thembekile Komani, Kai Luke Brummer, Soyama Mbashe', 'R', 'U.S. Marshal Mason Pollard specializes in “erasing” people – faking the deaths of high-risk witnesses. With the technological advances of the last 25 years, the game has upgraded, and it’s just another day at the office when he’s assigned to Rina Kimura, a crime boss’ wife who’s decided to turn state’s evidence. As the two flee to Cape Town, South Africa, Pollard discovers he’s been set up and will need to be at the top of his game, or he’ll be the one who’s erased.', 'U.S. Marshal Mason Pollard specializes in “erasing” people – faking the deaths of high-risk witnesses. With the technological advances of the last 25 years, the game has upgraded, and it’s just another day at the office when he’s assigned to Rina Kimura, a crime boss’ wife who’s decided to turn state’s evidence. As the two flee to Cape Town, South Africa, Pollard discovers he’s been set up and will need to be at the top of his game, or he’ll be the one who’s erased.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWE48knKsaPGqVoANXoWraiub2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923597'),
  ('550580748315721911', 'Eraserhead', 1977, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Frederick Elmes, Herbert Cardwell, Catherine E. Coulson', 'David Lynch', 'Jack Nance, Charlotte Stewart, Allen Joseph, Jeanne Bates, Judith Roberts, Laurel Near, Jack Fisk, Jean Lange', 'NR', 'First-time father Henry Spencer tries to survive his industrial environment, his angry girlfriend, and the unbearable screams of his newly born mutant child.', 'First-time father Henry Spencer tries to survive his industrial environment, his angry girlfriend, and the unbearable screams of his newly born mutant child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxveW3mGVc0DzLdOmtkZsgd7c3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985'),
