  ('229331135072848962', 'Erax', 2022, 'Mystery, Family', 'Hebru Brantley', 'Hebru Brantley, Henry G.M. Jones', 'Jasmine Cephas Jones, Genesis White, Lance Gross', 'PG', 'Monstrous creatures leap from a magical storybook and unleash mayhem and mischief for Auntie Opal and her tween niece Nina in this spooky short film.', 'Monstrous creatures leap from a magical storybook and unleash mayhem and mischief for Auntie Opal and her tween niece Nina in this spooky short film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMp04rYhy4yfOfjZq5F9R3wkeqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929472'),
  ('848072293576649696', 'Erbsen auf halb 6', 2004, 'Drama', 'Lars Büchel, Judith Kaufmann', 'Ruth Toma, Lars Büchel', 'Fritzi Haberlandt, Tina Engel, Harald Schrott, Jenny Gröllmann, Alice Dwyer, Max Mauff, Annett Renneberg, Jens Münchow', null, 'It all starts with a bang. The car breaks through the crash barrier and falls off the bridge. The lights go out. After that, he is not able to see anymore. His optic nerve is severed, from now on the young stage-director Jakob is blind. His life will change and nothing will ever be the same. Jakob cannot handle the idea of never being able to see again and screams at the only woman who is able and willing to help him, Lily. A rehabilitation teacher, she helps the blind deal with the darkness. Lily has been living with it since birth, she too is blind.', 'It all starts with a bang. The car breaks through the crash barrier and falls off the bridge. The lights go out. After that, he is not able to see anymore. His optic nerve is severed, from now on the young stage-director Jakob is blind. His life will change and nothing will ever be the same. Jakob cannot handle the idea of never being able to see again and screams at the only woman who is able and willing to help him, Lily. A rehabilitation teacher, she helps the blind deal with the darkness. Lily has been living with it since birth, she too is blind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dHHRyyIxhSf2xn7Dp93BtopMlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2349'),
