  ('669869340042876610', 'Erendira', 1983, 'Drama', 'Ruy Guerra, Denys Clerval', 'Gabriel García Márquez', 'Irene Papas, Claudia Ohana, Michael Lonsdale, Oliver Wehe, Blanca Guerra, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Delia Casanova', null, 'While Erendira, a beautiful teenage girl, has a surreal mystical vision, her grandmother''s house catches on fire and burns to the ground. Her grandmother holds Erendira responsible and, in order to extract restitution from the girl, forces her into prostitution. Erendira''s surreal mystical experiences continue while her grandmother grows rich from exploiting her.', 'While Erendira, a beautiful teenage girl, has a surreal mystical vision, her grandmother''s house catches on fire and burns to the ground. Her grandmother holds Erendira responsible and, in order to extract restitution from the girl, forces her into prostitution. Erendira''s surreal mystical experiences continue while her grandmother grows rich from exploiting her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cel0jAK893bLAaXv4BNwiPOGFb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133750'),
  ('398342352752192412', 'Eric', 2026, 'Horror', 'Shankar', 'Murali Raman', 'Hemand Menon, Geethika Tiwary, Prem Praveen, Manu Kurishinkal, Kiran Prathap', null, 'A woman''s life spirals as her car acts independently, triggering paranormal events tied to a bloodied hand missing a finger. She investigates the intensifying haunting, revealing a hidden history of betrayal and revenge.', 'A woman''s life spirals as her car acts independently, triggering paranormal events tied to a bloodied hand missing a finger. She investigates the intensifying haunting, revealing a hidden history of betrayal and revenge.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzI4MDllOWMtNWFlYi00MDQxLTk2ZDUtOTBkZDQxMTNiOWY2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:eric-2026-1'),
  ('210753879264569350', 'Eric Andre: Legalize Everything', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Eric Notarnicola, Ashley Connor', 'Eric André', 'Eric André', 'R', 'Comedian Eric Andre presents his very first Netflix original stand-up special. Taking the stage in New Orleans, Andre breaks the boundaries of comedy as he critiques the war on drugs, the war on sex, and the war on fart jokes!', 'Comedian Eric Andre presents his very first Netflix original stand-up special. Taking the stage in New Orleans, Andre breaks the boundaries of comedy as he critiques the war on drugs, the war on sex, and the war on fart jokes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epCjHq5yefl7h3cKaOJgexc0AMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:703754'),
  ('447230605046400274', 'Eric Antoine - Réalité ou illusion', 2010, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Éric Antoine', null, 'An extraordinary artist in more ways than one, actor-comedian-illusionist-agitator of ideas and audiences, this learned and multi-talented joker with the air of a mad scientist draws the audience into a kind of “scientificomic” vertigo during a spectacular show-conference full of surprises on the theme of “reality or illusion.”', 'An extraordinary artist in more ways than one, actor-comedian-illusionist-agitator of ideas and audiences, this learned and multi-talented joker with the air of a mad scientist draws the audience into a kind of “scientificomic” vertigo during a spectacular show-conference full of surprises on the theme of “reality or illusion.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYZcjxfjS7LUOWgacltYUQKaqeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89375'),
  ('846982216267243210', 'Erik the Conqueror', 1961, 'Adventure, History', 'Mario Bava, Franco Prosperi, Tonino Ricci', 'Oreste Biancoli, Mario Bava, Piero Pierotti', 'Cameron Mitchell, George Ardisson, Alice Kessler, Ellen Kessler, Franco Giacobini, Raf Baldassarre, Enzo Doria, Franco Ressel', null, 'In the 9th Century, two Viking children, separated since their early childhood with one raised by the British and the other by Vikings, meet after nearly 20 years as rivals as war breaks out between Britian and the Vikings for control of England.', 'In the 9th Century, two Viking children, separated since their early childhood with one raised by the British and the other by Vikings, meet after nearly 20 years as rivals as war breaks out between Britian and the Vikings for control of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meIpKJlicElyzUWj0lWKTNGgvkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88266'),
  ('536128070052749529', 'Erik the Viking', 1989, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Terry Jones, Ian Wilson, David Brown', 'Terry Jones', 'Tim Robbins, Mickey Rooney, Eartha Kitt, Terry Jones, Imogen Stubbs, John Cleese, Tsutomu Sekine, Antony Sher', 'PG-13', 'Erik the Viking gathers warriors from his village and sets out on a dangerous journey to Valhalla, to ask the gods to end the Age of Ragnorok and allow his people to see sunlight again. A Pythonesque satire of Viking life.', 'Erik the Viking gathers warriors from his village and sets out on a dangerous journey to Valhalla, to ask the gods to end the Age of Ragnorok and allow his people to see sunlight again. A Pythonesque satire of Viking life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRaNvLehJf0OVsBexo4u4NRKLJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11828'),
  ('1081654236185146400', 'Erin Brockovich', 2000, 'Drama', 'Steven Soderbergh, Edward Lachman, Keith P. Cunningham', 'Susannah Grant', 'Julia Roberts, Albert Finney, Aaron Eckhart, Marg Helgenberger, Cherry Jones, Veanne Cox, Conchata Ferrell, Tracey Walter', 'R', 'A twice-divorced mother of three who sees an injustice, takes on the bad guy and wins -- with a little help from her push-up bra. Erin goes to work for an attorney and comes across medical records describing illnesses clustered in one nearby town. She starts investigating and soon exposes a monumental cover-up.', 'A twice-divorced mother of three who sees an injustice, takes on the bad guy and wins -- with a little help from her push-up bra. Erin goes to work for an attorney and comes across medical records describing illnesses clustered in one nearby town. She starts investigating and soon exposes a monumental cover-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMs20iUQyZVs05Ck7Q0LNnRsstr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462'),
  ('809405134238828243', 'Erkan & Stefan', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Michael Herbig, Stephan Schuh', 'Günter Knarr, Philipp Weinges', 'John Friedmann, Florian Simbeck, Alexandra Neldel, Manfred Zapatka, Christian Tramitz, Anna Böttcher, Tim Wilde, Siegfried Terpoorten', null, 'Editor Eckernförde has come into the possession of an audiocassette that contains a recording of the last minutes of deceased politician Uwe Barschel. The circumstances of his untimely death have never been completely resolved - until now. Unfortunately, the editor''s daughter Nina accidentally takes the tape with her to Munich, where she is about to visit her paralyzed Mom in a sanatorium. When this information reaches the CIA and the BND, both organizations compete to get hold of the tape. Meanwhile Erkan & Stefan, two loveable wannabe supercheckers from Munich, are assigned as bodyguards for Nina - of course, they are expected to mess up their job, so that the tape can be retrieved. But the two friends prove to be a bit more streetwise than CIA or BND ever expected.', 'Editor Eckernförde has come into the possession of an audiocassette that contains a recording of the last minutes of deceased politician Uwe Barschel. The circumstances of his untimely death have never been completely resolved - until now. Unfortunately, the editor''s daughter Nina accidentally takes the tape with her to Munich, where she is about to visit her paralyzed Mom in a sanatorium. When this information reaches the CIA and the BND, both organizations compete to get hold of the tape. Meanwhile Erkan & Stefan, two loveable wannabe supercheckers from Munich, are assigned as bodyguards for Nina - of course, they are expected to mess up their job, so that the tape can be retrieved. But the two friends prove to be a bit more streetwise than CIA or BND ever expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8Vjf8vlHhivc9aY9nN8JHlgvIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9601'),
  ('18335787944408664', 'Erkan & Stefan 2', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Axel Sand', null, 'Florian Simbeck, John Friedmann, Bettina Zimmermann, Leon Boden, Corinna Harfouch, Rick Kavanian, Dietrich Hollinderbäumer, Ralph Herforth', null, 'A couple of slackers find an antique dagger and manage to free the gorgeous female warrior that was imprisoned in it by an evil spell. An evil sorcerer is not happy by this turn of events and determines to possess both the blade and the warrior through a sacrificial ceremony. The two heroes manage to rescue the damsel in distress and defeat the wizard and his minions by employing skills mastered through hours of video game play.', 'A couple of slackers find an antique dagger and manage to free the gorgeous female warrior that was imprisoned in it by an evil spell. An evil sorcerer is not happy by this turn of events and determines to possess both the blade and the warrior through a sacrificial ceremony. The two heroes manage to rescue the damsel in distress and defeat the wizard and his minions by employing skills mastered through hours of video game play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHOYfPKVmdjpXSFR4ZF6LE1KY6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1615'),
  ('899609939798709082', 'Erkan & Stefan 3', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Michael Karen', null, 'John Friedmann, Florian Simbeck, Ludger Pistor, Andrea Sawatzki, Christoph Maria Herbst, Julia Dietze, Daniel Krauss, Michael Schiller', null, 'The 3rd movie by the comedian duo Erkan and Stefan.', 'The 3rd movie by the comedian duo Erkan and Stefan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lsquAV4O1QZXlYnDhQlAQb9M7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1616'),
  ('1060495149060582248', 'Ermo', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lu Gengxin, Zhou Xiaowen', 'Lang Yun', 'Ai Liya, Liu Peiqi, Ge Zhijun, Zhang Haiyan', null, 'A humble noodle-maker in a remote Chinese province, Ermo feels that she''s being taken for granted by family and friends. She decides the best way to impress them is to bring home the biggest, most expensive television set she can find - no matter how many noodles she has to peddle.', 'A humble noodle-maker in a remote Chinese province, Ermo feels that she''s being taken for granted by family and friends. She decides the best way to impress them is to bring home the biggest, most expensive television set she can find - no matter how many noodles she has to peddle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEpslyFWDswkWnRslFp8ZGQ9YA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124468'),
  ('40271943928752090', 'Ernest & Celestine: A Trip to Gibberitia', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Music, Adventure', 'Jean-Christophe Roger, Julien Chheng', 'Sébastien Oursel, Guillaume Mautalent', 'Lambert Wilson, Pauline Brunner, Michel Lerousseau, Céline Ronté, Lévanah Solomon, Jean-Marc Pannetier, Christophe Lemoine, Georges Caudron', 'PG', 'Ernest and Celestine are travelling back to Ernest''s country, Gibberitia, to fix his broken violin. This exotic land is home to the best musicians on earth and music constantly fills the air with joy. However, upon arriving, our two heroes discover that all forms of music have been banned for many years - and for them, a life without music is unthinkable. Along with their friends and a mysterious masked outlaw, Ernest and Celestine must try their best to bring music and happiness back to the land of bears.', 'Ernest and Celestine are travelling back to Ernest''s country, Gibberitia, to fix his broken violin. This exotic land is home to the best musicians on earth and music constantly fills the air with joy. However, upon arriving, our two heroes discover that all forms of music have been banned for many years - and for them, a life without music is unthinkable. Along with their friends and a mysterious masked outlaw, Ernest and Celestine must try their best to bring music and happiness back to the land of bears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2E8SU5J6pk5BheYPJLjGyVPsrv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947219'),
  ('980452447479273534', 'Ernest Cole: Lost and Found', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Raoul Peck', null, 'LaKeith Stanfield, Raoul Peck', null, 'More than 60,000 of Ernest Cole’s 35mm film negatives were inexplicably discovered in a bank vault in Stockholm, Sweden. Most considered these forever lost, especially the thousands of pictures he shot in the U.S. Told through Cole’s own writings, the stories of those closest to him, and the lens of his uncompromising work, the film is a reintroduction of a pivotal Black artist to a new generation and will unravel the mystery of his missing negatives.', 'More than 60,000 of Ernest Cole’s 35mm film negatives were inexplicably discovered in a bank vault in Stockholm, Sweden. Most considered these forever lost, especially the thousands of pictures he shot in the U.S. Told through Cole’s own writings, the stories of those closest to him, and the lens of his uncompromising work, the film is a reintroduction of a pivotal Black artist to a new generation and will unravel the mystery of his missing negatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEqDYZtw9GlzmwvmflY6b2mfwd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127632'),
  ('661286190436110029', 'Ernest Goes to Africa', 1997, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'John Cherry, James Robb', 'John Cherry', 'Jim Varney, Linda Kash, Jamie Bartlett, Robert Whitehead, Sello Sebotsane, Frank Opperman, Zane Meas, Ian Yule', 'PG', 'The title says it all. There''s a mix up involving stolen diamonds which Ernest has (naturally) made into a yo-yo and given to his would be girlfriend, Rene. But Rene wants a man of action, and doesn''t think that Ernest fits the bill. After the bad guys come looking for the stolen diamonds and kidnap Rene, all of her fantasies come true as Ernest has to go to Africa to rescue her.', 'The title says it all. There''s a mix up involving stolen diamonds which Ernest has (naturally) made into a yo-yo and given to his would be girlfriend, Rene. But Rene wants a man of action, and doesn''t think that Ernest fits the bill. After the bad guys come looking for the stolen diamonds and kidnap Rene, all of her fantasies come true as Ernest has to go to Africa to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qj2T8ZcbB29wE01Lk4ryje2YFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34600'),
  ('494144618186637701', 'Ernest Goes to Camp', 1987, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Cherry, Jim May, Harry Mathias', 'John Cherry, Coke Sams', 'Jim Varney, Victoria Racimo, John Vernon, Lyle Alzado, Gailard Sartain, Daniel Butler, Iron Eyes Cody, Patrick Day', 'PG', 'Ernest, a lovable loser who works as a summer camp handyman and dreams of becoming a guidance counselor, must find a way to inspire a group of juvenile delinquents while stopping a shady strip mining company from closing the camp as well.', 'Ernest, a lovable loser who works as a summer camp handyman and dreams of becoming a guidance counselor, must find a way to inspire a group of juvenile delinquents while stopping a shady strip mining company from closing the camp as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14GzgM3U2ABJ3h4ixhOkWpoQJAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18935'),
  ('787139378485699949', 'Ernest Goes to Jail', 1990, 'Comedy, Family, Crime', 'John Cherry, Peter Stein, Ben Rubin', 'Charlie Cohen', 'Jim Varney, Gailard Sartain, Bill Byrge, Barbara Tyson, Barry Scott, Randall ''Tex'' Cobb, Dan Leegant, Charles Napier', 'PG', 'Bumbling bank janitor Ernest P. Worrell is assigned to jury duty, and soon finds himself in trouble when he is covertly switched with a look-a-like crime boss. Ernest must escape from jail to expose the mix-up.', 'Bumbling bank janitor Ernest P. Worrell is assigned to jury duty, and soon finds himself in trouble when he is covertly switched with a look-a-like crime boss. Ernest must escape from jail to expose the mix-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1k8SgODFQOk9wHjX4mi8QdkYAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18943'),
  ('823675209508955777', 'Ernest Goes to School', 1994, 'Family, Comedy', 'David Geddes, Coke Sams, Sid Kozak', 'Coke Sams, Bruce Arntson', 'Jim Varney, Linda Kash, Bill Byrge, Jason Michas, Sarah Chalke, Gabe Khouth, Corrine Koslo, Will Sasso', 'PG', 'Jim Varney''s recurring dim-bulb character Ernest P. Worrell returns in this film as a school janitor seeking to obtain a high school diploma.', 'Jim Varney''s recurring dim-bulb character Ernest P. Worrell returns in this film as a school janitor seeking to obtain a high school diploma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2S6bIKKGK6kHSCWLsoQFpUeawN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20551'),
  ('489281937840678707', 'Ernest Goes to Splash Mountain', 1989, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Cherry', null, 'Jim Varney, Danny Breen, Sheryl Bernstein', 'NR', 'An exciting mock documentary produced for the opening of the Splash Mountain attraction at Disneyland. Ernest Goes To Splash Mountain chronicles the adventures of Ernest P. Worrell who trains as America''s first "Splashtranaut" destined to become the very first person to conquer the mountain. Ralph Story, veteran news anchor and his team are determined to cover the momentous event by every angle possible.', 'An exciting mock documentary produced for the opening of the Splash Mountain attraction at Disneyland. Ernest Goes To Splash Mountain chronicles the adventures of Ernest P. Worrell who trains as America''s first "Splashtranaut" destined to become the very first person to conquer the mountain. Ralph Story, veteran news anchor and his team are determined to cover the momentous event by every angle possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtoJYUpLZs1erzVjyfo59xCIYDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263387'),
  ('973425283119736350', 'Ernest in the Army', 1998, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Cherry, James Robb, Anna Feyder', 'Joseph Dattorre, Jeffrey Pillars', 'Jim Varney, Hayley Tyson, Farouk Valley-Omar, Peter Butler, Jeffrey Pillars, John Cherry, David Müller, Christo Davids', 'PG', 'Ernest P. Worrell is now in the military as a soldier. Once he begins, him and his team investigates a dictator who was responsible for the wars in the nearly village. Suddenly, Ernest finds a lost boy and has to keep him safe until his father recovers.', 'Ernest P. Worrell is now in the military as a soldier. Once he begins, him and his team investigates a dictator who was responsible for the wars in the nearly village. Suddenly, Ernest finds a lost boy and has to keep him safe until his father recovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFMfjhkN01aKdUBmbNJe76rRPtg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39128'),
  ('715415107361414560', 'Ernest Rides Again', 1993, 'Comedy, Family', 'David Geddes, John Cherry', 'John Cherry, William M. Akers', 'Jim Varney, Ron James, Tom Butler, Linda Kash, Frank C. Turner, Lillian Carlson, Alf Humphreys, Mitchell Kosterman', 'PG', 'Buffoonish Ernest and his dimwitted pal Abner unearth a huge cannon reputed to contain the crown jewels of England.', 'Buffoonish Ernest and his dimwitted pal Abner unearth a huge cannon reputed to contain the crown jewels of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lv9xbTZSafdFAXLpcbfJ779nnOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34300'),
  ('581916088964901320', 'Ernest Saves Christmas', 1988, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Cherry, Peter Stein, Coke Sams', 'B. Kline, Ed Turner', 'Jim Varney, Oliver Clark, Noelle Parker, Gailard Sartain, Billie Bird, Bill Byrge, Douglas Seale, Robert Lesser', 'PG', 'When Santa Claus decides to retire and pass on his magic bag of Christmas surprises to a new Saint Nick, he enlists the aid of a hilarious assortment of characters. A perky teen runaway and hapless taxi driver Ernest P. Worrell must convince a skeptical kiddie-show host to take over the post of Father Christmas.', 'When Santa Claus decides to retire and pass on his magic bag of Christmas surprises to a new Saint Nick, he enlists the aid of a hilarious assortment of characters. A perky teen runaway and hapless taxi driver Ernest P. Worrell must convince a skeptical kiddie-show host to take over the post of Father Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XYMlJg9sqM1e80pNb9lCK3oJ4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26386'),
  ('1073157565959384444', 'Ernest Scared Stupid', 1991, 'Comedy, Family, Horror', 'John Cherry, Hanania Baer, Douglas A. Raine', 'Charles Gale, Coke Sams', 'Jim Varney, Bill Byrge, John Cadenhead, Austin Nagler, Shay Astar, Jonas Moscartolo, Daniel Butler, Larry Black', 'PG', 'Well-intentioned, eternally bumbling Ernest P. Worrell accidentally releases an evil demon from its sacred tomb. As the demon flexes its power and goes on a ruinous rampage, good-guy Ernest tries to step in to save the town from mass destruction. Trouble is, a 200-year-old curse has scared Ernest stupid, and that means hilarity all around! So, kick back and let the laugh-ridden adventures begin.', 'Well-intentioned, eternally bumbling Ernest P. Worrell accidentally releases an evil demon from its sacred tomb. As the demon flexes its power and goes on a ruinous rampage, good-guy Ernest tries to step in to save the town from mass destruction. Trouble is, a 200-year-old curse has scared Ernest stupid, and that means hilarity all around! So, kick back and let the laugh-ridden adventures begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnMtX8eKFFrJVEPZijFZqzDbckK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32685'),
  ('602840957803603478', 'Ernesto', 1979, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Salvatore Samperi, Camillo Bazzoni, Inga Seyric', 'José Luis Martínez Mollá, Peter Berling, Salvatore Samperi', 'Martin Halm, Michele Placido, Virna Lisi, Turi Ferro, Lara Wendel, Gisela Hahn, Stefano Madia, Francisco Marsó', null, 'Ernesto is a young Italian Jew of the early 1900s who works in his uncle''s factory in Trieste. Not entirely secure with his sexual orientation, Ernesto enters into an affair with one of his uncle''s employees.', 'Ernesto is a young Italian Jew of the early 1900s who works in his uncle''s factory in Trieste. Not entirely secure with his sexual orientation, Ernesto enters into an affair with one of his uncle''s employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euZYIgXNTIYuODAM96Tc21oTbPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225408'),
  ('335181931975822833', 'Ernst & the Light', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Tomas Villum Jensen', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Jens Jørn Spottag, Søren Østergaard', null, 'The businessman Ernst has just landed in the airport and is on his way home to his wife. Its raining heavy outside and therefore he takes a hitchhiker with him. They start a conversation about the value of life and soon it becomes evident to the spectators that the hitchhiker is Jesus Christ, but Ernst is in too much of a rush to go back to his wife to notice.', 'The businessman Ernst has just landed in the airport and is on his way home to his wife. Its raining heavy outside and therefore he takes a hitchhiker with him. They start a conversation about the value of life and soon it becomes evident to the spectators that the hitchhiker is Jesus Christ, but Ernst is in too much of a rush to go back to his wife to notice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1QTJmrNoSGFZylpeMfskzxzYuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210822'),
  ('310134147286935474', 'Ero in guerra ma non lo sapevo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Luca Turtulici, Nico Marzano, Fabio Resinaro', 'Fabio Resinaro, Carlo Mazzotta, Mauro Caporiccio', 'Francesco Montanari, Laura Chiatti, Stefano Fregni, Gianluca Gobbi, Luca Guastini, Juju Di Domenico, Gualtiero Burzi, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio', null, 'The story of Pierluigi Torregiani, a Milanese jeweler who in 1979 was killed in revenge by the Armed Proletarians for Communism after killing one of their own during a robbery.', 'The story of Pierluigi Torregiani, a Milanese jeweler who in 1979 was killed in revenge by the Armed Proletarians for Communism after killing one of their own during a robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywuNHbHnN5EZQGtRsx6ArdiEAAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776340'),
  ('241654413492294509', 'Erogeny', 1976, 'Drama', 'James Broughton', null, null, null, 'The film travels in close-up over the mysterious terrains of nude human bodies as they touch and explore one another.', 'The film travels in close-up over the mysterious terrains of nude human bodies as they touch and explore one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gfDIAYXxykH02SSQLje6oFXjTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388811'),
  ('345121559052234530', 'Eroica', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Andrzej Munk, Jakub Goldberg, Paweł Komorowski', 'Jerzy Stefan Stawiński', 'Edward Dziewoński, Józef Nowak, Barbara Połomska, Ignacy Machowski, Leon Niemczyk, Kazimierz Opaliński, Zofia Czerwińska, Jerzy Felczyński', null, 'Tells two tales set during WWII: A seemingly feckless and selfish man finally takes up arms in the national struggle against the Nazis. Set in a POW camp, Polish inmates cling to their hopes for an eventual escape, encouraged by the legendary escape of one of their own.', 'Tells two tales set during WWII: A seemingly feckless and selfish man finally takes up arms in the national struggle against the Nazis. Set in a POW camp, Polish inmates cling to their hopes for an eventual escape, encouraged by the legendary escape of one of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWiEsDfapHS1F3gLh6VUUywo0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117767'),
  ('719318844243579022', 'Eros', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Steven Soderbergh, Marco Pontecorvo', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Steven Soderbergh, Tonino Guerra', 'Gong Li, Chang Chen, Tien Feng, Robert Downey Jr., Alan Arkin, Ele Keats, Christopher Buchholz, Regina Nemni', 'R', 'A three-part anthology about love and sexuality: a menage-a-trois between a couple and a young woman on the coast of Tuscany; an advertising executive under enormous pressure at work, who, during visits to his psychiatrist, is pulled to delve into the possible reasons why his stress seems to manifest itself in a recurring erotic dream; a story of unrequited love about a beautiful, 1960s high-end call girl in an impossible affair with her young tailor.', 'A three-part anthology about love and sexuality: a menage-a-trois between a couple and a young woman on the coast of Tuscany; an advertising executive under enormous pressure at work, who, during visits to his psychiatrist, is pulled to delve into the possible reasons why his stress seems to manifest itself in a recurring erotic dream; a story of unrequited love about a beautiful, 1960s high-end call girl in an impossible affair with her young tailor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bz8pWVNsbg1MMKCgp2VX6wFOXJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39850'),
  ('411459007180996854', 'Eros + Massacre', 1969, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Motokichi Hasegawa, Hiroshi Takano', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Masahiro Yamada', 'Mariko Okada, Toshiyuki Hosokawa, Yūko Kusunoki, Etsushi Takahashi, Masako Yagi, Taiko Shinbashi, Kazuko Inano, Kinji Matsueda', null, 'Two interwoven stories. The first is a biography of anarchist Sakae Osugi which follows his relationship with three women in the 1920s. The second centers around two 1960s students researching Osugi''s theories.', 'Two interwoven stories. The first is a biography of anarchist Sakae Osugi which follows his relationship with three women in the 1920s. The second centers around two 1960s students researching Osugi''s theories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6veIw3yDiIrxOhUPJJeg8pKn4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78117'),
  ('1091662772948185120', 'Eros School: Feels So Good', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Koretsugu Kurahara, Kenji Hagiwara, Toshitaka Takashima', 'Akira Momoi', 'Asami Ogawa, Asami Morikawa, Mami Yuki, Jun Aki, Morihei Murata, Toshikatsu Matsukaze, Wataru Ishibashi', null, 'A delinquent transfer student calling himself Ryu the Rapist and his pet pig ravages his way through the female student body of a high school. He soon sets his sights on the popular class president and track star who is favored to win the upcoming track meet. How long can she resist?', 'A delinquent transfer student calling himself Ryu the Rapist and his pet pig ravages his way through the female student body of a high school. He soon sets his sights on the popular class president and track star who is favored to win the upcoming track meet. How long can she resist?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGwJOsklTRTYMYcjoDvx5niodAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105832'),
  ('170657570296512938', 'Eros Therapy', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Danièle Dubroux, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Pascal Richou, Danièle Dubroux', 'Catherine Frot, Isabelle Carré, François Berléand, Melvil Poupaud, Julie Depardieu, Claire Nebout, Éva Ionesco, Marc Andréoni', null, 'A husband wants to win back his wife, even though she has been living with her lesbian lover for six months.', 'A husband wants to win back his wife, even though she has been living with her lesbian lover for six months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snCS9EvumteS7DSl0TulsZe46yK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69126'),
  ('136773611643366519', 'Erotibot', 2011, 'Science Fiction', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu', 'Mahiro Aine, Maria Ozawa, Yasunori Tanaka, Fukuten, Yûya Tokumoto, Asami', null, 'Tamayo, lives her life in simple elegance. Her overprotective crimelord father, in order to protect her from outside danger, has given her 3 android bodyguards. Life is good. Until one day Tamayo''s father is hospitalized for a stroke and his computer is hacked and his will is found! Inside his will it says that he is leaving his immense fortune solely to Tamayo! When Tsukiyo discovers this, she plots to regain her inheritance. Can she distract the 3 Androids long enough to exact her plan?! Who will the Androids love in the end?! Which Android will win Tamayo''s love??!!', 'Tamayo, lives her life in simple elegance. Her overprotective crimelord father, in order to protect her from outside danger, has given her 3 android bodyguards. Life is good. Until one day Tamayo''s father is hospitalized for a stroke and his computer is hacked and his will is found! Inside his will it says that he is leaving his immense fortune solely to Tamayo! When Tsukiyo discovers this, she plots to regain her inheritance. Can she distract the 3 Androids long enough to exact her plan?! Who will the Androids love in the end?! Which Android will win Tamayo''s love??!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRe78enQk7czfnP07kfiLTcxfQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75556'),
