  ('339704929309389715', 'Escape', 1940, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Al Shenberg, Robert H. Planck', 'Arch Oboler, Marguerite Roberts', 'Norma Shearer, Robert Taylor, Conrad Veidt, Alla Nazimova, Felix Bressart, Albert Bassermann, Philip Dorn, Edgar Barrier', 'NR', 'An American goes to pre-war Germany to find his mother and discovers her in a concentration camp. With the help of an American-born widowed countess he seeks to engineer her escape.', 'An American goes to pre-war Germany to find his mother and discovers her in a concentration camp. With the help of an American-born widowed countess he seeks to engineer her escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQWrCUM3JnTrDT4Iz9l173JjAHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109008'),
  ('699503691253852752', 'Escape', 1948, 'Thriller', 'Freddie Young, Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Anthony Hearne', 'Philip Dunne', 'Rex Harrison, Peggy Cummins, William Hartnell, Norman Wooland, Jill Esmond, Frederick Piper, Marjorie Rhodes, Betty Ann Davies', 'NR', 'A convict sentenced to three years for killing a detective escapes and goes on the lam, aided by a local girl.', 'A convict sentenced to three years for killing a detective escapes and goes on the lam, aided by a local girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pKvRn8fUxKoqVDlyQ4DCgfyDui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41599'),
  ('300032764707032472', 'Escape', 2012, 'Action, History', 'Roar Uthaug, John Christian Rosenlund', 'Thomas Moldestad', 'Isabel Christine Andreasen, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Kristian Espedal, Hallvard Holmen, Bjørn Moan, Milla Olin, Iren Reppen, Eirik Holden Rotheim', null, 'Ten years after the Black Death devastated the country, a poor family sets out on a journey to search for better living conditions. In a deserted mountain pass, they are attacked by a gang of ruthless killer thieves. The only one spared is 19 year old Signe. She is taken prisoner, and the gang brings her back to their camp. Here, she soon learns that they have a fate worse than death in store for her, and realises that her only hope is to escape.', 'Ten years after the Black Death devastated the country, a poor family sets out on a journey to search for better living conditions. In a deserted mountain pass, they are attacked by a gang of ruthless killer thieves. The only one spared is 19 year old Signe. She is taken prisoner, and the gang brings her back to their camp. Here, she soon learns that they have a fate worse than death in store for her, and realises that her only hope is to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhCUKKg9fz4i7FiVy95SzUB2KyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136080'),
  ('334165284906277173', 'Escape', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Lee Jong-pil, Kim Sung-an, Park Dong-jin', 'Kim Woo-geun, Kwon Sung-hui', 'Lee Je-hoon, Koo Kyo-hwan, Hong Xa-bin, Seo Hyun-woo, Lee Sung-wook, Yoo Tae-joo, Jung Jun-won, Jang Young-nam', null, 'After completing his required decade of military service and being honored as a hero, a North Korean sergeant makes a sudden shocking attempt to defect to the South, risking life and limb for the chance to finally determine his own destiny.', 'After completing his required decade of military service and being honored as a hero, a North Korean sergeant makes a sudden shocking attempt to defect to the South, risking life and limb for the chance to finally determine his own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiYaXpjoPASnLwyts0ZOLBjZO0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921436'),
  ('1045483295408891130', 'Escape by Night', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Roberto Rossellini, Franco Rossellini, Carlo Carlini', 'Sergio Amidei, Brunello Rondi, Diego Fabbri', 'Leo Genn, Giovanna Ralli, Renato Salvatori, Paolo Stoppa, Sergio Fantoni, Enrico Maria Salerno, Sergey Bondarchuk, Hannes Messemer', null, 'In Nazi-occupied Rome, a beautiful bootlegger, to the chagrin of her lover, gives sanctuary to three escaped POWs: an American pilot, a Russian sergeant and a British major.', 'In Nazi-occupied Rome, a beautiful bootlegger, to the chagrin of her lover, gives sanctuary to three escaped POWs: an American pilot, a Russian sergeant and a British major.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k40hZ9b5pMIUge74mZgY40yOdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78812'),
  ('919411245925735493', 'Escape Clause', 1996, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Bert Tougas, Shane Cardwell', 'Danilo Bach', 'Andrew McCarthy, Paul Sorvino, Connie Britton, Kate McNeil, Stan Egi, Kenneth Welsh, John Evans, Peter Donaldson', 'R', 'A man finds out that his wife has paid $10,000 to have him killed. Then both the would-be killer and the wife turn up dead ...', 'A man finds out that his wife has paid $10,000 to have him killed. Then both the would-be killer and the wife turn up dead ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zQrDPSahAocYAiLTlpabdU7e9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155724'),
  ('755730542606010263', 'Escape from Alaska', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Steve Kroschel, Richard Pepin, Steve Kroschel', 'Steve Kroschel', 'Thomas Ian Griffith, Caroleen Feeney, R. Lee Ermey, C. Thomas Howell, John Ashton, Geoffrey Lower, Hilary Shepard, Gary Kasper', 'PG-13', 'A helicopter pilot work with a husband and his wife in the frozen North tagging foxes for the Environmental Protection Agency. When an avalanche hits the group, the husband is killed and only by the pilot''s perseverance is the wife saved. Two years later, the wife takes on a corporation which wants to extend an oil pipeline across the tundra above Juneau. She is convinced that this will cause an avalanche on the town. Of course, she is rejected by the corporation executives. She recruits the pilot to try to aid her, but with no success.', 'A helicopter pilot work with a husband and his wife in the frozen North tagging foxes for the Environmental Protection Agency. When an avalanche hits the group, the husband is killed and only by the pilot''s perseverance is the wife saved. Two years later, the wife takes on a corporation which wants to extend an oil pipeline across the tundra above Juneau. She is convinced that this will cause an avalanche on the town. Of course, she is rejected by the corporation executives. She recruits the pilot to try to aid her, but with no success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kctxZPGdg5VPj2D1pPxAtAjBjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73842'),
  ('1089976909624854228', 'Escape from Alcatraz', 1979, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Don Siegel, Bruce Surtees, Luigi Alfano', 'Richard Tuggle', 'Clint Eastwood, Patrick McGoohan, Roberts Blossom, Jack Thibeau, Fred Ward, Paul Benjamin, Larry Hankin, Bruce M. Fischer', 'PG', 'San Francisco Bay, January 18, 1960. Frank Lee Morris is transferred to Alcatraz, a maximum security prison located on a rocky island. Although no one has ever managed to escape from there, Frank and other inmates begin to carefully prepare an escape plan.', 'San Francisco Bay, January 18, 1960. Frank Lee Morris is transferred to Alcatraz, a maximum security prison located on a rocky island. Although no one has ever managed to escape from there, Frank and other inmates begin to carefully prepare an escape plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uORr2GXQnyqgBOg6tVsRCJD2qxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10734'),
  ('1117725203291093200', 'Escape from Brothel', 1992, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Hung San-Nam, Ray Wong Chi-Wai', 'Jamie Luk Kim-Ming', 'Pauline Chan Bo-Lin, Rena Murakami, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Sophia Crawford, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Stuart Yung Sai-Kit, William Ho', null, 'Hung and Ann are down-on-their luck prostitutes trapped in Hong Kong. Pauline''s boyfriend, Sam, back in China, who is under the impression that she is away working at a factory, is double-crossed by Billy Chow, and while looking to escape, flees for Hong Kong and winds up at the Brothel where Pauline is employed. He is crushed when he finds out the truth, but by this point, everyone involved on all sides is too deeply involved to turn back.', 'Hung and Ann are down-on-their luck prostitutes trapped in Hong Kong. Pauline''s boyfriend, Sam, back in China, who is under the impression that she is away working at a factory, is double-crossed by Billy Chow, and while looking to escape, flees for Hong Kong and winds up at the Brothel where Pauline is employed. He is crushed when he finds out the truth, but by this point, everyone involved on all sides is too deeply involved to turn back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyWZe8VIzQVstU4V9XtmdOUdp7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118465'),
  ('1003177635760837510', 'Escape from Death Block 13', 2021, 'Action', 'Gary Jones', 'Gary Jones', 'Robert Bronzi, Chris Hahn, Debbie Scaletta, Tim Lovelace, Lyindaa Russell, Beau Roberts, Nicholas Turturro, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs', 'NR', 'After the death of his brother, Mick travels to America to seek Justice. Wrongly convicted of extortion and attempted murder, Mick is sent to Pleasant Hill Penitentiary''s notorious death block 13. Seething with revenge after discovering the truth behind his brother''s death, Mick''s rage ignites an explosive riot as he makes a daring escape from Death Block 13.', 'After the death of his brother, Mick travels to America to seek Justice. Wrongly convicted of extortion and attempted murder, Mick is sent to Pleasant Hill Penitentiary''s notorious death block 13. Seething with revenge after discovering the truth behind his brother''s death, Mick''s rage ignites an explosive riot as he makes a daring escape from Death Block 13.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4C0EGz0h7R6ckaVslHROOFFrZry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891910'),
