  ('590496168195716710', 'Escape from East Berlin', 1962, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Siodmak, Georg Krause, Heinz Garbowski', 'Peter Berneis, Millard Lampell, Gabrielle Upton', 'Don Murray, Christine Kaufmann, Werner Klemperer, Ingrid van Bergen, Edith Schultze-Westrum, Bruno Fritz, Maria Tober, Horst Janson', 'NR', 'East Berlin, shortly after the construction of the Berlin Wall. Kurt Schröder and his family dig a tunnel to escape to West Berlin as they struggle to overcome the obstacles blocking their underground path to freedom.', 'East Berlin, shortly after the construction of the Berlin Wall. Kurt Schröder and his family dig a tunnel to escape to West Berlin as they struggle to overcome the obstacles blocking their underground path to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCK0EnrVRxUk7rc4OeyWb9Pc0oQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241944'),
  ('514716914406982097', 'Escape from Fort Bravo', 1953, 'Western', 'John Sturges, Robert Surtees, Arvid Griffen', 'Frank Fenton', 'William Holden, Eleanor Parker, John Forsythe, William Demarest, William Campbell, Polly Bergen, Richard Anderson, Carl Benton Reid', 'NR', 'A Southern belle frees a Rebel officer and his men from a Union captain''s Arizona fort.', 'A Southern belle frees a Rebel officer and his men from a Union captain''s Arizona fort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWOpEeHS7ACISCdKE2k0N12zZyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83099'),
  ('465678049066349439', 'Escape from Galaxy 3', 1981, 'Science Fiction', 'Bitto Albertini, Sandro Mancori', 'John Thomas', 'Sherry Buchanan, Fausto Di Bella, Don Powell, Chris Avram, Margaret Rose Keil, Attilio Dottesio, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Max Turilli', null, 'The crew of a space ship confronts an evil galactic ruler out to rule the universe. Also known as "Escape from Galaxy 3", "Starcrash II" or "Star Crash II" dubbed in English', 'The crew of a space ship confronts an evil galactic ruler out to rule the universe. Also known as "Escape from Galaxy 3", "Starcrash II" or "Star Crash II" dubbed in English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zK0Oi5PDNaUy4J8tfmt8yHUYlzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101652'),
  ('1104813497499961852', 'Escape from Germany', 2024, 'History, Drama, War', 'T.C. Christensen', 'T.C. Christensen', 'Paul Wuthrich, Sebastian Michael Barr, David McConnell, Landon Henneman, Brad Witbeck, Scarlett Hazen, Trystyn Roberts, Kevin Kirschenmann', 'PG', '1939, Hitler''s army was closing borders, and 85 American missionaries were in Germany serving their church. The escape of these missionaries from Nazi Germany is one of the most dramatic events to occur in modern LDS history.', '1939, Hitler''s army was closing borders, and 85 American missionaries were in Germany serving their church. The escape of these missionaries from Nazi Germany is one of the most dramatic events to occur in modern LDS history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ImLwjncbby96zBhPyI2mDRplnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1129508'),
  ('31954610131699773', 'Escape from Hell', 1980, 'Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Edoardo Mulargia, Manuel Mateos', 'Edoardo Mulargia, Sergio Chiusi, Roberto Estévez', 'Anthony Steffen, Ajita Wilson, Cristina Lay, Cintia Lodetti, Luciano Pigozzi, Serafino Profumo, Gilberto Galimberti, Maite Nicote', null, 'A women''s prison camp is located deep in the tropical rain forest. Sadistic guards and a warden from hell make life almost unbearable for the inmates, and any infraction of the rules is dealt with swiftly and savagely. The camp doctor is horrified at what he sees happening, and drinks heavily to push the horror away. Finally the inmates have had had enough, and they enlist the help of the doctor to try and escape.', 'A women''s prison camp is located deep in the tropical rain forest. Sadistic guards and a warden from hell make life almost unbearable for the inmates, and any infraction of the rules is dealt with swiftly and savagely. The camp doctor is horrified at what he sees happening, and drinks heavily to push the horror away. Finally the inmates have had had enough, and they enlist the help of the doctor to try and escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSQr7mS6M6jY02udDWAXVhRKl4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105836'),
  ('140513586544767774', 'Escape from Hell', 2000, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Danny Carrales, James Burgess', 'Michael Martin', 'Daniel Kruse, Emilie Jo Tisdale, Terry Jernigan, Paul Stober, Greg Provance, Lauren Edwards, Bob Lauro, Julie Jenny', null, 'Eric Robinson wants to believe and experience that infinite love and warmth that near-death testimonies claim is on the other side of life. His colleague Marissa is on a crusade to alleviate the fear of death and suffering by proving that Heaven awaits everyone. In a moment of desperation, Eric faces an untimely death and discovers the reality of Hell – a place the Bible portrays – a Hell from which we must all avoid.', 'Eric Robinson wants to believe and experience that infinite love and warmth that near-death testimonies claim is on the other side of life. His colleague Marissa is on a crusade to alleviate the fear of death and suffering by proving that Heaven awaits everyone. In a moment of desperation, Eric faces an untimely death and discovers the reality of Hell – a place the Bible portrays – a Hell from which we must all avoid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srqBVzQbX3TLeKjYzYsXV8YFcFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188032'),
  ('767343634850602707', 'Escape from Kabul', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Jamie Roberts', null, null, 'R', 'Unfolding over 18 monumental days in August 2021, this deeply immersive and emotional documentary combines never-before-seen archival footage from those on the ground at the airport with exclusive interviews with people who were there throughout the period, including Afghan citizens attempting to flee, U.S. Marines tasked with managing the evacuation, and Taliban commanders and fighters who had recently taken the city.', 'Unfolding over 18 monumental days in August 2021, this deeply immersive and emotional documentary combines never-before-seen archival footage from those on the ground at the airport with exclusive interviews with people who were there throughout the period, including Afghan citizens attempting to flee, U.S. Marines tasked with managing the evacuation, and Taliban commanders and fighters who had recently taken the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93lfqZPBSyZnRdQQOEAxyOCRe3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013258'),
  ('49285301377764291', 'Escape from L.A.', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure', 'Gary B. Kibbe, John Carpenter, Marty Jedlicka', 'John Carpenter, Debra Hill, Kurt Russell', 'Kurt Russell, Stacy Keach, Steve Buscemi, A. J. Langer, Bruce Campbell, Pam Grier, Peter Fonda, Georges Corraface', 'R', 'Into the 9.6-quaked Los Angeles of 2013 comes Snake Plissken. His job: wade through L.A.''s ruined landmarks to retrieve a doomsday device.', 'Into the 9.6-quaked Los Angeles of 2013 comes Snake Plissken. His job: wade through L.A.''s ruined landmarks to retrieve a doomsday device.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3L9lL2eUsmLNNfENPwNOc82Hzpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10061'),
