  ('1117349275205698036', 'Escape from Sobibor', 1987, 'Drama, Thriller, War, TV Movie', 'Jack Gold, Ernest Vincze', 'Reginald Rose', 'Alan Arkin, Joanna Pacula, Rutger Hauer, Hartmut Becker, Jack Shepherd, Emil Wolk, Simon Gregor, Linal Haft', null, 'The true story of WWII''s notorious Sobibor Nazi death camp, where a courageous inmate orchestrates and leads the escape of over 300 prisoners.', 'The true story of WWII''s notorious Sobibor Nazi death camp, where a courageous inmate orchestrates and leads the escape of over 300 prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3IGS3gAecPB5dNeQH4926S9PSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25318'),
  ('285596791698730186', 'Escape from the 21st Century', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Action', 'Li Yang, Saba Mazloum, Xiaozhu Long', 'Li Yang', 'Zhang Ruoyun, Zhong Chuxi, Song Yang, Wu Xiaoliang, Zhu Yanmanzi, Leon Lee, Wen Zhengrong, Shi Liang', null, 'Three friends discover that they have the power to travel back and forth 20 years with a sneeze. However, the future is not as good as they hope, and they need to take on the responsibility of saving the world.', 'Three friends discover that they have the power to travel back and forth 20 years with a sneeze. However, the future is not as good as they hope, and they need to take on the responsibility of saving the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jgXcjisegB0XBzIvIiKo0aLFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242372'),
  ('795303752834632920', 'Escape from the Bronx', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Francesco De Masi, Giuseppe Giglietti', 'Tito Carpi, Enzo G. Castellari', 'Mark Gregory, Henry Silva, Valeria D''Obici, Giancarlo Prete, Paolo Malco, Ennio Girolami, Antonio Sabàto, Alessandro Prete', 'R', 'A ragtag group of people have to fight extermination squads amid their ruined city.', 'A ragtag group of people have to fight extermination squads amid their ruined city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCAP4uwtJ51mehSxz0L580u2XLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69152'),
  ('786659994649752499', 'Escape from the Liberty Cinema', 1990, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jerzy Zieliński, Wiesława Gościk, Tadeusz Proć', 'Wojciech Marczewski', 'Janusz Gajos, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Teresa Marczewska, Piotr Fronczewski, Władysław Kowalski, Michał Bajor, Jan Peszek, Jerzy Bińczycki', null, 'The screening of a movie "Daybreak" at the "Liberty" Cinema is interrupted by an unusual event - actors come to life on the screen, start conversations among themselves, draw the audience into them. Crowds gather around the cinema, the relevant authorities and services wonder what to do in this complicated situation. Also arriving is the censor, a man reaching his fifties, a one-time literary critic and journalist. The line between fiction and reality begins to blur.', 'The screening of a movie "Daybreak" at the "Liberty" Cinema is interrupted by an unusual event - actors come to life on the screen, start conversations among themselves, draw the audience into them. Crowds gather around the cinema, the relevant authorities and services wonder what to do in this complicated situation. Also arriving is the censor, a man reaching his fifties, a one-time literary critic and journalist. The line between fiction and reality begins to blur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzZIr3zw3yWTgz5OjFCDwnw4oeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176032'),
  ('1114093355498695358', 'Escape from the Outland', 2025, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Shen Ao, Rui Zhong, Yao Xingxing', 'Shen Ao, Xu Luyang', 'Xiao Yang, Qi Xi, Simon Yam, Ryan Zheng, Pan Binlong, Fathi Anouar Ghammam, Zhou Le, David Yan', null, 'The couple of Ma Xiao, a foreign correspondent, and Pan Wenjia, a volunteer doctor, accompanied engineer Miao Feng on a trip to the suburbs to repair a base station. During the trip, the local situation suddenly changed and the three were kidnapped by an extremist organisation. While in prison, they met Zhou Weijie, an overseas Chinese businessman. In order to find a chance of survival, they embarked on a journey of escape in the midst of barbaric warfare and chaos.', 'The couple of Ma Xiao, a foreign correspondent, and Pan Wenjia, a volunteer doctor, accompanied engineer Miao Feng on a trip to the suburbs to repair a base station. During the trip, the local situation suddenly changed and the three were kidnapped by an extremist organisation. While in prison, they met Zhou Weijie, an overseas Chinese businessman. In order to find a chance of survival, they embarked on a journey of escape in the midst of barbaric warfare and chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hlydT6jWkKjSpqStjkunMRCEg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1325866'),
  ('173241450958560394', 'Escape from the Planet of the Apes', 1971, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Joseph F. Biroc, Don Taylor', 'Paul Dehn', 'Roddy McDowall, Kim Hunter, Bradford Dillman, Natalie Trundy, Eric Braeden, William Windom, Sal Mineo, Albert Salmi', 'G', 'The world is shocked by the appearance of three talking chimpanzees, who arrived mysteriously in a spacecraft. Intrigued by their intelligence, humans use them for research - until the apes attempt to escape.', 'The world is shocked by the appearance of three talking chimpanzees, who arrived mysteriously in a spacecraft. Intrigued by their intelligence, humans use them for research - until the apes attempt to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnbLVdUEroTfHTUVAJCxkL4R0IH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1687'),
  ('311378595217684004', 'Escape from Tomorrow', 2013, 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lucas Lee Graham, Randy Moore, Lee Andrews', 'Randy Moore', 'Roy Abramsohn, Elena Schuber, Katelynn Rodriguez, Jack Dalton, Danielle Safady, Annet Mahendru, Lee Armstrong, Kimberly Ables Jindra', 'NR', 'In a world of fake castles and anthropomorphic rodents, an epic battle begins when an unemployed father''s sanity is challenged by a chance encounter with two underage girls on holiday.', 'In a world of fake castles and anthropomorphic rodents, an epic battle begins when an unemployed father''s sanity is challenged by a chance encounter with two underage girls on holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3qZofBWiLauJviv27f8zpEFbki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158752'),
  ('625380957070911894', 'Escape from Women''s Prison', 1978, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Sebastiano Celeste, Donatella Botti, Giovanni Brusadori', 'George Eastman, Giovanni Brusadori', 'Lilli Carati, Ines Pellegrini, Marina Daunia, Zora Kerova, Dirce Funari, Filippo De Gara, Ada Pometti, Artemia Terenziani', null, 'Four female convicts break out of prison, and during their escape they take hostage a bus full of young female tennis players. They drive the bus to the house of the judge who originally sent them to prison, where--since this is after all a women-in-prison picture--the hostages undergo various forms of physical and sexual abuse in various degrees of nudity.', 'Four female convicts break out of prison, and during their escape they take hostage a bus full of young female tennis players. They drive the bus to the house of the judge who originally sent them to prison, where--since this is after all a women-in-prison picture--the hostages undergo various forms of physical and sexual abuse in various degrees of nudity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qY5HlWlTcERVLZ1v42BiNaxiBm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40135'),
  ('985776666819079479', 'Escape from Zahrain', 1962, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Ronald Neame, Tom Connors Jr., Irmin Roberts', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Yul Brynner, Madlyn Rhue, Sal Mineo, Jack Warden, James Mason, Anthony Caruso, Jay Novello, Leonard Strong', null, 'Yul Brynner plays political leader Sharif who is sprung from a police van on his way to a firing squad by young loyalists led by Sal Mineo. Yul and the other prisoners kidnap an ambulance and head into the Arabian desert with the police in hot pursuit. All the performances are magnificent: Sal Mineo showing his acting talents, Jack Warden in a wiseguy performance as an employee of Zahrain oil who was involved in embezzlement, Anthony Caruso as a slimy psychotic and the underrated Madlyn Rhue as a nurse who becomes emotionally involved in the proceedings.', 'Yul Brynner plays political leader Sharif who is sprung from a police van on his way to a firing squad by young loyalists led by Sal Mineo. Yul and the other prisoners kidnap an ambulance and head into the Arabian desert with the police in hot pursuit. All the performances are magnificent: Sal Mineo showing his acting talents, Jack Warden in a wiseguy performance as an employee of Zahrain oil who was involved in embezzlement, Anthony Caruso as a slimy psychotic and the underrated Madlyn Rhue as a nurse who becomes emotionally involved in the proceedings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIKJrNPoKBeCYX8qqPh8qGxb3fX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118300'),
  ('937735536146273271', 'Escape in the Fog', 1945, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Budd Boetticher, George Meehan', 'Aubrey Wisberg', 'Otto Kruger, Nina Foch, William Wright, Konstantin Shayne, Ivan Triesault, Ernie Adams, Jessie Arnold, Chin Kuang Chow', 'NR', 'A military nurse recovering at an inn from a nervous breakdown keeps having dreams where she sees two men trying to murder a third. When she meets a man who is a federal agent at the inn, she is astounded to discover that he is the man in her dream who is the intended murder victim.', 'A military nurse recovering at an inn from a nervous breakdown keeps having dreams where she sees two men trying to murder a third. When she meets a man who is a federal agent at the inn, she is astounded to discover that he is the man in her dream who is the intended murder victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81h4vZJNQPhisVOmZ48uA44pIiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30102'),
  ('426666669600344516', 'Escape Me Never', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Godfrey, Sol Polito, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Thames Williamson', 'Errol Flynn, Ida Lupino, Eleanor Parker, Gig Young, Reginald Denny, Isobel Elsom, Albert Bassermann, Ludwig Stössel', 'NR', 'A penniless composer marries a young widow with a baby—even though he is in love with his brother''s fiancée.', 'A penniless composer marries a young widow with a baby—even though he is in love with his brother''s fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsDrG4IVckZrfB7LtYUOGUF0rXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107874'),
  ('139894912088650688', 'Escape of Shark', 2021, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Hang Zhu', null, 'Xu Dongdong, Zhang Xinyuan, Ziwen Zhang, Liu Qianyu, Zhuang Qiqian, Su Shenghua, Wang Xiaolong, Marina Maloy', null, 'An island resort with stunning scenery is struck by a sudden tsunami, and along with it, a giant shark! The shark and the frightened tourists are about to face each other in a duel to the death!', 'An island resort with stunning scenery is struck by a sudden tsunami, and along with it, a giant shark! The shark and the frightened tourists are about to face each other in a duel to the death!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYjFb4S1utHbXqUkhZEPDex4DI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862565'),
  ('762771278175772155', 'Escape Plan', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Douglas Plasse, Nick Satriano, Mikael Håfström', 'Jason Keller', 'Sylvester Stallone, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Jim Caviezel, 50 Cent, Sam Neill, Vinnie Jones, Faran Tahir, Vincent D''Onofrio', 'R', 'Ray Breslin is the world''s foremost authority on structural security. After analyzing every high security prison and learning a vast array of survival skills so he can design escape-proof prisons, his skills are put to the test. He''s framed and incarcerated in a master prison he designed himself. He needs to escape and find the person who put him behind bars.', 'Ray Breslin is the world''s foremost authority on structural security. After analyzing every high security prison and learning a vast array of survival skills so he can design escape-proof prisons, his skills are put to the test. He''s framed and incarcerated in a master prison he designed himself. He needs to escape and find the person who put him behind bars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOZPLflxDqKogu9v9hYw3lolxGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107846'),
  ('239355502112126881', 'Escape Plan 2: Hades', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Steven C. Miller, Brandon Cox, Jonathan Southard', null, 'Sylvester Stallone, Dave Bautista, Jesse Metcalfe, 50 Cent, Huang Xiaoming, Wes Chatham, Titus Welliver, Tyron Woodley', 'R', 'Ray Breslin manages an elite team of security specialists trained in the art of breaking people out of the world''s most impenetrable prisons. When his most trusted operative, Shu Ren, is kidnapped and disappears inside the most elaborate prison ever built, Ray must track him down with the help of some of his former friends.', 'Ray Breslin manages an elite team of security specialists trained in the art of breaking people out of the world''s most impenetrable prisons. When his most trusted operative, Shu Ren, is kidnapped and disappears inside the most elaborate prison ever built, Ray must track him down with the help of some of his former friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6tb8JNrie2qT8JC2tGqshayuck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440471'),
  ('1031815419007208210', 'Escape Plan: The Extractors', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Herzfeld, Angela Boehm, Jacques Jouffret', 'John Herzfeld', 'Sylvester Stallone, Dave Bautista, 50 Cent, Max Zhang, Harry Shum Jr., Devon Sawa, Jaime King, Lydia Hull', 'R', 'After security expert Ray Breslin is hired to rescue the kidnapped daughter of a Hong Kong tech mogul from a formidable Latvian prison, Breslin''s girlfriend is also captured. Now he and his team must pull off a deadly rescue mission to confront their sadistic foe and save the hostages before time runs out.', 'After security expert Ray Breslin is hired to rescue the kidnapped daughter of a Hong Kong tech mogul from a formidable Latvian prison, Breslin''s girlfriend is also captured. Now he and his team must pull off a deadly rescue mission to confront their sadistic foe and save the hostages before time runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qVzb6qDdh5ni76bLAPHAZDNHv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480042'),
  ('995022622868297571', 'Escape Room', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Pierluigi Malavasi, Peter Dukes', 'Peter Dukes', 'Skeet Ulrich, Sean Young, Christine Donlon, Randy Wayne, Matt McVay, Ashley Gallegos, Hayley Goldstein, Iyad Hajjaj', null, 'Four friends who partake in a popular Los Angeles escape room find themselves stuck with a demonically possessed killer. They have less than an hour to solve the puzzles needed to escape the room alive.', 'Four friends who partake in a popular Los Angeles escape room find themselves stuck with a demonically possessed killer. They have less than an hour to solve the puzzles needed to escape the room alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCthgwsV0AXIMqliQL6njAWf7Sb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431259'),
  ('68591366751718386', 'Escape Room', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adam Robitel, Marc Spicer, Robyn Glaser', 'Bragi F. Schut, Maria Melnik', 'Taylor Russell, Logan Miller, Jay Ellis, Deborah Ann Woll, Nik Dodani, Tyler Labine, Yorick van Wageningen, Cornelius Geaney Jr.', 'PG-13', 'Six strangers find themselves in circumstances beyond their control, and must use their wits to survive.', 'Six strangers find themselves in circumstances beyond their control, and must use their wits to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ls1tZ6qjGzfGHjBB7ihOnf7f0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522681'),
  ('913494356737259622', 'Escape Room: La pel·lícula', 2022, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Héctor Claramunt', 'Joel Joan, Héctor Claramunt', 'Joel Joan, Paula Vives, Ivan Massagué, Mònica Pérez, Ferran Carvajal, Jordi Boixaderas', null, 'Four friends. One room. Many secrets. And only one way out: the truth. The season''s most hilarious comedy turns the tables on two couples set to have a great night in an escape room. If they want to escape this unpredictable and crazy game, they''ll have to put their friendship to the test. The moment of truth has arrived for them.', 'Four friends. One room. Many secrets. And only one way out: the truth. The season''s most hilarious comedy turns the tables on two couples set to have a great night in an escape room. If they want to escape this unpredictable and crazy game, they''ll have to put their friendship to the test. The moment of truth has arrived for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xneqfHjr8Vo8tTwWLvuqwdgr7e0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:855433'),
  ('1056468688533127505', 'Escape Room: Tournament of Champions', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'George Amos, Mark Walker, Marc Spicer', 'Maria Melnik, Daniel Tuch, Will Honley', 'Taylor Russell, Logan Miller, Indya Moore, Holland Roden, Thomas Cocquerel, Carlito Olivero, James Frain, Isabelle Fuhrman', 'PG-13', 'Six people unwittingly find themselves locked in another series of escape rooms, slowly uncovering what they have in common to survive... and discovering they''ve all played the games before.', 'Six people unwittingly find themselves locked in another series of escape rooms, slowly uncovering what they have in common to survive... and discovering they''ve all played the games before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGYJyPzVgrVV2bgClI9uvEZgVLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585216'),
  ('360781974418979528', 'Escape the Field', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Stephen Chandler Whitehead, Emerson Moore', 'Joshua Dobkin, Sean Wathen, Emerson Moore', 'Jordan Claire Robbins, Theo Rossi, Tahirah Sharif, Shane West, Elena Juatco, Julian Feder, Dillon Jagersky, Nicole Kawalez', 'R', 'Six strangers suddenly awaken in a remote, endless cornfield. Stripped of their possessions, they are left with only six items: a gun with a single bullet, matches, a lantern, a knife, a compass, and a flask of water. As mysterious sirens blare in the distance and traps appear at every turn, the group realizes it’s been plunged into a cat-and-mouse game with an unseen evil, and survival depends upon solving a diabolical and deadly puzzle.', 'Six strangers suddenly awaken in a remote, endless cornfield. Stripped of their possessions, they are left with only six items: a gun with a single bullet, matches, a lantern, a knife, a compass, and a flask of water. As mysterious sirens blare in the distance and traps appear at every turn, the group realizes it’s been plunged into a cat-and-mouse game with an unseen evil, and survival depends upon solving a diabolical and deadly puzzle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qDumKWwi3YZacMI9u2UoPHWVDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739643'),
  ('63786439744333723', 'Escape the Undertaker', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Family', 'Ben Simms', null, 'Mark Calaway, Kofi Sarkodie-Mensah, Austin Watson, Ettore Ewen', null, 'The Undertaker has set a trap for the decorated tag team The New Day at his mansion. What they don''t know: The Undertaker''s mansion is an extreme Haunted House, packed to the brim with supernatural challenges. It''s up to viewers to decide the fate of these poor souls trying to survive the wrath of The Undertaker.', 'The Undertaker has set a trap for the decorated tag team The New Day at his mansion. What they don''t know: The Undertaker''s mansion is an extreme Haunted House, packed to the brim with supernatural challenges. It''s up to viewers to decide the fate of these poor souls trying to survive the wrath of The Undertaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSF7INctoCQ4iPFRiRkZjIQIIVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:871875'),
  ('951508154944838615', 'Escape to Athena', 1979, 'Adventure, Comedy, War', 'George P. Cosmatos, John Graysmark, Derek Cracknell', 'Richard S. Lochte, Edward Anhalt', 'Roger Moore, Telly Savalas, David Niven, Stefanie Powers, Claudia Cardinale, Richard Roundtree, Sonny Bono, Elliott Gould', 'PG', 'During the World War II, the prisoners of a German camp in a Greek island are trying to escape. They not only want their freedom, but also seek an ineffable treasure hidden in a monastery at the summit of the island''s mountain.', 'During the World War II, the prisoners of a German camp in a Greek island are trying to escape. They not only want their freedom, but also seek an ineffable treasure hidden in a monastery at the summit of the island''s mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4SeQMQnc2eIpQgDTnLRNg0d6iR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28981'),
  ('459255981900074253', 'Escape to Berlin', 1961, 'Drama', 'Will Tremper', 'Will Tremper', 'Christian Doermer, Susanne Korda, Narziß Sokatscheff, Gerda Blisse, Ralf Gregan, Karl Meixner', null, 'A farmer from Eastern Germany decides to flee to West Germany.', 'A farmer from Eastern Germany decides to flee to West Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lTFEOoDgbftAsYPp6pg11rrAej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343012'),
  ('373321761217815577', 'Escape to Victory', 1981, 'Drama, War', 'John Huston, Gerry Fisher, Elie Cohn', 'Evan Jones, Yabo Yablonsky', 'Sylvester Stallone, Michael Caine, Max von Sydow, Pelé, Carole Laure, Bobby Moore, Osvaldo Ardiles, Paul Van Himst', 'PG-13', 'A group of POWs in a German prison camp during World War II play the German National Soccer Team in this powerful film depicting the role of prisoners during wartime.', 'A group of POWs in a German prison camp during World War II play the German National Soccer Team in this powerful film depicting the role of prisoners during wartime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3j6H0dnbvjNXLK1l9nKguXw5vvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17360'),
  ('557004028889342674', 'Escape to Witch Mountain', 1975, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'John Hough, Frank V. Phillips', 'Robert M. Young', 'Eddie Albert, Ray Milland, Donald Pleasence, Kim Richards, Ike Eisenmann, Walter Barnes, Reta Shaw, Denver Pyle', 'G', 'Tia and Tony are two orphaned youngsters with extraordinary powers. Lucas Deranian poses as their uncle in order to get the kids into the clutches of Deranian''s megalomaniacal boss, evil millionaire Aristotle Bolt, who wants to exploit them. Jason, a cynical widower, helps Tia and Tony escape to witch mountain, while at the same time Tia and Tony help Jason escape the pain of the loss of his wife.', 'Tia and Tony are two orphaned youngsters with extraordinary powers. Lucas Deranian poses as their uncle in order to get the kids into the clutches of Deranian''s megalomaniacal boss, evil millionaire Aristotle Bolt, who wants to exploit them. Jason, a cynical widower, helps Tia and Tony escape to witch mountain, while at the same time Tia and Tony help Jason escape the pain of the loss of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXicoCiCfO6FDfv6ozwcfQCnhVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14821'),
  ('121451351877707983', 'Escape to Witch Mountain', 1995, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Peter Rader, Russ T. Alsobrook', 'Peter Rader, Robert M. Young', 'Robert Vaughn, Elisabeth Moss, Erik von Detten, Sam Horrigan, Lynne Moody, Perrey Reeves, Lauren Tom, Vincent Schiavelli', 'PG', 'The tale of two orphan twins with special powers who go looking for their origins. The two are hindered by an avaricious tycoon who only wants to exploit their abilities.', 'The tale of two orphan twins with special powers who go looking for their origins. The two are hindered by an avaricious tycoon who only wants to exploit their abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe1VE1Sxhwar4lS5mtkA2Y7ygRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239033'),
  ('132254633737023367', 'Escape: Puzzle of Fear', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror', 'J. Jones, Brian Vilim', 'Lizze Gordon', 'Tommy Nash, Aubrey Reynolds, Omar Gooding, Naina Michaud, Nicholas Turturro, Keila Dolle', null, 'Hot-shot Hollywood agent Matthew Blake has a dark past. He thinks that he is on his way to a double date with his oldest friend to a new Escape Room in Los Angeles. When the couples are locked into the Escape Room, Matthew quickly finds himself at the center of a revenge plot meant to right the wrongs of his past, with deadly results.', 'Hot-shot Hollywood agent Matthew Blake has a dark past. He thinks that he is on his way to a double date with his oldest friend to a new Escape Room in Los Angeles. When the couples are locked into the Escape Room, Matthew quickly finds himself at the center of a revenge plot meant to right the wrongs of his past, with deadly results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4VVr6QRTBIv0j9uvylxnMZP6Lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726217'),
  ('1074883961578086080', 'Escapee', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Campion Murphy, Neil Cervin, Stanton Barrett', 'Campion Murphy', 'Christine Evangelista, Dominic Purcell, Scott Elrod, Carly Chaikin, Faith Ford, Melissa Ordway, Kadeem Hardison, Danny Nucci', 'R', 'While on a class observation trip at a local mental hospital, young psychology major Abby Jones, has a chilling encounter with high-risk patient, Harmon Porter. She returns home for an evening of normal study with her two roommates unaware of the darkness she’s awakened within him.', 'While on a class observation trip at a local mental hospital, young psychology major Abby Jones, has a chilling encounter with high-risk patient, Harmon Porter. She returns home for an evening of normal study with her two roommates unaware of the darkness she’s awakened within him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4L6rmQJ1K0MGB58hnJkmbC1cdlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77677'),
  ('785051090134561325', 'Escaping Tel Aviv', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Sherif Arafa, Mahmoud Badawi, Ayman Abu El Makarem', 'Amro Samir Atef', 'Karim Abdel Aziz, Mona Zaki, Sherif Mounir, Eman, Kinda Alloush, Mohamed Tharwat, Yasser Ali Maher, Gamil Barsoum', null, 'A seemingly ordinary life is shattered when a woman uncovers a hidden truth about her husband, plunging her into a high-stakes international conflict. As loyalties blur and danger escalates, an Egyptian intelligence officer is tasked with a critical mission where failure is not an option.', 'A seemingly ordinary life is shattered when a woman uncovers a hidden truth about her husband, plunging her into a high-stakes international conflict. As loyalties blur and danger escalates, an Egyptian intelligence officer is tasked with a critical mission where failure is not an option.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxmbaArDd8zHovKbc8s4Cvqx6y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56084'),
  ('579373104265013405', 'Escaping the Madhouse: The Nellie Bly Story', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Karen Moncrieff, Luc Montpellier', 'Helen Childress', 'Christina Ricci, Judith Light, Joshua Bowman, Anja Savcic, Nikki Duval, Lauren Cochrane, Johise Namwira, Kathleen Gallagher', null, 'An investigative reporter Nellie Bly, who’s on a mission to expose the deplorable conditions and mistreatment of patients at the notorious Women’s Lunatic Asylum, and feigns mental illness in order to be institutionalized to report from the inside. The movie is an account of actual events surrounding Nellie’s stay beginning after she has undergone treatment, leaving her with no recollection of how she came to the asylum or her real identity.', 'An investigative reporter Nellie Bly, who’s on a mission to expose the deplorable conditions and mistreatment of patients at the notorious Women’s Lunatic Asylum, and feigns mental illness in order to be institutionalized to report from the inside. The movie is an account of actual events surrounding Nellie’s stay beginning after she has undergone treatment, leaving her with no recollection of how she came to the asylum or her real identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9LRcrTDtc9Vehv6wC0iuA4CiMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522892'),
  ('1086324208061694444', 'Esclava del deseo', 1968, 'Drama', 'Emilio Gómez Muriel', 'Alfredo Ruanova', 'Libertad Leblanc, Manuel López Ochoa, Carlos East, Wolf Ruvinskis, Juan Ferrara, Héctor Andremar, Al Greenfield, César del Campo', null, 'Criminals hiding out on an island find a shipwrecked stranger.', 'Criminals hiding out on an island find a shipwrecked stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNCFuELXFrZ9M2tWdJuni5zoYAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370372'),
  ('327900469082834967', 'Escobar: Paradise Lost', 2014, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Andrea Di Stefano, Luis David Sansans, Thibaut Josserand', 'Andrea Di Stefano', 'Benicio del Toro, Josh Hutcherson, Brady Corbet, Claudia Traisac, Carlos Bardem, Ana Girardot, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Laura Londoño', 'PG-13', 'For Pablo Escobar family is everything. When young surfer Nick falls for Escobar''s niece, Maria, he finds his life on the line when he''s pulled into the dangerous world of the family business.', 'For Pablo Escobar family is everything. When young surfer Nick falls for Escobar''s niece, Maria, he finds his life on the line when he''s pulled into the dangerous world of the family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HngNLzCmUYCPB8FbxSZWN0eDKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255343'),
