  ('6558741192824855', 'Escort Girl', 1941, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Greenhalgh, Edward Kaye', 'David Halperin, Ann Halperin', 'Betty Compson, Margaret Marquis, Robert Kellard, Wheeler Oakman, Guy Kingsford, Isabel La Mal, Arthur Housman, Rick Vallin', 'NR', 'A pair of nightclub owners run a string of escort bureaus where men pay for the "companionship" of young women. The district attorney sends an undercover agent to infiltrate the bureaus.', 'A pair of nightclub owners run a string of escort bureaus where men pay for the "companionship" of young women. The district attorney sends an undercover agent to infiltrate the bureaus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30ne4lBLdZ0u4Ie0dKYRIXXmavy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213529'),
  ('424650012068314602', 'Escort in Love', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Roberto Forza', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Edoardo Falcone', 'Paola Cortellesi, Raoul Bova, Rocco Papaleo, Valerio Aprea, Anna Foglietta, Caterina Guzzanti, Massimiliano Bruno, Giovanni Bruno', null, '35-year-old Alice has a husband and a son. Her life seems a beautiful dream, but it soon turns out to be a nightmare. Her husband dies in a car accident and her lawyer tells her that she is on her uppers. The only way she has to earn money in a short time is by resorting to the oldest job in history.', '35-year-old Alice has a husband and a son. Her life seems a beautiful dream, but it soon turns out to be a nightmare. Her husband dies in a car accident and her lawyer tells her that she is on her uppers. The only way she has to earn money in a short time is by resorting to the oldest job in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/626jMahE21C1M04EFDq3dQmSQvb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59570'),
  ('198750543316394034', 'Escort West', 1959, 'Action, Western', 'Francis D. Lyon, William H. Clothier', 'Fred Hartsook, Leo Gordon', 'Victor Mature, Elaine Stewart, Faith Domergue, Reba Waters, Noah Beery Jr., Leo Gordon, Harry Carey, Jr., Slim Pickens', 'NR', 'Seeking a new place to call home, former Confederate soldier Ben Lassiter (Victor Mature) and his daughter meet Beth (Elaine Stewart), whose fiancé is a Union soldier. Lassiter falls for Beth, and when Indians attack, they head to a cavalry camp where Lassiter must battle the Indians as well as Beth''s fiancé.', 'Seeking a new place to call home, former Confederate soldier Ben Lassiter (Victor Mature) and his daughter meet Beth (Elaine Stewart), whose fiancé is a Union soldier. Lassiter falls for Beth, and when Indians attack, they head to a cavalry camp where Lassiter must battle the Indians as well as Beth''s fiancé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4UCjxnd6njgJEIpe0IdFta8VDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66888'),
