  ('1051767677645399112', 'Esteros', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Papu Curotto', 'Andi Nachon', 'Ignacio Rogers, Esteban Masturini, Joaquín Parada, Blas Finardi Niz, Renata Calmon, María Merlino, Marcelo Subiotto, Pablo Cura', null, 'Childhood friends Matías and Jerónimo reach adolescence and experience sexual attraction to each other, before being separated by circumstances. Later, as young adults, they meet again, and the film follows themes of complicated relationships and sexual tensions, as well as issues of homophobia.', 'Childhood friends Matías and Jerónimo reach adolescence and experience sexual attraction to each other, before being separated by circumstances. Later, as young adults, they meet again, and the film follows themes of complicated relationships and sexual tensions, as well as issues of homophobia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmFfVRBD4MHfH3gK5CoZvcvS5h7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418718'),
