  ('528278732103283538', 'Eternal', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Wilhelm Liebenberg, Federico Sánchez, Jamie Thompson', 'Wilhelm Liebenberg, Federico Sánchez', 'Conrad Pla, Caroline Néron, Victoria Sanchez, Nick Baillie, Ilona Elkin, Sarah Manninen, Liane Balaban, Arthur Holden', 'R', 'Detective Raymond Pope is a detective of questionable morals, searching for his missing wife. His investigation leads him to the wealthy estate of the enigmatic Elizabeth Kane and her young maid Irina. Under Elizabeth''s fascinating looks and aristocratic manners hides a terrifying secret,shared by her companion Irina. As Detective Pope finds himself perversely drawn to the powerful Elizabeth, bodies begin to surface, his inquiries only deepening the mystery surrounding Elizabeth''s past. Pope''s obsession grows so intense that he completely fails to anticipate Elizabeth''s reaction to his intrusion into her dark world, a fatal mistake that might cost him his life and the lives of those close to him.', 'Detective Raymond Pope is a detective of questionable morals, searching for his missing wife. His investigation leads him to the wealthy estate of the enigmatic Elizabeth Kane and her young maid Irina. Under Elizabeth''s fascinating looks and aristocratic manners hides a terrifying secret,shared by her companion Irina. As Detective Pope finds himself perversely drawn to the powerful Elizabeth, bodies begin to surface, his inquiries only deepening the mystery surrounding Elizabeth''s past. Pope''s obsession grows so intense that he completely fails to anticipate Elizabeth''s reaction to his intrusion into her dark world, a fatal mistake that might cost him his life and the lives of those close to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jhHwF0sMoi8fcmiZh1TAFfG7vF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30767'),
  ('168046929031000695', 'Eternal', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Romance', 'Jacob Møller, Ulaa Salim', 'Ulaa Salim', 'Simon Sears, Nanna Øland Fabricius, Viktor Hjelmsøe, Anna Søgaard Frandsen, Magnus Krepper, Halldóra Geirharðsdóttir, Oscar Langer Carlsen, Iselin Shumba Skjævesland', 'NR', 'Young climate change scientist, Elias falls in love with an aspiring singer, Anita. But when an opportunity arises for him to join a mission researching a dangerous climate change phenomenon – a mysterious fracture on the ocean floor – he chooses career over love. Years later, during his mission, he experiences a vision of what his life could have been like if he made a different choice and his new obsession becomes to get his old life and love back.', 'Young climate change scientist, Elias falls in love with an aspiring singer, Anita. But when an opportunity arises for him to join a mission researching a dangerous climate change phenomenon – a mysterious fracture on the ocean floor – he chooses career over love. Years later, during his mission, he experiences a vision of what his life could have been like if he made a different choice and his new obsession becomes to get his old life and love back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmXAytaq3vSX00fjEbGL9W35M6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053927'),
  ('941505151551008316', 'Eternal 831', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Kenji Kamiyama, Hiroki Matsuura', 'Kenji Kamiyama', 'Soma Saito, Mao Ichimichi, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Yoko Hikasa, Akio Otsuka, Takatsugu Awazu, Takayuki Kondo, Ryota Iwasaki', null, 'In the present day, the world is in turmoil due to an "unprecedented disaster." A young man living in Tokyo, Suzushirō, has a secret he cannot tell anyone. That secret is that he can stop the time around him despite his thoughts. One day, he meets a girl named Nazuna who has the same "power". When he learns that she is being used in a crime, he impulsively reaches out to help her.', 'In the present day, the world is in turmoil due to an "unprecedented disaster." A young man living in Tokyo, Suzushirō, has a secret he cannot tell anyone. That secret is that he can stop the time around him despite his thoughts. One day, he meets a girl named Nazuna who has the same "power". When he learns that she is being used in a crime, he impulsively reaches out to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dlrpSf3q1GAgBUOjnemHP06QHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857756'),
  ('781741578518441999', 'Eternal Beauty', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Craig Roberts, Kit Fraser, Karen Lindsay-Stewart', 'Craig Roberts', 'Sally Hawkins, David Thewlis, Alice Lowe, Billie Piper, Penelope Wilton, Robert Pugh, Banita Sandhu, Paul Hilton', 'R', 'When Jane is rejected by life, she spirals into a chaotic, schizophrenic world where love and normality collide with humorous consequences.', 'When Jane is rejected by life, she spirals into a chaotic, schizophrenic world where love and normality collide with humorous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wXrBtfrvwMWE1i3iHjKjoRZjYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501953'),
  ('855868629661287381', 'Eternal Beloved', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Yu Feihong', 'Yu Feihong', 'Duan Yihong, Li Jia, Yu Feihong, Yao Lu, Tu Songyan, 姬勇强, 王永成, 陳玉彪', null, 'A Jiu and A Ming, two lovers from two enemy families make a pledge to continue their forbidden love in their next life. A Jiu quickly gets reborn but her lover misses his own chance and becomes a homeless ghost. 50 years later, right before A Ming’s next change for rebirth, A Jiu finally shows up. She has become a happily married housewife and has no memory of her previous life…', 'A Jiu and A Ming, two lovers from two enemy families make a pledge to continue their forbidden love in their next life. A Jiu quickly gets reborn but her lover misses his own chance and becomes a homeless ghost. 50 years later, right before A Ming’s next change for rebirth, A Jiu finally shows up. She has become a happily married housewife and has no memory of her previous life…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3Jjc0zMZNSOJcdJRFVdzMFAgVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44788'),
  ('431334762013645348', 'Eternal Blood', 2002, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Jorge Olguín, José Luis Arredondo, Amparo Baeza', 'Carolina García, Jorge Olguín', 'Blanca Lewin, Juan Pablo Ogalde, Patricia López, Carlos Borquez, Claudio Espinoza, Yerko Farías, Ximena Huilipan, Jorge Denegri', 'R', 'Carmila is introduced by ''M'' to a sinister role-playing game called "Eternal Blood". Once settled in an abandoned house, the group meets Dahmer, a young man who practices vampirism rites and who begins to influence young people, or perhaps... turn them into vampires.', 'Carmila is introduced by ''M'' to a sinister role-playing game called "Eternal Blood". Once settled in an abandoned house, the group meets Dahmer, a young man who practices vampirism rites and who begins to influence young people, or perhaps... turn them into vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oX5pBME2LlpU6zlHnU9qcj0FFkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101604'),
  ('76971009947886419', 'Eternal Evil', 1985, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Paul Van der Linden, George Mihalka', 'Robert Geoffrion', 'Winston Rekert, Karen Black, John Novak, Patty Talbot, Vlasta Vrana, Andrew Bednarski, Bronwen Booth, Tom Rack', null, 'A dissatisfied Montreal director of TV commercials is taught to astrally project himself by a mysterious woman. But soon he finds that he does it against his will when he sleeps, and while he does it, he commits savage acts against those in his life.', 'A dissatisfied Montreal director of TV commercials is taught to astrally project himself by a mysterious woman. But soon he finds that he does it against his will when he sleeps, and while he does it, he commits savage acts against those in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LXztLyKypCDr8Y4iRQSFizJH6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87110'),
  ('185403635227575815', 'Eternal Love', 1929, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Charles Rosher, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Hanns Kräly', 'John Barrymore, Camilla Horn, Victor Varconi, Hobart Bosworth, Bodil Rosing, Mona Rico, Evelyn Selbie, Constantine Romanoff', null, 'In the Swiss Alps of the early 19th century, a couple forced into loveless marriages struggle to find happiness with one another.', 'In the Swiss Alps of the early 19th century, a couple forced into loveless marriages struggle to find happiness with one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d27WM87hfQE8tBoLKIS9GYA0UJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102695'),
  ('514508399852987566', 'Eternal Moment', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Zhang Yibai, Huang Lian', null, 'Li Yapeng, Xu Jinglei, Wang Xuebing, Chapman To Man-Chat, Vicky Zhao, Li Feng, Ning Hao, Xu Dongdong', null, 'Eternal Moment (将爱) is a Chinese romantic drama film directed by Zhang Yibai and starring Xu Jinglei, Li Yapeng and Chapman To. The film is a sequel to the television drama, Cherish Our Love Forever (1998), which was also directed by Zhang.[1] The film follows the two leads from that earlier drama (played by Xu Jinglei and Li Yapeng) reuniting after being apart for 12 years.', 'Eternal Moment (将爱) is a Chinese romantic drama film directed by Zhang Yibai and starring Xu Jinglei, Li Yapeng and Chapman To. The film is a sequel to the television drama, Cherish Our Love Forever (1998), which was also directed by Zhang.[1] The film follows the two leads from that earlier drama (played by Xu Jinglei and Li Yapeng) reuniting after being apart for 12 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhPJq38FxtZBVJsioBCekYbAeIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65652'),
  ('1056981638538414408', 'Eternal Playground', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tara-Jay Bangalter, Joseph Rozé, Pablo Cotten', 'Joseph Rozé, Pablo Cotten', 'Andranic Manet, Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Arcadi Radeff, Alassane Diong, Carla Audebaud, Nina Zem, Noée Abita, Matthieu Rozé', null, 'Following the death of his twin sister, Gaspard, a young music teacher, brings together his five former best friends in their deserted childhood school, in the middle of July.', 'Following the death of his twin sister, Gaspard, a young music teacher, brings together his five former best friends in their deserted childhood school, in the middle of July.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46YdXcTb1OPlQAPJ4ld6H9wibBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232072'),
  ('92879980677133122', 'Eternal Summer', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leste Chen, Charlie Lam Chi-Kin, Chan Wai-Ming', 'Cheng-Ping Hsu', 'Ray Chang, Joseph Chang, Kate Yeung', 'NR', 'Three high school students experience the perks and pitfalls of love in director Leste Chen’s sensitive tale of friendship and yearning.', 'Three high school students experience the perks and pitfalls of love in director Leste Chen’s sensitive tale of friendship and yearning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuGW4Vb5GgYGOCACMwj6mznEw4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57005'),
  ('999371878072871591', 'Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Romance', 'Michel Gondry, Ellen Kuras, Michael Hausman', 'Charlie Kaufman', 'Jim Carrey, Kate Winslet, Kirsten Dunst, Mark Ruffalo, Elijah Wood, Tom Wilkinson, Jane Adams, David Cross', 'R', 'Joel Barish, heartbroken that his girlfriend underwent a procedure to erase him from her memory, decides to do the same. However, as he watches his memories of her fade away, he realises that he still loves her, and may be too late to correct his mistake.', 'Joel Barish, heartbroken that his girlfriend underwent a procedure to erase him from her memory, decides to do the same. However, as he watches his memories of her fade away, he realises that he still loves her, and may be too late to correct his mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MwkWH9tYHv3mV9OdYTMR5qreIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38'),
