  ('834777047616039229', 'Eternally Yours', 1939, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tay Garnett, Werner Janssen, Charles Kerr', 'C. Graham Baker, Gene Towne, Ben Hecht', 'Loretta Young, David Niven, Billie Burke, C. Aubrey Smith, Zasu Pitts, Broderick Crawford, Eve Arden, Hugh Herbert', 'NR', 'Anita, engaged to solid Don Barnes, is swept off her feet by magician Arturo. Before you can say presto, she''s his wife and stage assistant on a lengthy world tour. But Anita is annoyed by Arturo''s constant flirtations, and his death-defying stunts give her nightmares. And forget her plan to retire to a farmhouse. Eventually, she has had enough and disappears.', 'Anita, engaged to solid Don Barnes, is swept off her feet by magician Arturo. Before you can say presto, she''s his wife and stage assistant on a lengthy world tour. But Anita is annoyed by Arturo''s constant flirtations, and his death-defying stunts give her nightmares. And forget her plan to retire to a farmhouse. Eventually, she has had enough and disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDyCtBweXl2fpV4RKCLHXnDZEJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76382'),
  ('397130691292052064', 'Eternals', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Matthew Gray, Chloé Zhao, Ben Davis', 'Patrick Burleigh, Ryan Firpo, Kaz Firpo', 'Gemma Chan, Richard Madden, Angelina Jolie, Salma Hayek Pinault, Kumail Nanjiani, Lia McHugh, Brian Tyree Henry, Lauren Ridloff', 'PG-13', 'The Eternals are a team of ancient aliens who have been living on Earth in secret for thousands of years. When an unexpected tragedy forces them out of the shadows, they are forced to reunite against mankind’s most ancient enemy, the Deviants.', 'The Eternals are a team of ancient aliens who have been living on Earth in secret for thousands of years. When an unexpected tragedy forces them out of the shadows, they are forced to reunite against mankind’s most ancient enemy, the Deviants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFByFSLV5WDJEv3KabbdAF959F2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524434'),
