  ('996219643674057367', 'Euthanizer', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, Comedy', 'Teemu Nikki, Tuula Nikkola, Sari Aaltonen', 'Teemu Nikki', 'Matti Onnismaa, Jari Virman, Hannamaija Nikander, Heikki Nousiainen, Pihla Penttinen, Jouko Puolanto, Santtu Karvonen, Alina Tomnikov', null, 'Euthanizer tells the story of a mechanic who euthanises sick and old pets as a side job. Despite the grim work, he has a soft spot for the animals. Trouble stirs when the owner of a dog he was supposed to end realises that the canine is still alive. The only innocent party in the drama that ensues is the dog itself.', 'Euthanizer tells the story of a mechanic who euthanises sick and old pets as a side job. Despite the grim work, he has a soft spot for the animals. Trouble stirs when the owner of a dog he was supposed to end realises that the canine is still alive. The only innocent party in the drama that ensues is the dog itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2JcwM4C1vciVgCYlQhicRcuFib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471105'),
  ('508175664727347394', 'Ev', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Caner Özyurtlu, Alper Özyurtlu', 'Caner Özyurtlu, Volkan Keleş, Alper Özyurtlu', 'Deniz Celiloğlu, Kerem Atabeyoğlu, Funda Eryiğit, Gülçin Santırcıoğlu, Ece Çeşmioğlu, Ahmet Saraçoğlu, Alican Yücesoy, Levent Ünsal', null, 'A psychopath gunman breaks in and plants bombs in bigbrother house to change the rules of the game.', 'A psychopath gunman breaks in and plants bombs in bigbrother house to change the rules of the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4Zzyw2BIxeQowOPMpfjd9gf5ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114648'),
  ('1129255983499856072', 'Eva', 1948, 'Drama', 'Åke Dahlqvist, Gustaf Molander, Hugo Bolander', 'Gustaf Molander', 'Birger Malmsten, Eva Stiberg, Eva Dahlbeck, Åke Claesson, Wanda Rothgardt, Hilda Borgström, Stig Olin, Inga Landgré', null, 'Marine Bo Fredriksson is travelling home on a leave. He reminisce about an accident he caused as a 12-year old which killed a young girl, an event that has made him feel revulsion for death. Back home he meets Eva, a girl he fancies and they move together to Stockholm to start a life together.', 'Marine Bo Fredriksson is travelling home on a leave. He reminisce about an accident he caused as a 12-year old which killed a young girl, an event that has made him feel revulsion for death. Back home he meets Eva, a girl he fancies and they move together to Stockholm to start a life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOrrGqWkORGPtPbjQJyoioKGtcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68290'),
  ('789275039099707278', 'Eva', 1962, 'Drama', 'Joseph Losey, Gianni Di Venanzo, Henri Decaë', 'Hugo Butler, Evan Jones', 'Jeanne Moreau, Stanley Baker, Giorgio Albertazzi, James Villiers, Virna Lisi, Riccardo Garrone, Lisa Gastoni, Checco Rissone', null, 'Best-selling author Tyvian Jones has a life of leisure in Venice, Italy, until he has a chance encounter with sultry Frenchwoman Eva Olivier. He falls for her instantly, despite already having wedding plans with Francesca Ferrara. Winning Eva''s affection proves elusive; she''s more interested in money than in love. But Tyvian remain steadfast in his obsession, going after Eva with a fervor that threatens to destroy his life.', 'Best-selling author Tyvian Jones has a life of leisure in Venice, Italy, until he has a chance encounter with sultry Frenchwoman Eva Olivier. He falls for her instantly, despite already having wedding plans with Francesca Ferrara. Winning Eva''s affection proves elusive; she''s more interested in money than in love. But Tyvian remain steadfast in his obsession, going after Eva with a fervor that threatens to destroy his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEBNSaPwlp7s8oQoopovMFVKreA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94655'),
  ('1062240683372745985', 'Eva', 2005, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Gaspar Noé, Gaspar Noé', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Eva Herzigová', null, 'A series of 3 shortfilms, shot for Canal+ and broadcasted during Cannes Film Festival 2005, starring Eva Herzigova.', 'A series of 3 shortfilms, shot for Canal+ and broadcasted during Cannes Film Festival 2005, starring Eva Herzigova.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e737IWnOhiHIighxAdqRlieBC7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128920'),
  ('136479495869485868', 'Eva', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Benoît Jacquot, Julien Hirsch', 'Gilles Taurand, Benoît Jacquot', 'Isabelle Huppert, Gaspard Ulliel, Julia Roy, Marc Barbé, Richard Berry, Didier Flamand, Pascal Aubert, Nina Ballester-Moulin', null, 'A playwright encounters a mysterious woman when he takes shelter in a chalet during a violent snowstorm and becomes obsessed with her.', 'A playwright encounters a mysterious woman when he takes shelter in a chalet during a violent snowstorm and becomes obsessed with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDIQvVf8ZyAxf3WzJhbn15hpXPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431135'),
  ('892286938454824127', 'Eva', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeffrey Hidalgo, Rommel Sales, Aika Rapay', 'Dennis Marasigan', 'Angeli Khang, Ava Mendez, Marco Gomez, Ivan Padilla, Angelica Cervantes, Quinn Carrillo, Cecil Paz, Max Durano', null, 'When Eva gets involved in a steamy threesome with a houseboy and her lady boss, she realizes she has to choose only one between them.', 'When Eva gets involved in a steamy threesome with a houseboy and her lady boss, she realizes she has to choose only one between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xADCcluh5TaqETZGO45RulKnYDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893694'),
  ('345996958197519559', 'EVA', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Kike Maíllo, Arnau Valls Colomer, Toni Carrizosa', 'Aintza Serra, Martí Roca, Cristina Clemente', 'Daniel Brühl, Marta Etura, Alberto Ammann, Claudia Vega, Anne Canovas, Lluís Homar, Sara Rosa Losilla, Manel Dueso', 'PG-13', 'In 2041, humans live side-by-side with robots and androids. A well-known cybernetic engineer, Alex Garel, returns to his hometown to create a new model of robot child.', 'In 2041, humans live side-by-side with robots and androids. A well-known cybernetic engineer, Alex Garel, returns to his hometown to create a new model of robot child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GH6VRhwI5SrD178aqPCI1Xpf4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77561'),
  ('277025298077494329', 'Eva & Leon', 2015, 'Drama', 'Emilie Cherpitel', null, 'Clotilde Hesme, Florian Lemaire, Clotilde Courau, Keziah Jones, Yannick Choirat, Peter Coyote, Frédéric Beigbeder, Idit Cebula', null, 'Leon arrives in Eva''s life one morning, on the terrace of a café. The little boy settles down, asks for hot chocolate. The young woman, 35, without children, takes her home, calls social services and learns that Leon has run away from home. Eva has to bring him back but eventually delays the deadline. She who leads an idle existence, sheltered from need, attaches herself to the little boy. Called to order by the authorities, she ignores and tells Leon that they are now on the run. Together, they go to Italy in search of the mother of the little boy ...', 'Leon arrives in Eva''s life one morning, on the terrace of a café. The little boy settles down, asks for hot chocolate. The young woman, 35, without children, takes her home, calls social services and learns that Leon has run away from home. Eva has to bring him back but eventually delays the deadline. She who leads an idle existence, sheltered from need, attaches herself to the little boy. Called to order by the authorities, she ignores and tells Leon that they are now on the run. Together, they go to Italy in search of the mother of the little boy ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dryLMxVpP4LwuTERPrvHwCG2xlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346307'),
  ('373043368890841615', 'Eva + Candela', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ruth Caudeli, Ruben Fernandez Naar', 'Ruth Caudeli', 'Silvia Santamaría, Alejandra Lara, Roberto Cano, Kristina Lilley, Luna Baxter, Ana María Cuéllar, Cristina Warner, Andrés Estrada', null, 'Eva and Candela meet two years after their relationship ends because Eva needs something from Candela. Although they seem to have remade their lives, they still have outstanding issues between them.', 'Eva and Candela meet two years after their relationship ends because Eva needs something from Candela. Although they seem to have remade their lives, they still have outstanding issues between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAJ6yo44A6JmNvdx9vk4aWATTOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526028'),
  ('963569340048877625', 'Eva Braun', 2015, 'Drama', 'Simone Scafidi, Filippo Bernabei', 'Simone Scafidi', 'Andrea Riva, Susanna Giaroli, Federica Fracassi, Adele Raes, Giulia Martina Faggioni, Gabriella Riva, Nathan Macchioni, Gabriele Falsetta', null, 'Eva Braun takes inspiration from the actual sex scandals in the Italian Parliament and the 120 Days of Sodoma by Marquis De Sade. This mix create a grotesque journey through power, sex and will of people who does everything to be successful. Pier is a powerful and important Mogul who keeps the power in his country. Elegant, ironical and well educated, he has a bizarre sexual instinct which is satisfied by her mistress, Romy, who collect people, men and women (musicians, directors, writers and businessmen) which agree to satisfy his weird fantasies for getting his help to the way to success. Like a Decameron, a group of people in a house meet their pride and greed for power and sex.', 'Eva Braun takes inspiration from the actual sex scandals in the Italian Parliament and the 120 Days of Sodoma by Marquis De Sade. This mix create a grotesque journey through power, sex and will of people who does everything to be successful. Pier is a powerful and important Mogul who keeps the power in his country. Elegant, ironical and well educated, he has a bizarre sexual instinct which is satisfied by her mistress, Romy, who collect people, men and women (musicians, directors, writers and businessmen) which agree to satisfy his weird fantasies for getting his help to the way to success. Like a Decameron, a group of people in a house meet their pride and greed for power and sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFoeH698T2lFUCcahqCRIUQBcJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342030'),
  ('137018173987109735', 'Eva Doesn''t Sleep', 2015, 'Drama', 'Pablo Agüero, Iván Gierasinchuk', 'Pablo Agüero', 'Gael García Bernal, Denis Lavant, Imanol Arias, Ailín Salas, Daniel Fanego, Sofía Brito, Nicolás Goldschmidt, Miguel Ángel Solá', null, 'In 1952, Argentina''s beloved First Lady, Eva Perón, died of cancer at the age of thirty-three. A renowned embalmer was commissioned by the grieving Juan Perón to preserve her body for display, and Argentines flocked to be near "Evita". Three years later, when his government was overthrown by a military coup, Perón fled the country before he could make arrangements for the transportation of his wife''s body. The military junta now in control kidnapped the corpse; so afraid were they of Eva''s symbolic power that they even made it illegal to utter her name.', 'In 1952, Argentina''s beloved First Lady, Eva Perón, died of cancer at the age of thirty-three. A renowned embalmer was commissioned by the grieving Juan Perón to preserve her body for display, and Argentines flocked to be near "Evita". Three years later, when his government was overthrown by a military coup, Perón fled the country before he could make arrangements for the transportation of his wife''s body. The military junta now in control kidnapped the corpse; so afraid were they of Eva''s symbolic power that they even made it illegal to utter her name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BcRdH1O7Y6ic25SxvLt2DLmUn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354288'),
  ('553603697636974591', 'Eva Fools Around', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Martin Frič, Václav Hanuš', 'Vladimír Peroutka', 'Nataša Gollová, Oldřich Nový, Zdeňka Baldová, Ella Nollová, Gustav Hilmar, Marta Májová, Jiřina Sedláčková, Josef Gruss', null, 'Eva''s aunt is jealous of her neighbor''s excellent roses and wants to know the secret. To help auntie out Eva applies for secretarial work at the neighbor''s house in order to find out the formula. Things get complicated when it turns out that Eva''s brother is in love with the daughter of the house and also wants to get in there under false pretenses.', 'Eva''s aunt is jealous of her neighbor''s excellent roses and wants to know the secret. To help auntie out Eva applies for secretarial work at the neighbor''s house in order to find out the formula. Things get complicated when it turns out that Eva''s brother is in love with the daughter of the house and also wants to get in there under false pretenses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxWhn3b5ApBURR41y9gBP7eFK0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65903'),
  ('335169588120237910', 'Eva Man', 1980, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Antonio D''Agostino', 'Antonio D''Agostino, Luis Castro, Marino Onorati', 'Eva Robin''s, Ajita Wilson, Ramón Centenero, Fabián Conde, Annj Goren, Sara Mora, Brunello Chiodetti', null, 'Eva, a hermaphrodite from birth, with clear signs of both sexes, is raised under the strict guidance of her uncle, Professor Pissinger. The professor surgically implants a device called a "sexmaker" which allows Eva to control her sexual intensity. Unfortunately, this also puts her in the sights of an impotent gangster who wants the device for himself.', 'Eva, a hermaphrodite from birth, with clear signs of both sexes, is raised under the strict guidance of her uncle, Professor Pissinger. The professor surgically implants a device called a "sexmaker" which allows Eva to control her sexual intensity. Unfortunately, this also puts her in the sights of an impotent gangster who wants the device for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZguqlNBbjNmZNllpFNc1V6oIn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393634'),
  ('38393066888386745', 'Eva Perón', 1996, 'Drama', 'Juan Carlos Desanzo, Juan Carlos Lenardi', 'José Pablo Feinmann', 'Esther Goris, Víctor Laplace, Cristina Banegas, Pepe Novoa, Irma Córdoba, Lorenzo Quinteros, Tony Vilas, Jorge Petraglia', null, 'Drama based on the life of Eva Peron, an obscure actress, who rose to become wife of Argentine strong-man President Juan Peron and one of the most powerful figures in Argentina until her death in 1952 at age 33.', 'Drama based on the life of Eva Peron, an obscure actress, who rose to become wife of Argentine strong-man President Juan Peron and one of the most powerful figures in Argentina until her death in 1952 at age 33.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fHmUns7qqieMLcbch7HJukUnC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127174'),
  ('536241308551248825', 'Eva''s Eye', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Berit Nesheim', 'Berit Nesheim', 'Andrine Sæther, Bjørn Sundquist, Gisken Armand, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Dennis Storhøi, Marit Andreassen, Per Egil Aske, Christin Borge', null, 'While Eva Magnus and her daughter, Jenny, are taking a walk, they discover a dead body floating along the riverside. Eva runs to the nearest phone booth and pretends to call the police. Then she leaves the body for someone else to find. Why? Konrad Sejer, the police officer investigating the case, links it to another unsolved murder of a woman killed in her bed. A woman that used to be a childhood friend of Eva Magnus.', 'While Eva Magnus and her daughter, Jenny, are taking a walk, they discover a dead body floating along the riverside. Eva runs to the nearest phone booth and pretends to call the police. Then she leaves the body for someone else to find. Why? Konrad Sejer, the police officer investigating the case, links it to another unsolved murder of a woman killed in her bed. A woman that used to be a childhood friend of Eva Magnus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7KtDSnuAdMcKD4SL4rOMcTyJGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115509'),
  ('364505540493643232', 'Evan Almighty', 2007, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Tom Shadyac, Ian Baker, Jonathan Watson', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Steve Carell, Morgan Freeman, Lauren Graham, Johnny Simmons, Graham Phillips, Jimmy Bennett, John Goodman, Wanda Sykes', 'PG', 'God contacts Junior Congressman Evan Baxter and tells him to build an ark in preparation for a great flood.', 'God contacts Junior Congressman Evan Baxter and tells him to build an ark in preparation for a great flood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blI1ioXbgJWOJ3PbcBuSV65Ebwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2698'),
  ('506970721323392007', 'Evanescence: Synthesis Live', 2018, 'Music', 'P.R. Brown', 'Amy Lee', 'Amy Lee, Tim McCord, Will Hunt, Troy McLawhorn, Jen Majura', null, 'The two-time GRAMMY Award-winners return as you''ve never seen them before with Synthesis Live. Filmed in the fall of 2017 at the Grand Theater in Connecticut, this concert film features a re-imagining of some of Evanescence''s best-loved songs with the spotlight on Amy Lee''s virtuoso piano and voice supported by the combination of full orchestra, electronics and the band. The new arrangements give a focus to the emotions and stories in the band''s songs.', 'The two-time GRAMMY Award-winners return as you''ve never seen them before with Synthesis Live. Filmed in the fall of 2017 at the Grand Theater in Connecticut, this concert film features a re-imagining of some of Evanescence''s best-loved songs with the spotlight on Amy Lee''s virtuoso piano and voice supported by the combination of full orchestra, electronics and the band. The new arrangements give a focus to the emotions and stories in the band''s songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G0xZZLCtWGAKxCo1LahsUD13zv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554386'),
  ('142828067839045653', 'EVANGELION 30th Anniversary Special Screening', 2026, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Naoyuki Asano, Nanae Hirabayashi', 'Hideaki Anno, Kazuya Tsurumaki, Naoyuki Asano', 'Yuko Miyamura, Megumi Ogata, Akira Ishida, Kotono Mitsuishi, Miki Nagasawa, Maria Kawamura, Maaya Sakamoto, Motomu Kiyokawa', null, 'A short film celebrating the 30th anniversary of Neon Genesis Evangelion starring both the classic and Rebuild iterations of Asuka. The short comedically explores alternate timelines.', 'A short film celebrating the 30th anniversary of Neon Genesis Evangelion starring both the classic and Rebuild iterations of Asuka. The short comedically explores alternate timelines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25csgA1l0jpvvSRwdFgjrI7PDnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1600672'),
  ('698343656319374036', 'Evangelion: 1.0 You Are (Not) Alone', 2007, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Yoshiyuki Sadamoto, Takeshi Honda, Hidenori Matsubara', 'Hideaki Anno', 'Megumi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Akira Ishida, Fumihiko Tachiki, Motomu Kiyokawa, Miki Nagasawa', 'PG-13', 'After the Second Impact, Tokyo-3 is being attacked by giant monsters called Angels that seek to eradicate humankind. The child Shinji’s objective is to fight the Angels by piloting one of the mysterious Evangelion mecha units. A remake of the first six episodes of GAINAX’s famous 1996 anime series. The film was retitled “Evangelion: 1.01” for its DVD release and “Evangelion: 1.11” for a release with additional scenes.', 'After the Second Impact, Tokyo-3 is being attacked by giant monsters called Angels that seek to eradicate humankind. The child Shinji’s objective is to fight the Angels by piloting one of the mysterious Evangelion mecha units. A remake of the first six episodes of GAINAX’s famous 1996 anime series. The film was retitled “Evangelion: 1.01” for its DVD release and “Evangelion: 1.11” for a release with additional scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pETU4GurpeEjBOM8oytMH0yNBHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15137'),
  ('69935203186002970', 'Evangelion: 2.0 You Can (Not) Advance', 2009, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Takeshi Honda, Hidenori Matsubara, Atsushi Okuda', 'Hideaki Anno', 'Megumi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Yuko Miyamura, Maaya Sakamoto, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Koichi Yamadera, Fumihiko Tachiki', 'NR', 'Under constant attack by monstrous creatures called Angels that seek to eradicate humankind, U.N. Special Agency NERV introduces two new EVA pilots to help defend the city of Tokyo-3: the mysterious Makinami Mari Illustrous and the intense Asuka Langley Shikinami. Meanwhile, Gendo Ikari and SEELE proceed with a secret project that involves both Rei and Shinji.', 'Under constant attack by monstrous creatures called Angels that seek to eradicate humankind, U.N. Special Agency NERV introduces two new EVA pilots to help defend the city of Tokyo-3: the mysterious Makinami Mari Illustrous and the intense Asuka Langley Shikinami. Meanwhile, Gendo Ikari and SEELE proceed with a secret project that involves both Rei and Shinji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VLYN2CfJpB6PrcuzDKKqdGSUi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22843'),
  ('75200847307507385', 'Evangelion: 3.0 You Can (Not) Redo', 2012, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Toru Fukushi, Takeshi Honda, Toshiyuki Inoue', 'Hideaki Anno', 'Megumi Ogata, Yuko Miyamura, Akira Ishida, Megumi Hayashibara, Maaya Sakamoto, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Fumihiko Tachiki', 'PG-13', 'Fourteen years after Third Impact, Shinji Ikari awakens to a world he does not remember. He hasn''t aged. Much of Earth is laid in ruins, NERV has been dismantled, and people who he once protected have turned against him. Befriending the enigmatic Kaworu Nagisa, Shinji continues the fight against the angels and realizes the fighting is far from over, even when it could be against his former allies. The characters'' struggles continue amidst the battles against the angels and each other, spiraling down to what could inevitably be the end of the world.', 'Fourteen years after Third Impact, Shinji Ikari awakens to a world he does not remember. He hasn''t aged. Much of Earth is laid in ruins, NERV has been dismantled, and people who he once protected have turned against him. Befriending the enigmatic Kaworu Nagisa, Shinji continues the fight against the angels and realizes the fighting is far from over, even when it could be against his former allies. The characters'' struggles continue amidst the battles against the angels and each other, spiraling down to what could inevitably be the end of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0s1xvykzl0kz7fP5S2ROYqphdz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75629'),
  ('812230311628117899', 'Evangelion: 3.0+1.0 Thrice Upon a Time', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Toru Fukushi, Atsushi Nishigori, Sejoon Kim', 'Hideaki Anno', 'Megumi Ogata, Yuko Miyamura, Maaya Sakamoto, Megumi Hayashibara, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yuriko Yamaguchi, Tomokazu Seki, Tetsuya Iwanaga', 'NR', 'In the aftermath of the Fourth Impact, stranded without their Evangelions, Shinji, Asuka and Rei find refuge in one of the rare pockets of humanity that still exist on the ruined planet Earth. There, each lives a life far different from their days as an Evangelion pilot. However, the danger to the world is far from over. A new impact is looming on the horizon—one that will prove to be the true end of Evangelion.', 'In the aftermath of the Fourth Impact, stranded without their Evangelions, Shinji, Asuka and Rei find refuge in one of the rare pockets of humanity that still exist on the ruined planet Earth. There, each lives a life far different from their days as an Evangelion pilot. However, the danger to the world is far from over. A new impact is looming on the horizon—one that will prove to be the true end of Evangelion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/md5wZRRj8biHrGtyitgBZo7674t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283566'),
  ('11467741556488420', 'Evangelion: Another Impact (Confidential)', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Masaru Matsumoto, Shinji Aramaki', 'Shinji Aramaki', null, null, 'Another time, another place. An activation test of a decisive weapon was underway. With its development and operational trials shrouded in complete secrecy, the Another Number - Unit Null, suddenly breaks free of human control and goes berserk. For what purpose was Another Number - Unit Null created? The story of an Evangelion''s activation, rampage and howling in another world.', 'Another time, another place. An activation test of a decisive weapon was underway. With its development and operational trials shrouded in complete secrecy, the Another Number - Unit Null, suddenly breaks free of human control and goes berserk. For what purpose was Another Number - Unit Null created? The story of an Evangelion''s activation, rampage and howling in another world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klnFbml9sVnpfH5cbY2r1EyOeap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365930'),
  ('74140398446859989', 'EVANGELION: DEATH (TRUE)²', 1998, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Masayuki, Hideaki Anno, Tsuyoshi Kaga', 'Akio Satsukawa', 'Megumi Ogata, Kotono Mitsuishi, Megumi Hayashibara, Yuko Miyamura, Akira Ishida, Fumihiko Tachiki, Koichi Yamadera, Motomu Kiyokawa', null, 'A highly experimental film presenting a story out of chronological order taking place 15 years after a near-apocalyptic catastrophe, about four traumatized 14 year olds who are tasked with piloting massive humanoid decisive weapons called Evangelion, the psychologically maladjusted adults who handle and command them, and the events and forces that affect them or which they take part in as they engage massive hostile invaders known as "Angels."', 'A highly experimental film presenting a story out of chronological order taking place 15 years after a near-apocalyptic catastrophe, about four traumatized 14 year olds who are tasked with piloting massive humanoid decisive weapons called Evangelion, the psychologically maladjusted adults who handle and command them, and the events and forces that affect them or which they take part in as they engage massive hostile invaders known as "Angels."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AehyZFGm68ep76b81IbLJ1EJ5ot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857862'),
  ('34771001159367108', 'EVANGELION:3.0(-46h)', 2023, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Toko Yatabe, Kazuya Tsurumaki, Toru Fukushi', 'Yukiyo Yamashiro', 'Mariya Ise, Yuko Miyamura, Sayaka Ohara, Anri Katsu, Maaya Sakamoto', null, '46 hours before the events of "EVANGELION:3.0 YOU CAN (NOT) REDO." Midori remembers her life post Near Third Impact and how she is saved by WILLE.', '46 hours before the events of "EVANGELION:3.0 YOU CAN (NOT) REDO." Midori remembers her life post Near Third Impact and how she is saved by WILLE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bygotyRYDdheieVvPSCW5scTJKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096648'),
  ('958874828895315062', 'Evasive Action', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jerry P. Jacobs, Ken Blakey', 'Tripp Reed', 'Dorian Harewood, Ray Wise, Roy Scheider, Delane Matthews, Ed O''Ross, John Toles-Bey, Clint Howard, Don Swayze', null, 'When Redwood Federal Penitentiary closes, there are going to be several hundred prisoners looking for a new home. Several of the most dangerous, all killers, will be transported by train to Santa Ana, a new high tech prison for the worst of the worst. Included in this transfer are: -Ian Kelly, explosions expert who has set off terrorist bombings worldwide. -Lorenzo "Enzo" Martini, a mafia kingpin who enjoyed nationwide fame before finally being put away. -Karl "The Killer" Miller, a serial killer with absolutely no conscience and an unquenchable thirst for blood. -Tommy "Zimm" Zimmer, a man who''s serving life for killing his wife and her lover. -Luke Sinclair, who''s finishing up the last nine months of a fifteen-year sentence for killing the man who murdered his wife. When the prisoners, under heavy security, board the last car of the train, it quickly becomes clear that an escape plan has been hatched', 'When Redwood Federal Penitentiary closes, there are going to be several hundred prisoners looking for a new home. Several of the most dangerous, all killers, will be transported by train to Santa Ana, a new high tech prison for the worst of the worst. Included in this transfer are: -Ian Kelly, explosions expert who has set off terrorist bombings worldwide. -Lorenzo "Enzo" Martini, a mafia kingpin who enjoyed nationwide fame before finally being put away. -Karl "The Killer" Miller, a serial killer with absolutely no conscience and an unquenchable thirst for blood. -Tommy "Zimm" Zimmer, a man who''s serving life for killing his wife and her lover. -Luke Sinclair, who''s finishing up the last nine months of a fifteen-year sentence for killing the man who murdered his wife. When the prisoners, under heavy security, board the last car of the train, it quickly becomes clear that an escape plan has been hatched', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLz9EK5AyEbiHZ2SiGebU9Lfj2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36294'),
  ('27583735457556854', 'Evdokia', 1971, 'Drama', 'Lakis Papastathis, Nikos Zervos, Alexis Damianos', 'Alexis Damianos', 'Maria Vassiliou, Giorgos Koutouzis, Koula Agagiotou, Christos Zorbas, Nasos Katakouzinos, Vassilis Panayiotopoulos, Paulos Roussos, S. Douligerakis', null, 'A prostitute (Evdokia) meets a sergeant (Yorgos). They fall in love and get married after a short love affair. Her profession, however, is a barrier for their relationship. They try to stay together and overcome their inner conflicts, but the social environment crushes them.', 'A prostitute (Evdokia) meets a sergeant (Yorgos). They fall in love and get married after a short love affair. Her profession, however, is a barrier for their relationship. They try to stay together and overcome their inner conflicts, but the social environment crushes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPkFvGgeT3rDw4V99YeY8OZKSlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47704'),
  ('367207248417111266', 'Eve and the Handyman', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer', 'Russ Meyer', 'Eve Meyer, Anthony-James Ryan, Frank Bolger, Francesca Leslie, Florence E. Moore, Ken Parker, Charles H. Vaughn, Barbara Murphy', null, 'Dressed in a long raincoat, Eve follows the handyman around as he makes his appointed rounds. She witnesses humorous run-ins on his various errands. But why is she watching him so carefully?', 'Dressed in a long raincoat, Eve follows the handyman around as he makes his appointed rounds. She witnesses humorous run-ins on his various errands. But why is she watching him so carefully?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWjGKUYVFZ5kZO8MjMMi9ro5uNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5642'),
  ('938465707841791303', 'Eve of Destruction', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Duncan Gibbins, Alan Hume, Brian Ort', 'Duncan Gibbins, Yale Udoff', 'Gregory Hines, Renée Soutendijk, Michael Greene, Kurt Fuller, John M. Jackson, Loren Haynes, Nelson Mashita, Greg Collins', 'R', 'Eve is a military robot made to look exactly like her creator, Dr. Eve Simmons. When she is damaged during a bank robbery, the robot becomes an unstoppable killing machine. Colonel Jim McQuade is assigned to stop the robot and with the help from Dr. Simmons they have to predict where she will go next.', 'Eve is a military robot made to look exactly like her creator, Dr. Eve Simmons. When she is damaged during a bank robbery, the robot becomes an unstoppable killing machine. Colonel Jim McQuade is assigned to stop the robot and with the help from Dr. Simmons they have to predict where she will go next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lssgv86oGv5zMvfRV0bxcZN9Yuk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45096'),
  ('129550874229723310', 'Eve''s Bayou', 1997, 'Drama', 'Kasi Lemmons, Amy Vincent, James Alan Hensz', 'Kasi Lemmons', 'Jurnee Smollett, Meagan Good, Samuel L. Jackson, Lynn Whitfield, Debbi Morgan, Jake Smollett, Ethel Ayler, Diahann Carroll', 'R', 'Summer heats up in rural Louisiana beside Eve’s Bayou, 1962, as the Batiste family tries to survive the secrets they’ve kept and the betrayals they’ve endured.', 'Summer heats up in rural Louisiana beside Eve’s Bayou, 1962, as the Batiste family tries to survive the secrets they’ve kept and the betrayals they’ve endured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33yTPcGSv7eo3FVlb7XKACHl1M8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45153'),
  ('306296039297175467', 'Eve''s Flower Petal', 1984, 'Romance', 'Minoru Yoneda, Shun Nakahara, Osamu Murakami', 'Tomomi Kimura', 'Eve, Ayako Ota, Akira Hanagami, Makoto Kakeda, Akio Kaneda, Saeko Kizuki, Yōhei Nagae', null, 'A young woman wanders aimlessly around a beach resort and has sex with various men.', 'A young woman wanders aimlessly around a beach resort and has sex with various men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zljU1KjTGQ7FLFdoIGmLm6iCrV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931848'),
  ('469568096358232833', 'Evel Knievel', 1971, 'Action, Drama', 'Marvin J. Chomsky, David M. Walsh', 'Alan Caillou, John Milius', 'George Hamilton, Sue Lyon, Bert Freed, Rod Cameron, Dub Taylor, Ron Masak, Hal Baylor, Mary Peters', null, 'Biography of the famed motorcycle daredevil, much of which was filmed in his home town of Butte, Montana. The film depicts Knievel reflecting on major events in his life just before a big jump.', 'Biography of the famed motorcycle daredevil, much of which was filmed in his home town of Butte, Montana. The film depicts Knievel reflecting on major events in his life just before a big jump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40LZZPLECxBkIrHBOeZnxkxeMpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139324'),
  ('1129290151199440456', 'Evelyn', 2002, 'Drama', 'Bruce Beresford, Andre Fleuren', 'Paul Pender', 'Pierce Brosnan, Aidan Quinn, Julianna Margulies, Stephen Rea, John Lynch, Sophie Vavasseur, Alan Bates, Niall Beagan', 'PG', 'Desmond Doyle is devastated when his wife abandons their family on the day after Christmas. His unemployment, and the fact that there is no woman in the house to care for the children—Evelyn, Dermot and Maurice—make it clear to the authorities this is an untenable situation. The Catholic Church and the Irish courts decide to put the Doyle children into Church-run orphanages.', 'Desmond Doyle is devastated when his wife abandons their family on the day after Christmas. His unemployment, and the fact that there is no woman in the house to care for the children—Evelyn, Dermot and Maurice—make it clear to the authorities this is an untenable situation. The Catholic Church and the Irish courts decide to put the Doyle children into Church-run orphanages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGsCpJcJj9JDsSLQRlfukNuZJgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21868'),
  ('794274469124932524', 'Evelyn', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Isabel de Ocampo', 'Juanma Romero, Isabel de Ocampo', 'Cindy Díaz, Agnes Kiraly, Guadalupe Lancho, Pilar Ordóñez, Ari Saavedra, Javier Sanz, Sveta Zhukovska, Adolfo Fernández', null, 'Evelyn travels to Spain from his native village in Peru. She thinks she will work with her cousin in a restaurant. But is deceived and kidnapped to engage in prostitution at a club road. This is the story of brainwashing, which transforms a small town girl into a sex slave.', 'Evelyn travels to Spain from his native village in Peru. She thinks she will work with her cousin in a restaurant. But is deceived and kidnapped to engage in prostitution at a club road. This is the story of brainwashing, which transforms a small town girl into a sex slave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nf8Nmio3skGS5HTLGGfMDqZkb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112755'),
  ('190813545920815014', 'Evelyn Prentice', 1934, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'William K. Howard, Horace Hough, Charles G. Clarke', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Una Merkel, Rosalind Russell, Isabel Jewell, Harvey Stephens, Edward Brophy, Henry Wadsworth', 'NR', 'A criminal lawyer''s wife is blackmailed when she is falsely accused of infidelity.', 'A criminal lawyer''s wife is blackmailed when she is falsely accused of infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJHsYlgbyAIUIr9d6qcPYHJAcuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53864'),
  ('282315432290748940', 'Even – As You and I', 1937, null, 'Roger Barlow, Harry Hay, LeRoy Robbins', null, 'LeRoy Robbins, Roger Barlow, Harry Hay, Hy Hirsh', null, 'Three fellows dream of prize money and a chance for a real Hollywood contract by winning the Liberty-Pete Smith amateur movie contest. They work on a script, as their wastebasket and ashtrays fill. They head outside to shoot: down a manhole, up a telephone pole, through a keyhole, and at night using binoculars. Next they must edit their film, then it''s time for a first screening of their product, "The Afternoon of a Rubberband." It''s a montage of experimental images, including a razor blade cutting various objects, a baby in a cooking pot, and a snail in the path of a steamroller. After the screening, the boys wonder if that was their only shot at Hollywood fame. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2004.', 'Three fellows dream of prize money and a chance for a real Hollywood contract by winning the Liberty-Pete Smith amateur movie contest. They work on a script, as their wastebasket and ashtrays fill. They head outside to shoot: down a manhole, up a telephone pole, through a keyhole, and at night using binoculars. Next they must edit their film, then it''s time for a first screening of their product, "The Afternoon of a Rubberband." It''s a montage of experimental images, including a razor blade cutting various objects, a baby in a cooking pot, and a snail in the path of a steamroller. After the screening, the boys wonder if that was their only shot at Hollywood fame. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2004.', null, 'tmdb:movie:146816'),
  ('298076969099779560', 'Even Angels Eat Beans', 1973, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Francisco Marín, Enzo Barboni, Bernard Farrel', 'Marie Claire Solleville, Enzo Barboni, Tulio Demicheli', 'Giuliano Gemma, Bud Spencer, Robert Middleton, Bill Vanders, Riccardo Pizzuti, Lara Sender, Steffen Zacharias, Francy Fair', null, 'Two mismatched buddies are mistaken for mob enforcers in Depression-era America.', 'Two mismatched buddies are mistaken for mob enforcers in Depression-era America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEeC0pFHZ4gK13czO0BJHwDpdzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11612'),
  ('235475623703434554', 'Even Cowgirls Get the Blues', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Western', 'Gus Van Sant, Eric Alan Edwards, John J. Campbell', 'Gus Van Sant', 'Uma Thurman, Lorraine Bracco, Pat Morita, Angie Dickinson, Keanu Reeves, John Hurt, Rain Phoenix, Ed Begley Jr.', 'R', 'A girl born with enormous thumbs in the repressive era of the 1950s learns to turn her quirks into assets.', 'A girl born with enormous thumbs in the repressive era of the 1950s learns to turn her quirks into assets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20x8nm0nPXkYv04COAHFA2AHyAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34444'),
  ('230503526972485790', 'Even Dwarfs Started Small', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thomas Mauch, Werner Herzog, Wolfgang von Ungern-Sternberg', 'Werner Herzog', 'Helmut Döring, Paul Glauer, Gisela Hertwig, Hertel Minkner, Gertrud Piccini, Marianne Saar, Brigitte Saar, Gerd Gickel', null, 'A group of tormented patients stage a coup at an oppressive, dismal asylum after they''re not allowed out on an excursion.', 'A group of tormented patients stage a coup at an oppressive, dismal asylum after they''re not allowed out on an excursion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jt9Cw1o7JchR4Tka1RiADJ9Fe9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11900'),
  ('499261660581223945', 'Even If She Had Been a Criminal...', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Gabriel Périot', 'Jean-Gabriel Périot', null, null, 'French archive images of the Second World War pass in a dizzying tempo. The pace slows when we see images of the liberation. We see happy, liberated citizens, but slowly a cruel scene becomes visible. Women who are alleged to have had a relationship with the Germans are publicly insulted, shaved and beaten.', 'French archive images of the Second World War pass in a dizzying tempo. The pace slows when we see images of the liberation. We see happy, liberated citizens, but slowly a cruel scene becomes visible. Women who are alleged to have had a relationship with the Germans are publicly insulted, shaved and beaten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93tqV1Tsx7DxDI3GZhPWVEntR6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300556'),
  ('461035884846219170', 'Even If This Love Disappears from the World Tonight', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Sho Tsukikawa, Hana Matsumoto', 'Shunsuke Michieda, Riko Fukumoto, Kotone Furukawa, Honoka Matsumoto, Toru Nomaguchi, Maki Mizuno, Masato Hagiwara, Maho Nonami', null, 'A high school girl wakes up each day with no memory of the day before. When she agrees to date a shy classmate, Toru, he begins to fall for her—despite her rule against falling in love.', 'A high school girl wakes up each day with no memory of the day before. When she agrees to date a shy classmate, Toru, he begins to fall for her—despite her rule against falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DbGJFjAqoyephghPkKWq0VGSKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977871'),
  ('985803423742295023', 'Even If This Love Disappears Tonight', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Hye-young, Lee Seok-min, Choi Yun-ui', 'Kim Hye-young, Lee Yu-jin, Jo Ba-reun', 'Choo Young-woo, Shin Sia, Cho Yu-jung, Jin Ho-eun, Cho Han-cheul, Lee Chae-kyung, Jang Yoo-sang, Yun Ki-chang', 'PG-13', 'A high school girl wakes up each day with no memory of yesterday. When she agrees to date a shy classmate, can their love grow with every new beginning?', 'A high school girl wakes up each day with no memory of yesterday. When she agrees to date a shy classmate, can their love grow with every new beginning?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eNN8KLDPUXDqIkTdCbmn1gx5P7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1466115'),
  ('66395332119566836', 'Even Lambs Have Teeth', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Terry Miles, Anna MacDonald', 'Terry Miles', 'Kirsten Zien, Tiera Skovbye, Darren Mann, Michael Karl Richards, Manny Jacinto, Craig March, Garrett Black, Brittany-Ellen Willacy', null, 'Two young women terrorized by a group of small town psychos seek revenge on their tormentors.', 'Two young women terrorized by a group of small town psychos seek revenge on their tormentors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG1Dx8h5CYILB60zBtfPZLpyJYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359245'),
