  ('154693665022387348', 'Every Stewardess Goes to Heaven', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Burman', 'Emiliano Torres, Daniel Burman', 'Alfredo Casero, Ingrid Rubio, Emilio Disi, Valentina Bassi, Verónica Llinás, Kayne Di Pilato, Norma Aleandro, Rodolfo Samsó', null, 'Teresa is a stewardess who lives a perfect life in the midst of his impeccable suits world clean and prepared foods. However the world scares land: men, motherhood, love ... Meanwhile, Julian, a young doctor, must travel to Ushuaia to throw the ashes of his dead wife in the place where they fell in love.', 'Teresa is a stewardess who lives a perfect life in the midst of his impeccable suits world clean and prepared foods. However the world scares land: men, motherhood, love ... Meanwhile, Julian, a young doctor, must travel to Ushuaia to throw the ashes of his dead wife in the place where they fell in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKc0eB2VFAiAsaelgx6MXBm4Na2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127257'),
  ('390310147617561968', 'Every Thing Will Be Fine', 2015, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Benoît Debie, Dominic Gaglione D''Amico', 'Bjørn Olaf Johannessen', 'James Franco, Rachel McAdams, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Marie-Josée Croze, Peter Stormare, Patrick Bauchau, Julia Sarah Stone, Lilah Fitzgerald', 'NR', 'One day, driving aimlessly around the outskirts of town after a trivial domestic quarrel, a writer named Tomas accidentally hits and kills a child. Will he be able to move on?', 'One day, driving aimlessly around the outskirts of town after a trivial domestic quarrel, a writer named Tomas accidentally hits and kills a child. Will he be able to move on?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTQC2MVoxYl0Qi336fB7iOBBuEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246127'),
  ('168434749075505608', 'Every Time a Bell Rings', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Maclain Nelson, Newton TerMeer', 'Audrey Shulman', 'Erin Cahill, Brittany Ishibashi, Ali Liebert, Wes Brown, Dee Wallace, Ryan Sands, Lyndie Greenwood, Ritchie Montgomery', 'G', 'Three reunited sisters discover their late father planned one last scavenger hunt - an annual holiday tradition when they were young. As their sisterly bond gets rekindled, they soon learn important lessons about what they want in life and in love.', 'Three reunited sisters discover their late father planned one last scavenger hunt - an annual holiday tradition when they were young. As their sisterly bond gets rekindled, they soon learn important lessons about what they want in life and in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oONJjxMXeWJehLYR6m35POcxjuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874239'),
  ('352677670719318988', 'Every Time I Die', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Tal Lazar, Robi Michael', 'Robi Michael, Gal Katzir', 'Marc Menchaca, Drew Fonteiro, Tyler Fleming, Michelle Macedo, Melissa Macedo, Andrea Leigh, Erica Camarano, Lia Johnson', null, 'When Sam is murdered in a remote lake, his consciousness begins to travel through the bodies of his friends in an effort to protect them from his killer. This dark passage leads him on a greater journey - discovering his own true identity.', 'When Sam is murdered in a remote lake, his consciousness begins to travel through the bodies of his friends in an effort to protect them from his killer. This dark passage leads him on a greater journey - discovering his own true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8Bk0T0ZzkMWn3sxkwfqenzyq3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612571'),
  ('502270050085547962', 'Every Time I See A Yellow Car', 2026, 'Short, Thriller, Drama', 'Matt Chandler, Ola Shoyinka', 'Matt Chandler', 'Ty Tennant, Sam Buchanan, Cyril Nri, Lucas Mead, Marloe Mead', null, 'Olly, a man haunted by a childhood tragedy and a recent assault, and his older brother Liam, who desperately attempts to protect Olly, find themselves in a spiral of revenge and chaos. Whilst their seemingly clashing personalities should make them anything but friends, the pair both aim to break a cycle of trauma, but in contradictory ways.', 'Olly, a man haunted by a childhood tragedy and a recent assault, and his older brother Liam, who desperately attempts to protect Olly, find themselves in a spiral of revenge and chaos. Whilst their seemingly clashing personalities should make them anything but friends, the pair both aim to break a cycle of trauma, but in contradictory ways.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvYukCwWFEBfFGz1ssydLPJr0Pgz.jpg', 'plex:movie:every-time-i-see-a-yellow-car'),
  ('404072125383034390', 'Every Time We Say Goodbye', 1986, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Giuseppe Lanci, Moshé Mizrahi', 'Rachel Fabien, Leah Appet, Moshé Mizrahi', 'Tom Hanks, Cristina Marsillach, Benedict Taylor, Anat Atzmon, Gila Almagor, Moni Moshonov, Avner Hizkiyahu, Esther Parnass', 'PG-13', 'A Protestant World War II pilot and a Jewish girl fall in love in Jerusalem, even though their diverse backgrounds threaten to pull them apart.', 'A Protestant World War II pilot and a Jewish girl fall in love in Jerusalem, even though their diverse backgrounds threaten to pull them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMiWlS4jNZysUquP6CZfKswukMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35866'),
  ('885485163897957283', 'Every Trick In The Book', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Hideta Takahata, Yoko Itakura, Kazuaki Arima', 'Hideta Takahata, Kiyomi Fujii', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Tao Tsuchiya, Shunsuke Kazama, Nanase Nishino, Aimi Satsukawa, Yuki Sakurai, Hayato Kakizawa, Taro Suruga', null, 'Shinichi Tsuda, a Naoki Prize winning author, is working to publish his newest story. It revolves around Tsuyama, a driver for a call girl business in Toyama Prefecture, who comes across a mysterious counterfeit bill and has his life targeted by underworld kingpin Kurata. Is his story fact or fiction? His editor, Nahomi Torikai, decides to verify whether his latest work is mere fiction based on real-life experiences. She looks into a family that vanished, a post office worker who went missing, a shady load of cash, the whereabouts of the doves, and the fateful encounter from that night... A series of shocking facts are revealed from Tsuda’s stories. Why did the counterfeit money end up in Tsuda’s hands? What is the “ending” that Tsuda wished to portray?', 'Shinichi Tsuda, a Naoki Prize winning author, is working to publish his newest story. It revolves around Tsuyama, a driver for a call girl business in Toyama Prefecture, who comes across a mysterious counterfeit bill and has his life targeted by underworld kingpin Kurata. Is his story fact or fiction? His editor, Nahomi Torikai, decides to verify whether his latest work is mere fiction based on real-life experiences. She looks into a family that vanished, a post office worker who went missing, a shady load of cash, the whereabouts of the doves, and the fateful encounter from that night... A series of shocking facts are revealed from Tsuda’s stories. Why did the counterfeit money end up in Tsuda’s hands? What is the “ending” that Tsuda wished to portray?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r17SeH5XkjKkOn97TodTfR8b8e6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844225'),
  ('511471268468697873', 'Every Which Way but Loose', 1978, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure, Romance, Drama', 'James Fargo, Rexford L. Metz, Al Silvani', 'Jeremy Joe Kronsberg', 'Clint Eastwood, Sondra Locke, Geoffrey Lewis, Manis, Beverly D''Angelo, Walter Barnes, George Chandler, Roy Jenson', 'PG', 'Philo Beddoe is your regular, easygoing, truck-driving guy. He''s also the best bar-room brawler west of the Rockies. And he lives with a 165-pound orangutan named Clyde. Like other guys, Philo finally falls in love - with a flighty singer who leads him on a screwball chase across the American Southwest. Nothing''s in the way except a motorcycle gang, some cops, and legendary brawler Tank Murdock.', 'Philo Beddoe is your regular, easygoing, truck-driving guy. He''s also the best bar-room brawler west of the Rockies. And he lives with a 165-pound orangutan named Clyde. Like other guys, Philo finally falls in love - with a flighty singer who leads him on a screwball chase across the American Southwest. Nothing''s in the way except a motorcycle gang, some cops, and legendary brawler Tank Murdock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcSfAskDGCgInfJAXwLLORPQLAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15417'),
  ('107115616076331291', 'Every-Night Dreams', 1933, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Heizô Iwaya, Minoru Shibuya', 'Tadao Ikeda', 'Sumiko Kurishima, Tatsuo Saitō, Teruko Kojima, Jun Arai, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Takeshi Sakamoto, Kenji Oyama, Shigeru Ogura', null, 'In Depression-era Tokyo, the life of a single mother and her young son are disrupted by the return of her ex-husband, who fathered the child and walked out on her years earlier.', 'In Depression-era Tokyo, the life of a single mother and her young son are disrupted by the return of her ex-husband, who fathered the child and walked out on her years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxiNUmAaZC99qiqwWa3FBybxOjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126516'),
  ('222476856112676265', 'Everybody Dies But Me', 2008, 'Drama', 'Valeriya Gay Germanika, Sergey Ovcharenko, Alisher Khamidkhodzhaev', 'Alexandr Rodionov, Yury Klavdiev', 'Polina Filonenko, Agniya Kuznetsova, Olga Shuvalova, Donatas Grudovich, Yuliya Aleksandrova, Olga Lapshina, Inga Strelkova-Oboldina, Garold Strelkov', null, 'One Monday morning Katya, Vika and Zhanna learn that there will be a school disco, their first disco, on the coming Saturday night. The girls feverishly start preparing for the event, which rapidly becomes the most important moment ever in their universe, and looks like the ideal way to escape their daily lives...', 'One Monday morning Katya, Vika and Zhanna learn that there will be a school disco, their first disco, on the coming Saturday night. The girls feverishly start preparing for the event, which rapidly becomes the most important moment ever in their universe, and looks like the ideal way to escape their daily lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxEP7J9RGn80rQLObnExy49cktK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31418'),
  ('97703464126706195', 'Everybody Digs Bill Evans', 2026, 'Biography, Drama, Music', 'Grant Gee', 'Mark O''Halloran', 'Anders Danielsen Lie, Bill Pullman, Laurie Metcalf, Isabelle Harriet, Barry Ward', null, 'Legendary jazz pianist Bill Evans forms his perfect trio, recording two groundbreaking albums. When his brilliant young bassist dies tragically, Evans is devastated. The story follows Evans'' journey to overcome grief and return to music.', 'Legendary jazz pianist Bill Evans forms his perfect trio, recording two groundbreaking albums. When his brilliant young bassist dies tragically, Evans is devastated. The story follows Evans'' journey to overcome grief and return to music.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FexHDyaXx7rK4tboHnY0WaBijnlM.jpg', 'plex:movie:everybody-digs-bill-evans-2026'),
  ('107023177995241363', 'Everybody Does It', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Hugo Martín Cuervo', 'Marta Sánchez, Irene Niubó', 'Salva Reina, Kira Miró, Macarena Gómez, Carlos Santos, Pablo Carbonell, Andrea Duro, Julián López, Mariam Hernández', null, 'The story follows several couples who return to the hotel where they celebrated their wedding years ago at the invitation of the owner of the accommodation. Some live happily married, others on the contrary are on the verge of divorce. They all have something in common, an enemy. And it is that the owner of the hotel is on the verge of ruin and is willing to get out of that situation no matter what.', 'The story follows several couples who return to the hotel where they celebrated their wedding years ago at the invitation of the owner of the accommodation. Some live happily married, others on the contrary are on the verge of divorce. They all have something in common, an enemy. And it is that the owner of the hotel is on the verge of ruin and is willing to get out of that situation no matter what.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFeEFG9erc93AfFgB6z0Bm8kf8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892048'),
  ('927504251637022033', 'Everybody Go Home!', 1960, 'Comedy, War, Drama', 'Luigi Comencini, Franco Montemurro, Roberto Pariante', 'Furio Scarpelli, Agenore Incrocci, Marcello Fondato', 'Alberto Sordi, Eduardo De Filippo, Serge Reggiani, Martin Balsam, Alex Nicol, Carla Gravina, Didi Perego, Claudio Gora', null, 'When Italy surrenders to the Allies, part of the Italian army is dispersed and soldiers begin to return to their homes.', 'When Italy surrenders to the Allies, part of the Italian army is dispersed and soldiers begin to return to their homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD9VusieQYGabQgMtKn06ZKZSvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48955'),
  ('878649691878104246', 'Everybody Has a Plan', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ana Piterbarg, Lucio Bonelli, Federico D''Auria', 'Ana Piterbarg, Ana Cohan', 'Viggo Mortensen, Soledad Villamil, Daniel Fanego, Javier Godino, Sofía Gala Castiglione, Oscar Alegre, Sergio Boris, Alberto Ajaka', 'R', 'Pedro, a humble beekeeper who lives in the mysterious Argentinian region of the Delta del Tigre, travels to Buenos Aires to visit his twin brother Agustín, a successful but troubled pediatrician with marital issues, to give him bad news and ask him for a favor hard to fulfill, a unexpected arrival which will change Agustín''s life forever.', 'Pedro, a humble beekeeper who lives in the mysterious Argentinian region of the Delta del Tigre, travels to Buenos Aires to visit his twin brother Agustín, a successful but troubled pediatrician with marital issues, to give him bad news and ask him for a favor hard to fulfill, a unexpected arrival which will change Agustín''s life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub01cFc8V7KdNpJiQOxaqpbu4kN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114285'),
  ('617165384879247861', 'Everybody Has Secrets', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jang Hyeon-su, Kim Yeong-cheol', 'Kim Yeong-chan, Kim Hee-jae', 'Lee Byung-hun, Choi Ji-woo, Kim Hyo-jin, Chu Sang-mi, Sunwoo Yong-nyeo, Jeon Jae-hyeong, Kim Hae-gon, Tak Jae-hoon', null, 'Mi-young shows her boyfriend, Soo-hyun, to her two sisters. However, the sisters feel weird after the meeting, since both sisters immediately fall in love with Soo-hyun.', 'Mi-young shows her boyfriend, Soo-hyun, to her two sisters. However, the sisters feel weird after the meeting, since both sisters immediately fall in love with Soo-hyun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iopUmfAbq1UlJeGhjZYSUxGLJ0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21442'),
  ('605770631717515341', 'Everybody Hates Johan', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Sunniva Sollied Møller, Jon Vatne, Dag André Koteng', 'Erlend Loe', 'Pål Sverre Hagen, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Ine Jansen, Paul-Ottar Haga, John Brungot, Trond-Ove Skrødal, Ingunn Beate Øyen, Vee Vimolmal', null, 'Johan, a loner with horses and explosives, is never accepted by the local community. We follow his struggle for belonging in the village and the lifelong, unrequited love for the girl next door, which he accidentally blew up in his youth.', 'Johan, a loner with horses and explosives, is never accepted by the local community. We follow his struggle for belonging in the village and the lifelong, unrequited love for the girl next door, which he accidentally blew up in his youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UgamuOMuYdi7F5N7JWAwsgYGLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750498'),
  ('411858747883341918', 'Everybody He Is Nice, Everybody He Is Beautiful', 1972, 'Comedy, Music', 'Jean Yanne, Jean Boffety', 'Gérard Sire, Jean Yanne', 'Michel Serrault, Jean Yanne, Bernard Blier, Marina Vlady, Jacques François, Jacqueline Danno, Ginette Garcin, Paul Préboist', null, 'Selon "Radio plus près de Dieu", rien n''est conçu sans Dieu, surtout pas les shampoings, produits de beauté, la vente des disques... Un animateur dénonce cette escroquerie à l''antenne, ce qui lui vaut d''être licencié. Il réapparaîtra sur de nouvelles ondes avec "Radio plus près de la Vérité".', 'Selon "Radio plus près de Dieu", rien n''est conçu sans Dieu, surtout pas les shampoings, produits de beauté, la vente des disques... Un animateur dénonce cette escroquerie à l''antenne, ce qui lui vaut d''être licencié. Il réapparaîtra sur de nouvelles ondes avec "Radio plus près de la Vérité".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1ljpT4eN7UGlXF9peX735Wcu6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27020'),
  ('905000765743087980', 'Everybody Knows', 2018, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Asghar Farhadi, José Luis Alcaine, David Pareja', 'Asghar Farhadi', 'Penélope Cruz, Javier Bardem, Ricardo Darín, Eduard Fernández, Bárbara Lennie, Inma Cuesta, Elvira Mínguez, Ramón Barea', 'R', 'Laura, a Spanish woman living in Buenos Aires, returns to her hometown outside Madrid with her Argentinian husband and children. However, the trip is upset by unexpected events that bring secrets into the open.', 'Laura, a Spanish woman living in Buenos Aires, returns to her hometown outside Madrid with her Argentinian husband and children. However, the trip is upset by unexpected events that bring secrets into the open.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TuuM451os3NaltCwGfPCVL2BST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401545'),
  ('1101681998247737449', 'Everybody Leaves', 2015, 'Drama', 'Sergio Cabrera', 'Laura Martel, Ramón Jimeno, Sergio Cabrera', 'Yoima Valdés, Abel Rodríguez, Rachel Mojena, Scott Cleverdon, Indhira Serrano, Tahimí Alvariño, Mateo Giraldo, Félix Antequera', null, 'In Cienfuegos in the 1980s, a poetic young girl tries to make sense of her parents'' volatile separation while keenly observing the reality of Cuba''s dilemmas.', 'In Cienfuegos in the 1980s, a poetic young girl tries to make sense of her parents'' volatile separation while keenly observing the reality of Cuba''s dilemmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWF5OQJB8hcuupYefJNxegJtd5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337398'),
  ('776544451002678840', 'Everybody Lies', 2022, 'TV Movie, Crime', 'Hélène Angel', 'Olivier Norek', 'Vincent Elbaz, Nicolas Marié, Mariama Gueye, Joséphine de Meaux, Thomas Silberstein, Anne Girouard, Jackie Berroyer', null, 'Vincent Verner is a former cop who was fired from the police force for refusing to turn a blind eye to an investigation involving a powerful man. A young prosecutor comes to get him to join a new group in charge of investigating "delicate" cases, those that no one dares to summon: men and women of power, politics, finance, the media, the star system, lobbies, consortiums, and the bosses of large companies. Verner, a maverick with an aversion to lying, will apply his own methods.', 'Vincent Verner is a former cop who was fired from the police force for refusing to turn a blind eye to an investigation involving a powerful man. A young prosecutor comes to get him to join a new group in charge of investigating "delicate" cases, those that no one dares to summon: men and women of power, politics, finance, the media, the star system, lobbies, consortiums, and the bosses of large companies. Verner, a maverick with an aversion to lying, will apply his own methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIeRn3DiCbDuG6JtX6aOcUmE7DR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978004'),
  ('849478048930042552', 'Everybody Loves Jeanne', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Olivier Boonjing, Céline Devaux', 'Céline Devaux', 'Blanche Gardin, Laurent Lafitte, Marthe Keller, Nuno Lopes, Maxence Tual, Samira Sedira, Lisa Mirey, Andrew Sanko Logan', null, 'Everybody has always loved Jeanne. These days, she hates herself. Up to her ears in debt, she has to go to Lisbon and sell her mother’s apartment, who passed away one year ago. At the airport, she runs into Jean, a whimsical and somewhat intrusive former high school classmate.', 'Everybody has always loved Jeanne. These days, she hates herself. Up to her ears in debt, she has to go to Lisbon and sell her mother’s apartment, who passed away one year ago. At the airport, she runs into Jean, a whimsical and somewhat intrusive former high school classmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJwZkJeEZhU8KSCGPPIMO8vuXqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925096'),
  ('920384078983595559', 'Everybody Loves Me When I''m Dead', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Nithiwat Tharathorn, Sutthichai Luangamornlert, Rattapol Jantararuangtong', 'Nithiwat Tharathorn, Sopana Chaowwiwatkul', 'Theeradej Wongpuapan, Vachirawich Aranthanawong, Chulachak Chakrabongse, Fatima Dechawaleekul, Kullanat Preeyawat, Jirayut Paloprakarn, Pitipat Kootrakul, Alissa Intusmith', 'R', 'Two bank employees steal from a dead woman''s account and unwittingly entangle themselves in Pattaya''s criminal underworld.', 'Two bank employees steal from a dead woman''s account and unwittingly entangle themselves in Pattaya''s criminal underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p43EHgFFik8csqNlRDI9uVU1onx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429750'),
  ('266947669076593508', 'Everybody Loves Somebody', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Catalina Aguilar Mastretta, Jon Aguirresarobe', 'Catalina Aguilar Mastretta', 'Karla Souza, José María Yázpik, Ben O''Toole, Patricia Bernal, Tiaré Scanda, K.C. Clyde, Alejandro Camacho, Ximena Romo', 'PG-13', 'On the surface, Clara Barron seems to have it all: a job as an OB-GYN; a great house in LA; and a loving family. But, the one thing Clara doesn''t have figured out is her love life. Pressured by a family wedding in Mexico, Clara asks a co-worker to pose as her boyfriend for the weekend festivities,- only to be caught by surprise when her ex- boyfriend (and family favorite) suddenly shows up after disappearing from her life completely. Torn, Clara must decide between going back to the past or open her heart to new and unexpected possibilities.', 'On the surface, Clara Barron seems to have it all: a job as an OB-GYN; a great house in LA; and a loving family. But, the one thing Clara doesn''t have figured out is her love life. Pressured by a family wedding in Mexico, Clara asks a co-worker to pose as her boyfriend for the weekend festivities,- only to be caught by surprise when her ex- boyfriend (and family favorite) suddenly shows up after disappearing from her life completely. Torn, Clara must decide between going back to the past or open her heart to new and unexpected possibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZKpuVXmYu6gaprjfkOdvlvY5Z9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431093'),
  ('135060152148908862', 'Everybody Loves Touda', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Virginie Surdej, Nabil Ayouch, Christèle Agnello', 'Nabil Ayouch, Maryam Touzani', 'Nisrin Erradi, Jalila Talemsi, Joud Chamihy, El Moustafa Boutankite, Lahcen Razzougui, Khalil Oubaaqa', null, 'Touda is a Sheikha, a traditional Moroccan singer. Performing in the bars of her provincial town under the gaze of men, she plans to leave for the lights of Casablanca in search of recognition and to ensure a better future for her deaf-mute son.', 'Touda is a Sheikha, a traditional Moroccan singer. Performing in the bars of her provincial town under the gaze of men, she plans to leave for the lights of Casablanca in search of recognition and to ensure a better future for her deaf-mute son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVzge34J0nQEZtekqHKDZmPaGQJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1246211'),
  ('935268660163888676', 'Everybody to Kenmure Street', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Felipe Bustos Sierra', null, 'Emma Thompson, Kate Dickie', null, 'In May 2021, a UK Home Office dawn raid triggers one of the most spontaneous and successful acts of civil resistance in recent memory. In Pollokshields, Scotland’s most diverse neighbourhood, hundreds of residents rush to the streets to stop the deportation of their neighbours.', 'In May 2021, a UK Home Office dawn raid triggers one of the most spontaneous and successful acts of civil resistance in recent memory. In Pollokshields, Scotland’s most diverse neighbourhood, hundreds of residents rush to the streets to stop the deportation of their neighbours.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fm3ZR0dcDwpO7JdAs6sc12ks3Th9.jpg', 'plex:movie:everybody-to-kenmure-street'),
  ('766143773847527945', 'Everybody Wants Some!!', 2016, 'Comedy', 'George Sledge, Max Sturgeon, Jeremy Mohler', 'Richard Linklater', 'Blake Jenner, Zoey Deutch, Ryan Guzman, Tyler Hoechlin, J. Quinton Johnson, Glen Powell, Wyatt Russell, Will Brittain', 'R', 'A comedy that follows a group of friends as they navigate their way through the freedoms and responsibilities of unsupervised adulthood.', 'A comedy that follows a group of friends as they navigate their way through the freedoms and responsibilities of unsupervised adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAIFZ8bw0spSvcIYgfuX99B3H2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295699'),
  ('51341537316767484', 'Everybody Wants to Be Italian', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jason Todd Ipson, Michael Fimognari', 'Jason Todd Ipson', 'Jay Jablonski, Cerina Vincent, John Kapelos, John Enos III, Richard Libertini, Marisa Petroro, Perry Anzilotti, Anthony Russell', null, 'Are all relationships based on lies? Jake Bianski runs a fish market in north Boston, surrounded by Italians. For years, he''s carried a torch for Isabella, an ex-girlfriend now married with three children and no interest in Jake. Yet, he tells everyone she''s his girlfriend, including Marisa, a veterinarian his employees set him up with at the Italian singles club. She''s interested in him until he tells her about his girlfriend, then he''s persistent in asking her to be his friend. As the friendship bumps along, Jake realizes that reality may be better than fantasy, but what if Isabella changes her mind about Jake, and what if it comes out that Marisa, like Jake, isn''t Italian?', 'Are all relationships based on lies? Jake Bianski runs a fish market in north Boston, surrounded by Italians. For years, he''s carried a torch for Isabella, an ex-girlfriend now married with three children and no interest in Jake. Yet, he tells everyone she''s his girlfriend, including Marisa, a veterinarian his employees set him up with at the Italian singles club. She''s interested in him until he tells her about his girlfriend, then he''s persistent in asking her to be his friend. As the friendship bumps along, Jake realizes that reality may be better than fantasy, but what if Isabella changes her mind about Jake, and what if it comes out that Marisa, like Jake, isn''t Italian?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsguL1TrXJ8qyfHgw6Daex721co.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12818'),
  ('899864213887953448', 'Everybody Wins', 1990, 'Crime', 'Karel Reisz, Ian Baker, Timothy M. Bourne', 'Arthur Miller', 'Debra Winger, Nick Nolte, Will Patton, Judith Ivey, Kathleen Wilhoite, Jack Warden, Frank Converse, Frank Military', 'R', 'A seemingly good Samaritan hires a private detective to prove a teen sitting in prison on a murder charge is innocent. His investigation discovers deep corruption in a Connecticut town and finds the woman isn''t everything she is pretending to be either.', 'A seemingly good Samaritan hires a private detective to prove a teen sitting in prison on a murder charge is innocent. His investigation discovers deep corruption in a Connecticut town and finds the woman isn''t everything she is pretending to be either.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djkoK0O3ARHiq9gEbVHMKpPTl4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41816'),
  ('308807992256733711', 'Everybody''s All-American', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Taylor Hackford, Stephen Goldblatt', 'Thomas Rickman', 'Dennis Quaid, Jessica Lange, Timothy Hutton, John Goodman, Carl Lumbly, Ray Baker, Savannah Smith Boucher, Patricia Clarkson', 'R', 'Louisiana football star Gavin Grey had it all. He was an All-American champion who married his high-school sweetheart, homecoming queen Babs Rogers, and who was a hero to his hometown. Yet after a failed professional career, Gavin realizes that fame and success have passed him by and that he no longer is the hero everyone keeps reminding him he should still be. His dissatisfaction with his life leads to strains in his marriage, and Gavin begins to wonder who he is, if he''s not a hero anymore.', 'Louisiana football star Gavin Grey had it all. He was an All-American champion who married his high-school sweetheart, homecoming queen Babs Rogers, and who was a hero to his hometown. Yet after a failed professional career, Gavin realizes that fame and success have passed him by and that he no longer is the hero everyone keeps reminding him he should still be. His dissatisfaction with his life leads to strains in his marriage, and Gavin begins to wonder who he is, if he''s not a hero anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU8DdARin8VwV0j3G27mFEEitCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34053'),
  ('241358669054743083', 'Everybody''s Baby: The Rescue of Jessica McClure', 1989, 'Drama, Action, Family, TV Movie', 'Mel Damski', null, 'Beau Bridges, Pat Hingle, Daryl Anderson, Don Hood, Guy Stockwell, Jack Rader, Mills Watson, Patty Duke', null, 'Based on the true story of baby Jessica McClure who fell into a drain pipe in her back yard while playing. She was stuck in the pipe about 20 to 30 feet down and it took rescuers 58 hours to get her out. There was fear that if they shook the earth too much with machinery they could cause Jessica to fall further down and die.', 'Based on the true story of baby Jessica McClure who fell into a drain pipe in her back yard while playing. She was stuck in the pipe about 20 to 30 feet down and it took rescuers 58 hours to get her out. There was fear that if they shook the earth too much with machinery they could cause Jessica to fall further down and die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfpPXkYEdDTlZZCHXYbmJcfkGKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108221'),
  ('600397364792746962', 'Everybody’s Everything', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Ramez Silyan, Sebastian Jones', null, 'Lil Peep, Lil Tracy, GHOSTEMANE, Killstation, Bexey, Juicy J, Post Malone, Liza Womack', null, 'The story of artist Lil Peep from his birth in Long Island and meteoric rise as a genre blending pop star & style icon, to his death due to an accidental opioid overdose in Arizona at just 21 years of age.', 'The story of artist Lil Peep from his birth in Long Island and meteoric rise as a genre blending pop star & style icon, to his death due to an accidental opioid overdose in Arizona at just 21 years of age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbMkjkNX8VylPVLmQ2Dp6i5iayY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576712'),
  ('656341370417487979', 'Everybody''s Famous!', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Dominique Deruddere, Willy Stassen, Frank Devos', 'Dominique Deruddere', 'Josse De Pauw, Eva van der Gucht, Werner De Smedt, Thekla Reuten, Victor Löw, Gert Portael, Ianka Fleerackers, Alice Reijs', 'R', 'Jean is a family man and factory worker who dreams of becoming a songwriter. Pinning his hopes on his teenage daughter, Marva, he takes her to singing contests in which the awkward and overweight girl struggles to belt out a tune. When Jean is suddenly fired because of cut backs, he is ashamed and even more desperate to have his daughter succeed. In a chance meeting Jean kidnaps the most famous pop star in the country and holds her hostage demanding to be heard by the music industry. Catching the attention of the media and the eyes of the nation, Jean and Marva realize that the show must go on until everyone is famous.', 'Jean is a family man and factory worker who dreams of becoming a songwriter. Pinning his hopes on his teenage daughter, Marva, he takes her to singing contests in which the awkward and overweight girl struggles to belt out a tune. When Jean is suddenly fired because of cut backs, he is ashamed and even more desperate to have his daughter succeed. In a chance meeting Jean kidnaps the most famous pop star in the country and holds her hostage demanding to be heard by the music industry. Catching the attention of the media and the eyes of the nation, Jean and Marva realize that the show must go on until everyone is famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPVRGoOQ6N9sMYYJW8OLT2CqDnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58886'),
  ('792470368858191787', 'Everybody''s Fine', 1990, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Tornatore, Giuseppe Giglietti, Francesco Ascione', 'Tonino Guerra, Giuseppe Tornatore, Massimo De Rita', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Valéria Cavalli, Michèle Morgan, Marino Cenna, Norma Martelli, Domenico Gennaro, Salvatore Cascio, Roberto Nobile', 'PG-13', 'Matteo Scuro is a retired Sicilian bureaucrat, a widower with five children, all of whom live on the mainland and hold responsible jobs. He decides to surprise each with a visit and finds none as he imagined.', 'Matteo Scuro is a retired Sicilian bureaucrat, a widower with five children, all of whom live on the mainland and hold responsible jobs. He decides to surprise each with a visit and finds none as he imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHCK2Czp4kx8TSaU7Hyh2UYFUOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45799'),
  ('768525643056098265', 'Everybody''s Fine', 2009, 'Drama', 'Kirk Jones, Henry Braham, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Massimo De Rita, Giuseppe Tornatore, Tonino Guerra', 'Robert De Niro, Drew Barrymore, Kate Beckinsale, Sam Rockwell, Melissa Leo, Damian Young, James Frain, Kate Moennig', 'PG-13', 'Eight months after the death of his wife, Frank Goode looks forward to a reunion with his four adult children. When all of them cancel their visits at the last minute, Frank, against the advice of his doctor, sets out on a road trip to reconnect with his offspring. As he visits each one in turn, Frank finds that his children''s lives are not quite as picture-perfect as they''ve made them out to be.', 'Eight months after the death of his wife, Frank Goode looks forward to a reunion with his four adult children. When all of them cancel their visits at the last minute, Frank, against the advice of his doctor, sets out on a road trip to reconnect with his offspring. As he visits each one in turn, Frank finds that his children''s lives are not quite as picture-perfect as they''ve made them out to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnC4ypkpviWgp4aHsXvWym38v56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26171'),
  ('185732588766312322', 'Everybody''s Got Somebody... Not Me', 2012, 'Drama', 'Raúl Fuentes, Jerónimo Rodríguez-García', 'Raúl Fuentes', 'Naian González Norvind, Andrea Portal, Tamara Mazarrasa, Gimena Gómez, Isabel Aerenlund', null, '"Everybody''s Got Somebody... Not Me" - Alejandra is sick of her daily life and her past relationships that have not worked out. Then she meets María, an adolescent, with whom she has an affair. At first everything runs smoothly, however Alejandra´s personality and her emotional needs prove increasingly demanding; being around her becomes unbearable. At this point, they ask themselves whether they should continue the oppressive relationship, or go on with their ordinary lives.', '"Everybody''s Got Somebody... Not Me" - Alejandra is sick of her daily life and her past relationships that have not worked out. Then she meets María, an adolescent, with whom she has an affair. At first everything runs smoothly, however Alejandra´s personality and her emotional needs prove increasingly demanding; being around her becomes unbearable. At this point, they ask themselves whether they should continue the oppressive relationship, or go on with their ordinary lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXPPZY54UfmfjRQzkQwMQX0S4ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141152'),
  ('169030596671730863', 'Everybody''s Talking About Jamie', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christopher Ross, Adam Tomlinson, Jonathan Butterell', 'Tom MacRae', 'Max Harwood, Sarah Lancashire, Lauren Patel, Sharon Horgan, Richard E. Grant, Shobna Gulati, Ralph Ineson, Adeel Akhtar', 'PG-13', 'Jamie New is 16 and doesn’t quite fit in—instead of pursuing a "real" career he dreams of becoming a drag queen. Uncertain about his future, Jamie knows one thing for sure: he is going to be a sensation. Supported by his loving mom and his amazing friends, Jamie overcomes prejudice, beats the bullies and steps out of the darkness, into the spotlight.', 'Jamie New is 16 and doesn’t quite fit in—instead of pursuing a "real" career he dreams of becoming a drag queen. Uncertain about his future, Jamie knows one thing for sure: he is going to be a sensation. Supported by his loving mom and his amazing friends, Jamie overcomes prejudice, beats the bullies and steps out of the darkness, into the spotlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsCHo64bJ8lMhKv8LtOKEn1kjsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624899'),
  ('158507160011680204', 'Everybody''s Woman', 1934, 'Drama', 'Max Ophüls', 'Curt Alexander, Max Ophüls, Hans Wilhelm', 'Isa Miranda, Memo Benassi, Tatyana Pavlova, Friedrich Benfer, Franco Coop, Lamberto Picasso, Nelly Corradi, Mario Ferrari', null, 'Gaby is expelled from school after a married teacher commits suicide after telling her he can''t live without her. Though she has done nothing, she is punished for his act.', 'Gaby is expelled from school after a married teacher commits suicide after telling her he can''t live without her. Though she has done nothing, she is punished for his act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcBaFUvpq0ZA4LDQh1S9rfRcj5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120972'),
  ('1100768188674851197', 'Everyday Objects', 2013, 'Drama', 'Reinhold Vorschneider, Nicolas Wackerbarth', 'Nicolas Wackerbarth', 'Anne Ratte-Polle, Lou Castel, Leonard Proxauf, Nathalie Richard, Maren Kroymann, David Fennelly, Henry Arnold, Loïc Pichon', null, 'Merle follows the invitation of her lover to spend the summer in the South of France. She is surprised to find only his children in the summer house. Did she expect more than she should have? An ambiguous summer full of silent desire.', 'Merle follows the invitation of her lover to spend the summer in the South of France. She is surprised to find only his children in the summer house. Did she expect more than she should have? An ambiguous summer full of silent desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orisq8rvIr3B9Xu0Dv0wYyGhxBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165148'),
  ('1002386918145383340', 'Everyman', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Bert Haanstra', 'Simon Carmiggelt, Anton Koolhaas, Bert Haanstra', 'Simon Carmiggelt, Peter Ustinov', null, 'Bert Haanstra paints a portrait of The Netherlands and the Dutch, in his own unparalleled manner. Partly with the aid of a hidden camera he observes people in the most diverse situations. He shows the unusual in the usual and the usual in the unusual. The harsh years of the post war era of reconstruction have passed and for most people life is better than before.', 'Bert Haanstra paints a portrait of The Netherlands and the Dutch, in his own unparalleled manner. Partly with the aid of a hidden camera he observes people in the most diverse situations. He shows the unusual in the usual and the usual in the unusual. The harsh years of the post war era of reconstruction have passed and for most people life is better than before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ajbe3k9gMTe4GBJyqqVnirgxBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39241'),
  ('917306589510651109', 'Everyman''s War', 2009, 'Drama, War', 'Thad Smith, Joel Stirnkorb', 'Craig Smith', 'Cole Carson, Lauren Bair, Michael J. Prosser, Sean McGrath, Eric Martin Reid, Brian Julian, Lee Selmyhr', null, 'No one in high command believed that German forces would attack in the sub zero temperatures and near blizzard conditions. As the pre-dawn attack comes, with communications down Sgt. Smith is left with no choice but to make his way through enemy fire, unarmed and wounded, into town and warn of the coming attack. Based on actual accounts "Everyman''s War" explores the heroic events of this decorated veterans courage and the struggle between duty and desire. Between the prospect of the life and love, Dorine that waits at home and the harsh realities of war which marks the pivotal epoch in his life as he discovers that the loss of hope can be worse than the loss of life. One man''s courage... One man''s hope...Everyman''s War.', 'No one in high command believed that German forces would attack in the sub zero temperatures and near blizzard conditions. As the pre-dawn attack comes, with communications down Sgt. Smith is left with no choice but to make his way through enemy fire, unarmed and wounded, into town and warn of the coming attack. Based on actual accounts "Everyman''s War" explores the heroic events of this decorated veterans courage and the struggle between duty and desire. Between the prospect of the life and love, Dorine that waits at home and the harsh realities of war which marks the pivotal epoch in his life as he discovers that the loss of hope can be worse than the loss of life. One man''s courage... One man''s hope...Everyman''s War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LpGhP4IssE4kx0UQreRrOErxmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37531'),
  ('563623158619362956', 'Everyone Else', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maren Ade, Bernhard Keller', 'Maren Ade', 'Birgit Minichmayr, Lars Eidinger, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Nicole Marischka, Carina Wiese, Paula Hartmann, Mira Partecke, Atef Vogel', null, 'While on a Mediterranean vacation, a seemingly happy boyfriend and girlfriend find their connection to one another tested as they bond with another couple.', 'While on a Mediterranean vacation, a seemingly happy boyfriend and girlfriend find their connection to one another tested as they bond with another couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwncG9rCrVCoA20mGAx0TV31Kp6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33809'),
