  ('585368281147093047', 'Everything for a Pop Star', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bruno Garotti, Guido Pera, Daniela Pedrosa', 'Thalita Rebouças, Thalita Rebouças', 'Klara Castanho, Maisa Silva, Mel Maia, Giovanna Lancellotti, Felipe Neto, João Guilherme Ávila, Victor Aguiar, Isacque Lopes', null, 'The pop band Slavabody Disco Disco Boys, a fever among girls from all over Brazil, announces that it will play in Rio de Janeiro. Gabi, Manu and Ritinha will do everything they can to watch the show far from the city where they live.', 'The pop band Slavabody Disco Disco Boys, a fever among girls from all over Brazil, announces that it will play in Rio de Janeiro. Gabi, Manu and Ritinha will do everything they can to watch the show far from the city where they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SAAmvqFqYgO5AjKQLrvy4RozDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551572'),
  ('565951302642216923', 'Everything for Sale', 1969, 'Drama', 'Andrzej Kostenko, Andrzej Jerzy Piotrowski, Krystyna Grochowicz', 'Andrzej Wajda', 'Beata Tyszkiewicz, Elżbieta Czyżewska, Andrzej Łapicki, Daniel Olbrychski, Witold Holtz, Małgorzata Potocka, Elżbieta Kępińska, Bogumił Kobiela', null, 'Wajda''s homage to Zbigniew Cybulski, the "Polish James Dean" who starred in the director''s ASHES AND DIAMONDS and died young. The movie follows the tribulations of a director attempting to make a movie with a Cybulski-like star who never shows up.', 'Wajda''s homage to Zbigniew Cybulski, the "Polish James Dean" who starred in the director''s ASHES AND DIAMONDS and died young. The movie follows the tribulations of a director attempting to make a movie with a Cybulski-like star who never shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPTIKRNJ2rexJS93AjIdBbr2lcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94527'),
  ('206331677040358981', 'Everything Goes Wrong', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Atsushi Fujiura, Seijun Suzuki, Izumi Hagiwara', 'Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Tamio Kawachi, Yoshiko Nezu, Sayuri Yoshinaga, Shinako Nakagawa, Shinsuke Ashida, Tomoko Naraoka, Kotoe Hatsui, Chikako Miyagi', null, 'Everything goes wrong when Jiro tries to break up his mother''s relationship with a business man. The young rebel Jiro has to deal with an environment of crime and prostitution, and the impact of its choices on personal relationships: one with his mother, one with her business man lover and one with the girl in love with him.', 'Everything goes wrong when Jiro tries to break up his mother''s relationship with a business man. The young rebel Jiro has to deal with an environment of crime and prostitution, and the impact of its choices on personal relationships: one with his mother, one with her business man lover and one with the girl in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm7loUOAsldbTrVnBtr3Wr09tmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206461'),
  ('781804583011748844', 'Everything I Don''t Know', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ana Lambarri, Carlos de Miguel, Irene Cogolludo', 'Ana Lambarri', 'Susana Abaitua, Iñaki Ardanaz, Fran Cantos, Francesco Carril, Ane Gabarain, Natalia Huarte, Javier Laorden, Stéphanie Magnin', null, 'At 35, Laura leads a monotonous life between work, caring for her father,and an unstable relationship.Everything changes when a former colleague offers her the chance to revive a tech project. She decides to try, prioritizing herself for the first time in a long time, but her choices shake her world.', 'At 35, Laura leads a monotonous life between work, caring for her father,and an unstable relationship.Everything changes when a former colleague offers her the chance to revive a tech project. She decides to try, prioritizing herself for the first time in a long time, but her choices shake her world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/915xBmH2YErsMzOjtStN6VXCCtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1369105'),
