  ('454810445517496111', 'Everything Is Fine', 2008, 'Drama', 'Yves Christian Fournier, Sara Mishara', 'Guillaume Vigneault, Yves Christian Fournier', 'Maxime Dumontier, Chloé Bourgeois, Normand D''Amour, Maxime Bessette, Sébastien Bergeron-Carranza, Jean-Noël Raymond-Jetté, Niels Schneider, Claude Legault', null, 'Josh is an ordinary teen living in an ordinary suburb. One morning he finds his friend''s dead body. Next, he discovers that three more friends also have killed themselves, leaving him out of their pact. As the sole survivor, Josh becomes more and more detached from the world around him. It is a modern portrait of today''s teens: invincible yet fragile, clear-thinking yet confused...', 'Josh is an ordinary teen living in an ordinary suburb. One morning he finds his friend''s dead body. Next, he discovers that three more friends also have killed themselves, leaving him out of their pact. As the sole survivor, Josh becomes more and more detached from the world around him. It is a modern portrait of today''s teens: invincible yet fragile, clear-thinking yet confused...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSL4uDMlk4AB7IH6eC8puTvf2EO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18379'),
