  ('1136513280594118370', 'Everything Is Love', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Music', 'Andaç Haznedaroğlu', 'Andaç Haznedaroğlu, Ayşe Balıbey Tanıl', 'Hande Doğandemir, Şükrü Özyıldız, Mithat Can Özer, Hakan Meriçliler, Bala Atabek, Öznur Serçeler, Dilşad Şimşek, Evrim Doğan', null, 'A girl gets through a break up with her and her fiancé when she knows that he''s cheating on her. A young passionate man helps her and they fall in love but there is some conditions that keeps them from being together.', 'A girl gets through a break up with her and her fiancé when she knows that he''s cheating on her. A young passionate man helps her and they fall in love but there is some conditions that keeps them from being together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DXWhrKSnBVuwMMgbYAqblcc5YT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442392'),
  ('342129897860808967', 'Everything Must Disappear', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Muyl, Luc Drion', 'Philippe Le Dem, Philippe Muyl', 'Didier Bourdon, Élie Semoun, Yolande Moreau, Ophélie Winter, José Garcia, Régis Laspalès, Didier Bénureau, Luc Palun', null, 'Robert Millard has based his industrial kingdom - based on all the noise technologies - thanks to his marriage with the wealthy and cantankerous Irene, he blithely cheat for years. However, his last link with his pretty secretary, Eve, is the straw that broke the camel : Irene has indeed hired a detective-photographer, aptly named M.Colle order to have a maximum of incriminating shots. Threatened to divorce and thus to total ruin by his wife, the unfaithful husband should give up and dismiss Eve.', 'Robert Millard has based his industrial kingdom - based on all the noise technologies - thanks to his marriage with the wealthy and cantankerous Irene, he blithely cheat for years. However, his last link with his pretty secretary, Eve, is the straw that broke the camel : Irene has indeed hired a detective-photographer, aptly named M.Colle order to have a maximum of incriminating shots. Threatened to divorce and thus to total ruin by his wife, the unfaithful husband should give up and dismiss Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vh0IJXLKKHz3KHVd8cCdsS6gWRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60744'),
  ('1088354796171083849', 'Everything Must Go', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Barrett, Dan Rush, Joe McDougall', 'Dan Rush', 'Will Ferrell, C.J. Wallace, Rebecca Hall, Michael Peña, Rosalie Michaels, Stephen Root, Laura Dern, Glenn Howerton', 'R', 'When an alcoholic relapses, causing him to lose his wife and his job, he holds a yard sale on his front lawn in an attempt to start over. A new neighbor might be the key to his return to form.', 'When an alcoholic relapses, causing him to lose his wife and his job, he holds a yard sale on his front lawn in an attempt to start over. A new neighbor might be the key to his return to form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4wMD3LHyo3nYZNWEOGLzgdyWjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45658'),
  ('351411755625194537', 'Everything Now', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Jean-Paul Agostini, Thomas Hardmeier, Richard Berry', 'Morgan Sportès, Richard Berry', 'Richard Berry, Steve Achiepo, Marc Ruchmann, Romane Rauss, Idit Cebula, Pascale Louange, Morgane Nairaud, Edouard Giard', null, 'This gripping and wrenching thriller tells the story of Ilan Halimi who was kidnapped for ransom in a Paris suburb. His captors, who dub themselves The Gang of Barbarians, operate under the assumption that his Jewish heritage means he is worth a lot of money. Taking the audience through the harrowing experience of the Halimi family and sharing a searing insight into Ilan''s vicious ordeal, the story tracks the massive but futile investigation doomed by near-misses and tragedy that triggered a national outcry. For 24 days the police, insistent upon handling the case as a normal for-ransom kidnapping, failed to recognize the anti-Semitic overtones of the abduction. Faithfully reenacting events from the view of the various characters, Tout, tout de suite raises troubling questions about the state of anti-Semitism and race relations in contemporary France.', 'This gripping and wrenching thriller tells the story of Ilan Halimi who was kidnapped for ransom in a Paris suburb. His captors, who dub themselves The Gang of Barbarians, operate under the assumption that his Jewish heritage means he is worth a lot of money. Taking the audience through the harrowing experience of the Halimi family and sharing a searing insight into Ilan''s vicious ordeal, the story tracks the massive but futile investigation doomed by near-misses and tragedy that triggered a national outcry. For 24 days the police, insistent upon handling the case as a normal for-ransom kidnapping, failed to recognize the anti-Semitic overtones of the abduction. Faithfully reenacting events from the view of the various characters, Tout, tout de suite raises troubling questions about the state of anti-Semitism and race relations in contemporary France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3FDf26DJOYmwKUpj2kql3LvuF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418670'),
  ('12450847503009675', 'Everything or Nothing', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Stevan Riley', 'Stevan Riley, Peter Ettedgui', 'Daniel Craig, Pierce Brosnan, Timothy Dalton, Roger Moore, George Lazenby, Judi Dench, Famke Janssen, Bill Clinton', null, 'The story of three men with a shared dream: James Bond franchise producers Albert R. Broccoli and Harry Saltzman, and Bond creator and author Ian Fleming. It’s the thrilling and inspiring narrative behind the longest running film franchise in cinema history, which began in 1962.', 'The story of three men with a shared dream: James Bond franchise producers Albert R. Broccoli and Harry Saltzman, and Bond creator and author Ian Fleming. It’s the thrilling and inspiring narrative behind the longest running film franchise in cinema history, which began in 1962.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7ibOc2uYDZbIr7T0aaFMdIi6Ud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135921'),
  ('913024326922593530', 'Everything Turns, Everything Revolves', 1929, null, 'Hans Richter, Reimar Kuntze', 'Hans Richter, Werner Graeff', null, null, 'A day at the carnival — sensational tent shows where miracles can be seen for the price of admission, boisterous noise of crowds and barkers, shrill and gaudy circus music, the violence of the street ten-fold. This is the substance of Everything Turns, Richter’s first sound film. At its premier at Baden-Baden Richter got into a fight with two Nazi officials who disliked the film''s ‘modernism.’ Yet in 1936 it was awarded first prize for artistic merit by the Nazis, with Richter’s name suppressed from the credits. He had long since left Germany.', 'A day at the carnival — sensational tent shows where miracles can be seen for the price of admission, boisterous noise of crowds and barkers, shrill and gaudy circus music, the violence of the street ten-fold. This is the substance of Everything Turns, Richter’s first sound film. At its premier at Baden-Baden Richter got into a fight with two Nazi officials who disliked the film''s ‘modernism.’ Yet in 1936 it was awarded first prize for artistic merit by the Nazis, with Richter’s name suppressed from the credits. He had long since left Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17UFrKncqPX9Su1zynA8eosDJIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190278'),
  ('52427398415492862', 'Everything Went Fine', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hichame Alaouié, François Ozon', 'Philippe Piazzo', 'Sophie Marceau, André Dussollier, Géraldine Pailhas, Charlotte Rampling, Éric Caravaca, Hanna Schygulla, Grégory Gadebois, Judith Magre', 'G', 'When her elderly father has a stroke, Emmanuelle rushes to his bedside. Sick and half-paralysed in his hospital bed, he asks Emmanuelle to help him end his life.', 'When her elderly father has a stroke, Emmanuelle rushes to his bedside. Sick and half-paralysed in his hospital bed, he asks Emmanuelle to help him end his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyNNufs7Ds8TuT2kv4Z1mEfPx0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735726'),
  ('332485326146945544', 'Everything Will Be All Right', 1995, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Yuri Vorontsov, Dmitriy Astrakhan, Sergey Dvortsov', 'Oleg Danilov', 'Anatoli Zhuravlyov, Olga Ponizova, Mark Goronok, Aleksandr Zbruev, Irina Mazurkevich, Valentin Bukin, Mikhail Ulyanov, Vladimir Kabalin', null, 'This charming comedy tracks the lives of several romantic pairs through trials and tribulations. The main focus of the story is a young soldier with a good heart but little ambition and his fiancée, who feels torn when a charming and sophisticated intellectual enters her life and sweeps her off her feet. There are also several side stories, also all dealing with relationships, most significantly the soldier''s mother, whose comfortable but unexceptional marriage is threatened when a past love returns to her life.', 'This charming comedy tracks the lives of several romantic pairs through trials and tribulations. The main focus of the story is a young soldier with a good heart but little ambition and his fiancée, who feels torn when a charming and sophisticated intellectual enters her life and sweeps her off her feet. There are also several side stories, also all dealing with relationships, most significantly the soldier''s mother, whose comfortable but unexceptional marriage is threatened when a past love returns to her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NbyW7qSzGodmEiIoknJjH1era6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133088'),
  ('915910813165244400', 'Everything Will Be OK', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', null, 'A series of dark and troubling events forces Bill to reckon with the meaning of his life… or lack thereof.', 'A series of dark and troubling events forces Bill to reckon with the meaning of his life… or lack thereof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAYKV1UGyzkOGsRbD0oJGgr0bTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32532'),
  ('611186052847830813', 'Everything Will Be Okay', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Patrick Vollrath', 'Patrick Vollrath', 'Simon Schwarz, Julia Pointner, Marion Rottenhofer', null, 'A divorced father picks up his eight-year-old daughter Lea. It seems pretty much like every second weekend, but after a while Lea can''t help feeling that something isn''t right. So begins a fateful journey.', 'A divorced father picks up his eight-year-old daughter Lea. It seems pretty much like every second weekend, but after a while Lea can''t help feeling that something isn''t right. So begins a fateful journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4nfHygjuIanhs3QDRDjXyitcia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365909'),
  ('1058418403295013249', 'Everything You Always Wanted to Know About Sex *But Were Afraid to Ask', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Woody Allen, David M. Walsh, Fred T. Gallo', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, John Carradine, Lou Jacobi, Louise Lasser, Anthony Quayle, Tony Randall, Lynn Redgrave, Burt Reynolds', 'R', 'A collection of seven vignettes, which each address a question concerning human sexuality. From aphrodisiacs to sexual perversion to the mystery of the male orgasm, characters like a court jester, a doctor, a queen and a journalist adventure through lab experiments and game shows, all seeking answers to common questions that many would never ask.', 'A collection of seven vignettes, which each address a question concerning human sexuality. From aphrodisiacs to sexual perversion to the mystery of the male orgasm, characters like a court jester, a doctor, a queen and a journalist adventure through lab experiments and game shows, all seeking answers to common questions that many would never ask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1ZNhNd8FV8kCW39OeDelokT0tv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11624'),
  ('843190405460398517', 'Everything You Want', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ryan Little', 'Steven A. Lee', 'Shiri Appleby, Nick Zano, Alexandra Holden, Orlando Seale, Will Friedle, Edie McClurg, K.C. Clyde, Britani Bateman', null, 'A visionary and artistic young woman finds her love torn between her imaginary boyfriend and a real boy from one of her classes.', 'A visionary and artistic young woman finds her love torn between her imaginary boyfriend and a real boy from one of her classes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19Ii8uFaODwEDHwR4b6Ppin3bjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21753'),
  ('345439647720233415', 'Everything You Want', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesco Bruni, Arnaldo Catinari, Chiara Natalucci', 'Francesco Bruni', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Andrea Carpenzano, Arturo Bruni, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Riccardo Vitiello, Donatella Finocchiaro, Antonio Gerardi, Raffaella Lebboroni', null, 'An aimless young troublemaker, Alessandro, squanders his days gambling and getting into fights, and he often spends his nights in jail. With few prospects, he begrudgingly accepts a job as a companion to Giorgio, an elderly poet suffering from Alzheimer’s. On their daily walks, the two banter and become friends, and Alessandro quickly learns more about this forgotten poet as the old man’s memory drifts. After learning a secret from Giorgio’s past, Alessandro and his friends work to uncover the mystery of this tale, an unexpected history lesson and a touching coming-of-age adventure.', 'An aimless young troublemaker, Alessandro, squanders his days gambling and getting into fights, and he often spends his nights in jail. With few prospects, he begrudgingly accepts a job as a companion to Giorgio, an elderly poet suffering from Alzheimer’s. On their daily walks, the two banter and become friends, and Alessandro quickly learns more about this forgotten poet as the old man’s memory drifts. After learning a secret from Giorgio’s past, Alessandro and his friends work to uncover the mystery of this tale, an unexpected history lesson and a touching coming-of-age adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FOuI1i7jWb4MNfPgIERrsUGYrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457601'),
  ('298074969295313341', 'Everything, Everything', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Igor Jadue-Lillo, Shannon Hawes, Ryan Hyland', 'J. Mills Goodloe', 'Amandla Stenberg, Nick Robinson, Anika Noni Rose, Ana de la Reguera, Taylor Hickson, Danube R. Hermosillo, Dan Payne, Fiona Loewi', 'PG-13', 'A teenager who''s lived a sheltered life because she''s allergic to everything, falls for the boy who moves in next door.', 'A teenager who''s lived a sheltered life because she''s allergic to everything, falls for the boy who moves in next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gukkmf3W5Cev7winxBa8FHvKLql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417678'),
  ('295689055105723002', 'Everything''s Fifty Fifty', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Alireza Golafshan, Matthias Fleischer', 'Alireza Golafshan', 'Laura Tonke, Moritz Bleibtreu, David Kross, Valentin Thatenhorst, Axel Stein, Jasin Challah, Theresa Teubner, Herbert Forthuber', null, 'Marion and Andi thought they were happily divorced until their old love unexpectedly reignites during a family vacation with their son Milan.', 'Marion and Andi thought they were happily divorced until their old love unexpectedly reignites during a family vacation with their son Milan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmkkp1PphsDIsIxu27nCYZ9zXSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149100'),
  ('314540338446015205', 'Everything''s Fine, We''re Leaving', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Mouriéras', 'Claude Mouriéras', 'Natacha Régnier, Miou-Miou, Sandrine Kiberlain, Michel Piccoli, Laurent Poitrenaux, Marcial Di Fonzo Bo, Hubert Koundé', null, 'Three French sisters have their lives interrupted and their relationship called into question when their father returns to visit 15 years after having abandoned them and their now-deceased mother. Each responds differently to his return according to how her character evolved from her relation with him and his unexpected departure. They eventually realize, though, that the somewhat elderly father is quickly losing his memory and his ability to function, and the youngest daughter''s decision to accept him again while she can ends up permanently changing her family ties with her sisters.', 'Three French sisters have their lives interrupted and their relationship called into question when their father returns to visit 15 years after having abandoned them and their now-deceased mother. Each responds differently to his return according to how her character evolved from her relation with him and his unexpected departure. They eventually realize, though, that the somewhat elderly father is quickly losing his memory and his ability to function, and the youngest daughter''s decision to accept him again while she can ends up permanently changing her family ties with her sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqWrOfItLk3xUgo7Ts2ZQRO5r9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89560'),
  ('874038196290864380', 'Everything''s Going to Be Great', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jon S. Baird, Mark Wolf, Tyler Delben', 'Steven Rogers', 'Allison Janney, Bryan Cranston, Benjamin Evan Ainsworth, Jack Champion, Simon Rex, Chris Cooper, Laura Benanti, Cady Huffman', 'R', 'When they are unexpectedly forced to move in with an estranged relative, the Smart Family must navigate oversized dreams, identity struggles and regional theater in this warmly observant family comedy.', 'When they are unexpectedly forced to move in with an estranged relative, the Smart Family must navigate oversized dreams, identity struggles and regional theater in this warmly observant family comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v64pw0k8FvWb7fvfpWCNj8il8Ei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115982'),
  ('633626662596859672', 'Everything''s Gone Green', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Paul Fox, David Frazee', 'Douglas Coupland', 'Paulo Costanzo, Steph Song, JR Bourne, Gordon Michael Woolvett, Aidan Devine, Tom Butler, Susan Hogan, Katharine Isabelle', 'R', 'Ryan, a good-natured slacker, is tempted into a money laundering scheme while working for a lottery magazine. A capitalistic comedy that asks the question - when is "enough" enough?', 'Ryan, a good-natured slacker, is tempted into a money laundering scheme while working for a lottery magazine. A capitalistic comedy that asks the question - when is "enough" enough?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UkXUnbb6xTgA2oamLKmZ2Kga21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13164'),
  ('902573533189203648', 'Everything''s Gone Wrong!', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Issa López, Emiliano Villanueva', 'Issa López, Ari Rosen', 'Osvaldo Benavides, Martín Altomaro, Alfonso Dosal, Marcela Guirado, Sebastián Zurita, Eduardo España, Adrián Vázquez, Marianna Burelli', null, 'When a young diplomat manages to get the Austrian government to return the Plume of Moctezuma to Mexico for an exhibition, his life quickly falls apart.', 'When a young diplomat manages to get the Austrian government to return the Plume of Moctezuma to Mexico for an exhibition, his life quickly falls apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7038rxSU26SOacXEpAyvoFS8aJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509421'),
  ('452094841712443803', 'Everything''s Gonna Be Alright', 2020, 'Drama', 'Francesco Bruni, Carlo Rinaldi', 'Francesco Bruni', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Lorenza Indovina, Barbara Ronchi, Giuseppe Pambieri, Raffaella Lebboroni, Nicola Nocella, Fotinì Peluso, Tancredi Galli', null, 'Bruno Salvati is a director of little success, fresh from the separation from his wife Anna with whom he had two children, the twenty-year-old Adele and the seventeen-year-old Tito. Following a sudden illness, Bruno is diagnosed with a disease that requires the intervention of a donor. All his family relationships are called into question, including that with his father Umberto, the custodian of a secret that will force Bruno to embark on a journey in search of someone who can help him.', 'Bruno Salvati is a director of little success, fresh from the separation from his wife Anna with whom he had two children, the twenty-year-old Adele and the seventeen-year-old Tito. Following a sudden illness, Bruno is diagnosed with a disease that requires the intervention of a donor. All his family relationships are called into question, including that with his father Umberto, the custodian of a secret that will force Bruno to embark on a journey in search of someone who can help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KWKSpiotA5W54vEezCpUANiTTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654894'),
  ('828582637237163438', 'Everything''s Gonna Be Great', 1998, 'Family, Drama, Comedy, Adventure', 'Ömer Vargı', 'Hakan Haksun, Ömer Vargı, Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Mazhar Alanson, Ceyda Düvenci, Mustafa Uzunyılmaz, Selim Naşit, Ayumi Takano, Nurgül Yeşilçay, Celal Belgil', null, 'When Altan swipes prescription drugs from his brother Nuri''s pharmacy, they soon find themselves on a dangerous but funny road trip to get rid of the stuff and escape the mafiosi Altan tried to double-cross. Along the way, the brother who are compete opposites finally bond.', 'When Altan swipes prescription drugs from his brother Nuri''s pharmacy, they soon find themselves on a dangerous but funny road trip to get rid of the stuff and escape the mafiosi Altan tried to double-cross. Along the way, the brother who are compete opposites finally bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHuxySsdTsYfp9ePGeYTmq4YvM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81549'),
  ('929891185804227669', 'Evet, I Do!', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Sinan Akkuş, Peter Nix', 'Sinan Akkuş', 'Oliver Korittke, Heinrich Schafmeister, Lale Yavaş, Tim Seyfi, İdil Üner, Hülya Duyar, Eralp Uzun, Ingeborg Westphal', null, 'The movie revolves around three different couples who have to overcome familial and cultural obstacles to be with their ones they love. A man looking for a bride-for-hire also learns the hard way that expectations and reality do not always come together well.', 'The movie revolves around three different couples who have to overcome familial and cultural obstacles to be with their ones they love. A man looking for a bride-for-hire also learns the hard way that expectations and reality do not always come together well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaIBbpTMYVX7qrsyXuEy20tckGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38098'),
